('GRE_2','GRE_2_3796','exemption','ɪg''zɛmpʃən','ɪɡ''zempʃn','[n] 解除, 免除, 免税','You qualify for a tax exemption on the loan.  你有资格获准贷款免税。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3797','thaw','θɔ','θɔː','[n] 解冻','The thaw begins in March.  解冻期从3月份开始。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3798','undoing','ʌn''duɪŋ','ʌn''duːɪŋ','[n] 解开, 复旧, 毁灭, 取消','This temptation to cover the distance between himself and the reader, to study his image in the sight of those who do not know him, can be his undoing: he has begun to write to please.  这种企图消除自己和读者之间距离的作法，企图用不了解自己的人的观点来研究自己塑造的形象的作法，会导致作家的毁灭，因为他已经开始为取悦他人而写作了。,
???'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3799','scalpel','skæl''pɛl','''skælp(ə)l','[n] 解剖刀','I pointed with my scalpel to the chest cavity, where nothing but a black lump of coal squatted in the lipstick-red center.  我用解剖刀指着她的胸腔，那里只有一团黑乎乎的煤块，伏在唇膏般红色的胸腔中部。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3800','exponent','ɪk''sponənt','ɪk''spəʊnənt; ek-','[n] 解释者, 说明者, 代表者, 典型, 指数','The Alvin Ailey American Dance Theatre was formed in the 1950s and quickly established itself as a leading exponent of progressive choreography and contemporary dance.  阿尔文·艾利美国舞蹈剧形成于20世纪50年代，并很快树立自己为激进舞蹈艺术和现代舞蹈的最主要的典范。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3801','commandment','kə''mændmənt','kə''mɑːndmənt','[n] 戒律','So you would not break the third commandment.  那么你就不会违反第三条戒律。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3802','pretext','''pritɛkst','''priːtekst','[n] 借口, 托辞','He’ll phone on some pretext or other.  他会以这样或那样的理由打电话的。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3803','pretension','prɪ''tɛnʃən','prɪ''tenʃ(ə)n','[n] 借口, 要求, 主张, 自负, 骄傲',''),
