('GRE_2','GRE_2_3862','comportment','kəm''pɔrtmənt','kəm''pɔːtm(ə)nt','[n] 举止, 态度, 动作','Another aspect of executive presence is comportment—your way of conducting yourself in interacting with others.  领导者气质的另一方面就是举止风度——你与他人交流时行为表现。'),
