('GRE_2','GRE_2_3876','scroll','skrol','skrəʊl','[n] 卷轴, 卷形物, 名册','Ancient scrolls were found in caves by the Dead Sea.  在死海边的洞穴里发现了古代的卷轴。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3877','pout','paʊt','paʊt','[n] 撅嘴, 板脸, 生气, 大头鱼类','She shot me a reproachful pout.  她作责备状地冲我噘了个嘴。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3878','duel','''dʊəl','''djuːəl','[n] 决斗','The officer challenged him to a duel .  那军官向他提出决斗。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3879','knack','næk','næk','[n] 诀窍','He''s got the knack of getting people to listen.  他有让人们倾听的诀窍。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3880','infallibility','','','[n] 绝无错误, 绝对可靠性',''),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3881','cadet','kə''dɛt','kə''det','[n] 军官学校学生, <旧俚>(妓院)拉皮条的人','...army cadets.  …陆军军校学员们。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3882','ordnance','''ɔrdnəns','''ɔːdnəns','[n] 军火','...a team clearing an area littered with unexploded ordnance.  ...一个在四处留有未爆炸武器的地区排爆的小组。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3883','accoutrements','','','[n] 军人的配备, 服装','the stylish accoutrements of an English country gentleman  一名英国乡绅的时髦装备'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3884','munitions','mju:''niʃnz','mju:''niʃnz','[n] 军需品(munition之复数)','a munitions factory  兵工厂'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3885','monarch','''mɑnɚk','''mɒnək','[n] 君主','The monarch was ousted by a military coup.  那君主被军事政变者废黜了。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_3886','sovereign','sɑvrɪn','''sɒvrɪn','[n] 君主, 统治','In March 1889, she became the first British sovereign to set foot on Spanish soil.  1889年3月，她成为首位踏上西班牙国土的英国君主。'),
