('GRE_2','GRE_2_4520','liquidation',',lɪkwɪ''deʃən','lɪkwɪ''deɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 清算','Hundreds of small businesses went into liquidation (= were closed ).  数以百计的小公司破产了。'),
