('GRE_2','GRE_2_4524','appeal','ə''pil','ə''piːl','[n] 请求, 呼吁, 上诉, 吸引力, 要求','The girl’s family have made a public appeal for help to try and catch her killer.  那名遇害女孩的家人吁请公众协助捉拿凶手。'),
