('GRE_2','GRE_2_4542','pugilism','','''pjuːdʒɪlɪz(ə)m','[n] 拳击','"Put down pugilism - if I have to wear it night and day, " said the Moral Sentiment of the Community, sternly.  “如果我要日夜带着它的话，我要镇压拳击运动。” 德先生坚决的说。'),
