('GRE_2','GRE_2_4568','demography','dɪ''mɑɡrəfi','dɪ''mɒgrəfɪ','[n] 人口统计学','This slow-motion disaster, demography insists, cannot be avoided without a major shift in resources.  这是一场缓慢进行的灾难，人口统计学仍坚持不能避免资源的主要转移。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4569','anthropology','''ænθrə''pɑlədʒi',',ænθrə''pɒlədʒɪ','[n] 人类学','"In anthropology, you can''t equate third gender with homosexuality," he said.  “在人类学中，你不能将同性恋和第三性别混同，”他说。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4570','capitation','''kæpə''teʃən','kæpɪ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 人头税, 按人收费','No capitation, or other direct, tax shall be laid, unless in proportion to the census or enumeration herein before directed to be taken.  除按本宪法前文对人口普查或统计结果规定的比例征税外，不得征收人头税或其他直接税。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4571','physiognomy','''fɪzɪ''ɑnəmi',',fɪzɪ''ɒ(g)nəmɪ','[n] 人相学, 人相, 脸, 相面术, 相貌, 地貌, 地势','He was fascinated by her physiognomy – the prominent nose, brooding eyes, and thick hair.  他被她的相貌—高挺的鼻梁、深邃的双眸和浓密的秀发—迷住了。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4572','humanity','hjʊ''mænəti','hjʊ''mænɪtɪ','[n] 人性, 人类, 博爱, 仁慈','We want a clean healthy environment for all humanity .  我们希望全人类拥有一个干净健康的生存环境。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4573','margarine','''mɑrdʒərən',',mɑːdʒə''riːn; ''mɑːgəriːn','[n] 人造黄油','And not just getting up for a sandwich -- eating from tubs of margarine or eating cigarettes and raw meat.  这可不仅 仅是起床拿一块三明治那么简单，而是吃大块的黄油或者香烟还有生肉。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4574','hostage','''hɑstɪdʒ','''hɒstɪdʒ','[n] 人质, 抵押品','The group are holding two tourists hostage (= keeping them as hostages ) .  这伙人挟持了两名游客作为人质。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4575','benevolence','bə''nɛvələns','bɪ''nev(ə)l(ə)ns; bɪ''nevəl(ə)ns; bɪ''nevələns','[n] 仁爱心, 善行',''),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4576','benignity','bɪ''nɪgnəti','bɪ''nɪɡnətɪ','[n] 仁慈, 善行','We now of no scripture which records the pure benignity of the gods on a New England winter night.  但没有一本书记录了新英格兰的冬夜，尽管它是上天仁慈的恩惠。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4577','nomination',',nɑmɪ''neʃən','nɒmɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 任命','...the nomination of Texas Senator Lloyd Bentsen to be treasury secretary.  …德克萨斯州议员劳埃德·本特森作财政部长的任命。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4578','cronyism','''kronɪɪzəm','''krəʊnɪɪz(ə)m','[n] 任用亲信','Befitting his ideology, Krugman has only one policy to propose, regardless of topic: Transfer more resources from the discipline and dynamism of markets to the inefficiency and cronyism of government.  与他的理念相衬，不管是什么主题，克鲁格曼只会提出一条经济政策：把更多的资源从有纪律和活力的市场转移到低效和任人唯亲的政府手中。'),
