('GRE_2','GRE_2_4585','redundancy','rɪ''dʌndənsi','rɪ''dʌnd(ə)nsɪ','[n] 冗余','This means that they have no redundancy.  这意味着，它们没有冗余。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_4586','verbosity','','','[n] 冗长','Another motivation is to reduce the verbosity of inner classes, which are currently the closest way to get this effect.  另一个动机是减少冗长的内部类，这是目前最可能获得这一效果的方式。'),
