('GRE_2','GRE_2_5303','telepathy','tə''lɛpəθi','tɪ''lepəθɪ','[n] 心灵感应, 感应','You never tell me what you''re thinking. Am I supposed to use telepathy?  你从来不告诉我你在想什么。我是不是该用心灵感应术呢？'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5304','discomposure','','','[n] 心乱, 狼狈, 不安','THE discomposure of spirits which this extraordinary visit threw Elizabeth into, could not be easily overcome; nor could she, for many hours, learn to think of it less than incessantly.  这不速之客去了以后，伊丽莎白很是心神不安，而且很不容易恢复宁静。 她接连好几个钟头不断地思索着这件事。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5305','sanity','''sænəti','''sænɪtɪ','[n] 心智健全','I began to doubt his sanity.  我开始怀疑他是否神志正常。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5306','travail','''trævel','''træveɪl','[n] 辛苦','The team, despite their recent travails, are still in the game.  这支运动队，尽管近来遇到了难题，但还没有出局。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5307','toil','tɔɪl','tɒɪl','[n] 辛苦, 苦工, 网, 罗网, 圈套','a life of toil  辛劳的一生'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5308','poignancy','''pɔɪɡnənsi','','[n] 辛酸(事) 强烈, 尖刻, 辛辣','The film contains moments of almost unbearable poignancy.  电影中有几段令人无法承受的辛酸情节。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5309','rejoicing','rɪ''dʒɔɪsɪŋ','rɪ''dʒɒɪsɪŋ','[n] 欣喜, 高兴','I personally haven''t tasted any entomological specimens lately, but I am still rejoicing in the limitless curiosity, the draws me to books and people and places.I hope I never lose it.  我个人最近并未品尝任何昆虫的标本，但我仍欣喜于自己无限的好奇心，它促使我博览群书、乐于与人交往和四处旅行。 我希望永远拥有好奇心。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5310','recruit','rɪ''krut','rɪ''kruːt','[n] 新兵, 新分子, 新会员','New recruits are sent to the Atlanta office for training.  新成员被送到亚特兰大办事处接受培训。'),
