('GRE_2','GRE_2_5315','tenderfoot','','''tendəfʊt','[n] 新手','I may look like a tenderfoot, but I think I can follow a trail or carry a pack if necessary.  我也许看起来像个新手，不过有必要的话我认为我也能跟着上路或扛包。'),
