('GRE_2','GRE_2_5348','fallow','''fælo','''fæləʊ','[n] 休耕地','Farmers know that soil needs rest, so they rotate their crops and systematically leave a portion of their land fallow.  农夫们知道土地是需要休息的，因此他们轮流种植农作物并系统地留一部分土地休耕。'),
