('GRE_2','GRE_2_5840','lard','lɑrd','lɑːd','[n] 猪油','Ok so it goes against the grain to spend &pound;20 on moisturiser when you have saddle soap and an old packet of lard in the cupboard, but buy it you must.  这样做就像当你的柜橱中只有脊肉汤和一袋旧猪油时你却花费20英镑去买保湿霜一样不合常情，你必须得放弃这样的想法。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5841','expulsion','ɪk''spʌlʃən','ɪk''spʌlʃ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 逐出, 开除','The headmaster threatened the boys with expulsion.  校长警告这几名男生说要开除他们。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5842','convalescence',',kɑnvə''lɛsns',',kɒnvə''lesns','[n] 逐渐康复','a long and painful convalescence  漫长且痛苦的康复期'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5843','candela','kæn''dɛlə','kæn''delə; -''diːlə; ''kændɪlə','[n] 烛光','Luminous intensity is indicated with the symbol I and its unit of measurement is the candela.  其定义符号为I 以及其测量单位表示为烛光。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5844','compere','''kɔmpɛə','''kɔmpɛə','[n] 主持人, 指挥者','Oscars organizers have already confirmed one change by announcing Australian actor Hugh Jackman as the host of the show, a departure from the recent tradition of popular comedians acting as  compere.  奥斯卡的主办者已经证实了一项改变，就是这次的主持将由澳大利亚人休·杰克曼担任。 以往都是由知名的喜剧演员担任这一职务的。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5845','initiative','ɪ''nɪʃətɪv','ɪ''nɪʃɪətɪv; -ʃə-','[n] 主动','I wish my son would show more initiative.  我希望我的儿子能表现得再主动一些。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_5846','host','host','həʊst','[n] 主人, 旅馆招待 许多','Our host greeted us at the door.  主人在门口迎接我们。'),
