('GRE_2','GRE_2_6332','topple','''tɑpl','''tɒp(ə)l','[v] 倾倒','This scandal could topple the government.  这一丑闻可能使政府倒台。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6333','confide','kən''faɪd','kən''faɪd','[v] 倾诉, 委托, 信赖',''),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6334','sanitize','''sænitaiz','''sænɪtaɪz','[v] 清洁','This is usually fine, unless they forget to sanitize, or check, the incoming data.  这通常是没问题的，除非他们忘记清洁或检查输入数据。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6335','liquidate','''lɪkwɪdet','''lɪkwɪdeɪt','[v] 清算','The stock was sold to liquidate the loan.  股票被卖出以偿还贷款。'),
