('GRE_2','GRE_2_6338','dislodge','dɪs''lɑdʒ','dɪs''lɒdʒ','[v] 驱逐','the revolution that failed to dislodge the British in 1919  未能推翻英国统治的1919年革命'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6339','expel','ɪk''spɛl','ɪk''spel; ek-','[v] 驱逐, 开除, 排出, 发射','More than five-thousand high school students have been expelled for cheating.  五千多名中学生因考试作弊而被开除。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6340','evict','ɪ''vɪkt','ɪ''vɪkt','[v] 驱逐, 逐出(租户), 收回(租屋、租地等)',''),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6341','genuflect','''dʒɛnjuflɛkt','''dʒenjʊflekt','[v] 屈服','He genuflected in front of the altar.  他在祭坛前屈膝施礼。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6342','quash','kwɑʃ','kwɒʃ','[v] 取消','When you encounter a particular strain, your body eventually produces antibodies to it, which remain on hand to quash that virus the next time you’re exposed.  当你遇到一种特殊的抗原时，你体内最终就会产生抗体对付它，下次你再感染这种病毒就会马上产生抗体消灭它。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6343','rusticate','''rʌstɪ,ket','''rʌstɪkeɪt','[v] 去乡下, 使定居乡下',''),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6344','propitiate','prə''pɪʃɪet','prə''pɪʃɪeɪt','[v] 劝解','I''ve never gone out of my way to propitiate people.  我从未违心安慰过别人。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6345','exhort','ɪɡ''zɔrt','ɪg''zɔːt; eg-','[v] 劝诫, 忠告','Kennedy exhorted his listeners to turn away from violence.  肯尼迪劝告他的听众要远离暴力。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6346','avouch','ə''vautʃ','ə''vaʊtʃ','[v] 确保','He offered to avouch his innocence with his sword.  他表示愿以剑来保证他是无辜的。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6347','throng','θrɔŋ','θrɒŋ','[v] 群集','Tourists thronged the bars and restaurants.  游客挤满了酒吧和餐馆。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6348','inflame','ɪn''flem','ɪn''fleɪm','[v] 燃烧',''),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6349','defile','dɪ''faɪl','dɪ''faɪl','[v] 染污','Hallam’s tomb had been defiled and looted.  哈勒姆的坟墓遭到了亵渎和洗劫。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6350','discomfit','dɪs''kʌmfɪt','dɪs''kʌmfɪt','[v] 扰乱','They fear the public ignoring their jobs so that city services are not maintained, a discomfit to the elite.  他们也害怕公众不再去上班，导致城市服务无法维持，这种情况会扰乱精英们的计划。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6351','deem','dim','diːm','[v] 认为, 相信','French and German were deemed essential.  法语和德语被认为是必需的。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6352','ablate','æb''let','æb''leɪt','[v] 融化','Objective To evaluate the therapeutic efficacy of percutaneous ethanol injection (PEI) under CT guidance to ablate retroperitoneal or intraperitoneal metastatic lymph nodes.  目的研究CT引导下经皮穿刺酒精消融疗法对腹膜后或腹腔转移性淋巴结的治疗价值。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6353','squirm','skwɝm','skwɜːm','[v] 蠕动','Christine squirmed uncomfortably in her chair.  克里斯蒂娜坐在椅子上不自在地扭来扭去。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6354','revile','rɪ''vaɪl','rɪ''vaɪl','[v] 辱骂, 斥责','The President was now reviled by the same party he had helped to lead.  如今谩骂总统的正是他曾经协助领导的那个政党。'),
