('GRE_2','GRE_2_6367','deify','''deɪfaɪ','''deɪɪfaɪ; ''diːɪ-','[v] 神化','Valentino was virtually deified by legions of female fans.  华伦天奴实际上被女性粉丝团神化了。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6368','seep','sip','siːp','[v] 渗出, 渗漏','Radioactive water had seeped into underground reservoirs.  放射性水已渗入了地下蓄水池。'),
