('GRE_2','GRE_2_6375','etch','ɛtʃ','etʃ','[v] 蚀刻','A laser is used to etch a pattern in the smooth surface of the disc.  激光器用于在光盘的光滑表面刻录图案。'),
('GRE_2','GRE_2_6376','rehabilitate',',riə''bɪlə,tet','riːə''bɪlɪteɪt','[v] 使(身体)康复, 使复职, 使恢复名誉, 使复原','The Prime Minister seems to be trying to rehabilitate the former defence secretary.  首相似乎在努力为前国防大臣恢复名誉。'),
