('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_246','Procrustes','prəu''krʌsti:z','prəu''krʌsti:z','普罗克拉斯提斯（古希腊神话传说中 Attica 的一个强盗）','Near to the banks of the Cephissus lived the giant Procrustes , of whom (as was the case with other giants) Theseus had heard long before he met him.  在科菲索斯河岸边住着巨人普洛克洛斯忒斯，就象其它的巨人一样，忒修斯早就听说了他的情况。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_247','Crete','kri:t','kri:t','克里特岛（希腊位于地中海西部的一个岛屿）','Pavlos Tsimas says some people commit suicide in a public way, like the businessman in Crete.  特斯马斯表示一些人以公开的方式自杀，就像克里特岛这位小商人。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_248','fleece','flis','fliːs','[n] 羊毛','...a special protein which triggers the animal to shed its fleece.  …一种能够促使这种动物脱毛的特殊蛋白质。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_249','Perseus','''pə:sju:s; -siəs','''pə:sju:s; -siəs','珀尔休斯（希腊主神宙斯之女，杀死怪 Medusa 的英雄）','The hero is Perseus, called a demi-god, because his father is Zeus the god, while his mother a human.  我们的主角是珀尔修斯，他是一个半人神，因为他的爸爸是一个神，宙斯，而他的妈妈是一个人。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_250','vice versa',',vaisi''və:sə',',vaisi''və:sə','反之亦然','The boys may refuse to play with the girls, and vice versa.  男孩可能拒绝和女孩玩耍，反之亦然。'),
