('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_302','unwary','ʌn''wɛri','ʌn''weərɪ','[adj] 无警惕的，易受欺骗的','With its quicksands the river usually drowns a few unwary visitors every season.  这条有流沙的河每季都要淹死一些不警觉的游客。'),
('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_303','autobiography',',ɔtəbaɪ''ɑɡrəfi','ɔːtəbaɪ''ɒgrəfɪ','[n] 自传','He published his autobiography last autumn.  他去年秋天出版了他的自传。'),
