('PEPGaoZhong_11','PEPGaoZhong_11_309','roundabout','''raʊndəbaʊt','''raʊndəbaʊt','[adj] 迂回的；委婉的','The bus took a very long and roundabout route.  公共汽车路线很长，绕着圈子走。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1','back','bæk','bæk','[adv] 回原处; [n] 背,后面; [adj] 后面的; [v] 后退','I’ll be back in a minute.  我马上回来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2','significant','sɪɡ''nɪfɪkənt','sɪg''nɪfɪk(ə)nt','[adj] 重要的,意义重大的','His most significant political achievement was the abolition of the death penalty.  他政治上最重大的成就是废除了死刑。'),
