('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_30','member','''mɛmbɚ','''membə','[n] 成员,会员','The majority of union members voted in favour of a strike.  大多数工会成员投票赞成罢工。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_31','toward','tɔrd; təˈwɔrd','tə''wɔːd; twɔːd; tɔːd','[prep] 向,朝,接近',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_32','house','haʊs','haʊs','[n] 房屋; [v] 给…房子住','a four-bedroom house  一幢有四间卧室的房子'),
