('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_34','last','læst','lɑːst','[adj] 刚过去的,最后的; [adv] 最后; [v] 持续','Much has changed since my last visit.  自我上次来访后，变化很大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_35','location','lo''keʃən','lə(ʊ)''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 位置,地点','His apartment is in a really good location.  他的公寓地段很好。'),
