('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_42','family','''fæməli','''fæmɪlɪ; -m(ə)l-','[n] 家,家庭','Do you know the family next door?  你认识隔壁那家人吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_43','site','saɪt','saɪt','[n] 位置,地点; [v] 使位于,设置','an archaeological site  考古现场'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_44','incorrect',',ɪnkə''rɛkt','ɪnkə''rekt','[adj] 不正确的,错误的','The information you gave us was incorrect.  你给我们的信息不准确。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_45','agricultural',',ægrɪ''kʌltʃərəl','æɡrɪ''kʌltʃərəl','[adj] 农业的','Farmers struggling for survival strip the forests for agricultural land.  为生存而挣扎的农民们把森林伐光来作农业用地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_46','generally','''dʒɛnrəli','''dʒen(ə)rəlɪ','[adv] 通常,普遍地','It could be five years before the drug is generally available.  这种药可能还要过五年才能广泛投入市场。'),
