('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_48','atmosphere','''ætməsfɪr','''ætməsfɪə','[n] 大气,空气,气氛','The hotel had a lovely relaxed atmosphere .  那家宾馆的气氛轻松愉快。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_49','themselves','ðɛm''sɛlvz','ð(ə)m''selvz','[pron] 他(她、它)们自己','Teachers have no choice but to take measures to protect themselves.  教师们别无选择，只能采取措施来保护自己。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_50','though','ðo','ðəʊ','[conj] 尽管,虽然; [adv] 可是','Though she’s almost 40, she still plans to compete.  尽管已经快40岁了，她仍然打算参加比赛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_51','strong','strɔŋ','strɒŋ','[adj] 强烈的,坚强的,强壮的','He was a big strong man.  他高大健壮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_52','clear','klɪr','klɪə','[a&ad] 清晰的(地); [v] 清除; [v] 变清澈','Snowplows have been out clearing the roads.  扫雪机已经出动，去清扫路面了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_53','reduce','rɪ''dʊs','rɪ''djuːs','[v] 减少,缩小','The governor announced a new plan to reduce crime.  州长宣布了一项降低犯罪率的新计划。'),
