('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_56','thus','ðʌs','ðʌs','[adv] 如此,因此','Most of the evidence was destroyed in the fire. Thus it would be almost impossible to prove him guilty.  大多数证据已在大火中烧毁，因而要证明他有罪几乎是不可能的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_57','cannot','''kænɑt','''kænɒt; kæ''nɒt','[conj] 不能','You cannot have both together.  你不能二者兼得。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_58','statement','''stetmənt','''steɪtm(ə)nt','[n] 陈述,声明','In an official statement, she formally announced her resignation.  在一份官方声明中，她正式宣布辞职。'),
