('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_145','past','pæst','pɑːst','[adj] 以前的; [prep&ad] 经过,过; [n] 过去','Judging by her past performance, Jane should do very well.  从以往的表现来看，简应该会干得很好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_146','say','se','seɪ','[v] 说,表明','‘I’m so tired,’ she said.  “我太累了。”她说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_147','flow','flo','fləʊ','[n&v] 流动,淹没','a new road system to improve traffic flow through the city centre  疏导市中心车流的新道路系统'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_148','break','brek','breɪk','[n] 休息; [v] 打破,弄坏','We’ll have a short break for lunch, then start again at two o''clock.  我们稍微休息一下吃午饭，两点钟再开始。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_149','low','','ləʊ','[a&ad] 低(的),低下(的)','He had to duck his head to get through the low doorway.  他只得把头低下才能通过那低矮的门道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_150','seed','sid','siːd','[n] 种子; [v] 播种','He’s been top seed for the past two years.  他在过去两年中一直是头号种子选手。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_151','perhaps','pɚ''hæps','pə''hæps','[adv] 也许,可能','Perhaps she’s next door.  她也许在隔壁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_152','steam','stim','stiːm','[n] 蒸汽v蒸,蒸发','Steam rose from the hot tub.  水蒸气从热腾腾的浴缸里升起。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_153','picture','''pɪktʃɚ','''pɪktʃə','[n] 画,照片; [v] 描绘,构想','The room had several pictures on the walls.  那个房间墙上有几幅画。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_154','east','ist','iːst','[n] 东(方，部)a东方(部)的; [adv] 向东方','Which way is east?  哪边是东？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_155','agriculture','''æɡrɪkʌltʃɚ','''ægrɪkʌltʃə','[n] 农业,农学','More than 75% of the land is used for agriculture.  75%以上的土地用于农耕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_156','particle','''pɑrtɪkl','''pɑːtɪk(ə)l','[n] 微粒,极小量','dust particles  尘埃'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_157','aspect','''æspɛkt','''æspekt','[n] 方面,外观','The storm outside gave the room a sinister aspect.  外面的暴风雨使房间里变得阴森可怕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_158','industrial','ɪn''dʌstrɪəl','ɪn''dʌstrɪəl','[adj] 工业的,产业的','By 1900, Britain was a mainly industrial society.  到1900年英国已基本进入工业社会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_159','field','fild','fiːld','[n] 田地,领域','a view of green fields and rolling hills  田野青翠、丘陵起伏的景色'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_160','experiment','ɪk''sperɪmənt','ɪk''sperɪm(ə)nt; ek-','[n] 试验; [v] 尝试,做实验','The astronauts are conducting a series of experiments to learn more about how the body adapts to weightlessness.  那些宇航员正在进行一系列实验，以便更多地了解人体如何适应失重状态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_161','itself','ɪt''sɛlf','ɪt''self','[pron] 它自己','The cat lay on the sofa, washing itself.  猫躺在沙发上把自己舔干。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_162','relate','rɪ''let','rɪ''leɪt','[v] 叙述,使有联系,有关联','I don’t understand how the two ideas relate.  我不明白这两个观点有什么联系。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_163','yet','jɛt','jet','[adv] 还,已经; [conj] 然而','‘When’s your holiday?’ ‘Oh, not for ages yet.’  “你什么时候去休假？”“噢，不知何年何月呢。”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_164','instrument','''ɪnstrəmənt','''ɪnstrʊm(ə)nt','[n] 仪器,工具','surgical instruments  外科(手术)器械'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_165','speed','spid','spiːd','[n] 速度; [v] 加速,急行','The truck was travelling at a speed of 50 mph.  卡车正以 50 英里的时速在行驶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_166','thousand','''θaʊznd','''θaʊz(ə)nd','[n] 一千(个),许许多多,成千上万','a journey of almost a thousand miles  将近1,000英里的旅程'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_167','print','prɪnt','prɪnt','[v] 印刷,冲洗(照片)','Over five million copies of the paper are printed every day.  这份报纸每日印量超过五百万。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_168','therefore','''ðɛrfɔr','''ðeəfɔː','[adv] 因此,所以','Their car was bigger and therefore more comfortable.  他们的车大些，所以更舒适些。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_169','tradition','trə''dɪʃən','trə''dɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 传统,惯例','the traditions of South East Asia  东南亚的传统'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_170','goods','ɡʊdz','ɡʊdz','[n] 货物,商品','the large market for consumer goods  庞大的消费品市场'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_171','represent',',rɛprɪ''zɛnt','reprɪ''zent','[v] 代表,表现,描绘','Mr Kobayashi was chosen to represent the company at the conference.  小林先生被选中代表公司出席会议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_172','iceberg','''aɪs''bɝg','''aɪsbɜːg','[n] 冰山,冷若冰霜的人',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_173','our','aʊr','aʊə','[pron] 我们的','They partook of our triumph.  他们分享我们的胜利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_174','man','mæn','mæn','[n] 男人,人(类)','There were two men and a woman in the car.  车上有两男一女。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_175','store','stɔr','stɔː','[v] 储存,贮藏; [n] 商店','Store the beans in an airtight jar.  把豆子贮存在密封罐内。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_176','depend','dɪ''pɛnd','dɪ''pend','[v] 依靠,取决于','He depended on his writing for his income.  他靠写作谋生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_177','heavy','''hɛvi','''hevɪ','[a&ad] 重的,大量的','His heavy boots cumbered him in walking.  他的笨重的靴子使他行走不便。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_178','general','''dʒɛnrəl','''dʒen(ə)r(ə)l','[adj] 普遍的,概括的','There has been a general decline in standards.  道德水准普遍下降。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_179','story','''stɔri','''stɔːrɪ','[n] 故事,小说','a book of short stories  短篇小说集'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_180','technology','tɛk''nɑlədʒi','tek''nɒlədʒɪ','[n] 工艺,技术','Modern technology makes moving money around much easier than it used to be.  现代科技使货币流动比以前便捷得多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_181','rain','reɪn','reɪn','[n] 雨; [v] 下雨','a night of wind and rain  风雨交加的夜晚'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_182','contrast','''kɑntræst','''kɒntrɑːst','[v&n] 对比,对照','The sauce is quite sweet, so add dried thyme as a contrast.  这调味汁很甜，所以要加点干百里香作为陪衬。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_183','predator','''prɛdətɚ','''predətə','[n] 掠夺者,食肉动物','With no natural predators on the island, the herd increased rapidly.  由于岛上没有天然食肉动物，牧群的数量迅速增加。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_184','against','ə''ɡɛnst','ə''genst; ə''geɪnst','[prep] 反对,逆,防御','sailing against the wind  逆风航行'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_185','survive','sɚ''vaɪv','sə''vaɪv','[v] 活着,幸存','Only 12 of the 140 passengers survived.  140 名乘客中只有 12 人生还。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_186','biological',',baɪə''lɑdʒɪkl','baɪə(ʊ)''lɒdʒɪk(ə)l','[adj] 生物(学)的','the biological functions of the body  人体的生物机能'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_187','nature','''netʃɚ','''neɪtʃə','[n] 自然(界),本性','We grew up in the countryside, surrounded by the beauties of nature.  我们在乡村长大，周围是美丽的大自然。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_188','expression','ɪk''sprɛʃən','ɪkˈspreʃn','[n] 措辞,表达','Student leaders are demanding greater freedom of expression (= the right to say what you think without being punished ).  学生领袖要求得到更多的言论自由。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_189','solar','''solɚ','''səʊlə','[adj] 太阳(能)的','a solar eclipse  日食'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_190','teacher','''titʃɚ','''tiːtʃə','[n] 教师','a primary school teacher  小学教师'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_191','off','ɔf','ɒf','[adv] 掉(下),离开,停止','He got into his car and drove off.  他上了车，随即开车走了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_192','town','taʊn','taʊn','[n] 城市,城镇','an industrial town in the Midlands  英格兰中部的一座工业城镇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_193','architecture','''ɑrkə''tɛktʃɚ','''ɑːkɪtektʃə','[n] 建筑,建筑学','He studied architecture at university.  他在大学里读的是建筑学。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_194','train','tren','treɪn','[v] 训练,培训','a highly trained workforce  训练有素的劳动力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_195','contribute','kən''trɪbjut','kən''trɪbjuːt; ''kɒntrɪbjuːt','[v] 捐助,贡献','The three sons also contribute to the family business.  3个儿子也为家族企业做贡献。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_196','least','list','liːst','[ad&a] 最小的,最少的','Who knows most says least.  懂得最多的人， 说得最少。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_197','pass','pæs','pɑːs','[v] 通过,经过','The crowd parted to let the truck pass.  人群分开让卡车通过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_198','always','''ɔlwez','''ɔːlweɪz; -ɪz','[adv] 总是,一直,始终,','Always lock your bicycle to something secure.  每次都要把自行车锁在牢固的物体上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_199','normal','''nɔrml','''nɔːm(ə)l','[adj] 正常的,正规的','A normal working week is 40 hours.  一个正常的工作周是40小时。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_200','mineral','''mɪnərəl','''mɪn(ə)r(ə)l','[n] 矿物,矿石','The area is very rich in minerals .  该地区矿产非常丰富。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_201','primarily','praɪ''mɛrəli','''praɪm(ə)rɪlɪ; praɪ''mer-','[adv] 主要地,起初地','The advertisement is aimed primarily at children.  这则广告的对象主要是儿童。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_202','knowledge','''nɑlɪdʒ','''nɒlɪdʒ','[n] 知识,学问','He did not have much knowledge of American history.  他对美国历史所知不多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_203','ask','æsk','ɑːsk','[v] 询问,请求,邀请','‘What’s your name?’ she asked.  “你叫什么名字？”她问道 。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_204','observe','əb''zɝv','əb''zɜːv','[v] 注意到,观察,监视','Scientists have observed a drop in ozone levels over the Antarctic.  科学家已经观察到南极洲上方的臭氧浓度有所下降。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_205','simple','''sɪmpl','''sɪmp(ə)l','[adj] 简单的,朴素的','a simple but effective solution to the problem  对这个问题简单而有效的解决办法'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_206','slow','sloʊ','sləʊ','[adj] 慢的; [v] 放慢,减速','The car was travelling at a very slow speed.  汽车正以非常慢的速度行驶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_207','canal','kə''næl','kə''næl','[n] 运河,沟渠','We walked along by the side of the canal.  我们沿着运河边往前走。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_208','craft','kræft','krɑːft','[n] 工艺,手艺','traditional rural crafts  传统的乡村手工艺'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_209','name','nem','neɪm','[n] 名字; [v] 命名','Her name is Mandy Wilson.  她的名字是曼迪•威尔逊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_210','reflect','rɪ''flɛkt','rɪ''flekt','[v] 反映,反射','The drop in consumer spending reflects concern about the economy.  消费支出的下降反映出人们对经济的担忧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_211','addition','ə''dɪʃən','ə''dɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 加,增加,附加物','This is a fine book; a worthy addition to the series.  这是一本好书——是对这套丛书有价值的增补。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_212','argue','''ɑrgjʊ','''ɑːgjuː','[v] 说服,争论,辩论','We could hear the neighbours arguing.  我们听到邻居在争吵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_213','draw','drɔ','drɔː','[v] 画,拖,移动','Katie had drawn a cottage with a little stream running next to it.  凯蒂画了一间小茅舍，旁边流淌着一条小溪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_214','theater','''θiətɚ','''θɪətə','[n] 戏院,剧场','It ushered in the new theater season.  它预示了新的戏剧旺季的来临。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_215','above','ə''bʌv','ə''bʌv','[prep] 在…上方,多(大,高)于; [adv] 在上面','Our office is above the hairdresser’s.  我们的办公室在理发店上面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_216','especially','ɪ''spɛʃəli','ɪ''speʃ(ə)lɪ; e-','[adv] 特别,尤其','I never liked long walks, especially in winter.  我向来不喜欢长距离散步，尤其在冬天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_217','central','''sɛntrəl','''sentr(ə)l','[adj] 中心的,主要的,重要的','He lives in central London.  他住在伦敦市中心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_218','apply','ə''plaɪ','ə''plaɪ','[v] 申请,应用','We need to apply for planning permission to build a garage.  我们建车库需要申请规划许可。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_219','quickly','''kwɪkli','''kwɪklɪ','[adv] 快速地','We need to get this finished as quickly as possible.  我们必须尽快完成此事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_220','every','''ɛvri','''evrɪ','[adj] 每个,一切的,每隔','His every utterance will be scrutinized.  他说的每句话都会被细查。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_221','successful','sək''sɛsfl','sək''sesfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 成功的,圆满的','The operation was successful.  手术成功了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_222','frequent','''frikwənt','''friːkw(ə)nt','[adj] 频繁的,经常的','Trains rushed past at frequent intervals .  火车频频驶过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_223','surround','sə''raʊnd','sə''raʊnd','[v] 包围,环绕','He glared at the people who surrounded the tent.  他怒视着围住帐篷的那些人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_224','practice','''præktɪs','''præktɪs','[n&v] 练习','It takes hours of practice to learn to play the guitar.  学习弹吉他需要长时间的练习。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_225','introduce','ˌɪntrə''dus','ɪntrə''djuːs','[v] 介绍,引进','Have you two been introduced? Tom, this is Greg.  有人给你们俩互相介绍了吗？汤姆，这位是格雷格。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_226','aggressive','ə''ɡrɛsɪv','ə''gresɪv','[adj] 侵略的,进攻性的','an aggressive form of breast cancer  一种侵袭性乳腺癌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_227','act','ækt','ækt','[v] 行动,表演; [n] 行为','The company acted correctly in sacking him.  公司解雇他做得对。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_228','Canada','''kænədə','''kænədə','[n] 加拿大','She was domiciliated in Canada.  她在加拿大定居。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_229','extreme','ɪk''strim','ɪk''striːm; ek-','[adj] 极度的,极端的; [n] 极端,过分','Extreme poverty still exists in many rural areas.  许多农村地区仍处于赤贫状态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_230','test','tɛst','test','[n&vt] 试验,测试','Did you get a good mark in the test?  你这次测验成绩好吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_231','glacial','''ɡleʃl','''gleɪsɪəl; -ʃ(ə)l','[adj] 冰川(期)的,非常冷的','a glacial valley  冰川谷'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_232','sense','sɛns','sens','[v] 感觉,意识到','Perhaps he sensed your distrust.  也许他感觉到了你的不信任。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_233','eat','it','iːt','[v] 吃','Felix chatted cheerfully as he ate.  费利克斯一边吃一边兴奋地聊天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_234','single','''sɪŋɡl','''sɪŋg(ə)l','[adj] 单一的,单个的,独身的','A single tree gave shade from the sun.  唯有一棵树遮阴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_235','quality','''kwɑləti','''kwɒlɪtɪ','[n] 质量,品质,性质','Much of the land was of poor quality.  很多地的土质很差。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_236','teach','titʃ','tiːtʃ','[v] 讲授,教授','She taught me fractions and counting.  他教我分数和计算。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_237','continent','''kɑntɪnənt','''kɒntɪnənt','[n] 大陆,洲','the continents of Asia and Africa  亚洲及非洲大陆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_238','cycle','''saɪkl','''saɪk(ə)l','[n] 循环,周期; [v] 骑自行(摩托)车,循环','a woman’s menstrual cycle  女性的月经周期'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_239','previous','''privɪəs','''priːvɪəs','[adj] 以前的,先于,在之前','She has a teenage daughter from a previous marriage.  她有个出自前一次婚姻的十几岁的女儿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_240','northern','''nɔrðɚn','''nɔːð(ə)n','[adj] 北方的,北部的','a man with a northern accent  带有北方口音的男子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_241','separate','(for v.) sɛpəˌret; (for adj.) sɛprɪt','(for v.) ˈsepəreɪt; (for adj.) ˈseprət','[v] 分开,隔开','Ed stepped in to separate the two dogs.  埃德上前把这两条狗分开。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_242','cost','kɔst','kɒst','[n] 价格,成本; [v] 花费,使付出','I offered to pay the cost of the taxi.  我提出支付出租车费。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_243','advantage','əd''væntɪdʒ','əd''vɑːntɪdʒ','[n] 优势,有利条件; [v] 有利于','Younger workers tend to be at an advantage (=  have an advantage  ) when applying for jobs.  年轻点的工人申请工作时往往处于优势地位。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_244','transportation',',trænspɔr''teʃən','trænspɔː''teɪʃ(ə)n; trɑːns-','[n] 运输(工具、系统)','The city needs to improve its public transportation (= buses, trains etc ) .  这座城市需要改善公共交通。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_245','discovery','dɪ''skʌvəri','dɪ''skʌv(ə)rɪ','[n] 发现,发现物','I felt I''d made an incredible discovery.  我感到自己有了一个惊人的发现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_246','stream','strim','striːm','[n] 小河,溪流; [v] 涌流(出)','There was a small stream at the end of the garden.  这个花园的尽头有一条小溪。'),
