('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_254','get','ɡɛt','get','[v] 获得,得到','We need to get help quickly!  我们需要马上得到帮助！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_255','substance','''sʌbstəns','''sʌbst(ə)ns','[n] 物质,实质,主旨','The leaves were covered with a strange sticky substance.  树叶上覆着一层黏糊糊的怪东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_256','original','ə''rɪdʒənl','ə''rɪdʒɪn(ə)l; ɒ-','[adj] 原始的,最初的','The land was returned to its original owner.  这块土地归还给了原主。'),
