('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_259','belong','bɪ''lɔŋ','bɪ''lɒŋ','[v] 属于','The house had belonged to her family for three or four generations.  这座房子属于她家已有三四代了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_260','construction','kən''strʌkʃən','kən''strʌkʃ(ə)n','[n] 建造,结构','a road construction project  道路修建计划'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_261','swim','swɪm','swɪm','[n&v] 游泳','Let’s go swimming this afternoon.  今天下午我们游泳去吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_262','southern','''sʌðɚn','''sʌð(ə)n','[adj] 南的,南方的','a southern accent  南部口音'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_263','worth','wɝθ','wɜːθ','[prep] 相当于…价值的,值得…的; [n] 价值','It was a lot of hard work, but it was worth it .  虽然非常辛苦，但是值得。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_264','run','rʌn','rʌn','[v] 跑,运转,经营','For a while, she ran a restaurant in Boston.  有一段时间她在波士顿开餐馆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_265','imply','ɪm''plai','ɪm''plaɪ','[v] 暗示, 意味','an implied threat  隐含的威胁'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_266','basic','''besɪk','''beɪsɪk','[adj] 基本的,基础的','the basic principles of chemistry  化学的基本原理'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_267','internal','ɪn''tɝnl','ɪn''tɜːn(ə)l','[adj] 内在的,国内的','We have no interest in interfering in the internal affairs of other countries.  我们对干涉其他国家内政不感兴趣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_268','crystal','''krɪstl','''krɪst(ə)l','[n] 水晶','a set of six crystal glasses  六件套水晶玻璃杯'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_269','explanation',',ɛksplə''neʃən','eksplə''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 解释,说明','She told the court she would give a full explanation of the prosecution''s decision on Monday.  她告诉法庭她将在星期一就控方的决定做出详尽的解释。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_270','evolve','ɪ''vɑlv','ɪ''vɒlv','[v] 演变,进化,发展','Animals have evolved camouflage to protect themselves from predators.  动物进化形成了伪装，以保护自身不被捕食性动物所捕食。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_271','hundred','''hʌndrəd','''hʌndrəd','[n] 百,[pl]数以百计','I’m not a hundred percent sure where she lives.  我不能完全确定她住在哪里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_272','start','stɑrt','stɑːt','[v] 开始,出发','There’s so much to do. I don’t know where to start.  有那么多的事情要做，我都不知道从哪里开始。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_273','beg','bɛɡ','beg','[v] 请求,乞求','She begged and pleaded with them until they finally agreed.  她一再恳求，后来他们终于同意了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_274','rapid','''ræpɪd','''ræpɪd','[adj] 快的,迅速的','The patient made a rapid recovery.  病人迅速康复。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_275','quantity','''kwɑntəti','''kwɒntɪtɪ','[n] 量,数量','Your work has improved in quantity and quality this term.  这学期你的作业在完成数量和质量上都有提高。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_276','illustrate','''ɪləstret','''ɪləstreɪt','[v] 说明,阐明','Let me give an example to illustrate the point.  让我举个例子来说明这一点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_277','locate','ˈloˌket; loˈket','lə(ʊ)''keɪt','[v] 定位,把…设置在','Large retail chains are usually only prepared to locate stores in areas of high population density.  大型零售连锁店一般只愿意开在人口密集的地区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_278','remove','rɪ''muv','rɪ''muːv','[v] 移开,去除','Remove the old wallpaper and fill any holes in the walls.  撕下旧墙纸，把墙上的洞都填平。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_279','across','ə''krɔs','ə''krɒs','[prep] 穿过,在对面',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_280','whose','huz','huːz','[pron] 谁的,那(些)人的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_281','typical','''tɪpɪkl','''tɪpɪk(ə)l','[adj] 典型的,有代表性的','typical British weather  典型的英国天气'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_282','matter','''mætɚ','''mætə','[n] 事情,情况; [v] 要紧','There are more important matters we need to discuss.  我们有更重要的事情需要讨论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_283','resource','''risɔrs','rɪ''sɔːs; rɪ''zɔːs','[n] 资源','Canada’s vast mineral resources  加拿大丰富的矿产资源'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_284','eastern','''istɚn','''iːst(ə)n','[adj] 东方的,东部的','the eastern shore of the island  岛的东岸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_285','half','hæf','hɑːf','[n&a] 一半,半个的','Two halves make a whole.  两个一半构成一个整体。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_286','migration','maɪ''ɡreʃən','maɪ''greɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 移居,迁移','What does this migration not do?  这种迁移不能做什么？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_287','course','kɔrs','kɔːs','[n] 过程,课程','You must pass the examination to get credit for the course.  你必须通过考试才能获得那门课程的学分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_288','date','det','deɪt','[n] 日期,时期; [v] 追溯到','The date on the letter was 30th August 1962.  信上的日期是1962年8月30日。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_289','merchant','''mɝtʃənt','''mɜːtʃ(ə)nt','[n] 商人','He had a job with an Edinburgh wine merchant.  他在爱丁堡的一个葡萄酒商那里做过事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_290','face','fes','feɪs','[n] 脸; [v] 面向,面对','She had a beautiful face.  她面容秀美。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_291','coast','kost','kəʊst','[n] 海岸,海滨','We drove along the Pacific coast to Seattle.  我们沿着太平洋海岸驾车前往西雅图。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_292','machine','mə''ʃin','mə''ʃiːn','[n] 机器,机械','Could you get me a coffee from the drinks machine ?  给我从自动饮料机里买一罐咖啡好吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_293','claim','klem','kleɪm','[n&v] 声称,要求','I don’t claim to be a feminist, but I’d like to see more women in top jobs.  我不会自称是女权主义者，但我希望看到更多的女性担任高职。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_294','religious','rɪ''lɪdʒəs','rɪ''lɪdʒəs','[adj] 宗教的','I don’t share her religious beliefs .  她的宗教信仰和我的不同。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_295','twentieth','ˈtwentiəθ','ˈtwentiəθ','[num] 第二十,二十分之一','One twentieth of the total output was exported.  产量中有二十分之一出口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_296','throughout','θrʊ''aʊt','θruː''aʊt','[prep] 遍及,贯穿; [adv] 始终','a large organization with offices throughout the world  在世界各地都设有办事处的一家大型机构'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_297','special','''spɛʃl','''speʃ(ə)l','[adj] 特别的,特殊的','a special place in the classroom for reading  教室里的阅读专区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_298','plate','pleɪt','pleɪt','[n] 盘子,碟','This horse won the Galway Plate.  这匹马在戈尔韦银碟赛中获胜了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_299','mark','','mɑːk','[n] 痕迹,记号; [v] 做标记','What do those strange marks at the top mean?  顶端那些奇怪的记号是什么意思？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_300','atomic','ə''tɑmɪk','ə''tɒmɪk','[adj] 原子的,原子能的','atomic power  核动力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_301','rapidly','''ræpɪdli','''ræpɪdlɪ','[adv] 迅速地','The disease was spreading more rapidly than expected.  疾病的蔓延比预期的要快。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_302','wood','wʊd','wʊd','[n] 木头,木材','Put some more wood on the fire.  往火上再添些木柴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_303','leader','''lidɚ','''liːdə','[n] 领导者','the largest ever gathering of world leaders  全世界领导人史无前例的大聚会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_304','fire','faɪr','''faɪə','[n] 火; [v] 开火,解雇,点燃','The warehouse was completely destroyed by fire.  仓库全给烧毁了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_305','entire','ɪn''taɪɚ','ɪn''taɪə; en-','[adj] 全部的,整个的','It was the worst day in my entire life.  那是我一生中最糟糕的一天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_306','plain','plen','pleɪn','[n] 平原,草原; [adj] 清晰的,简单的','The grassy plain gave way to an extensive swamp.  青草覆盖的平原被广阔的沼泽地所取代。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_307','extend','ɪk''stɛnd','ɪk''stend; ek-','[v] 延伸,扩展','We plan to extend the kitchen by six feet.  我们打算把厨房扩建六英尺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_308','difficulty','''dɪfɪkəlti','''dɪfɪk(ə)ltɪ','[n] 困难,难点','If you have any difficulties, give me a call.  如果你遇到困难，就给我打电话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_309','core','kɔr','kɔː','[n] 核心,要点','Remove the cores, and bake the apples for 40 minutes.  去除果心，然后把苹果烤40分钟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_310','easy','''izi','''iːzɪ','[adj] 容易的,轻松的','The test was easy.  考试很容易。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_311','constant','''kɑnstənt','''kɒnst(ə)nt','[adj] 不变的,持续的','There was a constant stream of visitors to the house.  参观这幢房子的游客川流不息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_312','adult','''ædʌlt','''ædʌlt; ə''dʌlt','[n] 成年人','Some children find it difficult to talk to adults.  一些孩子觉得与大人很难谈得来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_313','consist','kən''sɪst','kən''sɪst','[v] 由组成,在于','My diet consisted almost exclusively of chocolate-covered cookies and glasses of milk.  我的饮食几乎只包含裹上巧克力的曲奇饼和一杯杯牛奶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_314','figure','''fɪɡjɚ','''fɪgə','[n] 图形,外形; [v] 计算,认为','A hexagon is a six-sided figure.  六边形是一种有六条边的几何图形。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_315','cold','kold','kəʊld','[adj] (寒)冷的; [n] (寒)冷,感冒','She splashed her face with cold water.  她往脸上泼冷水。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_316','education',',ɛdʒu''keʃən','edjʊ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 教育','She also hopes her children will get a good education.  她也希望她的孩子可以受到良好的教育。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_317','railroad','''relrod','''reɪlrəʊd','[n] 铁路; [v] 由铁道运输; [v] 在铁路公司工作','The supplies were sent on the railroad.  补给经由铁路运送。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_318','law','lɔ','lɔː','[n] 法律','Elected officials ought to obey the law.  民选官员理应遵守法律。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_319','unlike','''ʌn''laɪk','ʌn''laɪk','[adj] 不同的; [prep] 不象…','Now I see that, unlike her, they were my positive models.  现在我知道了，那些人不像她，他们是我的正面的表率。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_320','expand','ɪk''spænd','ɪk''spænd; ek-','[v] 扩大,扩展,膨胀','Water expands as it freezes.  水结冰时会膨胀。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_321','brain','bren','breɪn','[n] 脑,头脑','Messages from the brain are carried by the central nervous system.  大脑发出的信息是通过中枢神经系统传递的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_322','carbon','''kɑrbən','''kɑːb(ə)n','[n] 碳','I dread to think what the carbon footprint must be like of moving that coal but we have no choice.  我都不敢想象为了运这些煤产生了多少碳足迹，但我们没有选择。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_323','return','rɪ''tɝn','rɪ''tɜːn','[v] 返回,恢复,归还','It was forty five minutes before she returned.  过了45分钟她才回来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_324','cell','sɛl','sel','[n] 单元,细胞','cancer cells  癌细胞'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_325','either','''iðɚ','''aɪðə; ''iː-','[adv] [否]也; [a&pron] 任一的','I haven’t seen the movie and my brother hasn’t either (= he also has not seen it ).  我没看过这部电影，我弟弟也没看过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_326','company','''kʌmpəni','''kʌmp(ə)nɪ','[n] 公司','Which company do you work for?  你在哪家公司上班？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_327','grass','ɡræs','grɑːs','[n] 草','I walked across the grass.  我走在草地上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_328','engine','''ɛndʒɪn','''endʒɪn','[n] 发动机,引擎','Is the engine running smoothly?  发动机运转平稳吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_329','stimulus','''stɪmjələs','''stɪmjʊləs','[n] 促进(因素),刺激(物)','Tax cuts provided the stimulus which the slow economy needed.  减税为不景气的经济带来了其所需的刺激。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_330','hour','''aʊɚ','''aʊə','[n] 小时,钟点','The interview will last about two hours.  面试大概要持续两小时。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_331','program','''proɡræm','''prəʊɡræm','[n] 节目,计划,程序; [v] 编程','a word processing program  文字处理程序'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_332','prevent','pri''vɛnt','prɪ''vent','[v] 防止,预防','The rules are intended to prevent accidents.  这些规定旨在预防事故。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_333','per','pɚ','pɜː','[prep] 每,每一','The park attracts four million visitors per year.  那座公园每年吸引400万游客。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_334','sell','sɛl','sel','[v] 出售,卖','If you offer him another hundred, I think he’ll sell.  如果你再加一百元钱，我想他会卖的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_335','damage','''dæmɪdʒ','''dæmɪdʒ','[v&n] 损害,毁坏','These chemicals have been found to cause serious environmental damage.  经发现，这些化学物质会造成严重的环境破坏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_336','unusual','ʌn''jʊʒʊəl','ʌn''juːʒʊəl','[adj] 异常的,独特的','an unusual feature  不寻常的特点'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_337','lie','','laɪ','[v] 躺,说谎','The dog was lying dead on the floor.  那只狗躺在地上死了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_338','wall','wɔl','wɔːl','[n] 墙; [v] 围住,隔开','the Great Wall of China  中国的长城'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_339','landscape','''lænd''skep','''læn(d)skeɪp','[n] 风景,全景; [v] 美化','the beauty of the New England landscape  新英格兰风光之美'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_340','brief','brif','briːf','[n] 摘要,大纲; [adj] 简短的','The ACLU filed a brief (=  gave one to the court  ) opposing the decision.  美国公民自由联盟提交了辩护状反对这个判决。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_341','associate','ə''soʃɪet','ə''səʊʃɪeɪt; -sɪeɪt','[v] 联合,结交; [n] 伙伴; [adj] 副的','When bad men combine,good men must associate.  当坏人朋比为奸时，好人应该联合起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_342','rare','rɛr','reə','[adj] 稀有的,珍奇的','This species of plant is becoming increasingly rare.  这种植物越来越罕见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_343','minor','''maɪnɚ','''maɪnə','[adj] 较小的,次要的','We have made some minor changes to the program.  我们对那个程序做了一些小改动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_344','artisan','''ɑrtəzn',',ɑːtɪ''zæn; ''ɑːtɪzæn','[n] 工匠,技工','That allowed England to harness the creative potential of its artisan classes in a way that no other country had managed before.  如此，使得英国得以在某种程度上利用本国工匠阶层创造性潜能产生巨大的能量，此为他国以前没有做到之事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_345','meteorite','''mitɪəraɪt','''miːtɪəraɪt','[n] 陨石, 流星','I close the meteorite room and try the door across thecorridor.  我关上陨石房间的门，又打开了走廊对面的门。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_346','define','dɪ''faɪn','dɪ''faɪn','[v] 定义,详细说明','the ability to define clients’ needs  确定客户需求的能力'),
