('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_359','organization',',ɔrɡənə''zeʃən','ˌɔːɡənaɪ''zeɪʃn','[n] 组织,机构,团体','The public expect high standards from any large organization.  公众对任何大型机构都期望很高。'),
