('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_361','preserve','prɪ''zɝv','prɪ''zɜːv','[v] 保护,保存','We must encourage the planting of new trees and preserve our existing woodlands.  我们必须鼓励栽种新树木，同时也要保护现有的林地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_362','detail','''ditel','''diːteɪl','[n] 细节,详情; [v] 详述','This issue will be discussed in more detail in Chapter 5.  这个问题将在第五章里作更为详细的论述。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_363','bone','bon','bəʊn','[n] 骨,骨骼','The X-ray showed that the bone was broken in two places.  X光检查显示有两处骨折。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_364','position','pə''zɪʃən','pə''zɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 位置,职务,立场; [v] 安置','Our hotel was in a superb central position near St Mark’s Square.  我们的酒店处于极佳的中心位置，在圣马克广场附近。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_365','protect','prə''tɛkt','prə''tekt','[v] 保护','Are we doing enough to protect the environment?  我们在保护环境方面做得够吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_366','labor','''lebɚ','''leɪbə(r)','[n] 工人; [v] 劳动','However, after years of labor in their chosen field, they begin to hate their jobs.  然而，他们在选择的领域工作了几年后，便开始痛恨自己的工作。'),
