('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_369','read','rid; (read, read) rɛd','riːd; (read, read) red','[v] 读,理解','I can’t read your writing.  我看不懂你写的东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_370','positive','''pɑzətɪv','''pɒzɪtɪv','[adj] 积极的,肯定的','the power of positive thinking  正向思考的力量'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_371','receive','rɪ''siv','rɪ''siːv','[v] 接到,收到,接待','All the children will receive a small gift.  每个孩子都会收到一份小礼物。'),
