('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_377','apparent','ə''pærənt','ə''pær(ə)nt','[adj] 明显的,表面上的','The difference in quality was immediately apparent .  质量的差异显而易见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_378','motion','''moʃən','''məʊʃ(ə)n','[n] 运动,动作','Newton’s first law of motion  牛顿第一运动定律'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_379','you','ju','juː','[pron] 你,你们','Hi, Kelly. How are you?  嗨，凯利，你好吗？'),
