('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_383','vegetation','''vɛdʒə''teʃən','vedʒɪ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 植物,草木','Lefkas has an abundance of lush green vegetation.  莱夫卡斯有葱郁茂盛的植被。'),
