('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_406','data','''detə','''deɪtə','[n] 数据,资料','The research involves collecting data from two random samples.  该项研究需要从两个随机样本里收集资料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_407','coal','kol','kəʊl','[n] 煤','Put some coal on the fire.  往火里加点煤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_408','combine','kəm''baɪn','kəm''baɪn','[v] 联合,使结合','Diets are most effective when combined with exercise.  节食和锻炼相结合是最有效的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_409','happen','''hæpən','''hæp(ə)n','[v] 发生,碰巧,出现','When did the accident happen?  事故什么时候发生的？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_410','five','faɪv','faɪv','[num] 五,五个','There is also a golf course five miles away.  五英里外还有个高尔夫球场。'),
