('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_419','terrestrial','tə''rɛstrɪəl','tə''restrɪəl','[adj] 陆地的','...terrestrial life forms.  …地球上的生命形态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_420','leaf','lif','liːf','[n] 叶子','a flowering bush with large shiny leaves  叶子大而油亮的开花灌木'),
