('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_422','star','stɑr','stɑː','[n] 星,明星; [v] 以星状物装饰,变成演员','I lay on my back and looked up at the stars.  我仰卧着看天上的星星。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_423','estimate','''ɛstə,met','''estɪmeɪt','[n&v] 估计,估价','We just need an estimate of the number of people who will come.  我们只需估算一下有多少人会来。'),
