('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_437','assume','ə''sum','ə''sjuːm','[v] 假定,设想','I think we can safely assume (=  it is almost certain  ) that interest rates will go up again soon.  我想我们几乎可以肯定，利率很快会再次上调。'),
