('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_440','principle','''prɪnsəpl','''prɪnsɪp(ə)l','[n] 原理,原则','Schools try to teach children a set of principles.  学校设法教给孩子们一套道德准则。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_441','global','''ɡlobl','''gləʊb(ə)l','[adj] 全球性的,总的','global climate change  全球气候变化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_442','cause','kɔz','kɔːz','[v] 引起,使发生; [n] 原因','Heavy traffic is causing delays on the freeway.  交通拥挤使高速公路通行不畅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_443','eye','aɪ','aɪ','[n] 眼睛','He’s got beautiful eyes.  他有一双漂亮的眼睛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_444','introductory',',ɪntrə''dʌktəri','ɪntrə''dʌkt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 引导的,介绍的','as the chairman said in his introductory remarks  正如主席在开场白中所说的'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_445','weight','wet','weɪt','[n] 重量,负担; [v] 加重量于','The average weight of a baby at birth is just over seven pounds.  婴儿的平均出生体重是七磅多一点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_446','variation',',vɛrɪ''eʃən','veərɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 变化,变动','Most of his poems are variations on the theme of love.  他的大部分诗作都是有关爱情主题的形式不同的作品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_447','sculpture','''skʌlptʃɚ','''skʌlptʃə','[n] 雕塑,雕刻','...stone sculptures of figures and animals.  …人物及动物石雕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_448','student','''studnt','''stjuːd(ə)nt','[n] 学生','He’s obviously an excellent student of human nature.  显然他对人性的研究很深入。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_449','bacteria','bæk''tɪrɪə','bæk''tɪərɪə','[n] 细菌','Is it possible to multiply bacteria in the laboratory?  有可能在实验室繁殖细菌吗?'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_450','presence','''prɛzns','''prez(ə)ns','[n] 出席,存在','Your presence is requested at the club meeting on Friday.  敬请出席于周五举行的俱乐部会议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_451','accept','ækˈsɛpt; əkˈsɛpt','ə''ksept','[v] 接受,承认,同意','Rick accepted her offer of coffee.  她请里克喝咖啡，他接受了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_452','accumulate','ə''kjumjəlet','ə''kjuːmjʊleɪt','[v] 积聚,堆积','It is unjust that a privileged few should continue to accumulate wealth.  少数特权阶级继续积聚财富，这是不公平的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_453','colony','''kɑləni','''kɒlənɪ','[n] 殖民地','Algeria was formerly a French colony.  阿尔及利亚以前是法国的殖民地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_454','gradual','''ɡrædʒuəl','''grædʒʊəl','[adj] 逐渐的,逐步的','There has been a gradual change in climate.  气候渐渐发生了变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_455','piece','pis','piːs','[n] 片,块; [v] 拼合(凑)','Cut off a piece of wood 5 cm in length.  截下一段五厘米长的木头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_456','solid','''sɑlɪd','''sɒlɪd','[n] 固体','the properties of liquids and solids  液体和固体的特性'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_457','action','''ækʃən','''ækʃ(ə)n','[n] 行动,行为,作用','The government must take action (=  do something  ) now to stop the rise in violent crime.  政府现在必须采取行动遏止暴力犯罪的上升。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_458','service','''sɝvɪs','''sɜːvɪs','[n] 公共设施,服务; [v] 服务','the health service  医疗保健服务'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_459','destroy','dɪ''strɔɪ','dɪ''strɒɪ','[v] 破坏,毁灭,消灭','companies that are polluting and destroying the environment  污染和破坏环境的公司'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_460','relative','''rɛlətɪv','''relətɪv','[adj] 相对的,相关的; [n] 亲属','The relative merits of both approaches have to be considered.  两种方法的相对优点都得考虑在内。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_461','military','''mɪlətɛri','''mɪlɪt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 军事的; [n] 军队','a military helicopter  军用直升机'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_462','memory','''mɛməri','''mem(ə)rɪ','[n] 记忆(力),回忆','He has lots of happy memories of his stay in Japan.  他对在日本逗留的那段时光有许多美好的回忆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_463','potential','pə''tɛnʃl','pəˈtenʃl','[adj] 潜在的; [n] 潜能','The company has identified 60 potential customers.  该公司已确定了60位潜在的客户。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_464','sign','saɪn','saɪn','[n] 标记,符号; [v] 做标记','a sign on the door  门上的标牌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_465','electricity','ɪ''lɛk''trɪsəti',',ɪlek''trɪsɪtɪ; ,el-; ,iːl-','[n] 电流,电','The farm was very isolated, but it had electricity.  那个农场非常偏远，但有电力供应。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_466','dioxide','daɪ''ɑksaɪd','daɪ''ɒksaɪd','[n] 二氧化物','How much carbon dioxide you save, if any, depends on how far you live from work and how you get there, among other things.  如果真有的话，你可以节约多少二氧化碳？ 它取决于你住得有多远还是你如何完成目标抑或其他因素？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_467','perform','pɚ''fɔrm','pə''fɔːm','[v] 执行,履行,表演','Chenier and the band are performing at the Silver Palace tomorrow.  车尼尔和乐队明天将在银宫演出。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_468','situation',',sɪtʃu''eʃən','sɪtjʊ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 情形,境遇','I explained the situation to everyone.  我向大家介绍了一下情况。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_469','evolution','ˌɛvəˈluʃən; (occas.) ˌ ivəˈluʃən',',iːvə''luːʃ(ə)n; ''ev-','[n] 进化,发展,演变','the theory of evolution  进化论'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_470','soon','sun','suːn','[adv] 不久,很快','It will be dark soon.  天很快就要黑了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_471','fill','fɪl','fɪl','[v] 装满','He poured her a drink, then filled his own glass.  他给她倒了一杯，然后将自己的杯子斟满。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_472','fort','fɔrt','fɔːt','[n] 堡垒,要塞','The fort flanked on a swamp.  堡垒侧面靠着沼泽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_473','content','''kɑntɛnt','kən''tent','[n] 内容; [v] 使满足,使安心','The content of the media course includes scripting, editing and camera work.  大众传媒课程的内容包括稿件写作、剪辑和摄像操作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_474','success','sək''sɛs','sək''ses','[n] 成功,成就','The experiment was a big success.  实验非常成功。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_475','signal','''sɪgnl','''sɪgn(ə)l','[n] 信号,标志; [v] 发信号,标志着','At a prearranged signal the lights went out.  预定的信号一发出，灯就全灭了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_476','generation','''dʒɛnə''reʃən','dʒenə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 一代人(或产品),产生,发生','Like most of my generation, I had never known a war.  和我们这一代的大多数人一样，我并没有经历过战争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_477','vast','væst','vɑːst','[adj] 巨大的,辽阔的,大量的','The refugees come across the border in vast numbers.  大量难民涌过边境。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_478','manufacture','''mænjə''fæktʃɚ','mænjʊ''fæktʃə','[vt&n] 制造,制造业[pl]产品','the company that manufactured the drug  生产这种药的公司'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_479','compete','kəm''pit','kəm''piːt','[v] 竞争,比赛','He will be competing in the 100-metre race.  他将参加100米比赛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_480','link','lɪŋk','lɪŋk','[v] 连接,联系; [n] 联系','Police think the murders are linked.  警方认为这些谋杀案互有关联。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_481','blood','blʌd','blʌd','[n] 血; [v] 流血','Her body was found in a pool of blood.  她的尸体被发现倒在血泊之中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_482','commercial','kə''mɝʃəl','kə''mɜːʃ(ə)l','[adj] 商业的,贸易的','Our top priorities must be profit and commercial growth.  我们必须把利润和贸易增长作为我们的第一要务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_483','approach','ə''protʃ','ə''prəʊtʃ','[v] 靠近,接近; [n] 途径,方法','As I approached the house, I noticed a light on upstairs.  我走近那幢房子的时候注意到楼上有灯光。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_484','predict','prɪ''dɪkt','prɪ''dɪkt','[v] 预知,预言','Sales were five percent lower than predicted.  销售额比预期低5%。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_485','step','stɛp','step','[n] (脚)步,步骤,台阶; [v] 行走,踏上','a video of baby’s first steps  一盒婴儿学步的录像带'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_486','stand','stænd','stænd','[v] 站,坐落,处于','It looks like we’ll have to stand – there are no seats left.  看来我们只能站着——没有座位了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_487','release','rɪ''lis','rɪ''liːs','[vt&n] 释放,解脱','Police arrested several men, who were later released.  警察逮捕了几个人，后来都释放了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_488','plan','plæn','plæn','[n] 计划; [v] 计划,设计','His plan is to get a degree in economics and then work abroad for a year.  他计划先取得经济学学位，然后去国外工作一年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_489','sample','''sæmpl','''sɑːmp(ə)l','[n] 样品,样本; [v] 采样,取样','They took a blood sample to test for hepatitis.  他们取了血样做肝炎化验。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_490','expansion','ɪk''spænʃən','ɪk''spænʃ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 膨胀,扩展,扩充','The industry underwent a period of rapid expansion.  该产业经历了一轮快速扩张。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_491','extensive','ɪk''stɛnsɪv','ɪk''stensɪv; ek-','[adj] 广泛的,广阔的','The house stands in extensive grounds.  这栋房子占地面积很大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_492','reveal','rɪ''vil','rɪ''viːl','[v] 揭露,显示','He may be prosecuted for revealing secrets about the security agency.  他可能因泄露安全部门的机密而被起诉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_493','helium','''hilɪəm','''hiːlɪəm','[n] 氦','We have a helium nucleus and one electron.  我们有一个氦核和一个电子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_494','regular','''rɛgjəlɚ','''regjʊlə','[adj] 规则的,定期的','The company holds regular meetings with employees.  公司定期召集雇员开会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_495','effort','''ɛfɚt','''efət','[n] 努力,成就','please make an effort to be polite.  请尽量礼貌些。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_496','mile','maɪl','maɪl','[n] 英里','It’s 40 miles from here to the Polish border.  从这里到波兰边界有40英里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_497','irrigation','ˌɪrɪˈɡeʃn','','[n] 灌溉','Rivers and lakes provide us with water transport and irrigation.  江河湖泽给我们以舟楫和灌溉之利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_498','next','nɛkst','nekst','[n&a] 下一个的; [prep] 靠近','You have to consider what to do next.  你必须考虑下一步该做什么。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_499','actual','''æktʃuəl','''æktʃʊəl; -tjʊəl','[adj] 实际的,真实的','I’m not joking. Those were his actual words.  我没开玩笑，那都是他的原话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_500','egyptian','','ɪ''dʒɪpʃ(ə)n','[n&a] 埃及人(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_501','attempt','ə''tɛmpt','ə''tem(p)t','[n&vt] 尝试,企图,努力','He made no attempt to hide his anger.  他毫不掩饰自己的愤怒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_502','finally','''faɪnəli','''faɪnəlɪ','[adv] 最后,终于','After several delays we finally took off at six o’clock.  几经耽搁后，我们终于在六点起飞了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_503','serious','''sɪrɪəs','''sɪərɪəs','[adj] 严肃的,认真的,严重的','the serious problem of unemployment  严重的失业问题'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_504','clock','klɑk','klɒk','[n] 时钟','I heard the clock strike six (= make six loud sounds ) .  我听到钟敲了六下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_505','adapt','ə''dæpt','ə''dæpt','[v] 适应,改编','The ability to adapt is a definite asset in this job.  适应能力是做这份工作的绝对有利条件。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_506','observation',',ɑbzɚ''veʃən','ɒbzə''veɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 观察,观测','He spent two nights under close observation in hospital.  他在医院接受了两个晚上的严密观察。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_507','fine','faɪn','faɪn','[adj] 好的,优质的,健康的','‘How are you?’ ‘Fine, thanks, how are you?’  “你好吗？”“很好，谢谢，你呢？”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_508','mar','mɑr','mɑː','[n] 污点,瑕疵; [v] 破坏','Their wedding was marred by the death of Jenny’s mother a week earlier.  一周之前珍妮母亲的过世使他们的婚礼蒙上了一层阴影。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_509','distinguish','dɪ''stɪŋɡwɪʃ','dɪ''stɪŋgwɪʃ','[v] 区别,辨别','Could he distinguish right from wrong?  他能辨别是非吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_510','decrease','dɪ''kris','dɪ''kriːs','[v&n] 减少,降低','The number of people who have the disease has decreased significantly in recent years.  近年来，这种病的患者人数明显下降。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_511','Dutch','dʌtʃ','dʌtʃ','[n] 荷兰人; [adj] 荷兰的','English, Dutch and German are cognate languages.  英语、荷兰语、德语是同语族的语言。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_512','African','''æfrɪkən','''æfrɪk(ə)n','[n] 非洲人; [adj] 非洲的','Fish is a staple in the diet of many Africans.  鱼是很多非洲人饮食中的主食。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_513','rich','rɪtʃ','rɪtʃ','[adj] 富有的; [n] 有钱人','Rich mineral deposits have been found in the sea bed.  海底发现有丰富的矿床。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_514','negative','''nɛɡətɪv','''negətɪv','[adj] 否定的,消极的','students with a negative attitude to school  对上学抱消极态度的学生'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_515','vessel','''vɛsl','''ves(ə)l','[n] 船,容器,血管','a fishing vessel  渔船'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_516','galaxy','''ɡæləksi','''gæləksɪ','[n] 银河,星系','Astronomers have discovered a distant galaxy.  天文学家们发现了一个遥远的星系。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_517','focus','''fokəs','''fəʊkəs','[v] 集中,聚集; [n] 焦点,中心','The focus of recent research has been on environmental issues.  近期的研究重点是环境问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_518','instead','ɪn''stɛd','ɪn''sted','[adv] 代替,反而','You probably picked up my keys instead of yours.  你可能没拿你的钥匙而错拿了我的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_519','democrat','''dɛməkræt','''deməkræt','[n] 民主主义者,美国民主党人','Murray has joined other Senate Democrats in blocking the legislation.  默里已经加入其他民主党参议员反对这项立法了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_520','aquifer','''ækwɪfɚ','''ækwɪfə','[n] 含水土层,蓄水层','Know the source of your drinking water—the river, lake, or aquifer that supplies your home.  知道你的饮用水的来源——河流，湖泊或是你家的含水土层。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_521','road','rod','rəʊd','[n] 道路,途径','65 Maple Road  枫树路65号'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_522','bank','bæŋk','bæŋk','[n] 银行; [v] 把(钱)存入银行','Barclays Bank  巴克莱银行'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_523','drift','drɪft','drɪft','[v&n] 漂流','Smoke drifted up from the jungle ahead of us.  我们前方的丛林里有烟升起。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_524','appearance','ə''pɪrəns','ə''pɪər(ə)ns','[n] 出现,露面,外貌','It was his first public appearance since the election.  这是选举后他首次公开露面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_525','wire','''waɪɚ','waɪə','[n] 金属丝,电线; [v] 安装电线,发电报','copper wire  铜丝'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_526','Australia','ɔ''streljə','ɒ''streɪlɪə','[n] 澳大利亚','He transplanted his family to Australia.  他把家迁到澳大利亚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_527','price','praɪs','praɪs','[n] 价格,价值; [v] 给…定价,估价','They may pay a high price for their few years of glory.  为了短短几年的辉煌，他们也许要付出高昂的代价。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_528','outside',',aʊt''saɪd','aʊt''saɪd; ''aʊtsaɪd','[prep&n&ad&a] (在,向)的外面(的)','...the outside of the building.  …该建筑物的外部。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_529','bottom','''bɑtəm','''bɒtəm','[n] 底部,底端','The drugs had been hidden in a suitcase with a false bottom.  毒品藏在一个带假底板的行李箱里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_530','Greek','grik','griːk','[n] 希腊人; [adj] 希腊的','I had to learn Greek.  我只好学希腊语。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_531','decline','dɪ''klaɪn','dɪ''klaɪn','[v&n] 下降,衰退','The number of staff has declined from 217,000 to 114,000.  员工人数已从217000人减少到114000人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_532','business','ˈbɪznəs','ˈbɪznɪs','[n] 商业,事务,生意','Students on the course learn about all aspects of business.  这门课程的学生要学习商业活动的各个方面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_533','display','dɪ''sple','dɪ''spleɪ','[n&vt] 陈列,展览,显示','a dazzling display (= very good display ) of flowers  令人目眩神迷的花卉展'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_534','immediate','ɪ''midɪət','ɪ''miːdɪət','[adj] 直接的, 立即的','Our immediate response to the attack was sheer horror.  我们对攻击的第一反应就是非常惊恐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_535','crater','''kretɚ','''kreɪtə','[n] 弹坑','craters on the moon’s surface  月球表面的坑'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_536','strike','straɪk','straɪk','[v&n] 罢工,袭击,打','She fell heavily, striking her head against the side of the boat.  她重重地摔倒，头撞在船舷上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_537','feed','fid','fiːd','[v] 喂养','Have you fed the cat?  你喂猫了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_538','aggression','ə''ɡrɛʃən','ə''greʃ(ə)n','[n] 进攻,侵略','an unprovoked act of aggression  无端的侵犯'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_539','master','''mæstɚ','''mɑːstə','[v] 控制,精通; [n] 主人','the skills needed to master a new language  掌握一门新语言所需的技能'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_540','emerge','ɪ''mɝdʒ','ɪ''mɜːdʒ','[v] 浮现,显露','The flowers emerge in the spring.  花儿在春天开放。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_541','nation','''neʃən','''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 国家,民族','the President’s radio broadcast to the nation  总统对全国的广播讲话'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_542','import','''ɪmpɔt','ɪm''pɔːt; ''ɪm-','[vt&n] 进口,输入,[pl]进口商品',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_543','muscle','''mʌsl','''mʌs(ə)l','[n] 肌肉','Relax your stomach muscles , then stretch again.  放松腹部肌肉，然后再绷紧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_544','organize','ɔrɡənˌaɪz','ˈɔ:gənaɪz','[v] 组织,安排','The course was organized by a training company.  这一课程是由一家培训公司组织的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_545','personal','''pɝsənl','''pɜːs(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 私人的,个人的','My personal view is that we shouldn’t offer him the job.  我个人认为我们不该给他这份工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_546','careful','''kɛrfl','''keəfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 小心的,仔细的','Be careful - the floor’s slippery.  小心——地板很滑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_547','danger','''dendʒɚ','''deɪn(d)ʒə','[n] 危险(物)','Danger! No boats beyond this point.  危险！船只不可越过此处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_548','equal','''ikwəl','''i:kwəl','[adj] 同样的; [v] 等于','Two plus two equals four.  二加二等于四。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_549','desire','dɪ''zaɪɚ','dɪ''zaɪə','[n&vt] 渴望,要求','The hotel has everything you could possibly desire .  这家酒店里你想要的东西应有尽有。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_550','publish','''pʌblɪʃ','''pʌblɪʃ','[v] 出版,发表','The first edition was published in 1765.  第一版于1765年出版。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_551','bear','bɛr','beə','[v] 忍受,承担','She was afraid she wouldn’t be able to bear the pain.  她恐怕自己忍受不了这种痛苦。'),
