('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_553','character','''kærəktɚ','''kærəktə','[n] 特征,品质','The financial concessions were of a precarious character.  财政优惠具有不稳定性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_554','season','''sizn','''siːz(ə)n','[n] 季节','the effect on plants as the seasons start to change  换季对植物的影响'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_555','turtle','''tɝtl','''tɜːt(ə)l','[n] 海龟','...a pet turtle.  …一只宠物龟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_556','useful','''jusfl','''juːsfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 有用的,有益的','useful information  有用的信息'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_557','generate','''dʒɛnəret','''dʒenəreɪt','[v] 产生,发生','a useful technique for generating new ideas  能产生新创意的有用技术'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_558','breathe','brið','briːð','[v] 呼吸','The room filled with smoke, and it was becoming difficult to breathe.  房间里全是烟，呼吸越来越困难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_559','park','pɑrk','pɑːk','[n] 公园; [v] 停放(汽车等)','Let’s go for a walk in the park.  我们去公园散步吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_560','pheromone','''fɛrəmon','''ferəməʊn','[n] <生化>信息素','As they groom themselves, the tears—and the pheromone—get spread around their bodies and nests.  随着他们刷洗全身，眼泪——还有信息素——就会散布到它们的全身和窝里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_561','characterize','''kærəktə''raɪz','''kærəktəraiz','[v] 以…为特征','Bright colours characterize his paintings.  明亮的色彩是他绘画作品的特点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_562','loss','lɔs','lɒs','[n] 丧失,遗失,损失','The company is closing down two of its factories, leading to 430 job losses .  公司要关闭其中的两家工厂，这将造成430人失业。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_563','pay','pe','peɪ','[v] 付款,给予(注意等),付出代价; [n] 工资','How would you like to pay?  你想怎么付款？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_564','diversity','dɪˈvəsɪti','daɪ''vɜːsɪtɪ; dɪ-','[n] 多样性,差异','...the cultural diversity of Latin America.  …拉丁美洲文化的多样性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_565','simply','''sɪmpli','''sɪmplɪ','[adv] 简单地','Try to express yourself more simply.  尽量把你的意思表达得更简单明了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_566','real','''riəl','riːl','[adj] 真的,真实的','There is a real danger that the disease might spread.  这种疾病确实有蔓延的危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_567','stability','stə''bɪləti','stə''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 稳定性','a period of relative stability  相对稳定的一段时期'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_568','solution','sə''luʃən','sə''luːʃ(ə)n','[n] 解决,解答','The best solution would be for them to separate.  最好的解决方法是他们分开。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_569','era','''ɪrə','''ɪərə','[n] 时代,纪元','His death marked the end of an era.  他的去世标志着一个时代的终结。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_570','climax','''klaɪmæks','''klaɪmæks','[n] 高潮,顶点','The festival reaches its climax with the traditional boat-burning ceremony.  传统的烧船仪式将节庆活动推向了高潮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_571','standard','''stændɚd','''stændəd','[n] 标准,规格; [adj] 标准的','Students have to reach a certain standard or they won’t pass.  学生必须达到某一标准，否则无法通过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_572','task','tæsk','tɑːsk','[n] 任务,作业','Sara had the task of preparing the agenda for meetings.  萨拉的任务是准备会议议程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_573','speak','spik','spiːk','[v] 说话,谈话','I was so shocked I couldn’t speak.  我震惊得说不出话来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_574','shift','ʃɪft','ʃɪft','[v&n] 转移,转变,转换',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_575','additional','ə''dɪʃənl','ə''dɪʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 另外的,附加的','Additional information can be obtained from the centre.  可以从中心获取更多信息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_576','considerable','kən''sɪdərəbl','kən''sɪd(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 重要的,相当大的,可观的','Michael has already spent considerable time in Barcelona.  迈克尔在巴塞罗那已经待了相当长的时间了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_577','British','''brɪtɪʃ','''brɪtɪʃ','[adj] 英国(人)的; [n] 英国人','the British government  英国政府'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_578','mine','maɪn','maɪn','[n] 矿; [v] 采矿','Copper has been mined here since the sixteenth century.  从16世纪起这里就开始开采铜矿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_579','geologist','dʒɪ''ɑlədʒɪst','dʒɪ''ɒlədʒɪst','[n] 地质学者','He is also a geologist.  他也是一位地质学家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_580','isolate','aɪslˌet','''aɪsəleɪt','[v] 使隔离,使孤立','The town was isolated by the floods.  洪水使该镇与外界隔绝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_581','attention','ə''tɛnʃən','ə''tenʃ(ə)n','[n] 注意,关心','My attention wasn’t really on the game.  我的注意力其实不在比赛上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_582','again','ə''ɡɛn','ə''gen; ə''geɪn','[adv] 再,又','Can you say that again? I didn’t hear.  你能再说一遍吗？ 我没听见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_583','settlement','''sɛtlmənt','''set(ə)lm(ə)nt','[n] 解决,协议,居留地','Union leaders and company bosses will meet tomorrow in an attempt to reach a settlement .  工会领导人和公司老板将于明天举行会议以期达成协议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_584','wealth','wɛlθ','welθ','[n] 财富,财产','The country’s wealth comes from its oil.  这个国家的财富来自石油。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_585','prove','pruv','pruːv','[v] 证明,证实','You’re wrong, and I can prove it.  你错了，我可以证明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_586','achieve','ə''tʃiv','ə''tʃiːv','[v] 完成,达到','Frances achieved very good exam results.  弗朗西丝考试取得了优异成绩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_587','eighteenth','''e''tinθ','''eɪ''tiːnθ','[num] 第十八,十八分之一','The first accurate census, I think, is in Copenhagen at the end of the eighteenth century.  我认为,第一次精确的人口普查,是在十八世纪末的哥本哈根'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_588','opportunity','ˌɑpɚˈtunɪti, -ˈtju-','ɒpə''tjuːnɪtɪ','[n] 机会','There are fewer opportunities for new graduates this year.  今年新毕业的大学生就业机会较少。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_589','continuous','kən''tɪnjʊəs','kən''tɪnjʊəs','[adj] 连续的,持续的','continuous economic growth  持续的经济增长'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_590','flower','''flaʊɚ','''flaʊə','[n] 花; [v] 开花,繁荣','a lovely rose bush with delicate pink flowers  一簇开着娇嫩的粉红色花朵的美丽蔷薇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_591','stratum','''stretəm','''strɑːtəm; ''streɪtəm','[n] 地层,阶层','people of different social strata  各个社会阶层的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_592','kilometer','ˈkɪləˌmitɚ; kəˈlɑmətɚ','''kɪlə,mitɚ','[n] 千米,公里','She had to battle snowstorms, landslides, snakes and loneliness on her 350 kilometer journey.  在350公里的行程中，她要克服暴风雪、滑坡、蛇和孤独寂寞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_593','paper','''pepɚ','''peɪpə','[n] 纸,报纸','I’ll get you a piece of paper so you can write the number down.  我给你找张纸，你好把号码写下来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_594','red','rɛd','red','[n&a] 红色(的),','I like the way the artist uses red in this painting.  我喜欢画家在这幅作品中对红色的运用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_595','arrange','ə''rendʒ','ə''reɪn(d)ʒ','[v] 安排,排列','Contact your local branch to arrange an appointment.  请联络当地分部安排预约。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_596','promote','prə''mot','prə''məʊt','[v] 促进,提升','You don''t have to sacrifice environmental protection to promote economic growth.  你们没有必要牺牲环保来促进经济增长。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_597','prefer','prɪ''fɝ','prɪ''fɜː','[v] 更喜欢,宁愿','This type of owl prefers a desert habitat.  这种猫头鹰更喜欢沙漠的生活环境。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_598','inhabitant','ɪn''hæbɪtənt','ɪn''hæbɪt(ə)nt','[n] 居民,居住者','a city of six million inhabitants  有600万居民的城市'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_599','Mediterranean',',mɛdətə''renɪən','','[n] 地中海','You have the choice of night fishing in the Mediterranean, or windsurfing on a lake in Switzerland.  你可选择在地中海夜间垂钓，或是在瑞士的湖上玩帆板。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_600','issue','''ɪʃu','''ɪʃuː; ''ɪsjuː','[n&v] 问题,分发,颁布','Abortion is a highly controversial issue.  堕胎是个很有争议的话题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_601','fungus','''fʌŋɡəs','''fʌŋgəs','[n] 真菌,真菌类植物','It can be derived from plants, animals or other categories such as fungus or fermented products like alcohol.  它的来源来自植物、动物或者其他物质，例如真菌类或者像酒等发酵产品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_602','analysis','ə''næləsɪs','ə''nælɪsɪs','[n] 分析,解析','She’s been in analysis for three years.  她接受精神分析治疗已经三年了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_603','pot','pɑt','pɒt','[n] 罐,壶','Is there any tea left in the pot?  壶里还有茶吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_604','fuller','fʊlɚ','''fʊlə','[n] 漂洗工',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_605','slight','slaɪt','slaɪt','[adj] 轻微的,微小的','a slight improvement  些许的改进'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_606','month','mʌnθ','mʌnθ','[n] 月','I hope I’ll have finished the work by the end of the month .  我希望我这个月底能完成工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_607','hydrogen','''haɪdrədʒən','''haɪdrədʒ(ə)n','[n] 氢','Water contains hydrogen and oxygen.  水含有氢和氧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_608','depth','dɛpθ','depθ','[n] 深度','People need to realize the depth of the problem.  人们必须认识到这个问题的严重程度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_609','upon','ə''pɑn','ə''pɒn','[prep] 在之上','an honour bestowed upon the association  授予该协会的荣誉'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_610','visible','''vɪzəbl','ˈvɪzəbl','[adj] 看得见的,显而易见的','The comet is visible to the naked eye (= can be seen without using special equipment ).  这颗彗星肉眼看得见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_611','belief','bɪ''lif','bɪ''liːf','[n] 信念,信仰','When you get something wrong, it can shake your belief in yourself.  如果有什么事情没做好，就会动摇你对自己的信心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_612','skeleton','''skɛlɪtn','''skelɪt(ə)n','[n] 骨架,纲要','We agreed on a skeleton outline of the proposal.  我们给提案商定了一个基本框架。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_613','absorb','æbˈsɔrb; æbˈzɔrb; əbˈsɔrb','əb''zɔːb; -''sɔːb','[v] 吸收,吸引','Plants absorb nutrients from the soil.  植物从土壤中吸收养分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_614','advertise','''ædvɚtaɪz','''ædvətaɪz','[v] 登广告,宣传','They no longer advertise alcohol or cigarettes at sporting events.  他们不再在体育赛事上做烟酒广告了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_615','host','host','həʊst','[n] 主人','Our host greeted us at the door.  主人在门口迎接我们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_616','enable','ɪ''nebl','ɪn''eɪb(ə)l; en-','[v] 使能够,使可能','The new test should enable doctors to detect the disease early.  新的检验使医生能在早期发现该种疾病。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_617','basin','''besn','''beɪs(ə)n','[n] 脸盆,盆地','a wash basin  洗脸盆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_618','money','''mʌni','''mʌnɪ','[n] 钱,货币','Don’t spend all your money on the first day of your holiday!  别在度假的第一天就把钱都花完了！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_619','gather','''ɡæðɚ','''gæðə','[v] 聚集,集合,收集','A crowd gathered to watch the fight.  一群人聚拢来围观打架。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_620','note','not','nəʊt','[n] 便条,笔记; [v] 注意,记录','Can I borrow your lecture notes?  我能不能借用一下你的课堂笔记？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_621','flood','flʌd','flʌd','[v] 淹没,充满; [n] 洪水','Towns and cities all over the country have been flooded.  全国各地的城镇都被淹没了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_622','black','blæk','blæk','[adj] 黑暗的,黑人的','a black evening dress  黑色晚礼服'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_623','soldier','''soldʒɚ','''səʊldʒə','[n] 士兵,军人','A British soldier was wounded in the fighting.  战斗中，有一名英国士兵受了伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_624','artistic','ɑr''tɪstɪk','ɑː''tɪstɪk','[adj] 艺术的','artistic work  艺术作品'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_625','shell','ʃɛl','ʃel','[n] (贝)壳,外壳; [v] 剥壳,炮击','Never buy eggs with cracked shells.  千万不要买破壳的蛋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_626','section','''sɛkʃən','''sekʃ(ə)n','[n] 部分','The plane’s tail section was found in a cornfield.  飞机的尾部在玉米田里找到了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_627','big','bɪɡ','bɪg','[adj] 大的','a big house  大房子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_628','device','dɪ''vaɪs','dɪ''vaɪs','[n] 装置,设备','The recording device has activated.  录音装置已开动起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_629','fast','fæst','fɑːst','[a&ad] 快的,迅速的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_630','drop','drɑp','drɒp','[v] 下降,放弃; [n] 下降','The proposal was dropped after opposition from civil liberties groups.  遭到公民自由组织的反对后这一提案便被驳回了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_631','nitrogen','''naɪtrədʒən','''naɪtrədʒ(ə)n','[n] 氮','Well, we know nitrogen has what?  对于氮气我们知道什么？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_632','surprise','sɚ''praɪz','sə''praɪz','[n] 惊奇; [v] 使惊奇','The man had a look of surprise on his face.  那人脸上一副惊讶的表情。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_633','transform','træns''fɔrm','træns''fɔːm; trɑːns-; -nz-','[v] 改变,转换','Increased population has transformed the landscape.  人口的增加使景观发生了变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_634','television','''tɛlɪvɪʒn','''telɪvɪʒ(ə)n; telɪ''vɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 电视(机)','Lucy turned on the television to watch the evening news.  露西打开电视收看晚间新闻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_635','band','bænd','bænd','[n] 乐队; [v] 联合,结合','The band was playing old Beatles songs.  乐队正在演奏披头士的老歌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_636','sufficient','səˈfɪʃənt','sə''fɪʃ(ə)nt','[adj] 足够的,充分的','We can only prosecute if there is sufficient evidence.  有了足够的证据，我们才能提出起诉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_637','private','''praɪvət','''praɪvət','[adj] 私人的,私有的','Morris has a private jet.  莫里斯拥有一架私人喷气式飞机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_638','Asia','ˈeʒə;ˈeʃə','ˈeɪʒə;ˈeɪʃə','[n] 亚洲','The European powers extended their authority in Asia.  欧洲列强在亚洲扩大他们的管辖权。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_639','dust','dʌst','dʌst','[n] 尘土,粉末; [v] 除尘,撒(粉末等)','The wind was blowing dust and leaves up from the ground.  风吹起了地上的尘土和树叶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_640','attitude','''ætɪtʊd','''ætɪtjuːd','[n] 态度,看法','As soon as they found out I was a doctor, their whole attitude changed.  他们一听说我是医生，态度就完全改变了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_641','painter','''pentɚ','''peɪntə','[n] 画家,油漆匠','Gerry’s ambition was to become a portrait painter.  格里的志向是成为一名肖像画家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_642','birth','bɝθ','bɜːθ','[n] 出生','Patsy was celebrating last night after giving birth to twins.  帕齐生下一对双胞胎，昨天晚上在庆祝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_643','English','ɪŋɡlɪʃ','''ɪŋɡlɪʃ','[n&a] 英语,英国人(的)','Do you speak English?  你会说英语吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_644','agree','ə''ɡri','ə''griː','[v] 同意,赞成','Teenagers and their parents rarely agree.  十几岁的孩子跟父母意见很少一致。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_645','expensive','ɪk''spɛnsɪv','ɪk''spensɪv; ek-','[adj] 昂贵的,高价的','the most expensive restaurant in town  城里最贵的餐馆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_646','valuable','ˈvæljuəbəl; ˈvæljə-','''væljʊəb(ə)l','[adj] 贵重的,有价值的','a valuable painting  一幅名贵的画'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_647','approximate','ə''prɑksɪmət','ə''prɒksɪmət','[adj] 近似的,大约的; [v] 近似,接近','What is the approximate number of students in each class?  每个班大致有多少学生？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_648','fuel','''fjuəl','fjʊəl','[n] 燃料; [v] 加燃料','Coal is one of the cheapest fuels.  煤是最廉价的燃料之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_649','blue','blu','bluː','[n] 蓝色; [adj] 蓝色的,忧郁的','She nearly always dresses in blue.  她几乎总是穿蓝色的衣服。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_650','visual','''vɪʒʊəl','''vɪʒjʊəl; -zj-','[adj] 视觉的,看得见的','Artists translate their ideas into visual images.  画家把自己的思想转换成视觉画面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_651','shop','ʃɑp','ʃɒp','[n] 商店; [v] 买东西','a barber’s shop  理发店'),
