('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_653','offer','''ɔfɚ','''ɒfə','[n&vt] 给予,提供','A number of groups offer their services free of charge.  一些团体免费提供服务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_654','wear','wɛr','weə','[v] 穿,戴','Susanna was wearing a black silk dress.  苏珊娜穿着一条黑色真丝连衣裙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_655','dye','daɪ','daɪ','[n] 染料; [v] 给…染色','hair dye  染发剂'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_656','future','''fjʊtʃɚ','''fjuːtʃə','[n] 未来,将来','Does this school have a future?  这所学校有前途吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_657','share','ʃɛr','ʃeə','[v] 分享,分担','As a kid he’d never share his toys.  他小时候从不肯与人分享他的玩具。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_658','writer','''raɪtɚ','''raɪtə','[n] 作者,作家','She’s one of my favourite writers.  她是我最喜欢的作家之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_659','hide','haɪd','haɪd','[v] 躲藏,隐瞒','She keeps a bottle of gin hidden behind a stack of books.  她在一堆书的后面藏了一瓶杜松子酒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_660','fee','fi','fiː','[n] 费, 酬金','You can use the gym and pool for a fee of £35 a month.  月付35英镑，即可使用健身房和游泳池。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_661','tell','','tel','[v] 告诉,讲述','I’ll tell you all about it when I get back.  我回来再告诉你这一切。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_662','practical','''præktɪkl','''præktɪk(ə)l','[adj] 实际的,实践的,实用的','Candidates should have training and practical experience in basic electronics.  应征者应该具备基础电子学方面的培训和实践经验。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_663','electron','ɪ''lɛktrɑn','ɪ''lektrɒn','[n] 电子','Most things are balanced - with equal numbers of electrons and protons.  大部分物体都是电荷平衡的——含等量的电子和质子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_664','bill','bɪl','bɪl','[n] 帐单; [v] 开帐单','Have you paid the phone bill?  电话费你付了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_665','rhythm','''rɪðəm','''rɪð(ə)m','[n] 节奏,韵律','Drums are basic to African rhythm.  非洲音乐节奏少不了鼓。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_666','topic','''tɑpɪk','''tɒpɪk','[n] 话题,主题','The environment is a popular topic these days.  如今环境是一个热门话题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_667','ritual','''rɪtʃuəl','''rɪtʃʊəl','[n] 仪式,典礼','ancient pagan rituals  古老的异教仪式'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_668','existence','ɪɡ''zɪstəns','ɪg''zɪst(ə)ns; eg-','[n] 存在(物)','Scientists have many theories about how the universe first came into existence (= started to exist ).  关于宇宙的起源，科学家有多种理论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_669','spring','sprɪŋ','sprɪŋ','[n] 春天,泉; [v] 跳,涌现','spring flowers  春花'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_670','communication','kə,mjunɪ''keʃən','kəmjuːnɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 交流,通讯','Good communication is vital in a large organization.  在大机构里良好的沟通是极为重要的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_671','lightning','''laɪtnɪŋ','''laɪtnɪŋ','[n] 闪电','Two farmworkers were struck by lightning (= hit by lightning ).  两个农民遭闪电击中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_672','account','ə''kaʊnt','ə''kaʊnt','[n] 记述,帐(户),解释; [v] 说明,占',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_673','connect','kə''nɛkt','kə''nekt','[v] 连接,联系','We’d like two rooms with connecting doors (= doors that join the rooms ) .  我们想要两个有门相通的房间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_674','folk','fok','fəʊk','[n] 人们','I’m sure there are some folk who would rather they weren’t here.  我敢肯定有些人宁愿自己不在这里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_675','block','blɑk','blɒk','[v] 堵塞,妨碍','A fallen tree is blocking the road.  一棵倒下的树把路阻断了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_676','photograph','''fotəɡræf','''fəʊtəgrɑːf','[n] 照片,相片; [v] 拍照','a colour photograph  彩色照片'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_677','village','''vɪlɪdʒ','''vɪlɪdʒ','[n] 村庄','a little fishing village  一座小渔村'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_678','thin','θɪn','θɪn','[a&ad] 薄、细、瘦(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_679','beneath','bɪˈniːθ','bɪ''niːθ','[prep] 在…下,(地位等)低于; [adv] 在下方','The dolphins disappeared beneath the waves.  海豚消失在波涛中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_680','head','hɛd','hed','[n] 头部,头脑v前进,领导','He kissed the top of her head.  他吻了一下她的头顶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_681','survival','sɚ''vaɪvl','sə''vaɪv(ə)l','[n] 幸存,生存','The doctors gave him a one in ten chance of survival .  医生说他有十分之一的生存希望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_682','university',',junɪ''vɝsəti','juːnɪ''vɜːsɪtɪ','[n] (综合)大学','He teaches Esperanto at that university.  他在那所大学教世界语。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_683','concentration','''kɑnsn''treʃən','kɒns(ə)n''treɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 集中,专心','She needed all her powers of concentration to stop herself from slipping on the icy road.  她需要集中全部注意力才能不让自己在结冰的路上滑倒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_684','invention','ɪn''vɛnʃən','ɪn''venʃ(ə)n','[n] 发明,创造','The dishwasher is a wonderful invention.  洗碗机是一项奇妙的发明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_685','extinct','ɪk''stɪŋkt','ɪk''stɪŋkt; ek-','[adj] 熄灭的,灭绝的','Dinosaurs have been extinct for millions of years.  恐龙已灭绝数千万年了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_686','avoid','ə''vɔɪd','ə''vɒɪd','[v] 避免,预防','Road safety is taught to young children to avoid road accidents.  小孩子受到道路安全知识的教育，以避免交通事故。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_687','carve','kɑrv','kɑːv','[v] 雕刻,切割','carved wooden chairs  木雕椅子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_688','interior','ɪn''tɪrɪɚ','ɪn''tɪɜːrɪə','[adj] 内部的','The interior walls are all painted white.  室内墙壁都粉刷成了白色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_689','electrical','ɪ''lɛktrɪkl','ɪ''lektrɪk(ə)l','[adj] 电的,与电有关的','The fire was caused by an electrical fault.  大火是电力故障引起的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_690','continental',',kɑntɪ''nɛntl','kɒntɪ''nent(ə)l','[adj] 大陆的','the warming-up of continental interiors  内陆地区的变暖'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_691','technological','tɛknə''lɑdʒɪkl','teknə''lɒdʒɪk(ə)l','[adj] 科技的','The steam engine was the greatest technological advance of the 19th century.  蒸汽机是19世纪最伟大的技术进步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_692','death','dɛθ','deθ','[n] 死,死亡','1.5 million people are in immediate danger of death from starvation.  150万人正因饥饿而即将面临死亡的危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_693','wave','wev','weɪv','[n] 波(浪); [v] 挥动,波动','Dee watched the waves breaking on the shore.  迪伊凝视着拍岸的波涛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_694','explosion','ɪk''sploʒən','ɪk''spləʊʒ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 爆炸,爆发','We heard a loud explosion.  我们听到一声巨大的爆炸声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_695','network','''nɛtwɝk','''netwɜːk','[n] 网络,网状物','Hungary’s telephone network  匈牙利的电话网'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_696','density','''dɛnsəti','''densɪtɪ','[n] 密度','areas of high population density  人口密度高的地区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_697','flight','flaɪt','flaɪt','[n] 飞行,航班','He immediately booked a flight to Toulouse.  他当即就订了去图卢兹的航班。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_698','class','klæs','klɑːs','[n] 阶级,班级,课','I missed Bible class last week.  上周我缺席了《圣经》课。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_699','financial','faɪ''nænʃl','faɪ''nænʃ(ə)l; fɪ-','[adj] 财政的,金融的','financial transactions  财务往来'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_700','moon','mun','muːn','[n] 月球,月亮','the craters on the surface of the moon  月球表面的环形山'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_701','tissue','''tɪʃu','''tɪʃuː; ''tɪsjuː','[n] 组织,纸巾','a box of tissues  一盒面巾纸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_702','indeed','ɪn''did','ɪn''diːd','[adv] 真正地,的确,事实上','The blood tests prove that Vince is indeed the father.  验血证明文斯确实是父亲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_703','prepare','prɪ''pɛr','prɪ''peə','[v] 预备,准备','The prosecution wanted more time to prepare their case.  原告想要有更多的时间来准备诉讼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_704','cotton','''kɑtn','''kɒt(ə)n','[n] 棉花','a white cotton shirt  白色棉布衬衫'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_705','crust','krʌst','krʌst','[n] 外壳,硬壳,面包皮','sandwiches with the crusts cut off  切去边皮的三明治'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_706','trace','tres','treɪs','[v] 追踪,探索; [n] 痕迹','Sondheim’s book traces the changing nature of the relationship between men and women.  桑德海姆的这本书研究了男女关系性质的变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_707','discussion','dɪ''skʌʃən','dɪ''skʌʃ(ə)n','[n] 讨论','class discussions  课堂讨论'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_708','floor','flɔr','flɔː','[n] 地面,地板','a polished wooden floor  上过蜡的木地板'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_709','fiber','''faɪbɚ','''faibə','[n] 光纤','And remember nuts like almonds with their skins on have more fiber than those without.  记住，向杏仁那样有皮的坚果比那些没有皮的更富含纤维素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_710','geological','dʒɪə''lɑdʒɪkl','dʒɪə''lɒdʒɪkl','[adj] 地质学的','With geological maps, books, and atlases you can find out all the proven sites of precious minerals.  有了地质地图、书籍和地图册，你就可以找到所有已探明的珍贵矿藏的位置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_711','escape','ɪˈskep','ɪ''skeɪp; e-','[v] 逃跑,逃脱','He broke down the locked door and escaped.  他砸开上锁的门，逃走了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_712','dense','dɛns','dens','[adj] 密集的,浓厚的','a dense rurally-based population  居住在乡村的密集人口'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_713','stimulate','''stɪmjə''let','''stɪmjʊleɪt','[v] 刺激,激励','Her interest in art was stimulated by her father.  她对艺术的兴趣是她父亲激发的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_714','reflection','rɪ''flɛkʃən','rɪ''flekʃ(ə)n','[n] 反映,考虑','A moment’s reflection will show the stupidity of this argument.  只需认真想一下便可看出这种观点多么愚蠢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_715','accurate','''ækjərət','''ækjʊrət','[adj] 准确的,精确的','The brochure tries to give a fair and accurate description of each hotel.  该手册尽量公正、准确地介绍每一家酒店。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_716','whole','hol','həʊl','[adj] 全部的,完整的','You have your whole life ahead of you!  你有一辈子要过呢！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_717','increasingly','ɪn''krisɪŋli','ɪn''kriːsɪŋlɪ','[adv] 日益,愈加','The commercial world is now being increasingly computerized.  商业界目前正在日益计算机化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_718','spot','spɑt','spɒt','[n] 地点,污点; [v] 认出,玷污','a nice quiet spot on the beach  海滩上一个安静的好地方'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_719','length','[leŋθ]','leŋθ','[n] 长度','We measured the length and width of the living room.  我们量了客厅的长和宽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_720','advertisement',',ædvɚ''taɪzmənt','əd''vɜːtɪzm(ə)nt; -tɪs-','[n] 广告','They put an advertisement in ‘The Morning News’, offering a high salary for the right person.  他们在《晨报》上刊登了一则启事，出高薪寻找合适的人选。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_721','top','tɑp','tɒp','[n] 顶部,顶端','I waited at the top of the stairs.  我在楼梯顶端上等着。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_722','tropical','''trɑpɪkl','''trɒpɪk(ə)l','[adj] 热带的,炎热的','the tropical rain forests  热带雨林'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_723','efficient','ɪ''fɪʃnt','ɪ''fɪʃ(ə)nt','[adj] 效率高的,有能力的','a very efficient secretary  效率高的秘书'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_724','nutrient','''nutrɪənt','''njuːtrɪənt','[n] 营养品; [adj] 营养的','The plant absorbs nutrients from the soil.  植物从土壤中吸取养分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_725','ten','tɛn','ten','[num] 十,十个','Snow had been falling steadily for ten days.  雪已经连续下了10天了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_726','pastoralist','','','[n] 田园诗的作者,牧民','And some farming systems, such as traditional pastoralist systems, are frequently under-represented, say the authors.  这组作者说，而且一些农业系统——诸如传统的畜牧系统——常常未被充分代表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_727','Britain','''brɪtən','''brɪt(ə)n','[n] 英国','In World War Ⅱ,Britain fought against Germany.  第二次世界大战中，英国对德国作战。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_728','search','sɝtʃ','sɜːtʃ','[v] 搜寻,调查','It was too dark to search further.  天太暗，无法继续寻找。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_729','leatherback','''lɛðɚbæk','''leðəbæk','[n] 棱龟(大海龟之一种)','Watch out of Venezuela on the critically endangered leatherback turtles.  请关注委内瑞拉极度濒危的棱皮龟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_730','boundary','''baʊndri','''baʊnd(ə)rɪ','[n] 边界,分界线','National boundaries are becoming increasingly meaningless in the global economy.  在全球经济中，国界已经变得越来越没有意义。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_731','sky','skaɪ','skaɪ','[n] 天,天空','The sky grew dark, and a cold rain began to fall.  天色转暗，开始下起冰冷的雨来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_732','steel','stil','stiːl','[n] 钢,钢铁','a steel bridge  钢铁大桥'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_733','thick','θɪk','θɪk','[adj] 厚的,粗的','a thick oak door  一扇厚实的橡木门'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_734','fail','fel','feɪl','[v] 失败,没有通过','It looks likely that the peace talks will fail.  看来和平谈判可能会失败。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_735','Atlantic','ət''læntɪk','æt''læntɪk','[n] 大西洋; [adj] 大西洋的','They underlaid the Atlantic with a cable.  他们在大西洋海底铺设了一条电缆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_736','computer','kəm''pjutɚ','kəm''pjuːtə','[n] 计算机,电脑','a huge global computer network  巨大的全球计算机网络'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_737','fruit','frut','fruːt','[n] 水果,果实','Try to eat plenty of fresh fruit .  尽量多吃新鲜水果。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_738','tension','''tɛnʃən','''tenʃ(ə)n','[n] 紧张,拉力; [vt] 使拉紧,使绷紧','The tension was becoming unbearable, and I wanted to scream.  这种紧张变得难以忍受，我真想大声尖叫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_739','performance','pɚ''fɔrməns','pə''fɔːm(ə)ns','[n] 履行,执行,表演','This evening’s performance will begin at 8.00 pm.  今晚的演出8点开始。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_740','audience','''ɔdɪəns','''ɔːdɪəns','[n] 听众,观众','The audience began clapping and cheering.  观众开始鼓掌欢呼。'),
