('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_750','fly','flaɪ','flaɪ','[v] 乘,飞(行); [n] 苍蝇','She’s flying back to the States tomorrow.  她明天乘飞机回美国。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_751','microscope','''maɪkrəskop','''maɪkrəskəʊp','[n] 显微镜','The slightest movement will defocus the microscope.  最轻微的运动都会使显微镜散焦。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_752','comparison','kəm''pærɪsn','kəm''pærɪs(ə)n','[n] 比较,对照','Her paintings invite comparison with those of the early Impressionists (= they remind you of them ) .  她的画作让人想起早期的印象派作品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_753','appeal','ə''pil','ə''piːl','[n&v] 呼吁,上诉','The girl’s family have made a public appeal for help to try and catch her killer.  那名遇害女孩的家人吁请公众协助捉拿凶手。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_754','map','mæp','mæp','[n] 地图; [v] 绘制地图','According to the map we should turn left.  从地图上看，我们应该左拐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_755','cue','kju','kjuː','[n] 暗示,提示','She stood nervously in the wings waiting for her cue.  她紧张地站在台侧等待出场的提示。'),
