('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_861','ecologist','i''kɑlədʒɪst','i:''kɔlədʒist','[n] 生态学者','Ecologists argue that the benefits of treating sewage with disinfectants are doubtful.  生态学家们认为用消毒剂处理污水的好处是值得怀疑的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_862','exercise','''ɛksɚsaɪz','''eksəsaɪz','[n&v] 运动,练习','Try to fit some regular exercise into your daily routine.  尽量在日常生活中安排一些经常性的锻炼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_863','despite','dɪ''spaɪt','dɪ''spaɪt','[prep] 尽管,不论','Despite all our efforts to save the school, the authorities decided to close it.  尽管我们竭力想保住这所学校，当局还是决定把它关闭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_864','Indian','''ɪndɪən','''ɪndɪən','[n] 印度(人)','Do you fancy going out for an Indian?  你想出去吃印度菜吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_865','independent','''ɪndɪ''pɛndənt',',ɪndɪ''pendənt','[n] 中立派,无党派者','Mr. Vassiliou, standing as an independent, succeeded in convincing a significant number of voters of his argument.  瓦西里欧先生以无党派人士身份成功地说服了大量选民支持他的观点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_866','neighbor','''nebɚ','''neɪbə','[n] 邻居,邻国','I parked my baby at the neighbor''s house.  我把小孩寄放在邻居家里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_867','migrate','''maɪɡret','maɪ''greɪt; ''maɪgreɪt','[v] 迁移,转移','People migrate to cities like Jakarta in search of work.  人们移居到雅加达这样的城市找工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_868','contribution',',kɑntrɪ''bjuʃən','kɒntrɪ''bjuːʃ(ə)n','[n] 贡献','All the money has been raised by voluntary contribution.  所有这些钱都是靠自愿捐献筹集的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_869','divide','dɪ''vaɪd','dɪ''vaɪd','[v] 分,划分','The physical benefits of exercise can be divided into three factors.  锻炼对身体的好处可以分成3个方面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_870','prey','pre','preɪ','[v] 捕食,掠夺','The effect was to disrupt the food chain, starving many animals and those that preyed on them.  后果是打断食物链，使许多动物和捕食它们的动物饿死。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_871','expect','ɪk''spɛkt','ɪk''spekt; ek-','[v] 期待,预期','He will be hard to beat. I fully expect (= am completely sure about ) that and I’m ready.  他很难击败。我确信这一点，不过我准备好了。'),
