('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_873','billion','''bɪljən','''bɪljən','[n&a] 十亿(的)','Vivian: So you actually have billion dollars?  维维安:  你真的有十亿美元吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_874','die','daɪ','daɪ','[v] 死亡','He died in 1985 at the age of 76.  他1985年去世，终年76岁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_875','innovation',',ɪnə''veʃən','ˌɪnəˈveɪʃn','[n] 改革,创新','We must encourage innovation if the company is to remain competitive.  公司要想保持竞争力，就必须鼓励革新。'),
