('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_888','adaptation',',ædæp''teʃən','ædəp''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 适应, 改编, 改写本','Branagh won two awards for his screen adaptation of Shakespeare''s Henry the Fifth.  布拉纳因他对莎士比亚的《亨利五世》的荧幕改编而获了两次奖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_889','attack','ə''tæk','ə''tæk','[v&n] 攻击,进攻','The king hight them to attack the castle.  国王命令他们向城堡发起进攻。'),
