('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_895','summer','''sʌmɚ','''sʌmə','[n] 夏季','We tour by car every summer.  每年夏天我们都驾车出外旅行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_896','competition',',kɑmpə''tɪʃən','kɒmpɪ''tɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 竞争,竞赛','Going to trade fairs is an ideal opportunity to size up the competition .  参加商品交易会是估量竞争规模的理想机会。'),
