('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_916','poor','pʊr','pɔː; pʊə','[adj] 贫穷的,可怜的','Poor kid, he’s had a rough day.  可怜的孩子，今天他真倒霉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_917','depict','dɪ''pɪkt','dɪ''pɪkt','[v] 描述,描写','a book depicting life in pre-revolutionary Russia  描写革命前俄国人生活的一本书'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_918','prior','''praɪɚ','''praɪə','[adj] 优先的,在前的','You do not need any prior knowledge of the subject.  你无需事先具备该方面的知识。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_919','fantasy','''fæntəsi','''fæntəsɪ; -zɪ','[n] 幻想','I used to have fantasies about living in Paris with an artist.  我过去常幻想着在巴黎与一位艺术家同住。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_920','ecological','''ikə''lɑdʒɪkl','iːkə''lɒdʒɪk(ə)l; ek-','[adj] 生态学的','an ecological disaster  生态灾难'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_921','acorn','''ekɔrn','''eɪkɔːn','[n] 橡树果,橡子','First an acorn; then an oak tree forest.  先有一颗橡子，然后有了一片橡树森林。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_922','employ','ɪm''plɔɪ','ɪm''plɒɪ; em-','[v] 雇用','The factory employs over 2,000 people.  这家工厂雇用了2,000多名员工。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_923','fair','fɛr','feə','[a&ad] 公平的','We stand for fair play.  我们主张公平竞赛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_924','immigrant','''ɪmɪɡrənt','''ɪmɪgr(ə)nt','[n] 移民,侨民','an illegal immigrant  非法移民'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_925','pump','pʌmp','pʌmp','[n] 泵,抽水机','...pumps that circulate the fuel around in the engine.  …使燃料在发动机内循环的压泵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_926','fresh','frɛʃ','freʃ','[adj] 新鲜的,无经验的','Ryan will bring a fresh approach to the job.  瑞安将带来一种新的工作方法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_927','industrialization','','','[n] 工业化,产业化','And, at this point, traces of industrialization can only be found in sediments in Europe.  而在这一点上，工业化的痕迹只在欧洲的沉积物中找到。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_928','suitable','''sutəbl','''suːtəb(ə)l','[adj] 适当的,相配的','We are hoping to find a suitable school.  我们希望能找到一所合适的学校。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_929','cultivate','''kʌltɪvet','''kʌltɪveɪt','[v] 培养,耕作','The land was too rocky to cultivate.  这块地石头太多，无法耕作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_930','tie','taɪ','taɪ','[v] 扎,捆绑','I tie my hair back when I’m jogging.  我慢跑时把头发扎在脑后。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_931','derive','dɪ''raɪv','dɪ''raɪv','[v] 获取,得自,起源','Mr. Ying is one of those happy people who derive pleasure from helping others.  英先生是那种助人为乐的快活人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_932','retain','rɪ''ten','rɪ''teɪn','[v] 保持,保留','You have the right to retain possession of the goods.  你有权保留这些物品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_933','chance','tʃæns','tʃɑːns','[n] 机会','There’s always the chance that something will go wrong.  总有可能会出现问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_934','civil','''sɪvl','''sɪv(ə)l; -ɪl','[adj] 公民的,文明的','They were married in a civil ceremony in May.  他们在五月份举行了世俗婚礼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_935','prehistoric',',prihɪ''stɔrɪk','priːhɪ''stɒrɪk','[adj] 史前的','prehistoric burial grounds  史前墓地'),
