('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_937','numerous','''numərəs','''njuːm(ə)rəs','[adj] 众多的,许多的','Numerous attempts have been made to hide the truth.  为掩盖事实作了很多尝试。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_938','hunter','''hʌntɚ','''hʌntə','[n] 猎人','The hunters stalked their prey.  猎人们隐伏跟踪猎物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_939','Florida','','''flɔridə','[n] 佛罗里达(美国州名)','Well, Florida, we are here to say, not this time.  那么，佛罗里达，我们在这里说，这次不能如此。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_940','rule','rul','ruːl','[n] 规则,条例; [v] 支配,统治','There are no hard and fast rules (= clear and definite rules ) about what to wear to classes.  对于上课着装并没有硬性规定。'),
