('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_942','obsidian','əb''sɪdɪən','əb''sɪdɪən','[n] [矿]黑曜石','The Texas show includes an obsidian mask that likely traveled to Khara Khorum all the way from Egypt, Lessem says.  德克萨斯州展出包括了一个黑曜石面具，可能是从埃及被带到哈喇和林来的，莱塞姆说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_943','migratory','''maɪɡrətɔri','''maɪgrət(ə)rɪ; maɪ''greɪt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 迁移的,流浪的','migratory birds  候鸟'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_944','nestling','''nɛstlɪŋ','''nes(t)lɪŋ','[n] 尚未离巢的小鸟,婴孩',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_945','sculptor','''skʌlptɚ','''skʌlptə','[n] 雕刻家','There was a great demand for engravings of his portrait, and his head was being modelled by an admiring sculptor.  人们强烈要求要帮他做一个雕塑，一位有名的雕刻家正在把他的头像做成模型。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_946','complicate','''kɑmplɪket','''kɒmplɪkeɪt','[v] (使)变复杂','I think that is because we unnecessarily complicate it.  我想这是因为我们不必要地将生活复杂化了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_947','progress','''prɑɡrɛs','''prəʊgres','[n&v] 前进,进步,发展','We made good progress despite the snow.  尽管下雪，我们的行程还是很顺利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_948','consumer','kən''sumɚ','kən''sjuːmə','[n] 消费者','Consumers will soon be paying higher airfares.  不久消费者就要支付更高的机票价了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_949','frontier','frʌn''tɪr','''frʌntɪə; frʌn''tɪə','[n] 国境,边疆','a novel about a family’s struggle on the American frontier  描写一家人在美国边远地区奋斗的小说'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_950','suit','sut','sju:t; su:t','[v] 合适,相配','Whatever your reason for borrowing, we have the loan that suits your needs .  不管您因何贷款，我们都会有满足您需要的贷款。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_951','kill','kɪl','kɪl','[v] 杀死,毁掉','Why did she kill her husband?  她为什么杀死丈夫？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_952','distinct','dɪ''stɪŋkt','dɪ''stɪŋ(k)t','[adj] 清楚的,明显的,不同的','two entirely distinct languages  两种完全不同的语言'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_953','responsible','rɪ''spɑnsəbl','rɪ''spɒnsɪb(ə)l','[adj] 有责任的,负责的','We are determined to bring the people responsible to justice.  我们决意要将肇事者绳之以法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_954','decorative','''dɛkəretɪv','''dek(ə)rətɪv','[adj] 装饰的','a decorative panel above the door  门楣上的饰板'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_955','president','''prɛzɪdənt','''prezɪd(ə)nt','[n] 总统,会长','President Bush  布什总统'),
