('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_958','modify','''mɑdɪfaɪ','''mɒdɪfaɪ','[v] 更改,修改','The feedback will be used to modify the course for next year.  这些反馈意见将用于修改明年的课程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_959','finish','''fɪnɪʃ','''fɪnɪʃ','[n&v] 完成,结束','You can’t go anywhere until you’ve finished your homework.  没完成家庭作业前你哪儿也不能去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_960','tone','ton','təʊn','[n] 音调','Her tone was sharp with anger.  她很气愤，语气尖刻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_961','abundance','ə''bʌndəns','ə''bʌnd(ə)ns','[n] 丰富,充裕','This area of Mexico has an abundance of safe beaches and a pleasing climate.  墨西哥的这个地区有大量的安全沙滩与宜人的气候。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_962','vocabulary','və''kæbjəlɛri','və(ʊ)''kæbjʊlərɪ','[n] 词汇,词表','Teachers were impressed by his vocabulary.  他的词汇量给老师们留下了深刻的印象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_963','alder','''ɔldɚ','''ɔːldə','[n] [植]桤木','A few scrubby trees, like red alder, have re-established themselves, and ants, frogs, meadowlarks, beavers and other species have moved in.  一些矮灌木丛，像红桤木很快又长起来了，蚂蚁青蛙草地鸬海狸还有其他一些物种也都迁进来了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_964','title','''taɪtl','''taɪt(ə)l','[n] 标题; [v] 加标题于,赋予称','"Patience and Sarah" was first published in 1969 under the title "A Place for Us."  《耐心与萨拉》于1969年以《我们的地方》为书名首次出版。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_965','moreover','mɔr''ovɚ','mɔːr''əʊvə','[adv] 此外,而且','The rent is reasonable and, moreover, the location is perfect.  租金合理，而且位置也非常好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_966','propose','prə''poz','prə''pəʊz','[v] 打算,向提议,求婚','the changes currently proposed by the local planning authorities  目前由地方规划局提议的改革'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_967','street','strit','striːt','[n] 街道','We moved to Center Street when I was young.  在我小时候，我们搬到了中心大街。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_968','collection','kə''lɛkʃən','kə''lekʃ(ə)n','[n] 收藏(品)','a debt collection agency  收债服务机构'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_969','seven','''sɛvn','''sev(ə)n','[num] 七,七个','The women visited cities in seven states.  这些女性访问了七个州的城市。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_970','explicit','ɪk''splɪsɪt','ɪk''splɪsɪt; ek-','[adj] 明确的,清晰的','The contrast could not have been made more explicit.  这个对比再清楚不过了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_971','reaction','rɪ''ækʃən','rɪ''ækʃ(ə)n','[n] 反应,反作用','What was Jeff’s reaction when you told him about the job?  你告诉杰夫这个工作时，他是什么反应？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_972','molecule','''mɑlɪkjul','''mɒlɪkjuːl','[n] 分子','The molecules of oxygen gas contain just two atoms.  氧分子中只有两个原子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_973','readily','''rɛdɪli','''redɪlɪ','[adv] 乐意地,欣然','Jack readily agreed to help.  杰克爽快地答应帮忙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_974','mix','mɪks','mɪks','[v] 使混和,混淆','Oil and water don’t mix.  油和水不相融。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_975','document','dɑkjəmənt','''dɒkjʊm(ə)nt','[n] 公文,文件; [v] 记载','She produces legal documents for a downtown Seattle law firm.  她为西雅图市区的一家法律事务所撰写法律文件。'),
