('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_988','citizen','''sɪtɪzn','''sɪtɪz(ə)n','[n] 市民,公民','We need our schools to teach students to be good citizens.  我们需要学校把学生培养为好公民。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_989','interaction','','','[n] 交互作用','But you only get the maximum benefit if you implement all of them, because their power comes from their interaction.  但您只能在实现所有方法的情况下获得最大收益，因为它们的力量来自它们之间的交互。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_990','beyond','bɪ''jɑnd','bɪ''jɒnd','[prep] 远于,越出; [adv] 在更远处','More people are choosing to work beyond retirement age.  越来越多的人选择过了退休年龄继续工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_991','desertification','dɪ,zɝtɪfɪ''keʃən','dɪˌzɜ:tɪfɪˈkeɪʃn','[n] 荒漠化,沙漠化','A third of Africa is under threat of desertification.  三分之一的非洲大陆面临着荒漠化的威胁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_992','gold','ɡold','gəʊld','[n] 黄金,金币; [adj] 金的','She came to the party dripping with gold (= wearing a lot of gold ) .  她披金戴银地来参加派对。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_993','analyze','''ænə,laɪz','''ænə,laɪz','[v] 分析,分解','How do you analyze this change?  你该如何分析这种变化？'),
