('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_995','army','''ɑrmi','''ɑːmɪ','[n] 军队','The army are helping to clear up after the floods.  陆军部队正协助洪灾后的清理工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_996','expedition',',ɛkspə''dɪʃən','ekspɪ''dɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 远征,探险队','an expedition to the North Pole  北极探险'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_997','conduct','kən''dʌkt','''kɒndʌkt','[n] 行为; [v] 引导,管理','The Senator’s conduct is being investigated by the Ethics Committee.  该参议员的行为正受到道德委员会的调查。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_998','principal','''prɪnsəpl','''prɪnsəp(ə)l','[adj] 主要的,首要的; [n] 资本','His principal reason for making the journey was to visit his family.  他那次旅程的首要目的是探访家人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_999','front','frʌnt','frʌnt','[n&a] 前面(的); [v] 面向','He wore an old sweater with a coffee stain down the front.  他穿着一件旧毛衣，前面有一道咖啡渍。'),
