('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1025','destructive','dɪ''strʌktɪv','dɪ''strʌktɪv','[adj] 破坏(性)的','the destructive power of modern weapons  现代武器的破坏力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1026','plankton','''plæŋktən','''plæŋ(k)t(ə)n; -tɒn','[n] 浮游生物','...its usual diet of plankton and other small organisms.  ...它通常赖以为食的浮游生物和其他微生物。'),
