('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1028','reproduce',',riprə''dus','riːprə''djuːs','[v] 再生,复制','Klimt’s artwork is reproduced in this exquisite book.  这本精美的书里翻印了克里木特的艺术作品。'),
