('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1045','exact','ɪɡ''zækt','ɪg''zækt; eg-','[adj] 精确的,准确的','Police are still investigating the exact cause of the accident.  警方还在调查这起事故的确切原因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1046','behind','bɪ''haɪnd','bɪ''haɪnd','[prep] 在…后,落后于; [adv] 在后面','I turned to speak to the person standing behind me.  我转身和站在我后面的那人说话。'),
