('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1049','enjoy','ɪn''dʒɔɪ','ɪn''dʒɒɪ; en-','[v] 享受,喜爱','Sandra enjoys her job in the city.  桑德拉很喜欢她在城里的这份工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1050','furthermore',',fɝðɚ''mɔr','fɜːðə''mɔː','[adv] 而且,此外','He is old and unpopular. Furthermore, he has at best only two years of political life ahead of him.  他年纪已老，又不得人心，而且他最多也只有两年的政治生命了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1051','independence',',ɪndɪ''pɛndəns','ɪndɪ''pend(ə)ns','[n] 独立,自主','The country has made great advances since independence.  该国自独立以来发展迅速。'),
