('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1060','instance','''ɪnstəns','''ɪnst(ə)ns','[n] 实例,建议','We need to rethink the way we consume energy. Take, for instance, our approach to transport.  我们需要重新考虑我们使用能源的方式，例如我们的运输方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1061','decoration',',dɛkə''reʃən','dekə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 装饰(品)','Christmas decorations  圣诞节装饰物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1062','decay','dɪ''ke','dɪ''keɪ','[v&n] 衰退,腐败','In Orthodox Europe, mass religion seems to have decayed less.  在正教会流行的欧洲地区，集体宗教信仰的影响力似乎衰退得没那么严重。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1063','originate','əˈrɪdʒəˌnet','ə''rɪdʒɪneɪt; ɒ-','[v] 起源于,创始','How did the plan originate?  这个计划最早是怎么想到的？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1064','radiation',',redɪ''eʃən','reɪdɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 放射物,辐射','An accident at the power station could result in large amounts of radiation being released.  发电站事故会造成大量核辐射泄漏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1065','massive','''mæsɪv','''mæsɪv','[adj] 巨大的,大规模的','My phone bill was massive last month.  上个月我的电话费数额巨大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1066','fundamental',',fʌndə''mɛntl','fʌndə''ment(ə)l','[adj] 基础的,基本的','We have to tackle the fundamental cause of the problem.  我们必须解决问题的根本原因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1067','height','haɪt','haɪt','[n] 高度,海拔','Sam’s about the same height as his sister now.  萨姆现在身高和他姐姐差不多了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1068','butterfly','''bʌtɚflaɪ','''bʌtəflaɪ','[n] 蝴蝶','Butterflies and moths are attracted to the wild flowers.  蝴蝶和飞蛾为野花所吸引。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1069','reproduction',',riprə''dʌkʃən','riːprə''dʌkʃ(ə)n','[n] 再现,复制品','...a reproduction of a popular religious painting.  …一幅通俗宗教画的复制品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1070','asteroid','''æstərɔɪd','''æstərɒɪd','[n] 小行星','Astronomers have detected an asteroid not far from Earth, moving in the same orbit around the Sun.  天文学家在距离地球不远处发现一颗与地球绕日轨道相同的小行星。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1071','tunnel','''tʌnl','''tʌnl','[n] 隧道,地道','a railway tunnel  铁路隧道'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1072','apartment','ə''pɑrtmənt','ə''pɑːtm(ə)nt','[n] 公寓住宅','She lives in a small apartment.  她住在一套小公寓里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1073','him','hɪm','hɪm','[pron] 他','Are you in love with him?  你爱上他了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1074','burn','bɝn','bɜːn','[v] 烧; [n] 烧伤','I burnt all his old letters.  我把他以前的信全烧了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1075','export','ˈekspɔːrt；ɪkˈ-','ˈekspɔːt；ɪkˈ-','[v&n] 输出,出口','Wheat is one of the country’s main exports.  小麦是该国的主要出口商品之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1076','flash','flæʃ','flæʃ','[n&v] 闪光,闪现','Lightning flashed overhead.  头顶上电光闪闪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1077','secondary','''sɛkəndɛri','''sek(ə)nd(ə)rɪ','[adj] 次要的,二级的','the novel’s secondary characters  这本小说中的次要人物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1078','pottery','''pɑtəri','''pɒt(ə)rɪ','[n] 陶器','Native American pottery  美洲印第安人的陶器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1079','chimpanzee',',tʃɪmpæn''zi','tʃɪmpæn''ziː','[n] 黑猩猩','So when you go from head to toe, you''re seeing a mosaic creature that is neither chimpanzee, nor is it human.  所以从头到脚，让人看到的是一个在黑猩猩和人类之间模棱两可的生物，这就是始祖地人猿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1080','onto','ˈɑnˌtu, -tə, ˈɔn-','''ɒntuː','[prep] 在之上','The boy emptied out all his pockets onto the table.  这男孩把口袋里的东西都掏出来放在桌上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1081','occupy','''ɑkjupaɪ','''ɒkjʊpaɪ','[v] 占,占领','He occupies the house without paying any rent.  他住在这幢房子里，没有付一分钱房租。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1082','harvest','''hɑrvɪst','''hɑːvɪst','[n] 收获; [v] 收获,收割','The company is now reaping the harvest of careful planning.  公司现在尝到了精心规划带来的甜头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1083','disappear','''dɪsə''pɪr','dɪsə''pɪə','[v] 消失','At this point the path seemed to disappear altogether (= disappear completely ) .  小路到这里好像完全消失了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1084','Australian','ɑ''strelɪən','','[n] 澳大利亚(的)','He wore a tooth from that shark round his neck ever after, as well as one big hoop earring and an Australian hat.  自那以后，他就把这条鲨鱼的一颗牙齿戴在脖子上，此外，还戴了一个环形大耳环和一顶澳大利亚的帽子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1085','conclusion','kən''kluʒn','kən''kluːʒ(ə)n','[n] 结束,结论','These are the report’s main conclusions.  这些就是这篇报告的主要结论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1086','dominant','''dɑmɪnənt','''dɒmɪnənt','[adj] 有统治权的,占优势的','The dominant male gorilla is the largest in the group.  领头的公猩猩是这群大猩猩中体形最大的一个。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1087','pull','pʊl','pʊl','[v] 拉,拖,拔','Mom! Davey’s pulling my hair!  妈妈! 戴维拽我的头发！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1088','tuna','''tunə','''tjuːnə','[n] 金枪鱼','...a shoal of tuna.  …一群金枪鱼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1089','restrict','rɪ''strɪkt','rɪ''strɪkt','[v] 限制,约束','The new law restricts the sale of hand guns.  新法规限制手枪的销售。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1090','distribution','''dɪstrə''bjʊʃən','dɪstrɪ''bjuːʃ(ə)n','[n] 分发,分配,分布','population distribution  人口分布'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1091','movie','''muvi','''muːvɪ','[n] 电影','It was like one of those old John Wayne movies.  这部电影有点像约翰•韦恩演的一部老片子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1092','projection','prə''dʒɛkʃən','prə''dʒekʃ(ə)n','[n] 发射','projection equipment  投影设备'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1093','stretch','strɛtʃ','stretʃ','[v&n] 伸展,延伸','Carl sat up in bed, yawned, and stretched.  卡尔从床上坐起来，打了个呵欠，伸了伸懒 腰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1094','goal','ɡol','gəʊl','[n] 目的,目标','Your goal as a parent is to help your child become an independent adult.  身为父母，你的目标就是要培养孩子成为独立的成年人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1095','requirement','rɪ''kwaɪɚmənt','rɪ''kwaɪəm(ə)nt','[n] 需求,要求','The refugees’ main requirements are food and shelter.  难民的主要需求是食物和住所。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1096','operate','''ɑpə''ret','''ɒpəreɪt','[v] 操作,运转','The whole tax system is now operating more efficiently.  现在整个税收制度运作效率更高了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1097','trap','træp','træp','[v] 设圈套,陷入(困境); [n] 圈套','Twenty miners were trapped underground.  20名矿工被困在地下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1098','reject','rɪ''dʒɛkt','rɪ''dʒekt','[v] 拒绝,退回','Sarah rejected her brother’s offer of help.  萨拉拒绝了她弟弟的帮助。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1099','majority','mə''dʒɔrəti','mə''dʒɒrɪtɪ','[n] 大多数','The Labour Party won a huge majority at the last general election.  工党在上次大选中以巨大的票数优势获胜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1100','volume','''vɑljum','''vɒljuːm','[n] 卷,册','The period from 1940 – 1945 is in volume 9.  1940年至1945年这段时间在第9卷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1101','float','flot','fləʊt','[v&n] 漂浮,浮现','I looked up at the clouds floating in the sky.  我仰望着天上的浮云。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1102','zone','zon','zəʊn','[n] 地域,地带; [v] 分成区','San Francisco and Tokyo are both located in earthquake zones.  旧金山和东京都位于地震带。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1103','pastoralism','','','[n] 田园主义,牧歌体',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1104','reliable','rɪ''laɪəbl','rɪ''laɪəb(ə)l','[adj] 可靠的,可信赖的','a birth control method that is cheap and reliable  既便宜又可靠的避孕方法'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1105','frequency','''frikwənsi','''friːkw(ə)nsɪ','[n] 频率,发生次数','Side effects from prescribed drugs are being reported with increasing frequency (= more and more often ) .  处方药的副作用正越来越频繁地被报道出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1106','geologic','dʒɪə''lɑdʒɪk',',dʒɪəʊ''lɒdʒɪk','[adj] 地质的','The best gauge of quake risk is the geologic record.  我们最好的测量地震风险的办法是地质记录。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1107','extent','ɪk''stɛnt','ɪk''stent; ek-','[n] 范围,程度,广度',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1108','pleistocene','''plaistəusi:n','''plaistəusi:n','[n&a] [地]更新世(的)(一段时期)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1109','enhance','ɪn''hæns','ɪn''hɑːns; -hæns; en-','[v] 提高,增强','Good lighting will enhance any room.  良好的照明能给房间增色不少。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1110','accompany','ə''kʌmpəni','ə''kʌmpənɪ','[v] 陪伴,伴奏','Children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult.  14岁以下儿童必须有成人陪同。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1111','interpret','ɪn''tɝprɪt','ɪn''tɜːprɪt','[v] 解释,说明','Freud’s attempts to interpret the meaning of dreams  弗洛伊德对梦的含义的解析'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1112','snowfall','''snofɔl','''snəʊfɔːl','[n] 降雪,降雪量','Heavy snowfalls are forecast.  天气预报说将有大雪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1113','storm','stɔrm','stɔːm','[n] 暴风雨,暴风雪','The weather forecast is for severe storms tonight.  天气预报说今晚有强暴风雨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1114','musician','mjʊ''zɪʃən','mjuː''zɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 音乐家','a talented young musician  有天赋的年轻音乐家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1115','critical','''krɪtɪkl','''krɪtɪk(ə)l','[adj] 批评的,挑剔的,决定性的','He made some highly critical remarks.  他发表了一些严厉的批判性言论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1116','Netherlands','''neðələndz','''neðələndz','[n] 荷兰[国家]','I want a mountain, a real one. In the Netherlands.  我想要一个山峰，一个荷兰的真正的山。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1117','choose','tʃuz','tʃuːz','[v] 选择,选定','It took us ages to choose a new carpet.  我们挑选新地毯花了很长时间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1118','polar','''polɚ','''pəʊlə','[adj] (近)地极的,对立的','As our climate warms up, the polar ice caps will begin to melt.  随着地球气候逐渐变暖，极地的冰冠将开始融化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1119','pollutant','pə''lutənt','pə''l(j)uːt(ə)nt','[n] 污染物质','a dumping ground for toxic pollutants  有毒污染物堆放场'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1120','unable','ʌn''ebl','ʌn''eɪb(ə)l','[adj] 不能的,不会的','The military may feel unable to hand over power to a civilian president next year.  军方可能觉得无法在明年把政权移交给一位民选总统。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1121','elite','ɪˈliːt','[eɪˈliːt]','[n] 精英,精华','a struggle for power within the ruling elite   统治阶层内部的争权夺利'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1122','branch','bræntʃ','brɑːn(t)ʃ','[n] 树枝,分部,分支','After the storm, the ground was littered with twigs and branches.  暴风雨过后，满地都是大大小小的树枝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1123','seawater','','','[n] 海水','Their answer is to spray them with seawater.  他们的答案是把海水喷到云层上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1124','Chicago','ʃɪ''kɑɡo','ʃɪˈkɑːɡəʊ','[n] 芝加哥','They hoped to locate in Chicago.  他们希望在芝加哥定居。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1125','walk','wɔk','wɔːk','[v] 行,走; [n] 步行','‘How did you get here?’ ‘We walked.’  “你们是怎么来这里的？”“我们是步行来的。”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1126','Health','hɛlθ','helθ','[n] 健康','Tea contains caffeine. It''s bad for your health.  茶含有咖啡因，对你的健康不利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1127','decorate','''dɛkəret','''dekəreɪt','[v] 装饰','The bathroom is decorated in green and yellow.  浴室里是用绿色和黄色装潢的。'),
