('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1129','combination',',kɑmbɪ''neʃən','kɒmbɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 结合,联合,合并','a combination nightclub and café  夜总会兼咖啡馆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1130','active','''æktɪv','''æktɪv','[adj] 积极的,活跃的,起作用的','games for active youngsters  活跃好动的年轻人玩的游戏'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1131','division','də''vɪʒən','dɪ''vɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 分开,分割,区分','the traditional division of labour (= the way that particular tasks are shared ) between husband and wife  夫妻之间传统的分工'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1132','pure','pjʊr','pjʊə','[adj] 纯的,纯粹的','rings made of pure gold  纯金制成的戒指'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1133','engage','ɪn''ɡedʒ','ɪn''geɪdʒ; en-','[v] 雇佣,从事,参加','I have never engaged in drug trafficking.  我从来没有从事过贩毒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1134','stay','ste','steɪ','[v&n] 逗留,保持,延缓','They stayed all afternoon chatting.  他们待了整个下午聊天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1135','regulate','''rɛɡjulet','''regjʊleɪt','[v] 管理,控制,调整','strict rules regulating the use of chemicals in food  限制化学品在食物中使用的严格规定'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1136','send','sɛnd','send','[v] 发送,派遣','Lyn sent some pictures of the wedding.  琳恩寄了几张婚礼照片。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1137','copper','''kɑpɚ','''kɒpə','[n] 铜,警察','He offered to do the job for a few coppers.  他说他来做这份工作，给他几个铜板就行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1138','engineer',',ɛndʒɪ''nɪr','endʒɪ''nɪə','[n] 工程师; [v] 设计,建造','He trained as a civil engineer (= one who designs and builds roads, bridges etc ).  他接受过土木工程师培训。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1139','critic','''krɪtɪk','''krɪtɪk','[n] 批评家,评论家','Mather was a film critic for many years.  马瑟做过多年的电影评论家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1140','investment','ɪn''vɛstmənt','ɪn''ves(t)m(ə)nt','[n] 投资,可获利的东西','We plan to buy some property as an investment.  我们打算买些房地产作为投资。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1141','Boston','''bɔstən','''bɔstən','[n] 波士顿',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1142','opportunist',',ɑpɚ''tunɪst','ɒpə''tjuːnɪst','[n] 机会主义者,投机取巧者','Voters dislike opportunists – politicians who change their policies according to opinion polls.  选民不喜欢机会主义分子——那些根据民意调查结果来改变方针的政客。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1143','dependent','dɪ''pɛndənt','di''pendənt','[adj] 依靠的,依赖的','Jan’s mother was dependent on her for physical care.  简的母亲要靠简来照顾。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1144','week','wik','wiːk','[n] 星期,周','I can’t see you this week.  我这星期不能见你。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1145','balance','''bæləns','''bæl(ə)ns','[n] 平衡; [v] 使平衡','I lost my balance and fell on my face.  我失去平衡，脸着地摔倒了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1146','pollution','pə''luʃən','pə''luːʃ(ə)n','[n] 污染','California’s tough anti-pollution laws  加利福尼亚州严厉的反污染法'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1147','mother','''mʌðɚ','''mʌðə','[n] 母亲','His mother and father are both doctors.  他的父母都是医生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1148','drought','draʊt','draʊt','[n] 干旱,缺乏','...a country where drought and famines have killed up to two million people during the last eighteen years.  …过去18年来干旱和饥荒致死达两百万人的一个国家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1149','survey','ˈsɝˌve; (for v.) sɝˈve','ˈsəːveɪ; (for v.) səˈveɪ','[n&vt] 调查','Of the 100 companies surveyed, 10% had a turnover of £50 m to £99 m.  被调查的 100 家公司中，10% 的公司营业额在 5,000 万到 9,900 万英镑之间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1150','repeat','rɪ''pit','rɪ''piːt','[n&v] 重复,重做,使再现','Can you repeat your question?  你能重复一遍你的问题吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1151','reflective','rɪ''flɛktɪv','rɪ''flektɪv','[adj] 反射的,反映的,沉思的','Stick reflective tape on your school bag.  给你的书包贴上反光带。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1152','status','ˈstætəs; ˈstetəs','''steɪtəs','[n] 身份,地位,情形,','These documents have no legal status in Britain.  这些文件在英国并无法律效力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1153','authority','ə''θɔrəti','ɔː''θɒrɪtɪ','[n] 权威,权力','Jack’s air of quiet authority  杰克那静默威严的气势'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1154','perception','pɚ''sɛpʃən','pə''sepʃ(ə)n','[n] 观念,洞察力,认识能力','It did not require a lot of perception to realize the interview was over.  不需要很强的洞察力就可以意识到面试结束了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1155','ridge','rɪdʒ','rɪdʒ','[n] 背脊,山脊','We made our way carefully along the ridge.  我们沿着山脊小心前行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1156','stress','strɛs','stres','[n] 压力,重点; [v] 着重,强调','Your headaches are due to stress.  你的头痛是压力造成的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1157','accumulation','ə,kjʊmjə''leʃən','əkjuːmjʊ''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 积聚,堆积物','...an accumulation of experience and knowledge.  …经验和知识的一种积累。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1158','bound','baʊnd','baʊnd','[n] 范围,界限',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1159','Alaska','ə''læskə','ə''læskə','[n] 阿拉斯加州(美国州名)','Like I said, perfect, if you live in Alaska.  像我说过的，完美，如果你住在阿拉斯加的话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1160','context','''kɑntɛkst','''kɒntekst','[n] 上下文','The meaning of ‘mad’ depends on its context. mad  一词的意义要视上下文而定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1161','perfect','ˈpɝfɪkt; (for v.) pɝˈfɛkt','ˈpəːfɪkt; (for v.) pəˈfekt','[adj] 完美的; [v] 使完美,修改','His English was perfect.  他的英语很地道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1162','millennium','məˈlɛniəm','mɪˈlɛnɪəm','[n] 太平盛世,一千年','people who have inhabited this land for millennia  在这片土地上已经居住了数千年的人们'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1163','somewhat','''sʌmwʌt','''sʌmwɒt','[adv] 稍微,有点,有些','Things have changed somewhat since then.  从那时候起，情况就有些不一样了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1164','China','','tʃaɪnə','[n] 中国,瓷器','...a small bowl made of china.  …一个小瓷碗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1165','favorable','''fevərəbl','''feɪvərəbl','[adj] 赞成的,有利的','These favorable anticipations have been realized.  这些有利的期望已被实现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1166','broad','brɔd','brɔːd','[adj] 宽的,广泛的','We went along a broad passage.  我们走在一条宽阔的走廊上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1167','risk','rɪsk','rɪsk','[vt&n] 冒险,风险','It was a risk, sending a letter to my house.  将信寄到我家是冒险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1168','antarctica','æn''tɑrktɪkə','æn''tɑːktɪkə','[n] 南极洲',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1169','kinetoscope','','','[n] 活动电影放映机','The kinetoscope, which could only be viewed by one person at a time, was soon replaced by screen projectors , which showed the movie to a whole room of people at once.  电影放映机一开始一次只能有一个观众，不过后来很快就被投影机所取代，这部机器可以让一屋子的人一起欣赏电影。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1170','absence','''æbsns','''æbs(ə)ns','[n] 不在, 缺席, 缺乏, 没有','In the absence of any evidence, the police had to let Myers go.  警察没有证据，只好把迈尔斯放了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1171','representative','''rɛprɪ''zɛntətɪv','reprɪ''zentətɪv','[n] 代表 a典型的, 有代表性的','a union representative  工会代表'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1172','enlarge','ɪn''lɑrdʒ','ɪn''lɑːdʒ; en-','[v] 扩大, 放大','an operation to enlarge her breasts  她的丰胸手术'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1173','defense','dɪ''fɛns','dɪ''fens','[n] 国防部,防卫',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1174','category','''kætəɡɔri','''kætɪg(ə)rɪ','[n] 种类','people in the over-45 age category  属45岁以上年龄组的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1175','intensity','ɪn''tɛnsəti','ɪn''tensɪtɪ','[n] 强度,强烈','The intensity of the hurricane was frightening.  飓风的猛烈程度令人恐惧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1176','abandon','ə''bændən','ə''bænd(ə)n','[v] 放弃,遗弃','How could she abandon her own child?  她怎么能抛弃自己的孩子？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1177','relation','rɪ''leʃən','rɪ''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 关系,联系','The price the meat is sold for bears no relation to (= is not connected to ) the price the farmer receives.  肉的售价和农民拿到的价格无关。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1178','virus','''vaɪrəs','''vaɪrəs','[n] 病毒','children infected with the Aids virus  感染艾滋病病毒的儿童'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1179','exhibition',',ɛksɪ''bɪʃən','eksɪ''bɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 表现,展览会','I’ve never seen such an exhibition of jealousy.  我从未见过如此嫉妒的表现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1180','alter','''ɔltɚ','''ɔːltə; ''ɒl-','[v] 改变','Her face hadn’t altered much over the years.  过了这么多年，她的容貌并没有多大改变。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1181','myth','mɪθ','mɪθ','[n] 神话','a book of Greek myths  一本关于希腊神话的图书'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1182','arid','''ærɪd','''ærɪd','[adj] 干旱的,贫瘠的','Water from the Great Lakes is pumped to arid regions .  五大湖中的水被输往干旱地区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1183','erode','ɪ''rod','ɪ''rəʊd','[v] 侵蚀,腐蚀','The cliffs are being constantly eroded by heavy seas.  悬崖正不断受到汹涌海浪的侵蚀。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1184','dramatic','drə''mætɪk','drə''mætɪk','[adj] 戏剧性的,生动的','the amateur dramatic society  业余剧团'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1185','arise','ə''raɪz','ə''raɪz','[v] 出现,发生,起因于','A crisis has arisen in the Foreign Office.  外交部出现了危机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1186','reverse','rɪ''vɝs','rɪ''vɜːs','[v] 颠倒,倒转','Reverse the paper in the printer.  把打印机中的纸翻过来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1187','capacity','kə''pæsəti','kə''pæsɪtɪ','[n] 容量,能力','The room had seating capacity for about 80.  这房间能坐80个人左右。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1188','competitor','kəm''pɛtɪtɚ','kəm''petɪtə','[n] 竞争者','Last year they sold twice as many computers as their competitors.  去年他们的计算机销量是竞争对手的两倍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1189','promise','''prɑmɪs','''prɒmɪs','[vt&n] 允诺,答应','Last night the headmaster promised a full investigation.  校长昨晚允诺进行全面调查。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1190','wooden','''wʊdn','''wʊd(ə)n','[adj] 木制的','a wooden bench  木制长椅'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1191','portray','pɔr''tre','pɔː''treɪ','[v] 描绘','Romantic artists portrayed nature as wild and powerful.  浪漫主义艺术家描绘的大自然是狂野而强大的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1192','composer','kəm''pozɚ','kəm''pəʊzə','[n] 作家,作曲家','...music by Strauss, Mozart, Beethoven, and other great composers.  …施特劳斯、莫扎特、贝多芬及其他伟大作曲家创作的音乐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1193','stick','stɪk','stɪk','[n] 棍; [v] 刺,戳','a pair of drum sticks  一对鼓槌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1194','glaciation','''glesɪ''eʃən','','[n] 冻结成冰,冰河作用','These changes alter the intensity of sunlight hitting the Earth at high latitudes, and so affect the extent of glaciation.  这些变化改变了高纬度区域的日照强度，由此影响了冰河作用的范围。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1195','arm','ɑrm','ɑːm','[n] 臂; [v] 供给,武装','Dave has a broken arm .  戴夫手臂断了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1196','transfer','træns''fɝ','træns''fɜː; trɑːns-; -nz-','[n&v] 迁移,移动,转移','He was transferred for a fee of £8 million.  他以800万英镑的转会费转到了其他球队。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1197','arch','ɑrtʃ','ɑːtʃ','[n] 拱门v(使)弯成弓形','When she passed under the arch leading out of the park, Mira whooped with delight.  从通向公园外的拱门下走过时，米拉高兴地喊叫起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1198','prediction','prɪ''dɪkʃən','prɪ''dɪkʃ(ə)n','[n] 预言','The data can be used to make useful economic predictions .  这些数据可用于进行有用的经济预测。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1199','stencil','''stɛnsl','''stensɪl; -s(ə)l','[n] 模版,蜡纸; [v] 用蜡纸印刷','He then stencilled the ceiling with a moon and stars motif.  他接着用模版在天花板印上月亮和星星图案。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1200','distinctive','dɪ''stɪŋktɪv','dɪ''stɪŋ(k)tɪv','[adj] 有区别的,独特的','a rock band with a distinctive sound  音色独特的摇滚乐队'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1201','tail','tel','teɪl','[n] 尾巴; [v] 跟踪,尾随','The dog wagged its tail .  那条狗摇了摇尾巴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1202','France','','frɑːns','[n] 法国,法兰西',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1203','toxic','''tɑksɪk','''tɒksɪk','[adj] 有毒的,中毒的','fumes from a toxic waste dump  有毒废料堆产生的毒气'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1204','magnetic','mæg''nɛtɪk','mæg''netɪk','[adj] 磁的,有吸引力的','magnetic forces  磁力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1205','visit','''vɪzɪt','''vɪzɪt','[n&v] 拜访,访问','Eric went to Seattle to visit his cousins.  埃里克到西雅图去看望他的表兄弟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1206','apart','ə''pɑrt','ə''pɑːt','[adv] 相间隔,分离; [adj] 分离(隔)的','They have offices in countries as far apart as India and Peru.  他们的办事处远至印度、秘鲁等国。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1207','gull','ɡʌl','gʌl','[n] 海鸥; [v] 欺骗','You have to practice and see the real gull, the good in every one of them, and to help them see it in themselves.  你应该通过练习去认识真正的海鸥，要看到每只海鸥的美德，并帮助他们去认识自己的美德。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1208','herbivore','ɝ​bəˌvɔr','''hɜːbɪvɔː','[n] 草食动物','The meat of the herbivore is, in comparison, far more edible , smellwise.  相对地，食草动物的肉闻起来要好些，更易食用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1209','cross','krɔs','krɒs','[n] 十字,交叉; [v] 使交叉,横过','The by-pass crosses Wilton Lane shortly after a roundabout.  这条旁道绕过环岛后不久就和威尔顿巷相交。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1210','tornado','tɔr''nedo','tɔː''neɪdəʊ','[n] 龙卷风','The tornado rubbished the whole village.  龙卷风毁掉了整个村庄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1211','metallic','mə''tælɪk','mɪ''tælɪk','[adj] 金属(性)的','The key turned in the lock with a loud metallic click.  钥匙在锁里转动发出金属撞击的咔嗒声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1212','loud','laʊd','laʊd','[a&ad] 高声的,大声地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1213','drain','dren','dreɪn','[n] 排水,消耗','The flood was caused by a blocked drain .  溢水是由排水管堵塞引起的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1214','realize','rɪəˌlaɪz','''riːəlaɪz','[v] 认识到,了解','It took us a while to realize the extent of the tragedy.  我们过了一段时间才意识到这场悲剧有多严重。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1215','shallow','''ʃælo','''ʃæləʊ','[adj] 浅的','a shallow river  浅河'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1216','surplus','''sɝpləs','''sɜːpləs','[n] 剩余,过剩','Any surplus can be trimmed away.  多出来的部分可以修剪掉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1217','explore','ɪk''splɔr','ɪk''splɔː; ek-','[v] 探险,探测','Management need to explore ways of improving office security.  管理层需要探讨如何加强办事处的安全措施。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1218','classify','''klæsɪfaɪ','''klæsɪfaɪ','[v] 分类,分等','We’d classify Drabble’s novels under ‘Romance’.  我们把德拉布尔的小说归类为“言情小说”。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1219','possibility',',pɑsə''bɪləti',',pɒsɪ''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 可能性','There’s always a possibility that he might go back to Seattle.  他也许会回到西雅图去，这种可能性一直存在。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1220','novel','ˈnɑːvl','''nɒv(ə)l','[n] 小说,长篇故事','a novel by Jane Austen  简·奥斯丁的小说'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1221','afford','ə''fɔrd','ə''fɔːd','[v] 提供,给予','The room affords a beautiful view over the city.  这房间可以俯瞰城市美景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1222','southeast',',saʊθ''ist',',saʊθ''iːst','[n&a] 东南(的)','It shook buildings as far away as Galveston, 90 miles to the southeast.  它震动了东南方向90英里远的加尔维斯顿的建筑物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1223','narrow','''næro','''nærəʊ','[adj] 狭窄(隘)的,勉强的; [v] 变窄,压缩','The stairs were very narrow.  楼梯非常狭窄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1224','northwest','''nɔrθ''wɛst',',nɔ:θ''west','[n&a] 西北方(的)','...four miles to the northwest.  …西北方向4英里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1225','collision','kə''lɪʒən','kə''lɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 碰撞,冲突','Two people were killed in a head-on collision (= between two vehicles that are moving directly towards each other ) on highway 218.  218号公路上有两辆汽车迎面相撞，两人死亡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1226','lung','lʌŋ','lʌŋ','[n] 肺,呼吸器','Smoking can cause lung cancer.  吸烟会引起肺癌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1227','diverse','daɪ''vɝs','daɪ''vɜːs; ''daɪvɜːs','[adj] 不同的,变化多的','Albert Jones'' new style will inevitably put him in touch with a much more diverse and perhaps younger audience.  艾伯特·琼斯的新风格无疑将使他接触更多形形色色的、或许更年轻的观众。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1228','temperate','''tɛmpərət','''temp(ə)rət','[adj] 温和的,适度的,有节制的','The Nile Valley keeps a temperate climate throughout the year.  尼罗河流域全年气候温和。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1229','widespread','ˈwʌɪdsprɛd','ˈwʌɪdsprɛd','[adj] 分布广泛的,普遍的','the widespread use of chemicals in agriculture  化学品在农业中的广泛使用'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1230','isotope','''aɪsə''top','''aɪsətəʊp','[n] 同位素','...tritium, a radioactive isotope of hydrogen.  ...氚，氢的一种放射性同位素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1231','detect','dɪ''tɛkt','dɪ''tekt','[v] 察觉,侦查,发现','Many forms of cancer can be cured if detected early.  如果发现得早，许多种癌症都可以治愈。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1232','nevertheless',',nɛvɚðə''lɛs','nevəðə''les','[adv] 尽管如此; [conj] 然而,不过','What you said was true. It was, nevertheless, a little unkind.  你说的都是实话，只不过有点刻薄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1233','wheat','wit','wiːt','[n] 小麦','a field of wheat  小麦地'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1234','peak','pik','piːk','[n] 山顶,顶点','Sales this month have reached a new peak .  本月的销售额创了新高。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1235','parlor','''pɑrlɚ','''pɑ:lə','[n] 客厅,会客室','I thought maybe Grandpa came over and sat around the den or parlor or whatever for years before he proposed.  我以前以为奶奶来到爷爷家，坐在私室或客厅或什么地方几年，然后爷爷才求婚的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1236','navigate','''nævə''get','''nævɪgeɪt','[v] 航行,航海','The river is too dangerous to navigate.  这河道太危险，不适宜航行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1237','tendency','''tɛndənsi','''tend(ə)nsɪ','[n] 趋向,倾向','children with aggressive or anti-social tendencies  具有攻击性倾向或反社会倾向的儿童'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1238','flourish','ˈflɜːrɪʃ','''flʌrɪʃ','[v&n] 繁荣,茂盛','The economy is booming and small businesses are flourishing.  经济繁荣，小企业蒸蒸日上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1239','catch','kætʃ','kætʃ','[v] 捕获,抓住','He was caught red-handed (= as he was doing something wrong ) taking money from the cash register.  他从现金出纳机偷钱时被当场抓住。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1240','evolutionary',',ivə''luʃənɛri',',iːvə''luːʃənərɪ','[adj] 进化的,发展的,演变的','the evolutionary development of birds  鸟类的进化过程'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1241','bead','bid','biːd','[n] 珠子,水珠','She wore a string of green glass beads around her neck.  她脖子上戴着一串绿色的玻璃珠子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1242','variability',',vɛrɪə''bɪləti',',veərɪə''bɪlətɪ','[n] 可变性','Operations and parameters variability—You can parameterize operations and parameters at the interface definition level.  操作和参数可变性——您可以在接口定义级别参数化操作和参数。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1243','turbine','''tɝbaɪn','''tɜːbaɪn; -ɪn','[n] 涡轮','The new ship will be powered by two gas turbines and four diesel engines.  那艘新轮船将由2台燃气涡轮机和4台柴油机驱动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1244','highland','''haɪlənd','''haɪlənd','[n] 高地,丘陵地带','Once an isolated highland, it has been the home shared by people of more than 10 nationalities, with pure blue sky, clear and beautiful lake as well as the legendary matriarchal community.  这里曾是与世界隔离的地方，一个10多个民族混居的地方。 有高原上湛蓝纯净的天空，清澈美丽的湖水，还有传说中的母系社会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1245','meat','mit','miːt','[n] (食用)肉,肉类','I gave up eating meat a few months ago.  我几个月以前开始不吃肉了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1246','match','mætʃ','mætʃ','[v] 相配,相称','We painted the cabinets green to match the rug.  我们把柜子刷成绿色，和地毯相配。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1247','tall','tɔl','tɔːl','[adj] 高的,长的','He was young and tall.  他年轻，身材高大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1248','communicate','kə''mjunɪket','kə''mjuːnɪkeɪt','[v] 沟通,通信,传达','We communicated mostly by e-mail.  我们主要是用电子邮件沟通。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1249','distribute','dɪ''strɪbjut','dɪ''strɪbjuːt; ''dɪstrɪbjuːt','[v] 分发,分配','a man distributing leaflets to passers-by  一个向路人派发传单的男子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1250','comparative','kəm''pærətɪv','kəm''pærətɪv','[adj] 比较的,相当的','After a lifetime of poverty, his last few years were spent in comparable comfort.  他穷了一辈子，最后几年还算过得比较舒适。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1251','newly','''nuli','''njuːlɪ','[adj] 重新,最近',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1252','mill','','mɪl','[v] 碾磨,搅拌','All our flours are milled using traditional methods.  我们所有的面粉全是用传统方法碾磨的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1253','indirect',',ɪndə''rɛkt','ɪndɪ''rekt; ɪndaɪ-','[adj] 间接的,迂回的','Losing weight is an indirect result of smoking cigarettes.  吸烟间接导致体重减轻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1254','stop','stɑp','stɒp','[n&v] 停止,阻止','The government tried to stop publication of the book.  政府企图阻止这本书出版。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1255','destruction','dɪ''strʌkʃən','dɪ''strʌkʃ(ə)n','[n] 破坏,毁灭','{"COLLOINEXA":["weapons of mass destruction"]}  大规模杀伤性武器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1256','customer','''kʌstəmɚ','''kʌstəmə','[n] 消费者',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1257','suddenly','''sʌdənli','''sʌd(ə)nlɪ','[adv] 突然地','I suddenly realized that there was someone following me.  我突然意识到有人跟着我。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1258','multiple','''mʌltəpl','''mʌltɪpl','[adj] 多样的; [n] 倍数','Baxter was rushed to the hospital with multiple stab wounds.  巴克斯特因多处刺伤被紧急送往医院。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1259','vitamin','''vaɪtəmɪn','''vɪtəmɪn; ''vaɪt-','[n] 维他命,维生素','Try to eat foods that are rich in vitamins and minerals.  尽量吃富含维生素和矿物质的食物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1260','manner','''mænɚ','''mænə','[n] 礼貌,方式','He felt some guilt over the manner of her death.  她以这种方式死去，他心里有些内疚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1261','vegetable','ˈvɛdʒtəbəl; ˈvɛdʒətəbəl','''vedʒtəb(ə)l; ''vedʒɪtə-','[n] 蔬菜,植物','fresh fruit and vegetables  新鲜果蔬'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1262','conclude','kən''klud','kən''kluːd','[v] 推断出,结束,总结','When the investigation is concluded, the results will be sent to the US Attorney’s office.  等到调查结束后，结果会被送到联邦检察官办公室。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1263','barrier','''bærɪɚ','''bærɪə','[n] 障碍物,栅栏','He advocated the removal of trade barriers.  他提倡消除贸易壁垒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1264','mud','mʌd','mʌd','[n] 泥,泥浆','By the end of the game, all the kids were covered in mud.  到了比赛快结束的时候，所有的孩子都浑身是泥。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1265','motif','mo''tif','məʊ''tiːf','[n] 主题,主旨','The theme of creation is a recurrent motif in Celtic mythology.  天地万物的创造是凯尔特神话中反复出现的主题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1266','wheel','wil','wiːl','[n] 轮; [v] 推,拉,转动','a gear wheel  齿轮'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1267','rough','rʌf','rʌf','[adj] 粗糙的,大致的','Her hands were rough from hard work.  她的双手因为干重活而变得很粗糙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1268','corridor','''kɔrɪdɔr','''kɒrɪdɔː','[n] 走廊','Go down here and the bathroom’s at the end of the corridor.  沿着这儿走，浴室就在走廊的尽头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1269','challenger','''tʃælɪndʒɚ','''tʃælindʒə','[n] 挑战者','The strongest challenger, Texas Democrat Martin Frost, has withdrawn from the race.  最强劲的挑战者，德克萨斯州的民主党人马丁·弗罗斯特已经退出了竞选。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1270','fragment','''fræɡmənt','''frægm(ə)nt','[n] 碎片; [v] (使)成碎片','glass fragments  玻璃碎片'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1271','occasionally','o''keʒənəli','əˈkeɪʒnəli','[adv] 有时候,偶而',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1272','component','kəm''ponənt','kəm''pəʊnənt','[n] 成分','companies that make electronic components for computer products  为计算机产品生产电子零件的公司'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1273','beaver','''bivɚ','''biːvə','[n] 海狸(毛皮)','...a coat with a huge beaver collar.  …一件带有大海狸毛皮领的大衣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1274','comprehension',',kɑmprɪ''hɛnʃən','kɒmprɪ''henʃ(ə)n','[n] 理解,包含','Why you let her talk you into doing such a foolish thing is beyond my comprehension (= impossible for me to understand ) .  你怎么会被她说服去做这种蠢事，我实在是无法理解。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1275','physiological',',fɪzɪə''lɑdʒɪkl',',fɪzɪə''lɒdʒɪkəl','[adj] 生理(学)的','If so, this would add to a growing list of physiological and biological markers of sexual orientation.  如果是这样，这可能会给生理和生物学上的性取向标记增加一长串名单。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1276','ceremony','ˈsɛrəˌmoʊni','''serɪmənɪ','[n] 典礼,仪式','a wedding ceremony  婚礼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1277','altitude','''æltɪtud','''æltɪtjuːd','[n] 高度(海拔)','The aircraft had reached its cruising altitude of about 39,000 feet.  那架飞机已经达到了大约三万九千英尺的巡航高度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1278','arrive','ə''raɪv','ə''raɪv','[v] 到达,抵达','Give me a call to let me know you’ve arrived safely.  打个电话给我，告诉我你已平安到达。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1279','exploit','ɪk''splɔɪt','ɪk''splɒɪt; ek-','[v] 开拓,开采','the urgent need to exploit the resources of the Irish Sea  开发爱尔兰海资源的迫切需要'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1280','microscopic',',maɪkrə''skɑpɪk','maɪkrə''skɒpɪk','[adj] 显微镜的,极小的','a microscopic speck of dust  微小的尘粒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1281','schedule','''skɛdʒul; (canadian) ˈʃɛdʒʊl; ˈʃɛdjʊl','ˈʃɛdjuːl','[n] 时刻表,日程; [v] 安排,排定','How can he fit everything into his busy schedule ?  他是怎么把所有的事情都排进自己忙碌的时间表的？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1282','former','''fɔrmɚ','''fɔːmə','[adj] 从前的,以前的','the former Soviet Union  前苏联'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1283','career','kə''rɪr','kə''rɪə','[n] 事业,生涯','a teaching career  教学事业'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1284','aim','em','eɪm','[n] 目标v对瞄准,打算','The main aim of the course is to improve your writing.  这一课程的主要目的是提高写作能力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1285','inventor','ɪn''vɛntɚ','ɪn''ventə','[n] 发明家','...Alexander Graham Bell, the inventor of the telephone.  …亚历山大·格雷厄姆·贝尔，电话的发明者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1286','consume','kənˈsum','kən''sjuːm','[v] 消耗,消费,消灭','Only 27% of the paper we consume is recycled.  我们消耗的纸张只有 27% 得到回收利用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1287','examine','ɪg''zæmɪn','ɪg''zæmɪn; eg-','[v] 检查,调查,考试','A team of divers was sent down to examine the wreck.  一组潜水员被送到水下检查沉船。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1288','atmospheric',',ætməs''fɛrɪk','ætməs''ferɪk','[adj] 大气的','atmospheric pressure  大气压力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1289','fore','fɔr','fɔː','[adj] 在前的; [n] 前头,船头','There had been no direct damage in the fore part of the ship.  没有对船的前部造成直接损坏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1290','province','''prɑvɪns','''prɒvɪns','[n] 省(一个国家的大行政区)','a Chinese province  中国的一个省'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1291','introduction',',ɪntrə''dʌkʃən',',ɪntrə''dʌkʃ(ə)n','[n] 介绍,传入','Pete, are you going to make the introductions?  皮特，你来作一下介绍吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1292','encode','ɪn''kod','ɪn''kəʊd; en-','[v] 把编码','These changes basically take a section of the description and encode it into RDF serialization.  这些更改基本上是抽取描述的一部分并将其编码为 RDF 序列化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1293','squirrel','''skwɝrəl','''skwɪr(ə)l','[n] 松鼠','It was moving fast like a squirrel, but it was as loud as a bear.  它像松鼠一样快速的移动但那声音却像是熊发出的似的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1294','random','''rændəm','''rændəm','[n&a] 任意(的),随便(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1295','tulip','''tʊlɪp','''tjuːlɪp','[n] 郁金香','Finance has a history of messing up, from the Dutch tulip bubble in 1637 to now.  从1637年荷兰郁金香泡沫到今天，财务混乱有相当一段历史了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1296','invent','ɪn''vɛnt','ɪn''vent','[v] 发明,创造','Alexander Graham Bell invented the telephone in 1876.  亚历山大 · 格雷厄姆 · 贝尔于1876年发明了电话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1297','pueblo','pjʊ''ɛblo','''pwebləʊ','[n] 印第安人村庄','There are several dozen Indian pueblos near Santa Fe.  圣达菲附近有几十个印第安人村庄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1298','pound','paʊnd','paʊnd','[n] 磅,英镑; [v] (连续)猛击,捣碎','Moira weighs about 130 pounds .  莫伊拉的体重约为130磅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1299','pebble','''pɛbl','''peb(ə)l','[n] 小圆石,小鹅卵石','As the last Ice Age came to an end, somebody picked a pebble out of a small river not far from Bethlehem.  随着最后一个冰河时代宣告结束，有人从伯利恒附近流水淙淙的小溪边，捡起了一枚鹅卵石。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1300','lot','lɑt','lɒt','[n] 许多,大量','We’ve spent a lot on the children’s education.  我们在孩子的教育上花费甚多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1301','obvious','''ɑbvɪəs','''ɒbvɪəs','[adj] 明显的,显而易见的','The obvious way of reducing pollution is to use cars less.  减少污染显而易见的办法就是少用汽车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1302','station','ˈsteɪʃən','''steɪʃ(ə)n','[n] (车)站,台; [v] 安置,派驻','I want to get off at the next station.  我要在下一站下车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1303','limestone','''laɪmston','''laɪmstəʊn','[n] 石灰石','...high limestone cliffs.  …高耸的石灰岩峭壁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1304','sumerian','','','[n] 闪族人[语]',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1305','brown','braʊn','braʊn','[n&a] 棕色(的),人名','This particular model is available in brown, white, or grey.  这个型号的产品有棕色、白色和灰色的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1306','gazelle','gə''zɛl','gə''zel','[n] 瞪羚,小羚羊',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1307','Columbia','kə''lʌmbɪr','kə''lʌmbɪə','[n] 哥伦比亚','In 1498, Columbus ever been to Columbia coast.  1498年，哥伦布曾到过哥伦比亚海岸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1308','statistic','stə''tɪstɪk','stə''tɪstɪk','[n] 统计数值','The statistic comes from a study recently conducted by the British government.  这项统计数据来自英国政府最近进行的一项研究。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1309','evaporation','ɪ,væpə''reʃən','ɪ,væpə''reɪʃən','[n] 蒸发','Water enters air via evaporation.  水通过蒸发进入空气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1310','archaeology',',ɑrkɪ''ɑlədʒi',',ɑːkɪ''ɒlədʒɪ','[n] 考古学','He specializes in archaeology.  他专修考古学。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1311','dweller','''dwɛlɚ','','[n] 居住者,居民','The number of city dwellers is growing.  城市居民的数量日渐增长。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1312','possess','pə''zɛs','pə''zes','[v] 占有,拥有','Different workers possess different skills.  不同的工人拥有不同技能。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1313','elsewhere','','els''weə; ''elsweə','[adv] 在别处','She is becoming famous in Australia and elsewhere.  她在澳大利亚和其他地方渐渐出名了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1314','seasonal','''sizənl','''siːz(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 季节的,周期性的','heavy seasonal rains  季节性的大雨'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1315','assemble','ə''sɛmbl','ə''semb(ə)l','[v] 集合,聚集,装配','A large crowd had assembled outside the American embassy.  一大群人聚集在美国大使馆外。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1316','mask','mæsk','mɑːsk','[n] 面具','a surgical face mask  外科手术口罩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1317','reality','rɪ''æləti','rɪ''ælɪtɪ','[n] 真实,事实','the distinction between fantasy and reality  幻想和现实之间的区别'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1318','alone','ə''lon','ə''ləʊn','[adj] 单独的','She lives alone .  她一个人生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1319','college','''kɑlɪdʒ','''kɒlɪdʒ','[n] 学院','a teacher training college  师范学院'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1320','definition',',dɛfɪ''nɪʃən','defɪ''nɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 定义,解说','a dictionary definition  词典里的释义'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1321','dead','dɛd','ded','[adj] 死的; [n] 死者','Her mother had been dead for ten years.  她母亲去世十年了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1322','regional','''ridʒənl','''riːdʒənl','[adj] 整个地区的,地域性地','local and regional government  地方及区域治理'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1323','border','''bɔrdɚ','''bɔːdə','[n] 边界; [v] 与接壤,接近','writing paper with a black border  饰有黑边的信纸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1324','household','''haʊshold','''haʊshəʊld','[n] 家庭','A growing number of households have at least one computer.  越来越多的家庭拥有至少一台电脑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1325','trend','trɛnd','trend','[n&v] 倾向,趋势','The current trend is towards more part-time employment.  当前的趋势是雇用更多的兼职人员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1326','sandstone','''sænd''ston','''sæn(d)stəʊn','[n] 沙岩','A red sandstone mosque stands on one side.  一座红色砂岩清真寺耸立在一旁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1327','Sweden','''swidən','''swidən','[n] 瑞典','Sweden borders Norway and Finland.  瑞典与挪威、芬兰接壤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1328','suck','sʌk','sʌk','[v] 吸,吮','Don’t suck your thumb, dear.  不要吮大拇指，宝贝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1329','speech','spitʃ','spiːtʃ','[n] 演说','He has to make a lot of after-dinner speeches .  他经常要发表席后演说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1330','consequent','''kɑnsəkwənt','''kɒnsɪkw(ə)nt','[n] 推论,结论','If we got an if then statement are we asserting an antecedent, an if clause or the consequent, Q the then clause, or are we saying if P then Q.  如果我们的论述中有如果,我们在主张先行词，假设条件句或者结果，然后从句，或者我们说如果P那么。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1331','crisis','''kraɪsɪs','''kraɪsɪs','[n] 决定性时刻,危机','The country now faces an economic crisis .  该国目前正面临一场经济危机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1332','modem','''mo''dɛm','''məʊdem','[n] [计]调制解调器','He sent his work to his publishers by modem.  他通过调制解调器把作品发给他的出版商。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1333','literary','lɪtərɛri','''lɪt(ə)(rə)rɪ','[adj] 文学的','a literary prize  文学奖'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1334','pioneer',',paɪə''nɪr','paɪə''nɪə','[n] 先驱者,创始人; [v] 开拓(创)','...one of the leading pioneers of photojournalism.  …摄影新闻界的主要先驱之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1335','criticize','''krɪtə''saɪz','''krɪtɪsaɪz','[v] 批评,责备','Ron does nothing but criticize and complain all the time.  罗恩什么也不干，只是一味指责和抱怨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1336','originally','ə''rɪdʒənəli','ə''rɪdʒɪn(ə)lɪ','[adv] 最初,原先','The family originally came from France.  这个家族最初来自法国。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1337','salinity','sə''lɪnəti','səˈlɪnətɪ','[n] 盐分,盐度','Each card has not only a date but the latitude and longitude, salinity measures, temperatures and depth of each data point.  每个卡片不仅记有日期，还有每个数据点的纬度和经度，盐度，温度和深度的测量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1338','room','rum','ruːm; rʊm','[n] 房间','I looked around the room.  我四下看了看房间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1339','shrub','ʃrʌb','ʃrʌb','[n] 灌木, 灌木丛','...flowering shrubs.  …开花的灌木。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1340','weapon','''wɛpən','''wep(ə)n','[n] 武器','They all had sticks which they planned to use as weapons.  他们都持有棍棒，打算当武器用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1341','clean','klin','kliːn','[adj] 清洁的; [v] 打扫,使干净','Are your hands clean?  你的手干净吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1342','corn','kɔrn','kɔːn','[n] 玉米','All our chickens are fed on corn.  我们所有的鸡都喂玉米。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1343','dynasty','''daɪnəsti','''dɪnəstɪ','[n] 朝代,王朝','The Habsburg dynasty ruled in Austria from 1278 to 1918.  哈布斯堡王朝在1278至1918年间统治奥地利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1344','livestock','''laɪvstɑk','''laɪvstɒk','[n] 家畜','The heavy rains and flooding killed scores of livestock.  大雨和洪水淹死了许多家畜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1345','drama','''drɑmə','''drɑːmə','[n] 戏剧','the great traditions of ancient Greek drama  古希腊戏剧的伟大传统'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1346','photography','fə''tɑɡrəfi','fə''tɒgrəfɪ','[n] 摄影','He did fashion photography for ‘Vogue’ magazine.  他为《时尚》杂志拍过时装照片。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1347','colonist','''kɑlənɪst','''kɒlənɪst','[n] 殖民地居民,殖民者','The colonists struggled through their first winter.  这些殖民地居民艰难地度过了第一个冬天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1348','extra','''ɛkstrə','''ekstrə','[adj] 额外的','Could you get an extra loaf of bread?  你能多拿一条面包吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1349','algae','''ældʒi','ˈældʒiː','[n] 水藻','...an effort to control toxic algae in Green Lake.  …控制绿湖里有毒水藻的努力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1350','lowland','''lolənd','''ləʊlənd','[n] 低地','But lowland species with no mountains nearby, such as those in the vast Amazon and Congo basins, will have nowhere to go.  但是那些生活在无山区域的低地物种，例如那些生活在广阔的亚马逊和刚果流域的物种，将会无处可逃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1351','otherwise','''ʌðɚwaɪz','''ʌðəwaɪz','[conj] 否则; [adv] 否则,除此以外','We must achieve modernization of science and technology, otherwise we will lag behind other nations.  我们必须实现科学技术现代化，否则我们要落后于其他国家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1352','round','raʊnd','raʊnd','[adj] 圆的; [adv] 在周围; [prep] 大约','a big round table  一张大圆桌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1353','imagine','ɪ''mædʒɪn','ɪ''mædʒɪn','[v] 想象,设想','He could not imagine a more peaceful scene.  他想像不出比这更幽静的场景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1354','selection','sɪ''lɛkʃən','sɪ''lekʃ(ə)n','[n] 选择,挑选','The judges have made their final selection.  评委已经作出最后的评选。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1355','vertebrate','''vɝtɪbrət','''vɜːtɪbrət','[n] 脊椎动物','Because these cells are among the largest in the vertebrate brain, they were the first neurons to be identified.  由于这些细胞是脊椎动物大脑中最大的细胞，它们是最早被识别出来的神经元。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1356','sixteenth','''sɪks''tinθ','''sɪks''tiːnθ','[num] 第十六,十六分之一','But in the course of history, we settled beginning in the sixteenth and seventeenth century, down into just two patterns: what we call the major pattern and the minor pattern.  但在历史的发展过程中,在十六到十七世纪期间,人们最终确定了下列两种模式,我们称之为大调模式和小调模式'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1357','recover','rɪ''kʌvɚ','rɪ''kʌvə','[v] 恢复,复原,重获','After a few days of fever, she began to recover.  发烧几天之后，她开始恢复。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1358','forward','''fɔrwɚd','''fɔːwəd','[adv] 向前,从今往后; [adj] 前部的','He leaned forward , his elbows resting on the table.  他身体前倾，胳膊肘撑在桌子上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1359','expense','ɪk''spɛns','ɪk''spens; ek-','[n] 费用,代价','He borrowed £150,000 and used the money for legal expenses.  他借了15万英镑用于支付律师费。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1360','smooth','smʊð','smuːð','[adj] 光滑的,平整的; [v] 弄平','Her skin felt smooth and cool.  她的皮肤摸上去又滑又凉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1361','talk','tɔk','tɔːk','[v&n] 谈话','I could hear Sarah and Andy talking in the next room.  我听到萨拉和安迪在隔壁讲话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1362','scheme','skim','skiːm','[n] 安排; [v] 计划,策划','She’s nothing but a lying, scheming little monster!  她就是个爱撒谎、爱算计的小巫婆！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1363','tower','''taʊɚ','''taʊə','[n] 塔,城堡','the Eiffel Tower  埃菲尔铁塔'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1364','bright','braɪt','braɪt','[adj] 明亮的','Her eyes were hurting from the bright lights.  明亮的光线刺痛了她的眼睛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1365','anthropologist',',ænθrə''pɑlədʒɪst',',ænθrə''pɒlədʒɪst','[n] 人类学家','This is something I learned as an anthropologist –people love to tell their stories.  这是我作为一名人类学家所理解的----人们喜欢讲述自己的故事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1366','discipline','''dɪsəplɪn','''dɪsɪplɪn','[n] 纪律,学科; [v] 训练','Martial arts teach respect, discipline, and cooperation.  武术能教人尊重他人、遵守纪律并且相互合作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1367','opposite','ˈɑpəzɪt; ˈɑpəsɪt','''ɒpəzɪt; -sɪt','[adj] 相对的,对面的; [n] 相反的事物','I thought the medicine would make him sleep, but it had the opposite effect.  我以为这药会让他睡觉，但是它却起了反作用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1368','oyster','''ɔɪstɚ','''ɒɪstə','[n] 牡蛎,蚝','How can I pull the pearl from the burning oyster?  我怎样做才能算是从燃烧的牡蛎中取出珍珠？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1369','interval','''ɪntɚvl','''ɪntəv(ə)l','[n] 间隔,距离','He left the room, returning after a short interval with a message.  他离开房间，过了一会儿就带回来一条消息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1370','volcano','vɑl''keno','vɒl''keɪnəʊ','[n] 火山','Pompeii was destroyed when the volcano erupted in 79 AD.  庞贝城于公元79年在火山爆发中毁灭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1371','love','lʌv','lʌv','[n&v] 爱','I love you, Tracy.  我爱你，特雷西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1372','mind','maɪnd','maɪnd','[n] 头脑,意见; [v] 介意,注意','It is impossible to understand the complex nature of the human mind .  要想了解人类思维复杂的特性是不可能的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1373','steady','''stɛdi','''stedɪ','[adj] 稳固的,坚定的','Paul is making steady progress.  保罗逐渐在进步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1374','full','fʊl','fʊl','[n] 全部; [adj] 充满的,完全的','The debt must be paid in full .  欠款必须全部偿清。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1375','universal','''jʊnə''vɝsl','juːnɪ''vɜːs(ə)l','[adj] 普遍的,全体的','free universal healthcare  免费的全民保健制度'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1376','union','''junɪən','''juːnjən; -ɪən','[n] 联合,联盟','the British Golf Union  英国高尔夫球协会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1377','terrain','tə''reɪn','təˈreɪn','[n] 地形','rocky terrain  多石的地形'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1378','fluid','''fluɪd','''fluːɪd','[n] 液体; [adj] 流体的,流动的','He is not allowed solid food yet, only fluids.  他还不能吃固体食物，只能进流食。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1379','wildebeest','''wɪldəbist','''wɪldəbiːst; ''vɪ-','[n] 羚羊(其中一种)','Next there are springbok and kudu, then wildebeest and zebra, grazing in a private game reserve.  接着又有羚羊和条纹羚，牛羚和斑马，它们被放养在私人野生动物保护地里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1380','resistance','rɪ''zɪstəns','rɪ''zɪst(ə)ns','[n] 反抗,抵抗','The U.S. wants big cuts in European agricultural export subsidies, but this is meeting resistance.  美国想要在欧洲农业出口补贴上的大幅度削减，但这正遭遇抵制。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1381','rabbit','''ræbɪt','''ræbɪt','[n] 兔','The rabbit disappeared in the bushes.  那只兔子消失在树丛中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1382','candidate','ˈkændɪˌdet, -dɪt','''kændɪdeɪt; -dət','[n] 候选人,投考者','a presidential candidate  总统候选人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1383','museum','mju''ziəm','mjuː''zɪəm','[n] 博物馆','the Museum of Modern Art  现代艺术博物馆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1384','hormone','''hɔrmon','''hɔːməʊn','[n] 荷尔蒙,激素','...the male sex hormone testosterone.  …男性性激素睾酮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1385','countryside','''kʌntrɪsaɪd','''kʌntrɪsaɪd','[n] 乡下地方','The house had lovely views over open countryside .  这房子望出去是开阔的乡村美景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1386','thereby',',ðɛr''baɪ','ðeə''baɪ','[adv] 因此,从而','Our bodies can sweat, thereby losing heat by evaporation.  我们的身体会流汗，由此能通过蒸发散热。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1387','violin',',vaɪə''lɪn','vaɪə''lɪn; ''vaɪəlɪn','[n] 小提琴','She rippled a lively rhythm on the violin.  她在小提琴上奏出明快的节奏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1388','bad','bæd','bæd','[adj] 劣质的,有害的,坏的','I have some bad news for you.  我有坏消息要告诉你。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1389','copy','''kɑpi','''kɒpɪ','[n] 副本; [v] 复印,抄袭','back-up copies of your files  你的文档的备份'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1390','distant','''dɪstənt','''dɪst(ə)nt','[adj] 远的,疏远的','the sound of distant gunfire  远处的炮火声'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1391','lens','lɛnz','lenz','[n] 透镜,镜头','a standard 50mm lens  50毫米标准镜头'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1392','track','træk','træk','[n] 轨道,踪迹; [v] 跟踪','To run a mile, you have to run four circuits of the track.  跑一英里要绕跑道四圈。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1393','porcelain','ˈpɔrsələn','''pɔːs(ə)lɪn','[n] 瓷,瓷器','a porcelain vase  瓷花瓶'),
