('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1395','physics','''fɪzɪks','''fɪzɪks','[n] 物理学','...the laws of physics.  …物理学定律。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1396','spectrum','''spɛktrəm','''spektrəm','[n] 光谱','the electromagnetic spectrum  电磁（波）谱'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1397','forth','fɔrθ','fɔːθ','[adv] 往前,向外','The house was still burning, pouring forth thick black smoke.  房子仍在燃烧，冒出浓浓的黑烟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1398','mesozoic',',mesəu''zəuik; ,mez-',',mesəu''zəuik; ,mez-','[n&a] 中生代(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1399','assign','ə''saɪn','ə''saɪn','[v] 分配,指派','The selling broker is then required to assign a portion of the commission to the buyer broker.  卖方经纪人则被要求分给买方经纪人一部分佣金。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1400','giant','''dʒaɪənt','''dʒaɪənt','[n] 巨人,天才','...a Nordic saga of giants.  …一部关于巨人的北欧传奇。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1401','superior','səˈpɪriər','suːˈpɪərɪə','[n] 长者,上级; [adj] 较高的,上级的','He had a good working relationship with his immediate superior (= the person directly above him ) .  他和他的顶头上司工作关系很融洽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1402','sheet','ʃit','ʃiːt','[n] (一)片,(一)张','...a sheet of newspaper.  …一张报纸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1403','rigid','''rɪdʒɪd','''rɪdʒɪd','[adj] 刚硬的,严格的','rigid and authoritarian methods of education  死板、专断的教育方法'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1404','Denmark','''denma:k','''denma:k','[n] 丹麦','They tried to chart the sea area between Norway and Denmark.  他们企图绘制挪威与丹麦之间的海域图。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1405','symbol','''sɪmbl','''sɪmb(ə)l','[n] 符号,记号,象征','The symbol on the packet is a guarantee that the food has been produced organically.  包装盒上的这个标识保证这种食物是有机生产的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1406','gar','','gɑː','[n] 雀鳝属鱼, 雀鳝','Officials with the Mississippi Department of Wildlife, Fisheries and Parks (MDWFP) said it could be the largest alligator gar caught.  野生动物、鱼类和公园(MDWFP)的密西西比河部门的官员说它是被逮住的最大的鳄雀鳝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1407','functional','''fʌŋkʃənl','''fʌŋ(k)ʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 功能的','The two departments have slight functional differences.  这两个部门功能稍有不同。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1408','cultivation','''kʌltə''veʃən','kʌltɪ''veɪʃn','[n] 培养,教养','Where within this they can establish cultivation, collaboration, and competence culture and they can actually really do all the amazing things that Agile supports them to do and can get great results.  在这个空间内，人们可以建立培养、协作和胜任文化，他们真的可以做各种由敏捷支持的、令人惊奇的事情，而且得到出色的成果。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1409','impossible','ɪm''pɑsəbl','ɪm''pɒsɪb(ə)l','[adj] 不可能的','‘I want to speak to Mr Franks.’ ‘I’m afraid that’s impossible.’  “我想和弗兰克斯先生谈谈。”“恐怕不行。”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1410','domestic','də''mɛstɪk','də''mestɪk','[adj] 国内的,家庭的','Unfortunately his domestic life wasn’t very happy.  不幸的是，他的家庭生活并不幸福。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1411','emphasis','''ɛmfəsɪs','''emfəsɪs','[n] 强调,重点','a change of emphasis in government policy  政府政策重心的变化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1412','colonize','''kɑlənaɪz','''kɔlənaiz','[v] 拓殖,殖民','The first British attempt to colonize Ireland was in the twelfth century.  英国第一次企图把爱尔兰变成殖民地是在12世纪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1413','flipper','''flɪpɚ','''flɪpə','[n] 鳍状肢','Not only that, but when a wave threatened to return the seal to danger, the humpback used its massive flipper (at five metres, the longest in the animal kingdom) to nudge it back on.  不仅如此，当一个浪头即将把海豹扫回险境之时，座头鲸还利用它的巨大的鳍状肢（五米长，动物王国中最长的）把它轻轻地推了回来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1414','peninsula','pə''nɪnsələ','pɪ''nɪnsjʊlə','[n] 半岛','the Korean peninsula  朝鲜半岛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1415','acid','''æsɪd','''æsɪd','[n] 酸; [adj] 酸的','sulphuric acid  硫酸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1416','droplet','''drɑplət','''drɒplɪt','[n] 小滴','Droplets of sweat were welling up on his forehead.  一颗颗小汗珠从他额头上不断冒出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1417','paleontologist',',pelɪɑn''tɑlədʒɪst',',peiliɔn''tɔlədʒist','[n] 古生物学者','As a result, the research has the potential to change the way a paleontologist views a fossil.  现在，研究者们已经拥有了改变一个古生物学家观察化石方式的潜力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1418','apprentice','ə''prɛntɪs','ə''prentɪs','[n] 学徒; [v] 当学徒','The apprentice lingered his work.  这个徒弟磨洋工。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1419','grandma','ɡrænmɑ','''græn(d)mɑː','[n] 奶奶','Grandma was from Scotland.  奶奶来自苏格兰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1420','justify','''dʒʌstə''fai','''dʒʌstɪfaɪ','[v] 证明是正当的','Nothing justifies murdering another human being.  什么都不能成为谋杀他人的正当理由。'),
