('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1432','policy','''pɑləsi','''pɒləsɪ','[n] 政策,方针','...plans that include changes in foreign policy and economic reforms.  …包括外交政策调整和经济改革的计划。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1433','wrong','rɔŋ','rɒŋ','[a&ad] 错误的,不正当的','I calculate he is wrong in saying that.  我认为他说的那句话是错误的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1434','transition','træn''zɪʃən','træn''zɪʃ(ə)n; trɑːn-; -''sɪʃ-','[n] 转变,过渡','Making the transition from youth to adulthood can be very painful.  从青少年过渡到成年有时是一个非常痛苦的过程。'),
