('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1498','resist','rɪ''zɪst','rɪ''zɪst','[v] 抵抗,反抗','He resisted pressure to resign.  他顶住压力，没辞职。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1499','win','wɪn','wɪn','[v] (获)胜,赢得','Who’s winning (= who is most successful at this point in the game )?  现在谁领先？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1500','fluctuation',',flʌktʃʊ''eʃən',',flʌktʃʊ''eɪʃ(ə)n; -tjʊ-','[n] 波动,起伏','Prices are subject to fluctuation.  价格可能会有波动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1501','breed','brid','briːd','[v] 教养,抚养; [n] 品种','Society’s obsession with sex has bred a generation of unhappy children.  纵欲的社会生养了一代不幸的儿童。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1502','partner','''pɑrtnɚ','''pɑːtnə','[n] 合伙人','She’s a partner in a law firm.  她是一家律师事务所的合伙人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1503','argument','''ɑrɡjumənt','''ɑːgjʊm(ə)nt','[n] 争论','We need to provide a convincing argument as to why the system should be changed.  我们得提出有说服力的论据，证明为何要改变体制。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1504','solve','sɔlv','sɒlv','[v] 解决,解答','Charlie thinks money will solve all his problems.  查理认为钱能解决他所有的问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1505','cage','kedʒ','keɪdʒ','[n] 笼','I hate to see birds in cages.  我不喜欢看到鸟在笼子里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1506','shale','ʃel','ʃeɪl','[n] 页岩,泥板岩',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1507','productivity',',prodʌk''tɪvəti','prɒdʌk''tɪvɪtɪ','[n] 生产力','high productivity levels in manufacturing  制造业中的高生产率'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1508','furniture','''fɝnɪtʃɚ','''fɜːnɪtʃə','[n] 家具,设备','I helped him choose the furniture for his house.  我帮他挑选房子里用的家具。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1509','systematic','''sɪstə''mætɪk','sɪstə''mætɪk','[adj] 系统的,体系的','What about all other systematic knowledge?  对于所有其他系统的知识呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1510','attribute','ə''trɪbjut','ə''trɪbjuːt','[n] 属性,品质,特征','What attributes should a good manager possess?  一名优秀的经理应该具备哪些素质？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1511','maker','''mekɚ','''meɪkə','[n] 制造者','a leading Japanese computer maker  日本一家主要的计算机生产商'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1512','variable','''vɛrɪəbl','''veərɪəb(ə)l','[adj] 多变的,可变的; [n] 变量','Expect variable cloudiness and fog tomorrow.  预计明天多云有雾，天气多变。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1513','preservation',',prɛzɚ''veʃən','prezə''veɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 保存','methods of food preservation  保存食物的各种方法'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1514','initiate','ɪ''nɪʃɪet','ɪ''nɪʃɪeɪt','[v] 开始,发起','They have decided to initiate legal proceedings against the newspaper.  他们决定向该报提起法律诉讼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1515','breakfast','''brɛkfəst','''brekfəst','[n] 早餐 vi进早餐','We had bacon and eggs for breakfast .  我们早餐吃了熏肉鸡蛋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1516','perceive','pɚ''siv','pə''siːv','[v] 察觉,感知','That morning, he perceived a change in Franca’s mood.  那天早上，他注意到弗兰卡情绪的变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1517','convince','kən''vɪns','kən''vɪns','[v] 使确信, 使信服','Her arguments didn’t convince everyone, but changes were made.  她的论点不能说服每个人，但还是引起了一些变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1518','competitive','kəm''pɛtətɪv','kəm''petɪtɪv','[adj] 竞争的','Some US industries are not as competitive as they have been in the past.  美国有些行业不如以前有竞争力了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1519','clue','klʊ','kluː','[n] 线索','Police have found a vital clue .  警方发现了至关重要的线索。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1520','nervous','''nɝvəs','''nɜːvəs','[adj] 紧张的,不安的','I wish you’d stop looking at me like that. You’re making me nervous.  我希望你不要再那样看着我了，你让我紧张。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1521','count','kaʊnt','kaʊnt','[v] 数,计算','I was amazed at the number of plants - I counted 147.  我对植物的数量之多感到惊讶，我数了有147棵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1522','adjust','ə''dʒʌst','ə''dʒʌst','[v] 调整,校准','Check and adjust the brakes regularly.  经常检查并调节刹车装置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1523','challenge','''tʃælɪndʒ','''tʃælɪn(d)ʒ','[n&v] 挑战','They threw down the challenge that he couldn’t wash 40 cars in one hour (= invited him to try to do it ) .  他们激将他，说他不可能在1小时内擦洗40辆汽车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1524','hyper','''haɪpɚ','''haɪpə','[adj] 亢奋的,高度紧张的','No, don’t give Luke any candy - it’ll make him hyper.  不，别给卢克糖果，不然他会起劲折腾的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1525','eliminate','ɪ''lɪmɪnet','ɪ''lɪmɪneɪt','[v] 排除,除去','Recent measures have not eliminated discrimination in employment.  最近的举措还未能根除就业歧视。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1526','warren','''wɔrən','''wɒr(ə)n','[n] 养兔场,大杂院',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1527','resident','''rɛzɪdənt','ˈrɛzɪdənt','[n] 居民','As one local resident put it in May, "By day there is government.  正如一位当地居民在五月份对它的描述”白天有政府。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1528','vent','vɛnt','vent','[n] 出口; [v] 排出,发泄','a blocked air vent  堵塞的通风口'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1529','pole','pol','pəʊl','[n] 柱,地极','a telephone pole  电话线杆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1530','storage','''stɔrɪdʒ','''stɔːrɪdʒ','[n] 贮藏(量),存储','the storage of highly radioactive material  高放射性材料的存放'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1531','investor','ɪn''vɛstɚ','ɪn''vestə','[n] 投资者','The main investor in the project is the French bank Credit National.  该项目的主要投资方是法国国民信贷银行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1532','loose','lus','luːs','[n] 解放,放任; [v] 弄松, 释放','And now the anger Maggie had feared was loosed.  现在，玛吉所害怕的怒火发泄出来了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1533','miss','mɪs','mɪs','[n] 过错; [v] 错过,遗漏','I don''t want to miss seeing that film on television tonight.  我不想错过今晚在电视上看那部影片的机会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1534','upward','''ʌpwɚd','''ʌpwəd','[adj] 向上的; [adv] 以上','upward pressure on bank interest rates  针对银行利率的越来越大的压力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1535','linguistic','lɪŋ''gwɪstɪk','lɪŋ''gwɪstɪk','[adj] 语言(学)上的','a child’s linguistic development  儿童的语言发展'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1536','primitive','''prɪmətɪv','''prɪmɪtɪv','[adj] 原始的,远古的','a primitive society  原始社会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1537','uniform','''junɪfɔrm','''juːnɪfɔːm','[n] 制服; [v] 使统一','The police wear dark blue uniforms.  警察穿深蓝色制服。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1538','vision','''vɪʒən','''vɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 幻想,视觉','She suffered temporary loss of vision after being struck on the head.  她头部受撞击以后出现暂时性失明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1539','graze','ɡrez','greɪz','[v] 放牧,掠过','A bullet grazed his arm.  一颗子弹擦过他的手臂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1540','cucumber','''kjʊ,kʌmbɚ','''kjuːkʌmbə','[n] 黄瓜','The "gurkophone" is one of their classics, made from a hollowed cucumber, a pepper and a carrot.  黄瓜管"是他们的经典乐器之一,那是用掏空的黄瓜、辣椒和胡萝卜做的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1541','exception','ɪk''sɛpʃən','ɪk''sepʃ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 除外,例外','It’s been cold, but today’s an exception.  天气一直寒冷，但今天是个例外。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1542','elaborate','ɪ''læbəret','ɪ''læb(ə)rət','[adj] 详尽的,复杂的; [v] 详述','pure silks embroidered with elaborate patterns  绣有精美图案的真丝衣服'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1543','failure','''feljɚ','''feɪljə','[n] 失败','Successful people often aren’t very good at dealing with failure.  一帆风顺的人往往不太擅长应对失败。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1544','secure','sə''kjʊr','sɪ''kjʊə; sɪ''kjɔː','[adj] 安全的,可靠的; [v] 保护','There are no secure jobs these days.  如今已经没有铁饭碗了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1545','pool','pul','puːl','[n] 池','They have a nice pool in their backyard.  他们后院有个漂亮的游泳池。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1546','mystery','ˈmɪstri','ˈmɪstri','[n] 神秘,神秘的事物','Twenty years after the event, his death remains a mystery .  事情过去二十年了，他的死仍然是个谜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1547','coat','kot','kəʊt','[n] 外套; [v] 涂上,包上','Billy! Put your coat on , it’s cold outside!  比利！穿上外套，外面很冷！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1548','mature','mə''tʃʊr','mə''tʃʊə','[adj] 成熟的; [v] 使成熟','Laura is very mature for her age .  相对她的年龄来说劳拉是很成熟的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1549','sustain','sə''sten','sə''steɪn','[v] 支撑,维持','She found it difficult to sustain the children’s interest.  她发现很难保持孩子们的兴趣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1550','latitude','''lætɪtud','''lætɪtjuːd','[n] 纬度,范围','The birds breed in northern latitudes.  这些鸟在北纬地区繁殖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1551','clothe','kloð','kləʊð','[v] 给穿衣,覆盖','She was on her own with two kids to feed and clothe.  她自己一个人要招呼两个孩子的衣食。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1552','coin','kɔɪn','kɒɪn','[n] 硬币; [v] 铸造(硬币)','Toss a coin to see who goes first.  抛硬币决定谁先来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1553','news','nuz','njuːz','[n] 新闻,消息','I hope to have some good news for you soon.  我希望很快就能给你好消息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1554','organ','''ɔrɡən','''ɔːg(ə)n','[n] 器官,机构','the decision-making organs  决策机关'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1555','earthenware','''ɝθnwɛr','''ɜːθ(ə)nweə','[n] 土器,陶器','...colourful Italian china and earthenware.  ...五颜六色的意大利瓷器和陶器。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1556','refuse','ri''fjʊz','rɪ''fjuːz','[v] 拒绝','She asked him to leave, but he refused.  她叫他走，但他不肯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1557','hill','hɪl','hɪl','[n] 小山,丘陵','Their house is on a hill overlooking the sea.  他们的房子建在可以俯视大海的小山上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1558','wagon','''wægən','''wæg(ə)n','[n] 四轮马车,货车',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1559','rite','raɪt','raɪt','[n] 仪式,典礼','funeral rites  殡葬仪式'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1560','achievement','ə''tʃivmənt','ə''tʃiːvm(ə)nt','[n] 成就,功绩','His great achievement is to make all the players into a united team.  他的伟大成就在于把所有选手组织成一支团结的队伍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1561','inhabit','ɪn''hæbɪt','ɪn''hæbɪt','[v] 居住于,栖息','The woods are inhabited by many wild animals.  很多野生动物栖居在这片森林里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1562','locust','''lokəst','''ləʊkəst','[n] 蝗虫','a swarm of locusts  一大群蝗虫'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1563','federal','''fɛdərəl','''fed(ə)r(ə)l','[adj] 联邦的,联合的','Switzerland is a federal republic.  瑞士是一个联邦共和国。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1564','govern','''ɡʌvɚn','''gʌv(ə)n','[v] 统治,支配,管理','the leaders who govern the country  治理这个国家的领导人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1565','philosophy','fə''lɑsəfi','fɪ''lɒsəfɪ','[n] 哲学','Emma studies philosophy at university.  埃玛在大学攻读哲学。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1566','endure','ɪn''dʊr','ɪn''djʊə; en-; -''djɔː','[v] 耐久,忍耐','It seemed impossible that anyone could endure such pain.  似乎谁都不可能忍受这样的疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1567','offspring','''ɔfsprɪŋ','''ɒfsprɪŋ','[n] 儿女,子孙','a young mother trying to control her offspring  一个想管住自己孩子的年轻妈妈'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1568','Hawaii','hə''waii:','hə''waii:','[n] 夏威夷','They''ve hopped to Hawaii for holidays.  他们已坐飞机到夏威夷度假去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1569','brick','brɪk','brɪk','[n] 砖块','a brick wall  砖墙'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1570','convert','kən''vɝt','kən''vɜːt','[v] 使转变,转换','a 19th-century converted barn  由19世纪谷仓改建的房子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1571','pigeon','''pɪdʒɪn','''pɪdʒɪn; ''pɪdʒ(ə)n','[n] 鸽子','Many journalists here choose to pigeon all but the most innocuous of stories.  除了平淡乏味的报道，这儿的新闻记者将一切通过鸽子传递出去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1572','celebrity','sə''lɛbrəti','sɪ''lebrɪtɪ','[n] 名声,名人','a sporting celebrity  体育明星'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1573','devise','dɪ''vaɪz','dɪ''vaɪz','[v] 设计,发明','She devised a method for quicker communications between offices.  她想出一种加快办公室之间通信联络的方法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1574','your','jʊr, jɔr, jor,jə','jɔː; jʊə','[pron] 你的,你们的','You should keep in with your colleagues.  你应当与你的同事友好相处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1575','territory','''tɛrətɔri','''terɪt(ə)rɪ','[n] 领土,地域','Hong Kong is a Chinese territory.  香港是中国的领土。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1576','interact',',ɪntɚ''ækt','ɪntər''ækt','[v] 互相作用,互相影响','While the other children interacted and played together, Ted ignored them.  当其他孩子们相互交往、一起玩耍时，泰德却不理他们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1577','gulf','ɡʌlf','gʌlf','[n] 海湾,深渊','the Gulf of Mexico  墨西哥湾'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1578','bond','bɑnd','bɒnd','[n] 结合,协定; [v] 使结合,粘合','Use a glue gun to form a strong bond on wood or china.  用喷胶枪使木头或瓷器牢固地黏合起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1579','cluster','''klʌstɚ','''klʌstə','[n] 串,丛','a diamond cluster ring  群镶钻戒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1580','calcium','''kælsɪəm','''kælsɪəm','[n] 钙','Like fibre, calcium binds with fat molecules and helps flush them out through the intestine.  像纤维、钙可以和脂肪分子结合，帮助他们彻底的通过肠道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1581','vital','''vaɪtl','''vaɪt(ə)l','[adj] 重大的,至关重要的','The work she does is absolutely vital.  她所做的工作至关重要。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1582','poetry','''poətri','''pəʊɪtrɪ','[n] 诗','He reads a lot of poetry.  他大量阅读诗歌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1583','notice','''notɪs','''nəʊtɪs','[n] 通知; [v] 注意到','The notice on the wall said ‘No smoking’.  墙上的告示写着“禁止吸烟”。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1584','inland',',ɪn''lænd','''ɪnlənd; -lænd','[adj] 内陆的,国内的','the largest area of inland water in the southeast  东南部最大的内陆水域'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1585','voice','vɔɪs','vɒɪs','[n] 嗓音,意见; [v] 说(话)','He recognized her voice instantly.  他立刻听出了她的声音。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1586','double','''dʌbl','''dʌb(ə)l','[n&a] 两倍(的); [v] 使加倍','Scotch and water, please – make it a double.  请来苏格兰威士忌加水——要双份的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1587','entrance','''ɛntrəns','''entr(ə)ns','[n] 入口','the station entrance  车站的入口处'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1588','chemistry','''kɛmɪstri','''kemɪstrɪ','[n] 化学','a person’s body chemistry  人体的化学组成'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1589','oppose','ə''poz','ə''pəʊz','[v] 反对,对抗','Congress is continuing to oppose the President’s health care budget.  国会继续反对总统的医疗保健预算。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1590','portrait','''pɔrtrɪt','''pɔːtrɪt','[n] 肖像,人像','a family portrait  全家福'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1591','agent','''edʒənt','''eɪdʒ(ə)nt','[n] 代理(商)','Our agent in Rio deals with all our Brazilian business.  我们在里约热内卢的业务代表处理我们在巴西的全部业务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1592','weave','wiv','wiːv','[v] 织,编','hand-woven scarves  手织围巾'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1593','scatter','''skætɚ','''skætə','[v] 撒(播),分散','The sound of gunfire made the crowd scatter in all directions.  枪声使人群四散奔逃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1594','empty','ˈɛmptɪ','''em(p)tɪ','[adj] 空的; [v] (使)空,倒出','an empty box  空盒子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1595','islander','''aɪləndɚ','''aɪləndə','[n] 岛上居民','The islanders endured centuries of exploitation.  岛民们忍受了几个世纪的剥削。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1596','recognition',',rɛkəɡ''nɪʃən','rekəg''nɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 识别,确认','He stared at her, but there was no sign of recognition .  他盯着她看，但似乎没认出她来。'),
