('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1599','implement','''ɪmplɪmɛnt','''ɪmplɪm(ə)nt','[v] 履行,实施; [n] 工(器,用)具','The government promised to implement a new system to control financial loan institutions.  政府许诺要实施新的制度来控制金融贷款机构。'),
