('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1613','container','kən''tenɚ','kən''teɪnə','[n] 容器','ice cream in plastic containers  塑料容器里的冰激凌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1614','article','''ɑrtɪkl','''ɑːtɪk(ə)l','[n] 文章,论文','The paper’s leading article (=  the main article  ) described the government as weak.  该报社论称政府软弱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1615','sink','sɪŋk','sɪŋk','[v] 下沉','Their motorboat struck a rock and began to sink.  他们的摩托艇触了礁，开始下沉。'),
