('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1619','watercolor','''wɔ:tə,kʌlə, ''wɔ-','''wɔ:tə,kʌlə, ''wɔ-','[n] 水彩颜料,水彩画(法)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1620','streamline','''strimlaɪn','''striːmlaɪn','[adj] 流线型的','Can you streamline this kind of airship?  你能把这种飞艇设计成流线型吗?'),
