('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1622','reward','rɪ''wɔrd','rɪ''wɔːd','[n] 报酬; [v] 酬劳','The school has a system of rewards and punishments to encourage good behaviour.  学校有奖惩制度以鼓励良好行为。'),
