('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1625','subsequent','''sʌbsɪkwənt','''sʌbsɪkw(ə)nt','[adj] 后来的,并发的','These skills were passed on to subsequent generations.  这些技能代代相传。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1626','hungry','''hʌŋɡri','''hʌŋgrɪ','[adj] 饥饿的,渴望的','I was cold, tired, and hungry.  我又冷，又累，又饿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1627','episode','''ɛpɪsod','''epɪsəʊd','[n] 一段情节','She decided she would try to forget the episode by the lake.  她决心尽量忘掉湖边的那次经历。'),
