('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1630','cheap','tʃip','tʃiːp','[adj] 便宜的,不值钱的','cheap rail fares  便宜的火车票'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1631','sort','sɔrt','sɔːt','[n] 种类v分类,拣选','Most of the victims developed psychological problems of one sort or another (= of various different types ) .  大多数受害者都出现了这样那样的心理问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1632','industrialize','ɪn''dʌstrɪəlaɪz','ɪnˈdʌstrɪəlʌɪz','[v] 使工业化','Energy consumption rises as countries industrialize.  能源消耗随着各国工业化而增加。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1633','burial','''bɛrɪəl','''berɪəl','[n] 埋葬','The priest prepared the body for burial.  牧师为尸体做好了下葬的准备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1634','hominid','''hɑmɪnɪd','''hɒmɪnɪd','[n] 原始人类','A hominid is really any extinct ape more closely related to us than the chimpanzee.  原始人类中任何一个灭绝的猿物种和我们的关系都比黑猩猩更密切。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1635','laboratory','''læbrə''tɔri','lə''bɒrə,t(ə)rɪ; ''læb(ə)rə,t(ə)rɪ','[n] 实验室','a research laboratory  研究实验室'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1636','cinema','''sɪnəmə','''sɪnɪmə; -mɑː','[n] 电影院,电影','It’s on at the local cinema.  此片正在当地影院上映。'),
