('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1641','everything','''ɛvrɪ''θɪŋ','''evrɪθɪŋ','[pron] 每件事物','Everything was covered in a thick layer of dust.  所有东西上面都蒙着厚厚一层灰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1642','purchase','''pɝtʃəs','''pɜ:tʃəs','[v] 购买','You can purchase insurance online.  你可以在网上买保险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1643','sanctuary','''sæŋktʃuɛri','''sæŋ(k)tjʊərɪ','[n] 避难所','His church became a sanctuary for thousands of people who fled the civil war.  他的教堂成了数千逃避内战的人们的一个避难所。'),
