('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1649','laborer','''lebərɚ','''leɪbərə','[n] 劳动者','Traditionally cut blue jeans carry a whiff of the laborer about them, so denim on a leader suggests a willingness to roll up the sleeves and dig in.  传统剪裁的蓝色牛仔裤带有一种劳动者的气息，因此领导者穿着仔裤可以表达一种愿意卷起袖子大干一场的意思。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1650','proton','''protɑn','''prəʊtɒn','[n] 质子','So we get at the number of neutrons indirectly because we know the proton number here.  所以，我们可以间接得到中子数,因为我们知道质子数了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1651','commerce','''kɑmɝs','''kɒmɜːs','[n] 商业','measures promoting local commerce and industry  促进地方工商业发展的措施'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1652','decide','dɪ''saɪd','dɪ''saɪd','[v] 决定,判决','Has anything been decided yet?  已经作出什么决定了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1653','fireplace','''faɪɚples','''faɪəpleɪs','[n] 壁炉','In the evenings, we gathered around the fireplace and talked in hushed whispers.  晚上，我们聚集在壁炉周围轻声交谈。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1654','aluminum','ə''lʊmɪnəm','ˌæljʊˈmɪnɪəm','[n] 铝','To make an aluminum can, that takes energy.  为了制造一个铝罐，就得消耗能源。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1655','firm','fɝm','fɜːm','[n] 公司','The firm''s employees were expecting large bonuses.  这家公司的雇员们正期待着大笔的奖金。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1656','collide','kə''laɪd','kə''laɪd','[v] 碰撞,抵触','A car and a van collided on the motorway.  一辆汽车和一辆小型货车在高速公路上相撞了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1657','fight','faɪt','faɪt','[n&v] 战斗,打架,斗争','Neither country is capable of fighting a long war .  两个国家都没有能力打持久战。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1658','puzzle','''pʌzl','''pʌz(ə)l','[n] 难题; [v] (使)迷惑','The meaning of the poem has always been a puzzle.  那首诗的含义始终是个谜。'),
