('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1662','listen','''lɪsn','''lɪs(ə)n','[v] 听','Listen! There’s a strange noise in the engine.  听！引擎发出奇怪的声音。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1663','dependence','dɪ''pɛndəns','dɪ''pend(ə)ns','[n] 依靠,信任','...the city''s traditional dependence on tourism.  …这个城市对旅游业的传统依赖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1664','struggle','''strʌɡl','''strʌg(ə)l','[v] 努力,奋斗,挣扎','The team has been struggling all season.  整个赛季球队都打得很艰难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1665','German','','''dʒɜːmən','[n] 德国人; [adj] 德国的','I heard a very angry man talking in German.  我听到一个怒不可遏的人说着德语。'),
