('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1671','female','''fimel','''fiːmeɪl','[n] 女性','As a group, females performed better on the test than males.  整体来说，女性在这次测试中胜过男性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1672','emit','ɪ''mɪt','ɪ''mɪt','[v] 发出,放射','The kettle emitted a shrill whistle.  水壶发出了刺耳的鸣笛声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1673','retreat','rɪ''trit','rɪ''triːt','[v] 撤退,退却','The rebels retreated to the mountains.  叛乱分子撤退到山区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1674','deficiency','dɪ''fɪʃənsi','dɪ''fɪʃ(ə)nsɪ','[n] 缺乏,不足','They did blood tests on him for signs of vitamin deficiency.  他们给他做了血检看是否有缺乏维生素的迹象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1675','rotate','''rotet','rə(ʊ)''teɪt','[v] (使)旋转','The Earth rotates on its axis once every 24 hours.  地球每24小时绕地轴自转一周。'),
