('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1677','symbiotic','sɪmbaɪ''ɑtɪk','sɪmbaɪ''ɒtɪk','[adj] 共生的','...fungi that have a symbiotic relationship with the trees of these northwestern forests.  ...与这些位于西北部的森林里的树木存在共生关系的真菌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1678','alternative','ɔl''tɝnətɪv','ɔːl''tɜːnətɪv; ɒl-','[adj] 选择性的,二中择一的','...alternative health care.  …替代性保健。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1679','bridge','brɪdʒ','brɪdʒ','[n] 桥; [v] 架桥,渡过','He walked back over the railway bridge.  他从铁路桥上走了回去。'),
