('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1681','circle','''sɝkl','''sɜːk(ə)l','[n] 圆(圈); [v] 围着,盘旋','Draw a circle 10cm in diameter.  画一个直径10厘米的圆形。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1682','quarter','''kwɔrtɚ','''kwɔːtə','[n] 四分之一,一刻钟','It’s about a page and a quarter.  大概是一又四分之一页。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1683','fix','fɪks','fɪks','[v] 修理,安装,整理','He’s outside fixing the brakes on the car.  他在外面修理汽车的刹车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1684','doubt','daʊt','daʊt','[n&v] 怀疑,怀疑','There was still one little nagging doubt at the back of his mind.  他的心头仍有一丝挥之不去的疑虑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1685','Tennessee','ˌtɛnɪˈsiː','ˌtenə''siː','[n] 田纳西州','The study at the University of Tennessee selected 169 married couples under the age of 35 and asked them to fill in questionnaires every six months for four years.  田纳西州大学的这项研究选取了169对35岁以下的已婚夫妇，在四年的时间里每隔6个月请他们填一份调查问卷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1686','eruption','ɪ''rʌpʃən','ɪ''rʌpʃ(ə)n','[n] 爆发,火山灰','The last eruption of this volcano lasted over a year, so this cannot be ruled out.  该火山上次爆发持续了一年，所以现在也不能排除这个可能性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1687','treat','trit','triːt','[vt&n] 对待,款待','Artie treated most women with indifference.  阿蒂对待大多数女性颇为冷淡。'),
