('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1786','Erie','''iəri','''iəri','[n] 伊利(人)','They drove north back home, where he would start chemotherapy at a cancer center in Erie.  他们驱车向北返回家中，要在伊利肿瘤治疗中心开始进行化疗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1787','inhibit','ɪn''hɪbɪt','ɪn''hɪbɪt','[v] 阻止妨碍抑制','An unhappy family life may inhibit children’s learning.  不幸福的家庭生活可能会阻碍儿童的学习。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1788','Yucatan','','','[n] 尤卡坦半岛','This is the brochure for Mexico, Yucatan is at the back, and this is the brochure for Guatemala.  这是墨西哥的旅游宣传册，尤卡坦半岛在背面，这是危地马拉的旅游宣传册。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1789','alkali','''ælkə''lai','''ælkəlaɪ','[n] 碱; [adj] 碱性的','The extremely salty, alkali lake holds little life, but its waters are a favorite spot for wading birds.  其味极咸，碱湖保存了湖中的小生命，但其水域仍为涉水鸟所喜欢的地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1790','complexity','kəm''plɛksəti','kəm''pleksətɪ','[n] 复杂(性),复杂的事物','a design of great complexity  一项非常复杂的设计'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1791','sedimentary',',sɛdɪ''mɛntri','sedɪ''mentrɪ','[adj] 沉积的,沉淀性的','sedimentary rock  沉积岩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1792','accelerate','əkˈsɛləˌret','ək''seləreɪt','[v] 加速,促进','measures to accelerate the rate of economic growth  加快经济增长速度的措施'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1793','Spain','spen','spein','[n] 西班牙(欧洲南部国家)','They are touring in Spain.  他们正在西班牙旅游。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1794','window','''wɪndo','''wɪndəʊ','[n] 窗,窗口','Television provides us with a useful window on the world.  电视为我们提供了了解世界的有用渠道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1795','text','tɛkst','tekst','[n] 正文,课文','There should not be too much text in children’s books.  儿童书籍里不应该有太多的文字。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1796','sing','sɪŋ','sɪŋ','[v] 唱,演唱','She can sing beautifully.  她唱歌很好听。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1797','assist','ə''sɪst','ə''sɪst','[v] 援助,帮助','The family decided to assist me with my chores.  家人决定分担我的琐事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1798','representation','''rɛprɪzɛn''teʃən',',reprɪzen''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 表示法,表现,陈述','Puerto Ricans are U.S. citizens but they have no representation in Congress.  波多黎各人是美国公民，但是他们在国会中没有代表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1799','regulation','ˌrɛɡjəˈleʃən','regjʊ''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 规则','There seem to be so many rules and regulations these days.  如今好像条条框框很多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1800','enclose','ɪn''kloz','ɪn''kləʊz; en-','[v] 放入封套,围绕',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1801','fluctuate','''flʌktʃʊ''et','''flʌktʃʊeɪt; -tjʊ-','[v] 变动,波动','Insect populations fluctuate wildly from year to year.  昆虫的数量每年变化很大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1802','furnace','''fɝnɪs','''fɜːnɪs','[n] 炉子,熔炉','We had better fire up the furnace.  我们最好把炉子生起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1803','reptile','''rɛptaɪl','''reptaɪl','[n] 爬虫动物','Bird evolved from reptiles, so the first bird must have come out of an egg--laid by a reptile.  禽类是由爬虫类进化而来，所以，第一只禽鸟肯定是从爬虫类孵化的蛋里出来的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1804','popularity',',pɑpju''lærəti','pɒpjʊ''lærətɪ','[n] 普及,流行','The president’s popularity has declined considerably.  总统的支持率大大下降了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1805','whom','hum','huːm','[pron] 谁','From whom shall I get comfort?  我从谁那儿能得到安慰呢?'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1806','bake','bek','beɪk','[v] 烘焙,烤','I’m baking some bread.  我在烤一些面包。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1807','ash','æʃ','æʃ','[n] 灰(烬),[植]岑树','His ashes were scattered at sea.  他的骨灰被撒向大海。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1808','institution',',ɪnstɪ''tuʃən','ɪnstɪ''tjuːʃ(ə)n','[n] 公共机构,协会,制度','powerful institutions such as world banks  诸如世界银行之类的强大机构'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1809','symbolic','sɪm''bɑlɪk','sɪm''bɒlɪk','[adj] 象征的,符号的','Each element of the ceremony has a symbolic meaning .  仪式的每一个元素都具有象征意义。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1810','religion','rɪ''lɪdʒən','rɪ''lɪdʒ(ə)n','[n] 宗教,信仰','The U.S. Constitution promises freedom of religion.  美国宪法保证宗教信仰自由。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1811','conserve','kən''sɝv','kən''sɜːv','[v] 保存,保藏','We must conserve our woodlands for future generations.  我们必须为子孙后代保护林地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1812','pit','pɪt','pɪt','[n] 深坑,陷阱v窖藏,使凹下','The female digs a pit in which to lay the eggs.  雌性挖坑产卵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1813','traffic','''træfɪk','''træfɪk','[n] 交通,运输','There wasn’t much traffic on the roads.  路上车辆不多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1814','Harvard','''hɑvəd','''hɑ:vəd','[n] 哈佛大学(美国)','A: He got the scholarship to Harvard.  他得到了哈佛大学的奖学金。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1815','Himalaya','','','[n] 喜马拉雅山','From the deck of a ship, the island makes a startling apparition, like the Himalaya just emerged from the Flood.  坐船从甲板上看，这个岛屿简直是个惊人的神迹，就像喜马拉雅山在一片洪水中耸立。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1816','digest','daɪ''dʒɛst','daɪ''dʒest; dɪ-','[v] 消化,融会贯通','Most babies can digest a wide range of food easily.  大多数婴儿能轻易地消化很多种食物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1817','application','ˌæpləˈkeʃən','ˌæplɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 请求,申请,应用','We receive hundreds of job applications each year.  我们每年收到数百封求职信。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1818','gravity','''ɡrævəti','''grævɪtɪ','[n] 地心引力,重力','the force of gravity  重力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1819','explorer','ɪk''splɔrɚ','ek''splɔːrə(r)','[n] 探险者','...the travels of Columbus, Magellan, and many other explorers.  …哥伦布、麦哲伦和许多其他探险家的旅行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1820','educate','''ɛdʒuket','''edjʊkeɪt','[v] 教育,培养','The Ormerod School educates handicapped children.  奥默罗德学校的教育对象为残疾儿童。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1821','sudden','''sʌdn','''sʌd(ə)n','[adj] 突然的,意外的','a sudden change in the weather  天气的突然变化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1822','precipitation','prɪ''sɪpə''teʃən','prɪ,sɪpɪ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 仓促',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1823','sheep','ʃip','ʃiːp','[n] 羊,绵羊','Sheep were grazing on the hillside.  羊群在山坡上吃草。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1824','mercy','''mɝsi','''mɜːsɪ','[n] 仁慈,宽恕,怜悯','He showed no mercy to his enemies.  他对敌人毫不仁慈。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1825','lewis','''lʊɪs','''luːɪs','[n] [机] 吊楔,起重爪',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1826','oceanic','''oʃɪ''ænɪk',',əʊsɪ''ænɪk; -ʃɪ-','[adj] 海洋的','an oceanic island  大洋岛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1827','award','ə''wɔrd','ə''wɔːd','[n] 奖,奖品; [v] 授予,判给','The movie has won a number of awards.  该片获得了多个奖项。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1828','comfortable','''kʌmftəbl','ˈkʌmftəbl','[adj] 舒适的,充裕的','I was so comfortable and warm in bed I didn’t want to get up.  床上又舒服又暖和，我都不想起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1829','sail','sel','seɪl','[v] 航行(于),启航','Three tall ships sailed past.  三艘大船驶了过去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1830','recall','''rikɔl','rɪ''kɔːl','[v] 回忆,记起; [n] 召回','You don’t happen to recall his name, do you?  你不会恰巧还想得起他的名字吧？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1831','publisher','''pʌblɪʃɚ','''pʌblɪʃə','[n] 出版者,发行人','The publishers planned to produce the journal on a weekly basis.  出版社计划将这份杂志做成周刊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1832','seat','sit','siːt','[n] 座位; [v] 使坐下','I was in the back seat and Jo was driving.  我在后座，乔开车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1833','usual','''juʒuəl','''juːʒʊəl','[adj] 平常的,通常的','Make a cheese sauce in the usual way.  按通常的做法做奶酪酱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1834','touch','tʌtʃ','tʌtʃ','[v] 接触,达到','As our glasses touched, he said ‘Cheers!’  我们的酒杯相碰时，他说了声:“干杯！”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1835','boom','buːm','buːm','[n] 繁荣; [v] 发隆隆声,兴隆','The boom has created job opportunities.  经济繁荣创造了就业的机会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1836','administration','əd,mɪnɪ''streʃən','ədmɪnɪ''streɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 管理,经营','We’re looking for someone with experience in administration.  我们正在寻找一个有管理经验的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1837','outflow','''aʊtflo','''aʊtfləʊ','[n] 流出(物)','the outflow valve  外流阀，排放阀'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1838','durable','''dʊrəbl','''djʊərəb(ə)l','[adj] 持久的,耐用的','Wood is a durable material.  木头是耐用材料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1839','undertake',',ʌndɚ''tek','ʌndə''teɪk','[v] 承担,采取','She undertook the task of monitoring the elections.  她承担了监督选举的任务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1840','finance','''faɪnæns','faɪ''næns; fɪ-; ''faɪnæns','[n] 财政; [v] 供给经费,筹措资金','leasing and other forms of business finance  租赁及其他商业金融形式'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1841','seal','sil','sil','[n] 封铅 vt封, 密封','When assembling the pie, wet the edges where the two crusts join, to form a seal.  捏合馅饼时，弄湿两块面皮封合的边缘，以形成一个封口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1842','assumption','ə''sʌmpʃən','ə''sʌm(p)ʃ(ə)n','[n] 假定, 设想','You would be making an assumption that''s not based on any fact that you could report.  你会做出不以你能报道的任何事实为依据的一种假设。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1843','Ohio','əu''haiəu','əu''haiəu','[n] 俄亥俄州(美国州名)','And the next day, he gave a speech in Ohio about faith.  第二天，他还在俄亥俄州做一场关于信仰的演讲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1844','guide','ɡaɪd','gaɪd','[n] 领路人,指南 vt指导, 支配','Follow our step-by-step guide .  跟着我们的分步指南去做。'),
