('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1882','classic','''klæsɪk','''klæsɪk','[adj] 最优秀的,标准的 n杰作','Roy scored a classic goal in the 90th minute.  罗伊在第90分钟时踢进了漂亮的一球。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1883','sum','sʌm','sʌm','[n] 总数,总和; [v] 共计,概括','You will have to pay the sum of the two sets of costs.  你得支付那两笔费用的总和。'),
