('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1901','Germany','''dʒɝməni','''dʒɜːmənɪ','[n] 德国','Germany borders on France.  德国与法国接壤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1902','beautiful','''bjʊtəfəl','''bjuːtɪfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 美丽的','She was even more beautiful than I had remembered.  她比我记忆中更美。'),
