('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1908','artwork','''ɑrt''wɝk','''ɑːtwɜːk','[n] 艺术品,美术品','The museum contains 6,000 contemporary and modern artworks.  该博物馆藏有6000件现当代艺术作品。'),
