('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1919','indium','''ɪndiəm','''ɪndɪəm','[n] [化]铟','Photovoltaic cells rely on amorphous or crystalline silicon, cadmium telluride, or copper indium selenide and sulfide.  光伏电池依赖于非晶态或晶态的硅，碲化镉或者硒化、硫化铜铟。'),
