('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1926','imprint','''ɪmprɪnt','ɪm''prɪnt','[v] 留下烙印','The company carries a variety of binders that can be imprinted with your message or logo.  该公司经营各种可以印上客户所需信息或标识的活页夹。'),
