('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1930','iridium','ɪ''rɪdɪəm','ɪ''rɪdɪəm; aɪ-','[n] [化]铱','Analyzing the fossils at this small site, they counted 52 distinct species just below the iridium layer.  他们分析了这个小地区的化石层，一共计算了在铱层下面的52个不同物种。'),
