('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1959','worldwide','''wɝldwaɪd','''wɜːl(d)waɪd; wɜːl(d)''waɪd','[adj] 全世界的','We have offices in over 56 countries worldwide.  我们在全世界超过56个国家设有办事处。'),
