('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_1994','contract','''kɑntrækt','''kɒntrækt','[n] 合同 v缩小,订合同','Employees who refuse to relocate are in breach of contract (= have done something not allowed by their contracts ) .  员工拒绝调动岗位是违反合约的。'),
