('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2011','attain','ə''ten','ə''teɪn','[v] 达到, 获得','More women are attaining positions of power.  越来越多的女性获得要职。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2012','background','''bækɡraʊnd','''bækgraʊnd','[n] 背景,后台','Students with a background in chemistry will probably find the course easier.  学过化学的学生可能会觉得这门课程容易些。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2013','facilitate','fə''sɪlə''tet','fə''sɪlɪteɪt','[v] 促进, 帮助','The new airport will facilitate the development of tourism.  新机场将促进旅游业的发展。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2014','flexible','''flɛksəbl','''fleksɪb(ə)l','[adj] 易弯曲的,灵活的,柔韧的','We can be flexible about your starting date.  你具体从哪天开始，我们可以灵活一点。'),
