('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2018','shelve','ʃɛlv','ʃelv','[v] 搁置','King County has shelved plans to build a driving range.  金郡已搁置了建造一个高尔夫练习场的计划。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2019','judge','dʒʌdʒ','dʒʌdʒ','[n] 法官,裁判员 v断定,裁决','The trial judge specifies the number of years to be spent in prison.  由主审法官确定刑期。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2020','progressive','prə''ɡrɛsɪv','prə''gresɪv','[adj] 先进的,前进的; [n] 进步分子','a progressive administration  进步的政府'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2021','adjacent','ə''dʒesnt','ə''dʒeɪs(ə)nt','[adj] 邻近的,毗连的','We stayed in adjacent rooms.  我们住在毗连的房间里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2022','unfortunately','ʌn''fɔrtʃənətli','ʌnˈfɔːtʃənətli','[adv] 不幸地, 遗憾地','Unfortunately, you were out when we called.  很遗憾，我们来的时候你出去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2023','participate','pɑr''tɪsə''pet','pɑː''tɪsɪpeɪt','[v] 参与, 参加','Some members refused to participate.  有些会员拒绝参加。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2024','downward','''daʊnwɚd','''daʊnwəd','[adj] 向下的','a gentle downward slope  缓坡'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2025','warbler','''wɔrblɚ','''wɔːblə','[n] 鸣鸟','Mountaintop coal mining in Appalachia clears patches of forest contributing to the decline of birds like the cerulean warbler that breeds and forests in treetops.  在阿巴拉契亚的山顶的煤矿开采导致森林许多小片土地的减少，从而像蓝鹂莺这样的鸟类繁殖减少。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2026','specialization',',spɛʃəlɪ''zeʃən',',speʃəlaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 特殊化, 专门化','industrial specialization  工业的专门化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2027','media','','''miːdɪə','[n] 媒体','The scandal was widely reported in the national media .  这一丑闻在全国媒体上被广泛报道。'),
