('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2042','percentage','pɚ''sɛntɪdʒ','pə''sentɪdʒ','[n] 百分数, 百分率','Interest rates fell by six percentage points (= 6% ) .  利息下降了6个百分点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2043','butter','''bʌtɚ','''bʌtə','[n] 黄油,牛油','He spread some butter on his bread.  他在面包上涂了些黄油。'),
