('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2053','heighten','''haɪtn','''haɪt(ə)n','[v] 提高, 升高','Both factors heighten the danger of a hacker break-in.  这两个因素提高了黑客入侵的危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2054','archaeopteryx','''ɑrkɪ''ɑptɛrɪks',',ɑːkɪ''ɒptərɪks','[n] 始祖鸟(古代生物)',''),
