('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2056','desirable','dɪ''zaɪərəbl','dɪ''zaɪərəb(ə)l','[adj] 值得拥有的,可取的','The ability to speak a foreign language is highly desirable .  能说一门外语是非常理想的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2057','carbonate','''kɑrbənət','''kɑːbəneɪt','[n] 碳酸盐','calcium carbonate  碳酸钙'),
