('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2088','perceptual','pɚ''sɛptʃuəl','pə''septjʊəl','[adj] 感性的,知觉的','Some children have more finely trained perceptual skills than others.  一些孩子比其他孩子具备更为训练有素的感知技能。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2089','plentiful','''plɛntɪfəl','''plentɪfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 丰富的,充裕的','a plentiful supply of food  食物的大量供应'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2090','childhood','''tʃaɪldhʊd','''tʃaɪldhʊd','[n] 孩童时期','I had a very happy childhood.  我的童年很快乐。'),
