('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2109','tire','''taɪɚ','taɪə','[n&v] 疲劳,厌倦','As we neared the summit, we were tiring fast.  接近山顶时，我们感到越来越累了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2110','camel','''kæml','''kæm(ə)l','[n] 骆驼','When fresh food and water are not available,the camel can feed off its hump.  在没有新食物和水供应时，骆驼从它的驼峰中获取能量。'),
