('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2131','graduate','ˈɡrædʒuˌet','ˈɡradʒʊeɪt','[n] 毕业生','a Harvard graduate  哈佛毕业生'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2132','everywhere','''ɛvrɪwɛr','''evrɪweə','[adv] 到处, 无论何处','I’ve looked everywhere but I can’t find the map.  我到处都找过了，但就是找不到地图。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2133','outward','''aʊtwɚd','''aʊtwəd','[adj] 外表(面)的; [adv] 向外','The economy and outward appearance of the area have changed considerably.  该地区的经济和面貌发生了很大的变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2134','succeed','sək''sid','sək''siːd','[v] 成功, 继承, 接着发生','She wanted to be the first woman to climb Mount Qomolangma, and she almost succeeded.  她本想成为第一位登上珠穆朗玛峰的女性，而且差一点就成功了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2135','aware','ə''wɛr','ə''weə','[adj] 意识到,知道的','Mr Braley has been made aware of the need for absolute secrecy.  布雷利先生被告知需要绝对保密。'),
