('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2142','thirty','''θɝti','''θɜːtɪ','[num] 三十','In the thirties, air travel really began to take off.  在30年代，乘飞机旅行迅速流行了起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2143','prize','praɪz','praɪz','[n] 奖(金，品)vt珍视，珍惜','In this month’s competition you could win a prize worth £3,000.  在本月的竞赛中您可以赢得价值3,000英镑的奖品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2144','profitable','''prɑfɪtəbl','''prɒfɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 有益的,有利可图的','The advertising campaign proved very profitable.  事实证明，这次广告宣传活动卓有成效。'),
