('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2149','proper','''prɑpɚ','''prɒpə','[adj] 适当的,正确的','Everything was in its proper place (= where it should be ) .  每样东西都放在恰当的位置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2150','dairy','''dɛri','''deərɪ','[n] 牛奶场,乳品店','In my childhood, local dairies bought milk from local farmers.  在我小时候，本地的乳品公司向当地农场主收购牛奶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2151','phase','fez','feɪz','[n] 阶段,方面','a new drug that is in the experimental phase  处于试验阶段的一种新药'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2152','substantial','səbˈstænʃəl','səb''stænʃ(ə)l','[adj] 可观的,牢固的，实质的','We have the support of a substantial number of parents.  我们有相当多家长的支持。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2153','continually','kən''tɪnjʊəli','kən''tɪnjʊəlɪ','[adv] 不断地，频繁地','The desert continually encroaches on the fertile land.  沙漠在不断地侵蚀肥沃土地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2154','confine','kən''faɪn','kən''faɪn','[v] 限制; [n] 界限','Vaughan is confined to a wheelchair .  沃恩离不开轮椅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2155','calcite','''kælsaɪt','''kælsaɪt','[n] 方解石','His team analysed mud samples from Lough Monreagh in Ireland and discovered layers of white sediment made up of calcite crystals from algae.  他的团队分析了爱尔兰洛蒙雷阿湖泥浆样本，发现了由海藻中方解石晶体构成的白色沉淀物涡旋层。'),
