('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2157','orchestra','''ɔrkɪstrə','''ɔːkɪstrə','[n] 管弦乐队','He directed an orchestra.  他指挥一个管弦乐队。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2158','me','mi','miː','[pron] 我','Stop, you’re hurting me.  住手，你弄疼我了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2159','southward','''sʌðəd','''saʊθwəd','[adj] 向南 a向南的','Instead of her normal southward course towards Alexandria and home, she headed west.  她不走平常向南去亚历山大和家乡的路，而是向西走。'),
