('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2161','proponent','prə''ponənt','prə''pəʊnənt','[n] 支持者，拥护者','Halsey was identified as a leading proponent of the values of progressive education.  哈尔西被认为是进步教育价值观的首要支持者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2162','tip','tɪp','tɪp','[n] 末端,小费 v倾斜','Did you leave a tip ?  你留小费了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2163','partnership','''pɑrtnɚʃɪp','''pɑːtnəʃɪp','[n] 合伙(关系)','It’s one of the most successful partnerships in the country.  它是该国最成功的合伙企业之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2164','gender','''dʒɛndɚ','''dʒendə','[n] 性别,(语法中的)性','people of the same gender  同性别的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2165','republican','rɪ''pʌblɪkən','rɪ''pʌblɪk(ə)n','[a&n] 共和政体的,共和党人(的)','What made you decide to become a Republican, as opposed to a Democrat?  是什么使你决定成为共和党人，而不是民主党人呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2166','strict','strɪkt','strɪkt','[adj] 严格的, 严厉的','a strict teacher  严格的老师'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2167','ichthyosaur','''ɪkθɪə,sɔr','''ɪkθɪəsɔː','[n] 鱼龙','Fossil forensics has now identified the most likely culprit: another ichthyosaur.  化石证据已锁定了最为可能的凶手：另一条鱼龙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2168','India','''ɪndɪə','''ɪndɪə','[n] 印度','Burma borders on India.  缅甸与印度毗邻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2169','niche','niʃ','niːʃ; nɪtʃ','[n] 壁龛,合适的职务(环境、位置等)','Amanda soon found her niche at the club.  阿曼达很快就在俱乐部里找到了一份理想的工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2170','magazine','''mæɡəzin','mægə''ziːn','[n] 杂志, 期刊','a magazine article  杂志中的文章'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2171','logical','''lɑdʒɪkl','''lɒdʒɪk(ə)l','[adj] 符合逻辑的,合理的','It’s a logical site for a new supermarket, with the housing development nearby.  附近有住宅区，新的超级市场选址在此是合情合理的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2172','cavity','''kævəti','''kævɪtɪ','[n] 洞, 空穴','Put herbs inside the body cavity of the fish.  把香草放进鱼肚里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2173','primate','''praɪmet','''praɪmeɪt; -mət','[n] 灵长类(动物)','The woolly spider monkey is the largest primate in the Americas.  绒毛蛛猴是美洲最大的灵长目动物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2174','tribal','''traɪbl','''traɪb(ə)l','[adj] 部落的,种族的','a tribal dance  部落舞蹈'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2175','storytelling','''storɪ,tɛlɪŋ','','[n] 说书, 讲故事','The programme is 90 minutes of dynamic Indian folk dance, live music, and storytelling.  该节目为90 分钟，由动感印度民间舞蹈、现场音乐表演和说书组成。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2176','oven','''ʌvn','''ʌv(ə)n','[n] 烤箱','Preheat the oven to 200 degrees C.  把烤箱预热至200摄氏度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2177','district','''dɪstrɪkt','''dɪstrɪkt','[n] 区域,行政区','a postal district  邮政区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2178','wait','wet','weɪt','[v&n] 等待','Hurry up! Everyone’s waiting.  快点！大家在等着呢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2179','stationary','''steʃənɛri','''steɪʃ(ə)n(ə)rɪ','[adj] 固定的,静止不动的','How did you manage to drive into a stationary vehicle?  你是怎么开车的，竟会撞上一辆停着的车子？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2180','measurement','''mɛʒɚmənt','''meʒəm(ə)nt','[n] 测量法,度量,','accurate measurement of body temperature  体温的精确测量'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2181','pleasure','ˈplɛʒɚ','''pleʒə','[n] 愉快,乐趣','the simple pleasures of life  生活中的简单乐趣'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2182','snowflake','''snoflek','''snəʊfleɪk','[n] 雪花','Star join supports snowflake schema as well.  星型连接也支持雪花模式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2183','swallow','''swɑlo','''swɒləʊ','[n&v] 吞下,咽下','He swallowed the last of his coffee and asked for the bill.  他喝完最后一口咖啡，要求结账。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2184','insufficient',',ɪnsə''fɪʃnt','ɪnsə''fɪʃ(ə)nt','[adj] 不足的','Insufficient resources have been devoted to the health service.  用于医疗保健服务的资源不足。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2185','imagination','ɪ,mædʒɪ''neʃən','ɪ,mædʒɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 想象(力)','a storyteller with an incredible imagination  想象力极丰富的讲故事者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2186','telephone','''tɛlə''fon','''telɪfəʊn','[n] 电话','The telephone rang just as I was leaving.  我正要走，电话铃响了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2187','pterosaur','''tɛrə,sɔr','''terəsɔː','[n] 翼龙','This is huge for a pterosaur.  这对翼龙来说非常巨大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2188','fifteen',',fɪf''tin','fɪf''tiːn; ''fɪftiːn','[num] 十五','a coastal village fifteen miles south of Tourane  土伦以南15英里的一个滨海村落'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2189','bay','','','[n] 海湾','a house with a view across the bay  能看到海湾全景的一幢房子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2190','squeeze','skwiz','skwiːz','[n&v] 压榨, 挤','She smiled as he squeezed her hand.  他捏了捏她的手，她笑了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2191','realist','''riəlɪst','''rɪəlɪst','[n] 现实主义者','She had always been a realist, not a dreamer.  她一向是现实主义者，不是梦想家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2192','pack','pæk','pæk','[v] 捆扎,打包; [n] 包','I forgot to pack my razor.  我忘记把剃须刀放入行李包了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2193','populate','''pɑpjulet','''pɒpjʊleɪt','[v] 构成人口, 居住于','The highlands are populated mainly by peasant farmers.  高原人口主要是农民。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2194','gallery','''gæləri','''gæl(ə)rɪ','[n] 走廊,画廊','The bright modern painting stares out at you in the otherwise conservative gallery.  有些古典派画廊也会陈列出明亮色彩的现代派绘画。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2195','defend','dɪ''fɛnd','dɪ''fend','[v] 防护, 辩护','She was always defending her husband in front of their daughter.  她在女儿面前总是为丈夫辩解。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2196','porous','''pɔrəs','''pɔːrəs','[adj] 多孔渗水的','porous material  渗透性材料'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2197','dot','dɑt','dɒt','[n] 点 vt打点于,点缀','a pattern of dots  圆点图案'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2198','disturb','dɪ''stɝb','dɪ''stɜːb','[v] 打扰,弄乱','Sorry to disturb you, but I have an urgent message.  对不起打扰一下，我有个紧急消息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2199','harbor','''hɑrbɚ','''hɑ:bə','[n] 海港','All the battleships can refresh in this harbor.  所有战舰都能在这个港口装上补充供应品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2200','tract','trækt','trækt','[n] 传单,小册子,大片(土地或森林)','vast tracts of woodland  大片大片的林地'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2201','merely','''mɪrli','''mɪəlɪ','[adv] 仅仅, 只, 不过','He’s merely a boy – you can’t expect him to understand.  他只是个孩子——你不要指望他能理解。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2202','protein','''protin','''prəʊtiːn','[n] 蛋白质','Where do you get your protein?  你从哪里获得蛋白质？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2203','inexpensive',',ɪnɪk''spɛnsɪv','ɪnɪk''spensɪv; ɪnek-','[adj] 廉价的,便宜的','a good selection of inexpensive wines  可供选择的各种价格公道的葡萄酒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2204','equatorial',',ɛkwə''tɔrɪəl',',ekwə''tɔːrɪəl','[adj] (近)赤道的','equatorial rain forests  赤道雨林'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2205','tiredness','','','[n] 疲劳,疲倦','Her arm muscles have knotted with tiredness.  她手臂的肌肉由于疲劳而突出出来。'),
