('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2228','cow','kaʊ','kaʊ','[n] 母牛','a herd of cows  一群牛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2229','terminal','ˈtɜːrmɪnl','''tɜːmɪn(ə)l','[n] 终点(站),终端','the airport’s passenger terminal  机场航站楼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2230','herd','hɝd','hɜːd','[n] 兽群; [v] 使集中，把…赶在一起','Chobe is also renowned for its large herds of elephant and buffalo.  乔贝还以其大群的大象和水牛而闻名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2231','ceremonial',',sɛrɪ''monɪəl','serɪ''məʊnɪəl','[n] 仪式; [adj] 正式的','an occasion for public ceremonial  公共庆典仪式'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2232','piston','''pɪstən','''pɪst(ə)n','[n] 活塞','Filling the cylinder with steam pushes the piston out.  填充汽缸的蒸汽将活塞推出。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2233','tolerate','''tɑləret','''tɒləreɪt','[v] 忍受,容忍','We simply will not tolerate vigilante groups on our streets.  我们决不容许有自行惩办犯罪的组织出现在我们的街头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2234','virtue','''vɝtʃʊ','''vɜːtjuː; -tʃuː','[n] 美德, 贞操','Women have often been used as symbols of virtue.  女性常被用作美德的象征。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2235','icebox','''aɪsbɑks','''aɪsbɒks','[n] 冷藏库',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2236','roost','rust','ruːst','[v& n] 栖息鸟巢','Something disturbed the bird on its roost.  什么东西惊扰了那只栖息的鸟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2237','tropic','''trɑpɪk','''trɒpɪk','[n] 回归线,热带; [adj] 热带的','plant species found in the tropics  见于热带地区的植物物种'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2238','nestle','''nɛsl','''nes(ə)l','[v] 依偎,（舒适地）安顿','Sarah lay there peacefully, the child nestling by her side.  萨拉安静地躺在那儿，孩子偎依在她身边。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2239','tactic','''tæktɪk','''tæktɪk','[n] 策略, 战略','You have probably heard of this tactic before.  你以前也可能听说过这个策略。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2240','contaminate','kən''tæmɪnet','kən''tæmɪneɪt','[v] 弄脏, 污染','Drinking water supplies are believed to have been contaminated.  据信饮用水已受到污染。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2241','Japanese',',dʒæpə''niz','ˌdʒæpə''ni:z','[n&a] 日本人(的), 日语（的）','The Japanese women salute the people with formal bows in welcome.  这些日本妇女以正式的鞠躬向人们施礼以示欢迎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2242','cap','kæp','kæp','[n] 帽子,盖 vt覆盖,胜过','...a dark blue baseball cap.  …一顶深蓝色的棒球帽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2243','carver','','','[n] 雕刻匠','The ivory industry employed about a thousand carvers.  象牙工业雇佣了大约一千个雕刻工。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2244','accomplish','ə''kɑmplɪʃ','ə''kʌmplɪʃ; ə''kɒm-','[v] 完成,实现','We have accomplished all we set out to do.  所有计划要做的事情，我们都已完成。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2245','properly','''prɑpɚli','''prɒp(ə)lɪ','[adv] 适当地；正确地','The brakes don’t seem to be working properly.  刹车似乎不正常。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2246','kohoutek','kə''hu:tek','kə''hu:tek','[n] [天]科胡特克彗星','But comet kohoutek offered astronomers a unique opportunity to make a concerted attack on many of them.  科霍切克慧星为天文学家提供了 一个难得的机会，使他们能同时研究其中的许都问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2247','mere','mɪr','mɪə','[adj] 仅仅的,起码的','She lost the election by a mere 20 votes.  她仅仅以20票之差落选。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2248','immune','ɪ''mjʊn','ɪ''mjuːn','[adj] 免疫的','Once we’ve had the disease, we’re immune for life.  我们一旦得过这种病，就获得了终身免疫力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2249','gill','ɡɪl','gɪl','[n] 鳃,及耳[液量单位]',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2250','disagreement',',dɪsə''ɡrimənt','dɪsə''ɡriːmənt','[n] 不一致；争论','We’ve had a few disagreements , but we’re still good friends.  虽然有过一些分歧，但我们仍是好朋友。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2251','entrepreneur','ˌɑntrəprəˈnɝ​','ˌɒntrəprəˈnɜː(r)','[n] 企业家, 主办人','“You have to be an optimist to be an inventor or entrepreneur, ” he concludes.  要成为一位发明家或企业家，你必须得是个乐天派。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2252','ingredient','ɪn''ɡridɪənt','ɪn''griːdɪənt','[n] 成分, 因素','Combine all the ingredients in a large bowl.  把所有食材都放在一个大碗里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2253','prominent','''prɑmɪnənt','''prɒmɪnənt','[adj] 显著的,杰出的, 突出的','a prominent Russian scientist  杰出的俄罗斯科学家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2254','exploration',',ɛksplə''reʃən','eksplə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 探险, 探测','oil exploration facilities in the North Sea  北海的石油勘探设施'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2255','fashion','''fæʃən','''fæʃ(ə)n','[n] 方式,流行款式; [v] 形成,塑造','Young people are very concerned with fashion  年轻人很关注时尚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2256','alarm','ə''lɑrm','ə''lɑːm','[n] 警报 vt恐吓, 警告','I forgot to set the burglar alarm.  我忘记打开防盗警报器了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2257','husband','''hʌzbənd','''hʌzbənd','[n] 丈夫','Have you met my husband Roy?  你见过我的丈夫罗伊吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2258','proceed','pro''sid','prə''siːd','[v] 进行,继续下去','Before proceeding further, we must define our terms.  我们必须先定义术语，然后再往下展开。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2259','feat','fit','fiːt','[n] 功绩，伟业','A racing car is an extraordinary feat of engineering.  赛车是工程学的一项非凡业绩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2260','angle','''æŋɡl','''æŋg(ə)l','[n] [数]角,角落','You didn’t measure the angle accurately.  你没有量准角度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2261','coordinate','ko''ɔrdɪnet','kəʊ''ɔ:dɪneɪt','[v] 调节，协调','The agencies are working together to co-ordinate policy on food safety.  这些机构在共同合作为食品安全政策做协调工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2262','substitute','''sʌbstɪtut','''sʌbstɪtjuːt','[v] 代替,替换','Michael Owen had to be substituted after 20 minutes on the field.  迈克尔·欧文上场 20 分钟后，不得不被换下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2263','meaningful','''minɪŋfl','''miːnɪŋfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 意味深长的','Sam and Barbara exchanged meaningful glances.  萨姆和芭芭拉交换了会意的眼神。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2264','agrarian','ə''ɡrɛrɪən','ə''greərɪən','[adj] 有关土地的, 耕地的','an agrarian economy (=  based on farming  )  农业经济'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2265','message','''mɛsɪdʒ','''mesɪdʒ','[n] 消息,信息','He left a message saying he would probably be a little late.  他留言说可能会晚一点来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2266','margin','''mɑrdʒən','''mɑːdʒɪn','[n] 边缘,余地,页边空白','Someone had scribbled a note in the margin .  有人在页边写了条批注。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2267','airplane','ˈerpleɪn','''eəpleɪn','[n] 飞机','The airplane cracked up in landing.  这架飞机在着陆时坠毁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2268','utility','ju''tɪləti','juːˈtɪlɪtɪ','[n] 效用,公用','Does your rent include utilities?  你的房租包括公用事业费吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2269','warn','wɔrn','wɔːn','[v] 警告，告诫','‘Be careful, the rocks are slippery,’ Alex warned.  “小心，岩石很滑。”亚历克斯提醒说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2270','motive','''motɪv','''məʊtɪv','[n] 动机，目的','What do you suppose the killer’s motive was?  你认为凶手的动机是什么？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2271','letter','''lɛtɚ','''letə','[n] 信，函件，字母','There are 26 letters in the English alphabet.  英语字母表有26个字母。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2272','contrary','''kɑntrɛri','''kɒntrərɪ','[adj] 相反的; [n] 反面, 相反','Two contrary views emerged.  出现了两种相反的观点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2273','canoes','','','[n] 独木舟','Nearby were two canoes in which they had cine to the island.  附近有二条独木舟，他们就是坐这个独木舟来的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2274','adequate','ˈædɪkwət','''ædɪkwət','[adj] 足够的,适当的','Farmers have been slow to make adequate provision for their retirement.  农民们迟迟没有为退休做好适当安排。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2275','starling','''stɑrlɪŋ','''stɑːlɪŋ','[n] 欧掠鸟',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2276','correspond',',kɔrə''spɑnd','kɒrɪ''spɒnd','[v] 符合,相当','The two halves of the document did not correspond.  这份文件的前后两部分不相符。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2277','fifteenth','''fɪf''tinθ','fɪf''tiːnθ','[num] 第十五','So, initially they came up with four lines and then eventually five and even six, and then they went back to five by the fifteenth century.  那么,他们最初提出的是四条线,但是最终却是五条线,甚至六条线,然后在十五世纪又回到了五条线'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2278','invade','ɪn''ved','ɪn''veɪd','[v] 侵略','The Romans invaded Britain 2,000 years ago.  2,000年前古罗马人入侵了英国。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2279','sensitive','''sɛnsətɪv','''sensɪtɪv','[adj] 敏感的,灵敏的','a very sensitive child  一个很敏感的小孩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2280','humidity','hju''mɪdəti','hjʊ''mɪdɪtɪ','[n] 湿气,潮湿','The room is kept at 72 degrees and 50% relative humidity.  房间的温度保持在72度，相对湿度50%。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2281','additive','''ædətɪv','''ædɪtɪv','[adj] 附加的; [n] 添加剂','As you build these kinds of simulations, or anything like this, you need to think through whether things should be multiplicative or additive.  正如你建立各种仿真程序，或者类似的仿真程序时，你应该去想一想,他们应该是用加法还是用乘法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2282','hope','hop','həʊp','[v&n] 希望,信心','I do hope everything goes well.  我真心希望一切顺利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2283','peripheral','pə''rɪfərəl','pə''rɪf(ə)r(ə)l','[adj] 外围的,不重要的','the city’s peripheral suburbs  这座城市的市郊'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2284','Egypt','''idʒɪpt','ˈiːdʒɪpt','[n] 埃及','They caravaned through Egypt.  他们结队在埃及坐大篷车旅行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2285','steadily','''stɛdəli','''stedɪlɪ','[adv] 稳定地,坚定地','The bus climbed steadily up the road.  公共汽车稳定地沿公路向上爬。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2286','odor','''oʊdə','''əʊdə','[n] 气味','I smelled the odor of money.  我闻到了一股铜臭气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2287','deprive','dɪ''praɪv','dɪ''praɪv','[v] 剥夺,使丧失','They''ve been deprived of the fuel necessary to heat their homes.  他们无法得到住房取暖必需的燃料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2288','shoot','ʃut','ʃuːt','[v] 发射, 开枪','Don’t shoot! I’m coming out with my hands up.  别开枪！ 我现在举起双手出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2289','conquer','''kɑŋkɚ','''kɒŋkə','[v] 征服, 战胜','The Normans conquered England in 1066.  诺曼人于 1066 年征服英格兰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2290','loyalty','''lɔɪəlti','''lɒɪəltɪ','[n] 忠诚','the agony of divided loyalties (= loyalty to two different or opposing people ) for the children in a divorce  父母离婚过程中孩子两面都要依顺的痛苦'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2291','unexpected','''ʌnɪk''spɛktɪd','ʌnɪk''spektɪd; ʌnek-','[adj] 想不到的,意外的','The experiment produced some unexpected results.  这次试验产生了一些意想不到的结果。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2292','eagle','''igl','''iːg(ə)l','[n] 鹰','The eagle drooped its wings.  那只鹰收拢双翅做俯冲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2293','exchanger','','','[n] 交换器, 换热器','The Zurich laboratory has already constructed a prototype that feeds the water from the chips into a heat-exchanger.  苏黎世实验室已经建造了一个模型，把从芯片中流出的水引入一个热交换器。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2294','strictly','''strɪktli','''strɪk(t)lɪ','[adv] 严格地','Alcohol is strictly forbidden on school premises.  校内严禁喝酒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2295','psychodynamic','','','[adj] 精神动力的','In the early 1900s, Sigmund Freud developed the psychodynamic view of human behavior.  早在20世纪的初期，西格蒙德•弗洛伊德就开发了人类行为的精神动力观。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2296','lighthouse','''laɪthaʊs','''laɪthaʊs','[n] 灯塔','Hundreds of moths flew against the lighthouse windows.  数以千计的飞蛾扑向灯塔的窗子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2297','chart','tʃɑrt','tʃɑːt','[n] 图表 vt制图','a chart showing last year’s sales  显示去年销售情况的一份图表'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2298','palm','pɑm','pɑːm','[n] 手掌,掌状物','He held the pebble in the palm of his hand .  他把那颗卵石握在手心里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2299','innovative','''ɪnəvetɪv','''ɪnəvətɪv','[adj] 创新的, 革新的','an innovative approach to language teaching  创新的语言教学法'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2300','impose','ɪm''poz','ɪm''pəʊz','[v] 强加,征收(税款)','Parents should beware of imposing their own tastes on their children.  父母应该提防把自己的兴趣强加给孩子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2301','underlie',',ʌndɚ''laɪ','ʌndə''laɪ','[v] 位于之下, 成为的基础','the one basic principle that underlies all of the party’s policies  贯穿该党各项政策的那一条基本原则'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2302','enemy','''ɛnəmi','''enəmɪ','[n] 敌人','She’s a dangerous enemy to have.  与她为敌很危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2303','expectation',',ɛkspɛk''teʃən','ekspek''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 期待,预料','Having raised expectations (= made people more hopeful ), he went on to help only a few people.  他唤起了大家的希望，但接着只是帮助了几个人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2304','farmland','''fɑrmlænd','''fɑːmlænd','[n] 农田','It is surrounded by 62 acres of farmland.  它被62英亩的农田环绕着。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2305','disperse','dɪ''spɝs','dɪ''spɜːs','[v] 分散, 疏散','Police used tear gas to disperse the crowd.  警察用催泪瓦斯驱散人群。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2306','relic','''rɛlɪk','''relɪk','[n] 遗物, 废墟','Roman relics found in a field  在野外发现的古罗马遗迹'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2307','pile','paɪl','paɪl','[n] 一堆，一叠 v堆积','He balanced the plate on the top of a pile of books.  他把盘子在一摞书上放稳。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2308','smell','smɛl','smel','[n] 气味v嗅, 闻到','What’s that horrible smell?  是什么味道，这么难闻？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2309','management','''mænɪdʒmənt','''mænɪdʒm(ə)nt','[n] 经营,管理,处理','a lack of management skills  缺乏管理技巧'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2310','gallium','''gælɪəm','''gælɪəm','[n] 镓','Production of such nanoscale wires need to be a kind of organic molecules and gallium salt mixture placed in a super-clean silver foil.  制作这种纳米级的金属线需要将一种有机分子和镓盐的混合物置于一个超级干净的银薄片上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2311','lion','''laɪən','''laɪən','[n] 狮子','The wounded lion bellowed out.  受伤的狮子发出了怒吼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2312','suspend','sə''spɛnd','sə''spend','[v] 暂停,悬，挂','Sales of the drug will be suspended until more tests are completed.  这种药品在完成进一步检验之前将暂停销售。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2313','camera','''kæmərə','''kæm(ə)rə','[n] 照相机','Her grandmother lent her a camera for a school trip to Venice and Egypt.  她的祖母借给她一部相机，让她在学校组织的到威尼斯和埃及的旅行中使用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2314','ion','''aɪən','''aɪən','[n] 离子','These vibrations turn the ion into a sort of superfast metronome.  铝离子因为这些振动成为一种超高速节拍器。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2315','ink','ɪŋk','ɪŋk','[n] 墨水','Please write in black ink.  请用黑色墨水书写。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2316','eggshell','''ɛɡʃɛl','''egʃel','[n] 蛋壳, 易碎的东西',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2317','invader','ɪn''vedɚ','ɪn''veɪdə(r)','[n] 侵略者','Invaders ransacked the town.  侵略军洗劫了小镇。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2318','interview','''ɪntɚvju','''ɪntəvjuː','[n] 接见，会见；面谈','a portfolio of work presented at interview  在面试时呈递的工作成果样本'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2319','pigment','''pɪgmənt','''pɪgm(ə)nt','[n] 天然色素,颜料','Melanin is the dark brown pigment of the hair, skin and eyes.  黑色素是头发、皮肤以及眼睛中的深棕色色素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2320','hire','''haɪɚ','''haɪə','[v] ／n租用，雇用','The best way to explore the island is to hire a car.  在该岛寻幽访胜的最好方式就是租用一辆汽车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2321','finger','''fɪŋɡɚ','''fɪŋgə','[n] 手指 v用手指拨弄','The woman had a ring on her finger, so I assumed she was married.  那女人手指上戴着戒指，因此我猜想她已经结婚了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2322','silversmith','''sɪlvɚsmɪθ','''sɪlvəsmɪθ','[n] 银器匠','The son of a Huguenot silversmith, Apollos Rivoire, and Deborah Hitchbourn, Revere received a rudimentary "writing-school" education before turning to his father''s trade.  他是胡格诺派银匠阿波罗·里维尔和黛博拉·赫奇博的儿子，他还没读到他父亲的程度就获得了基本的写作结业证书。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2323','poet','''poət','''pəʊɪt','[n] 诗人','He was a painter and poet.  他是一位画家兼诗人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2324','biome','''baɪom','''baɪəʊm','[n] (生态)生物群系','Covering parts of Bolivia, Paraguay and Argentina, it is a mix of forest, palm woodland, shrubby steppe, and swamp. It is the second largest biome in South America after Amazonia.  该地区横跨玻利维亚、巴拉圭和阿根廷等三个国家，森林、棕榈林地、灌木草原和沼泽相互交错，生物群落规模在南美仅次于亚马逊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2325','darkness','''dɑrknəs','','[n] 黑暗,漆黑','the long hours of darkness during winter  冬季漫长的黑夜'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2326','mount','maʊnt','maʊnt','[v] 登上 n山,峰','Larry was mounting the stairs up into the attic.  拉里正在拾级而上到阁楼去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2327','sodium','''sodɪəm','''səʊdɪəm','[n] [化] 钠','The fish or seafood is heavily salted with pure sodium chloride.  鱼或海产品以厚厚的纯氯化钠盐腌制。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2328','ready','''rɛdi','''redɪ','[adj] 有准备的','Come on. Aren’t you ready yet?  快点，你还没准备好吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2329','Hispanic','hi''spænik','hi''spænik','[adj] 西班牙的','Miami’s Hispanic community  迈阿密的西裔美国人社区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2330','instinct','''ɪnstɪŋkt','''ɪnstɪŋ(k)t','[n] 本能','Her instinct told her that something was wrong.  直觉告诉她有些不对劲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2331','reformer','rɪ''fɔrmɚ','rɪ''fɔːmə','[n] 改革家, 改革运动者','a great social reformer  伟大的社会改革家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2332','minimize','''mɪnɪmaɪz','ˈmɪnɪˌmaɪz','[v] 将减到最少','Click on the top of the window to minimize it.  点击窗口的顶端使其最小化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2333','Mississippian',',mɪsə''sɪpɪən',',misi''sipiən','[adj] 密西西比河的 n密西西比州人','Cahokia was one of the great centers of Mississippian culture and its largest settlement of Missippian.  卡霍基亚是密西西比文化最大的一个中心，也是密西西比最大的一个居住区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2334','browse','braʊz','braʊz','[v&n] 浏览, 放牧','a feature that allows you to browse your hard drive and choose the graphic you want to display  让你可以浏览硬盘驱动器选择自己想要显示的图像的一个功能'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2335','southwest',',saʊθ''wɛst',',saʊθ''west','[n] 西南方(的)','...some 500 kilometres to the southwest of Johannesburg.  …约翰内斯堡西南约五百公里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2336','convex','''kɑnvɛks','''kɒnveks','[adj] 凸出的','a convex lens  凸透镜'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2337','magma','''mæɡmə','''mægmə','[n] 岩浆, 糊剂','The volcano threw new showers of magma and ash into the air.  这座火山向空气中喷发了新的岩浆和火山灰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2338','intention','ɪn''tɛnʃən','ɪn''tenʃ(ə)n','[n] 意图, 目的','They went into town with the intention of visiting the library.  他们进了城，打算参观图书馆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2339','wash','wɑːʃ','wɒʃ','[n&v] 洗,洗涤','This shirt needs washing.  这件衬衫该洗洗了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2340','trader','''tredɚ','''treɪdə','[n] 商人','Market traders display an exotic selection of the island''s produce.  市场商家们展示了该岛具有异国情调的农产品系列。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2341','injury','''ɪndʒəri','''ɪn(d)ʒ(ə)rɪ','[n] 伤害,侮辱','She was taken to hospital with serious head injuries.  她头部受重伤被送到医院。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2342','sight','saɪt','saɪt','[n] 视力, 视域','Anne’s sight is very good for someone of her age.  安妮的视力对于她这个年龄的人来说算是非常好的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2343','meeting','''mitɪŋ','''miːtɪŋ','[n] 会议','We’re having a meeting next week to discuss the matter.  我们下周将开会讨论此事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2344','fault','fɔlt','fɔːlt; fɒlt','[n] 过错; [v] 挑剔,弄错','I’m really sorry - it’s all my fault.  我真的很抱歉——都是我的错。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2345','address','ə''drɛs','ə''dres','[n] 地址,演说 vt写地址,演说','The address is 2025 M Street, NW, Washington, DC, 20036.  地址是华盛顿哥伦比亚特区，华盛顿西北，M街2025号，邮编20036。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2346','saturate','''sætʃərɪt','''sætʃəreɪt','[v] 使湿透,饱和','Water poured through the hole, saturating the carpet.  水从洞里流进来，浸湿了地毯。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2347','terrace','ˈterəs','''terəs','[n] 平台,阳台; [v] 使成梯形地','Both a staircase and a lift connect the two floors with an enclosed terrace on the roof.  通过一道楼梯和一台电梯连接两层楼和封闭的屋顶平台。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2348','secret','''sikrɪt','''siːkrɪt','[n&a] 秘密(的)','I can’t tell you. It’s a secret .  我不能告诉你，这是个秘密。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2349','swamp','swɑmp','swɒmp','[n] 沼泽,湿地','I spent one whole night by a swamp behind the road listening to frogs.  我整个晚上都在这条路后面的一个沼泽地旁听蛙鸣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2350','inclusion','ɪn''kluʒn','ɪn''kluːʒ(ə)n','[n] 包含','With the recent inclusions, there will be 28 delegates in all.  连同新近加入的成员，总共将有28位代表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2351','navigation','''nævə''geʃən','nævɪ''geɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 航海,航行','compasses and other instruments of navigation  罗盘及其他导航仪器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2352','sheer','ʃɪr','ʃɪə','[a&ad] 十足的，陡峭的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2353','cadmium','''kædmɪəm','''kædmɪəm','[n] [化]镉','Some microbes like nothing better than to be nestled in a toxic sludge of heavy metals like zinc, arsenic and cadmium.  对于一些微生物而言，没有什么比生活在充满了锌、砷和镉之类的重金属的有毒淤泥中更加惬意的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2354','banker','''bæŋkɚ','''bæŋkə','[n] 银行家','...an investment banker.  …一位投资银行家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2355','designate','''dɛzɪɡnet','''dezɪgneɪt','[v] 指明,指定','Some of the rooms were designated as offices.  其中一些房间是被指定用作办公室的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2356','abstract','''æbstrækt','''æbstrækt','[n] 摘要,抽象','Talking about crime in the abstract just isn’t enough.  抽象地谈论犯罪根本不足以说明问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2357','assessment','ə''sɛsmənt','ə''sesmənt','[n] 估计；评估','a reading assessment test  阅读评估测试'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2358','dominance','''dɔmɪnəns','''dɒmɪnəns','[n] 支配,优势','The latest fighting appears to be an attempt by each group to establish dominance over the other.  最近的战斗似乎是冲突各方在试图争夺控制权。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2359','anger','''æŋɡɚ','''æŋgə','[n] 怒; [v] 恼火','There is growing anger among the people against the government.  民众对政府越来越不满。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2360','drum','drʌm','drʌm','[n] 鼓','a big bass drum  一面低音大鼓'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2361','horticulture','''hɔrtɪ''kʌltʃɚ','''hɔːtɪ,kʌltʃə','[n] 园艺','The area has a long tradition of horticulture.  园艺是这个地区源远流长的传统。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2362','compress','kəm''prɛs','kəm''pres','[v] 压缩,摘要叙述','Light silk is best for parachutes, as it compresses well and then expands rapidly.  轻质丝绸最适合制作降落伞，因为这种面料便于压缩，而且展开迅速。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2363','constitution','''kɑnstə''tʊʃən','kɒnstɪ''tjuːʃ(ə)n','[n] 宪法,章程','The right to speak freely is written into the Constitution of the United States.  言论自由的权利被写入美国宪法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2364','cone','kon','kəʊn','[n] 圆锥体；','...orange traffic cones.  …橙色的交通锥形警示标。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2365','fade','fed','feɪd','[v] 褪去，褪色','the fading evening light  渐暗的暮色'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2366','lifestyle','''laɪfstaɪl','''laɪfstaɪl','[n] 生活方式','Regular exercise is part of a healthy lifestyle.  经常锻炼身体是健康生活方式的一部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2367','patent','''pætnt','''pæt(ə)nt; ''peɪt(ə)nt','[n&a] 专利(权)(的)','He wants to take out a patent on his new type of dustbin.  他想为他的新型垃圾桶取得专利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2368','invest','ɪn''vɛst','ɪn''vest','[v] 投资，投入','I’ve got a few thousand dollars I’m looking to invest.  我有几千美元想作投资。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2369','lord','lɔrd','lɔːd','[n] 封建领主,君主','the feudal lords  封建领主'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2370','debt','dɛt','det','[n] 债务','He had enough money to pay off his outstanding debts.  他有足够的钱偿还亏欠的债务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2371','dispersal','dɪ''spɝsl','dɪ''spɜːsl','[n] 散布,传播,分散','the role of birds in the dispersal of seeds  鸟类对传播种子的作用'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2372','residential',',rɛzɪ''dɛnʃl','rezɪ''denʃ(ə)l','[adj] 住宅的, 居住的','a quiet residential neighbourhood  安静的住宅区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2373','Indiana',',indi''ænə',',indi''ænə','[n] 印地安那州','I own a coffee shop in Southern Indiana. I have a room in the back where I spend most of the week.  我在南印第安纳州开了间咖啡屋，咖啡屋后面还有间屋子，我就在那度过一周的大部分时间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2374','mild','maɪld','maɪld','[adj] 温和的, 轻微的,适度的','We had an exceptionally mild winter last year.  去年冬天我们这里异常暖和。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2375','tectonic','tɛk''tɑnɪk','tek''tɒnɪk','[adj] 构造的, 建筑的','tectonic movements  地壳构造运动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2376','firn','fɪrn','''fɪən','[n] 粒雪, 积雪','Snowslide, The Flow of snow in wind, firn, it is snow Disaster in alp.  雪崩、风吹雪及厚层积雪，是高山和严寒地区特有的一种自然灾害。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2377','adulthood','''ædʌlthʊd','''ædʌlthʊd','[n] 成人期','Few people nowadays are able to maintain friendships into adulthood.  现今很少有人能够把友谊维持到成年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2378','consciously','''kɑnʃəsli','''kɔnʃəsli','[adv] 有意识地, 自觉地','They do not consciously think of themselves as a class.  他们并不有意识地把自己当作一个阶层来看待。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2379','advocate','ˈædvəkeɪt；-et','''ædvəkeɪt；-ət','[v] 提倡,鼓吹','Extremists were openly advocating violence.  极端主义者公开鼓吹使用暴力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2380','sixteen',',sɪks''tin','sɪks''tiːn; ''sɪkstiːn','[num] 十六','sixteen years later  16年后'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2381','supernatural',',supɚ''nætʃrəl',',suːpə''nætʃ(ə)r(ə)l; ,sjuː-','[a&n] 超自然(的), 神奇(的)','belief in the supernatural  相信超自然力量'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2382','nomadism','''nəumædizəm, ''nɔ-','''nəʊmædɪzəm','[n] 游牧,流浪','In particular, it will usher in a new version of a very old idea: nomadism.  尤为重要的是，它预示了“游牧生活”这一古老概念的全新版本。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2383','catastrophe','kə''tæstrəfi','kə''tæstrəfɪ','[n] 大灾难','From all points of view, war would be a catastrophe.  从各个方面来看，战争都会是一场灾难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2384','selenium','sə''linɪəm','sɪ''liːnɪəm','[n] [化]硒','We’d normally get minerals such as selenium and copper from plants.  我们通常从植物中获取矿物质比如硒和铜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2385','poem','''poəm','''pəʊɪm','[n] 诗','...a book of love poems.  …一本爱情诗集。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2386','ballet','bæ''le','''bæleɪ; -lɪ','[n] 芭蕾(舞)','We’re going to the ballet tomorrow evening.  我们明天晚上要去看芭蕾舞演出。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2387','unhappy','ʌn''hæpi','ʌn''hæpɪ','[adj] 不幸的, 不快乐的','If you’re so unhappy, why don’t you change jobs?  你要是那么不开心，为什么不换个工作呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2388','Bantu','bæn''tu:','bæn''tu:','[n] 班图人, 班图语','Americans, they like soft corn, and the Bantu, we like hard corn.  而班图人喜欢硬质玉米。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2389','ratio','''reʃɪo','''reɪʃɪəʊ','[n] 比, 比率','The adult to child ratio is one to six.  成人与儿童之比是1比6。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2390','noise','nɔɪz','nɒɪz','[n] 喧闹声, 噪声','What’s that noise?  那是什么声音？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2391','inadequate','ɪn''ædɪkwət','ɪn''ædɪkwət','[adj] 不充分的,不适当的','inadequate resources  资源缺乏'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2392','strategy','''strætədʒi','ˈstrætədʒɪ','[n] 策略','the government’s long-term economic strategy  政府的长期经济策略'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2393','geothermal',',dʒio''θɝml','dʒiːə(ʊ)''θɜːm(ə)l','[adj] 地热的','a geothermal energy plant  地热能工厂'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2394','reclaim','rɪ''klem','rɪ''kleɪm','[v] 要回,开垦,回收','You may be entitled to reclaim some tax.  你也许可以享受一定额度的退税。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2395','restoration','''rɛstə''reʃən','restə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 恢复, 归还','You have control over the restoration of objects.  您还可以控制对象的恢复。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2396','eddy','''ɛdi','''edɪ','[n] 旋转,漩涡','The racing river caused swirling eddies.  湍急的河水形成了许多漩涡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2397','wherever','wɛr''ɛvɚ','weər''evə','[conj] 无论在哪里; [adv] 无论什么地方','Start now, from wherever you are. Do that, and trust me, the resources will show up.  从现在开始，无论你在那里，照上面的做，相信我，丰富的资源即将展现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2398','legislation',',lɛdʒɪs''leʃən','ledʒɪs''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 立法,法律的制定(或通过)','This is a very important piece of legislation (= law ).  这是一条非常重要的法规。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2399','welfare','''wɛl''fɛr','''welfeə','[n] 福利','Our only concern is the children’s welfare.  我们唯一关心的是孩子们的幸福。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2400','telecommuting','''tɛlɪkə,mjʊtɪŋ','''telɪkə,mjuːtɪŋ','[n] 远程联机,  远程办公','There is also the potential to develop telecommuting and other more flexible working practices.  也有发展家庭远程办公及其他更灵活的工作方式的可能性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2401','crowd','kraʊd','kraʊd','[n] 人群 v拥挤','A vast crowd gathered in the main square.  主广场上聚集了一大群人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2402','presumably','prɪ''zuməbli','prɪ''zjuːməblɪ','[adv] 大概,可能,据推测','It’s raining, which presumably means that your football match will be cancelled.  下雨了，这可能意味着你们的足球比赛要取消。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2403','metabolism','mɛ''tæbəlɪzəm','mɪ''tæbəlɪz(ə)m','[n] 新陈代谢','This drug speeds up your metabolism.  这种药物会加快你的新陈代谢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2404','transplant','træns''plænt','træns''plɑːnt; trɑːns-; -nz-','[v] 移栽,移植 n(器官)移植','The operation to transplant a kidney is now fairly routine.  移植肾脏的手术如今相当常见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2405','repress','rɪ''prɛs','rɪ''pres','[v] 抑制，镇压','He had long ago repressed the painful memories of his childhood.  他长久压抑着儿时的痛苦记忆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2406','subway','''sʌbwe','''sʌbweɪ','[n] 地铁, 地下通道','the New York City subway  纽约市的地铁'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2407','geographical','dʒɪə''græfɪkl','dʒɪə''græfɪk(ə)l','[adj] 地理(学)的','their geographical proximity to Japan (= nearness to Japan )  它们和日本相邻的地理位置'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2408','pride','praɪd','praɪd','[n] 自豪','He wore his medals with pride.  他自豪地戴着奖章。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2409','refrigerator','rɪ''frɪdʒəretɚ','rɪ''frɪdʒəreɪtə','[n] 电冰箱','My refrigerator suddenly started kicking up yesterday.  我的冰箱昨晚突然出了故障。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2410','fir','fɝ','fɜː','[n] [植]冷杉','a fir tree  冷杉树'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2411','reserve','rɪ''zɝv','rɪ''zɜːv','[v] 储备,保留','reserved parking spaces  预留的停车位'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2412','court','kɔrt','kɔːt','[n] 法庭，庭院','It could not be proved in a court of law.  这无法在法庭上证实。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2413','superorganism',',sju:pə''rɔ:ɡənizəm',',sjuːpə''rɔːɡənɪzəm','[n] [生]超个体(指群居昆虫等的群体)','In fact, the superorganism scenario is in a sense just the cosmic flip side of the diagnosis offered by Carr and other techno-skeptics.  事实上，在卡尔和其他科技怀疑论者的诊断里，超个体的假设在某种意义上只不过是宇宙的反面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2414','calculation',',kælkju''leʃən','kælkjʊ''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 计算,考虑','Leonard made a rapid calculation: he''d never make it in time.  伦纳德做了个快速的估算：他不可能及时做完。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2415','rational','''ræʃnəl','''ræʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 理性的,合理的','Parents need to be fully informed so they can make a rational decision.  父母需要充分了解情况，这样才可以作出合理的决定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2416','criterion','kraɪˈtɪriən','kraɪ''tɪərɪən','[n] 标准','the criteria we use to select candidates  我们挑选候选人的标准'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2417','linen','''lɪnɪn','''lɪnɪn','[n] 亚麻布（制品）','a linen jacket  亚麻布夹克'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2418','Harlem','''hɑləm','''hɑləm','[n] (纽约的）黑人住宅区','It was winter, and I was in Harlem.  这是一个冬天，我是在黑人住宅区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2419','orleans','','','[n] 奥尔良[法国]',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2420','orientation','orɪɛn''teʃən',',ɔːrɪən''teɪʃ(ə)n; ,ɒr-','[n] 方向，目标','The party has a broadly socialist orientation.  该政党大体上倾向于社会主义。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2421','foster','''fɔstɚ','''fɒstə','[v] 收养；培养，促进','The bishop helped foster the sense of a community embracing all classes.  主教鼓励一种包容各个阶层的社区精神。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2422','inevitable','ɪn''ɛvɪtəbl','ɪn''evɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 不可避免的, 必然的','A further escalation of the crisis now seems inevitable.  危机的进一步升级现在看来已不可避免。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2423','controversial',',kɑntrə''vɝʃl','kɒntrə''vɜːʃ(ə)l','[adj] 有争议的,引起争论的','the controversial issue of welfare reform  福利改革这一有争议的话题'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2424','dream','drim','driːm','[v] 做梦 n梦,梦想','She had been dreaming and had not followed the conversation.  她一直在走神，没注意听谈话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2425','geographic',',dʒiə''ɡræfɪk',',dʒɪə''græfɪk','[adj] 地理(学)的','User community and geographic distribution of users.  用户社区和用户的地理分布。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2426','projector','prə''dʒɛktɚ','prə''dʒektə','[n] 放映机','...a slide projector.  …幻灯机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2427','peepshow','''pi:pʃəu','','[n] 西洋镜','The cinema did not emerge as a form of mass consumption until its technology evolved from the initial "peepshow" format to the point where images were projected on a screen in a darkened treater.  直到科技发展使得最初的西洋镜形式到如今可以在漆黑的戏院里投放大屏幕的戏剧，电影才第一次得以成为一种大众消费品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2428','anemone','ə''nɛməni','ə''nemənɪ','[n] [植]银莲花, [动]海葵','In the spring all everything around the place is covered with primroses. At the moment wood anemone is abloom.  春天来了，这里周围的一切都被樱草花淹没，而此刻银莲花正在愉快的盛放。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2429','handedness','''hændɪdnɪs','''hændɪdnɪs','[n] 用右手或左手的习惯','An important factor that the researchers took note of was the participants'' handedness.  研究人员考察的一个重要因素是参与者的用手习惯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2430','harmony','''hɑrməni','''hɑːmənɪ','[n] 协调,融洽','I do believe it is possible for different ethnic groups to live together in harmony.  我确信不同民族的人民可以融洽相处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2431','nut','nʌt','nʌt','[n] 坚果','a pine nut  松子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2432','billfish','''bɪl,fɪʃ','''bɪlfɪʃ','[n] 长嘴鱼,尖嘴鱼',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2433','identical','aɪ''dɛntɪkl','aɪ''dentɪk(ə)l','[adj] 同一的,相同的','four identical houses  四幢一模一样的房子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2434','mutual','''mjutʃuəl','''mjuːtʃʊəl; -tjʊəl','[adj] 相互的,共有的','I didn’t like Dev, and the feeling seemed to be mutual.  我不喜欢德夫，他好像也不喜欢我。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2435','regularity','ˌrɛɡjəˈlærətɪ','reɡjʊ''lærətɪ','[n] 规律性,规则性','Climate change is disrupting the regularity of the seasons.  气候的变化正在打乱季节的规律性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2436','realization',',riələ''zeʃən','riːəlaɪ''zeɪʃn','[n] 实现','the realization of assets  资产变现'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2437','plow','plaʊ','plau','[v] 耕, 犁','He teamed one horse and one cow to a plow.  他把一匹马和一头牛套在犁上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2438','minimum','''mɪnɪməm','''mɪnɪməm','[adj] 最小的; [n] 最小值,','The minimum number of students we need to run the course is fifteen.  我们开这门课程最少要有15个学生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2439','truly','ˈtruːli','''truːlɪ','[adv] 真正地；忠实地','His work is truly original.  他的作品确实十分独特。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2440','figurine',',fɪɡjə''rin','''fɪgəriːn; -gjʊ-','[n] 小雕像','Michelle and her mother once gave me a figurine of a beautiful black child sitting in a wheelchair.  米歇尔和她的母亲曾经送给我一座小雕像，是一个坐在轮椅上的漂亮黑人小孩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2441','polygon','''pɑlɪɡɑn','''pɒlɪg(ə)n','[n] [数]多角形,多边形','The color is used for the area covered by a (multi-)polygon or the line of a (multi-)linestring.  颜色用于显示一个（多）多边形所覆盖的区域或一个（多）行字符串的行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2442','hypothesize','haɪ''pɑθəsaɪz','haɪ''pɒθɪsaɪz','[v] 假设,猜测','To explain this, they hypothesize that galaxies must contain a great deal of missing matter which cannot be detected.  为了解释这一点，他们假定银河系一定包含了大量无法探测到的不明物质。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2443','depletion','dɪ''pliʃən','dɪ''pliːʃn','[n] 损耗','Overfishing not only causes depletion in individual fish stocks, but also disruption to entire ecosystems and food webs in the ocean.  过度捕捞不仅引起个别鱼种的消耗，而且还引起海洋中整个生态系统和食物网的崩溃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2444','request','rɪ''kwɛst','rɪ''kwest','[v] 请求, 要求','To request more information, please call our toll free number.  欲知详情，请拨打我们的免费电话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2445','conservation',',kɑnsɚ''veʃən','kɒnsə''veɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 保存,保持','wildlife conservation  野生生物保护'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2446','ammonia','ə''monɪə','ə''məʊnɪə','[n] [化]氨, 氨水','Dilute the ammonia with water before you use it.  使用氨之前用水稀释它。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2447','beringia','','','[n] 白令海和楚可奇海海域',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2448','violent','''vaɪələnt','''vaɪəl(ə)nt','[adj] 猛烈的,暴力的','the increase in violent crime  暴力犯罪的增多'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2449','arrival','ə''raɪvəl','ə''raɪv(ə)l','[n] 到来, 到达','Only the timely arrival of the police prevented the situation from becoming worse.  警方及时赶到才阻止了事态恶化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2450','sedimentation',',sɛdɪmɛn''teʃən',',sedɪmən''teɪʃən','[n] 沉淀,沉降','Scientists estimate that human activities—such as pollution, global warming, and sedimentation—could kill 30 percent of reefs in the next three decades.  科学家估计人类活动--例如污染、全球变暖和沉淀--会在接下来的三十年间杀死30%的暗礁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2451','rectangular','rɛk''tæŋgjəlɚ','rek''tæŋgjʊlə','[adj] 长方形的，矩形的','...a rectangular table.  …一张长方形的桌子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2452','agency','''edʒənsi','''eɪdʒ(ə)nsɪ','[n] 代理处, 中介','We had to hire maids through an agency.  我们得通过代理公司雇用女佣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2453','questionnaire','ˌkwɛstʃənˈɛr','ˌkwestʃəˈneə(r)','[n] 调查表, 问卷','Teachers will be asked to fill in a questionnaire.  教师们将被要求填写一份调查问卷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2454','temple','''tɛmpl','ˈtempl','[n] 庙, 寺','They lighted the temple with many candles.  他们用许多蜡烛照亮这个寺庙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2455','remote','rɪ''mot','rɪ''məʊt','[adj] 遥远的, 偏僻的','a remote border town  一个偏远的边境小镇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2456','asphalt','''æsfɔlt','''æsfælt; -əlt','[n] 沥青','These comprise asphalt, tar and waxes.  其中包括沥青，焦油和蜡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2457','evergreen','''ɛvɚɡrin','''evəgriːn','[n] 常绿树; [adj] 常绿的','Holly, like ivy and mistletoe, is an evergreen.  冬青与常春藤和槲寄生一样，也是一种常绿植物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2458','lizard','''lɪzɚd','''lɪzəd','[n] [动]蜥蜴','Neither the lizard nor the glass has any secrets.  无论是蜥蜴还是玻璃，都没有任何秘密。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2459','ornament','''ɔrnəmənt','''ɔːnəm(ə)nt','[n&vt] 装饰(品),美化','a shelf covered with books and ornaments  摆满书籍和装饰品的架子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2460','parental','pə''rɛntl','pə''rentl','[adj] 父母的','parental responsibility  父母的责任'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2461','illumination','ɪ''lʊmə''neʃən','ɪ,ljuːmɪ''neɪʃən','[n] 阐明, 启发','The only illumination came from a small window high in the opposite wall.  惟一的照明来自对面墙上位于高处的一扇小窗户。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2462','healthy','''hɛlθi','''helθɪ','[adj] 健康的','a healthy baby boy  健康的男婴'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2463','simplify','''sɪmplɪfaɪ','''sɪmplɪfaɪ','[v] 单一化,简单化','an attempt to simplify the tax system  简化税制的尝试'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2464','equator','ɪ''kwetɚ','ɪ''kweɪtə','[n] 赤道','The United States is north of the equator.  美国位于赤道以北。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2465','advertiser','''ædvɚtaɪzɚ','''ædvə,taizə','[n] 登广告者,广告客户','the Stockport Advertiser  《斯托克波特广告报》'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2466','persian','','','[n] 波斯人[语]',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2467','neonate','''nionet','''niːə(ʊ)neɪt','[n] 初生婴儿','“Full, unabashed, total irradiation of a neonate,” Dr. Sclafani said, adding, “This poor, defenseless baby.  “对初生婴儿过量的毫不在乎的辐射，”Sclafani医生说，又接着说，“这些可怜的毫无防护能力的婴儿。”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2468','genius','''dʒinjəs','''dʒiːnɪəs','[n] 天才, 天赋','The film reveals Fellini’s genius.  这部影片展现了费里尼的天赋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2469','caterpillar','''kætɚpɪlɚ','''kætəpɪlə','[n] 毛虫','A caterpillar transforms into a butterfly.  毛虫变成了蝴蝶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2470','drainage','''drenɪdʒ','''dreɪnɪdʒ','[n] 排水系统,下水道','A handful of pebbles in the bottom of a flowerpot will help drainage.  在花盆底下放一把鹅卵石能够帮助排水。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2471','criticism','''krɪtə''sɪzəm','''krɪtɪsɪz(ə)m','[n] 批评, 批判','Despite strong criticism , the new system is still in place.  尽管遭到了猛烈的批评，新制度依然原封不动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2472','impress','ɪm''prɛs','ɪm''pres','[v] 印,留下印象','Steve borrowed his dad’s sports car to impress his girlfriend.  史蒂夫借来他爸爸的跑车向女友炫耀。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2473','smile','smaɪl','smaɪl','[vi&n] 微笑','her smiling face  她的笑脸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2474','silk','sɪlk','sɪlk','[n] 丝绸','pure silk stockings  生丝面料的漂亮连衣裙'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2475','friction','''frɪkʃən','''frɪkʃ(ə)n','[n] 摩擦,摩擦力','Putting oil on both surfaces reduces friction.  两面都上油可减小摩擦力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2476','excess','''ɛk''sɛs','ɪk''ses; ek-; ''ekses','[n&a] 过量(的)','After you apply the oil, wait 20 minutes before wiping off any excess.  涂上油以后，等20分钟再擦掉多余部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2477','zinc','zɪŋk','zɪŋk','[n] 锌','Copper and zinc are fused to make brass.  铜与锌熔合后形成黄铜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2478','vulnerable','''vʌlnərəbl','''vʌln(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 易受伤的，脆弱的','He took advantage of me when I was at my most vulnerable.  他在我最脆弱的时候利用了我。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2479','proposal','prə''pozl','prə''pəʊz(ə)l','[n] 提议,建议','The president is to put forward new proposals for resolving the country''s constitutional crisis.  总统将提出解决国家宪法危机的新议案。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2480','effectively','ɪ''fɛktɪvli','ɪ''fektɪvlɪ','[adv] 有效地','Children have to learn to communicate effectively.  小孩子应该学会有效地沟通。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2481','flee','fli','fliː','[v] 逃避,逃跑,消失','His attackers turned and fled.  袭击他的人转身逃走了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2482','wartime','''wɔrtaɪm','''wɔːtaɪm','[n] 战时','The government will commandeer ships only in wartime.  政府只在战争时期征用船只。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2483','Euphrates','','ju:''freiti:z','[n] 幼发拉底河','These grew up in the world''s great fertile river valleys, the Euphrates, the Tigris and the Indus, but I want to start with the most famous river of them all, the Nile.  最早期的城市与国家崛起于世界上伟大的肥沃河谷里，幼发拉底河、底格里斯河、印度河等等，然而我想从这所有河流中最著名的尼罗河开始。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2484','gypsum','''dʒɪpsəm','''dʒɪpsəm','[n] 石膏,','Their mouths were full of gypsum.  他们的嘴里叼满了石膏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2485','objective','əb''dʒɛktɪv','əb''dʒektɪv','[n] 目标,目的a客观的','He vowed to achieve certain objectives before the end of his presidency.  他立誓要在他的总统任期结束之前实现某些目标。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2486','inspiration','ˌɪnspəˈreʃən','ˌɪnspəˈreɪʃn','[n] 灵感','The Malvern Hills have provided inspiration for many artists and musicians over the decades.  几十年来，莫尔文丘陵为很多艺术家和音乐家提供了灵感。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2487','shrine','ʃraɪn','ʃraɪn','[n] 圣地, 神龛','Elvis’ home has become a shrine for his fans.  猫王的故居成了歌迷的朝圣地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2488','meltwater','''mɛlt,wɔtɚ','''meltwɔːtə(r)','[n] 冰雪融化成的水','No one quite knows why glaciers and ice shelves are melting so fast, or how a meltwater lake on the Greenland ice sheet covering six square kilometres could drain away in 24 hours, as it did in 2006.  没有人非常了解为什么冰架这么迅速的融化，也没人知道格林兰冰架上的一个覆盖6平方千米的融水湖会在24小时内流干——这在2006确实发生了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2489','sector','''sɛktɚ','''sektə','[n] 部分, 部门','...the nation''s manufacturing sector.  …该国的制造部门。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2490','bulb','bʌlb','bʌlb','[n] 鳞茎,球形物','tulip bulbs  郁金香球茎'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2491','trillion','''trɪljən','''trɪljən','[num] 万亿','In a short time the number of cells is more than a trillion.  不久细胞的数量就超过了一万亿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2492','isolation',',aɪsə''leʃən','aɪsə''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 隔离，孤立','Because of its geographical isolation, the area developed its own unique culture.  由于地理上的隔绝，该地区发展了自己独特的文化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2493','frontality','','','[n] 正面描绘',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2494','Tasmania','','tæz''meiniə; -njə','[n] 塔斯马尼亚岛, 塔斯马尼亚州(澳大利亚州名)','The next partial eclipse of the sun will occur on Nov. 25, 2011, but it will only be visible from Antarctica, Tasmania, New Zealand and southern South Africa.  下一次的太阳日偏食将发生在2011年11月25日，但它只能从南极洲、塔斯马尼亚岛、新西兰和南非的南部可以见到。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2495','Latin','''lætn','''lætɪn','[n&a] 拉丁文,拉丁语(的)','He is well grounded in Latin.  他拉丁语的功底很扎实。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2496','abroad','ə''brɔd','ə''brɔːd','[adv] 到国外,在国外','I’ve never lived abroad before.  我以前从未在国外生活过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2497','burgess','''bɝdʒɪs','''bɜːdʒɪs','[n] (英国)市民，镇民',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2498','split','splɪt','splɪt','[v] 分裂；撕裂 n裂口','It was feared that the issue would split the church.  人们担心这一问题会导致教会分裂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2499','alternate','''ɔltɚnət','''ɔːltəneɪt; ''ɒl-','[v] 交替, 轮流','Her aggressive moods alternated with gentle or more cooperative states.  她的挑衅情绪与温和或更为合作的情绪互相交替。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2500','guarantee',',ɡærən''ti','gær(ə)n''tiː','[n] 保证(书)vt保证, 担保','They offer a two-year guarantee on all their electrical goods.  他们所有的电器产品都有两年的保修期。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2501','manganese',',mæŋɡə''niz','''mæŋgəniːz','[n] n〈化〉锰',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2502','ultimately','''ʌltɪmətli','''ʌltɪmətlɪ','[adv] 最后，最终','Ultimately, the decision rests with the child’s parents.  最终，决定权在这孩子的父母手中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2503','strange','strendʒ','streɪn(d)ʒ','[adj] 陌生的,奇怪的','strange noises  奇怪的噪声'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2504','journey','''dʒɝni','''dʒɜːnɪ','[n] 旅行','the friends they made on the journey  他们在旅途中交下的朋友'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2505','igneous','''ɪgnɪəs','''ɪgnɪəs','[adj] (指岩石)火成的, 火的','The Great Dyke of Zimbabwe is a layered mafic intrusion of igneous, metal-bearing rock that has been dated to approximately 2.5 billion years old.  津巴布韦大堤是一个分层的火成岩，金属镁铁质侵入岩轴承已追溯到大约2.5亿年的历史。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2506','Zealand','''zilənd','''zi:lənd','[n] 西兰岛(丹麦最大的岛)','Unfortunately, we know that one effect of climate change in New Zealand will be more extreme weather like this.  遗憾的是，我们知道，气候变化在新西兰的影响之一是会有更多像这样的极端天气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2507','gaseous','''ɡæsɪəs','''gæsɪəs; ''geɪsɪəs','[adj] 气体的,气态的','Freon exists both in liquid and gaseous states.  氟利昂既有液态也有气态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2508','buck','','bʌk','[n] (一)美元；雄鹿(兔)','That would probably cost you about fifty bucks.  那可能会花费你大约五十美元。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2509','enrich','ɪn''rɪtʃ','ɪn''rɪtʃ; en-','[v] 充实,使富裕','Add fertilizer to enrich the soil.  施上肥料使土壤肥沃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2510','metropolis','mə''trɑpəlɪs','mɪ''trɒp(ə)lɪs','[n] 首都,大城市','The city has become a huge, bustling metropolis.  这座城市已变成繁忙的大都市。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2511','botanical','bə''tænɪkl','bə''tænɪkl','[adj] 植物(学)的','The area is of great botanical interest.  该地区很有植物学研究价值。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2512','wife','wʌɪf','wʌɪf','[n] 妻子','Have you met my wife?  你见过我的妻子吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2513','urge','ɝdʒ','''ɜːdʒ','[v] 鼓励；强烈要求; [n] 强烈的欲望','The charity urged quick action.  慈善机构敦促迅速采取行动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2514','lomas','','','[n] 洛马斯(阿根廷东部的一城镇)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2515','deform','dɪ''fɔrm','dɪ''fɔːm','[v] (使)变形','Wearing badly-fitting shoes can deform your feet.  穿不合脚的鞋会使脚变形。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2516','safe','sef','seɪf','[adj] 安全的; [n] 保险箱','She doesn’t feel safe in the house on her own.  她独自一人在家感到不安全。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2517','confederacy','kən''fɛdərəsi','kən''fed(ə)rəsɪ','[n] 联盟,邦联','They''ve entered this new confederacy because the central government''s been unable to control the collapsing economy.  他们已经参加了这个新同盟，因为中央政府已经不能控制摇摇欲坠的经济了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2518','spite','spaɪt','spaɪt','[n] (in ～ of)不顾,不管','We went out in spite of the rain.  尽管下着雨，我们还是出去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2519','fertilize','''fɝtəlaɪz','''fɜːtɪlaɪz','[v] 使肥沃；使多产','The faeces contain nitrogen which fertilizes the soil.  排泄物含有肥沃土壤的氮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2520','withstand','wɪð''stænd','wɪð''stænd','[v] 抵挡, 经受住','The Chancellor has withstood the criticism and held firm.  总理顶住批评，坚持立场。'),
