('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2736','inform','ɪn''fɔrm','ɪn''fɔːm','[v] 通知, 告诉','They decided to inform the police.  他们决定通知警察。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2737','chiefly','''tʃifli','''tʃiːflɪ','[adv] 首要,主要地','The work consists chiefly of interviewing the public.  这份工作主要是采访公众。'),
