('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2741','intelligence','ɪn''tɛlɪdʒəns','ɪn''telɪdʒ(ə)ns','[n] 智力, 聪明','To be good at the game, you need a reasonable level of intelligence.  要想把这种游戏玩好，需要一定的智力水平。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2742','visitor','''vɪzɪtɚ','''vɪzɪtə','[n] 访问者, 来宾','Times Square attracts more than 30 million visitors annually.  时代广场每年吸引三千多万游客。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2743','unskilled',',ʌn''skɪld','ʌn''skɪld','[adj] 不熟练的,拙劣的','companies employing unskilled labour  雇用非熟练工的公司'),
