('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2745','thickness','ˈθɪknɪs','''θɪknɪs','[n] 厚度, 浓度, 稠密','The thickness of the walls is 5 feet.  墙体厚度为5英尺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2746','graphic','''græfɪk','''græfɪk','[adj] 绘画似的, 图解的','a graphic artist  平面造型艺术家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2747','termite','''tɝmaɪt','''tɜːmaɪt','[n] 白蚁','A German man and woman, their faces in close-up, talked about the good and essential symbiotic nature of termite mounds, with subtitles.  一个德国男人和女人的脸部特写镜头，他们在谈论白蚁堆美好而必要的共栖性特质，带字幕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2748','analogy','ə''nælədʒi','ə''nælədʒɪ','[n] 类似, 类推','The analogy between music and fragrance has stuck.  音乐与香味的类比已经深入人心了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2749','sure','ʃʊər; ʃʊr','ʃɔ:(r)','[adj] 对有把握 ad的确, 当然','‘That’s Sarah’s cousin.’ ‘Are you sure?’  “那是萨拉的表妹。”“你肯定吗？”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2750','wrap','ræp','ræp','[v] 包，裹 n披肩，围巾','I’ve still got a few Christmas presents to wrap up.  我还有一些圣诞礼物要包起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2751','inability',',ɪnə''bɪləti','ɪnə''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 无能, 无力','Her inability to concentrate could cause an accident.  她无法集中注意力可能会导致意外。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2752','jump','dʒʌmp','dʒʌmp','[n&v] 跳跃','The cats jumped down and came to meet us.  这些猫跳下来，过来迎接我们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2753','consciousness','''kɑnʃəsnəs','''kɒnʃəsnɪs','[n] 意识；觉悟,知觉','The painful memories eventually faded from her consciousness.  那些痛苦的回忆最终从她的意识中淡去了。'),
