('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2757','compression','kəm''prɛʃən','kəm''preʃ(ə)n','[n] 浓缩, 压缩','The following example shows how to create partition table with compression.  下面的例子展示如何创建采用压缩的分区表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2758','slush','slʌʃ','slʌʃ','[n] 烂泥 v溅湿','Front-drive cars work better in the snow and slush.  前轮驱动的汽车在雪中和雪泥中开得更好。'),
