('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2761','repression','rɪ''prɛʃən','rɪ''preʃən','[n] 镇压, 抑制','{"COLLOINEXA":["sexual repression"]}  性压抑'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2762','recovery','rɪ''kʌvəri','rɪ''kʌv(ə)rɪ','[n] 恢复, 痊愈','Hopes of economic recovery are fading.  经济复苏的希望越来越渺茫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2763','father','''fɑðɚ','''fɑːðə','[n] 父亲','Ask your father to help you.  叫你父亲帮你。'),
