('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2765','horn','hɔrn','hɔːn','[n] 触角; [v] 强行介入','A mature cow has horns.  成年母牛头上长有角。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2766','phonograph','''fonəɡræf','''fəʊnəgrɑːf','[n] 留声机, 电唱机','Edison is credited with the invention of the phonograph.  留声机的发明应归功于爱迪生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2767','accustom','ə''kʌstəm','ə''kʌstəm','[v] 使习惯于','She tried to accustom herself to the tight bandages.  她尝试着使自己习惯那些紧绷的绷带。'),
