('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2769','Eurasia','juə''reiʃə','juə''reiʃə','[n] 欧亚大陆','The lake is the largest spawning ground for red salmon in Eurasia and the best place for bears.  这个湖泊是欧亚大陆上最大的，红三文鱼的产卵场所。 也是野熊最爱呆的地方。'),
