('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2774','cobalt','''kobɔlt','''kəʊbɔːlt; -ɒlt','[n] [化]钴','...a country rich in copper, cobalt, and diamonds.  ...一个铜、钴和钻石资源丰富的国家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2775','wish','wɪʃ','wɪʃ','[n] 愿望v希望, 想要','She was sincere and genuine in her wish to make amends for the past.  她诚恳而真心地希望弥补过去的错误。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2776','wale','wel','weɪl','[n] 条痕',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2777','accident','''æksədənt','''æksɪdənt','[n] 意外事件, 事故','Over 70,000 people are seriously injured every year in road accidents.  每年在道路事故中受重伤的有七万多人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2778','tongue','tʌŋ','tʌŋ','[n] 舌头','Joe ran his tongue over his dry lips.  乔舔了舔干燥的嘴唇。'),
