('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2780','uncommon','ʌn''kɑmən','ʌn''kɒmən','[adj] 不凡的, 难得的','Violent crimes against the elderly are fortunately very uncommon.  幸好针对老年人的暴力犯罪非常罕见。'),
