('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2789','intricate','''ɪntrɪkət','''ɪntrɪkət','[adj] 复杂的,难懂的','intricate patterns  繁复的图案'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2790','coarse','kɔrs','kɔːs','[adj] 粗糙的,粗俗的','a jacket of coarse wool  粗羊毛夹克衫'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2791','feedback','''fidbæk','''fiːdbæk','[n] 反馈, 反应','How can I provide feedback without making someone angry?  我怎样才能提出反馈意见又不会得罪人呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2792','cure','kjʊr','kjʊə; kjɔː','[n&v] 治愈, 治疗','The new treatment effected a miraculous cure.  这种新疗法产生了奇迹般的疗效。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2793','Norway','''nɔrweɪ','''nɔ:weɪ','[n] 挪威(北欧国家)','Sweden borders Norway and Finland.  瑞典与挪威、芬兰接壤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2794','encouragement','ɪn''kɝɪdʒmənt','ɪn''kʌrɪdʒm(ə)nt','[n] 鼓励, 奖励','With encouragement, Sally is starting to play with the other children.  萨莉受到了鼓励，开始和其他孩子玩起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2795','chew','tʃʊ','tʃuː','[v] 咀爵','This meat’s so tough I can hardly chew it!  这肉太老了，我几乎嚼不动！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2796','bombard','bɑm''bɑrd','bɒm''bɑːd','[v] 炮轰；轰击','I had been in action, bombarding the Normandy coast.  我参加过轰炸诺曼底海岸的行动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2797','praise','prez','preɪz','[v&n] 赞扬,称赞','Jane was praised by her teacher.  简受到了老师的表扬。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2798','editor','''ɛdɪtɚ','''edɪtə','[n] 编辑,编者','the editor of a book of essays on modern poetry  现代诗歌论文集的编者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2799','venture','''vɛntʃɚ','''ventʃə','[n&v] 冒险','When darkness fell, he would venture out.  天黑以后，他就会壮着胆子出去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2800','soluble','''sɑljəbl','''sɒljʊb(ə)l','[adj] 可溶的, 可溶解的','soluble aspirin  可溶性阿司匹林'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2801','Oceania',',oʃɪ''ænɪə',',əʊsɪ''ɑːnɪə; -ʃɪ-','[n] 大洋洲','The Mummies Of The World exhibition brings together a collection of mummies and related artefacts from South America, Europe, Asia, Oceania and Egypt.  汇集了来自南美，欧洲，亚洲，大洋洲和埃及的一系列干尸和艺术品将举办全球巡回展览。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2802','temporary','''tɛmpə''rɛri','''temp(ə)rərɪ','[adj] 暂时的, 临时的,','temporary pain relief  疼痛的暂时缓解'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2803','election','ɪ''lɛkʃən','ɪ''lekʃ(ə)n','[n] 选举','The Labour Party won the 2001 election by a huge majority.  工党在2001年选举中以巨大优势获胜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2804','backbone','''bæk''bon','''bækbəʊn','[n] 脊梁骨；支柱','You might be taking drastic measures and you''ve got to have the backbone to do that.  你可能在采取极端措施，而且你得有骨气做它。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2805','medical','''mɛdɪkl','''medɪk(ə)l','[adj] 医学的，医疗的','medical research  医学研究'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2806','orderly','''ɔrdɚli','''ɔːd(ə)lɪ','[adj] 整齐的，有秩序的','She needs to organize her ideas in a more orderly way.  她需要把自己的想法组织得更有条理些。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2807','chemist','''kɛmɪst','''kemɪst','[n] 化学家, 药剂师','She worked as a research chemist.  她是一名化学研究员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2808','trample','''træmpl','''træmp(ə)l','[v] 践踏, 轻视','They say loggers are destroying rain forests and trampling on the rights of natives.  他们说伐木工正在破坏雨林，无视当地人的权利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2809','mountainous','''maʊntənəs','''maʊntɪnəs','[adj] 多山的, 巨大的','the mountainous coast of Wales  威尔士多山的海岸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2810','removal','rɪ''muvl','rɪ''muːv(ə)l','[n] 除去，移动','stain removal  去污'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2811','potassium','pə''tæsɪəm','pə''tæsɪəm','[n] 钾','I let the silver nitrate react with pieces of brain hardened in potassium dichromate.  我让已被重铬酸钾硬化的一些脑组织细胞与硝酸银反应。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2812','cascade','kæ''sked','kæs''keɪd','[n] 小瀑布','The firework went off in a cascade of colour.  烟火散开像一片五彩缤纷的瀑布。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2813','reconstruction',',rikən''strʌkʃən','riːkən''strʌkʃn','[n] 重建, 改造','...America''s part in the postwar reconstruction of Germany.  …美国在战后德国重建中扮演的角色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2814','restless','''rɛstləs','ˈrestləs','[adj] 得不到休息的, 不安宁的','After a few weeks in Marseille, I grew restless and decided to move on.  在马赛住了几星期后，我开始待不住了，决定换个地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2815','accordingly','ə''kɔrdɪŋli','ə''kɔːdɪŋlɪ','[adv] 因此, 相应地, 于是','Katherine still considered him a child and treated him accordingly.  凯瑟琳仍旧把他当作小孩子，像对待小孩子一样对他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2816','silicate','''sɪlɪket','''sɪlɪkeɪt; -kət','[n] 硅酸盐','Beryl is a beryllium-aluminum silicate, and its color comes from small amounts of chromium.  绿宝石其实是一种铍铝硅酸盐，而它的颜色则来自于微量的铬元素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2817','locomotive',',lokə''motɪv','ləʊkə''məʊtɪv','[n] 机车, 火车头',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2818','predominant','prɪ''dɑmənənt','prɪ''dɒmɪnənt','[adj] 主要的,占优势的','the predominant group in society  社会中的主导群体'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2819','boil','bɔɪl','bɒɪl','[n] 沸点 v煮沸, 激动','Add the seasoning and bring the sauce to the boil .  加入调味料，把酱汁煮开。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2820','saturn','''sætɝn','''sæt(ə)n','[n] 土星',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2821','groove','ɡruv','gruːv','[n] 沟，槽','The bolt slid easily into the groove.  插销顺畅地滑入凹槽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2822','assert','ə''sɝt','ə''sɜːt','[v] 断言, 声称','French cooking, she asserted, is the best in the world.  她坚称法国菜是世界上最好的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2823','journeyman','''dʒɝnɪmən','''dʒɜːnɪmən','[n] 熟练工人','The choice was to be a journeyman developer or become a manager, and I''ve never wanted to be a manager -- at least not a manager who went for an MBA and had ambitions to be a captain of industry.  我的选择就是要做一个技术熟练的开发人员还是成为一名经理，而我从来没有想要成为一名经理--至少没想成为一名拥有 MBA 学位并立志成为业内领军人的经理。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2824','chondrule','''kɑndrʊl','''kɒndruːl','[n] 陨石球粒',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2825','accessible','ək''sɛsəbl','ək''sesɪb(ə)l','[adj] 可得到的,易接近的','The island is only accessible by boat.  这个岛只有坐船才能到。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2826','dimension','dɪ''mɛnʃ(ə)n; daɪ-','dɪ''menʃ(ə)n; daɪ-','[n] 尺寸, 尺度','a rectangle with the dimensions 5cm × 2cm  长五厘米、宽两厘米的长方形'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2827','bacterial','bæk''tɪrɪəl','bæk''tɪərɪəl','[adj] 细菌的','Cholera is a bacterial infection.  霍乱是一种由细菌引起的感染。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2828','medicine','''mɛdsn','''meds(ə)n; ''medɪsɪn','[n] 药','Medicines should be kept out of the reach of children.  药应放在孩子够不到的地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2829','homo','''homo','''həʊməʊ','[n] 人, 同性恋者',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2830','nose','noz','nəʊz','[n] 鼻','Someone punched him on the nose.  有人一拳打在他的鼻子上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2831','incubation',',ɪŋkju''beʃən','ɪŋkjʊ''beɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 孵化, 熟虑','Resourcing incubation has to be a part of planning – otherwise the natural tendency is to suck up all the resources for the critical activity of the day.  为孵化项目分配资源必须是计划的一部分，否则所有的资源都会被日常紧要事务所占用，这是自然的趋势。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2832','northeastern',',nɔrθ''istɚn',',nɔ:θ''i:stən','[adj] 东北方的, 在东北的','the northeastern states of the US  美国东北部各州'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2833','waterway','''wɔtɚwe','''wɔːtəweɪ','[n] 水路, 排水沟',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2834','excavation',',ɛkskə''veʃən','ekskə''veɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 挖掘, 发掘','A second excavation, in 1985, lasted a year and was cut short for technical reasons.  第二次挖掘是在1985年，因为技术原因持续了一年就突然停止了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2835','fraction','''frækʃən','''frækʃ(ə)n','[n] 小部分, 片断','The students had a grasp of decimals, percentages and fractions.  学生们掌握了小数、百分数和分数。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2836','mutualism','ˈmjuːtʃʊəˌlɪzəm','''mjuːtʃʊəlɪz(ə)m; -tjʊə-','[n] 互助论,互利共生','The acacia and its ant army are a textbook example of mutualism between species.  洋槐树和它的蚂蚁亲卫队是物种之间互利共生关系的经典范例。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2837','weaken','''wikən','''wiːk(ə)n','[v] 削弱, (使)变弱','Over the last two years the president’s position has weakened.  过去两年来，总统的地位被削弱了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2838','wolf','wʊlf','wʊlf','[n] 狼','a pack of wolves  一群狼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2839','bore','bɔr','bɔː','[v] 使厌烦 n令人讨厌的人(或事)','He’s the sort of person who bores you at parties.  他这人会在派对上烦你。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2840','probe','prob','prəʊb','[v] 探查, 查明','Police probed claims that he had sold drugs.  警方就有人称他贩卖毒品一事进行了调查。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2841','smoke','smok','sməʊk','[v] 抽烟, 吸烟','I don’t smoke and I don’t drink much.  我不吸烟，酒也喝得不多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2842','capillary','''kæpəlɛri','kə''pɪlərɪ','[n&a] 毛细管；毛状的','When air cools at night, dew collects on the lizard’s skin and is pulled to its mouth by capillary action.  待晚间空气温度下降，凝结在蜥蜴皮肤上的露珠就可以通过毛细管作用输送到它的口中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2843','behavioral','bɪ''hevjərəl','bi''heivjərəl','[adj] 行为的','It helps point out some of the behavioral barriers you have in making better food choices.  而且当你在选择更好的食物的时候它也可以帮助你指出一些行为障碍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2844','pleasant','''plɛznt','''plez(ə)nt','[adj] 令人愉快的,舒适的','It had been a pleasant evening.  那是个愉快的夜晚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2845','thread','θrɛd','θred','[n] 线(索),思路 vt穿(过)，通过','I’m looking for a needle and thread.  我在找针线。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2846','subsequently','''sʌbsɪkwəntli','''sʌbsɪkwəntlɪ','[adj] 其次，接着',''),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2847','intact','ɪn''tækt','ɪn''tækt','[adj] 完好无缺的, 未经触碰的','Only the medieval tower had remained intact.  只有这座中世纪塔楼保存完好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2848','blacksmith','''blæksmɪθ','''blæksmɪθ','[n] 锻工, 铁匠','In my youth my father bound me to a blacksmith.  在我年轻时我父亲立契让我给一名铁匠当学徒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2849','repair','rɪ''pɛr','rɪ''peə','[n] 修理 vt修理(补)','The church tower is in need of repair .  教堂的塔楼需要修缮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2850','electronic','ɪˌlekˈtrɑːnɪk','ɪˌlekˈtrɒnɪk','[adj] 电子的','electronic games  电子游戏'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2851','specify','''spɛsɪfaɪ','''spesɪfaɪ','[v] 指定, 详细说明','Payments will be made for a specified number of months.  款项将在规定的几个月内支付。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2852','besides','bɪ''saɪdz','bɪ''saɪdz','[prep] 除之外; [adv] 此外, 也','I need the money. And besides, when I agree to do something, I do it.  我需要这笔钱，而且，我一旦答应做什么事情就会做到。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2853','platform','''plæt''fɔrm','''plætfɔːm','[n] 站台, 讲台','The Edinburgh train will depart from platform six.  开往爱丁堡的火车将从六号站台发车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2854','surrounding','sə''raʊndɪŋ','sə''raʊndɪŋ','[n] 围绕物,环境 a周围的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2855','tobacco','tə''bæko','tə''bækəʊ','[n] 烟草(制品)','...Cuba''s tobacco crop.  …古巴的烟草作物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2856','rival','''raɪvl','''raɪvl','[v] 竞争,对抗',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2857','agreement','ə''grimənt','ə''griːm(ə)nt','[n] 同意, 一致','It is easier for two parties to reach agreement than for three.  两方达成一致比三方达成一致容易。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2858','custom','''kʌstəm','''kʌstəm','[n] 习惯, 风俗,','He awoke early, as was his custom.  他很早醒来，这是他的习惯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2859','costly','''kɔstli','''kɒs(t)lɪ','[adj] 昂贵的，代价高的','Such a database would be extremely costly to set up.  建立这样一个数据库要花很多钱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2860','exert','ɪɡ''zɝt','ɪg''zɜːt; eg-','[v] 尽(力),发挥','He exerted considerable influence on the thinking of the scientific community on these issues.  他对科学界在这些问题上的思考施加了相当大的影响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2861','director','dɪˈrɛktɚ; daɪˈrɛktɚ','dɪ''rektə; daɪ-','[n] 主管,导演','"Cut!" the director yelled. "That was perfect."  “停！”导演叫道。“太好了！”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2862','gift','ɡɪft','gɪft','[n] 赠品, 天赋','As a youth he discovered a gift for teaching.  年轻的时候他就发现了自己教书的天赋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2863','repeatedly','rɪ''pitɪdli','rɪ''piːtɪdlɪ','[adv] 重复地, 再三地','Both men have repeatedly denied the allegations.  两个人都再三地否认这些指控。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2864','tentacle','''tɛntəkl','''tentək(ə)l','[n] (动物)触角','Free speech is being gradually eroded year after year by new tentacles of government control.  言论自由正被政府控制的新触角逐渐侵蚀。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2865','fertility','fɚ''tɪləti','fə''tɪlɪtɪ; fɜː''tɪlɪtɪ','[n] 肥沃, 多产',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2866','simplicity','sɪm''plɪsəti','sɪm''plɪsɪtɪ','[n] 简单, 朴素','Mona wrote with a beautiful simplicity of style.  莫娜的文笔朴实优美。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2867','annually','''ænjuəli','''ænjʊəlɪ; ''ænjʊlɪ','[adv] 每年；按年计算','This is a perennating rhizome from which flowering shoots arise annually.  这是一种每年发芽开花的多年生根茎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2868','enthusiasm','ɪn''θuzɪæzəm','ɪn''θjuːzɪæz(ə)m; en-','[n] 热情, 热衷','Gillian and Darren greeted the speakers with great enthusiasm.  吉利恩和达伦非常热情地接待了演讲者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2869','rear','rɪr','rɪə','[n& a] 后部(面，方)(的) vt养，种','He settled back in the rear of the taxi.  他在出租车后座，往后靠着坐好了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2870','stagecoach','''stedʒkotʃ','''steɪdʒkəʊtʃ','[n] 公共马车','The Pony Express was much faster than the stagecoach.  驿马快信要比当时的公共马车快多了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2871','attraction','ə''trækʃən','ə''trækʃ(ə)n','[n] 吸引(力)；具有吸引力的事物(或人)','The attraction between them was almost immediate.  他们几乎是一见钟情。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2872','investigate','ɪn''vɛstɪɡet','ɪn''vestɪgeɪt','[v] 调查, 研究','The state police are investigating the incident.  州警察正调查此事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2873','locally','''lokəli','''ləʊkəlɪ','[adv] 在本地, 地方性地, 局部地','I live locally, so it’s easy to get to the office.  我就住在附近，所以上班很方便。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2874','excessive','ɪkˈsɛsɪv','ɪk''sesɪv; ek-','[adj] 过多的,过分的','his excessive drinking  他的酗酒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2875','adjustment','ə''dʒʌstmənt','ə''dʒʌs(t)m(ə)nt','[n] 调整, 调节','a period of adjustment  一段调整期'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2876','figurative','''fɪgərətɪv','''fɪg(ə)rətɪv; -gjʊ-','[adj] 比喻的，借喻的','He’s my son, in the figurative sense of the word.  打个比方，他就像是我的儿子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2877','inscription','ɪn''skrɪpʃən','ɪn''skrɪpʃ(ə)n','[n] 题字, 碑铭','a Latin inscription on the memorial stone  纪念碑上的拉丁语碑文'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2878','appalachian',',æpə''leitʃjən','','[adj] 阿帕拉契山脉的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2879','declaration',',dɛklə''reʃən','deklə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 宣布, 声明','a ceasefire declaration  停火声明'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2880','markedly','''ma:kidli','''mɑːkɪdlɪ','[adv] 显著地,明显地','Bankers say that they have got tougher but they have still tightened lending standards less markedly than their counterparts in the euro area as a whole.  银行业主说他们已经紧缩了信用，但是整体上他们对借贷标准的收紧并没有像欧洲其他地区的同行那样明显。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2881','attend','ə''tɛnd','ə''tend','[v] 出席, 参加,照料','Only 12 people attended the meeting.  只有12个人出席了会议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2882','climb','klaɪm','klaɪm','[v] 攀登, 爬','Harry climbed the stairs.  哈里爬上楼梯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2883','effectiveness','ə''fɛktɪvnɪs','ɪ''fektɪvnɪs','[n] 效力','Sometimes you have to sacrifice efficiency for effectiveness.  有时候你需要牺牲效率来达到效果。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2884','grant','ɡrænt','grɑːnt','[v] 授予,同意，准予','Britain could grant Spain’s request .  英国可能会同意西班牙的请求。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2885','optical','''ɑptɪkl','''ɒptɪk(ə)l','[adj] 视觉的, 光学的','microscopes and other optical instruments  显微镜和其他光学仪器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2886','overcast',',ovɚ''kæst','''əʊvəkɑːst','[v] 遮盖,变暗; [n] 覆盖, 阴天','Tomorrow will be overcast.  明天是阴天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2887','noisy','''nɔɪzi','''nɒɪzɪ','[adj] 吵杂的, 聒噪的','The kids have been really noisy today.  孩子们今天实在是吵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2888','muscular','''mʌskjəlɚ','''mʌskjʊlə','[adj] 肌肉发达的，强壮的','She was fast and strong, with a slender, muscular body.  她动作敏捷，身体强壮，身材苗条，肌肉结实。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2889','remarkably','rɪ''mɑkəblɪ','rɪ''mɑːkəblɪ','[adv] 非凡地；显著地','Remarkably, all of the passengers survived the crash.  令人称奇的是，这次事故中所有乘客都幸免于难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2890','team','tim','tiːm','[n] 队, 组','Which team do you support?  你支持哪个队？'),
