('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2908','notion','''noʃən','''nəʊʃ(ə)n','[n] 概念,观念,想法','She had no notion what he meant.  她根本不明白他是什么意思。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2909','reshape','riˈʃep','ˌri:''ʃeɪp','[v] 改造, 再成形','If they succeed, then they will have reshaped the political and economic map of the world.  如果他们获得成功，他们将会改变世界的政治和经济格局。'),
