('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2914','fundamentally',',fʌndə''mɛntəli','fʌndə''mentəlɪ','[adv] 从根本上, 基本地','The conclusions of the report are fundamentally wrong .  这份报告的结论从根本上来说就是错误的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2915','unprecedented','ʌn''prɛsɪdɛntɪd','ʌn''presɪdentɪd','[adj] 空前的, 前所未有的','He took the unprecedented step of stating that the rumours were false.  他史无前例地声明那些谣言实属子虚乌有。'),
