('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2946','examination','ɪg''zæmə''neʃən','ɪg,zæmɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n; eg-','[n] 考试, 检查, 细查','The examination results will be announced in September.  考试成绩将于9月公布。'),
