('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2958','propagate','''prɑpə''get','''prɒpəgeɪt','[v] 繁(增)殖；传播','The group launched a website to propagate its ideas .  这个团体建了一个网站来宣扬他们的主张。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2959','confusion','kən''fjʊʒən','kən''fjuːʒ(ə)n','[n] 混乱, 混淆','To avoid confusion, the teams wore different colours.  为了避免混淆，各队穿着不同颜色的服装。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2960','celebrate','''sɛlɪbret','''selɪbreɪt','[v] 庆祝, 祝贺','It’s Dad’s birthday and we’re going out for a meal to celebrate.  今天是爸爸的生日，我们打算出去吃饭庆祝一下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2961','environmentalist','ɪn,vaɪrən''mɛntəlɪst','ɪn,vaɪrən''ment(ə)lɪst; en-','[n] 环境保护论者, 环境论者, 环境论信奉者',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2962','outstanding','''aʊt''stændɪŋ','aʊt''stændɪŋ','[adj] 优秀的, 突出的,','an outstanding example of a 13th-century castle  13世纪城堡的杰出典范'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2963','endogenous','ɛn''dɑdʒənəs','en''dɒdʒɪnəs; ɪn-','[adj] 内生的, 内成的','endogenous rhythms'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2964','horseshoe','''hɔrʃʃu','''hɔːsʃuː; -ʃʃ-','[n] 马蹄铁','The smith forged the horseshoe with great skill.  那铁匠非常熟练地锻造马蹄铁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2965','probability','''prɑbə''bɪləti','prɒbə''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 可能性','You must decide whether, on the balance of probabilities , he committed the crime.  你们一定要权衡正反两方面的可能性，然后再裁定他是否犯罪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2966','boy','bɔɪ','bɒɪ','[n] 男孩','The boys wanted to play football.  男孩子们想踢足球。'),
