('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2968','vote','vot; voʊt','vəʊt','[n&v] 投票','In 1918 British women got the right to vote.  1918年，英国妇女获得了选举权。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2969','susceptible','sə''sɛptəbl','sə''septɪb(ə)l','[adj] 易受外界影响的,易受感染的','A lot of TV advertising is aimed at susceptible young children.  很多电视广告瞄准了易受影响的幼儿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2970','envision','ɪn''vɪʒn','ɪnˈvɪʒn','[v] 想象；预想','I envisioned a future of educational excellence.  我展望了一个有着优质教育的未来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2971','upside','''ʌpsaɪd','''ʌpsaɪd','[n] 上边,上部',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2972','adept','ə''dɛpt','ə''dept; ''ædept','[adj] 熟练的, 老练的 n老手, 擅长者','I’m afraid she’s also an adept liar.  恐怕她还是一个撒谎专家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2973','notation','no''teʃən','nəʊ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 符号','Musical notation was conceived for the C major scale and each line and space represents a note in this scale.  乐谱为C大音阶而构思，在这个音阶中的每一个线和间都代表一个音符。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2974','ease','iz','iːz','[n] 安逸','You always look ill at ease in a suit.  你穿套装看上去总有些不自在。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2975','capsize','''kæpsaɪz','kæp''saɪz','[v] (特指船)倾覆','The sea got very rough and the boat capsized.  海的风浪变得很大，船翻了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2976','elicit','ɪ''lɪsɪt','ɪ''lɪsɪt','[v] 得出, 引出, 抽出, 引起','Mr. Norris said he was hopeful that his request would elicit a positive response.  诺里斯先生说他希望他的要求会引起积极的回应。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2977','financier',',fɪnən''sɪr','faɪ''nænsɪə; fɪ-','[n] 财政家, 金融家','The Connells were leading financiers of the Democratic Party in Congress.  康奈尔家族是民主党在国会中的主要出资方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2978','obscure','əb''skjʊr','əb''skjʊə','[adj] 暗的 vt使暗,使不明显','The contracts are written in obscure language.  那些合同是用复杂难懂的语言写的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2979','turbulent','''tɝbjələnt','''tɜːbjʊl(ə)nt','[adj] 狂暴的,动荡的','the turbulent times of the French Revolution  法国大革命的动荡时期'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2980','simultaneously','saɪməl''tenɪəsli',',sɪml''teɪnɪəslɪ','[adv] 同时地','The image below is an example of showing an image and some text simultaneously.  下面的图像是同时显示图像和一些文本的示例。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2981','rodent','''rodnt','''rəʊd(ə)nt','[n] 啮齿类动物','This is an actual monster, some sort of rodent-like creature with a dinosaur beak.  这真的是怪兽，有点像啮齿动物，但长着恐龙一样的嘴巴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2982','prose','proz','prəʊz','[n] 散文','Shute''s prose is stark and chillingly unsentimental.  舒特的散文刻板而冷峻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2983','seafarer','''sifɛrɚ','''siːfeərə','[n] 船员, 航海家','The Estonians have always been seafarers.  爱沙尼亚人总是在海上漂泊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2984','impart','ɪm''pɑrt','ɪm''pɑːt','[v] 传授, 赋予, 告知','She had information that she couldn’t wait to impart.  她得到了消息，迫不及待地想告诉别人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2985','uneven','ʌn''ivən','ʌn''iːv(ə)n','[adj] 不平坦的,不均匀的','She walked back carefully over the uneven ground.  她小心翼翼地从凹凸不平的地面上走回来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2986','repudiate','rɪ''pjudɪet','rɪ''pjuːdɪeɪt','[v] 批判','Leaders urged people to turn out in large numbers to repudiate the violence.  领导们力劝人们集体出面来声讨该暴力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2987','faunal','','','[adj] 动物区系的','Nor do we have an idea as to the timing of these faunal connections.  我们也不知道这些动物物种联系的时间表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2988','nighttime','''naɪt,taɪm','''naɪttaɪm','[n] 夜间','During the riots last year, the nighttime patrol force was beefed up with volunteers.  去年骚乱期间志愿者增加了夜间巡逻力量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2989','hardly','''hɑrdli','''hɑːdlɪ','[adv] 几乎不,刚刚','My parents divorced when I was six, and I hardly knew my father.  我六岁时父母离婚，我对父亲几乎一无所知。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2990','pry','praɪ','praɪ','[v] 探查','I don’t want to pry , but I need to ask you one or two questions.  我不想唐突，不过我需要问你一两个问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2991','exclusive','ɪk''sklusɪv','ɪk''skluːsɪv; ek-','[adj] 排外的,独占的,唯一的','a racially exclusive hiring policy  种族排外的聘用政策'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2992','enterprise','''ɛntɚ''praɪz','''entəpraɪz','[n] 企业, 事业','commercial enterprises such as banks and food manufacturers  银行和食品制造厂等商业企业'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2993','discard','dɪsˈkɑːrd','dɪ''skɑːd','[v] 丢弃, 抛弃','Read the manufacturer''s guidelines before discarding the box.  先阅读制造商的说明书再把盒子丢掉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2994','simulation','''sɪmjə''leʃən',',sɪmjʊ''leɪʃən','[n] 仿真, 假装','a computer simulation used to train airline pilots  用于训练航空公司飞行员的电脑模拟程序'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2995','resolve','rɪ''zɑlv','rɪ''zɒlv','[v] 解决, 决定','Barnet was desperate for money to resolve his financial problems.  巴尼特急需钱来解决他的经济问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2996','mat','mæt','mæt','[n] 席子，垫子','Wipe your feet on the mat.  在地垫上蹭蹭你的鞋底。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2997','quick','kwɪk','kwɪk','[a&ad] 快的, 迅速的','He downed his opponent with a quick right to the jaw.  他迅速准确击中对手的下颌而把他击倒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2998','hero','''hɪro','''hɪərəʊ','[n] 英雄','He had dared to speak out against injustice, and overnight he became a national hero .  他敢于站出来抨击不公正的现象，一夜之间就成了国家英雄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_2999','manipulate','mə''nɪpjulet','mə''nɪpjʊleɪt','[v] 操纵,影响','He was one of those men who manipulated people.  他是那种要摆布别人的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3000','solo','''solo','''səʊləʊ','[n] 独奏曲 a单独的','a gorgeous piano solo  一首极其美妙的钢琴独奏曲'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3001','designer','dɪ''zaɪnɚ','dɪ''zaɪnə','[n] 设计者','an interior designer  室内装潢设计师'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3002','karst','kɑrst','kɑːst','[n] 石灰岩地区常见的地形',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3003','interstellar',',ɪntɚ''stɛlɚ',',ɪntə''stelə','[adj] 星际的','...interstellar space.  ...星际空间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3004','scratch','skrætʃ','skrætʃ','[v& n] 抓，搔,划(痕)','John yawned and scratched his leg.  约翰打了个呵欠，挠了挠腿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3005','recycle',',ri''saɪkl','riː''saɪk(ə)l','[v] 使再循环, 反复应用 n再循环, 再生, 重复利用','We take all our bottles to be recycled.  我们把我们所有的瓶子都回收利用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3006','uncover','ʌn''kʌvɚ','ʌn''kʌvə','[v] 揭露，揭示','Customs officials uncovered a plot to smuggle weapons into the country.  海关官员侦破了一个走私武器入境的阴谋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3007','gibraltar','dʒi''brɔ:ltə','dʒi''brɔ:ltə','[n] 直布罗陀(海峡)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3008','refill','''rifɪl','riː''fɪl','[v] 再装满,再充填','The waitress refilled our coffee cups.  女服务员又把我们的咖啡杯斟满。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3009','fame','fem','feɪm','[n] 名声, 名望','He claims he is not really interested in fame.  他称自己对出名真的没有兴趣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3010','caravan','''kærəvæn','''kærəvæn; kærə''væn','[n] 旅行队,商队, 大篷车','a gipsy caravan  吉卜赛人的大篷车'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3011','microorganism',',maɪkro''ɔrgən,ɪzəm','maɪkrəʊ''ɔːg(ə)nɪz(ə)m','[n] 微生物','This is actually just a microorganism. But it has roughly 500 genes.  这其实只不过是一个微生物，却拥有约500个基因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3012','probable','''prɑbəbl','''prɒbəb(ə)l','[adj] 很可能的, 大概的','The probable cause of the fire was faulty wiring.  起火的原因很可能是电路故障。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3013','compromise','''kɑmprəmaɪz','''kɒmprəmaɪz','[v&n] 妥协, 让步','Compromise is an inevitable part of marriage.  妥协是婚姻生活中必不可少的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3014','inequality',',ɪnɪ''kwɑləti','ɪnɪ''kwɒlɪtɪ','[n] 不平等, 不平均','People are concerned about corruption and social inequality.  人们对腐败和社会不公感到担忧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3015','physicist','''fɪzɪsɪst','''fɪzɪsɪst','[n] 物理学者, 唯物论者','...a nuclear physicist.  …一位核物理学家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3016','intensive','ɪn''tɛnsɪv','ɪn''tensɪv','[adj] 强烈的, 精深的','a one-week intensive course in English  为期一周的英语强化课程'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3017','forget','fɚ''ɡɛt','fə''get','[v] 忘记, 忽略','I’m sorry, I’ve forgotten your name.  对不起，我忘记你的名字了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3018','postal','''postl','''pəʊst(ə)l','[adj] 邮政的,邮局的','the U.S. postal service  美国邮政'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3019','queen','kwin','kwiːn','[n] 王后, 女王','the queen of diamonds  方块Q，方块王后'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3020','sailor','''selɚ','''seɪlə','[n] 海员, 水手','Six British sailors drowned.  六名英国海员溺水身亡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3021','intervention',',ɪntɚ''vɛnʃən','ɪntə''venʃ(ə)n','[n] 干涉','government intervention to regulate prices  政府介入控制物价'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3022','immobile','ɪ''mobl','ɪ''məʊbaɪl','[adj] 不动的, 静止的','She could see a figure sitting immobile, facing the sea.  她看到一个人影面朝大海坐着，一动不动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3023','entity','''ɛntəti','''entɪtɪ','[n] 实体','The mind exists as a separate entity.  思想作为一个独立的实体存在。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3024','calendar','''kæləndɚ','''kælɪndə','[n] 日历, 历法','There was a calendar on the wall above, with large squares around the dates.  墙的上方曾有一本日历，日期框在大方格里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3025','stabilize','''stebəlaɪz','''steɪbəlaɪz','[v] 稳定','The patient’s condition has now stabilized.  病人的情况现已稳定下来了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3026','tune','tun','tjuːn','[n] 曲调vt调音, 调整','That’s a nice tune.  那曲调很美。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3027','predominantly','prɪ''dɑmɪnəntli','prɪ''dɒmɪnəntlɪ','[adv] 主要地, 占优势地','The city’s population is predominantly Irish.  该城市的人口绝大多数是爱尔兰人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3028','disgust','dɪs''ɡʌst','dɪs''gʌst','[n] 厌恶vi令人厌恶，作呕','He reached into the bin with a look of disgust on his face.  他把手伸进垃圾箱，脸上带着厌恶的表情。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3029','deficient','dɪ''fɪʃnt','dɪ''fɪʃ(ə)nt','[adj] 缺乏的, 不足的','Women who are dieting can become iron deficient.  节食的女性有可能缺铁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3030','assistance','ə''sɪstəns','ə''sɪst(ə)ns','[n] 协助, 援助, 补助,','We offer financial assistance to students.  我们向学生提供经济援助。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3031','persistent','pə''zɪstənt','pə''sɪst(ə)nt','[adj] 持久稳固的','persistent rumours  持续流传的谣言'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3032','prestige','prɛ''stidʒ','pre''stiː(d)ʒ','[n] 声望, 威望','The king wanted to enhance his prestige through war.  国王想通过战争来提高自己的威信。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3033','mound','maʊnd','maʊnd','[n] 土墩，沙土堆','an ancient burial mound  古代墓冢'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3034','fashionable','''fæʃnəbl','''fæʃ(ə)nəb(ə)l','[adj] 流行的, 时髦的','Strong colours are very fashionable at the moment.  眼下流行艳丽的色彩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3035','sect','sɛkt','sekt','[n] 宗派, 教派','The sect, which broke from the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints more than a century ago, believes polygamy brings glorification in heaven.  这个教派，原本是一个多世纪以前从摩门教末世圣徒教会分离出来的，相信一夫多妻制可以升上天堂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3036','exclude','ɪk''sklʊd','ɪk''skluːd; ek-','[v] 把排除在外, 排斥','a special diet that excludes dairy products  不包含奶制品的特别食谱'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3037','vaudeville','''vɔdəvɪl','''vɔːdəvɪl; ''vəʊd-','[n] 歌舞杂耍','For the next fifteen years she sang and danced in both Broadway and vaudeville shows.  在此后的十五年中，她分别在百老汇和歌舞杂耍中演出。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3038','scent','sɛnt','sent','[n] 气味','a yellow rose with a lovely scent  香气怡人的黄玫瑰'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3039','uncertainty','ʌn''sɝtnti','ʌn''sɜːt(ə)ntɪ; -tɪntɪ','[n] 无常, 不确定','...a period of political uncertainty.  …一段政治不稳定时期。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3040','carnivore','''kɑrnɪvɔr','''kɑːnɪvɔː','[n] 食肉动物','This is a delicious vegetarian dish that even carnivores love.  这是一道肉食者们都喜欢的美味素食。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3041','civilian','sə''vɪlɪən','sɪ''vɪlj(ə)n','[n] 平民','Many innocent civilians were killed during the war.  许多无辜的平民在战争中丧生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3042','hunger','''hʌŋɡɚ','''hʌŋgə','[n] 饥饿, 欲望','Try to satisfy your hunger by eating some fruit.  吃些水果充充饥吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3043','publication',',pʌblɪ''keʃən',',pʌblɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 出版(物), 发行','The guide is being translated into several languages for publication near Christmas.  这本指南正被翻译成好几种语言，准备在圣诞节前后出版。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3044','prolong','prəˈlɑːŋ','prə''lɒŋ','[v] 延长, 拖延','I was trying to think of some way to prolong the conversation.  我在想方设法拖长这次谈话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3045','plaster','''plæstɚ','''plɑːstə','[n] 石膏 vt敷以膏药','There were huge cracks in the plaster, and the green shutters were faded.  灰泥上有巨大的裂缝，绿色的百叶窗也褪色了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3046','sadness','''sædnəs','''sædnəs','[n] 悲哀, 悲伤','There was a touch of sadness in his voice (= he sounded a little sad ) .  他的声音里含着一丝悲伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3047','theorize','''θiəraɪz','''θɪəraɪz','[v] 建立理论, 理论化','Police are theorizing that the robbers may be posing as hitchhikers.  警方推测那些劫匪可能会装成搭便车的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3048','tundra','''tʌndrə','''tʌndrə','[n] 苔原, 冻土地带','Frozen dog dirt stipples the tundra of the golf course.  冻成冰块的狗屎点缀着高尔夫球场的苔原。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3049','concert','''kɑnsɚt','''kɒnsət','[n] 音乐会','a rock concert  摇滚音乐会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3050','localize','''lokəlaɪz','''ləʊk(ə)laɪz','[v] 集中,局部化','Few officers thought that a German-Czech war could be localized.  没几个军官认为德捷之战会是局部战争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3051','dependable','dɪ''pɛndəbl','dɪ''pendəb(ə)l','[adj] 可靠的, 可信赖的','our most dependable ally  我们最可靠的盟友'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3052','anomaly','ə''nɑməli','ə''nɒm(ə)lɪ','[n] 不规则, 异常的人或物','The space shuttle had stopped transmitting data, a very serious anomaly for the mission.  这架航天飞机已经停止了传输数据，这是这次任务中一个十分严重的反常现象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3053','displace','dɪs''ples','dɪs''pleɪs','[v] 转移, 取代','Coal has been displaced by natural gas as a major source of energy.  作为一种主要能源，煤的地位已为天然气所取代。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3054','gravitational',',ɡrævɪ''teʃənl',',ɡrævɪ''teɪʃənəl','[adj] 重力的, 引力作用的','the Moon’s gravitational field  月球的引力场'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3055','pronounce','prə''naʊns','prə''naʊns','[v] 发音, 宣告','How do you pronounce your name?  你的名字怎么念？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3056','abundantly','ə''bʌndəntli','ə''bʌnd(ə)ntlɪ','[adv] 大量地, 丰富地','Melons grow abundantly in this region.  这个地区盛产甜瓜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3057','liberate','''lɪbə''ret','''lɪbəreɪt','[v] 解放, 释放','A few days later, our armies liberated the city.  几天以后，我军解放了这座城市。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3058','intensify','ɪn''tɛnsɪfaɪ','ɪn''tensɪfaɪ','[v] 加强,强化','In Junethe civil war intensified.  6月份内战更加激烈了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3059','accord','ə''kɔrd','ə''kɔːd','[n&v] 一致, 协定','There was a silence as the women turned with one accord to stare at Doreen.  那些女人一齐转身盯着多琳看，全场鸦雀无声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3060','pollute','pə''lut','pə''luːt','[v] 弄脏, 污染','beaches polluted by raw sewage  受未经处理的污水污染的海滩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3061','cuneiform','''kjʊnɪə,fɔrm','''kjuːnɪfɔːm; kjuː''neɪɪfɔːm','[a&n] 楔形的,楔形文字(的)','She wrote hymns to the gods in cuneiform.  她用楔形文字写下了献给神祇的颂歌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3062','gamma','''gæmə','''gæmə','[n] 100万分之1克, 微克',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3063','icy','''aɪsi','''aɪsɪ','[adj] 冰冷的, 冷淡的','an icy wind  刺骨寒风'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3064','nebula','''nɛbjələ','''nebjʊlə','[n] 星云','As the nebula collapsed because of its gravity, it spun faster and flattened into a disk.  随着由于重力引起的星云坍缩，它旋转得越来越快，并变成了盘状。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3065','security','sə''kjʊrəti','sɪ''kjʊərətɪ','[n] 安全','The trial was held under tight security .  这场审讯是在戒备森严的情况下进行的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3066','supervise','''sʊpɚ''vaɪz','''suːpəvaɪz; ''sjuː-','[v] 监督, 管理','Griffiths closely supervised the research.  格里菲思密切指导该项研究。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3067','parasitic',',pærə''sɪtɪk','pærə''sɪtɪk','[adj] 寄生的, 由寄生虫引起的','parasitic fungi  寄生真菌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3068','documentation','''dɑkjəmɛn''teʃən',',dɒkjʊmen''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 文件','Applicants must provide supporting documentation .  申请人必须提供证明文件。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3069','lithosphere','''lɪθəsfɪr','''lɪθəsfɪə','[n] [地]岩石圈','Even the planet''s outer skin, or lithosphere, has been transformed.  甚至于地球的表层——岩石圈——也已经被改变了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3070','richness','','','[n] 富饶；富裕','But I would like to suggest enough of them to impress upon you the richness and complexity of my background.  但我仍会给出足够多的建议让你对我的背景留下丰富而富有综合性的印象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3071','sulfate','''sʌl,fet','''sʌlfeɪt','[n] 硫酸盐','The major components of PM are sulfate, nitrates, ammonia, sodium chloride, carbon, mineral dust and water.  它的主要组成成分是硫酸盐、硝酸盐、氨、氯化钠、碳、矿物粉尘和水。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3072','unity','''junəti','ˈjuːnəti','[n] 团结, 联合','economic unity  经济统一'),
