('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3084','incomplete','''ɪnkəm''plit','ɪnkəm''pliːt','[adj] 不完全的, 不完整的','Unfortunately, I do not have the information because our records are incomplete.  很遗憾，由于我们的记录不完整，我无法提供有关资料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3085','lecture','''lɛktʃɚ','''lektʃə','[n&v] 演讲','...a series of lectures by Professor Eric Robinson.  …埃里克·鲁滨逊教授的系列讲座。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3086','tolerance','''tɑlərəns','''tɒl(ə)r(ə)ns','[n] 宽容，容忍','...his tolerance and understanding of diverse human nature.  …他对各种人性的宽容和理解。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3087','hostile','ˈhɑstəl','''hɒstaɪl','[adj] 敌对的','Southampton fans gave their former coach a hostile reception .  南安普敦队的球迷对球队的前任教练很不友善。'),
