('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3089','unchanging','ʌn''tʃendʒɪŋ','ʌn''tʃeɪn(d)ʒɪŋ','[adj] 不变的','...eternal and unchanging truths.  ...永恒不变的事实。'),
