('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3094','trial','''traɪəl','''traɪəl','[n] 试验, 考验','a new drug that is undergoing clinical trials  正在接受临床试验的一种新药'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3095','wound','wund','wuːnd','[n] 创伤, 伤口','A nurse cleaned and bandaged the wound.  护士把伤口清洗包扎好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3096','forbid','fɚ''bɪd','fə''bɪd','[v] 禁止, 不许','Lack of space forbids listing the names of all those who contributed.  由于篇幅限制，无法列出所有捐款人的姓名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3097','judgment','''dʒʌdʒmənt','''dʒʌdʒmənt','[n] 判断','I’ve known him for years and I trust his judgment.  我与他相识多年，相信他的判断力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3098','nickel','''nɪkl','''nɪk(ə)l','[n] 镍, 镍币','...a large glass jar filled with pennies, nickels, dimes, and quarters.  …一个装满1分、5分、10分和25分硬币的大玻璃罐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3099','Georgia','''dʒɔ:dʒjə','''dʒɔ:dʒjə','[n] (美)乔治亚州','In the past week alone we have lost about ten colleagues, in Georgia and in Afghanistan.  仅仅上星期在乔治亚州和阿富汗我们就已经失去了大约十名同事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3100','ourselves','ɑr''sɛlvz','aʊə''selvz','[pron] 我们自己','We prepared ourselves for the long journey ahead.  我们为将要开始的长途旅行做好了准备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3101','rid','rɪd','rɪd','[v] 使摆脱, 使去掉','The proposals are an attempt to rid the country of political corruption.  这些提议是使该国摆脱政治腐败的一种尝试。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3102','integral','''ɪntɪɡrəl','ˈɪntɪɡrəl','[adj] 完整的, 整体的','Rituals, celebrations, and festivals form an integral part of every human society.  仪式、庆典和节日是每个人类社会不可缺少的组成部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3103','pasture','''pæstʃɚ','''pɑːstʃə','[n] 牧草地，牧场 vt放牧','large areas of rough upland pasture  大片起伏的山地牧场'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3104','overwhelm',',ovɚ''wɛlm','əʊvə''welm','[v] 打击, 压倒, 打败','In 1532 the Spaniards finally overwhelmed the armies of Peru.  1532年，西班牙人最终打垮了秘鲁军队。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3105','prolific','prə''lɪfɪk','prə''lɪfɪk','[adj] 多产的；多子嗣的','Handel’s prolific output of opera  韩德尔丰富的歌剧作品'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3106','moist','mɔɪst','mɒɪst','[adj] 潮湿的，湿润的','Make sure the soil is moist before planting the seeds.  播种之前要确保土壤湿润。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3107','coral','''kɔrəl','''kɒr(ə)l','[n] 珊瑚(虫)','The seas around Bermuda are full of colourful corals and fantastic fish.  百慕大周围的海域中到处都是五彩的珊瑚虫和奇异的鱼类。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3108','cite','saɪt','saɪt','[v] 引用, 引证','The judge cited a 1956 Supreme Court ruling in her decision.  法官在她的判决中引用了1956年最高法院的一项裁决。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3109','barrel','''bærəl','''bær(ə)l','[n] 桶','The wine is aged in oak barrels.  这种葡萄酒是用橡木酒桶放陈的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3110','reef','rif','riːf','[n] 礁,暗礁','a proposal to protect several miles of thousand-year-old coral reef  保护绵延数英里的千年古珊瑚礁的提案'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3111','liberty','''lɪbɚti','''lɪbətɪ','[n] 自由, 特权','the fight for liberty and equality  争取自由和平等的斗争'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3112','millimeter','''mɪləˌmitə','''mɪlɪˌmi:tə','[n] 毫米','A micrometer is one thousandth of one millimeter.  一微米是一毫米的千分之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3113','molecular','mə''lɛkjəlɚ','mə''lekjʊlə','[adj] 分子的','...the molecular structure of fuel.  …燃料的分子结构。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3114','exterior','ɪk''stɪrɪɚ','ɪk''stɪərɪə; ek-','[adj] 外部的 n外部','The exterior walls need a new coat of paint.  外墙需要刷新漆了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3115','lifetime','''laɪftaɪm','''laɪftaɪm','[n] 一生, 终生','It’s the sort of opportunity you see only once in a lifetime.  这种机会你一辈子也只能碰到一次。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3116','antiquity','æn''tɪkwəti','æn''tɪkwɪtɪ','[n] 古代','a building of great antiquity  非常古老的建筑物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3117','adobe','''ədobɪ','ə''dəʊbɪ; ə''dəʊb','[n] 泥砖，土坯','...a few blocks of adobe houses.  …几个由土坯房组成的街区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3118','absorption','əbˈsɔrpʃən, -ˈzɔrp-','əb''zɔːpʃ(ə)n; -''sɔːp-','[n] 吸收','This controls the absorption of liquids.  这可以控制液体的吸收。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3119','sensitivity','''sɛnsə''tɪvəti','sensɪ''tɪvɪtɪ','[n] 敏感, 灵敏(度)','Each user should have access to a security level based upon the level of data sensitivity he or she can see.  根据用户可以看到的数据的敏感性级别，每个用户都应该可以访问某个安全级别。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3120','studio','''studɪo','''stjuːdɪəʊ','[n] 画室,工作室','a photographer’s studio  摄影师的工作室'),
