('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3122','fifty','''fɪfti','''fɪftɪ','[num] 五十','Standards of living rose in the fifties.  50年代生活水平提高了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3123','swing','swɪŋ','swɪŋ','[v] 摇摆, 摆动','Let your arms swing as you walk.  边走边摆动双臂。'),
