('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3137','amplification',',æmpləfə''keʃən',',æmplɪfɪ''keɪʃən','[n] 扩大','Since the Greek language in which John wrote had no exclamation marks, he used an amplification technique that is common in Scriptures.  后来约翰用希腊语写作没有惊叹的标志，他在经文中普片的使用用一种放大的手法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3138','subsurface','sʌb''sɝfɪs','''sʌbsɜːfɪs','[adj] 地下的, 表面下的n地表下岩石',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3139','philosopher','fə''lɑsəfɚ','fɪ''lɒsəfə','[n] 哲学家, 哲人','Plato, Aristotle, and other Greek philosophers  柏拉图、亚里士多德和其他希腊哲学家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3140','semiskilled',',sɛmaɪ''skɪld',',semɪ''skɪld','[adj] 半熟练的','Branded an intellectual, he spent 10 years working as a semiskilled laborer at the Beijing Heavy Machinery Factory.  带着知识分子的烙印，余先生在北京重机械厂作为半成品工人工作了10年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3141','relax','rɪ''læks','rɪ''læks','[v] 放松,休息','I just want to sit down and relax.  我只想坐下来休息一下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3142','mackerel','''mækrəl','''mæk(ə)r(ə)l','[n] 鲭','smoked mackerel  熏鲭鱼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3143','witness','ˈwɪtnɪs','ˈwɪtnɪs','[n] 目击者；证据(言) vt目击,作证','Police have appealed for witnesses to come forward.  警方呼吁目击者站出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3144','midwest',',mid''west',',mid''west','[n] 中西部','...farmers in the Midwest.  …中西部的农场主们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3145','scrub','skrʌb','skrʌb','[n] 灌木丛','There is an area of scrub and woodland beside the railway line.  那条铁路旁边有一片矮灌木丛和林地。'),
