('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3149','mutoscope','','','[n] (早期的)电影放映机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3150','summarize','''sʌməraɪz','''sʌməraiz','[v] 概述, 总结','The authors summarize their views in the introduction.  作者在序言里概述了他们的观点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3151','stalk','stɔk','stɔːk','[n] 茎，梗 v跟踪,高视阔步地走','celery stalks  芹菜茎'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3152','numerical','nʊ''mɛrɪkl','njuː''merɪk(ə)l','[adj] 数字的, 用数表示的','a numerical code  数字密码'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3153','dynamic','daɪ''næmɪk','daɪ''næmɪk','[adj] 动力的, 动力学的','a dynamic and unstable process  不断变化的、不稳定的过程'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3154','fellow','''fɛlo','''feləʊ','[n] 家伙, 同事','Paul’s an easy-going sort of fellow.  保罗人很随和。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3155','punishment','''pʌnɪʃmənt','''pʌnɪʃm(ə)nt','[n] 惩罚, 处罚','...a group that campaigns against the physical punishment of children.  …一个发起运动反对体罚儿童的组织。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3156','ethnic','''ɛθnɪk','''eθnɪk','[adj] 人种的, 种族的','The school teaches pupils from different ethnic groups.  该校教授不同种族的小学生。'),
