('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3160','mental','''mɛntl','''ment(ə)l','[adj] 精神的,智力的','The centre provides help for people suffering from mental illness .  该中心对精神病患者提供帮助。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3161','web','wɛb','web','[n] 网','He watched a spider spinning its web.  他观察一只蜘蛛织网。'),
