('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3177','dedicate','''dɛdɪket','''dedɪkeɪt','[v] 献(身), 致力','She dedicated her first album to Woody Allen, who she says understands her obsession.  她把她的第一张唱片献给伍迪·艾伦，她说艾伦理解她的痴迷。'),
