('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3264','via','ˈvaɪə, ˈviə','ˈvaɪə，ˈviːə','[prep] 经,通过,经由','We flew to Athens via Paris.  我们经由巴黎飞往雅典。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3265','financially','faɪ''nænʃəli','faɪ''nænʃəli','[adv] 财政上(金融上)','After all, your competitors are financially rational.  至少你的对手财政上是理性的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3266','diversification','dɪ,vɝsɪfɪ''keʃən','daɪ,vɜːsɪfɪ''keɪʃən','[n] 变化, 多样化','The idea behind diversification is to invest in a large number of assets so that a loss in any particular investment is minimized by gains in others.  多元化背后的想法是投资一个数额巨大的资产，这样任何特定投资的损失都被其他投资获得的收益最小化了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3267','sedentary','''sɛdntɛri','''sed(ə)nt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 久坐的,固定不动的','a sedentary people living north of the Danube  多瑙河北面的一个定居民族'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3268','descend','dɪ''sɛnd','dɪ''send','[v] 下来, 下降','Our plane started to descend.  我们的飞机开始下降。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3269','outwork','''aʊtwɝk','''aʊtwɜːk','[n] 外包活',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3270','eohippus',',io''hɪpəs',',iːəʊ''hɪpəs','[n] <古生>始祖马',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3271','conductor','kən''dʌktɚ','kən''dʌktə','[n] 领导者, 经理','Wood is a poor conductor of heat.  木头导热性能差。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3272','blast','blæst','blɑːst','[n] 爆炸；一阵(疾风等) vt炸，炸掉','Oh blast! I’ve forgotten my key.  真讨厌！ 我忘了带钥匙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3273','nutritionally','','','[adv] 在营养上, 营养方面',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3274','prime','praɪm','praɪm','[adj] 首要的,最好的','Smoking is the prime cause of lung disease.  抽烟是引发肺部疾病的首要原因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3275','fold','fold','fəʊld','[n] /v折叠','Her dress hung in soft folds .  她的连衣裙垂下来，上面打着松松的褶子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3276','wake','wek','weɪk','[v] 醒来,唤醒','When she woke, the sun was streaming through the windows.  她醒来时，阳光泻入窗内。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3277','worm','wɝm','wɜːm','[n] 虫，蠕虫','...a new computer worm that disables security software.  …一种使安全软件失灵的新型计算机蠕虫病毒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3278','mythical','''mɪθɪkl','''mɪθɪkəl','[adj] 神话的, 虚构的','a mythical creature like the Minotaur  像弥诺陶洛斯这类神话故事中的怪物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3279','handcraft','''hændkræft','''hæn(d)krɑːft','[n] 手工, 手艺','The ruler shaped his course to accelerate agriculture and handcraft industry.  金统治者先后制定了一系列政策扶持农业和手工业的发展。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3280','endanger','ɪn''dendʒɚ','ɪn''deɪn(d)ʒə; en-','[v] 危及','Smoking during pregnancy endangers your baby’s life.  孕期吸烟会危及胎儿生命。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3281','wage','wedʒ','weɪdʒ','[n] 工资 v发动','He earns a good wage.  他工资挺高。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3282','sweep','swip','swiːp','[v] 打扫, 清扫','Bert swept the path in front of the house.  伯特清扫了屋前的小路。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3283','porosity','pɔ''rɑsəti','pɔː''rɒsɪtɪ','[n] 多孔性','...the porosity of the coal.  ...煤炭的多孔性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3284','windmill','''wɪnd''mɪl','''wɪn(d)mɪl','[n] 风车','Only in Portugal can you rent your own windmill-inspired house on top of its own mini-mountain for under $800 per week.  要想以每周800美金的价格租到风车旅馆，而且是建在属于旅馆自有小山上的，你只能来葡萄牙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3285','backup','''bæk,ʌp','''bækʌp','[n] 后援, 支持','There is no emergency back-up immediately available.  没有立即就能获得的后备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3286','intent','ɪn''tɛnt','ɪn''tent','[n] 意图, 目的','She behaved foolishly but with good intent.  她干了蠢事，却是出于一片好意。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3287','understory','''ʌndɚ,stɔri; ''ʌndɚ,stori','''ʌndə,stɔ:ri','[n] 林下叶层','Wild sarsaparilla, wild oats, Solomon''s seal and a host of understory plants die off;  野生撒尔沙、野生燕麦、玉竹和大量的林下叶层植物相继死光；'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3288','shaman','''ʃæmən','''ʃæmən; ''ʃeɪm-','[n] 萨满教的道士, 僧人或巫师',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3289','stylize','''staɪ,laɪz','''staɪlaɪz','[v] 使风格化, 仿效的风格',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3290','autonomous','ɔ''tɑnəməs','ɔː''tɒnəməs','[adj] 自治的','They proudly declared themselves part of a new autonomous province.  他们自豪地宣布自己是新自治省的一部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3291','pipeline','''paɪplaɪn','''paɪplaɪn','[n] 管道, 传递途径','A consortium plans to build a natural-gas pipeline from Russia to supply eastern Germany.  一家财团计划修建一条从俄罗斯向德国东部供应天然气的管道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3292','renew','rɪ''nʊ','rɪ''njuː','[v] 更新, 恢复','The window frames need to be renewed.  窗框需要换新的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3293','dandelion','''dændɪlaɪən','''dændɪlaɪən','[n] 蒲公英','The wind puffed away the seeds of the dandelion.  风吹散了蒲公英的种子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3294','monopoly','mə''nɑpəli','mə''nɒp(ə)lɪ','[n] 垄断(者)','a monopoly in copper trading  对铜交易的垄断'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3295','membership','''mɛmbɚʃɪp','''membəʃɪp','[n] 成员资格,全体会员','You should carry your membership card with you at all times.  你应该随身携带会员卡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3296','gate','ɡet','geɪt','[n] 大门','We went through the gate into the orchard.  我们穿过大门进了果园。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3297','homogeneous',',homə''dʒinɪəs',',hɒmə(ʊ)''dʒiːnɪəs; -''dʒen-','[adj] 同质的,相似的','a homogeneous society  同种族人组成的社会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3298','substantially','səb''stænʃəli','səb''stænʃ(ə)lɪ','[adv] 大体上；本质上','There are one or two minor differences, but they’re substantially the same text.  这些文本有一两处细微差异，但大体上是一样的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3299','internally','in''tə:nəli','in''tə:nəli','[adv] 内部地, 国内地','There is an Afghan police force now and an Afghan army that are building up to be able to protect the people of Afghanistan internally like we all want them to.  现在，阿富汗正在组建一支警察部队和一支由军人组成的队伍，这样才会有能力保护阿富汗国内的人民，这是我们一直希望他们做的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3300','flame','flem','fleɪm','[n] 火焰, 光辉','Flames poured out of the windows of the building.  火焰从大楼窗口冒出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3301','breeze','briz','briːz','[n] 微风 vi吹微风,逃走','flowers waving in the breeze  在微风中摇曳的花儿'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3302','poorly','ˈpʊərlɪ; pʊrlɪ','''pɔːlɪ; ''pʊəlɪ','[adj] 不舒服的  ad贫穷地','Matt’s wife’s been very poorly.  马特的妻子身体一直不好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3303','popularly','''pɑpjəlɚli','''pɒpjələlɪ','[adv] 大众地, 通俗地','...the Mesozoic era, more popularly known as the age of dinosaurs.  …中生代，俗称恐龙时代。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3304','devoid','dɪ''vɔɪd','dɪ''vɒɪd','[adj] 全无的, 缺乏的','I have never looked on a face that was so devoid of feeling.  我从未见过这样一张完全没有感情的脸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3305','manifest','''mænɪfɛst','''mænɪfest','[v] 显示，表明，证明','The shareholders have manifested their intention to sell the shares.  股东们表明了要出售股票的意图。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3306','Guinea','''ɡɪni','''gɪnɪ','[n] 几内亚','This is not unheard of in Guinea.  这种事在几内亚并非罕见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3307','landform','''lænd''fɔrm','''læn(d)fɔːm','[n] 地形, 地貌','This small country has an amazing variety of landforms.  这个小国家拥有令人惊叹的丰富的地貌类型。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3308','mistake','mɪ''stek','mɪ''steɪk','[n] 错误; [v] 弄错,误解','The most common mistake is to plant them too deep.  最常见的错误就是把它们种得太深了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3309','pinpoint','''pɪnpɔɪnt','''pɪnpɒɪnt','[v] 确定,精确地定位; [adj] 十分精确的','Rescue teams have now pinpointed the location of the ship.  救援队现在已经找出那艘船的准确位置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3310','relief','rɪ''lif','rɪ''liːf','[n] 轻松，缓解','I felt a huge surge of relief and happiness.  我如释重负，大感欣慰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3311','rancher','''ræntʃɚ','''rɑːn(t)ʃə','[n] 大牧场主, 大牧场工人','...a cattle rancher.  ...一位养牛场场主。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3312','mosaic','mo''zeɪk','mə(ʊ)''zeɪɪk','[n] 镶嵌细工，马赛克','rooms decorated with wall paintings and mosaics  用壁画和马赛克装饰的房间'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3313','maturation',',mætʃu''reʃən','mætjʊ''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 化脓, 成熟','cell maturation  细胞的成熟过程'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3314','recruitment','rɪ''krʊtmənt','rɪ''kruːtm(ə)nt','[n] 征募新兵, 补充',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3315','preschooler',',pri''skʊlɚ','','[n] (美)学龄前儿童','A preschooler will learn that it''s not all right to eat in the classroom, because the teacher says it''s not.  一个学龄前儿童会认识到在教室里吃东西是不对的，因为老师说这样是不对的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3316','miniature','ˈmɪniətʃɚ; ˈmɪnɪtʃɚ','''mɪnɪtʃə','[adj] 小型的，微小的 n微小的模型','miniature roses  微型玫瑰'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3317','speculate','''spɛkjə''let','''spekjʊleɪt','[v] 推测, 思索, 做投机买卖','She refused to speculate.  她拒绝猜测。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3318','pale','pel','peɪl','[adj] 苍白的；淡的 vi变得苍白，变得暗淡',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3319','loft','lɔft','lɒft','[n] 阁楼','Our neighbours have just done aloft conversion(= changed the loft into bedrooms ).  我们的邻居刚刚完成阁楼改建。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3320','exotic','ɪɡ''zɑtɪk','ɪg''zɒtɪk; eg-','[adj] 外来的','exotic birds  外国的奇异鸟类'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3321','practitioner','præk''tɪʃənɚ','præk''tɪʃ(ə)nə','[n] 从业者, 开业者','one of golf’s most experienced practitioners  最有经验的高尔夫球员之一'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3322','ear','ɪr','ɪə','[n] 耳朵','She tucked her hair behind her ears.  她把头发拢到耳朵背后。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3323','photosynthesis',',foto''sɪnθəsɪs',',fəʊtə(ʊ)''sɪnθɪsɪs','[n] 光合作用','It has at least one gene necessary for photosynthesis—so far it’s the only animal known with this ability.  它有至少一个基因是光合作用所必需的——到目前为止这是唯一被发现具有此项能力的动物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3324','diffuse','dɪ''fjus','dɪ''fjuːz','[v] 散播,传播','Their ideas diffused quickly across Europe.  他们的观点很快在欧洲传播开来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3325','arc','ɑrk','ɑːk','[n] 弧, 弓形','the arc of a rainbow  彩虹的弧状'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3326','flagellum','flə''dʒɛləm','flə''dʒeləm','[n] [动]鞭毛','That vibration can then be coupled to another structure to turn a rotor, which in turn operates a flagellum-like tail.  这个颤动能够随即作用到另一个装置以启动马达，后者接着操纵像鞭毛一样的尾巴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3327','cloth','klɔθ','klɒθ','[n] 布, 织物','Clean the surface with a damp cloth.  用一块湿布清洗表面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3328','collapse','kə''læps','kə''læps','[v&n] 倒塌, 崩溃','Uncle Ted’s chair collapsed under his weight.  椅子承受不了特德叔叔的重量，塌架了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3329','phytoremediation',',faɪtorɪ,midi''eʃən','','[n] 植物除污, 植物治理法','The phytoremediation mechanisms to chemical air pollution on adhering , absorption, assimilation, degradation and transformation are introduced and the research orientation is also put forward.  介绍了植物对化学性大气污染物的吸附、吸收、同化、降解、转化等修复机理，并指出了其研究方向。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3330','mustard','''mʌstɚd','''mʌstəd','[n] 芥菜, 芥末','I''m not especially fond of mustard.  芥末我吃不来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3331','chlorosis','klə''rosɪs','klɒ''rəʊsɪs','[n] 萎黄病, 变色病',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3332','daylight','''delaɪt','''deɪlaɪt','[n] 日光, 白昼','The park is open to the public during daylight hours .  公园白天对公众开放。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3333','piecework','''piswɝk','''piːswɜːk','[n] 计件工作','bargaining over piecework rates  就计件工作报酬进行商讨'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3334','luck','lʌk','lʌk','[n] 运气, 好运','You’re not having much luck today, are you?  你今天运气不太好，是不是？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3335','moment','''momənt','''məʊm(ə)nt','[n] 片刻，瞬间','He was here a moment ago .  他刚刚还在这里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3336','ingenuity',',ɪndʒə''nuəti',',ɪndʒɪ''njuːɪtɪ','[n] 机灵, 独创性','It’s limited only by your ingenuity!  被束缚的仅仅是你的独创性！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3337','gear','ɡɪr','gɪə','[n] 齿轮; [v] 使适应','When she put the car in gear it began to buck wildly.  当她把汽车搭上齿轮时，汽车便开始颠簸地行进。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3338','intimate','ˈɪntəmɪt','''ɪntɪmət','[adj] 亲密的,私人的','an intimate friend of Picasso’s  毕加索的一个密友'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3339','efficiency','ɪ''fɪʃənsi','ɪ''fɪʃ(ə)nsɪ','[n] 效率, 功效','considerable advancements in energy efficiency  能源效率的显著提高'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3340','Polynesian',',pɔli''ni:ziən; -ʒiən',',pɔli''ni:ziən; -ʒiən','[n] 波利尼西亚人, 波利尼西亚语','Allegiance to chiefs was a fundamental of Polynesian culture.  效忠首领是波利尼西亚人最基本的文化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3341','inaccurate','ɪn''ækjərət','ɪn''ækjʊrət','[adj] 不准确的, 错误的','A lot of what has been written about him is inaccurate.  关于他的文字描述有大量失实之处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3342','eighteen',',e''tin','eɪ''tiːn; ''eɪtiːn','[num] 十八','At least eighteen bullets were fired.  至少射出了18颗子弹。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3343','lumber','''lʌmbɚ','''lʌmbə','[n] 木材,木料','It was made of soft lumber, spruce by the look of it.  它是软木做的，看样子是云杉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3344','monument','''mɑnjumənt','''mɒnjʊm(ə)nt','[n] 纪念碑','He erected a monument on the spot where his daughter was killed.  他在女儿遇难的地方立了块纪念碑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3345','garrison','''gærəsn','''gærɪs(ə)n','[n] 守备队, 驻地','The garrison was called out when news of the enemy’s advance was received.  收到敌人推进的情报后，卫戍部队奉命出动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3346','starve','stɑrv','stɑːv','[v] (使)饿死','Thousands of people will starve if food doesn’t reach the city.  如果食品不能运到那座城市，成千上万的人就要饿死。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3347','employment','ɪm''plɔɪmənt','ɪm''plɒɪm(ə)nt; em-','[n] 雇用','She was offered employment in the sales office.  她获聘在销售部工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3348','crevice','''krɛvɪs','''krevɪs','[n] 裂缝','small creatures that hide in crevices in the rock  藏在岩石缝里的小生物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3349','port','pɔrt','pɔːt','[n] 港口','Britain’s largest port  英国最大的港口城市'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3350','scavenger','''skævɪndʒɚ','''skævɪn(d)ʒə','[n] 清道夫,食腐动物','He struck at one with his knife lashed to the end of an oar and watched the scavenger sliding down into deep water.  他用绑在桨的一头的刀子击中了其中的一条，并看着这条食腐动物滑到深海里去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3351','antibiotic',',æntɪbaɪ''ɑtɪk; ˌæntaɪ-',',æntɪbaɪ''ɒtɪk','[n] 抗生素','Your doctor may prescribe antibiotics.  你的大夫可能会开抗生素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3352','complain','kəm''plen','kəm''pleɪn','[v] 抱怨,控诉','Residents are complaining because traffic in the area has increased.  由于这个地区的交通流量有所增加，居民都在抱怨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3353','patron','''petrən','''peɪtr(ə)n','[n] 资助人，赞助人','a wealthy patron  富有的赞助人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3354','legume','''lɛgjʊm','''legjuːm','[n] 豆类, 豆荚','We never think of this legume unless it''s in our soup.  我们从想不到这种豆类，除非它们放在汤里。'),
