('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3362','synthesize','''sɪnθəsaɪz','''sɪnθəsaɪz','[v] 综合, 合成','DDT is a pesticide that was first synthesized in 1874.  滴滴涕是最初合成于1874年的杀虫剂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3363','magnetosphere','mæg''nitə,sfɪr','mæg''niːtəsfɪə','[n] 磁气圈','The energy of the particles and the fields in the magnetosphere can vary by large amounts.  带电粒子的能量大小与磁气圈中的磁场的大小变化极大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3364','chisel','''tʃɪzl','''tʃɪz(ə)l','[n] 凿子 v砍凿','He is chipping away at a block marble with a chisel.  他正在用凿子在大理石上不停地凿。'),
