('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3369','conception','kən''sɛpʃən','kən''sepʃ(ə)n','[n] 观念, 概念','My conception of a garden was based on gardens I had visited in England.  我对花园的概念是基于我在英格兰参观过的一些花园的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3370','rental','''rɛntl','''rent(ə)l','[n] 租金额','Video rental is usually £3.  录像带的租金通常是3英镑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3371','informal','ɪn''fɔrml','ɪn''fɔːm(ə)l','[adj] 不正式的','The atmosphere at work is fairly informal.  工作气氛相当轻松。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3372','ambitious','æm''bɪʃəs','æm''bɪʃəs','[adj] 有雄心的','Alfred was intensely ambitious, obsessed with the idea of becoming rich.  艾尔弗雷德雄心勃勃，一心想着发财。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3373','measurable','''mɛʒərəbl','''meʒ(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 可测量的','measurable results  可衡量的结果'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3374','stroke','strok','strəʊk','[n] 划桨；击','a backhand stroke  一记反手击球'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3375','enforce','ɪn''fɔrs','ɪn''fɔːs; en-','[v] 实施, 执行,加强','Parking restrictions will be strictly enforced.  停车限制将会严格执行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3376','tannin','''tænɪn','''tænɪn','[n] [化]丹宁酸','Coffee contains tannin and antioxidants, which are good for the heart and arteries, Dr Trombetti says.  特龙贝蒂说，咖啡中含有丹宁酸和抗氧化剂，对心脏和动脉有好处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3377','disagree',',dɪsə''ɡri','dɪsə''griː','[v] 不一致, 不适宜','The statements of several witnesses disagree.  几名证人的证词不一致。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3378','joint','dʒɔɪnt','dʒɒɪnt','[n] 关节；接头','What should I use to seal the joint between the carport roof and the house wall?  我应该用什么材料填补车棚顶和房屋墙面的接缝？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3379','tourism','''tʊrɪzəm','''tʊərɪz(ə)m','[n] 旅游业, 观光','The country depends on tourism for much of its income.  该国的大部分收入依靠旅游业。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3380','woody','''wʊdi','''wʊdɪ','[adj] 多树木的,木质的','Care must be taken when trimming around woody plants like shrubs and trees.  修剪像灌木和乔木这样的木本植物必须小心翼翼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3381','card','kɑrd','kɑːd','[n] 纸牌, 卡片','Employees must show their identity cards at the gate.  雇员在大门口必须出示自己的身份卡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3382','ownership','''onɚʃɪp','''əʊnəʃɪp','[n] 所有权, 物主身份','The price of home ownership is increasing.  房价在不断上涨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3383','prehistory',',pri''hɪstri','priː''hɪstrɪ','[n] 史前时代, 史前学',''),
