('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3415','fan','fæn','fæn','[n] (风)扇 vt扇，煽动','a ceiling fan  吊扇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3416','agriculturalist',',æɡrɪ''kʌltʃərəlɪst','','[n] 农学家','Thadani runs workshops and seminars on how to be a small-scale agriculturalist -- and the workshops are growing in popularity.  Thadani开办了关于怎样成为一名小小农学家的讲习班和研讨会，讲习班很受欢迎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3417','cooperate','koʊˈɑːpəreɪt','kəʊ''ɒpəreɪt','[v] 合作, 协作','They agreed to co-operate with Brazil on a programme to protect the rain forests.  他们同意和巴西合作进行一个保护热带雨林的项目。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3418','adorn','ə''dɔrn','ə''dɔːn','[v] 装饰','His watercolour designs adorn a wide range of books.  他的水彩设计装饰着各种各样的书籍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3419','Pakistan','''pækistæn','''pækistæn','[n] 巴基斯坦(南亚国家)','Should I not be worrying about Pakistan?  我不该担心巴基斯坦问题吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3420','rhetorical','rɪ''tɔrɪkl','rɪ''tɒrɪk(ə)l','[adj] 带修辞色彩的','a speech full of rhetorical phrases  充满华丽辞藻的演讲'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3421','formula','''fɔrmjələ','''fɔːmjʊlə','[n] 公式, 规则','the formula for calculating distance  计算距离的公式'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3422','leap','lip','liːp','[v&n] 跳跃','My heart leaped when I saw Paul at the airport.  在机场看到保罗时，我的心猛地一跳。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3423','inferential',',ɪnfə''rɛnʃəl',',ɪnfə''renʃəl','[adj] 推理的, 推论的','In this article I will focus on data collected using a nominal scale of measurement and the inferential techniques appropriate for nominal data.  在本文中，我将主要讨论通过使用测量的定类尺度收集的数据，以及适用于定类数据的推论技术。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3424','reel','ril','riːl','[n] 卷轴 vt卷，绕','a cotton reel  棉线轴'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3425','partial','''pɑrʃəl','''pɑːʃ(ə)l','[adj] 部分的,局部的','The exhibition was only a partial success.  那次展会只获得部分成功。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3426','crown','kraʊn','kraʊn','[n] 王冠，冕','How long does it take to have crowns fitted?  镶齿冠需要多长时间？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3427','mysterious','mɪ''stɪrɪəs','mɪ''stɪərɪəs','[adj] 神秘的','The police are investigating the mysterious deaths of children at the hospital.  警察正在调查这家医院的儿童神秘死亡事件。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3428','audio','''ɔdɪo','''ɔːdɪəʊ','[adj] 音频的,声音的','audio and video equipment  音频视频设备'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3429','planetarium','''plænə''tɛrɪəm',',plænɪ''teərɪəm','[n] 天文馆','The motions of the stars can be approximated in a planetarium.  星星的运动可在天文馆里模拟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3430','spider','''spaɪdɚ','''spaɪdə','[n] 蜘蛛,三脚架',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3431','humorous','''hjumərəs','''hjuːm(ə)rəs','[adj] 幽默的,诙谐的','humorous stories  诙谐的故事'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3432','aristocratic','ə,rɪstə''krætɪk',',ærɪstə''krætɪk','[adj] 贵族政治的,贵族的','an aristocratic family  贵族家庭'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3433','parrot','''pærət','''pærət','[n] 鹦鹉','We recited poems parrot fashion.  我们鹦鹉学舌般机械地背诵诗歌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3434','bush','','bʊʃ','[n] 矮树丛',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3435','radar','''redɑr','''reɪdɑː','[n] 雷达,电波探测器','The coastline can now be monitored by radar.  现在能用雷达监测海岸线了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3436','strand','strænd','strænd','[v] 使搁浅',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3437','conductance','kən''dʌktəns','kən''dʌkt(ə)ns','[n] 电导, 导率','They measure skin conductance, or sweating response.  这些措施皮肤电导，或出汗的反应。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3438','filter','''fɪltɚ','''fɪltə','[v] 过滤 ,透(过)','The water in the tank is constantly filtered.  鱼缸里的水在不停地被过滤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3439','rainforest','''ren''fɔrɪst','','[n] 雨林','The rainforest is essential in other areas also.  雨林在其他地区也是必不可少的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3440','endocrine','''ɛndəkrɪn','''endə(ʊ)kraɪn; -krɪn','[n] 内分泌','Located near the base of the neck, the thyroid is a large endocrine gland that produces hormones that help control growth and metabolism.  甲状腺位于颈部的底部附近，是一个很大的内分泌腺体，它产生激素，协助控制生长和新陈代谢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3441','hemlock','''hɛmlɑk','''hemlɒk','[n] 铁杉,毒芹','Soon a dark wall of trees—red spruce, balsam fir, beech, hemlock—surrounds you, and there''s a sudden stony persistence.  很快你会被一堵厚厚的树墙包围——红云杉、香脂冷杉、山毛榉和铁杉，这会持续一段时间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3442','determination','dɪˌtɜːrmɪˈneɪʃn','dɪ,tɜːmɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 决心, 果断','his dogged determination (= very strong determination ) to succeed  他想要成功的坚定决心'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3443','exclusively','ɪk''sklʊsɪvli','ɪk''skluːsɪvlɪ','[adv] 专门地，排除其他地','...an exclusively male domain.  …一个由男性独占的领域。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3444','quotation','kwo''teʃən','kwə(ʊ)''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 引文,引语','The following quotation is taken from a nineteenth century travel diary.  下文引自19世纪的一篇旅行日记。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3445','discern','dɪ''sɝn','dɪ''sɜːn','[v] 察觉出,识别',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3446','professor','prə''fɛsɚ','prə''fesə','[n] 教授','The professor improvised a poem in the class.  教授在课堂上即兴创作了一首诗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3447','deposition',',dɛpə''zɪʃən',',depə''zɪʃ(ə)n; diː-','[n] 沉积, 免职','the deposition of marine sediments  海洋沉积物的沉积'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3448','handful','''hænd,fʊl','''hæn(d)fʊl; -f(ə)l','[n] 一把, 少数','There were only a handful of people there.  那里只有几个人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3449','flaw','flɔ','flɔː','[n] 缺点，瑕疵','A design flaw (= a mistake or weakness in the way something was made ) caused the engine to explode.  一个设计缺陷导致了引擎爆炸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3450','shuttle','''ʃʌtl','''ʃʌt(ə)l','[n] 航天飞机；梭子 v穿梭来回(运送)','He took the Washington - New York shuttle.  他乘坐华盛顿－纽约的往返班机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3451','necessity','nə''sɛsəti','nɪ''sesɪtɪ','[n] 需要,必需品','She saw books as a necessity, not a luxury.  她视书籍为必需品而非奢侈品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3452','reasonably','''riznəbli','''riːznəblɪ','[adv] 有理地；合理地','He can’t reasonably be expected to have known that.  按理说，他是不可能知道那件事的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3453','chill','tʃɪl','tʃɪl','[v] 使变冷(冷冻) n寒冷','a glass of chilled white wine  一杯冰镇白葡萄酒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3454','pink','pɪŋk','pɪŋk','[n&a] 粉红色(的)','Her room was decorated in bright pinks and purples.  她的房间装饰成明亮的粉红色和紫色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3455','ceiling','''silɪŋ','''siːlɪŋ','[n] 天花板, 上限','rooms with high ceilings  天花板很高的房间'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3456','commensalism','kə''mɛnsəlɪzəm','kə''mens(ə)lɪz(ə)m','[n] 共栖','Some associations of species are almost a form of commensalism.  有些种类的组合几乎是共栖的形式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3457','parasitism','''pærəsaɪt,ɪzm','''pærəsaɪtɪzəm','[n] 寄生状态, 寄生病',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3458','outdoor','''aʊt''dɔr','''aʊtdɔː','[adj] 室外的, 户外的','a huge outdoor market  一个规模庞大的露天市场'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3459','blanket','''blæŋkɪt','''blæŋkɪt','[n] 毯子','She huddled herself in the blanket.  她用毯子紧紧裹住自己。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3460','modernize','mɑdɚnˌaɪz','ˈmɒdənaɪz','[v] 使现代化','They need more funds to modernize the country’s telephone system.  他们需要更多的资金将本国的电话系统现代化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3461','boredom','''bɔrdəm','''bɔːdəm','[n] 厌倦','a game to relieve the boredom of a long journey  长途旅行中解闷的一个游戏'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3462','somewhere','''sʌmwɛr','''sʌmweə','[adv] 某处, 在某处','My wallet must be around here somewhere.  我的钱包肯定是在这里的什么地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3463','happiness','ˈhæpinəs','ˈhæpinəs','[n] 幸福, 快乐','Juliet’s eyes shone with happiness.  朱丽叶的双眼闪耀着幸福的光芒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3464','currency','ˈkɜrənsi','''kʌr(ə)nsɪ','[n] 流通','The bank can supply you with foreign currency .  这家银行能为你提供外币。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3465','county','''kaʊnti','''kaʊntɪ','[n] 县, 郡','Fairfax County, Virginia  弗吉尼亚州费尔法克斯县'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3466','correspondence',',kɔrə''spɑndəns','kɒrɪ''spɒnd(ə)ns','[n] 通信, 信件, 相符','A secretary came in twice a week to deal with his correspondence.  一个秘书每个星期来两次处理他的信件。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3467','confidence','''kɑnfɪdəns','''kɒnfɪd(ə)ns','[n] 信心','I felt I was doing well and my confidence began to grow.  我觉得自己干得不错，自信心就开始增加了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3468','coverage','''kʌvərɪdʒ','''kʌv(ə)rɪdʒ','[n] 覆盖','More satellites are needed to provide telephone coverage in remote areas.  需要更多的人造衞星覆盖边远地区的电话服务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3469','botany','''bɑtəni','''bɒt(ə)nɪ','[n] 植物学','To what degree are you interested in botany?  你对植物学的兴趣达到什么程度?'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3470','seemingly','''simɪŋli','''siːmɪŋlɪ','[adv] 表面上地','seemingly unrelated bits of information  似乎互不相关的零星信息'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3471','feminist','''fɛmənɪst','''femənɪst','[n] 男女平等主义者','She’s been an outspoken feminist for over twenty years.  20多年来，她一直是个直言不讳的女权主义者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3472','radium','''redɪəm','''reɪdɪəm','[n] [化]镭','Madame Curie discovered radium.  居里夫人发现了镭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3473','transmit','trænzˈmɪt','trænz''mɪt; trɑːnz-; -ns-','[v] 传送,传达','The US Open will be transmitted live via satellite.  美国公开赛将通过卫星现场直播。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3474','persist','pɚ''sɪst','pə''sɪst','[v] 坚持, 持续','‘I don’t think it’s right,’ John persisted.  “我认为那不对。”约翰坚持说道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3475','warrior','''wɔrɪɚ','''wɒrɪə','[n] 勇士，武士','a noble warrior  忠勇的战士'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3476','portable','''pɔrtəbl','''pɔːtəb(ə)l','[adj] 便于携带的,轻便的','a portable radio  便携式收音机'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3477','gentle','''dʒɛntl','''dʒent(ə)l','[adj] 温和的, 文雅的','Arthur was a very gentle, caring person.  阿瑟是一个非常温柔体贴的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3478','swift','swɪft','swɪft','[adj] 迅速的,敏捷的','My letter received a swift reply.  我的信很快就得到了回复。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3479','suspect','sʌspɛkt; (for v.) səˈspɛkt','ˈsʌspekt; (for v.) səˈspekt','[v] 推测,怀疑','She strongly suspected he was lying to her.  她非常怀疑他在对她撒谎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3480','sleepy','''slipi','''sliːpɪ','[adj] 困乏的,欲睡的','The warmth from the fire made her feel sleepy.  暖洋洋的炉火使她昏昏欲睡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3481','weakness','''wiknəs','ˈwiːknəs','[n] 虚弱,弱点','The legislation has a fundamental weakness.  这项立法有一个根本性缺陷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3482','outgoing','''aʊt''goɪŋ','''aʊtgəʊɪŋ','[adj] 外向的','We’re looking for someone with an outgoing personality.  我们在找一个性格外向的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3483','combat','''kɑmbæt','''kɒmbæt; ''kʌm-','[n] 战斗,格斗','We flew over 200 combat missions in the war.  我们在战争中执行过两百多次战斗飞行任务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3484','dispute','''dɪs''pjʊt','dɪ''spjuːt; ''dɪspjuːt','[n&v] 争论,争端','The facts of the case are still in dispute.  案情的真相仍有争议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3485','Baltic','''bɔ:ltik','''bɔ:ltik','[n] a波罗的海的, 波罗的语的','Why we like him: For They Don''t Make This Anymore, a visually cacophonous installation at Baltic in Gateshead inspired by the world of surveillance.  为什么我们喜欢他 ：因为他们不再这样做，受监视世界的启发，在盖茨黒德波罗的海展示的看上去杂乱的装置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3486','male','mel','meɪl','[adj] 男的, 雄的','a deep male voice  低沉的男声'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3487','prevalent','''prɛvələnt','''prev(ə)l(ə)nt','[adj] 普遍的, 流行的','the prevalent belief in astrology  对占星术的普遍相信'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3488','convey','kən''ve','kən''veɪ','[v] 搬运,传达','All this information can be conveyed in a simple diagram.  所有这些信息可以通过一张简单的图表来表示。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3489','recruit','rɪ''krut','rɪ''kruːt','[v] 招募,吸收; [n] 新成员, 新兵','We’re having difficulty recruiting enough qualified staff.  我们难以招聘到足够的合格职员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3490','hereditary','hə''rɛdə''tɛri','hɪ''redɪt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 世袭的,遗传的','a hereditary peer  世袭贵族'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3491','counterpart','''kaʊntɚpɑrt','''kaʊntəpɑːt','[n] 职务相当的人,副本','As soon as he heard what was afoot, he telephoned his German and Italian counterparts to protest.  他一听到在进行中的事，马上就给德国和意大利相应人员打电话抗议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3492','personality',',pɝsə''næləti','pɜːsə''nælɪtɪ','[n] 人格,个性','Despite their different personalities, they became the best of friends.  尽管个性不同，他们还是成了最好的朋友。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3493','strut','strʌt','strʌt','[n] 高视阔步; [v] 昂首阔步地走','Peacocks strut in the surrounding meadow.  孔雀在周围的草地上昂首阔步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3494','prowl','praʊl','praʊl','[v] 巡游','gangs of teenagers prowling the streets  在大街上鬼鬼祟祟四处游荡的少年团伙'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3495','worship','''wɝʃɪp','''wə:ʃip','[n&vt] 崇拜, 爱慕','He absolutely worships her.  他太崇拜她了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3496','hat','hæt','hæt','[n] 帽子 vt戴帽子','Maria was wearing a beautiful new hat.  玛丽亚戴着一顶漂亮的新帽子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3497','avenue','''ævənu','''æv(ə)njuː','[n] 林荫道,方法','The president wants to explore every avenue towards peace in the region.  总统想探索一切途径实现该地区的和平。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3498','consensus','kən''sɛnsəs','kən''sensəs','[n] 一致，同意','The EU Council of Finance Ministers failed to reach a consensus on the pace of integration.  欧盟财政部长会议未能就一体化的进度达成共识。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3499','sugar','''ʃʊgɚ','''ʃʊgə','[n] 糖','Do you take sugar in your coffee?  你的咖啡加糖吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3500','ethic','''ɛθɪk','''eθɪk','[n] 道德规范','The old ethic of hard work has given way to a new ethic of instant gratification.  旧有的崇尚勤勉的道德观已被及时行乐的新观念所取代。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3501','individualistic','ˌɪndɪˌvɪdʒʊr''lɪstɪk',',ɪndɪvɪdjʊə''lɪstɪk','[adj] 个人主义的','Most artists are very individualistic.  大多数艺术家都非常我行我素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3502','stylistic','staɪ''lɪstɪk','staɪ''lɪstɪk','[adj] 风格上的,文体上','the sculptor’s stylistic development  这位雕刻家艺术风格上的发展'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3503','eka','','','[n] 准(第一)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3504','check','tʃɛk','tʃek','[v] 检查; [n] 核对,支票','Check the tiles carefully before you buy them.  购买之前要把瓷砖仔细检查一下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3505','cabin','''kæbɪn','''kæbɪn','[n] 小屋, 船舱','a log cabin  原木小屋'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3506','convenient','kən''vinɪənt','kən''viːnɪənt','[adj] 便利的,方便的','Mail-order catalogs are a convenient way to shop.  使用邮购目录是一种方便的购物方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3507','geography','dʒɪ''ɑɡrəfi','dʒɪ''ɒgrəfɪ','[n] 地理(学)','a geography lesson  地理课'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3508','bottle','''bɑtl','''bɒt(ə)l','[n] 瓶子 vt用瓶装','an empty bottle  一个空瓶子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3509','exaggeration','ɪɡ,zædʒə''reʃən','ɪg,zædʒə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 夸张','It would be an exaggeration to say that we were close friends.  说我们是密友不免言过其实了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3510','hamper','''hæmpɚ','''hæmpə','[v] 妨碍, 牵制','She tried to run, but was hampered by her heavy suitcase.  她想跑，但沉重的旅行箱拖累了她。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3511','unpleasant','ʌn''plɛznt','ʌn''plez(ə)nt','[adj] 不愉快的；不合意的','an unpleasant experience  不愉快的经历'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3512','softwood','''sɔftwʊd','''sɒf(t)wʊd','[n] 软木材','It would be better to use softwood, which grows in cooler climes in sustainably managed forests.  因此，更好的办法是使用软木，软木生长在更凉爽的气候区，并且容易再生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3513','arsenic','''ɑrsnɪk','''ɑːs(ə)nɪk','[n] [化]砷, 砒霜','His wife poisoned him with arsenic.  他妻子用砒霜把他毒死了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3514','bean','bin','biːn','[n] 豆, 豆形果实','baked beans  烘豆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3515','slate','slet','sleɪt','[n] 板岩,石板','There were several slates missing from the roof.  房顶有几块石板瓦掉了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3516','reptilian','rɛp''tɪlɪən','rep''tɪlɪən','[n] 爬行类动物','A man who switches on his emotions is more likely to go into a reptilian mode and lash out vocally or become aggressive.  情绪变化的男人更可能进入爬虫类动物模式，进行口头攻击或变得咄咄逼人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3517','overirrigation','','','[n] 过量灌溉',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3518','bold','bold','bəʊld','[adj] 大胆的, 无礼的','In a surprisingly bold move , he is threatening court action against the company.  他出人意料地做出一个大胆举动，威胁要起诉这家公司。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3519','conclusive','kən''klusɪv','kən''kluːsɪv','[adj] 决定性的,结论性的','If you want change in your life to be permanent, strong, and conclusive you need a support group.   如果你想在生命中有永久的、牢固的、决定性的改变，你需要一个支持小组。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3520','file','faɪl','faɪl','[n] 文档 vt登记备案 ,提出','We will keep your details on file (= store them for later use ) .  我们将把你的详细资料存档。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3521','honeybee','''hʌnɪbi','''hʌnɪbiː','[n] 蜜蜂','When a honeybee takes its first flight, it immediately releases its strong smelling meconium.  蜕变后的蜜蜂第一次起飞时，它会立刻将难闻的“蛹便”丢弃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3522','satiric','sə''tɪrɪk','','[adj] 讽刺的,挖苦的','Of or relating to a genre of prose fiction that originated in Spain and depicts in realistic detail the adventures of a roguish hero, often with satiric or humorous effects.  流浪汉体裁小说的流浪汉体裁小说的，这种叙述性小说体源于西班牙，以现实主义的细节描写了一个流浪汉式主人公的历险，通常具有讽刺或幽默的效果；或关于这种小说的'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3523','refresh','ri''frɛʃ','rɪ''freʃ','[v] (使)精神振作,(使)恢复活力','A shower will refresh you.  洗个淋浴你就凉快了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3524','starvation','stɑr''veʃən','stɑː''veɪʃn','[n] 饥饿, 饿死','people dying of starvation  快饿死的人们'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3525','personally','''pə:sənəli','''pɜːs(ə)n(ə)lɪ','[adv] 亲自；就个人来说','Personally, I don’t think much of the idea.  就个人而言，我认为这个主意不怎么样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3526','spruce','sprʊs','spruːs','[n] 云杉','Trees such as spruce, pine, and oak have been planted.  像云杉、松树和橡树之类的树已经种了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3527','comprehend',',kɑmprɪ''hɛnd','kɒmprɪ''hend','[v] 理解，领会','She cannot comprehend the extent of the disaster.  她无法理解这场灾难的严重程度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3528','diffusion','dɪ''fjʊʒən','dɪ''fjuːʒ(ə)n','[n] 传播，散布','The invention of printing helped the diffusion of learning.  印刷术的发明有助于知识的传播。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3529','differentiate',',dɪfə''rɛnʃɪet',',dɪfə''renʃɪeɪt','[v] 区分 ,区别','A child may not differentiate between his imagination and the real world.  孩子也许无法区分想像与真实世界的差别。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3530','radical','''rædɪkl','''rædɪk(ə)l','[adj] 根本的；激进的 n激进分子',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3531','whenever','wɛn''ɛvɚ','wen''evə','[conj] 无论何时，随时','They were always there by you， whenever you needed them.  无论何时你需要他们，他们总是在你身边。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3532','stiffen','''stɪfn','''stɪf(ə)n','[v] 弄硬；加强','a campaign to stiffen rules against drink-driving  要求对酒后驾车严加管制的运动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3533','simulate','''sɪmjulet','''sɪmjʊleɪt','[v] 模拟, 模仿','a machine that simulates conditions in space  一台模拟太空环境的机器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3534','fetus','''fitəs','''fiːtəs','[n] 胎儿','Pregnant women who are heavy drinkers risk damaging the unborn fetus.  酗酒的孕妇冒有伤害胎儿的危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3535','feeder','''fidɚ','''fiːdə','[n] 饲养员','The feeder fed new feed to pigs so that they laid on fresh.  饲养员用新饲料喂猪好让它们长肉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3536','reminder','rɪ''maɪndɚ','rɪ''maɪndə','[n] 提醒物；暗示','The last thing you''d want is a constant reminder of a bad experience.  你最不想要的就是不断让你想起一段糟糕经历的东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3537','foodstuff','''fudstʌf','''fuːdstʌf','[n] 食品, 粮食','a shortage of basic foodstuffs  基本食品短缺'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3538','shepherd','''ʃɛpɚd','''ʃepəd','[n] 牧羊人; [v] 带领，引导','In comparison, a German shepherd has a biting pressure of 750 pounds per square inch.  相比较，德国牧羊犬在咬牙时每平方英寸大约有750英镑的压力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3539','pine','paɪn','paɪn','[n] 松(树) vi消瘦','an ancient pine forest  一片古老的松树林'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3540','informant','ɪn''fɔrmənt','ɪn''fɔːmənt','[n] 通知者, 告密者','One of the witnesses was a paid informant for the FBI.  目击者之一是联邦调查局出钱雇用的线人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3541','allocate','''æləket','''æləkeɪt','[v] 分派, 分配','Tickets are limited and will be allocated to those who apply first.  票数有限，将分配给那些先申请的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3542','cedar','''sidɚ','''siːdə','[n] 雪松','The yacht is built of cedar strip planking.  这艘游艇用雪松木板材制成。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3543','vanish','''vænɪʃ','''vænɪʃ','[v] 消失','My keys were here a minute ago but now they’ve vanished.  我的钥匙刚刚还在这里，现在却不翼而飞了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3544','slab','slæb','slæb','[n] 厚板，平板','a concrete slab  水泥板'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3545','coexist',',koɪɡ''zɪst',',kəʊɪg''zɪst','[v] 共存','But I think both can coexist.  但是我认为两者可以共存。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3546','marble','''mɑrbl','''mɑːb(ə)l','[n] 大理石','The columns were of white marble.  柱子是白色的大理石。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3547','moose','mus','muːs','[n] [动] 驼鹿','So did we encounter our bear, or a moose?  那么，我们到底遇到了熊或者麋鹿吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3548','cod','','kɒd','[abbr] 货到付款 (Cash on Delivery) n鳕鱼',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3549','migrant','''maɪɡrənt','''maɪgr(ə)nt','[n] 移居者, 候鸟','The government divides asylum seekers into economic migrants and genuine refugees.  政府将寻求政治庇护的人划分为经济移民和真正的难民。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3550','aviation',',evɪ''eʃən','eɪvɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 航空,飞机制造业','...the aviation industry.  …航空工业。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3551','frontal','''frʌntl','''frʌnt(ə)l','[n] 前沿','By monitoring their brain waves, he saw a pattern of high frequency neural activity in the right frontal cortex that identified in advance who would solve a puzzle through insight and who would not.   通过脑电波监测，他发现这些人在解开谜语之前，其右额叶皮质会出现一种高频率的神经活动，通常在得出答案的八秒钟甚至更短的时间内发生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3552','hexagonal','hɛk''sægənl','hek''sæɡənəl','[adj] 六角形的,六边的','Instead it is the Desert Express that pulls in, its nine coaches in smart blue, orange and white livery with large hexagonal windows.  然而驶进车站的是沙漠快车，它的九节车厢漆成漂亮的蓝色、橙色和白色，带有六边形的车窗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3553','journal','''dʒɝnl','''dʒɜːn(ə)l','[n] 定期刊物, 杂志','the British Medical Journal  《英国医学杂志》'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3554','assure','ə''ʃʊr','ə''ʃʊə; ə''ʃɔː','[v] 使确信, 确保','The document is genuine, I can assure you .  我能向你保证，这文件是真的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3555','sizable','''saɪzəbl','''saɪzəbl','[adj] 相当大的','Harry inherited the house and a sizable piece of land that surrounds it.  哈里继承了那座房子和房子周围一块相当大的土地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3556','decompose',',dikəm''poz','diːkəm''pəʊz','[v] (使)腐烂','a partially decomposed body  部分腐烂的尸体'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3557','scout','skaʊt','skaʊt','[n] 侦察员 vi侦察','He sent three scouts ahead to take a look at the bridge.  他派出三名侦察兵到前面侦察大桥的情况。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3558','mineralization','','','[n] 矿化作用,成矿作用',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3559','krypton','''krɪp''tɑn','''krɪptɒn','[n] [化] 氪','Xenon and krypton are not retained by the body so they have little effect.  氙和氪不能在人体内停留所以对人体影响很小。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3560','diminish','dɪ''mɪnɪʃ','dɪ''mɪnɪʃ','[v] (使)减少, (使)变小','The party’s share of the electorate has diminished steadily.  支持这个政党的选民比例持续下降。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3561','residual','rɪ''zɪdʒuəl','rɪ''zɪdjʊəl','[adj] 剩余的, 残留的','the residual effects of drug treatment  药物治疗的残留作用'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3562','chlorophyll','''klɔrəfɪl','''klɔːrəfɪl; ''klɒ-','[n] [生化]叶绿素','The chlorophyll in wheatgrass also helps to purify the liver.  麦草中的叶绿素同样可以帮助净化肝脏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3563','xenon','''zinɑn','''zenɒn; ''ziː-','[n] 氙(惰性气体的一种,元素符号Xe)','The krypton and xenon isotope ratios in the gas samples provided a surprising result: They did not match the ratios found in the primordial cloud that spawned the solar system.  气体采样中的氪和氙同位素比值产生了一个令人吃惊的结果：这些比值跟在形成太阳系的原始云团中所发现的比值不一致。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3564','coil','kɔɪl','kɒɪl','[v] 盘绕, 卷','The snake coiled around the branches of the tree.  这条蛇盘在树枝上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3565','penicillin',',pɛnɪ''sɪlɪn','penɪ''sɪlɪn','[n] [微]青霉素（一种抗菌素，音译名为盘尼西林）','He reacted well to penicillin.  他对青霉素的反应良好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3566','homestead','''homstɛd','''həʊmsted','[n] 家宅，宅基','He looked around, not just up the road but toward the homestead and edge of the woods.  他向四周看了看，看了看路上也看了看宅基地和树林的边缘。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3567','prestigious','prɛ''stɪdʒəs','pre''stɪdʒəs','[adj] 享有声望的','a prestigious literary award  享有盛名的文学奖'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3568','frustration','frʌ''streʃən','frʌ''streɪʃn','[n] 挫败, 挫折','There are moments when he feels great frustration and it bursts out of him.  会有这样的时刻:当他感觉很好挫折和它爆发出来了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3569','servant','''sɝvənt','''sɜːv(ə)nt','[n] 仆人','Many young girls became domestic servants .  许多年轻姑娘成了家仆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3570','imitative','''ɪmɪtetɪv','''ɪmɪtətɪv','[adj] 仿制的,模仿的','Young people might be provoked into imitative crime by the exploits they see on TV.  年轻人可能会从电视上看到的“英勇行为”中受到启发而仿效电视主人公实施犯罪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3571','lesson','''lɛsn','''les(ə)n','[n] 功课','piano lessons  钢琴课'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3572','incubate','''ɪŋkjubet','''ɪŋkjʊbeɪt','[v] 孵卵','The birds returned to their nests and continued to incubate the eggs.  那些鸟儿返巢继续孵卵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3573','hectare','''hɛktɛr','''hekteə; -ɑː','[n] 公顷（等于1万平方米）','Mist rose from a nearby stand of thriving eucalyptus trees she planted after receiving title to more than a hectare of farmland.  雾气从附近生长繁茂的桉树林中升起，这些树是她在获得对一公顷多农田的所有权后栽种的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3574','alert','ə''lɝt','ə''lɜːt','[adj] 警觉的n戒备','The animal raised its head, suddenly alert.  那只动物突然警觉地抬起头来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3575','committee','kə''mɪti','kə''mɪtɪ','[n] 委员会','a committee meeting  委员会会议'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3576','chocolate','''tʃɑklət','''tʃɒk(ə)lət','[n] 巧克力','a chocolate bar  巧克力条'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3577','loosely','''lusli','''lu:slɪ','[adv] 松散地','If you actually combine the best ideas of both, you end up with an extensible and modular and loosely coupled system.  如果你真的结合二者的最佳思想，就可以得到一个可扩展的、模块化的、松散耦合的系统。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3578','creator','krɪ''etɚ','kriː''eɪtə','[n] 创建者, 创作者','...Ian Fleming, the creator of James Bond.  …伊恩·弗莱明，詹姆斯·邦德的创作者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3579','dirt','dɝt','dɜːt','[n] 污垢, 泥土','You should have seen the dirt on that car!  你没看见那车上沾了多少泥！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3580','Asian','ˈeʒən, ˈeʃən','''eiʃən','[n&a] 亚洲(的), 亚洲人(的)','Many of the shops were run by Asians.  这些商店中有许多是由亚洲人经营的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3581','enthusiastic','ɪn,θuzɪ''æstɪk','ɪn,θjuːzɪ''æstɪk; en-','[adj] 热心的, 热情的','an enthusiastic supporter of reform  改革的热心支持者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3582','proof','pruf','pruːf','[n] 证据，证明','There is no proof that the document is authentic.  没有证据证明这份文件是真的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3583','infrastructure','''ɪnfrə''strʌktʃɚ','''ɪnfrəstrʌktʃə','[n] 下部构造,基础下部组织','Some countries lack a suitable economic infrastructure.  一些国家缺乏适当的经济基础设施。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3584','novelist','''nɑvlɪst','''nɒv(ə)lɪst','[n] (长篇)小说家','The key to success as a romantic novelist is absolute belief in your story.  一个浪漫派小说家成功的关键在于对自己故事的绝对信念。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3585','peruvian','','','[n&a] 秘鲁人(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3586','static','''stætɪk','''stætɪk','[adj] 静态的, 静止的','Economists predict that house prices will remain static for a long period.  经济学家预测，房价将长期保持稳定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3587','osprey','''ɑspre','''ɒsprɪ; -preɪ','[n] 白色的羽毛, 鱼鹰',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3588','Scotland','''skɔtlənd','''skɔtlənd','[n] 苏格兰(英国的一部分,在不列颠北部)','He traveled Scotland last year.  他去年在苏格兰旅行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3589','underneath',',ʌndɚ''niθ','ʌndə''niːθ','[adv] 在下面 prep在的下面','He has on his jeans and a long-sleeved blue denim shirt with a white T-shirt underneath.  他身穿牛仔裤和一件蓝色长袖粗斜纹棉布衬衫，里面还有件白色T恤衫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3590','pillar','''pɪlɚ','''pɪlə','[n] 柱子, 栋梁','Mr Fitzwilliam had been seen as a pillar of the community.  菲茨威廉先生已被视为社区的骨干。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3591','affection','ə''fɛkʃən','ə''fekʃ(ə)n','[n] 影响, 感情','Caroline is the object of his affections.  卡罗琳是他感情的归属。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3592','someone','''sʌmwʌn','''sʌmwʌn','[pron] 有人, 某人','What would you do if someone tried to rob you in the street?  要是有人在街上抢劫你，你会怎么办？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3593','kneel','nil','niːl','[v] 跪下','Tom knelt down and patted the dog.  汤姆跪下来轻轻拍了拍那只狗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3594','evaluation','ɪ,væljʊ''eʃən','ɪˌvæljuˈeɪʃn','[n] 估价, 评价','We need to carry out a proper evaluation of the new system.  我们要对新系统进行合理的评估。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3595','huckleberry','''hʌkl''bɛri','''hʌk(ə)lb(ə)rɪ','[n] 越橘类','Groves of stunted red spruce, huckleberry, blueberry, mountain laurel, mountain holly, speckled alder, and cranberry bogs, show combinations of colors throughout the year.  发育不良云杉的小树林、黑果木、蓝莓、山月桂、山冬青，斑点桤木和种越橘的沼泽地，显示着全年各种颜色的组合。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3596','elk','ɛlk','elk','[n] 麋鹿','I covered the elk with a tarp and sat down near it, wrapping myself in blankets.  我用一块防水布盖住了麋鹿，然后用毯子把自己裹起来，坐在它旁边。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3597','darken','''dɑrkən','''dɑːk(ə)n','[v] (使)变暗','The sky darkened and a few drops of rain fell.  天色变暗，落下几滴雨来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3598','suffer','''sʌfɚ','''sʌfə','[v] 遭受, 经历','At least he died suddenly and didn’t suffer.  至少他死得突然，没有遭罪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3599','jaw','dʒɔ','dʒɔː','[n] 颚,下巴','He punched him on the jaw.  他一拳打在他的下巴上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3600','hardship','''hɑrdʃɪp','''hɑːdʃɪp','[n] 困苦, 艰难','an economic policy that caused great hardship for many people  造成许多人贫困的经济政策'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3601','historically','his''tɔrikəli','hɪ''stɒrɪklɪ','[adv] 历史上地','And historically they acted with that sense of stewardship in mind, thinking of what was appropriate for the whole system and not simply for their firm.  而且在历史上，他们也在心目中带有那种使命感，思考的是什么对这个社会是最好的，不仅仅是对自己的公司。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3602','disorient','dɪsˈɔriˌɛnt, -ˈor-','dɪs''ɔ:rɪent','[v] 使失去方向感, 使迷惑',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3603','anthocyanin',',ænθə''saɪənɪn',',ænθə(ʊ)''saɪənɪn','[n] [植]花青素, [化]花色醣苔','Smith says that some species, most famously maples, produce anthocyanin during autumn as a kind of antioxidant for trees.  史密斯说，一些物种，例如最有名的枫树，在秋天会产生的一种抗氧化剂的花青素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3604','acidic','ə''sɪdɪk','ə''sɪdɪk','[adj] 酸的,酸性的','Some fruit juices taste a bit acidic.  有些果汁味道略酸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3605','elder','''ɛldɚ','''eldə','[n] 年长者, 老人','a meeting of the village elders  村里长辈们的集会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3606','modification',',mɑdɪfɪ''keʃən',',mɒdɪfɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 更改, 修改','They have used the same process for almost 50 years with only minor modifications .  同样的工序他们用了将近50年，期间只做过很小的改动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3607','anyone','''ɛnɪ''wʌn','''enɪwʌn','[pron] 任何一个','Anyone could win tonight.  今晚任何人都可能赢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3608','fingerboard','','''fɪŋgəbɔːd','[n] 键盘','I''m just doing it with a series of switches instead of a fingerboard, which we obviously don''t have-- Okay. That''s fine. That''s great.  只是我用的是阀键,代替圆号上很明显没有的指板,好的,很棒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3609','watercraft','''wɔtəkræft','''wɒtəkræːft','[n] 船只','Either way it seems certain that these people were using quite sophisticated technology and watercraft to fish offshore.  不管人们用的那种方法抓鱼，似乎可以肯定，那些人使用了娴熟的技术和船只。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3610','buildup','','''bɪldʌp','[n] 集结, 增长',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3611','varnish','''vɑrnɪʃ','''vɑːnɪʃ','[n] 清漆；光泽; [v] 涂清漆，使光亮','The varnish comes in six natural wood shades.  这种清漆有6种天然木材的色泽可选。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3612','warfare','''wɔrfɛr','''wɔːfeə','[n] 战争, 作战, 冲突, 竞争','the realities of modern warfare  现代战争的真实面貌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3613','cop','kɑp','kɒp','[n] 警官, 巡警','the local cop  本地警察'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3614','symbiosis',',sɪmbaɪ''osɪs',',sɪmbɪ''əʊsɪs; -baɪ-','[n] [生]共生(现象),合作关系','...the link between bacteria, symbiosis, and the evolution of plants and animals.  ...细菌、共生和动植物进化间的联系。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3615','presidential','''prɛzədɛnʃəl',',prezɪ''denʃəl','[adj] 总统的','a presidential election  总统大选'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3616','sponge','spʌndʒ','spʌn(d)ʒ','[n] 海绵 vt擦','a Victoria sponge  维多利亚海绵蛋糕'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3617','gut','ɡʌt','gʌt','[n] 内脏','By the time they finish, the crewmen are standing ankle-deep in fish guts.  到他们结束时，船员们正站在齐脚踝深的鱼内脏堆里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3618','Russia','''rʌʃə','''rʌʃə','[n] 俄罗斯','This program is beamed at Russia.  这套节目是对俄罗斯广播的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3619','powder','''paʊdɚ','''paʊdə','[n] 粉(末) v搽粉,撒粉','curry powder  咖喱粉'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3620','organizational','ˌɔːrɡənəˈzeɪʃənl','ˌɔːɡənaɪˈzeɪʃənl','[adj] 组织的','Evelyn''s excellent organizational skills were soon spotted by her employers.  伊夫琳出色的组织才干很快就被她的雇主发现了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3621','abruptly','ə''brʌptli','ə''brʌptli','[adv] 突然地；粗鲁地','The ground rises abruptly.  地势突然隆起。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3622','administrative','əd''mɪnɪstretɪv','əd''mɪnɪstrətɪv','[adj] 管理的，行政的','The job is mainly administrative.  这份工作主要是行政方面的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3623','hypothetical',',haɪpə''θɛtɪkl',',haɪpə''θetɪk(ə)l','[adj] 假说的，臆说的','The question is purely hypothetical .  这个问题完全基于假设。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3624','pastoral','''pæstərəl','''pɑːst(ə)r(ə)l','[adj] 田园生活的，宁静的','a charming pastoral scene  迷人的田园景象'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3625','overtime',',ovə''taɪm','''əʊvətaɪm','[n] 超时','six hours’ overtime  六小时的加班'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3626','interglacial',',ɪntɚ''gleʃəl','ɪntə''gleɪsɪəl; -ʃ(ə)l','[adj] 间冰期的','This new investigation shows temperature ''spikes'' within some of the interglacial periods over the last 340,000 years.  这项新的调查显示在过去的340,000年气温都“被钉在”间冰期内。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3627','bias','''baɪəs','''baɪəs','[n] 偏见vt使存偏见','Students were evaluated without bias.  对学生的评估都是公正的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3628','ahead','ə''hɛd','ə''hed','[a&ad] 在前, 向前',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3629','lamp','læmp','læmp','[n] 灯','She switched on the bedside lamp.  她打开了床头灯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3630','conform','kən''fɔrm','kən''fɔːm','[v] 使一致, 遵从',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3631','detractor','dɪ''træktɚ','','[n] 诽谤者','The attack took many by surprise, because few had anticipated that the major detractor of the faith would be one of our own.  这一攻击使许多人非常惊奇，因为很少人料想到信仰的主要诽谤者竟是我们自己中间的一位。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3632','timescale','','','[n] 时标, 时间量程','The timescale for completing the work would be fairly tight.  完成这项工作的时间很紧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3633','stove','stov','stəʊv','[n] 炉','a wood-burning stove  烧木柴的火炉'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3634','sailfish','''seilfiʃ','''seɪlfɪʃ','[n] 旗鱼','A fine start to the day, and my first sailfish on a fly.  这一天的开局真不错，这也是我第一次用飞杆钓到旗鱼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3635','marlin','''mɑrlɪn','''mɑːlɪn','[n] 枪鱼','He drank a little water before he lashed the marlin to bow and stern of his skiff.  他喝了一点水，然后把马林鱼捆绑在他那条小船的头部和尾部。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3636','swordfish','''sɔrdfɪʃ','''sɔːdfɪʃ','[n] 旗鱼','...grilled swordfish with a yoghurt dressing.  ...浇上酸奶酪的烤箭鱼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3637','commit','kə''mɪt','kə''mɪt','[v] 犯罪, 承诺, 委托','Women commit fewer crimes than men.  女性犯罪比男性少。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3638','renewal','rɪ''nuəl','rɪ''njuːəl','[n] 更新, 恢复','Mark’s contract comes up for renewal at the end of this year.  马克的合同将在今年年末到期，需要续签。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3639','false','fɔls','fɔːls; fɒls','[adj] 错误的；假的','Please decide whether the following statements are true or false .  请判断以下说法的对错。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3640','Eurasian','juə''reiʃən','juə''reiʃən','[adj] 欧亚的, 欧亚人的','...the whole of the Eurasian continent.  ...整个欧亚大陆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3641','tolerant','''tɑlərənt','''tɒl(ə)r(ə)nt','[adj] 宽容的, 容忍的','a tolerant society  宽容的社会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3642','dull','dʌl','dʌl','[adj] 乏味的；阴沉的','Life is never dull when Elizabeth is here.  有伊丽莎白在这里生活绝不会无聊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3643','depress','dɪ''prɛs','dɪ''pres','[v] 使沮丧, 使消沉','The thought of taking the exam again depressed him.  想到要补考，他就心情沮丧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3644','fortunate','''fɔrtʃənət','''fɔːtʃ(ə)nət','[adj] 幸运的, 侥幸的','By a fortunate coincidence, a passer-by heard her cries for help.  所幸正巧有个过路人听到了她的呼救。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3645','buoyant','''bujənt','''bɒɪənt','[adj] 有浮力的, 轻快的','Cork is very buoyant.  软木浮性很好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3646','slick','slɪk','slɪk','[adj] 圆滑的；精巧的','a slick used-car salesman  油嘴滑舌的二手车推销员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3647','shine','ʃaɪn','ʃaɪn','[v] 照耀,发光 n光泽','The sun was shining .  阳光照耀。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3648','kinship','''kɪnʃɪp','''kɪnʃɪp','[n] 血族关系','the ties of kinship  亲属关系'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3649','helpful','''hɛlpfl','''helpfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 有益的；给予帮助的','Thank you for your advice; it’s been very helpful.  谢谢你的建议，它非常有用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3650','domestication','də,mɛstə''keʃən','dəʊ,mestɪkeɪʃən','[n] 驯养, 教化','They might be the result of human domestication, institutionalization, or public schooling.  它们可能是人类教化、制度化或公共教育的结果。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3651','blur','blɝ','blɜː','[v] 弄脏; [n] 污点, 模糊','The island was a blur through misty rain.  小岛在蒙蒙烟雨中影影绰绰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3652','replenish','rɪ''plɛnɪʃ','rɪ''plenɪʃ','[v] 补充','More vaccines are needed to replenish our stocks.  还需要更多的疫苗来补充我们的储备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3653','fellowship','''fɛloʃɪp','''felə(ʊ)ʃɪp','[n] 伙伴关系',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3654','tutelage','''tʊtəlɪdʒ','''tjuːtɪlɪdʒ','[n] 监护','parental tutelage  父母的监护'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3655','freudian','''frɔidjən','''frɔidjən','[n] n&a,佛洛伊德学说(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3656','controversy','ˈkɑːntrəvɜːrsi','''kɒntrəvɜːsɪ; kən''trɒvəsɪ','[n] 论争, 辩论','a political controversy  政治争议'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3657','blubber','''blʌbɚ','''blʌbə','[n] 鲸脂,哭号v哭号',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3658','basalt','bə''sɔlt','''bæsɔːlt; -(ə)lt','[n] 玄武岩','But under the water, volcanoes continued to erupt, sending up magma and forming mountains of basalt.  但是在水下，火山依旧喷发，滚滚岩浆形成了玄武岩的山脉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3659','predation','prɪ''deʃən','prɪ''deɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 掠食','We think of these strategies as having been in response to competition and in response to predation.  我们认为，它们的这种生存策略是为了应对生存竞争和其他生物的捕食。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3660','qualification',',kwɑlɪfɪ''keʃən',',kwɒlɪfɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 资格, 条件','He left school without any qualifications.  他离校时没有拿到任何文凭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3661','perish','''pɛrɪʃ','''perɪʃ','[v] 丧生，消亡','Hundreds perished when the ship went down.  轮船沉没，数百人罹难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3662','photographer','fə''tɑgrəfɚ','fə''tɒgrəfə','[n] 摄影师','a fashion photographer  时装摄影师'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3663','boule','bʊl','buːl','[n] 人造宝石，议会',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3664','Berlin','bɝ''lɪn','bə:''lin','[n] 柏林[德国]','He captained the siege of Berlin.  他指挥了围攻柏林的战役。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3665','trance','træns','trɑːns','[n&v] 恍惚；出神','The old man was in a trance, thinking of his past life.  这位老人回想着自己过去的生活， 神情恍惚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3666','opaque','o''pek','ə(ʊ)''peɪk','[adj] 不透明的,难懂的','a shower with an opaque glass door  装有不透明玻璃门的淋浴间'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3667','vigorously','''vɪgərəsli','''vɪg(ə)rəslɪ','[adv] 精力旺盛地；健壮地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3668','lease','lis','liːs','[n] 租赁vt出租,租得','The landlord refused to renew his lease.  房东拒绝和他续签租约。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3669','brightly','''braɪtlɪ','''braɪtlɪ','[adv] 明亮地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3670','underlies',',ʌndɚ''laɪ','ʌndə''laɪ','[v] 位于之下, 成为的基础','Try to figure out what feeling underlies your anger.  设法找出什么情绪是你生气的原因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3671','telecommunication',',tɛlɪkə,mjʊnə''keʃən',',telɪkəmjuːnɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 电信，远程通信','If large media and telecommunication companies decide to close their offerings to the web, I am convinced the web will route around it.  如果大型媒体和电信公司决定停止向万维网提供内容，我很确信万维网会绕过这一点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3672','recur','rɪ''kɝ','rɪ''kɜː','[v] 再发生，重现','There is a danger that the disease may recur.  这种病有复发的危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3673','reset','''risɛt','riː''set','[v] 重新安排','She was careful to reset the alarm before she left the office.  在离开办公室之前，她小心翼翼地重设了警报器。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3674','constructive','kən''strʌktɪv','kən''strʌktɪv','[adj] 建设性的,构造上的','The meeting was very constructive.  这次会议很有建设性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3675','habituation','','','[n] 适应',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3676','generalization',',dʒɛnrələ''zeʃən',',dʒenrələ''zeɪʃən','[n] 一般化, 归纳, 概括','You can’t make generalizations about what men and women are like.  男人什么样，女人什么样，不能一概而论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3677','shock','ʃɑk','ʃɒk','[n&v] 震动；震惊','She was shaking with shock and humiliation.  她又是震惊，又是羞辱，身体直发抖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3678','permanence','''pɝmənəns','''pɜːmənəns','[n] 永久, 持久','Even the permanence of America’s success in Iraq is far from guaranteed.  甚至美国在伊拉克的成功的持久性也远未得到保证。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3679','tine','taɪn','taɪn','[n] (尖)齿, 叉',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3680','vacation','vəˈkeɪʃn; veɪ-','vəˈkeɪʃn; veɪ-','[n] 假期,休假','We’re planning a vacation in Europe.  我们正计划去欧洲度假。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3681','briefly','''brifli','''briːflɪ','[adv] 简短地；简略地','We stopped off briefly in London.  我们在伦敦短暂停留。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3682','precipitate','prɪ''sɪpɪtet','prɪ''sɪpɪteɪt','[v] 促成；使沉淀 n沉淀物','The riot was precipitated when four black men were arrested.  这场骚乱是因为四名黑人男子的被捕而突然引发的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3683','Scottish','''skɔtiʃ','''skɔtiʃ','[n] 苏格兰人(的), 苏格兰语（的）','You know, Gordon, I should not like you. You are Scottish, we have nothing in common and you are an economist.  你知道吗，戈登，我不应该喜欢你，你是苏格兰人，又是个经济学家，我们没有任何共同的地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3684','Norwegian','nɔ:''wi:dʒən','nɔ:''wi:dʒən','[adj] 挪威的 n挪威人, 挪威语',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3685','lime','laɪm','laɪm','[n] 酸橙,石灰','The lime has turned to powder.  石灰已经粉了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3686','ball','bɔl','bɔːl','[n] 球, 球状物','a ball of string  线团'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3687','joiner','''dʒɔɪnɚ','''dʒɒɪnə','[n] 工匠','John Harrison, a working-class joiner with relatively little education eventually won the prize after building a series of clocks, each improving on the previous one.  一个毫不起眼、没有受过多少教育的工匠，约翰·哈里森，最终凭借一系列的发明创造和不断改良，最终获得了这笔丰厚的奖金。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3688','bulk','','','[n] (大)块,主体 vt使更大',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3689','repetition','''rɛpə''tɪʃən','repɪ''tɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 重复，反复','Children used to learn by repetition.  过去小孩子是通过背诵来学习的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3690','patronage','''pætrənɪdʒ','ˈpeɪtrənɪdʒ','[n] 赞助；光顾(买东西)','Thank you for your patronage.  感谢您的惠顾。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3691','bacterium','bæk''tɪrɪəm','bæk''tɪərɪəm','[n] 细菌','It was so large and complex, they initially assumed it was a bacterium.  由于它们是如此庞大和复杂，最初被认为是一种细菌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3692','carman','''kɑrmən','''kɑːmən','[n] 车夫,司机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3693','incise','ɪn''saɪz','ɪn''saɪz','[v] 切入, 切割','In theory, the four axis tube-end incisory robot can incise round tubes'' ends of any form.  理论上，管端切割机器人能完成任意形状的圆管端头的切割。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3694','shaft','ʃæft','ʃɑːft','[n] 柄，杆','...golf clubs with steel shafts.  …带钢柄的高尔夫球棒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3695','leak','lik','liːk','[v] (使)漏；泄露 n漏洞','The roof is leaking.  屋顶在漏水。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3696','energetic',',ɛnɚ''dʒɛtɪk',',enə''dʒetɪk','[adj] 精力充沛的,积极的','an energetic man  精力旺盛的男子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3697','restore','rɪ''stɔr','rɪ''stɔː','[v] 恢复,重建','She was hoping that the Mediterranean climate would restore her to full health.  她希望地中海的气候能使她的身体完全复原。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3698','Mexican','''mɛksɪkən','''meksɪkən','[n&a] 墨西哥(的)， 墨西哥人(的)','In fact, some even joined the Mexican force that put down his rebellion.  事实上，有些人还加入墨西哥的军队，镇压他的反叛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3699','cat','kæt','kæt','[n] 猫','The police played an elaborate game of cat and mouse to trap him.  警方跟他玩了一场精心布局的猫捉老鼠游戏，诱他落网。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3700','bit','bɪt','bɪt','[n] 一点儿，少许；小片','He’s taken the engine to bits .  他把发动机拆开了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3701','doctor','''dɑktɚ','''dɒktə','[n] 医生；博士','She was treated by her local doctor.  她由她的本区医生治疗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3702','crumple','''krʌmpl','''krʌmp(ə)l','[v] (使)皱，扭曲；(使)崩溃','Dan tore the page out, crumpled it, and threw it in the wastepaper basket.  丹把这一页撕下来揉成一团，扔进了废纸篓。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3703','equality','ɪ''kwɑləti','ɪ''kwɒlɪtɪ; iː-','[n] 等同性, 平等','...equality of the sexes.  …性别平等。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3704','developmental','dɪ,vɛləp''mɛntl','dɪ,veləp''ment(ə)l','[adj] 发展的, 进化的','the developmental stages of childhood  儿童时期的各个发育阶段'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3705','await','ə''wet','ə''weɪt','[v] 等候','Several men are awaiting trial for robbery.  几个人因抢劫正在候审。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3706','saline','''selin','''seɪlaɪn','[adj] 含盐的；咸的','saline solution  盐溶液'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3707','minimal','''mɪnɪməl','''mɪnɪm(ə)l','[adj] 最小的, 最小限度的','The storm caused only minimal damage.  暴风雨只造成了轻微破坏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3708','warmth','wɔrmθ','wɔːmθ','[n] 暖和, 温暖','She went further into the room, drawn by the warmth of the fire.  她被火的温暖吸引着，走进了房间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3709','newborn','''nubɔrn','njuː''bɔːn; ''njuːbɔːn','[n] 婴儿','Mild jaundice in the newborn is common and often clears without treatment.  新生儿有轻微的黄疸较为常见，通常会不治自愈。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3710','opposition','''ɑpə''zɪʃən','ɒpə''zɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 反对,相反','He is confident in his ability to overcome all opposition with his personal charm.  他自信有能力以个人魅力来化解一切反对力量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3711','shadow','''ʃædo','''ʃædəʊ','[n] 阴影；影子','the long dark shadow of an old oak tree  一棵老橡树长长的影子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3712','magic','''mædʒɪk','''mædʒɪk','[n] 魔术；魔力 a有魔力的','Paris has lost some of its magic for me over the years.  这些年来巴黎对我来说已不如从前那么有魅力了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3713','meal','mil','miːl','[n] 餐, 一顿饭','We must have a meal together some time.  我们一定要找个时间一起吃顿饭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3714','mechanical','mɪ''kænɪkəl','mɪ''kænɪk(ə)l','[adj] 机械的, 机械制的','The flight has been cancelled due to mechanical failure .  因机械故障航班被取消了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3715','alien','ˈeliən,ˈeljən','''eɪlɪən','[adj] 外国(人)的; [n] 外国(星)人','alien cultures  异域文化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3716','chapbook','''tʃæp,bʊk','''tʃæpbʊk','[n] 畅销故事书',''),
