('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3774','salary','''sæləri','''sælərɪ','[n] 薪水','The average salary for a teacher is $39,000 a year.  教师的平均工资是39,000美元一年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3775','collaboration','kə,læbə''reʃən','kəlæbə''reɪʃn','[n] 合作，协作','The company is building the centre in collaboration with the Institute of Offshore Engineering.  该公司正与海洋工程学院合建这座中心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3776','waterpower','','','[n] 水力(水力发电)','In the19th century waterpower was widely utilized to generate electricity.  在19世纪人们大规模使用水力来发电。'),
