('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3780','relieve','rɪ''liv','rɪ''liːv','[v] 减轻, 解除','Drugs helped to relieve the pain.  药物有助于舒缓疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3781','defensive','dɪ''fɛnsɪv','dɪ''fensɪv','[n&a] 防御(的)','This is an example of defensive programming.  这是一个防御编程的实例。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3782','equilibrium',',ikwɪ''lɪbrɪəm',',iːkwɪ''lɪbrɪəm; ,ekwɪ-','[n] 平衡','The government is anxious not to upset the economic equilibrium.  政府急切希望不要打乱经济平衡。'),
