('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3787','exocrine','''ɛksəkrɪn','''eksə(ʊ)kraɪn; -krɪn','[adj] [医]外分泌的','They hitched the genes for these three factors onto a virus that infects another type of pancreatic cell, known as an exocrine cell.  他们把这三组因子的基因搭载到一种病毒上，再用病毒感染被称作外分泌细胞的另一种类型的胰腺细胞。'),
