('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3789','formerly','''fɔrmɚli','''fɔːməlɪ','[adv] 从前, 以前','Kiribati, formerly known as the Gilbert Islands  基里巴斯，旧称吉尔伯特群岛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3790','camp','kæmp','kæmp','[n] 营地; [v] 宿营','Let’s go back to camp – it’s getting dark.  我们回营地吧，天快黑了。'),
