('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3794','aboard','ə''bɔrd','ə''bɔːd','[prep&ad] 在(船、飞机、车)上，上船','They finally went aboard the plane.  他们终于登上了飞机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3795','blend','blɛnd','blend','[v] (使)混和n混合物','Blend the sugar, eggs, and flour.  把糖、鸡蛋和面粉掺在一起。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3796','participation','pɑr,tɪsɪ''peʃən','pɑː,tɪsɪ''peɪʃn','[n] 参加，参与','Thank you for your participation.  谢谢你的参与。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3797','brass','bræs','brɑːs','[n] 黄铜(制品)','an old brass bedstead  老式黄铜床架'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3798','detectable','dɪ''tɛktəbl','','[adj] 可发现的,可察觉的','Doctors say the disease is probably inherited but not detectable at birth.  医生们说该疾病很可能是遗传的，但在出生时是不可发现的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3799','adhere','əd''hɪr','əd''hɪə','[v] 粘附,遵守','All members of the association adhere to a strict code of practice.  所有该协会的成员都遵守严格的业务守则。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3800','accommodate','ə''kɑmədet','ə''kɒmədeɪt','[v] 容纳,提供(住处),适应','He bought a huge house to accommodate his library.  他买了一座大房子来放他的藏书。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3801','toolmaker','''tʊl,mekɚ','''tuːlmeɪkə','[n] 精密工具制造者','I have the hand of the ultimate toolmaker.  我有一双终极的工具制造者的手。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3802','printmaking','''prɪnt,mekɪŋ','','[n] 版画复制(术)','Instead of relegating himself to one media, Tuominen employs photography, printmaking, and painting, often mixing the techniques together to conjure the impression of memory.  托米能不仅仅局限于一种媒介而是涉及了摄影，版画和绘画，通常混合各种手法来召唤记忆的印象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3803','populous','''pɑpjələs','''pɒpjʊləs','[adj] 人口稠密的','Hong Kong is one of the most populous areas in the world.  香港是世界上人口最稠密的地区之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3804','wallpaper','''wɔlpepɚ','''wɔːlpeɪpə','[n] 墙纸','...the wallpaper in the bedroom.  …卧室里的墙纸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3805','reputation',',rɛpju''teʃən','repjʊ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 名誉, 名声','Alice Munro has a reputation for being a very depressing writer.  艾丽斯•门罗有文风抑郁的名声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3806','gasoline','''gæsəlin','''gæsəliːn','[n] 汽油','A gasoline engine drives the motorboat.  汽油引擎推动汽船。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3807','invite','ɪn''vaɪt','ɪn''vaɪt','[v] 邀请；征求','I’m afraid I wasn’t invited.  恐怕我没有受到邀请。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3808','tap','tæp','tæp','[n&v] 塞子，龙头；轻叩(拍)','(= water that comes out of a tap ) is usually heavily treated with chemicals.  自来水一般都用化学品严格处理过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3809','igloo','''ɪglʊ','''ɪgluː','[n] 圆顶建筑','Defining the town center of Râmnicu Vâlcea is a towering shopping mall that looks like a giant glass igloo.  沃尔恰市中心的地标性建筑是一座高耸的购物商场，它看上去就像是一座巨型的玻璃圆顶建筑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3810','endless','''ɛndləs','''endlɪs','[adj] 无止境的,无穷的','an endless stream of visitors  川流不息的游客'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3811','formalize','''fɔrməlaɪz','''fɔːm(ə)laɪz','[v] 使正式, 形式化','Final arrangements for the takeover have yet to be formalized.  这次收购的最后协议还没有正式确定。'),
