('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3815','geographer','dʒɪ''ɑɡrəfɚ','dʒɪ''ɒɡrəfə','[n] 地理学者','Another reason, says Peter Hopkins, a geographer at Newcastle University, is that Scotland’s cultural iconography is much more vivid and more popular than England’s.  纽卡斯尔大学地理学者彼得•霍普金斯表示，另一个原因是苏格兰的文化意象相比英格兰更生动，更深入人心。'),
