('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3817','foul','faʊl','faʊl','[adj] 邪恶的,下流的 n犯规 v弄脏','Refugees in the camps are short of food and at risk from foul water.  营中难民缺少食物，还面临水源污染的危险。'),
