('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3834','provision','prə''vɪʒn','prə''vɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 供应,预备','He made provisions for his wife and his children in his will.  在遗嘱里他为妻子和孩子都做好了安排。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3835','exceptionally','ɪk''sɛpʃənəli','ɪk''sepʃ(ə)nəlɪ','[adv] 格外地, 特别地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3836','fieldstone','','','[n] 散石,大卵石','Colonial style gardens are formal layouts of herbs, vegetables, and flowers surrounded by fieldstone, gravel or lawn walks.  群体性花园，是整齐匀称的布局。 将草本植物、蔬菜、花卉，环以大卵石、砂砾或草坪小径。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3837','ranch','ræntʃ','rɑːn(t)ʃ','[v] 经营牧场n牧场',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3838','imperial','ɪm''pɪrɪəl','ɪm''pɪərɪəl','[adj] 帝国的，帝王的','Britain’s imperial expansion in the 19th century  19世纪英帝国的扩张'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3839','defenseless','dɪ''fɛnslɪs','di''fenslis','[adj] 无防备的','Without Christ we are defenseless against the Devil, but with "the helmet of salvation" our minds are protected by God.  没有基督，我们无力防御魔鬼的攻击；但有救恩的头盔，我们的心思便有神的保护。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3840','furnish','''fɝnɪʃ','''fɜːnɪʃ','[v] 布置, 装备, 提供','Will these finds furnish more information on prehistoric man?  这些发现是否能提供更多有关史前人类的资料？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3841','lag','læɡ','læg','[v] 落后 n滞后','Western banks still lag behind financial institutions in most other regions of the country.  西部地区的银行仍然落后于这个国家其他大部分地区的金融机构。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3842','lumiere','','','[n] 彩色照相术',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3843','accompaniment','ə''kʌmpənɪmənt','ə''kʌmp(ə)nɪm(ə)nt','[n] 陪伴物, 伴奏','White wine makes an excellent accompaniment to fish.  白葡萄酒是吃鱼时绝佳的佐餐酒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3844','pretend','prɪ''tɛnd','prɪ''tend','[v] 假装，装作','Let’s pretend we’re on the moon.  我们假装自己是在月球上吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3845','thresh','θrɛʃ','θreʃ','[v] 打谷, 脱粒, 反复得做','The grain was still sown, cut and threshed as it was a hundred years ago.  谷物的播种、收割、脱粒方法还和一百年前一样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3846','repetitive','rɪ''pɛtətɪv','rɪ''petɪtɪv','[adj] 重复的,反复的','The song was dreary and repetitive.  这首歌又枯燥又重复。'),
