('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3863','headquarter','''hɛd''kwɔrtɚ','''hedkwɔːtə','[v] 将之总部设在','The NMSP is currently holding a one-month meeting at its headquarter with its army leaders and others.  新孟邦党目前正在其总部同其军队领导人和其他一些人召开一个为期一个月的会议'),
