('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3891','tax','tæks','tæks','[n] 税,税款','No-one enjoys paying tax.  没人喜欢缴税。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3892','plumb','plʌm','plʌm','[v] （用铅垂）测量,探测','When his wife left him, Matt plumbed the very depths of despair.  妻子离他而去，马特陷入了绝望的深渊。'),
