('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3899','foraminifera','','','[n] 有孔虫类','Looking like a puffy white star studded with little pearls, this is the shell of an amoeboid protist called a foraminifera, or foram.  看看这个胀鼓鼓的白色星星，它上面满是珍珠。 这是一类变形虫（属于原生生物）的外壳，这类变形虫被称为有孔虫（ foraminifera or foram）。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3900','peace','pis','piːs','[n] 和平, 安静','The country is at peace with its neighbours for the first time in years.  这是多年来该国与其邻国第一次和平共处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_3901','domain','do''men','də(ʊ)''meɪn','[n] 领地,范围','Looking after the house was viewed as a woman’s domain.  料理家务被认为是女性的份内之事。'),
