('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4087','aristocrat','ə''rɪstəkræt','''ærɪstəkræt; ə''rɪst-','[n] 贵族','...a wealthy southern aristocrat.  …一位富有的南方贵族。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4088','consolidate','kən''sɑlɪdet','kən''sɒlɪdeɪt','[v] 合并,统一,巩固','The company has consolidated its position as the country’s leading gas supplier.  这家公司巩固了作为该国主要煤气供应商的地位。'),
