('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4090','plug','plʌɡ','plʌg','[v] 塞 n插头','Crews are working to plug a major oil leak.  机组人员正在努力堵一个漏油的大洞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4091','spine','spaɪn','spaɪn','[n] 脊柱','...injuries to his spine.  …对他的脊柱的创伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4092','absolute','''æbsəlut','''æbsəluːt','[adj] 完全的, 绝对的','I have absolute confidence in her.  我对她充满信心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4093','lade','led','leɪd','[v] 装载,装货','Its action is very well for driver controling lade weight, deicing overload and keeping watch on the cargoes , ect.  对司机把握装载量，防止超载和监控货物等都有很好的作用。'),
