('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4364','verify','''vɛrɪfaɪ','''verɪfaɪ','[v] 核实, 证明','American forces will remain to verify compliance with the treaty.  美军将继续驻留，核查条约是否得到遵守。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4365','reelection',',riə''lɛkʃən','','[n] 再选, 改选','After they finished their commission business, Chernomyrdin came to see me to brief me on events in Russia and Yeltsin’s prospects for reelection.  在他们完成了使命后，他来拜访我，向我简单介绍了俄罗斯的近况和叶利钦再次当选的前景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4366','dwelling','''dwɛlɪŋ','''dwelɪŋ','[n] 住处','Some 3,500 new dwellings are planned for the area.  大约三千五百套新住宅计划在这个地区新建。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4367','foremost','''fɔr''most','''fɔːməʊst','[adj] 最重要的,最初的','one of the country’s foremost authorities on chemical warfare  该国化学战方面的最高权威之一'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4368','midair','mɪd''ɛr',',mɪd''eə','[n] 半空中','The planes collided in midair.  飞机在空中相撞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4369','crocodile','''krɑkə''daɪl','''krɒkədaɪl','[n] 鳄鱼, 鳄鱼皮','a crocodile briefcase  鳄鱼皮公文包'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4370','sister','''sɪstɚ','''sɪstə','[n] 姐妹','Janet and Abby are sisters.  珍妮特和阿比是两姐妹。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4371','calve','kæv','kɑːv','[v] 生小牛, (使)冰山崩解','The whales migrate some 6,000 miles to breed and calve in the warm lagoons.  这种鲸鱼环游了6,000英里到暖水湖里生育繁殖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4372','integration','''ɪntə''greʃən','ɪntɪ''greɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 综合','problems of racial integration  种族融合的问题'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4373','usefulness','''jʊsfəlnəs','''juːsf(ʊ)lnəs','[n] 有用, 有效性','As a commuter service, the ferry has outlived its usefulness(= is no longer useful ).  作为一种通勤服务，渡船已经没有用武之地了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4374','olfactory','ɑl''fæktəri','ɒl''fækt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 嗅觉的','the olfactory cells in the nose  鼻腔内的嗅觉细胞'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4375','cranial','''krenɪəl','''kreɪnɪəl','[adj] 头盖(形)的','...cranial bleeding.  ...颅出血。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4376','prerequisite',',pri''rɛkwəzɪt','priː''rekwɪzɪt','[n] 先决条件','Good self-esteem is a prerequisite for a happy life.  良好的自尊心是幸福生活的先决条件。'),
