('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4652','afternoon',',æftɚ''nun','ɑːftə''nuːn','[n] 午后','There’s a meeting on Thursday afternoon .  星期四下午有个会议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4653','rumen','','''ruːmen','[n] 瘤胃(反刍动物的第一胃)','Grazing animals do it through the celluloses generated by the microorganisms of their rumen.  食草动物利用它们瘤胃中微生物所产生的纤维素酶来水解纤维素。'),
