('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4655','advise','əd''vaɪz','əd''vaɪz','[v] 劝告, 忠告, 警告, 建议','She needed someone to advise her.  她需要有个人给她出主意。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4656','impair','ɪm''pɛr','ɪm''peə','[v] 损害,削弱','The illness had impaired his ability to think and concentrate.  这种疾病损害了他的思维能力和注意力。'),
