('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4668','corruption','kə''rʌpʃən','kə''rʌpʃ(ə)n','[n] 腐化；贪污','officials charged with bribery and corruption  被指控受贿和贪污的官员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4669','postwar','''post''wɔr','''pəʊst''wɔː','[adj] 战后的','Anaesthetics and bottle feeding were popular in the early postwar years.  麻醉药和奶瓶喂养在战后早些年代非常流行。'),
