('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4675','obsession','əb''sɛʃ(ə)n','əb''seʃ(ə)n','[n] 迷住, 困扰','She would try to forget her obsession with Christopher.  她会试图忘掉她对克里斯托弗的迷恋。'),
