('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4678','comfort','''kʌmfɚt','''kʌmfət','[n] /v安慰','Whenever he was upset, he would turn to her for comfort and advice.  他每当心烦意乱时，就会去向她寻求安慰和建议。'),
