('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4694','swimmer','''swɪmɚ','''swɪmə','[n] 游泳者','You don''t have to worry about me. I''m a good swimmer.  你不必替我担心。我是一个游泳健将。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4695','physically','''fɪzɪkli','''fɪzɪkəllɪ','[adv] 身体上地','She is young and physically fit.  她年轻而且身体健康。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4696','eagerly','''igɚli','''i:gəlɪ','[adv] 热心地,急切地','He eagerly snuffled a mouthful of smoke.  他急切贪婪地吸了一口烟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4697','protectionist','prə''tɛkʃənɪst','prəʊ''tekʃənɪst','[n] 保护贸易论(者)','Trade frictions between the two countries had been caused by trade protectionists.  两国间的贸易摩擦是由贸易保护主义者引起的。'),
