('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4710','greenhouse','''ɡrinhaʊs','''griːnhaʊs','[n] 温室, 花房','But these two countries are responsible for almost half of all greenhouse gas emissions.  但是这两个国家的温室气体排放量几乎占了全世界的一半。'),
