('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4797','transparent','træns''pærənt','træn''spær(ə)nt; trɑːn-; -''speə-','[adj] 透明的, 显然的','a transparent plastic container  透明的塑料容器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4798','conscious','''kɑnʃəs','''kɒnʃəs','[adj] 意识到的，自觉的','The driver was still conscious when the ambulance arrived.  救护车赶到时，司机仍然神志清醒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4799','spherical','''sfɪrɪkəl','''sferɪk(ə)l','[adj] 球(面、状)的','...purple and gold spherical earrings.  ...紫色和金色的球形耳环。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4800','retail','''ritel','''riːteɪl','[n] ／v／ad零售','a retail price of £8.99  8.99英镑的零售价'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4801','Japan','dʒə''pæn','dʒə''pæn','[n] 日本',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4802','microwave','''maɪkrə''wev','''maɪkrə(ʊ)weɪv','[n] 微波(波长为1毫米至30厘米的高频电磁波)','I’ll heat it up in the microwave.  我来把它用微波炉热一热。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4803','adversely','æd''vɝsli','æd''və:sli','[adv] 不利地,逆向地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4804','indirectly',',ɪndə''rɛktli',',ɪndɪ''rek(t)lɪ','[adv] 间接地','I heard the news indirectly.  这消息我是间接听来的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4805','domesticate','də''mɛstɪket','də''mestɪkeɪt','[v] 驯养, 教化','We domesticated the dog to help us with hunting.  我们驯养狗来帮助我们打猎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4806','philosophical',',fɪlə''sɑfɪkl','fɪlə''sɒfɪk(ə)l','[adj] 哲学的, 达观的','the philosophical problem of whether there is free will  关于是否有自由意志的哲学问题'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4807','deceive','dɪ''siv','dɪ''siːv','[v] 欺骗, 行骗','He had been deceived by a young man claiming to be the son of a millionaire.  他被一个自称是百万富翁之子的年轻人骗了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4808','aesthetically','ɛs''θɛtɪkli','iːs''θetɪkəlɪ','[adv] 有审美能力地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4809','anthropology','''ænθrə''pɑlədʒi',',ænθrə''pɒlədʒɪ','[n] 人类学','"In anthropology, you can''t equate third gender with homosexuality," he said.  “在人类学中，你不能将同性恋和第三性别混同，”他说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4810','functionalism','''fʌŋkʃənəlɪzəm','''fʌŋ(k)ʃ(ə)n(ə)lɪz(ə)m','[n] 功能主义, 机能心理学','While criticizing neo-realism and neo-functionalism, researchers adhering to the epistemic community approach (ECA) emphasize the importance of original ideas in the policy-shaping process.  晚近针对「新现实主义」与「新功能主义」之批判所发展出的「知识社群」研究取向，强调原创理念在政策塑过程中所扮演之重要角色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4811','talent','''tælənt','''tælənt','[n] 天才,才能','He has a lot of talent , and his work is fresh and interesting.  他很有天赋，作品新颖有趣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4812','continuation','kən''tɪnjʊ''eʃən','kəntɪnjʊ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 继续(部分)；续篇','It''s the coalition forces who are to blame for the continuation of the war.  是联军应对战争的持续负责。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4813','detach','dɪ''tætʃ','dɪ''tætʃ','[v] 拆卸,使分开','Please detach and fill out the application form.  请撕下申请表并填好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4814','hydrodynamic',',haɪdrodaɪ''næmɪk',',haɪdrəʊdaɪ''næmɪk','[adj] 水力的','A second type of thermal escape is far more dramatic. This form of thermal escape is called hydrodynamic escape or, more evocatively, the planetary wind.  热逸过程的第二种情形更为奇特，可称为流体力学逃逸（hydrodynamic escape），用通俗一些的话说，叫做“行星风”（以便和“太阳风”呼应）。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4815','shoreline','''ʃɔrlaɪn','''ʃɔːlaɪn','[n] 海岸线','the bay’s 13,000 km of shoreline  这个海湾 1.3 万公里的海岸线'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4816','sedge','sɛdʒ','sedʒ','[n] [植]莎草','Victims have ranged from the great auk and the lynx to the humble blue stag beetle and Davall''s sedge.  受害者从大型海雀、猞猁到不值一提的蓝色鹿角虫和Davall''s莎草。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4817','disproportionate','disprə''pɔ:ʃənət',',dɪsprə''pɔːʃ(ə)nət','[adj] 不成比例的','the disproportionate amount of money being spent on defence  比例失衡的国防开支'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4818','tanker','''tæŋkɚ','''tæŋkə','[n] 油轮','A Greek oil tanker has run aground.  一艘希腊油轮已经搁浅了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4819','lament','lə''mɛnt','lə''ment','[n] 悲伤v哀悼','She spoke of the professional woman''s lament that a woman''s judgment is questioned more than a man''s.  她谈到职业女性的悲哀，即女性的判断会比男性的遭到更多的置疑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4820','systematically',',sɪstə''mætɪkl',',sɪstə''mætɪklɪ','[adv] 有系统地, 有条理地','Rumours of possible human cases in other parts of the country have been systematically followed up.  已系统地对关于该国其它地区可能的人间病例的传闻进行跟踪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4821','curiosity',',kjʊrɪ''ɑsəti','kjʊərɪ''ɒsɪtɪ','[n] 好奇心','I opened the packet just to satisfy my curiosity .  我打开包裹只是为了满足我的好奇心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4822','ancestral','æn''sɛstrəl','æn''sestr(ə)l','[adj] 祖先的','...the family''s ancestral home in southern Germany.  …这一家在德国南部的祖宅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4823','resume','','rɪˈzjuːm; ˈrɛzjʊmeɪ','[v] (中断后)继续 n摘要；简历','She hopes to resume work after the baby is born.  她想生完孩子后继续工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4824','eligible','''ɛlɪdʒəbl','''elɪdʒɪb(ə)l','[adj] 有资格的, 合适的','Stephen was regarded as an eligible bachelor.  斯蒂芬被认为是一个钻石王老五。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4825','absolutely','''æbsəlutli','''æbsəluːtlɪ','[adv] 完全地, 绝对地','He made his reasons for resigning absolutely clear.  他把辞职的理由讲得一清二楚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4826','senator','''sɛnətɚ','''senətə','[n] 参议员','Senator Kennedy  肯尼迪参议员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4827','pig','pɪɡ','pɪg','[n] 猪','He kept pigs and poultry.  他养过猪和家禽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4828','marvel','''mɑrvl','''mɑːv(ə)l','[n] 令人惊奇的事物(或人物)','The whale, like the dolphin, has become a symbol of the marvels of creation.  鲸，和海豚一样，已经成为造物杰作的象征。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4829','afraid','ə''fred','ə''freɪd','[adj] 害怕的','There’s no need to be afraid.  没有必要害怕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4830','estuary','''ɛstʃʊ''ɛri','''estjʊ(ə)rɪ','[n] 河口, 江口','the Thames estuary  泰晤士河河口'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4831','seismic','''saɪzmɪk','''saɪzmɪk','[adj] [地]地震的','increased seismic activity  越来越频繁的地震活动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4832','radius','''redɪəs','''reɪdɪəs','[n] 半径（范围）','The shock of the explosion was felt over a radius of forty miles.  爆炸引起的剧烈震动在方圆40英里内都能感觉得到。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4833','withdrawal','wɪð''drɔəl','wɪð''drɔː(ə)l','[n] 收回, 撤退','large-scale troop withdrawals  大规模撤军'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4834','ember','''ɛmbɚ','''embə','[n] 灰烬, 余烬','glowing embers  发光的余烬'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4835','launch','lɔntʃ','lɔːntʃ','[vt&n] 发射','The organization has launched a campaign to raise $150,000.  为了筹集15万美元，该组织发起了一场募捐活动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4836','sorghum','''sɔrgəm','''sɔːgəm','[n] [植]高粱属的植物','But some plants, including maize and sorghum, have evolved to use a type called C4.  但是一些植物，包括玉米和高粱，进化成了使用C4型的光合作用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4837','paleoecologist','','','[n] 古生态学家',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4838','primal','''praɪml','''praɪm(ə)l','[adj] 最初的','Yet some of the most radical ideas about our primal urges have been harnessed by those who want everyone to drink the same brand of beer.  然而，那些恨不得人人都喝同一品牌啤酒的守旧派们，则给人类原始冲动中的某些最本质的欲望，套上了枷锁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4839','regulatory','','','[adj] 管理的, 控制的','Partially, that has to do with our regulatory framework, which is built on the idea that medicine is all about disease.  部分原因跟我们的监管架构有关。 这个架构建立在药物全是用来治病的理念之下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4840','isotopic','','','[adj] 同位素的,合痕的','The variations in isotopic ratios take place on the right time scale, and they mirror those seen in modern corals, he notes.  他说，同位素比例变化所发生的时间范围恰到好处，这与在现代珊瑚中的发现保持了一致。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4841','captain','ˈkæptən','''kæptɪn','[n] 首领, 船长','The captain and crew welcome you aboard.  机长和全体机组人员欢迎各位乘坐本次航班。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4842','extension','ɪk''stɛnʃən','ɪk''stenʃ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 延长, 扩充','We are thinking of having an extension built, as we now require an extra bedroom.  我们正在考虑扩建房屋，因为我们现在需要多一间卧室。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4843','ultimate','''ʌltəmət','''ʌltɪmət','[adj] 最后的, 最终的n终极(限)','The ultimate outcome of the experiment cannot be predicted.  试验的最后结果无法预测。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4844','omit','ə''mɪt','ə(ʊ)''mɪt','[v] 省略,遗漏','Please don’t omit any details, no matter how trivial they may seem.  请不要忽略任何细节，不管它多细小。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4845','applicable','''æplɪkəbl','ə''plɪkəb(ə)l; ''æplɪk-','[adj] 合适的, 适用的,','What is a reasonable standard for one family is not applicable for another.  对一个家庭合理的标准对于另一个家庭并不适用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4846','snowstorm','''snostɔrm','''snəʊstɔːm','[n] 暴风雪','The snowstorm added to our difficulties.  暴风雪增加了我们的困难。'),
