('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4849','persuasively','pɚ''swesɪvli','pə''sweisivli','[adv] 有说服力的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4850','livable','''livəbl','''lɪvəbl','[adj] 适于居住的','“The goal should be to make the villages livable, ” he said.  他说，“这个目标应该是使村庄适宜居住。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4851','pretty','''prɪti','''prɪtɪ','[adj] 漂亮的, 可爱的','a pretty little girl  漂亮的小姑娘'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4852','dime','daɪm','daɪm','[n] <美> 一角硬币','Filling stations have whacked as much as a dime off their regular prices.  加油站已经把正常价格降了一角银币。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4853','testify','''tɛstɪfaɪ','''testɪfaɪ','[v] 证明, 证实','Mr Molto has agreed to testify at the trial.  莫尔托先生已经同意出庭作证。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4854','outlying','''aʊtlaɪɪŋ','''aʊtlaɪɪŋ','[adj] 远离中心的，偏僻的','one of the outlying suburbs  边远郊区之一'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4855','dollar','''dɑlɚ','''dɒlə','[n] 元, 美元','It cost three dollars.  它要三美元。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4856','lid','lɪd','lɪd','[n] 盖子,vt给盖盖子','She lifted the lid of the box and displayed the contents.  她把盒盖掀起，展示了里边的东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4857','privilege','ˈprɪvəlɪdʒ','ˈprɪvəlɪdʒ','[n] 特权，优惠','He had no special privileges and was treated just like every other prisoner.  他不享受特权，待遇和任何其他犯人一样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4858','ethological','','','[n] 行为性的,  行为学的','At Agile 2006, she examined the cooperative behavior of Bonobo apes from an ethological perspective and spoke about how “natural” the cooperative aspects of Agile are.  在Agile2006上，她从动物行为学的角度分析了Bonobo大猩猩的合作行为，并说明了敏捷的合作性是多么“自然”。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4859','disruption','dɪs''rʌpʃən','dɪs''rʌpʃn','[n] 分裂','He could draw men round him and keep them bound to him; while his powerful attraction was there, disruption was out of the question.  他能够把人们吸引到他的周围而且保持他们的忠心；而他的强大吸引力所在之处，就不可能有分裂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4860','subsistence','səb''sɪstəns','səb''sɪst(ə)ns','[n] 生存, 生活, 留存','Many of the families are forced to live at the subsistence level.  很多家庭被迫生活在基本生活水准线上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4861','notwithstanding',',nɑtwɪθ''stændɪŋ','nɒtwɪð''stændɪŋ; -wɪθ-','[prep] ／ ad尽管','Notwithstanding differences, there are clear similarities in all of the world’s religions.  世界上的宗教尽管各不相同，但都有明显的相似之处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4862','autumn','''ɔtəm','''ɔːtəm','[n] 秋天','autumn mists  秋天的雾霭'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4863','clip','klɪp','klɪp','[n] 夹子 vt夹住','The wire is held on with a metal clip.  电线用金属夹子固定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4864','impetus','''ɪmpɪtəs','''ɪmpɪtəs','[n] 推动力, 促进','The discovery gave fresh impetus to the research.  这个发现为研究带来新动力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4865','grower','''ɡroɚ','''grəʊə','[n] 种植者，栽培者','The state''s apple growers are fighting an uphill battle against foreign competition.  该州的苹果种植者们正在与外来竞争进行艰难的抗争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4866','sophistication','sə,fɪstɪ''keʃən','sə,fɪstɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 老练, 精明','It would take many decades to build up the level of education and sophistication required.  要花好几十年的时间来逐步达到所需要的教育和发展水平。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4867','instructive','ɪn''strʌktɪv','ɪn''strʌktɪv','[adj] 有益的, 教育性的','Thank you, that was very instructive.  谢谢，这很有启发性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4868','manual','''mænjuəl','''mænjʊ(ə)l','[adj] 手工的 n手册,指南','People in manual occupations have a lower life expectancy.  干体力活的人预期寿命较短。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4869','mundane','mʌn''den','''mʌndeɪn; mʌn''deɪn','[adj] 平凡的, 世俗的','Initially, the work was pretty mundane.  刚开始，这工作非常乏味。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4870','raindrop','''ren''drɑp','''reɪndrɒp','[n] 雨滴, 雨点','If I were a raindrop ...   如果我是雨滴的话...'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4871','appoint','ə''pɔɪnt','ə''pɒɪnt','[v] 任命, 委派','officials appointed by the government  政府任命的官员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4872','inflation','ɪn''fleʃən','ɪn''fleɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 通货膨胀, 膨胀','Inflation is now at over 16%.  通货膨胀率现已超过16%。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4873','sunflower','''sʌnflaʊɚ','''sʌnflaʊə','[n] [植]向日葵','Do you know how to turn a simple sunflower seed into a piece of delicious meat?  你知道怎么把一个简单的向日葵花籽变成一片片美味的肉吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4874','doorway','''dɔr''we','''dɔːweɪ','[n] 门口','Hannah looked up to see David and another man standing in the doorway.  汉纳抬起头，看到戴维和另一个男人站在门口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4875','injure','''ɪndʒɚ','''ɪndʒə','[v] 伤害，损害','A number of bombs have exploded, seriously injuring at least five people.  一些炸弹爆炸了，至少5人严重受伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4876','instigate','''ɪnstə''get','''ɪnstɪgeɪt','[v] 鼓动','He accused union leaders of instigating the disturbances.  他指责工会领导人煽动骚乱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4877','spill','spɪl','spɪl','[v] (使)溢出 n溢出','Katie almost spilled her milk.  凯蒂差点把牛奶洒出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4878','January','''dʒænjʊ''ɛri','''dʒænjʊ(ə)rɪ','[n] 一月(略作Jan)','We always have snow in January.  我们这里1月份总会下雪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4879','gateway','''ɡetwe','''geɪtweɪ','[n] 入口；通道','He walked across the park and through a gateway.  他走过那个公园，并穿过一个大门口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4880','rigorously','''rigərəsli','''rigərəsli','[adv] 严格地','You then can a multi-group either diffusion equation or solve these types of equations and more rigorously.  然后你有一个多群的或者是扩散等式,或者更严厉地解决这些等式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4881','roam','rom','rəʊm','[v] 漫游, 闲逛','Chickens and geese roam freely in the back yard.  鸡和鹅在后院随意溜达。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4882','onrushing','''ɑn,rʌʃɪŋ','','[adj] 猛冲的','He was killed by an onrushing locomotive.  他被飞驰而来的火车头撞死了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4883','tricycle','''traɪsɪkl','''traɪsɪk(ə)l','[n] 三轮车','He cannibalized his old bicycle to repair his tricycle.  他把旧自行车的零件拆下来修配他的三轮车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4884','hydrological','','','[adj] 水文学的','The theme addresses the role of forests and trees outside forests to help moderate soil, hydrological and aquatic systems.  本主题处理森林及森林外树木帮助调节土壤、水文以及水生系统的作用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4885','foresee','fɔr''si','fɔː''siː','[v] 预见, 预知','I’ve put your name on the list and I don’t foresee any problems.  我把你的名字写在名单上了，估计不会有什么问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4886','ignorance','''ɪɡnərəns','''ɪgn(ə)r(ə)ns','[n] 无知','Excuse my ignorance, but how does it actually work?  请原谅我的无知，它究竟是如何运作的？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4887','constitutional',',kɑnstə''tuʃənl','kɒnstɪ''tjuːʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 法治的；体质的','a constitutional right to privacy  宪法规定的隐私权'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4888','orogeny','ɔ''rɑdʒəni','ɒ''rɒdʒənɪ','[n] [地] 山岳之形成','The cycle of geosyncline formation and orogeny can be integrated with the plate tectonics concept of opening and closing oceans in a simple and natural way.  这种地槽的形成与造山作用的循环可以以一种简单和自然的方式与板块构造的海洋开合理论结合起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4889','accuse','ə''kjuz','ə''kjuːz','[v] 控告, 谴责','The professor stands accused of (=  has been accused of  ) stealing his student’s ideas and publishing them.  那位教授被指控剽窃学生的观点拿去发表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4890','administrator','əd''mɪnɪstretɚ','əd''mɪnɪstreɪtə','[n] 管理人,行政官','On Friday the company''s administrators sought permission from a Melbourne court to keep operating.  在星期五，该公司的管理人员们从一家墨尔本法院取得了继续经营的许可。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4891','trainer','''trenɚ','''treɪnə','[n] 训练者','The football team was disciplined by a professional trainer.  这支足球队受过专业教练员的训练。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4892','temporarily','ˈtɛmpəˌrɛrili','''temp(ə)r(ər)ɪlɪ','[adv] 临时','You might only need it temporarily.  可能你只是暂时的需要它。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4893','befit','bɪ''fɪt','bɪ''fɪt','[v] 适合','As befits a castle of such national importance, there are many stories connected with its history.  这是一个对国家而言如此重要的古堡，理所当然流传着许许多多和它有关的历史故事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4894','compost','''kɑmpost','''kɒmpɒst','[n] 混合肥料','...a small compost heap.  …一小堆肥堆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4895','collaborator','kə''læbə''retɚ','kə''læbəreɪtə','[n] 合作者','collaborators on a biography of Dickens  狄更斯传记的合著者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4896','lodge','lɑdʒ','lɒdʒ','[v] (让)暂住 n乡间小屋，旅舍','The bullet lodged in the sergeant''s leg, shattering his thigh bone.  子弹射入这个军士的腿部，击碎了他的大腿骨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4897','endow','ɪn''daʊ','ɪn''daʊ; en-','[v] 捐赠, 赋予','You are endowed with wealth, good health and a lively intellect.  你天生赋有财富、健康，和敏锐的智力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4898','patience','''peʃns','''peɪʃ(ə)ns','[n] 耐性, 忍耐','He doesn''t have the patience to wait.  他没有耐心等。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4899','residency','''rɛzɪdənsi','''rezɪd(ə)nsɪ','[n] 居住, 住所','He applied for Canadian residency.  他申请了在加拿大的居住权。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4900','cosmopolitan','''kɑzmə''pɑlətn',',kɒzmə''pɒlɪt(ə)n','[adj] 全球的,四海为家的 n世界主义者','a vibrant, cosmopolitan city  一个充满活力的国际性都市'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4901','shower','''ʃaʊɚ','''ʃaʊə','[n] 阵雨, 淋浴','Why does the phone always ring when I’m in the shower?  为什么电话铃总是在我洗澡的时候响？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4902','collaborative','kə''læbəretɪv','','[adj] 合作的, 协作的','...a collaborative research project.  …一个合作研究项目。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4903','westerner','','','[n] 美国之西部的人','It''s the first time a Westerner has been convicted for a drug-related offence in recent years in China.  这是近年来第一次有西方人在中国被判犯有与毒品有关的罪行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4904','refrigerate','rɪ''frɪdʒəret','rɪ''frɪdʒəreɪt','[v] 使冷冻, 使冷藏','Refrigerate the mixture overnight.  把混合物冷藏过夜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4905','clergy','''klɝdʒi','''klɜːdʒɪ','[n] 圣职者, 牧师',''),
