('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4907','rage','redʒ','reɪdʒ','[n] 愤怒','Sobbing with rage, Carol was taken to the hospital.  卡罗尔气得呜呜哭，被送往医院。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4908','execution',',ɛksɪ''kjuʃən',',eksɪ''kjuːʃ(ə)n','[n] 处决, 执行','a public execution  当众处死'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4909','tough','tʌf','tʌf','[adj] 坚韧的，强硬的，困难的','The men who work on the oil rigs are a tough bunch.  在石油钻塔上工作的都是吃苦耐劳的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4910','skirt','skɝt','skɜːt','[n] 裙子','She wore a white blouse and a plain black skirt.  她穿着白衬衣和纯黑的裙子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4911','lithograph','''lɪθəɡræf','''lɪθəgrɑːf; ''laɪ-','[n] 石版画, 平版印刷',''),
