('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4979','sterile','''stɛrəl','''steraɪl','[adj] 贫脊的,不结果的','The classrooms are sterile, with no artwork on the walls.  这些教室毫无生气，墙上一张画都没有。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4980','seaweed','''si''wid','''siːwiːd','[n] 海草, 海藻','So the next time you see a chunk of seaweed ... notice the beauty of it, yes.  所以下次你碰见一大片海藻时，要毫不犹豫的欣赏它的美。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4981','preschool','''pri''skʊl','''priːskuːl','[adj] 未满学龄的n幼儿园','preschool children  学龄前儿童'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4982','smelt','smɛlt','smelt','[v] 熔解，熔炼',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4983','streambed','','','[n] 河床','Within 30 minutes, I was marching up a dry streambed, above the trees, on a ridge matted with magenta shrubs and dotted by boulders.  差不多30分钟的时候，我走在一个干枯的河床，上面长着树，在凸起的地方遍布着红色的灌木丛和星星点点的石头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4984','hint','hɪnt','hɪnt','[n] 暗示,  线索','There have been hints that he may take up coaching.  他暗示过可能会出任教练。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4985','rally','''ræli','''rælɪ','[n] 集会 v集合','About three thousand people held a rally to mark international human rights day.  大约三千人举行集会以纪念国际人权日。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4986','luckily','''lʌkɪli','''lʌkɪlɪ','[adv] 幸运地','Luckily the museum was not damaged by the earthquake.  幸好，博物馆没有在地震中遭到破坏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4987','drawback','''drɔbæk','''drɔːbæk','[n] 缺点,障碍','It’s a great city – the only drawback is the weather.  这是座很不错的城市，唯一的不足就是天气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_4988','successional','','','[adj] 接连著的, 连续性的','The style of the website, must have successional , cannot too too bouncing.  网站的风格，一定要有连续性，不能太过于跳跃。'),
