('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5007','chimney','''tʃɪmni','''tʃɪmnɪ','[n] 烟囱, 灯罩','We can’t light a fire because the chimney hasn’t been swept.  烟囱管没有清扫过，我们生不了火。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5008','shin','ʃɪn','ʃɪn','[n] 胫骨','She punched him on the nose and kicked him in the shins.  她猛击了他的鼻子又踢了他的胫部。'),
