('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5019','aqueduct','''ækwɪ''dʌkt','''ækwɪdʌkt','[n] 沟渠,导水管','...a nationwide system of aqueducts to carry water to the arid parts of this country.  ...一个将水输送到该国干旱地区的全国性输水系统。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5020','triple','''trɪpl','''trɪp(ə)l','[n] 三倍数, 三个一组',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5021','meanwhile','''minwaɪl','''miːnwaɪl','[adv] 其间','The flight will be announced soon. Meanwhile, please remain seated.  很快就要广播通知登机，在此期间请继续留在座位上。'),
