('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5023','befriend','bi''frend','bɪ''frend','[v] 待人如友,帮助','They befriended me when I first arrived in London as a student.  我初到伦敦求学时，他们待我如同朋友。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5024','adaptable','ə''dæptəbl','ə''dæptəb(ə)l','[adj] 能适应的,适应性强的','The American Constitution has proved adaptable in changing political conditions.  事实证明美国宪法能适应政治形势的变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5025','converge','kən''vɝdʒ','kən''vɜːdʒ','[v] 聚合, 集中','The two rivers converge into one near Pittsburgh.  这两条河在匹兹堡附近汇合。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5026','fortune','''fɔrtʃən','''fɔːtʃuːn; -tʃ(ə)n','[n] 财富, 运气','I had the good fortune to work with a brilliant head of department.  我有幸与一位出色的部门主管共事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5027','phosphorescence',',fɑsfə''rɛsns',',fɒsfə''res(ə)ns','[n] 磷光','Besides this, Javert possessed in his eye the feline phosphorescence of night birds.  况且沙威的眼睛有着夜鸟那种象猫一样的磷光。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5028','endeavor','ɪn''dɛvɚ','ɪn''devə','[n&v] 尽力, 努力','She improved visibly from day to day, until Martin wondered if he was doing right, for he knew that all her compliance and endeavor was for his sake.  她一天比一天进步了，直到马丁怀疑起自己的做法是否得体。 因为他明白她的这一切迁就和努力都是为了他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5029','supervisor','''supɚvaɪzɚ','''suːpəvaɪzə; ''sjuː','[n] 管理人；监督人','...a full-time job as a supervisor at a factory.  …在一家工厂担任监督员的一项全职工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5030','Portugal','''pɔtjuɡəl','ˈpɔːtjʊɡəl','[n] 葡萄牙(欧洲西南部国家)','Spain is bounded on the east by Portugal.  西班牙的东面与葡萄牙接壤。'),
