('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5033','visibility','''vɪzə''bɪləti','vɪzɪ''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 可见度','Visibility on the roads is down to 20 metres due to heavy fog.  道路能见度因浓雾降至20米。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5034','generalize','''dʒɛnrəlaɪz','ˈdʒɛnrəˌlaɪz','[v] 归纳, 概括','Critics love to generalize, to formulate trends into which all new work must be fitted, however contradictory.  评论家喜欢概括，归纳出所有新作品都必须符合的趋势，不管它们是如何地不符。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5035','levy','''lɛvi','''levɪ','[v] 征收(税等) n征税','They levied religious taxes on Christian commercial transactions.  他们对基督教的商业交易征收宗教税。'),
