('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5063','communicative','kə''mjunɪketɪv','kə''mjuːnɪkətɪv','[adj] 健谈的,交流的','Tom wasn’t very communicative, and kept himself to himself.  汤姆不大善于言谈，不喜欢与人交往。'),
