('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5070','ambient','''æmbɪənt','''æmbɪənt','[adj] 周围的 n周围环境','...ambient sounds of children in the background.  ...背景处环绕着孩子们的声音。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5071','accrete','ə''krit','ə''kriːt','[v] 共生, 附着, 增加','Over time, an implementation will accrete complexity as code is revisited for bug fixes and feature enhancements.  随着时间的迁移，系统实现与复杂度将共存，因为修改问题和添加新功能将会增加代码量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5072','bubbly','''bʌbli','''bʌblɪ','[adj] 多泡的','Melt the butter over a medium-low heat. When it is melted and bubbly, put in the flour.  用中低火把黄油加热。待黄油熔化起泡后，放入面粉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5073','metalwork','','''met(ə)lwɜːk','[n] 金属制品','a huge collection of antique metalwork  一大批金属古玩藏品'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5074','resent','rɪ''zɛnt','rɪ''zent','[v] 愤恨, 怨恨','Paul resented the fact that Carol didn’t trust him.  保罗非常气愤，因为卡萝尔不信任他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5075','correlation',',kɔrə''leʃən',',kɒrə''leɪʃ(ə)n; -rɪ-','[n] 相互关系','...the correlation between smoking and disease.  …吸烟和疾病之间的关联。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5076','devotion','dɪ''voʃən','dɪ''vəʊʃ(ə)n','[n] 献身, 热爱','At first she was flattered by his devotion.  最初他的挚爱使她感到受宠若惊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5077','useless','','','[adj] 无用的, 无效的','The editor killed a few useless lines.  编辑删掉了几行无用的文字。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5078','keen','kin','kiːn','[adj] 锋利的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5079','bulldozer','''bʊl''dozɚ','''bʊldəʊzə','[n] 推土机','What he meant was that Brett had his ownpersonality, all kids do, and his style was that of a bulldozer.  他的意思是布雷特有自己的个性，每个孩子都是如此，而他的风格就像不可一世的推土机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5080','politically','pə''lɪtɪkli','pə''litikli','[adv] 政治上地','Women were becoming more politically active.  妇女在政治上变得越来越活跃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5081','centigrade','''sɛntɪɡred','''sentɪgreɪd','[adj] 摄氏的','...daytime temperatures of up to forty degrees centigrade.  …高达40摄氏度的日间气温。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5082','alchemist','''ælkəmɪst','''ælkɪmɪst','[n] 炼金术士','Would you rather be an alchemist or a chemist?  那么，你想做一个炼金术士，还是一个化学家呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5083','optimum','''ɑptəməm','''ɒptɪməm','[n&a] 最适宜(的)','If we treat good diet as a cornerstone of optimum nutrition and do regular exercise, we will have much bigger chance to do and enjoy something else.  如果我们处理好饮食的一个基础就是最佳营养和做适量运动，我们将有更大的机会和享受做别的事情。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5084','mechanic','mə''kænɪk','mɪ''kænɪk','[n] 技工','a garage mechanic  汽车修理厂的技工'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5085','blame','blem','bleɪm','[n&vt] 责备','Don’t blame me – it’s not my fault.  别来怪我——又不是我的错。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5086','presently','''prɛzntli','''prez(ə)ntlɪ','[adv] 目前, 不久','The doctor will be here presently.  医生一会儿就到。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5087','reelect',',riə''lɛkt',',ri:i''lekt','[v] 重选, 改选','There are some objections to the proposal to reelect the chairman.  对重新选举董事长的提议有人持反对意见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5088','warehouse','''wɛrhaʊs','''weəhaʊs','[n] 仓库，货栈','The large warehouse backs on to the river.  这大货栈背朝江河。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5089','ensue','ɪn''su','ɪn''sjuː; en-','[v] 接着发生，接踵而来','If the Europeans did not reduce subsidies, a trade war would ensue.  如果欧洲不减少补贴，贸易战将随即爆发。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5090','cherry','''tʃɛri','''tʃerɪ','[n] 樱桃','a bunch of cherries  一串樱桃'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5091','historic','hɪ''stɔrɪk','hɪ''stɒrɪk','[adj] 有历史意义的, 历史的','a historic meeting of world leaders  具有历史意义的世界领导人会议'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5092','monster','''mɑnstɚ','''mɒnstə','[n] 怪物','the remains of a prehistoric monster  史前怪兽的遗骸'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5093','tapeworm','''tepwɝm','''teɪpwɜːm','[n] [动]绦虫','The stomach contained a fish hook, bits of digested fish skull and some tapeworm.  胃里面有个钓鱼钩，少量消化之后残留的鱼骸和一些绦虫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5094','languish','''læŋɡwɪʃ','''læŋgwɪʃ','[v] 憔悴, 凋萎','Many sickly ones have there always been among those who muse, and languish for God; violently they hate the discerning ones, and the latest of virtues, which is uprightness.  在那些无声祷告、为神憔悴的人群中间，总混有许多病态的家伙；他们极端憎恨有洞察力的人，憎恨那些最近得道、坦诚的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5095','mythology','mɪ''θɑlədʒi','mɪ''θɒlədʒɪ','[n] 神话','characters from classical mythology  古典神话中的人物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5096','lateness','','','[n] 迟, 晚','I must report your lateness to the teacher.  我必须报告老师你迟到了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5097','amid','ə''mɪd','ə''mɪd','[prep] 在中','The dollar has fallen in value amid rumors of weakness in the US economy.  在一片美国经济疲软的传言中，美元贬值了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5098','mythological',',mɪθə''lɑdʒɪkl','mɪθə''lɒdʒɪk(ə)l','[adj] 神话(学)的','Plato describes in “Phaedrus,” in mythological language, why and how the souls take their birth upon this plane, either as human or animal.  柏拉图在他的“斐德罗篇”中，以神话的语言描述了灵魂为何和怎样在人类的层面上或动物的层面上产生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5099','prototype','''protə''taɪp','''prəʊtətaɪp','[n] 原型','But how do you come up with the architecture for this evolutionary prototype?  但是你将如何为这个进化的原型提出系统的架构呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5100','newcomer','''nukʌmɚ','''njuːkʌmə','[n] 新来的人；移民','a special award for the most promising newcomer  颁发给最有前途新人的特殊奖项'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5101','holiday','''hɑləde','''hɒlɪdeɪ; -dɪ','[n] 假日','The school holidays start tomorrow.  学校假期从明天开始。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5102','gravitas','''ɡrævitæs','''grævɪtæs; -tɑːs','[n] 庄严(举止)','He is pale, dark, and authoritative, with the gravitas you might expect of a Nobel prize winner.  他面色苍白、皮肤呈深色、有权威性，带着你可能期待的一位诺贝尔奖得主的那种庄严。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5103','foresightedness','','','[n] 先见之明',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5104','prerecord',',prirɪ''kɔrd',',priː''rɪ''kɔːd','[v] 事先录音','a prerecorded interview  事先录制的采访'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5105','brittle','''brɪtl','''brɪt(ə)l','[adj] 易碎的, 脆弱的','In systems such as this we also often find that there are either no tests around this configuration code, or the tests that do exist are brittle and/or not realistic.  在这样的系统中，我们经常会发现对于这些配置代码没有进行测试，或者尽管存在测试，但它很脆弱且/或不切实际。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5106','dispense','dɪ''spɛns','dɪ''spens','[v] 分发, 分配','a machine for dispensing cash  取款机'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5107','inedible','ɪn''ɛdəbl','ɪn''edɪb(ə)l','[adj] 不能吃的，不宜食用的','The meat was so burnt that it was inedible.  肉烧得那么焦，不能吃了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5108','lure','lʊr','l(j)ʊə','[v] 引诱','He lured her to his home and shot her with his father''s gun.  他把她诱骗到家里，然后用父亲的枪把她打死。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5109','swiftly','''swɪftli','''swiftli','[adv] 很快地, 即刻','As I looked swiftly away, it seemed to me that his glance held some kind of unmet expectation.  我很快地看向别处，对我来说他的目光里似乎带着某种得不到满足的渴望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5110','risky','''rɪski','''rɪskɪ','[adj] 危险的','Doctors say it’s too risky to try and operate.  医生说动手术风险太大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5111','gibbon','''ɡɪbən','''gɪb(ə)n','[n] 长臂猿','Beverly: Why else would you grow a pancreas in a teenaged gibbon?  要不然在年轻长臂猿体内培育人类胰腺干什么?'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5112','raccoon','ræ''kun','rə''kuːn','[n] <美>[动]浣熊','a raccoon coat  浣熊皮大衣'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5113','peep','pip','piːp','[n&vi] 窥视, 偷看','On our website you can peep our video interview with R&B’s newest supergroup.  在我们的网站可以观看到节奏布鲁斯最新超级组合的采访录像。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5114','arousal','ə''raʊzl','ə''raʊzl','[n] 觉醒, 激励','It distracts us, and takes our arousal back to the starting blocks.  它分散我们的注意力，使我们的觉醒又回到了起点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5115','neurotransmitter','''nʊrotrænzmɪtɚ',',njʊərəʊtrænz''mɪtə','[n] [生化]神经传递素','All drugs of abuse stimulate the release of the neurotransmitter dopamine.  所有的药物滥用都刺激了神经递质多巴胺的释放。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5116','avalanche','''ævəlæntʃ','''ævəlɑːnʃ','[n] 雪崩','Two skiers were killed in the avalanche.  两名滑雪者在雪崩中丧生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5117','skyrocket','''skaɪ''rɑkɪt','''skaɪrɒkɪt','[n] 冲天火箭（烟火）',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5118','skate','sket','skeɪt','[n] 冰鞋 vi溜冰',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5119','ibex','''aɪbɛks','''aɪbeks','[n] 野生山羊','Other common forms of synecdoche include two concentric circles or triangles (used as eyes in horse and bison paintings), ibex horns and the hump of a mammoth.  其他普通的提喻形式包括两个同心圆或者三角形（在壁画上马和犀牛的眼睛里也有使用），野生山羊的羊角和长毛象弓起的背部。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5120','monkey','''mʌŋki','''mʌŋkɪ','[n] 猴子','The monkey is beating up and down.  那只猴子到处乱窜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5121','cessation','sɛ''seʃən','se''seɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 停止','He would not agree to a cessation of hostilities.  他不会同意敌对状态的停止。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5122','shovel','''ʃʌvl','''ʃʌv(ə)l','[n] 铲,挖斗机','...a coal shovel.  …一把煤铲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5123','eccentric','ɪk''sɛntrɪk','ɪk''sentrɪk; ek-','[adj] 古怪的; [n] 怪人','His eccentric behaviour lost him his job.  他古怪的行为使他丢了工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5124','steamer','''stimɚ','''stiːmə','[n] 汽船, 蒸汽机',''),
