('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5126','iridescent',',ɪrɪ''dɛsnt',',ɪrɪ''des(ə)nt','[adj] 闪光的，现晕光的','small iridescent blue flies  色彩变幻的蓝色小苍蝇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5127','eocene','''i:əusi:n','''i:əusi:n','[n&a] 始新世(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5128','cushion','''kʊʃən','''kʊʃ(ə)n','[n] 垫子','a velvet cushion  天鹅绒垫子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5129','bowel','''baʊəl','''baʊəl','[n] 肠','cancer of the bowel  肠癌'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5130','technician','tɛk''nɪʃən','tek''nɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 技术员, 技师','a laboratory technician  实验室技术人员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5131','maybe','''mebi','''meɪbiː; -bɪ','[adv] 大概, 或许','Maybe it’s all just a big misunderstanding.  也许这只是一个很大的误会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5132','snowdrift','''snodrɪft','''snəʊdrɪft','[n] 雪堆','Weller was once a stranded motorist himself. Driving in an Illinois blizzard when he was 16, he got stuck in a snowdrift.  韦勒自己曾经也是一个无助驾驶员，在他16岁的时候驾驶在伊利诺斯州的暴风雪中，陷入了雪堆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5133','seventy','''sɛvnti','''sev(ə)ntɪ','[num] 七十','We lost touch during the seventies.  我们在70年代失去了联系。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5134','cleaner','''klinɚ','''kliːnə','[n] 清洁工人, 清洁器','a vacuum cleaner  真空吸尘器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5135','accordion','ə''kɔrdɪən','ə''kɔːdɪən','[n] 手风琴','But my fancy accordion might as well have been a cardboard box that afternoon.  但是那天下午，我别致的手风琴好像变成了纸板盒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5136','manure','mə''nʊr','mə''njʊə','[n] 肥料','...bags of manure.  …一袋袋的肥料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5137','clover','''klovɚ','''kləʊvə','[n] [植]三叶草','a four-leaf clover  四叶（车轴）草'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5138','heater','''hitɚ','''hiːtə','[n] 加热器','Did you turn the heater off?  你关掉加热器了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5139','circumference','sɚ''kʌmfərəns','sə''kʌmf(ə)r(ə)ns','[n] 圆周, 周围','...a scientist calculating the Earth''s circumference.  …一位正在计算地球周长的科学家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5140','treatment','''tritmənt','''triːtm(ə)nt','[n] 待遇, 对待','Just lately, Kyra has been giving me the silent treatment (= refusing to speak to me because she is angry with me ) .  就在最近，凯拉一直对我不理不睬。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5141','sanitation',',sænɪ''teʃən','sænɪ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 卫生(设施)','Overcrowding and poor sanitation are common problems in prisons.  过度拥挤和卫生状况差是监狱里的普遍问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5142','entertainer','''ɛntɚ''tenɚ','entə''teɪnə','[n] 款待者, 表演娱乐节目的人','Sinatra remains one of the top entertainers of all time.  西纳特拉一直是最著名的艺人之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5143','scrape','skrep','skreɪp','[v&n] 刮，擦','Scrape the carrots and slice them thinly.  把这些胡萝卜去皮切成薄片。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5144','violently','''vaɪələntli','ˈvaɪələntli','[adv] 猛烈地, 激烈地','Several people have been violently attacked in the subway.  有几个人在地铁里受到了暴力袭击。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5145','masonry','''mesənri','''meɪs(ə)nrɪ','[n] 石工术, 石匠职业','Several people were buried under falling masonry.  好几个人被埋在倒塌的砖石下面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5146','flexibility',',flɛksə''bɪləti',',fleksɪ''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 灵活性, 弹性','Employees expect flexibility in the workplace.  员工们盼望工作安排有弹性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5147','obstruct','əb''strʌkt','əb''strʌkt','[v] 阻塞，堵塞','A small aircraft was obstructing the runway.  一架小型飞机堵住了跑道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5148','mediocre',',midɪ''okɚ',',miːdɪ''əʊkə','[adj] 平庸的','I thought the book was pretty mediocre.  我认为这本书非常一般。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5149','tributary','''trɪbjə''tɛri','''trɪbjʊt(ə)rɪ','[a&n] 支流(的)，进贡(的)','...the Napo river, a tributary of the Amazon.  ...纳波河，亚马孙河的一条支流。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5150','choosy','''tʃuzi','''tʃuːzɪ','[adj] 好挑剔的','Skiers should be particularly choosy about the insurance policy they buy.  滑雪者在购买保险的问题上应特别谨慎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5151','distinguishable','dɪ''stɪŋgwɪʃəbl','','[adj] 可区别的, 可辨别的','...features that make their products distinguishable from those of their rivals.  …将他们的产品与其竞争对手们的产品区别开来的一些特色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5152','commute','kə''mjʊt','kə''mjuːt','[v] 通勤, 折换; [n] 乘车上下班','Mike commutes to Miami every day.  迈克每天通勤去迈阿密。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5153','absenteeism',',æbsən''tiɪzəm','æbs(ə)n''tiːɪz(ə)m','[n] 旷课, 旷工','His boss discharged him for habitual absenteeism.  他的老板因他习惯性旷工而解雇了他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5154','pointillist','','','[n] 点彩派画家','The book is composed, like a pointillist painting, of thousands of factual details.  这本书像是一副点彩画，由成千上万证据确凿的细节组合而成。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5155','crudely','','','[adv] 粗糙地, 粗鲁地','The adult characters seemed too crudely drawn; the hopes and dreams of the fathers – and one assumes, the mothers – too easily dismissed.  成年人的角色塑造的太过粗糙，父亲们抑或是母亲们的希望和梦想太过轻易地被排斥。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5156','ride','raɪd','raɪd','[v] 骑, 乘','She learned to ride when she was seven.  她七岁时学会了骑马。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5157','epistle','ɪ''pɪsl','ɪ''pɪs(ə)l','[n] 书信','Now immediately we can see that this is an epistle which has a great deal to teach us as we live in the last times of the Gentiles.  现在我们能看见当我们住在非犹太人的最后时期，这是一封常常有教我们的书信。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5158','endotherms','','','[n] 温血动物, 恒温动物','For instance, humans are endotherms and maintain an internal temperature of 37℃, no matter whether the environment is warm or cold.  比如，人是恒温动物，无论环境温度是怎样，体温都维持在37℃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5159','disseminate','dɪ''sɛmɪnet','dɪ''semɪneɪt','[v] 散布，传播','Her findings have been widely disseminated .  她的发现已广为传播。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5160','berg','bɝg','bɜːg','[n] 冰山','At a time when sprawling shelves of ice are disintegrating, this berg seemed to signify more.  当伸展的冰架正在瓦解的时侯，这座冰山的出现更显得意味深长。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5161','corpus','''kɔrpəs','''kɔːpəs','[n] 资料, 文集',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5162','unchangeable','ʌn''tʃeindʒəbl','ʌn''tʃeɪn(d)ʒəb(ə)l','[adj] 不变的,不能改变的','The doctrine is unchangeable.  这条教义是不可改变的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5163','patriot','''petrɪət','''pætrɪət; ''peɪt-','[n] 爱国者','It has been suggested the founders were not true patriots but men out to protect their own interests.  有人指出创建者并非真正的爱国者，而是一些维护自己利益的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5164','gel','dʒɛl','dʒel','[n] 凝胶体 v成冻胶','hair gel  发胶'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5165','ignorant','''ɪɡnərənt','''ɪgn(ə)r(ə)nt','[adj] 无知的','an ignorant and uneducated man  不学无术的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5166','illusory','ɪ''lusəri','ɪ''l(j)uːs(ə)rɪ','[adj] 虚幻的','First impressions can often prove illusory.  第一印象往往被证明是不真实的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5167','sparsely','''spɑrsli','''spa:sli','[adv] 稀疏地','If an entry is only sparsely filled in, the results may look more like Figure 8.  如果一个条目只填充了稀疏的内容，那么结果看上去就像图 8 那样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5168','methyl','''mɪθɪl','''miːθaɪl; ''meθ-; -θɪl','[n] 甲基, 木精','However, thiomersal, the preservative in some vaccines, contains ethyl mercury not methyl mercury.  然而，在某些疫苗中用作防腐剂的硫柳汞含乙基汞，并非含甲基汞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5169','worshipper','''wɝʃɪpɚ','''wɜːʃɪpə','[n] 礼拜者','If a worshipper should make a mistake, do you not think God will know his intent?  如果崇拜者犯了错，那么,你以为上帝不知道他的意图吗'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5170','saturday','sætɚdɪ; -de','ˈsætədɪ; -deɪ','[n] 星期六','He called her on Saturday morning at the studio.  他星期六早上在工作室给她打电话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5171','watercourses','''wɔtɚkɔrs','''wɔːtəkɔːs','[n] 水流, 河道','This often results in huge holes in the ground, noxious spoil-heaps and polluted watercourses.  这常常会在地面上留下一个个巨大的坑，有毒的矸子山和污染的河道.'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5172','luxurious','lʌɡ''ʒʊrɪəs','lʌg''ʒʊərɪəs; lʌg''zjʊə-; lʌk''sjʊə-','[adj] 奢侈的, 豪华的','a luxurious 30-room villa  一栋有30个房间的豪华度假别墅'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5173','receptacle','rɪ''sɛptəkl','rɪ''septək(ə)l','[n] 容器','a trash receptacle  垃圾箱'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5174','motorcycle','''motɚ''saɪkl','''məʊtəsaɪk(ə)l','[n] 摩托车, 机车','You''d better encash your motorcycle at once.  你最好马上卖掉摩托车换成现款。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5175','recreation',',rɛkrɪ''eʃən',',rekrɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 消遣, 娱乐','His only recreations are drinking beer and watching football.  他唯一的消遣就是喝啤酒和看足球比赛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5176','vest','vest','vest','[n] 汗衫 vt使穿衣服, 授予',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5177','chemurgy','''kɛmɝdʒi','''kemɜːdʒɪ','[n] [化]农业化工,实用化学','The branch of chemistry that studies and finds ways to use raw materials from farm products to make industrial products is called chemurgy .  化学的一个分科就是要研究发现利用从农产品中提取的原料来创造新的产品，它被称为农业化学。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5178','imitator','''ɪmɪtetɚ','','[n] 模仿者','He doesn''t take chances; that''s why he''s survived and most of his imitators haven''t.  他不去碰运气；这就是为什么他得以幸存下来，而他的大部分仿效者却没有。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5179','edifice','''ɛdɪfɪs','''edɪfɪs','[n] 大厦, 大建筑物','Their head office was an imposing edifice.  他们的总部大楼是一幢宏伟建筑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5180','wary','''wɛri','''weərɪ','[adj] 机警的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5181','surmise','sɝ''maɪz','sə''maɪz','[v] 猜测','There''s so little to go on, we can only surmise what happened.  几乎没有什么可继续进行的，我们只能猜测发生过的事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5182','disdain','dɪs''den','dɪs''deɪn; -z-','[n] 轻蔑 v蔑视','Janet looked at him with disdain.  珍妮特轻蔑地看着他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5183','poisonous','''pɔɪzənəs','''pɒɪzənəs','[adj] 有毒的, 恶意的','Some mushrooms are extremely poisonous.  一些蘑菇有剧毒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5184','anti','''æntaɪ','''æntɪ','[n] 反对者 a反对的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5185','continuator','kən''tɪnjʊ,etɚ','kən''tɪnjʊeɪtə','[n] 继续者','Whether you are the anti-innovator or the traditional continuator, the indispensable premise and foundation is fully understanding about tradition.  无论是反传统的革新者，还是维护传统的继承派，都必须充分地认识并理解传统是其必要的前提和基础。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5186','grid','ɡrɪd','grɪd','[n] 格子, 栅格','...a grid of ironwork.  …铁格栅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5187','predispose','''pridɪ''spoz',',priːdɪ''spəʊz','[v] (使)易罹患, (使)预先偏向于','They take pains to hire people whose personalities predispose them to serve customers well.  他们煞费苦心雇用那些具备把顾客服务好的个性的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5188','aviator','','','[n] 飞行员','Like his father, he hopes to become a naval aviator.  与父亲一样，他希望成为海军飞行员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5189','preposterous','prɪ''pɑstərəs','prɪ''pɒst(ə)rəs','[adj] 荒谬的, 可笑的','The whole idea sounds absolutely preposterous!  整个想法听起来荒谬透顶！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5190','subtlety','''sʌtlti','''sʌt(ə)ltɪ','[n] 微妙, 精明','The play lacks subtlety.  这部戏不够精细。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5191','suburb','''sʌbɝb','''sʌbɜːb','[n] 市郊, 郊区','a London suburb  一个伦敦郊区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5192','streetcar','''stritkɑr','''striːtkɑː','[n] 路面电车','She was wearing a uniform jacket and skirt, and I realized that she was streetcar conductor.  她穿着制服上衣和裙子，我明白她原来是有轨电车检票员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5193','oscillate','''ɑsɪlet','''ɒsɪleɪt','[v] 振荡','The associated cross-peak amplitude also appears to oscillate.  相关的交叉峰的幅度也在振荡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5194','aptly','''æptli','''æptli','[adv] 适当地,适宜地','The aptly named Skyline Restaurant provides spectacular views of the city below.  天际餐厅名副其实，可以俯瞰城市美景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5195','underfoot',',ʌndɚ''fʊt','ʌndə''fʊt','[adv] 在脚下面, 踩着地','...a room, high and square with carpet underfoot and tapestries on the walls.  ...天花板很高的一间四方的房间，脚下有地毯，墙上有挂毯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5196','ox','ɑks','ɒks','[n] 牛, 公牛',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5197','developer','dɪ''vɛləpɚ','dɪ''veləpə(r)','[n] 开发者','a Florida property developer  佛罗里达州的一家房地产开发公司'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5198','worry','ˈwɜːri','''wʌrɪ','[n&v] 烦恼, 忧虑','The recent changes in the Earth’s climate are beginning to worry scientists.  近来地球的气候变化使科学家开始担忧起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5199','gourd','ɡʊrd','gʊəd; gɔːd','[n] 葫芦','I refused the last but washed down the fruit and vegetables with clear, cold water from a hollowed gourd.  我没有动第三碗，只就着一只葫芦里干净的凉水，把水果和蔬菜风卷残云地吃了下去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5200','landowner','''lændonɚ','''lændəʊnə','[n] 土地所有者','wealthy landowners  有钱的地主'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5201','crossing','''krɔsɪŋ','''krɒsɪŋ','[n] 交叉口','Turn left at the first crossing.  在第一个十字路口左转。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5202','pane','pen','peɪn','[n] 窗格玻璃；长方块','a window pane  一块窗玻璃'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5203','undisputed',',ʌndɪ''spjutɪd','ʌndɪ''spjuːtɪd','[adj] 无可置辩的','Doctors found undisputed evidence of nerve damage.  医生发现了神经受损的确凿证据。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5204','maneuver','mə''nʊvɚ; mə''njʊvɚ','mə''nʊvə','[n] 策略[ pl]演习 v(巧妙)控制；用策略',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5205','predictability','prɪ,dɪktə''bɪləti','pri,diktə''biliti','[n] 可预见性','Maybe that''s the definition of predictability?  也许那就是可预测性的定义？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5206','celsius','''sɛlsɪəs','''selsɪəs','[adj] 摄氏的','Highest temperatures 11° Celsius, that''s 52° Fahrenheit.  最高温度11摄氏度，即52华氏度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5207','uncomfortable','ʌn''kʌmftəbl','ʌn''kʌmf(ə)təb(ə)l','[adj] 不舒服的，不自在的','This sofa is so uncomfortable.  这张沙发太不舒服了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5208','revitalization','ˌrivaɪtlɪ''zeʃən','riːˌvaɪtəlaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 新生 复兴','Such bioactive mushroom metabolites are believed to have the capability to helping revitalization of our immune system against a large number of pathogenic and non-pathogenic diseases.  这种具有生物活性的蕈类代谢产物被认为是能够帮助我们的免疫系统新生，抵抗大量致病性的和非致病性的疾病。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5209','redbud','''rɛd,bʌd','''redbʌd','[n] 紫荆属植物','The production of flowers and fruits on the older branches or trunks of woody plants, such as the redbud, and many mostly tropical plants, including cacao.  木本植物，如紫荆以及包括可可在内的许多热带植物，其老枝或树干上生出的花朵或果实。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5210','bullrush','','','[n] 芦苇',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5211','speculator','''spɛkjuletɚ','''spekjʊleɪtə','[n] 投机者','a New York property speculator  纽约的一名房地产投机者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5212','homesteader','''hom,stɛdɚ','''həʊm,stedə','[n] 农场所有权人, 自耕农',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5213','valve','vælv','vælv','[n] 阀,活门','heart valves  心脏瓣膜'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5214','inaccessible',',ɪnæk''sɛsəbl','ɪnək''sesɪb(ə)l','[adj] 难接近的, 难达到的','In winter, the villages are inaccessible by road.  冬天时，进入这些村子的路很难走。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5215','draft','dræft','drɑːft','[n] 草稿; [v] 草拟','the rough draft of his new novel  他的新小说的草稿'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5216','qualify','ˈkwɑləˌfaɪ','''kwɒlɪfaɪ','[v] (使)胜任,(使)合格','Free school lunches are given to children who qualify.  符合条件的儿童可获得免费的学生午餐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5217','nodule','''nɑdʒul','''nɒdjuːl','[n] 节结','A simple and rapid diagnostic field test for BU is urgently needed because early disease – nodule – can be treated locally and inexpensively.  由于早期疾病 - 节结 - 可在当地廉价地进行治疗，迫切需要布鲁里溃疡的一种现场简单快速诊断检测。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5218','skillfully','''skɪlfəli','','[adv] 巧妙地,技术好地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5219','competence','''kɑmpɪtəns','''kɒmpɪt(ə)ns','[n] 能力','Typing is considered by most employers to be a basic competence.  大多数雇主认为打字是一项基本技能。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5220','dormancy','''dɔrmənsi','''dɔːmənsɪ','[n] 休眠','Automatic logoff feature helps alleviate such risks by automatically disabling the session using recommended time-out values for dormancy.  自动下线特性通过对休眠使用推荐的超时值，可以帮助降低此类风险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5221','supposedly','sə''pozɪdli','sə''pəʊzɪdlɪ','[adv] 推测地, 大概',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5222','basketry','''bɑ:skitri','''bɑːskɪtrɪ','[n] 篓编织品','Eva specializes in one of the most difficult techniques of basketry.  伊娃专攻一种最难的编织篮筐的技艺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5223','bark','bɑrk','bɑːk','[n] 吠声','Amy’s voice was a hoarse bark.  艾美发出的是粗哑的吼声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5224','amuse','ə''mjuz','ə''mjuːz','[v] 使发笑,使愉快','The thought seemed to amuse him.  这个想法好像让他觉得好笑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5225','legal','''ligl','''liːg(ə)l','[adj] 法律的,合法的','What the company has done is perfectly legal.  公司所做的这一切完全合法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5226','eukaryotic','ju:,kæri''ɔtik','juː,kærɪ''ɒtɪk','[adj] 真核状态的','These genes are needed for cell respiration, and without them eukaryotic cells die.  这些基因的细胞都需要呼吸，如果没有它们，真核细胞就会死亡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5227','emulsion','ɪ''mʌlʃən','ɪ''mʌlʃ(ə)n','[n] 乳状液',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5228','shake','ʃek','ʃeɪk','[n&  v] 摇动，颤抖','She shook him to wake him up.  她摇摇他，想把他叫醒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5229','condensation',',kɑndɛn''seʃən','kɒnden''seɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 浓缩',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5230','rebound','rɪ''baʊnd','rɪ''baʊnd','[n] /v回弹','I caught the ball on the rebound.  我接住了弹回的球。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5231','indefinite','ɪn''dɛfɪnət','ɪn''defɪnɪt','[adj] 不明确的，含糊的','Teachers find the report’s terminology so indefinite that it is confusing.  老师们发现报告的专门用语含义不明确，令人费解。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5232','insignificant',',ɪnsɪɡ''nɪfɪkənt','ɪnsɪg''nɪfɪk(ə)nt','[adj] 无关紧要的,  可忽略的','You realize that your problems are insignificant in comparison.  要知道，你的问题相对来说微不足道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5233','handmade','''hænd''med','hæn(d)''meɪd','[adj] 手工的','a pair of expensive handmade shoes  一双昂贵的手工制作的鞋子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5234','Iceland','''aislənd','''aislənd','[n] 冰岛(欧洲岛名,在大西洋北部,近北极圈)','WHICH country will be the next Iceland?  哪个国家会成为下一个冰岛？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5235','incandescent','''ɪnkən''dɛsnt','ɪnkæn''des(ə)nt','[adj] 遇热发光的, 白炽的','the invention of the incandescent lamp  白炽灯的发明'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5236','implicitly','im''plisitli','ɪm''plɪsɪtlɪ','[adv] 含蓄地,  暗中地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5237','rob','rɑb','rɒb','[v] 抢夺','They killed four policemen while robbing a bank.  他们抢劫一家银行的时候杀了4名警察。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5238','fanciful','''fænsɪfl','''fænsɪfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 想像的, 奇怪的','a fanciful story  想象出来的故事'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5239','fixture','''fɪkstʃɚ','''fɪkstʃə; -tjə','[n] 固定物(装置)','light fixtures  照明设备'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5240','battery','''bæt(ə)rɪ','''bætri','[n] 电池','You have to take the top off to change the batteries .  你得把顶盖拿掉才能更换电池。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5241','deprecate','''dɛprəket','''deprɪkeɪt','[v] 抨击, 反对','He deprecated the low quality of entrants to the profession.  他抨击了行业中的滥竽充数。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5242','infusion','ɪn''fjuʒn','ɪn''fjuːʒ(ə)n','[n] 灌输','He brought a tremendous infusion of hope to the people.  他给人们带来极大的希望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5243','carriage','''kærɪdʒ','''kærɪdʒ','[n] 马车, 客车','The president-elect followed in an open carriage drawn by six beautiful grey horses.  新当选的总统紧随其后，坐着6匹灰色骏马开道的敞篷马车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5244','worsen','''wɝsn','''wɜːs(ə)n','[v] 恶化','A lot of teachers expect the situation to worsen over the next few years.  许多老师认为接下来的几年情形会更糟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5245','portraitist','''pɔrtrətɪst','''pɔːtrɪtɪst','[n] 肖像画家','Rembrandt began to work as a professional portraitist about 1631.  伦勃朗成为一名职业画家的时间约是1631年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5246','rhythmical','ˈrɪðmɪkl','''rɪðmɪkəl','[adj] 节奏的, 合拍的','Good breathing is slow, rhythmic and deep.  良好的呼吸缓慢、有节奏并且深沉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5247','exploratory','ɪk''splɔrətɔri','ɪk''splɒrət(ə)rɪ; ek-','[adj] 勘探的, 探索的','He’s going to have exploratory surgery on his knee.  他的膝盖要做探查性手术。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5248','coconut','''kokənʌt','''kəʊkənʌt','[n] 椰子','large tropical gardens of coconut palms  大型热带椰树园'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5249','infancy','''ɪnfənsi','''ɪnf(ə)nsɪ','[n] 幼年',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5250','visualize','''vɪʒuəlaɪz','''vizjuəlaiz','[v] 想象，设想','I tried to visualize the house while he was describing it.  我一边听他描述，一边想象那房子的样子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5251','credence','''kridns','''kriːd(ə)ns','[n] 信任','Good studies are needed to lend credence to the notion that genuine progress can be made in this important field.  要有优秀的研究才能使人相信在这一重大领域能取得真正的进步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5252','encase','ɪn''kes','ɪn''keɪs; en-','[v] 装入, 包住','When nuclear fuel is manufactured it is encased in metal cans.  核燃料生产出来时被装在金属罐中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5253','bemoan','bɪ''mon','bɪ''məʊn','[v] 哀叹','He was bemoaning the fact that lawyers charge so much.  他抱怨律师收费太高。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5254','maroon','mə''run','mə''ruːn','[n] 栗色 a栗色的','I wore a maroon velvet trouser suit that my daughter chose, and most of the village came to the reception.  那天，我穿了女儿为我挑选的栗色天鹅绒裤装，村庄里的大多数人都应邀参加了我的婚礼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5255','legally','''li:gəli','''li:gəli','[adv] 法律上, 合法地','They are still legally married.  他们在法律上仍然是夫妻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5256','inspection','ɪn''spɛkʃən','ɪn''spekʃn','[n] 检查, 视察','An inspection was carried out at the school.  有人来学校视察了一遍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5257','immunity','ɪ''mjʊnəti','ɪ''mjuːnɪtɪ','[n] 免疫性','To protect you against small pox or diphtheria, you are vaccinated with a small amount of the toxin, and then your body develops immunity against that toxin.  为了避免你长小脓包或得白喉病，所以会给你的身体接种小量毒素，然后你的身体会针对这些毒素产生免疫力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5258','tariff','''tærɪf','''tærɪf','[n] 关税','America wants to eliminate tariffs on items such as electronics.  美国想要取消电子类产品的关税。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5259','restriction','rɪ''strɪkʃən','rɪ''strɪkʃ(ə)n','[n] 限制, 约束','a 50 mph speed restriction  每小时50英里的限速'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5260','asthenosphere','æs''θinə,sfɪr','əs''θenəsfɪə','[n] 岩流圈','The mesosphere comprises the rest of the mantle below the asthenosphere.  中间圈包括岩流圈以下地幔的其余部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5261','violet','''vaɪələt','''vaɪələt','[n] 紫罗兰 a紫色的','She inhaled the violet perfume, saying “How sweet!”  她一边闻紫罗兰的芳香， 一边说“好香啊！”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5262','periphery','pə''rɪfəri','pə''rɪf(ə)rɪ','[n] 外围','extremists on the periphery of the animal rights movement  处于动物权利运动边缘的极端分子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5263','insure','ɪn''ʃʊr','ɪn''ʃɔː; ɪn''ʃʊə','[v] 给保险,确保','Have you insured the contents of your home?  你给家庭财产投保了吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5264','insult','ɪn''sʌlt','ɪn''sʌlt','[n&vt] 侮辱, 辱骂','Nobody insults my family and gets away with it!  谁也别想侮辱了我的家人之后就这么算了！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5265','supercontinent','''supɚkɑntɪnənt','''suːpəkɒntɪnənt; ''sjuː-','[n] [地]超大陆','The very first supercontinent was called Vaalbara and it started forming more than 3.6 billion years ago.  真正意义上的第一个超大陆名叫瓦尔巴拉，它从36亿年前就开始形成了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5266','notorious','no''tɔrɪəs','nə(ʊ)''tɔːrɪəs','[adj] 臭名昭著的','a notorious computer hacker  声名狼藉的电脑黑客'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5267','idiom','''ɪdɪəm','''ɪdɪəm','[n] 成语, 方言','the new musical idiom  新的音乐风格'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5268','psychology','saɪ''kɑlədʒi','saɪ''kɒlədʒɪ','[n] 心理学','I understood the psychology of this, but it still hurt.  我理解这种心理，但这仍然让我感到伤心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5269','discrete','dɪ''skrit','dɪ''skriːt','[adj] 不连续的, 离散的','The change happens in a series of discrete steps.  这个变化在一系列分离的步骤中发生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5270','hieroglyphic',',haɪərə''glɪfɪk','haɪrə''glɪfɪk','[n] 象形文字','The Inca had no system of hieroglyphic writing, as the Maya did, and any portraits that Inca artists may have made of their rulers were lost.  和玛雅人一样，印加人也没有象形文字书写系统，而且印加艺术家们所绘制的统治者肖像业已失传。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5271','hurricane','hʌrɪˌken','''hʌrɪk(ə)n; -keɪn','[n] 飓风, 狂风','The hurricane devastated a large section of the coast.  飓风毁坏了沿海地区的大部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5272','condenser','kən''dɛnsɚ','kən''densə','[n] 冷凝器, 电容器','You take that gas phase mixture, and you condense it in your condenser.  然后用这新得到的气相混合物，在冷凝器中冷凝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5273','bilingual','''baɪ''lɪŋgwəl','baɪ''lɪŋgw(ə)l','[adj] 能说两种语言的','a bilingual dictionary  双语词典'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5274','abolish','ə''bɑlɪʃ','ə''bɒlɪʃ','[v] 废止, 废除','Slavery was abolished in the US in the 19th century.  美国于19世纪废除了奴隶制。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5275','entitle','ɪn''taɪtl','ɪn''taɪt(ə)l; en-','[v] 给权利(或资格), 给题名','...a performance entitled "United States."  …一场名为“合众国”的演出。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5276','streptomycin',',strɛptə''maɪsɪn',',streptə(ʊ)''maɪsɪn','[n] 链霉素','In 1947 there was no cure for TB - doctors prescribed fresh air and a regular diet - but there was a new, experimental drug on the market, streptomycin.  1947年，肺结核无异于绝症，医生嘱咐他多呼吸新鲜空气和注意有规律的日常饮食。 但市面上出现了一种新的试验性药物——链霉素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5277','innermost','''ɪnɚmost','''ɪnəməʊst','[adj] 最里面的, 内心的','a man who would never share his innermost thoughts with anyone  一个永远不会告诉别人自己内心深处想法的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5278','sting','stɪŋ','stɪŋ','[n&v] 刺, 刺痛','He was stung by a bee.  他被蜜蜂蜇了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5279','jellyfish','''dʒɛlɪfɪʃ','''dʒelɪfɪʃ','[n] 水母','But many marine experts have been saying for several years that we need to start loving jellyfish – because in the not too distant future, they may be the most plentiful marine species around.  但是，多年来，许多海洋专家一直在说，我们需要开始热爱水母——因为在不远的将来，它们也许是我们周围最丰富的海洋物种。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5280','stagnant','''stægnənt','''stægnənt','[adj] 停滞的；萧条的','a government plan to revive the stagnant economy  政府振兴低迷经济的计划'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5281','afar','ə''fɑ:','ə''fɑː','[adv] 遥远地','I saw him from afar.  我远远地看到了他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5282','epic','''ɛpɪk','''epɪk','[n] 史诗, 伟大事迹','a Hollywood epic  好莱坞史诗电影'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5283','circumscribe',',sɝkəm''sraɪb','''sɜːkəmskraɪb','[v] 在…周围画线；限制','The President’s power is circumscribed by Congress and the Supreme Court.  总统的权力受到国会和最高法院的制约。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5284','inactive','ɪn''æktɪv','ɪn''æktɪv','[adj] 不活动的, 怠惰的','The brain cells are inactive during sleep.  在睡觉时脑细胞不活跃。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5285','DNA','','','[abbr] [生化]脱氧核糖核酸(=deoxyribonucleic acid)','At the moment, the regulation on how much human DNA can be put into an animal is vague.  目前，有关多少人类脱氧核糖核酸可以放入一只动物身上的规定，还很模糊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5286','alkaloid','''ælkə''lɔɪd','''ælkəlɒɪd','[n] [化]生物碱','Cocaine is a crystalline tropane alkaloid that is obtained from the leaves of the coca plant.  可卡因是一种结晶状的莨菪生物碱，是从古柯叶中提取得来的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5287','televise','''tɛlɪvaɪz','''telɪvaɪz','[v] 广播, 播映',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5288','stump','stʌmp','stʌmp','[n] 树桩;残余部分; [v] 笨重地走,使为难','an old tree stump  老树墩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5289','reciprocate','rɪ''sɪprəket','rɪ''sɪprəkeɪt','[v] 互换,  交换',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5290','discourse','''dɪskɔrs','''dɪskɔːs; -''kɔːs','[n&v] 谈话, 演讲','Candidates should engage in serious political discourse.  候选人应该参加严肃的政治对话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5291','labellum','lə''bɛləm','lə''beləm','[n] （兰花的） 唇瓣','Pollinators are often visually attracted by the shape and colours of the labellum .  传粉昆虫通常被唇瓣的形状和颜色的视觉效果所吸引。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5292','fishery','''fɪʃəri','''fɪʃ(ə)rɪ','[n] 渔业, 水产业','...the fisheries off Newfoundland.  …纽芬兰附近的那些渔场。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5293','necrosis','nɛ''krosɪs','ne''krəʊsɪs','[n] 坏死','...liver necrosis.  ...肝坏死。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5294','eastward','''istwɚdz','''iːstwəd','[adj] 向东的; [adv] 向东','...the eastward expansion of the city.  …该市的东扩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5295','stag','stæɡ','stæg','[n] 牡鹿vi不带女伴参加晚会',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5296','encroach','ɪn''krotʃ','ɪn''krəʊtʃ; en-','[v] 侵占,侵犯','The new institutions do not encroach on political power.  这些新机构没有侵犯到政治权力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5297','rotary','''rotəri','''rəʊt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 旋转的','the rotary movement of the helicopter blades  直升机螺旋桨叶的转动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5298','syllable','''sɪləbl','''sɪləb(ə)l','[n] 音节','The accent falls on the third syllable.  重音落在第三个音节上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5299','sequoia','sɪ''kwɔɪə','sɪ''kwɒɪə','[n] [植] 美洲杉',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5300','humor','''hjʊmɚ','ˈhjuːmə','[n] 幽默, 诙谐','I like your sense of humor.  我喜欢你的 幽默感。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5301','tempera','','''temp(ə)rə','[n] 蛋彩画','The acclaimed artist painted landscapes and figure subjects and worked mostly in tempera and watercolor.  这位著名艺术家的创作多以风景和人物为主题，大多数作品为蛋彩画和水彩画。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5302','dogwood','''dɔɡwʊd','''dɒgwʊd','[n] 山茱萸','Tilly sat in Colleen’s mother’s lap, still eating cake, and Karen ran around the dogwood, chased by one of her cousins.  蒂莉坐在科琳妈妈的怀里，还在吃蛋糕，卡伦被一个表妹追得绕着山茱萸跑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5303','Switzerland','''swɪtsələnd','ˈswɪtsələnd','[n] 瑞士(欧洲中部国家)','The River Rhine rises in Switzerland.  莱茵河发源于瑞士。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5304','immigrate','''ɪmɪɡret','''ɪmɪgreɪt','[v] 移入','His father and mother immigrated when he was two.  他的父母在他两岁时移民到这里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5305','plank','plæŋk','plæŋk','[n] 厚木板(条)','a long plank of wood  一长条厚木板'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5306','lighten','''laɪtn','''laɪt(ə)n','[v] 减轻,点亮','She took one of the parcels from her father to lighten his load.  她从父亲那儿拿过一个包以减轻他的负担。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5307','cripple','''krɪpl','''krɪp(ə)l','[n] 跛子 v削弱',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5308','brand','brænd','brænd','[n] 商标, 牌子, 烙印','products which lack a strong brand image  缺乏鲜明品牌形象的产品'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5309','notoriously','noˈtɔːriəsli','nəu''tɔ:riəsli','[adv] 臭名昭著地, 众所周知地','Could some of the deaths have been prevented in this notoriously high-risk area?  在这个众所周知的高危地区，有些死亡是否可以避免？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5310','naked','''nekɪd','''neɪkɪd','[adj] 裸体的, 无遮盖的','The children ran naked through the yard.  孩子们光着身子跑过院子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5311','plutonic','','','[adj] 火成岩的','It provides collection of images of minerals in thin sections, and microtextures of plutonic , volcanic and metamorphic rocks.  网站提供了大量的矿物薄截面、火成岩、火山岩以及变质岩显微质地的图片。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5312','aggravate','''æɡrəvet','''ægrəveɪt','[v] 使恶化, 加重','Their money problems were further aggravated by a rise in interest rates.  由于利率上调，他们的财务问题更加严重。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5313','neutralize','''nʊtrə''laɪz','''nju:trəlaiz','[v] 压制',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5314','memorial','mə''morɪəl','mə''mɔːrɪəl','[n] 纪念物, 纪念馆','Building a memorial to Columbus has been his lifelong dream.  建一座哥伦布纪念碑一直是他一生的梦想。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5315','condor','''kɑndɔr','''kɒndɔː','[n] [动]秃鹰, 秃鹫','Just like this California condor, which—though teetering on the edge of extinction—still soars near the Grand Canyon in Arizona and in the state it was named after.  就像加利福利亚秃鹫，虽然依旧翱翔于亚利桑那和加利福利亚的大峡谷附近，但已在灭绝的悬崖边摇摇欲坠。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5316','disappointment',',dɪsə''pɔɪntmənt','dɪsə''pɒɪntm(ə)nt','[n] 失望','He could see the disappointment in her eyes.  他看到了她眼中的失望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5317','sprout','spraʊt','spraʊt','[v] 萌芽 n苗芽','It only takes a few days for beans to sprout.  豆子只需几天就会发芽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5318','badly','''bædli','''bædlɪ','[adv] 严重地, 恶劣地','The company has been very badly managed.  这家公司的管理非常差。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5319','corpse','kɔrps','kɔːps','[n] 尸体','The corpse was found by children playing in the woods.  这具尸体是在林子里玩耍的孩子发现的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5320','sake','[sek]','seɪk','[n] 缘故，理由','He moved to the seaside for the sake of his health.  他为了健康而迁居海滨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5321','attainment','ə''tenmənt','ə''teɪnm(ə)nt','[n] 达到','a low level of educational attainment  教育程度低'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5322','careless','''kɛrləs','''keələs','[adj] 粗心的, 疏忽的','It was careless of him to leave the door unlocked.  他忘了锁门，真是粗心大意。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5323','progression','prə''ɡrɛʃən','prə''greʃ(ə)n','[n] 行进, 级数',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5324','cable','''kebl','''keɪb(ə)l','[n] 缆绳；电缆','cables and switches for computers  电脑的缆线和开关'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5325','oceanographer',',oʃɪə''nɑgrəfɚ',',əʊʃɪə''nɒɡrəfə','[n] 海洋学者, 海洋研究者','The oceanographer told delegates that the problem of ocean acidification was worse in high latitudes, in the Arctic and around Antarctica, than it was nearer the equator.  这位海洋学家告诉与会代表，高纬度地区的海洋酸化问题更加严重，北极和南极周围比赤道附近糟糕得多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5326','legitimately','li''dʒitimitli','li''dʒitimitli','[adv] 正当地, 合理地','Methods that use this comparator legitimately depend on it to compare two files, without throwing any exceptions.  使用这个比较器的方法合理地依靠它来比较两个文件，而不抛出任何异常。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5327','estuarine','''ɛstjʊərɪn','''estjʊəraɪn','[adj] 入海的, 在入海口形成的','estuarine muds'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5328','cup','kʌp','kʌp','[n] 杯子','Mathew picked up the cup and sipped his coffee.  马修拿起杯子抿了口咖啡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5329','speciality',',spɛʃɪ''æləti',',speʃɪ''ælɪtɪ','[n] 特性, 特质','...seafood, paella, and other specialities.  …海鲜、西班牙肉菜饭及其他特色食品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5330','waterfront','''wɔtɚfrʌnt','''wɔːtəfrʌnt','[n] 水边地码头区, 滨水地区','The hotel is down on the waterfront.  这家酒店位于滨水区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5331','carboniferous',',kɑrbə''nɪfərəs',',kɑ:bə''nifərəs','[n] 石炭层',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5332','believable','bi''li:vəbl','bɪ''liːvəbl','[adj] 可信的','a story with believable characters in it  人物真实可信的故事'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5333','regularize','''rɛɡjələraɪz','''regjʊləraɪz','[v] 使有规则, 使有秩序','Cohabiting couples would regularize their unions, they said.  他们说，同居情侣会让他们的结合合法化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5334','casual','''kæʒʊəl','''kæʒjʊəl; -zj-','[adj] 偶然的, 不经意的','a casual manner  漫不经心的态度'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5335','skeletal','''skɛlətl','''skelɪt(ə)l; skə''liːt(ə)l','[adj] 骨骼的, 梗概的','Police discovered the skeletal remains of a corpse buried near the river.  警方发现了埋在河边的一具尸骨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5336','landmark','''lændmɑrk','''læn(d)mɑːk','[n] (航海)陆标, 地界标','One of Belfast’s most famous landmarks, the Grosvenor Hall, has been demolished.  贝尔法斯特最著名的地标之一格罗夫纳大厦已被拆毁了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5337','hinder','''hɪndɚ','''hɪndə','[v] 阻碍, 打扰','His career has been hindered by injury.  由于受伤，他的事业受到了阻碍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5338','elemental',',ɛlɪ''mɛntl',',elɪ''ment(ə)l','[adj] 元素的,自然力的','elemental sulphur  元素硫'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5339','serpentine','''sɝpəntin','''sɜːp(ə)ntaɪn','[adj] 蜿蜒的','the serpentine course of the river  蜿蜒曲折的河道'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5340','bog','bɑɡ','bɒg','[n] 沼泽','Your car will bog down in the mud.  你的车会陷进泥沼的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5341','reside','rɪ''zaɪd','rɪ''zaɪd','[v] 居住','He spent most of his time in Rutherglen, where his family resided.  他大部分时间都在拉瑟格伦度过，他的家人就在那里居住。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5342','toe','to','təʊ','[n] 趾, 脚趾','He stubbed his toe (= hurt it by kicking it against something ) on a rock.  他的脚趾踢到一块石头上受了伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5343','tentatively','''tɛntətɪvli','''tentətivli','[adv] 试验性地,犹豫不决地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5344','brightness','''braɪtnɪs','''braɪtnɪs','[n] 光亮, 明亮','A torch symbolizes the brightness (of the future).  火炬象征光明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5345','regeneration','ridʒɛnə''reʃən','rɪdʒenə''reɪʃn','[n] 再生, 重建','But they can definitely determine how they plan to grow as more people move in, and also how they want to rehabilitate areas that need regeneration.  但它们确实可以决定怎样在更多的人迁移进来的同时计划它们的增长，以及它们希望怎样修复需要重建的区域。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5346','contour','''kɑntʊr','''kɒntʊə','[n] 轮廓','the contours of the hills  群山的轮廓'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5347','kiwi','''kiwi','''kiːwiː; -wɪ','[n] [鸟]几维(一种新西兰产的无翼鸟)','Other sources of vitamin E include wheat germ oil, dry almond, safflower oil, hazelnut, peanut butter, spinach, broccoli, kiwi, and mango.  维生素E的其他来源的包括小麦胚芽油，干杏仁，红花油，榛子，花生酱，菠菜，西兰花，猕猴桃，芒果。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5348','hummingbird','''hʌmɪŋbɝd','''hʌmɪŋbɜːd','[n] 蜂雀','In a presumably posthumous voiceover, Bwana Beast says he would do it all again, in a hummingbird''s heartbeat.  在大概是死后的画外音里，比斯特说他愿意再来一次，不过这次是以蜂鸟的心跳。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5349','ridiculous','rɪ''dɪkjələs','rɪ''dɪkjʊləs','[adj] 荒谬的, 可笑的','That’s a ridiculous idea!  那主意很荒唐！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5350','resolution',',rɛzə''luʃən','rezə''luːʃ(ə)n','[n] 决心,决议','a resolution calling for a ban on dumping nuclear waste  要求禁止倾倒核废物的决议'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5351','unsuitable','ʌn''sutəbl','ʌn''suːtəb(ə)l; -''sjuːt-','[adj] 不适宜的, 不合适的','unsuitable housing  不合适的住房'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5352','hydroponic',',haɪdrə''pɑnɪk','','[adj] 溶液培养的','And for those who prefer a healthier diet there is also a hydroponic greenhouse where fresh vegetables will grow all year round.  还为那些注意健康饮食者建造了温室，温室内熟菜用溶液培养，新鲜绿色食品一年四季络绎不绝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5353','currier','''kɝɪɚ','''kʌrɪə','[n] 制革匠',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5354','Semitic','si''mitik; se-','si''mitik; se-','[n] /a闪族人(语) (的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5355','randomly','''rændəmlɪ','''rændəmlɪ','[adv] 随便地,任意地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5356','intergalactic',',ɪntɚɡə''læktɪk',',ɪntəgə''læktɪk','[adj] 银河间的, 星际间的','Intergalactic travel remains just a nice idea.  银河间的旅行仍然只是个美好的愿望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5357','diffuses','dɪ''fjus','dɪ''fjuːz','[v] 扩散,弥漫','It allows nicotine to diffuse slowly and steadily into the bloodstream.  它使尼古丁缓慢、稳步地扩散到血液当中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5358','synonymous','sɪ''nɑnɪməs','sɪ''nɒnɪməs','[adj] 同义的','"Getting fit" became synonymous not just with healthier living, but with a leaner, meaner body, and the ground was laid for a burgeoning gym industry.  “获得适合”成为同义词的不只是健康的生活，但一个更精简，寡情的身体，与地面是一个新兴的体育产业奠定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5359','arrow','''æro','''ærəʊ','[n] 箭, 箭头记号','Follow the arrows to the X-ray department.  顺着箭头指示的方向去X光科。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5360','discoloration',',dɪs,kʌlə''reʃən',',dɪskʌlə''reɪʃn','[n] 变色, 污点','Vitamin K is helpful in reducing discoloration and the appearance of capillaries.  维生素K能够帮助减少污点和外观毛细血管。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5361','laborious','lə''bɔrɪəs','lə''bɔːrɪəs','[adj] 艰苦的, 费劲的','the laborious business of drying the crops  把收获的庄稼晒干这一艰苦的工作'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5362','backdrop','''bæk''drɑp','''bækdrɒp','[n] 背景幕, 背景','...the rugged cliffs that formed a backdrop to the village.  ...构成村庄天然屏障的崎岖峭壁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5363','refractory','rɪ''fræktəri','rɪ''frækt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 难控制的,耐火的','...refractory priests who refused to side with the king.  ...拒绝支持国王的桀骜不驯的牧师。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5364','soilless','','','[adj] 不用泥土(培植)的','In horticultural applications, perlite is used throughout the world as a component of soilless growing mixes where it provides aeration and optimum moisture retention for superior plant growth.  在园艺应用，珍珠岩是用来作为在世界各地的一个组成部分无土混合增长，提供最佳的通风和湿度保持优势植物生长。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5365','tight','taɪt','taɪt','[adj] 紧的','tight jeans  紧身牛仔裤'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5366','chest','tʃɛst','tʃest','[n] 胸腔，橱','He crossed his arms over his chest.  他在胸前交叉双臂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5367','nebular','','','[adj] [天]星云的','Ultraviolet radiation from the hot star powers the nebular glow.  热恒星的紫外辐射使星云发光。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5368','mint','mɪnt','mɪnt','[n] 薄荷','new potatoes sprinkled with chopped mint  撒上薄荷屑的嫩马铃薯'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5369','chair','tʃɛr','tʃeə','[n] 椅子,主席 vt担任主席','a kitchen chair  厨房椅'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5370','merit','''mɛrɪt','''merɪt','[n] 优点，功绩; [v] 值得','The merit of the report is its realistic assessment of the changes required.  这份报告的优点就是它对所要求的变动进行了实事求是的评估。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5371','specially','''spɛʃəli','''speʃəlɪ','[adv] 专门地；特别地','specially trained police dogs  经过专门训练的警犬'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5372','someday','''sʌm,de','''sʌm,deɪ','[adv] 有朝一日','I’d like to visit Japan someday.  我想将来有一天去日本。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5373','journalism','''dʒɝnl''ɪzəm','''dʒɜːn(ə)lɪz(ə)m','[n] 新闻业；新闻工作','a career in journalism  新闻工作生涯'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5374','circuit','''sɝkɪt','''sɜːkɪt','[n] 电路,巡回','a well-known entertainer on the club circuit  到夜总会作巡回表演的一位著名艺人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5375','complementary','''kɑmplə''mɛntri','kɒmplɪ''ment(ə)rɪ','[adj] 补充的, 补足的','The computer and the human mind have different but complementary abilities.  电脑与人脑各不相同，却又互为补充。'),
