('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5387','astound','ə''staʊnd','ə''staʊnd','[v] 使惊骇, 使大吃一惊','If we did all the things we are capable of, we would literally astound ourselves.  如果我们所做的都是我们擅长的事情，我们最终将使自己大吃一惊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5388','ID','','ɪd','[abbr] 身份 (identification, identity); [n] 遗传素质',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5389','germinate','''dʒɝmɪnet','''dʒɜːmɪneɪt','[v] 发芽,使生长','Some seed varieties germinate fast, so check every day or so.  有一些品种的种子发芽快，所以差不多每天都要察看一下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5390','nitric','''naɪtrɪk','''naɪtrɪk','[adj] [化]氮的, 含氮的','...nitric oxide.  ...氧化氮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5391','luncheon','''lʌntʃən','''lʌn(t)ʃ(ə)n','[n] 午宴, 正式的午餐','Earlier this month, a luncheon for former U.N. staff was held in Vienna.  本月早些时候在维也纳为前联合国工作人员举行了午宴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5392','viscosity','vɪs''kɑsəti','vɪ''skɒsɪtɪ','[n] 粘质, 粘性',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5393','intrude','ɪn''trʊd','ɪn''truːd','[v] 侵入,强挤入','The press has been blamed for intruding into people''s personal lives in an unacceptable way.  新闻媒体因以一种令人无法接受的方式侵入人们的私生活而受到谴责。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5394','dating','''deɪtɪŋ','''deɪtɪŋ','[n] 约会; [v] 约会','I have no experience in dating girls.  我没有和女孩子约会的经验。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5395','muddy','''mʌdi','''mʌdɪ','[adj] 多泥的, 泥泞的','Take your boots off outside if they’re muddy.  要是靴子上都是泥，你就脱在门外吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5396','hive','haɪv','haɪv','[n] 蜂房; [v] (使)入蜂箱, 群居','The most important member of any hive is the queen bee.  任何一个蜂房中最重要的成员都是蜂王。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5397','incomprehensible','ɪn,kɑmprɪ''hɛnsəbl',',ɪnkɒmprɪ''hensɪb(ə)l','[adj] 费解的,不可思议的','legal documents full of incomprehensible jargon  满是难懂术语的法律文件'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5398','evidently','''ɛvɪdəntli','''evɪd(ə)ntlɪ','[adv] 显然,清楚地','She was evidently a heavy smoker.  她显然烟瘾很大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5399','label','ˈlebəl','''leɪb(ə)l','[n] 标签,商标; [v] 贴标签于','a luggage label  行李标签'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5400','symmetrical','sɪ''mɛtrɪkl','sɪ''metrɪk(ə)l','[adj] 匀称的，对称的','The pattern was perfectly symmetrical.  该图案完全对称。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5401','lily','''lɪli','''lɪlɪ','[n] 百合,百合花; [adj] 纯洁的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5402','theropod','','''θɪərə(ʊ)pɒd','[adj] 兽性的，野兽般的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5403','supporter','sə''pɔrtɚ','sə''pɔːtə','[n] 支持者, 赡养者','Manchester United supporters  曼彻斯特联队的支持者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5404','precarious','prɪ''kɛrərɪəs','prɪ''keərɪəs','[adj] 危险的,不确定的','Her health remained precarious, despite the treatment.  她尽管接受了治疗，但健康状况还是不稳定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5405','wispy','','','[adj] 纤细的, 脆弱的','The clouds exhibit thin, wispy light blue forms that contrast with the darkness of space (image upper right).  云层稀薄而纤细，并泛着蓝光，和无尽的黑暗太空形成对比（右上部分）。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5406','artificially',',a:ti''fiʃəli',',a:ti''fiʃəli','[adv] 人工地,不自然地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5407','exempt','ɪg''zɛmpt','ɪg''zem(p)t; eg-','[v] 免除; [adj] 被免除的','So we have the current argument over how much of the derivative market will be exempt from regulation.  所以我们就看到了当前有关衍生产品市场到底有多大份额可以得到规则的豁免的辩论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5408','vacancy','''vekənsi','''veɪk(ə)nsɪ','[n] 空白, 空缺','There are still two vacancies on the school board.  学校董事会还有两个职位空缺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5409','rehabilitate',',riə''bɪlə,tet','riːə''bɪlɪteɪt','[v] 修复, 改造','A lot of the older houses have now been rehabilitated.  很多老房子现在都进行了修葺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5410','persuade','pɚ''swed','pə''sweɪd','[v] 说服, 劝说, (使)相信','He was fairly easily persuaded .  他很轻易就被说服了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5411','sunset','''sʌnsɛt','''sʌnset','[n] 日落, 晚年','a glorious sunset  壮丽的日落景象'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5412','intoxication','ɪn,tɑksə''keʃən','ɪn,tɒksɪ''keɪʃn','[n] 陶醉,中毒','Intoxication interferes with memory and thinking, speech and coordination.  醉酒影响记忆、思考，讲话和协调性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5413','genuine','''dʒɛnjʊɪn','''dʒenjʊɪn','[adj] 真实的, 真正的, 诚恳的','‘Did he really?’ Her surprise seemed genuine.  “他真的这样？”她好像是真的惊讶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5414','whereby','wɛr''bai','weə''baɪ','[adv] 凭什么, 为何',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5415','auger','''ɔgɚ','''ɔːgə','[n] 螺丝钻; [vt] 用钻子钻洞于','Jason Hinson, a sixth-generation corn farmer near Kingston, Iowa, keeps an eye on his auger as he unloads his combine on the fly.  贾森·辛森，衣阿华州金士敦附近的第六代玉米农。 他一边把玉米从行进作业中的联合收割机上卸下来，一边观察着螺旋钻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5416','alteration',',ɔltə''reʃən','ɔːltə''reɪʃ(ə)n; ''ɒl-','[n] 变更, 改造','Making some simple alterations to your diet will make you feel fitter.  对你的饮食做一些简单的改变会使你感觉更健康。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5417','longtime','''lɔŋtaɪm','''lɒŋtaɪm','[adj] (已持续)长时间的; [adv] 长久地','"Maybe it doesn''t mean it''s a longtime relationship, but it means there is someone in your life," he said.   “也许这并不意味着是一段长久的关系，但它意味着在你的生命中有一个人的存在，”他说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5418','customary','''kʌstə''mɛri','''kʌstəm(ə)rɪ','[adj] 习惯的, 惯例的','Barbara answered with her customary enthusiasm.  芭芭拉以惯有的热情作了回答。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5419','validate','''vælɪdet','''vælɪdeɪt','[v] [律]使有效, 使生效','The Supreme Court has validated the lower court’s interpretation of the law.  最高法院已经认可下级法院对这条法规的阐释。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5420','sulfide','''sʌl,faɪd','''sʌlfaɪd','[n] <美>[化]硫化物','"Show them a metal sulfide deposit on the seafloor and they think it''s a six-course banquet, " he joked.  “给他们看海底的金属硫化物保护膜，他们就会认为这是一个六方会谈了”，他开玩笑的说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5421','sensibility',',sɛnsə''bɪləti',',sensɪ''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 敏感性,识别力','her religious sensibilities  她的宗教感情'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5422','ether','''iθɚ','''iːθə','[n] 天空醚, 大气','...a sweetish smell of ether and iodine.  ...乙醚和碘酒散发出的微甜味。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5423','tenon','','''tenən','[n] [木工]榫; [vt] 接榫, 造榫','This tenon won''t fit.  这个榫头对不上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5424','whittle','''wɪtl','''wɪt(ə)l','[v] 切, 削; [n] 屠刀','We need to whittle down the list of guests for the party.  我们需要缩减聚会的客人名单。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5425','supersede',',supɚ''sid',',suːpə''siːd; ,sjuː-','[v] 代替, 取代','Their map has since been superseded by photographic atlases.  他们的地图从此被摄影地图册取代。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5426','dehydrate','di''haɪdret','diːhaɪ''dreɪt; diː''haɪdreɪt','[v] (使)脱水','The substance is dehydrated and stored as powder.  该物质经脱水处理后以粉末形式储存。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5427','amino','ə''mino','ə''miːnəʊ; ə''maɪnəʊ','[adj] 氨基的; [n] [化学] 氨基','Players use the cursor to grab, bend, pull, and wiggle the chain of amino acids anywhere along its length, folding the protein into its optimum shape.  玩家们用光标沿着链长方向在任意位置上抓取、弯曲、拉伸和摆动氨基酸链，把蛋白质折叠成最合适的形状。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5428','subjective','səb''dʒɛktɪv','səb''dʒektɪv','[adj] 主观的, 个人的','As a critic, he is far too subjective.  作为评论家，他过于主观。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5429','milky','''mɪlki','''mɪlkɪ','[adj] 牛奶的,乳白色的','a cup of milky coffee  一杯牛奶咖啡'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5430','fertilization',',fɝtlə''zeʃən',',fɜːtɪlaɪ''zeɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 肥沃, 施肥, 授精',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5431','celestial','sə''lɛstʃəl','sɪ''lestɪəl','[adj] 天上的; [n] 神仙','...the clusters of celestial bodies in the ever-expanding universe.  …不断扩展的宇宙中的这些天体群。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5432','appreciable','ə''priʃəbl','ə''priːʃəb(ə)l; -ʃɪə-','[adj] 可感知的,相当可观的','There’s no appreciable change in the patient’s condition.  病人的状况没有明显改变。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5433','eject','ɪ''dʒɛkt','ɪ''dʒekt','[v] 逐出,喷射','Two engines cut out and the plane started to eject fuel as it lost height.  两个发动机突然熄火，飞机在下降的同时开始喷出燃料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5434','victory','''vɪktəri','''vɪkt(ə)rɪ','[n] 胜利,[罗神]胜利女神','Union leaders are heading for victory in their battle over workplace rights.  工会领袖们在争取工作场所权利的斗争中正迈向胜利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5435','tent','tɛnt','tent','[n] 帐篷','We looked for a flat spot where we could pitch our tent (= put up our tent ) .  我们寻找一个平缓的地方搭帐篷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5436','petrifaction',',pɛtrə''fækʃən',',petrɪ''fækʃən','[n] 石化, 化石','Oil distillation process is the first working procedure of the refinery and petrifaction enterprise.  原油蒸馏过程是大型炼油厂和石化企业的龙头工序。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5437','regolith','''rɛgə,lɪθ','''regəlɪθ','[n] [地质]风化层, 土被','Millions of megawatts (terawatts) of electric power will be generated on the Moon by solar arrays that have been constructed from lunar regolith materials.  用月球表面风化层材料制造的太阳能电池阵列的建设得到极大的普及，兆瓦级的太阳能电站星罗棋布。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5438','marrow','''mæro','''mærəʊ','[n] 精华, 活力','We''re getting into the marrow of the film.  我们就要进入这部电影最精彩的部分了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5439','rim','rɪm','rɪm','[n] 边, 轮缘; [v] 镶边','She looked at him over the rim of her glass.  她沿玻璃杯口看着他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5440','ptarmigan','''tɑrmɪɡən','''tɑːmɪg(ə)n','[n] 松鸡类','It was a fearful cry, but the fox, leaping away in fright, did not drop the ptarmigan.  这是一种可怕的喊声，那只狐狸吓跑了，可是没有丢下松鸡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5441','hydroxyapatite','','','[n] [矿]羟磷灰石','Manufacturing the screws out of the hydroxyapatite composite also simplifies production.  制造羟基磷灰石复合螺钉可以简化生产。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5442','percolate','''pɝkəlet','''pɜːkəleɪt','[n] 滤过之液体,滤液; [v] 过滤',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5443','stun','stʌn','stʌn','[v] 使晕倒,打晕; [n] 打昏,惊倒','The impact of the ball had stunned her.  那一球把她打昏了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5444','rapidity','rə''pɪdəti','rə''pɪdɪtɪ','[n] 速度,迅速,急速','And it is from this extended sense of connection that the magnitude of changes, the rapidity of changes, can truly begin to take place.  并且在这扩展延伸的连接感觉当中强度会发生改变，而且是迅速的改变，这会真实的开始并且发生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5445','mudflats','','','[n] 泥滩','They feature a complex network of tidal waterways, mudflats and small islands of salt-tolerant mangrove forests.  以潮汐水道的繁复、泥滩和耐盐的红树林的小岛屿而著名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5446','mineralize','''mɪnrəl,aɪz','''mɪn(ə)rəlaɪz','[v] 使矿物化,采集矿物','Using water softeners to de-mineralize drinking water may reduce some of the potentially helpful effects.  如果使用水质软化器减少饮用水中的矿物含量，就会降低水的作用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5447','calcareous','kæl''kɛrɪəs','kæl''keərɪəs','[adj] 钙质的,石灰质的','The more recent calcareous, or calcium carbonate, deposits that make up the tufa formations are closer to the bottom and lighter in color.  钙质或碳酸钙越近现代，所构成凝灰岩地层的沉积物越靠近底部，颜色也比较浅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5448','tailor','''telɚ','''teɪlə','[n] 裁缝; [v] 剪裁, 缝制','In his youth his father bound him out to a tailor.  他年轻时他父亲叫他去给一个裁缝当学徒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5449','eyebrow','''aɪbraʊ','''aɪbraʊ','[n] 眉毛','thick bushy eyebrows  浓密的眉毛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5450','bedcover','''bɛdkʌvɚ','''bedkʌvə','[n] 被面','Seven treasures equitable considering brush-off, on act not be cautious a bedcover pack to suffocate, hurriedly infuse a few orange juices just difficultly keep on swallowing.  七宝正想拒绝，一不留神被面包噎住，连忙灌了几口橙汁才艰难的咽下去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5451','pillow','''pɪlo','''pɪləʊ','[n] 枕头, 枕垫; [v] 枕着','I’ll be asleep as soon as my head hits the pillow.  我头一碰到枕头就会睡着。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5452','heal','hil','hiːl','[v] 治愈, 医治','a preacher who claims that he can heal the sick  自称可以治病的传道士'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5453','vaguely','''veɡli','''veɪglɪ','[adv] 含糊地, 暧昧地','His statement was very vaguely worded.  他的声明措辞十分含糊。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5454','hundredfold','''hʌndrəd,fold','''hʌndrədfəʊld','[adj] 百倍的; [n] 百倍, 百重','The eminent writers duly propose a huge (nay, hundredfold) boost in funding to help the poor cope with a shifting climate—through drought-resistant crops, for example.  许多著名的作家适时地提出了一个大量（不仅如此，百倍的）增加资金帮助那些穷人应对一个正在转变的气候——例如，通过抗旱作物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5455','agriculturally','','','[adv] 农业上','Illinois boasts convenient transportation and developed economy, and is one of the most agriculturally developed regions in the world.   伊利诺伊州交通便利、经济发达，是世界上农业最发达的地区之一；'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5456','pinhead','''pɪnhɛd','''pɪnhed','[n] 针头, 小东西','It may even be possible to make computers the size of a pinhead one day.  有一天，甚至有可能把计算机做得象针头一样小。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5457','immersion','ɪ''mɝʃən','ɪ''mɜːʃ(ə)n','[n] 沉浸,专心','...long-term assignments that allowed them total immersion in their subjects.  ...可使他们能潜心钻研自己课题的长期任务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5458','founding','''faʊndɪŋ','','[adj] 创办的; [n] 资金',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5459','indispensable','''ɪndɪ''spɛnsəbl','ɪndɪ''spensəb(ə)l','[n] 不可缺少之物; [adj] 不可缺少的','To be without some of the things you wan is an indispensable part of happiness.  你追求不到的东西有时也是幸福不可缺少的一部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5460','nail','nel','neɪl','[n] 指甲,钉子; [v] 将钉牢','The key was hanging on a nail by the door.  钥匙挂在门边的一颗钉子上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5461','entertain',',ɛntɚ''ten','entə''teɪn','[v] 娱乐,招待','Mark usually does the cooking when we entertain.  我们招待客人时通常都是马克下厨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5462','scuba','''skjʊbə','''skuːbə; ''skjuːbə','[n] 水中呼吸器',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5463','frustrate','''frʌstret','frʌ''streɪt; ''frʌs-','[v] 挫败, 阻挠; [n] 挫败的','Their attempts to speak to him were frustrated by the guards.  他们想跟他说话，但被警卫拦住了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5464','sunlit','''sʌnlɪt','''sʌnlɪt','[adj] 被日光照射了的, 阳光照射的','a sunlit garden  阳光灿烂的花园'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5465','unsatisfactory',',ʌn,sætɪs''fæktəri',',ʌnsætɪs''fækt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 不令人满意的,不满足的','an unsatisfactory situation  让人不满意的状况'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5466','separately','''sɛprətli','''sep(ə)rətlɪ','[adv] 分别地,分离地','Cook each vegetable separately until just tender.  把每样蔬菜单独烹煮，直到煮软就行了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5467','collectible','kə''lɛktəbl','kə''lektəbl','[adj] 可收集的, 可代收的','Many of these cushions have survived and are very collectible.  这些垫子中的许多保存了下来并极具收藏价值。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5468','mercury','','','[n] 水银, 汞','Some thieves have eaten off their irons with mercury water.  有些窃贼用汞水腐蚀他们的镣铐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5469','rider','''raɪdɚ','''raɪdə','[n] 骑手, 附文, 扶手','She is a very good and experienced rider.  她是一个有经验的优秀骑手。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5470','opera','''ɑprə','''ɒp(ə)rə','[n] 歌剧','We go to the opera (= go to a performance of opera ) regularly.  我们常去听歌剧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5471','orchestral','ɔr''kɛstrəl','ɔː''kestr(ə)l','[adj] 管弦乐的,管弦乐队的','orchestral music  管弦乐'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5472','landslide','''lændslaɪd','''læn(d)slaɪd','[n] [地]山崩, 滑坡','The storm caused landslides and flooding in Savona.  暴风雨引发了萨沃纳的山崩和水灾。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5473','counteract',',kaʊntɚ''ækt','kaʊntər''ækt','[v] 抵消, 中和, 阻碍','They gave him drugs to counteract his withdrawal symptoms.  他们给他服药以消除他的脱瘾症状。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5474','stature','''stætʃɚ','''stætʃə','[n] 身高,(精神、道德等的)高度','Bernard was short in stature, with a large head.  伯纳德个子矮，头很大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5475','relaxation','''rilæk''seʃən','riːlæk''seɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 松弛, 放宽','I play the piano for relaxation.  我弹钢琴自娱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5476','remediation','rɪ,midɪ''eʃən','rɪ,miːdɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 补习,补救','If you do find an infected machine, the jury is out about how best to do remediation.  如果你在企业网络中发现了一台被感染的机器，那就应该考虑如何来最好的进行补救。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5477','unincorporated','',',ʌnɪn''kɔːpəreɪtɪd','[n] 未联合的,未合并的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5478','profile','''profaɪl','''prəʊfaɪl','[n] 侧面,轮廓','Dani has a lovely profile.  达尼的侧面轮廓很好看。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5479','spurge','spə:dʒ','spɜːdʒ','[n] [植]大戟','An ornamental European spurge (Euphorbia lathyris) having a latex considered to be a potential source of hydrocarbons that can be converted into fuel.  一种装饰性欧洲大戟植物（续随子大戟属） ，它所含的一种乳液据认为是一种潜在的碳氢化合物的来源，可转化成燃料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5480','corner','''kɔrnɚ','''kɔːnə','[n] 角落, (街道)拐角处; [v] 迫至一隅,把难住','He pulled a dirty handkerchief out by its corner and waved it at me.  他拽出一块脏手帕，捏着一角向我挥动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5481','calotype','''kælətaip','''kælətaɪp','[n] 光力照像法',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5482','fringe','frɪndʒ','frɪn(d)ʒ','[n] 边缘, 须边; [adj] 边缘的','a small group on the fringes of the art world  艺术界边缘的一个小群体'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5483','molasses','mə''læsɪz','mə''læsɪz','[n] <美>糖蜜','A better natural substitute would be Manuka honey or molasses but only in very small amounts.  一个天然替代品是麦卢卡蜂蜜或者糖蜜，但是也只能非常小的量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5484','torque','tɔrk','tɔːk','[n] 扭矩, 转矩','In rotation, force becomes torque, mass becomes moment of inertia, and acceleration becomes angular acceleration.  在旋转时，力变成力矩，质量变成转动惯量，加速度变成角加速度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5485','battlefield','''bætlfild','''bæt(ə)lfiːld','[n] 战场, 沙场','...the struggle to save America''s Civil War battlefields.  …保存美国内战战场的努力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5486','dish','dɪʃ','dɪʃ','[n] 盘, 碟; [v] 把…装盘','a serving dish  上菜用的盘子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5487','needlefish','''nidl,fɪʃ','''niːd(ə)lfɪʃ','[n] [动] 颌针鱼(一种长嘴便鳞之海鱼)','We report on an unusual case of penetrating tracheal injury caused by a needlefish.  我们报告一个被针鱼刺伤穿通气管的罕见个案。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5488','discriminate','dɪ''skrɪmɪnet','dɪ''skrɪmɪneɪt','[v] 歧视,区别待遇','He is incapable of discriminating between a good idea and a terrible one.  他没能力在一个好主意和一个坏主意之间进行区分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5489','fireball','''faɪr''bɔl','''faɪəbɔːl','[n] 火球, 大流星','The jet exploded in midair and turned into a fireball.  那架喷气式飞机在半空爆炸，变成了一团火球。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5490','improvisation',',ɪmprəvaɪ''zeʃən','ɪmprəvaɪ''zeɪʃn','[n] 即席创作','It was the improvisation of the ebullition.  它是激情迸发的即兴创作。 哟！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5491','recommendation',',rɛkəmɛn''deʃən',',rekəmen''deɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 推荐, 介绍(信)','Try to get letters of recommendation from bosses and colleagues.  设法得到老板和同事的推荐信。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5492','meteor','''mitɪɚ','''miːtɪə; -tɪɔː','[n] 流星, 大气现象','Astronomers track large meteors using radar.  天文学家使用雷达跟踪大型流星。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5493','comprehensible','''kɑmprɪ''hɛnsəbl','kɒmprɪ''hensɪb(ə)l','[adj] 可理解的','Her speech was slurred and barely comprehensible.  她的发言含混不清，几乎无法听懂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5494','etch','ɛtʃ','etʃ','[v] 蚀刻','A laser is used to etch a pattern in the smooth surface of the disc.  激光器用于在光盘的光滑表面刻录图案。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5495','my','maɪ','maɪ','[pron] 我的','All my friends do not smoke.  我的朋友并不全都吸烟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5496','hay','','heɪ','[n] 干草','...bales of hay.  …一捆捆的干草。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5497','hale','','heɪl','[adj] 强壮的; [v] 硬拖','She’s still hale and hearty at 74.  她74岁仍然精神矍铄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5498','instantly','''ɪnstəntli','''ɪnst(ə)ntlɪ','[adv] 立即地, 即刻地','All four victims died instantly.  四名受害人全部当即死亡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5499','ingoing','''ɪn,goɪŋ','''ɪngəʊɪŋ','[adj] 进入的; [n] 进入,迁就','The outer firewall has ports open that allow ingoing and outgoing HTTP requests.  外部的防火墙仅仅允许进出的 HTTP 请求。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5500','realistically',',riə''lɪstɪkli',',riə''listikəli','[adv] 现实地,逼真地','You can’t realistically expect to win the whole competition.  你指望场场比赛都赢是不现实的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5501','artistry','''ɑrtɪstri','''ɑːtɪstrɪ','[n] 艺术之性质','...his artistry as a cellist.  …他作为大提琴家的艺术技艺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5502','knowledgeable','''nɑlɪdʒəbl','''nɒlɪdʒəb(ə)l','[adj] 知识渊博的, 有见识的','Do you think you are more knowledgeable about life than your parents were at your age?  父母在你这个年龄时，你认为你比他们更了解生活吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5503','cannon','''kænən','''kænən','[n] 大炮, 加农炮; [v] 炮轰','The cannons boom, the band plays.  炮声隆隆，鼓乐齐鸣。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5504','recede','rɪ''sid','rɪ''siːd','[v] 后退','The flood waters finally began to recede in November.  11 月，洪水终于开始退去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5505','organically','','','[adv] 器官上地, 有机地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5506','unintentionally','ˌʌnɪn''tenʃənəli','ʌnɪnˈtɛnʃ(ə)n(ə)li','[adv] 无意地,非故意地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5507','geomagnetic',',dʒiomæg''nɛtɪk',',dʒɪ(ː)əʊmæɡ''netɪk','[adj] 地磁的,地磁气的','The resulting solar storm could cause a geomagnetic storm on Earth, knocking out electricity grids around the world for hours, days, or even months, bringing much of normal life grinding to a halt.  由其引发的太阳风暴可能会激发地磁场风暴，届时，全球电网瘫痪，时间将长达数小时，数天，甚至几个月，大量的生产生活将无法继续进行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5508','magnetize','''mægnə''taɪz','''mægnɪtaɪz','[v] 使磁化, 吸引','His dark flashing eyes seemed to magnetize her.  他那双炯炯有神的黑眼睛好像把她给迷住了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5509','recess','''risɛs','rɪ''ses; ''riːses','[n] (墙壁等的)凹进处; [v] 使凹进,休假','the deep recesses of the cave  洞穴的幽深处'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5510','bonito','bə''ni:təu','bə''niːtəʊ','[n] 鲣','Get ready to savor those bonito flakes.  准备好去体味那些鲣鱼薄片。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5511','hatchling','','','[n] 人工孵化的鱼苗或小鸟','Lohmann speculates that hatchling turtles may imprint on the magnetic field of their home beach and, if so, such a phenomenon could be the basis of strategies for species preservation.  罗曼推测，人工孵化的海龟也许会留下它们家乡海滩磁场的烙印，如果是这样，这种现象可能会成为物种保护的策略基础。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5512','specialist','''spɛʃəlɪst','''speʃ(ə)lɪst','[n] 专门医师, 专家','a heart specialist  心脏专科医生'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5513','vocal','''vokl','''vəʊk(ə)l','[adj] 声音的,有声的; [n] 元音','vocal music  声乐'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5514','hilly','''hɪli','''hɪlɪ','[adj] 多小山的, 多坡的','The areas where the fighting is taking place are hilly and densely wooded.  战斗发生的地区丘陵起伏，树木茂密。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5515','elongate','ɪ''lɔŋɡet','''iːlɒŋgeɪt','[v] 拉长, (使)伸长; [adj] 伸长的','Her legs were elongated by the very high heels which she wore.  她穿的高跟鞋非常高，使她的腿显得长了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5516','linoleum','lɪ''nolɪəm','lɪ''nəʊlɪəm','[n] 油布, 油毯','...a grey linoleum floor.  ...灰色的油毡地面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5517','armor','''ɑrmɚ','''ɑ:mə','[n] 装甲; [v] 为…装甲','The leading role in the film is costumed in medieval armor.  影片中的主角穿着中古时代的甲胄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5518','customarily','''kʌstəmərəli','''kʌstəm(ə)rɪlɪ','[adv] 通常,习惯上','This transformation is customarily called the Industrial Revolution.  习惯上，这种转变被称为“产业革命”。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5519','comprehensive','ˌkɑːmprɪˈhensɪv','kɒmprɪ''hensɪv','[adj] 全面的,能充分理解的','We offer our customers a comprehensive range of financial products.  我们为客户提供全面的金融产品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5520','franklin','''fræŋklin','''fræŋklɪn','[n] 小地主, 乡绅',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5521','morally','''mɔrəli','''mɒrəlɪ','[adv] 道德上','What you did wasn’t illegal, but it was morally wrong .  你做的事并不违法，但从道义上讲是不对的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5522','lathe','leð','leɪð','[n] 车床; [vt] 用车床加工','Beech turns easily in the lathe.  山毛榉在车床上很容易车制。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5523','inherent','ɪn''hɪrənt','ɪn''hɪər(ə)nt; -''her(ə)nt','[adj] 固有的,与生俱来的','Every business has its own inherent risks.  每笔生意本身都有风险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5524','grand','ɡrænd','grænd','[adj] 盛大的,极重要的','We all had a grand time.  我们都过得非常愉快。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5525','inconspicuous','''ɪnkən''spɪkjʊəs','ɪnkən''spɪkjʊəs','[adj] 不显眼的,不引人注意的','an inconspicuous little restaurant  一家不起眼的小饭店'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5526','integrity','ɪn''tɛɡrəti','ɪn''tegrɪtɪ','[n] 正直, 诚实, 完整','the territorial integrity of the country  国家的领土完整'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5527','enroll','ɪn''rol','ɪn''rəʊl','[v] 登记, 招收, 参加',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5528','utterance','''ʌtərəns','''ʌt(ə)r(ə)ns','[n] 意见, 说话, 发表','These two utterances communicate the same message.  这两句话传递同样的信息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5529','treasury','''trɛʒəri','''treʒ(ə)rɪ','[n] 财政部, 国库','Some wonder if his campaign advisers may have a formal role, perhaps in the key job of treasury secretary.  有人想知道，他的竞选顾问是否可以得到正式的职位，也许是关键的财政部长的职位。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5530','apparatus','ˌæpəˈrætəs','ˌæpəˈreɪtəs','[n] 器械, 设备, 仪器','Astronauts have special breathing apparatus.  航天员有专门的呼吸装装备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5531','heartbeat','''hɑrtbit','''hɑːtbiːt','[n] 心跳','Your baby''s heartbeat will be monitored continuously.  您小宝宝的心跳将会受到持续监听。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5532','mast','mæst','mɑːst','[n] 桅,桅杆; [vt] 装桅杆于','While a ketch offers these advantages to cruisers, they may also be more expensive because of the added mast and sail.  尽管双桅帆给水手们提供了这些优势，它们也因为这额外的桅杆和船帆而造价更加昂贵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5533','unify','''junɪfaɪ','''juːnɪfaɪ','[v] 统一,使成一体','Strong support for the war has unified the nation.  对战争的坚决支持使这个国家团结了起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5534','scat','skæt','skæt','[v] 迅速走开; [n] 爵士音乐中无意义的音节的演唱',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5535','unexplored',',ʌnɪk''splɔrd','ʌnɪk''splɔːd; ʌnek-','[adj] [地质] 未勘查过的','unexplored planets  未经探索的行星'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5536','playground','''ple''graʊnd','''pleɪgraʊnd','[n] 运动场, 操场','children shouting and running in the playground  在操场上叫嚷奔跑的孩子们'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5537','upland','''ʌplənd','''ʌplənd','[n] 丘陵地, 高地; [adj] 高地的,山地的','...a deep valley ringed by green uplands.  ...一个绿色高地环绕的深谷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5538','woodpecker','''wʊdpɛkɚ','''wʊdpekə','[n] [鸟]啄木鸟','A woodcutter and a woodpecker lived in the forest.  森林里居住着一个樵夫和一个啄木鸟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5539','friendliness','''frɛndlɪnɪs','''fren(d)lɪnɪs','[n] 友谊,友善','His kind smile soon generated friendliness.  他友善的微笑很快造成了友好的气氛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5540','sympathy','''sɪmpəθi','''sɪmpəθɪ','[n] 同情, 同情心','Our sympathies are with the families of the victims.  我们向受害者家庭表示慰问。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5541','wingspan','''wɪŋ''spæn','''wɪŋspæn','[n] [空]翼展','...a glider with an 18-foot wingspan.  ...一架翼幅为18英尺的滑翔机。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5542','counter','''kaʊntɚ','''kaʊntə','[n] 计算器,柜台; [ad&prep] 相反地','He wondered if the girl behind the counter recognised him.  他在想柜台后面的那个女孩是否认出了他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5543','campus','''kæmpəs','''kæmpəs','[n] <美>校园,大学教育','a beautiful campus in New England  新英格兰的一个美丽校园'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5544','flicker','''flɪkɚ','''flɪkə','[n&v] 闪烁,摇曳','The overhead lights flickered momentarily.  头顶灯闪了一会儿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5545','approve','ə''prʊv','ə''pruːv','[v] 赞成, 批准','The conference approved a proposal for a referendum.  会议通过了举行全民公决的提议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5546','anvil','''ænvɪl','''ænvɪl','[n] [解]砧骨','Scientists recently used a diamond anvil like this one to squeeze tiny samples of metallic glass.  最近，科学家用一种像图中所示的菱形铁砧来压制金属玻璃的小样品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5547','proximity','prɑk''sɪməti','prɒk''sɪmɪtɪ','[n] 接近, 亲近','Here the rich and the poor live in close proximity (= very near to each other ) .  在这里，富人和穷人比邻而居。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5548','excellence','''ɛksləns','''eks(ə)l(ə)ns','[n] 优秀, 卓越','centres of academic excellence  成就卓著的学术中心'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5549','loggerhead','''lɔɡəhɛd','''lɒgəhed','[n] 傻子,铁球棒',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5550','pertain','pɝ''ten','pə''teɪn','[v] 适合, 属于','...matters pertaining to naval district defence.  …与海军区域防卫有关的问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5551','demonstration',',dɛmən''streʃən','demən''streɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 示范, 实证','a cookery demonstration  烹饪示范'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5552','dike','daɪk','daɪk','[n] 堤防; [v] 筑堤提防','When the river dike is completed, the crops will be safe against floods.  修好河堤， 庄稼就不怕淹了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5553','ineffective',',ɪnɪ''fɛktɪv','ɪnɪ''fektɪv','[adj] 无效的, (指人)工作效率低的','an ineffective marketing campaign  一场毫无成效的营销活动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5554','explosive','ɪk''splosɪv; ɪk''splozɪv','ɪk''spləʊsɪv; ek-','[adj] 爆炸(性)的,暴露; [n] 爆炸物','Because the gas is highly explosive, it needs to be kept in high-pressure containers.  由于这种气体极易爆炸，因此需要保存在高压容器内。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5555','rooftop','''rʊf''tɑp','','[n] 屋顶; [adj] 屋顶上的','Spectators stood on rooftops to watch the parade.  观众站在屋顶上观看庆祝游行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5556','interplanetary',',ɪntɚ''plænətɛri','ɪntə''plænɪt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 太阳系内的,行星间的','interplanetary space missions  星际太空飞行任务'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5557','actor','''æktɚ','''æktə','[n] 男演员,行动者','His father was an actor in the Cantonese Opera Company.  他父亲曾是粤剧团的一名演员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5558','lovely','''lʌvli','''lʌvlɪ','[adj] 可爱的,有趣的','She had a lovely face.  她有一张漂亮的脸蛋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5559','caput','''kepət','''keɪpət','[n] 头, 首','Chronic portal hypertension may lead to development of collateral circulation , which is manifested as caput medusa in the region of the umbilicus and epigastrium.  慢性门脉高压可导致侧枝循环建立，可出现脐部和上腹部局部水母头样改变。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5560','receptiveness','','','[n] 感受性,接受能力','Group intelligence is correlated, Malone and his colleagues found, with the average social sensitivity — the openness, and receptiveness, to others — of a group''s constituents.  马龙和他的同事们发现团队智能是和团队成员的平均社会敏感度——开放性，接受能力等等相关联的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5561','punish','''pʌnɪʃ','''pʌnɪʃ','[v] 惩罚,处罚','Smacking is not an acceptable way of punishing a child.  要惩罚孩子，不应该用打的方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5562','animate','''ænɪmet','''ænɪmeɪt','[v] 鼓舞; [adj] 生气勃勃的','Natural philosophy involved the study of all aspects of the material world, animate and inanimate.  自然哲学涉及到了对包括有生命体与无生命体的物质世界的全面研究。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5563','militaristic',',mɪlɪtə''rɪstɪk','','[adj] 军国主义的','...aggressive militaristic governments.  ...侵略性的军国主义政府。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5564','acreage','''ekərɪdʒ','''eɪk(ə)rɪdʒ','[n] 英亩数, 面积','The Palestinians would balk at that as far too much, even if they got the equivalent acreage back, perhaps adjacent to the Gaza Strip.  巴基斯坦方对于这个提议望而却步，即便他们能换回同样多的英亩数，还有可能得到加沙地带的邻近区域。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5565','impersonation','','','[n] 扮演','Convinced of his own righteousness, he was the perfect impersonation of a man of rectitude.  他确信自己很正直，可以完美地扮演刚正不阿的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5566','reabsorb',',ri:əb''sɔ:b',',riːəb''zɔːb; -''sɔːb','[v] 再吸附,重吸收','It could just be a cyst that would either reabsorb itself into the body or need to be surgically removed.  它也有可能仅仅是一个囊肿，能被身体再吸收或者通过手术就可以把它给切除掉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5567','interference',',ɪntɚ''fɪrəns','ɪntə''fɪər(ə)ns','[n] 冲突, 干涉','Industrial relations should be free from state interference.  劳资关系应不受政府干预。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5568','overturn','''ovətɝn','əʊvə''tɜːn','[n] 倾覆, 破灭; [v] 推翻, 颠倒','We saw the canoe overturn, throwing its passengers into the water.  我们看到独木舟倾覆了，把上面的乘客掀入水中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5569','duke','dʊk','djuːk','[n] 公爵','the Duke of Norfolk  诺福克公爵'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5570','squarely','''skwɛrli','''skweəlɪ','[adv] 方形地, 直角地','He turned and faced her squarely.  他转过身来和她正面相对。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5571','Henderson','','','[n] 亨德森（姓氏）','It was built for one of the Henderson family, right?  它是为了亨德森家族的一个成员建的，对吧？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5572','pronoun','''pronaʊn','''prəʊnaʊn','[n] 代名词','Now if we could only figure out the pronoun problem.  现在我们可以解决这个代词问题了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5573','prisoner','''prɪznɚ','''prɪz(ə)nə','[adj] 囚犯的; [n] 战俘','He was being held prisoner.  他正遭囚禁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5574','October','ɑk''tobɚ','ɒk''təʊbə','[n] 十月(略作Oct)','Most seasonal hiring is done in early October.  多数季节性招聘是在10月初进行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5575','rawhide','''rɔhaɪd','''rɔːhaɪd','[n] 生牛皮; [vt] 用生牛皮鞭抽打; [adj] 生牛皮的','At his belt he carried a rawhide whip.  他腰间别着一根生牛皮制作的鞭子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5576','nonagricultural','','','[adj] 非农业的','Many causes have been proposed for both the intelligence gap and the Flynn effect, including education, income, and even nonagricultural labor.  人们对智力差距和弗林效应提出了许多成因，包括教育、收入，甚至还包括非农业劳动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5577','dale','del','deɪl','[n] 宽谷, 溪谷','the Yorkshire Dales National Park  约克郡山谷国家公园'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5578','devastation',',devə''steiʃən',',devə''steɪʃn','[n] 毁坏,荒废','The war brought massive devastation and loss of life to the region.  战争给该地区造成巨大的破坏以及生命的丧失。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5579','fletcher','''fletʃə','''fletʃə','[n] <古>造箭者,弗莱彻',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5580','paradoxically',',pærə''dɔksikəli',',pærə''dɔksikəli','[adv] 相矛盾地,似非而是地','Paradoxically, the prohibition of liquor caused an increase in alcoholism.  矛盾的是，禁酒反而导致酗酒的增加。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5581','credible','''krɛdəbl','''kredɪb(ə)l','[adj] 可信的,可靠的','Her excuse was barely credible.  她的借口无法让人信服。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5582','flute','flut','fluːt','[n] 长笛; [v] 吹长笛,刻槽','The boy trilled on a flute.  男孩在长笛上吹颤音。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5583','automate','''ɔtəmet','''ɔːtəmeɪt','[v] 使自动化, 自动操作','Cash machines automate two basic functions of a bank – deposits and withdrawals.  柜员机使银行的两个基本功能——存款和取款自动化了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5584','pedagogy','''pɛdə''godʒi','''pedəgɒdʒɪ; -gɒgɪ','[n] 教学, 教授','I’ve learned as much about teaching from learning about marketing as I have from studying pedagogy – maybe more.  我从销售上学到的有关教育的东西和我研究教育学时候学到的一样多——可能更多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5585','pregnant','''prɛɡnənt','''pregnənt','[adj] 怀孕的, 重要的','care for pregnant women  孕妇保健'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5586','trait','tret','treɪt; treɪ','[n] 显著的特点, 特性','The study found that some alcoholics had clear personality traits showing up early in childhood.  这项研究发现一些酗酒者早在孩童时就表现出明显的个性特征。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5587','autonomy','ɔ''tɑnəmi','ɔː''tɒnəmɪ','[n] 自治','campaigners who want greater autonomy for Corsica  希望科西嘉有更多自治权的活动家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5588','exuberant','iɡ''zju:bərənt','ɪg''z(j)uːb(ə)r(ə)nt; eg-','[adj] 繁茂的,生气勃勃的','exube-rant carvings  充满生气的雕刻品'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5589','option','''ɑpʃən','''ɒpʃ(ə)n','[n] 选项, 选择权','There are a number of options available.  有多种选择。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5590','reaper','''ripɚ','''riːpə','[n] 收割者, 收割机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5591','anxiously','','','[adv] 忧虑地, 不安地','Sometimes kids would come to the set, and I could see them looking at me anxiously.  偶尔，会有小孩来剧组参观，我可以看出他们不安地看著我。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5592','elephant','''ɛlɪfənt','''elɪf(ə)nt','[n] 象','A trunk distinguishes the elephant.  长鼻是象的特征。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5593','plague','pleɡ','pleɪg','[n] 瘟疫,麻烦; [v] 折磨, 使苦恼','drops in population levels due to plagues and famines  瘟疫和饥荒造成的人口水平下降'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5594','bellow','''bɛlo','''beləʊ','[v] 怒吼, 咆哮','‘That’s your problem!’ bellowed Hurley.  “那是你的问题！”赫尔利吼道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5595','unreal',',ʌn''riəl','ʌn''rɪəl','[adj] 不真实的, 虚幻的','It seemed unreal to be sitting and talking to someone so famous.  和这么一位大名鼎鼎的人坐在一起谈话似乎很不真实。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5596','fond','fɑnd','fɒnd','[adj] 喜欢的,温柔的','Joe’s quite fond of her, isn’t he?  乔很喜欢她，是不是？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5597','toad','tod','təʊd','[n] [动]蟾蜍',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5598','heave','hiv','hiːv','[v] 举起; [n] 举起,投掷','Michael’s shoulders heaved with silent laughter.  迈克尔憋着不笑出声来，双肩直抖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5599','parade','pə''red','pə''reɪd','[n] 游行,炫耀; [v] 游行,炫耀','a victory parade  胜利游行'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5600','receptive','rɪ''sɛptɪv','rɪ''septɪv','[adj] 善于接受的,能容纳的','You might find them in a more receptive mood tomorrow.  也许他们明天会更乐于接受意见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5601','scope','skop','skəʊp','[n] (活动)范围','measures to limit the scope of criminals’ activities  限制罪犯活动范围的措施'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5602','unplanned',',ʌn''plænd','','[adj] 意外的,在计划外的','an unplanned pregnancy  意外怀孕'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5603','longevity','lɔn''dʒɛvəti','lɒn''dʒevɪtɪ','[n] 长命, 寿命','The ancient Chinese claimed that garlic promoted longevity.  中国古人说蒜能延寿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5604','submit','səb''mɪt','səb''mɪt','[v] (使)服从,递交','In desperation, Mrs. Jones submitted to an operation on her right knee to relieve the pain.  绝望中，琼斯夫人不得已接受了一次她右膝的手术以减轻疼痛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5605','nomad','''nomæd','''nəʊmæd','[n] 游牧部落的人,流浪者; [adj] 游牧的','...a country of nomads who raise cattle and camels.  ...一个饲养牛和骆驼的游牧国家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5606','Mongolia','mɔŋ''ɡəuliə; ''mɔn-','mɔŋ''ɡəuliə; ''mɔn-','[n] 蒙古','Mongolia really is the land of opportunity.  蒙古是名副其实的机会之地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5607','clarity','''klærəti','''klærɪtɪ','[n] 清楚,透明','Letters may be edited for length and clarity.  信件可能要加以修改以求篇幅合适，意思明了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5608','sexually','''sɛkʃʊəli','ˈsekʃʊəli','[adv] 性别地,两性之间地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5609','lifeway','''laɪf,we','''laɪfweɪ','[n] 生活方式, 生活','That alternative is to bring freedom back into existence by taking it back - back to the love of freedom, to our lifeway.  那选择是把自由带回生活存在 夺回来 回到自由的爱 回到我们生活的路.'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5610','facade','fə''sɑd','fə''sɑːd','[n] 正面','an impressive building with a red brick facade  正面为红砖的雄伟建筑'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5611','torrid','''tɔrɪd','''tɒrɪd','[adj] 晒热的,热情的','a torrid love affair  狂热的风流韵事'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5612','kindergarten','''kɪndɚɡɑrtn','''kɪndə,gɑːt(ə)n','[n] 幼儿园; [adj] 幼儿园的,启蒙阶段的','To my kindergarten.  去我的幼儿园。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5613','neuron','''nʊrɑn','''njʊərɒn','[n] [解]神经细胞,神经元','What it does mean is that, for whatever reason, this particular neuron was activated by this particular scene, almost certainly with a network of other neurons across the brain.  他确切的意思是:无论是处于什么原因，这个特别的神经元会被特别的场景激活，当然，是和大脑中同一个网状下的其它神经元一起工作的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5614','transmission','træns''mɪʃən','trænz''mɪʃ(ə)n; trɑːnz-; -ns-','[n] 播送, 发射','worldwide data transmission  全球数据传输'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5615','eukaryote','jʊ''kæriot; jʊ''kæriət','juː''kærɪəʊt','[n] 〈生〉真核细胞','Scientists now know that this common ancestor, ''the first eukaryote'', was a lot more sophisticated than any known bacterium.  科学家现在知道，这个共同的祖先，“第一真核生物”比任何已知的细菌都要复杂得多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5616','commensal','kə''mɛnsl','kə''mens(ə)l','[adj] 共餐的; [n] 共食伙伴, 共生物','Widespread outbreaks of intestinal disease are so rare that the commensal bacteria face little danger of extermination.  而且发达国家大规模爆发肠道疾病的可能性很小，使共栖菌被消灭的危险性也大大降低。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5617','living','''lɪvɪŋ','''lɪvɪŋ','[n] 生活,生计; [adj] 活的,逼真的','It’s not a great job, but it’s a living.  这不是什么了不起的工作，不过是一种生计。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5618','inadvertently','''ɪnəd''vɝtntli',',ɪnəd''vɜːt(ə)ntlɪ','[adv] 非故意地,不注意地','Viruses can be spread inadvertently by email users.  病毒会被电子邮件用户无意中传播开来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5619','volt','volt','vəʊlt; vɒlt','[n] (马术中的)环骑,[电工]伏特','That is one electron volt.  就是一单位的电子伏特。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5620','roadbed','''rod,bɛd','''rəʊdbed','[n] 路基','The earthquake made the roadbed cave in.  地震后路基沉陷了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5621','encompass','ɪn''kʌmpəs','ɪn''kʌmpəs; en-','[v] 包围,环绕','His repertoire encompassed everything from Bach to Schoenberg.  他的表演曲目从巴赫到勋伯格，样样俱全。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5622','outnumber','''aʊt''nʌmbɚ','aʊt''nʌmbə','[v] 数目超过, 比多','Flats outnumber houses in this area.  这个地区公寓房比独栋房子多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5623','scar','skɑr','skɑː','[n] 伤痕,疤痕; [v] 结疤,使留下伤痕','He had a long, curved scar on his right cheek.  他的右脸上有一道弯弯的长疤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5624','metabolize','mɛ''tæbəlaɪz','mɪ''tæbəlaɪz','[v] 产生代谢变化','Diabetics cannot metabolize glucose properly.  糖尿病患者不能使葡萄糖进行恰当的新陈代谢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5625','administer','əd''mɪnɪstɚ','əd''mɪnɪstə','[v] 管理, 给予, 执行','The money will be administered by local charities.  这笔资金将由当地慈善机构管理。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5626','fasten','''fæsən','''fɑːs(ə)n','[v] 扎牢,扣住','Make sure all the windows are securely fastened before you leave.  离开前要确保所有的窗子都已关严。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5627','diversify','daɪˈvɜrsəˌfaɪ','daɪˈvɜːsɪˌfaɪ','[v] 使多样化, 作多样性的投资','User requirements have diversified over the years.  这几年来，用户需求已经多样化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5628','grumble','''ɡrʌmbl','''grʌmb(ə)l','[adj] 嘟囔地说; [n] 怨言; [v] 发牢骚','My only grumble is that there isn''t a non-smoking section.  我惟一的抱怨是这儿没有无烟区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5629','degradation',',dɛɡrə''deʃən',',degrə''deɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 降级, 降格, 退化','...air pollution, traffic congestion, and the steady degradation of our quality of life.  …空气污染、交通阻塞以及我们生活质量的持续恶化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5630','neurospora','','','[n] [微]脉孢菌',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5631','subsidy','''sʌbsədi','''sʌbsɪdɪ','[n] 补助金,津贴','European farmers are planning a massive demonstration against farm subsidy cuts.  欧洲的农场主们正在策划一场反对削减农场补贴的大游行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5632','commonsense','','','[adj] 常识的,具有常识的','I mean, in spite of this commonsense explanation, we are going to see how to prove this.  我的意思是，不管常识怎么解释的，我们都将看看如何证明这个定理。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5633','destination',',dɛstɪ''neʃən',',destɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 目的地','Ellis Island has become one of America''s most popular tourist destinations.  埃利斯岛已经成为美国最受欢迎的游览地之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5634','yellowstone','''jeləustəun','''jeləustəun','[n] 黄石国家公园, 黄石河',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5635','mosquito','məˈskiːtoʊ','mɒ''skiːtəʊ','[n] 蚊子','The male mosquito never stings.  雄蚊不叮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5636','paucity','''pɔ:siti','''pɔːsɪtɪ','[n] 极小量',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5637','infect','ɪn''fɛkt','ɪn''fekt','[v] [医] 传染, 感染','People with the virus may feel perfectly well, but they can still infect others.  带有这种病毒的人可能毫无症状，却仍可能传染他人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5638','burin','''bjʊrɪn','''bjʊərɪn','[n] 冰凿,雕刻刀',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5639','walrus','''wɔlrəs','''wɔːlrəs; ''wɒl-','[n] [动]海象, 海象胡须',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5640','deserve','dɪ''zɝv','dɪ''zɜːv','[v] 应受, 值得','What have I done to deserve this?  我做了什么事，要得到这样的报应？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5641','incubator','''ɪŋkjubetɚ','''ɪŋkjʊbeɪtə','[n] 培养的器具, 孵卵器',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5642','poorhouse','''pɔrhaʊs','''pɔːhaʊs; ''pʊəhaʊs','[n] 救济院','Transport most of us to ancient Rome and we’ll find ourselves in a poorhouse or slave barracks.  把我们中的大多数传送到古罗马去，基本只能住救济院或奴隶营房呢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5643','subsidize','''sʌbsə''daɪz','ˈsʌbsɪdaɪz','[v] 资助,津贴','Farming is heavily subsidized (= subsidized a lot ) by the government.  农业得到政府的大量补贴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5644','excitation',',ɛksaɪ''teʃən',',eksaɪ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 刺激,兴奋, 激动',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5645','amniotic',',æmnɪ''otɪk','æmnɪ''ɒtɪk','[adj] [昆] 羊膜的','The amniotic fluid cushioning the baby in your uterus has reached its highest level this week.  这周，子宫里起缓冲作用的羊水达到了它最高的水平。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5646','porpoise','''pɔrpəs','''pɔːpəs; ''pɒpɒɪs','[n] [动]海豚, 小鲸','The rays are often seen gathering in groups near the surface, “flying” through the water by flapping their pectoral fins and sometimes even leaping porpoise-like into the air.  魟鱼经常会成群的聚集在水面以下，通过拍动胸鳍在水中“飞行”，有时候甚至会像海豚一样跃出海面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5647','spew','spju','spjuː','[v] 喷涌,呕吐','Factory chimneys spewed fumes out into the sky.  工厂的烟囱向空中喷吐浓烟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5648','emanate','ˈɛməˌneɪt','''eməneɪt','[v] 散发,发出','He emanates tranquility.  他身上散发着一种恬静气质。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5649','noxious','''nɑkʃəs','''nɒkʃəs','[adj] 有害的','noxious fumes  有毒烟雾'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5650','deviate','''divɪet','''diːvɪeɪt','[v] 偏离,偏轨','They stopped you as soon as you deviated from the script.  你一偏离剧本，他们就会叫停。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5651','shun','ʃʌn','ʃʌn','[v] 避开,避免','a shy woman who shunned publicity  不爱抛头露面的羞怯女子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5652','individually','ˌɪndɪˈvɪdʒuəli','ɪndɪ''vɪdjʊ(ə)lɪ','[adv] 个别地,单独地','The bridegroom thanked them all individually.  新郎向他们一一道谢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5653','aggregation',',ægrɪ''geʃən',',æɡrɪ''ɡeɪʃən','[n] 集合,集合体','An aggregation of fragments is the only kind of whole we now have.  这种碎片的集合体是我们现有的唯一完整无缺的方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5654','erectus','','','[adj] [拉丁语]直立的','Her team is also interested in asking similar questions about human ancestors from East Africa, as well as later species of hominin, such as Homo erectus.  她的团队对于回答有关人类祖先来自东非的类似问题也有兴趣，以及原始人类的人种问题，比如原始人类的直立行走。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5655','sleepiness','''slipɪnɪs','''sliːpɪnɪs','[n] 想睡,瞌睡','If there is excessive daytime sleepiness and desire to nap, in spite of adequate sleep time, this might suggest a sleep disorder warranting further evaluation.  如果白天有很强的睡意，想小睡一会，虽然有充足的睡眠时间，这也许意味着睡眠障碍需要进一步评估。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5656','oneness','''wʌnnəs','''wʌnnɪs','[n] 单一,  统一','Instead of trying to disidentify from the ego, we need to embrace the ego while merging it with a sense of oneness.  不要试图从 自我作出错误的识别，我们需要在把 自我 与“ 单一性 ”的观念相合并的同时，要去包容 自我 。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5657','remainder','rɪ''mendɚ','rɪ''meɪndə','[n] 残余, 剩余物; [adj] 剩余的','The remainder must be paid by the end of June.  剩余款项必须在6月底之前支付。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5658','passive','''pæsɪv','''pæsɪv','[adj] 被动的,消极的','Kathy seems to take a very passive role in the relationship.  凯茜在这一关系中似乎扮演着十分被动的角色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5659','excrete','ɪk''skrit','ɪk''skriːt; ek-','[v] 排泄, 分泌','Your open pores excrete sweat and dirt.  你张开的毛孔排出汗液与污垢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5660','namely','''nemli','''neɪmlɪ','[adv] 即,也就是','Three students were mentioned, namely John, Sarah and Sylvia.  有三名学生被提到，即约翰、萨拉和西尔维娅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5661','infection','ɪn''fɛkʃən','ɪn''fekʃ(ə)n','[n] 传染病, 影响,','The baby had an ear infection.  宝宝耳朵感染了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5662','piling','''paɪlɪŋ','''paɪlɪŋ','[n] 打桩, 打桩工程','...bridges set on stone pilings.  ..建造在石桩上的桥。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5663','button','''bʌtn','[ˈbʌtn]','[n] 钮扣; [v] 扣住,扣紧','small pearl buttons  小的珍珠纽扣'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5664','workforce','''wɝkfɔrs','''wɜːkfɔːs','[n] 劳动力,职工总数','Women now represent almost 50% of the workforce.  如今女性几乎占全部劳动人口的 50%。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5665','analyst','''ænəlɪst','''æn(ə)lɪst','[n] 分析家, 分解者','Political analysts expect the Conservatives to win.  政治分析家预计保守党获胜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5666','gradient','''ɡredɪənt','''greɪdɪənt','[adj] 倾斜的; [n] 梯度,坡度','a steep gradient  陡坡'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5667','brace','bres','breɪs','[n] 支柱; [v] 支住,撑牢','The gentle curve of the plywood louver creates its own structural brace and rigidity while softening the daylight around its profile.  百叶窗的柔和曲线的胶合板创建其自身的结构支撑和刚度，同时围绕日光其轮廓。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5668','quest','kwɛst','kwest','[n] 寻求; [v] 追求,探索','They journeyed to the distant Molucca islands in quest of spices.  他们远赴摩鹿加群岛寻找香料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5669','regulator','''rɛɡjuletɚ','''regjʊleɪtə','[n] 调整者,调整器','a heat regulator  热调节器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5670','toolmaking','','','[n] 工具(或刀具)制造,机床维修','If a physical change like that led to better toolmaking, then its owner would have survived better.  如果这样的身体变化导致更好的工具制造，那么变化的拥有者能够更好地存活下来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5671','essay','''ɛse','''eseɪ','[n] 散文','We asked Jason to write an essay about his hometown.  我们让杰森写一篇关于他家乡的短文。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5672','morphology','mɔr''fɑlədʒi','mɔː''fɒlədʒɪ','[n] [生物]形态学, [语法]词法',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5673','hiccup','''hɪkəp','''hɪkʌp','[n] 打嗝; [v] 打嗝','A baby may frequently get a bout of hiccups during or soon after a feeding.  婴儿在进食时或进食后常常会打一阵嗝儿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5674','sow','so','səʊ','[n] 大母猪; [v] 播种,散布','Sow the seeds in late March.  三月底播种。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5675','platypus','''plætɪpəs','''plætɪpəs','[n] [动]鸭嘴兽','The female platypus lays eggs like a bird.  像雌鸟一样，雌鸭嘴兽也下蛋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5676','nurse','nɝs','nɜːs','[n] 护士,保姆; [v] 护理,照料','The nurse is coming to give you an injection.  护士会来给你打针。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5677','damp','dæmp','dæmp','[n] 湿气; [adj] 潮湿的; [v] 使潮湿,阻尼','Damp had stained the walls.  墙上留下了潮湿的痕迹。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5678','halite','''hælaɪt','''hælaɪt','[n] [化]岩盐','Associated Minerals are halite , calcite , sulfur , pyrite , borax and many others.  伴生矿物是岩盐， 方解石， 硫， 硫铁矿， 硼砂和其他许多领域。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5679','subsist','səb''sɪst','səb''sɪst','[v] 生存, 存在, 供养','The prisoners subsisted on one mug of the worst quality porridge three times a day.  犯人一天三次靠一杯最差的粥维持生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5680','straighten','''stretn','''streɪt(ə)n','[v] (使)弄直, 伸直','Can you straighten your leg?  你能把腿伸直吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5681','July','','','[n] 七月(略作Jul)','But from February through July, Joy sat around with nothing to do.  但是从二月到七月，乔伊又无事可做了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5682','lump','lʌmp','lʌmp','[n] 肿块,笨人; [v] 使成块状','Strain the custard to remove lumps.  滤去牛奶蛋糊里的面块。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5683','balloon','bə''lun','bə''luːn','[n] 气球; [v] 膨胀','Can you help me blow up these balloons?  你帮我把这些气球吹起来好吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5684','meteorologist','''mitɪə''rɑlədʒɪst',',miːtɪə''rɒlədʒɪst','[n] 气象学者','"This is probably one of the worst storms since 1990," a meteorologist in Seattle said.  西雅图气象专家表示，这也许是自1990年以来最严重的暴风雪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5685','rust','rʌst','rʌst','[n] 铁锈; [v] (使)生锈,锈蚀','There were large patches of rust on the car.  车上有大片锈斑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5686','undeveloped',',ʌndɪ''vɛləpt','ʌndɪ''veləpt','[adj] 不发达的, 未开发的','an undeveloped stretch of coastline  一段未开发的海岸线'),
