('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5698','mesopotamian','','','[n] 美索不达米亚（两河流域）',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5699','birdlike','''bə:d,laik','''bɜːd,laɪk','[adj] 敏捷轻快的,似鸟的','...the birdlike way she darted about.  ...她像小鸟一样四处奔跑的样子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5700','somerset','','','[n] 翻筋斗; [vi] 翻筋斗',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5701','appetite','''æpɪtaɪt','''æpɪtaɪt','[n] 食欲,欲望','Her husband always had a huge appetite.  她丈夫向来胃口极大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5702','shrink','ʃrɪŋk','ʃrɪŋk','[v] 收缩, (使)皱缩; [n] 收缩','I’m worried about washing that shirt in case it shrinks.  我不太敢洗那件衬衫，怕它会缩水。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5703','dampen','''dæmpən','''dæmp(ə)n','[v] 使潮湿,沮丧',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5704','textural','','','[adj] 组织的,结构的','The design strategy embraces textural contrast and celebrates the dissonance of eclectic elements to create a truly memorable patron experience.  设计策略包括结构设计对比以及折中元素对比，建立一个真正令人难忘的顾客体验。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5705','ribbon','''rɪbən','''rɪbən','[n] 缎带,丝带; [v] 撕成条','little girls with ribbons in their hair  头发上系着丝带的小姑娘们'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5706','derrick','''dɛrɪk','''derɪk','[n] 起重机, (钻井)井口上的铁架塔',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5707','phoenix','''finɪks','''fiːnɪks','[n] 凤凰,完人','And let it direct your passion with reason, that your passion may live through its own daily resurrection, and like the phoenix rise above its own ashes.  让你们的灵魂以理性引导热情的方向，这样你们的热情才会经历每日的复活，宛若凤凰从自己的灰烬中再生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5708','impersonal','ɪm''pɝsnl','ɪm''pɜːs(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 客观的,没有人情味的','Business letters do not have to be impersonal and formal.  商业信函并非一定要刻板而缺乏人情味。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5709','secular','''sɛkjəlɚ','''sekjʊlə','[adj] 长期的,世俗的','secular education  世俗教育'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5710','onward','''ɑnwɚd','''ɒnwəd','[adj] 向前的; [adv] 向前,在前面','The company offers flights to Amsterdam with onward travel to The Hague.  这家公司开设了飞往阿姆斯特丹并续飞海牙的航班。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5711','expend','ɪk''spɛnd','ɪk''spend; ek-','[v] 花费,消耗,支出','Children expend a lot of energy and may need more high-energy food than adults.  孩子们耗能多，可能比成人需要更多高能量的食物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5712','imaginary','ɪ''mædʒɪnɛri','ɪ''mædʒɪn(ə)rɪ','[adj] 假想的,虚构的','As she listened, she played an imaginary piano on her knees.  她边听边在膝盖上作弹钢琴状。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5713','kinetic','kɪ''nɛtɪk','kɪ''netɪk; kaɪ-','[adj] (运)动的,动力(学)的','kinetic energy  动能'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5714','commitment','kə''mɪtmənt','kə''mɪtm(ə)nt','[n] 委托事项,许诺','Are you ready to make a long-term commitment ?  你是否准备好作出长久的承诺？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5715','pluto','','','[n] 冥王星, 阴间之神',''),
