('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5717','seaport','''sipɔrt','''siːpɔːt','[n] 海港, 港口都市','...the Baltic seaport of Rostock.  ...波罗的海沿岸的海港城市罗斯托克。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5718','patchy','''pætʃi','''pætʃɪ','[adj] 补丁的, 不调和的','patchy fog  局部弥漫的雾气'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5719','sacred','''sekrɪd','''seɪkrɪd','[adj] 神的,害怕的','a sacred vow  神圣的誓言'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5720','clinical','''klɪnɪkl','''klɪnɪk(ə)l','[adj] 临床的,诊所的','The drug has undergone extensive clinical trials (= tests to see if it is effective in treating people ) .  该药已经过大量的临床试验。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5721','verbalize','''vɝbəlaɪz','''vɜːb(ə)laɪz','[v] 用语言描述,累赘','Urge your child to verbalize his feelings.  鼓励你的孩子用言语表达自己的情感。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5722','generator','''dʒɛnəretɚ','''dʒenəreɪtə','[n] 发电机, 发生器','an emergency generator  应急发电机'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5723','uphold','ʌpˈhoʊld','ʌp''həʊld','[v] 支持, 赞成','a committee that aims to uphold educational standards  旨在保持教育水准的委员会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5724','fare','fɛr','feə','[n] 费用,票价; [v] 遭遇, 进展','He could barely afford the fare.  他几乎付不起车费。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5725','cellulose','''sɛljulos','''seljʊləʊz; -s','[n] 纤维素,（植物的）细胞膜质','Development of celluloses that are stable outside the cells of microorganisms enables the culturing of fungi and with yeasts on cellulose hydrolyzates.  开发在微生物细胞外部能稳定存在的纤维素酶使真菌和酵母在纤维素水解产物上培养有了可能。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5726','Patricia','pə''triʃə','pə''triʃə','[n] 帕特丽夏（女子名）','The novel''s epigraph states "Promise kept", and at the end Patricia says: "You asked my permission to write your story.   这本小说的题词为“不渝的承诺”，在书的结尾，帕特丽夏说道：“你问我可不可以写下你的故事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5727','yam','yam','jam','[n] 山药, 洋芋','And we went into the poisonous giant tubers, like the yam and the taro, which also had to be leeched, ground up and cooked before we could eat them.  我们也寻找到了那些带有毒性的、个头颇大的块茎，像山药、芋头，这些在食用之前得经过榨取、提炼和烹饪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5728','sharper','''ʃɑrpɚ','''ʃɑːpə','[n] 磨具,(赌博中的)骗子',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5729','candlelight','''kændllaɪt','''kænd(ə)llaɪt','[n] 烛火,黄昏','The jewels sparkled in the candlelight.  珠宝在烛光下熠熠生辉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5730','allocation',',ælə''keʃən','ælə''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 分配,安置','A State Department spokeswoman said that the aid allocation for Pakistan was still under review.  国务院的一位女发言人说对巴基斯坦的援助配置仍在审核之中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5731','vantage','''væntɪdʒ','''vɑːntɪdʒ','[n] 优势,有利情况','From that vantage point, he shrewdly harnessed his new influence in the struggle against the dominant Yankee establishment.  他机敏地利用了这一任职优势，在和那些美国大家族企业的斗争中施加自己的影响力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5732','flowerbed','''fləuəbed','','[n] 花床,花圃','Each flowerbed is populated with those classic English garden decorations: little statues of gnomes.  他们各自的花圃开的花布满了那些传统英式花园，这些花就是地精的塑像。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5733','debatable','dɪ''betəbəl','dɪ''beɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 成问题的,未决定的','a debatable point  有争议的地方'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5734','petrochemical','''pɛtro''kɛmɪkl','petrə(ʊ)''kemɪk(ə)l','[adj] 石化的; [n] 石化产品','Some petrochemical projects, which provide raw materials to make plastics and fertilizers, also are under pressure.  一些为制造塑料和化肥提供原材料的石化项目也面临着资金压力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5735','objectify','əb''dʒɛktɪfaɪ','ɒb''dʒektɪfaɪ','[v] 使客观化,具体化','a culture that objectifies women  将女性物化的一种文化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5736','alternatively','ɔl''tɝnətɪvli','ɔːl''tɜːnətɪvlɪ','[adv] 做为选择,二者择一地','Hotels are generally of a good standard and not too expensive. Alternatively you could stay in an apartment.  旅馆一般标准高并且不太贵。或者你可以住公寓。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5737','lawn','lɔn','lɔːn','[n] 草坪, (均匀生长于固体培养基的)菌苔','I spent all morning mowing the lawn (= cutting the grass ).  我整个上午都在修剪草坪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5738','intelligible','ɪn''tɛlɪdʒəbl','ɪn''telɪdʒɪb(ə)l','[adj] 可理解的,明了的','The language of Darwin was intelligible to experts and non-experts alike.  达尔文的语言对专家和平常人来说都容易理解。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5739','deviation','''divɪ''eʃən','diːvɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 背离,偏离','Deviation from the norm is not tolerated.  偏离规范是不能容忍的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5740','vacate','ˈveɪˌkeɪt; veɪˈkeɪt','veɪ''keɪt; və''keɪt','[v] 腾出, 空出,离(职),退(位)','Clay will vacate the position on June 19.  克莱将于6月19日离职。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5741','subtropic','','','[adj] 亚热带的,副热带的','The whole area of DingHu mount is in tropic zone, covered with subtropic forests, with unique climate.  鼎湖山整个地区为热带，亚热带森林所覆盖，气候独特。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5742','scenic','ˈsinɪk','''siːnɪk','[adj] 舞台的, 景色优美的; [n] 风景照片','a region of scenic beauty  景色优美的地区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5743','comic','''kɑmɪk','''kɒmɪk','[n] 滑稽演员; [adj] 滑稽的, 喜剧的','a stand-up comic  单口喜剧演员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5744','tusk','tʌsk','tʌsk','[n] 长牙; [v] 以牙刺戳','A huge tusk decorated the wall of his study.  他书房的墙上装饰着一支巨大的象牙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5745','meaty','''miti','''miːtɪ','[adj] 肉的,多肉的','a delicious meaty gravy  香浓美味的肉汁'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5746','resilient','rɪ''zɪlɪənt','rɪ''zɪlɪənt','[n] 帕特森（美国一座城市）',''),
