('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5752','soar','sɔr','sɔː','[v] 高飞,昂扬; [n] 高涨程度','Adam’s smile sent her spirits soaring .  亚当的微笑让她飘飘然了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5753','dismantle','dɪs''mæntl','dɪs''mænt(ə)l','[v] 拆除','Chris dismantled the bike in five minutes.  克里斯五分钟内就把自行车拆掉了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5754','refinery','rɪ''faɪnəri','rɪ''faɪn(ə)rɪ','[n] 精炼厂','...an oil refinery.  …一家炼油厂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5755','riverbank','''rɪvɚbæŋk','''rɪvəbæŋk','[n] 河堤, 河岸','A herd of about 100 African buffalo meanders quietly along a riverbank.  一群非洲水牛，大约100只，安详地顺着河岸漫步。'),
