('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5760','aquatic','ə''kwætɪk','ə''kwætɪk; -''kwɒt-','[adj] 水的,水生的; [n] 水生动物','an aquatic plant  水生植物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5761','vibration','vaɪ''breʃən','vaɪ''breɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 振动,颤动','the vibrations from the earthquake  地震引起的震动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5762','loop','lup','luːp','[n] 环,回路; [v] 使成环,打环','He looped the rope over the wood.  他把绳子打了环系在木头上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5763','unionization','','','[n] 联合, 结合','During the past 40 years, the fraction of unionized civilian workers fell steeply-and not only in the United States- while the unionization of government workers fell only a little.  在过去40年里，非政府工人在联合会的比例大幅度下降——这种现象不止发生在美国——而政府员工在联合会的比例仅小幅度下降。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5764','aboveground','ə''bʌv,graʊnd','ə''bʌv,ɡraʊnd','[adj] 在地面上的; [adv] 地面上地','Where the water table is very high and contamination cannot be otherwise avoided, aboveground tanks may be needed.  在地下水位很高以致水源污染无法被避免的地方，储水池需建在比地面高的地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5765','encroachment','ɪn''krotʃmənt','eŋ''krəʊtʃm(ə)nt','[n] 侵蚀, 侵犯','It''s a sign of the encroachment of commercialism in medicine.  这是营利主义入侵医学界的一种迹象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5766','semicircular','','','[adj] 半圆的','...a semicircular amphitheatre.  ...一个半圆形露天竞技场。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5767','handsome','''hænsəm','''hæns(ə)m','[adj] 英俊的,大方的','They won a handsome victory in the elections.  他们在选举中取得了重大的胜利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5768','snout','snaʊt','snaʊt','[n] 猪嘴,鼻子','Two alligators rest their snouts on the water''s surface.  两只鳄鱼把它们的大嘴栖息在水面上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5769','weightlessness','','','[n] 无重状态','He came closest to visiting alien worlds through his love of deep-sea diving, its weightlessness and strange life forms.  他以他深海潜水般的爱去做外星世界访问，探寻那里的失重状态和奇异的生命形式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5770','suggestive','sə''dʒɛstɪv','sə''dʒestɪv','[adj] 提示的,暗示的','He kept giving me suggestive looks.  他一直用挑逗的目光看我。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5771','rougher','','','[n] 粗切机,粗选槽',''),
