('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5773','mystique','mɪ''stik','mɪ''stiːk','[n] 神秘性,奥秘','Some of the mystique surrounding the presidency has gone forever.  总统职位的某些神秘性已经永远消失了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5774','lengthwise','''lɛŋθ,waɪz','''leŋθwaɪz; -ŋkθ-','[adj] 纵长的; [adv] 纵长地','His nose also bore a long cut lengthwise.  他的鼻腔也有一道纵向的长伤痕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5775','sensation','sɛn''seʃən','sen''seɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 感觉,感情','Jerry realized that he had no sensation in his legs.  杰里意识到自己双腿都没有了知觉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5776','Victorian','vik''tɔ:riən','vik''tɔ:riən','[adj] 维多利亚女王时代的','a big Victorian house  一幢维多利亚时代的大房子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5777','contend','kən''tɛnd','kən''tend','[v] 斗争, 竞争, 主张','Inevitably, fights break out between the members of contending groups.  争权夺利的几个团体之间不可避免地发生了打斗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5778','grace','ɡres','greɪs','[n] 优美, 雅致; [v] 使优雅','Lena moved with the grace of a dancer.  莉娜走路姿势有着舞者般的优美。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5779','Chile','''tʃili','''tʃili','[n] 智利','In the meantime, we must all have confidence in Chile.  与此同时，我们大家都必须对智利保持信心。'),
