('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5793','nutritive','''njʊtrətɪv','''njuːtrɪtɪv','[adj] 营养的; [n] 营养物','Coconut milk has little nutritive value.  椰子汁没什么营养价值。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5794','revision','rɪ''vɪʒən','rɪ''vɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 修订,修正,修订本','The phase of writing that is actually most important is revision.  写作中真正最重要的阶段是修改。'),
