('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5799','straightforward',',stret''fɔrwɚd','streɪt''fɔːwəd','[adj] 正直的,简单的; [adv] 坦率地','This area of law is far from straightforward (= complicated ) .  法律的这个领域很复杂。'),
