('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5809','rigor','''rɪgɚ','''riɡə','[n] 严格,精确','This approach represents the next level of rigor in modeling.  此方法表现出建模中的下一个精确级别。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5810','grotto','''ɡrɑto','''grɒtəʊ','[n] 洞穴,人工洞室','Water trickles through an underground grotto.  水流经一个地下岩洞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5811','salad','''sæləd','''sæləd','[n] 色拉','Would you like some salad with your pasta?  你的意大利面要配些色拉吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5812','prostrate','''prɑstret','''prɒstreɪt','[adj] 降伏的,俯卧的; [v] 使屈服','They found him lying prostrate on the floor.  他们发现他趴在地板上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5813','protector','prə''tɛktɚ','prə''tektə','[n] 保护者','Many mothers see their son as a potential protector and provider.  许多母亲将她们的儿子看作是潜在的保护人和赡养人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5814','bode','bəud','bəʊd','[v] 预示','She says the way the bill was passed bodes ill for democracy.  她说议案通过的方式预示民主的恶运。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5815','club','klʌb','klʌb','[n] 俱乐部,(扑克牌)梅花; [v] 募集','Manchester United Football Club  曼联（队）足球俱乐部'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5816','hump','hʌmp','hʌmp','[n] 驼峰,峰丘; [v] (使)隆起','Camels rebuild fat stores in their hump.  骆驼在自己的驼峰内重新贮备脂肪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5817','blaze','blez','bleɪz','[n] 火焰; [v] 照耀,激发','It took almost 100 firemen to bring the blaze under control.  出动了近100名消防员才控制住火势。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5818','indecipherable','''ɪndɪ''saɪfrəbl',',ɪndɪ''saɪf(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 无法解释的,难辨认的','an indecipherable signature  难以辨认的签名'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5819','substantiate','səb''stænʃɪet','səb''stænʃɪeɪt','[v] 使实体化,证实','Katzen offered little evidence to substantiate his claims .  卡曾拿不出什么证据来证明他的说法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5820','ghost','ɡost','gəʊst','[n] 鬼, 幽灵','They say the young girl’s ghost still haunts (= often appears in ) the house.  他们说那个少女的鬼魂依旧在那房子里出没。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5821','faint','fent','feɪnt','[n] 昏晕; [v] 昏晕; [adj] 头晕的','She slumped to the ground in a faint.  她跌倒在地上不醒人事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5822','Peru','pə''rʊ','pəˈruː','[n] 秘鲁','It sounds as though you enjoyed Peru.  这听起来好像你喜欢秘鲁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5823','diva','''divə','''diːvə','[n] 歌剧中的首席女主角','opera diva Jessye Norman  著名歌剧女歌唱家杰茜·诺曼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5824','nonstop','nɑn''stɑp','''nɔn''stɔp','[adj] 不断的,直达的; [adv] 不休息地','a nonstop flight to Los Angeles  直飞洛杉矶的航班'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5825','bifocal','''baɪ''fokl','baɪ''fəʊk(ə)l','[adj] 双焦点的','He had beautiful skin, with rosy cheeks, blue eyes, rimless round bifocal spectacles, resting on the tip of his nose.  他皮肤很好，面颊红润，眼睛深蓝，鼻梁上架着一副无框双焦眼镜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5826','cougar','''kuɡɚ','''kuːgə','[n] [动]美洲狮(尤指Felis concolor)','Then Mrs. McAlister grabbed a shovel in the yard and swung it at the cougar.  于是阿里斯特太太抓起后院的一把铁锹对着美洲狮挥来挥去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5827','versatile','''vɝsətl','''vɜːsətaɪl','[adj] 多才多艺的,万能的','a very versatile performer  多才多艺的表演者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5828','smear','smɪr','smɪə','[v] 涂污,弄脏; [n] 油迹, 涂片','smeared windows  脏了的窗户'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5829','ocher','''okɚ','''əʊkə','[n] 黄土, 赭土',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5830','mentally','''mɛntli','''ment(ə)lɪ','[adv] 精神上, 智力上','Above all be mentally prepared for the rigors of each trading day from the time you get up each morning until you go to bed at night.  最重要的是在精神上对每个交易日的严峻场面作好准备，从每天早晨你爬起来，一直到晚上回到床上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5831','obliterate','ə''blɪtə''ret','ə''blɪtəreɪt','[v] 涂去, 删除, 使湮没',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5832','aspiration','''æspə''reʃən','æspə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 热望, 渴望',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5833','conceivable','kən''sivəbl','kən''siːvəb(ə)l','[adj] 可能的,想得到的','It is conceivable that you may get full compensation, but it’s not likely.  你可能会得到全额赔偿，但可能性不大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5834','internationally','','','[adv] 国际性地, 在国际间','These days businesses have to be able to compete internationally.  如今，企业必须要有实力参与国际竞争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5835','greenish','''ɡrinɪʃ','','[adj] 呈绿色的','...his cold greenish eyes.  ...他冷酷的浅绿色眼睛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5836','succinct','sək''sɪŋkt','sək''sɪŋ(k)t','[adj] 简洁的, 紧身的','a succinct explanation  简明扼要的解释'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5837','midway','''mɪd''we','''mɪdweɪ; mɪd''weɪ','[n] 中途,半路; [adj] 中途的; [adv] 在中途','Fresno is close to the midway point between LA and San Francisco.  弗雷斯诺位于接进洛杉矶和旧金山的中间点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5838','unsung',',ʌn''sʌŋ','ʌn''sʌŋ','[adj] 未唱的,未赞颂的','one of the unsung heroes of French politics  法国政坛的一位无名英雄'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5839','fungicide','''fʌŋgə''saɪd','''fʌn(d)ʒɪsaɪd; ''fʌŋgɪ-','[n] 杀真菌剂','For one thing, they’re not confined to rats or to the fungicide he fed them.  一方面，他们不局限于他所喂养的老鼠及他喂给老鼠的杀菌剂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5840','popularize','''pɑpjələraɪz','''pɔpjuləraiz','[v] 普及','Skinner was the psychologist who popularized behavior modification.  斯金纳就是那位使行为矫正概念得到普及的心理学家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5841','changeable','''tʃendʒəbl','''tʃeɪn(d)ʒəb(ə)l','[adj] 可改变的,无常的','changeable weather  变化无常的天气'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5842','responsive','rɪ''spɑnsɪv','rɪ''spɒnsɪv','[adj] 响应的,应答的','a car with highly responsive steering  方向盘操纵灵活的汽车'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5843','amplify','''æmplɪfaɪ','''æmplɪfaɪ','[v] 放大,详述','an amplified guitar  带有扩音设备的电吉他'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5844','notebook','''notbʊk','''nəʊtbʊk','[n] 笔记簿, 笔记本','He brought out a notebook and pen from his pocket.  他从口袋里掏出了一个笔记本和一支钢笔。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5845','pertinent','''pɝtnənt','''pɜːtɪnənt','[adj] 有关的,相干的','He asked me a lot of very pertinent questions .  他问了我许多直接相关的问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5846','concise','kən''saɪs','kən''saɪs','[adj] 简明的,简练的','Your summary should be as clear and concise as possible.  你的总结应该尽可能地明白简洁。'),
