('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_5847','utilization','ˌjuːtəlaɪ''zeɪʃn',',juːtɪlaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 利用','For someone to realize the value of information, you need to organize data to permit rapid discovery and utilization.  要使某人实现信息的价值，您需要相应地组织数据以允许快速的发现和利用。'),
