('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6116','stonework','''ston''wɝk','''stəʊnwɜːk','[n] 石雕工艺, 做石工的场所','...the crumbling stonework of the derelict church.  ...废弃的教堂摇摇欲坠的石造部分。'),
