('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6118','uncle','''ʌŋkl','''ʌŋk(ə)l','[n] 伯父,叔父,援助者','I went to stay with my uncle and aunt for a few days.  我去和叔叔婶婶住了几天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6119','unanswered','ʌn''ɑnsɚd','ʌn''ɑːnsəd','[adj] 未答复的,无反应的','Many other questions remain unanswered.  还有许多其他问题没有得到解答。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6120','misfortune','''mɪs''fɔrtʃən','mɪs''fɔːtʃuːn; -tʃ(ə)n','[n] 不幸, 灾祸','It seems the banks always profit from farmers’ misfortunes.  银行似乎总是从农民的不幸中获益。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6121','greet','ɡrit','griːt','[v] 问候,向致意','Belinda greeted her warmly.  贝琳达热情地招呼她。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6122','aggregate','''æɡrɪɡət; (for v.) æɡrɪˌɡet','''ægrɪgət; (for v.) ˈægrɪgeɪt','[n] 合计; [v] 聚集, 集合','(=  as a group or in total  ) , women outlive men by 7 or more years.  总体来看，女性比男性多活七年或以上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6123','journalist','''dʒɝnəlɪst','''dʒɜːn(ə)lɪst','[n] 新闻记者,从事新闻杂志业的人','a well-known journalist and broadcaster  一位著名的新闻记者兼播音员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6124','mantel','mæntl','''mænt(ə)l','[n] 壁炉架','As I did, two beautiful cups gleamed from the mantel.  当我这么做的时候，壁炉架上有两座漂亮的奖杯微光一闪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6125','desalination',',di,sælɪ''neʃən','diː,sælɪ''neɪʃən','[n] 减少盐分, 脱盐作用',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6126','slit','slɪt','slɪt','[v] 撕裂; [n] 裂缝, 狭长切口','Guy slit open the envelope.  盖伊拆开信封。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6127','hydraulic','haɪ''drɔlɪk','haɪ''drɔːlɪk; haɪ''drɒlɪk','[adj] 水力的,水压的','a hydraulic pump  水压泵，液压泵'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6128','reappear',',riə''pɪr','riːə''pɪə','[v] 再出现','In March, his cancer reappeared.  3月份，他的癌症又复发了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6129','carton','''kɑrtn','''kɑːt(ə)n','[n] 硬纸盒, 纸板箱','a milk carton  牛奶盒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6130','wan','wɑn','wɒn','[adj] 苍白的,病态的; [v] (使)变苍白','She gave a wan smile.  她无力地笑了一下。'),
