('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6132','horsepower','''hɔrs''paʊɚ','''hɔːspaʊə','[n] 马力','a two-hundred horsepower engine  两百马力的发动机'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6133','quiver','''kwɪvɚ','''kwɪvə','[n] 震动,颤抖; [v] 颤抖,射中','I recognized it instantly and felt a quiver of panic.  我立刻认出它了，感到一阵惊恐的颤抖。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6134','airport','''ɛr''pɔrt','''eəpɔːt','[n] 机场,航空站','The plane landed at Heathrow Airport.  飞机降落在希思罗机场。'),
