('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6358','telescopic','','telɪ''skɒpɪk','[adj] 望远镜的,[眼科] 远视的','a telescopic lens  望远镜头'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6359','crayfish','''kre''fɪʃ','''kreɪfɪʃ','[n] 小龙虾','Earthworms, crayfish and tadpoles are examples.  蚯蚓、小龙虾和蝌蚪都是实例。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6360','geophysical',',dʒio''fɪzɪkl','','[adj] 地球物理学的','These geophysical facts affect the use of language in discussions about water, and the ways in which to think about the problems of scarcity.  这些地球物理学上的事实影响了水资源讨论中所使用的语言，并改变了思考缺水问题的方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6361','ample','''æmpl','''æmp(ə)l','[adj] 充足的, 丰富的','an ample bosom  丰满的胸部'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6362','synchronize','''sɪŋkrənaɪz','''siŋkrənaiz','[v] 同步','It was virtually impossible to synchronize our lives so as to take vacations and weekends together.  为了一起度假和过周末而要让我们的生活同步几乎是不可能的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6363','fluffy','''flʌfi','''flʌfɪ','[adj] 绒毛似的, 蓬松的','a fluffy little kitten  毛茸茸的小猫'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6364','militarily','','','[adv] 以武力, 以军事行动',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6365','precision','prɪ''sɪʒn','prɪ''sɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 精确, 精密度, 精度',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6366','clause','klɔz','klɔːz','[n] 子句, 条款','A confidentiality clause was added to the contract.  合同中加上了一项保密条款。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6367','enforcer','','','[n] 实施者,强制执行者','a law enforcer  执法人员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6368','ostracize','''ɑstrəsaɪz','''ɔstrəsaiz','[v] (古希腊)贝壳放逐法, 放逐, 排斥','She claims she''s being ostracized by some members of her local community.  她声称遭到自己所在社区的一些成员排斥。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6369','extracurricular',',ɛkstrəkə''rɪkjəlɚ','ekstrəkə''rɪkjʊlə','[adj] 课外的, 业余的','Each child had participated in extracurricular activities at school.  每个孩子都参加了学校的课外活动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6370','habitual','hə''bɪtʃuəl','hə''bɪtʃʊəl; -tjʊəl','[adj] 习惯的, 惯常的','James took his habitual morning walk around the garden.  詹姆斯又像往常习惯的那样绕花园作晨间散步去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6371','chronobiology','','','[n] [生]时间生物学, 生物钟学','Once your have familiarized yourself with your patterns, you can take advantage of chronobiology techniques to improve your health and productivity.  一旦你了解了自身的规律，你便能利用时间生物学的手段增强健康、提高生产率。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6372','thinker','','','[n] 思想者, 思想家, 心智','great thinkers such as Kant and Schopenhauer  康德、叔本华等伟大的思想家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6373','songwriter','''sɔŋraɪtɚ','''sɒŋraɪtə','[n] 歌曲作家，歌曲作者','...one of rock''n''roll''s greatest songwriters.  ...一名摇滚乐界最伟大的词曲作者之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6374','spotlight','''spɑtlaɪt','''spɒtlaɪt','[n] 聚光灯','The yard was lit by three huge spotlights.  院子里亮着三盏巨大的聚光灯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6375','inducement','ɪn''dusmənt','ɪn''djuːsm(ə)nt','[n] 诱因, 刺激物','financial inducements to attract good job candidates  吸引优秀人才前来应征的经济诱因'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6376','vogue','voɡ','vəʊg','[n] 、a流行（的）, 时髦（的）','Suntanning first came into vogue in the mid-1930s.  晒黑皮肤最早流行于20世纪30年代中期。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6377','overgeneralize','','','[v] 太笼统地概括',''),
