('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6487','sonar','''sonɑr','''səʊnɑː','[n] 声纳, 声波定位仪',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6488','perennial','pə''rɛnɪəl','pə''renɪəl','[adj] 终年的, 长期的','Lack of resources has been a perennial problem since the beginning.  财力不足从最初起就一直是个问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6489','infiltration',',ɪnfɪl''treʃən',',ɪnfɪl''treɪʃən','[n] 渗透','And what concerns do you have about their infiltration as we move forward?  随着我们的向前推进，您对他们的军事渗入有何看法？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6490','breakage','''brekɪdʒ','''breɪkɪdʒ','[n] 破坏, 破损, 破损量','Brushing wet hair can cause stretching and breakage.  梳刷湿的头发会导致拉抻和破损。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6491','bounce','baʊns','baʊns','[v] (使)反跳, 弹起 n(球)跳起, 弹回','Stop bouncing up and down on the sofa.  别在沙发上蹦来蹦去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6492','apace','ə''pes','ə''peɪs','[adv] 快速地, 急速地','Expansion of the company has continued apace .  该公司继续迅速扩张。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6493','herbicide','''ɝbɪsaɪd','''hɜːbɪsaɪd','[n] 除草剂','But water containing the herbicide cannot be released back into the river and it is known that low water levels can harm river ecosystems accustomed to higher levels.  但含有除草剂的水不能再排向河流，而且我们知道低水位将会对习惯于高水位的河流生态系统造成危害。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6494','compactness','','','[n] 紧密, 简洁','This is gauged by the faithfulness of the implementation to the algorithm''s specifications, the compactness of the algorithm, and the speed with which it encrypts.  这是由实现对算法规范的忠实性、算法的简洁性和加密的速度来衡量的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6495','pluck','plʌk','plʌk','[n] 勇气v拔, 采集','It takes a lot of pluck to stand up to a bully.  不向恃强凌弱者屈服需要很大勇气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6496','springboard','''sprɪŋbɔrd','''sprɪŋbɔːd','[n] 跳板vi利用跳板','The 1981 budget was the springboard for an economic miracle.  1981年的预算造就了一场经济奇迹。'),
