('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6498','genu','ˈdʒɛnjuː','''dʒenjuː','[n] 膝','Have on parental caress by every means, next issueless pester genu disturbing, everyday carefree, live easily comfortable.  上有父母亲的百般呵护，下无子女的缠膝烦扰，天天无忧无虑的，活得轻松安闲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6499','localization','ˌloʊkəlaɪ''zeɪʃn',',ləʊkəlaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 地方化, 局限, 定位',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6500','airborne','''ɛr''bɔrn','''eəbɔːn','[adj] 空运的, 空气传播的','airborne pollutants  空气传播的污染物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6501','catalyst','''kætəlɪst','''kæt(ə)lɪst','[n] 催化剂','I very much hope that this case will prove to be a catalyst for change.  我非常希望这件事终将成为促成变化的催化剂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6502','rarity','''rɛrəti','''reərɪtɪ','[n] 稀有','Some of these plants are national rarities.  这些植物中有些是国家珍品。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6503','fend','fend','fend','[v] 保护, 供养','Protection of the vital oil fields remained a unifying goal, and the United States viewed a more capable Saudi military, one able to fend off regional and domestic threats, as key to attaining it.  保护重要石油地区的安全是两国统一的目标，而美军认为一个能够抵御地区和国内威胁的更加强大的沙特军队，是实现这一目标的关键。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6504','beneficiary',',bɛnɪ''fɪʃɪɛri','benɪ''fɪʃ(ə)rɪ','[n] 受惠者, 受益人','One of the main beneficiaries of the early election is thought to be the former president.  前总统被认为是早期选举的主要受益者之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6505','leaflet','''liflət','ˈliːflət','[n] 小叶, 传单','Campaigners handed out leaflets on passive smoking.  发起人分发了关于被动吸烟的传单。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6506','genotype','''dʒɛno,taɪp','''dʒenətaɪp; ''dʒiːn-','[n] 基因型','"It will only be a good idea to know your APOE genotype when there''s something we can do about it, " she says.  “只有当我们可以做出改变的时候，知道你的载脂蛋白E基因才 会是一件好事”，她说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6507','affordable','ə''fɔrdəbl','ə''fɔːdəbəl','[adj] 负担得起的','...the availability of affordable housing.  …多数人支付得起的房产的供应。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6508','myxoma','mɪk''somə','mɪk''səʊmə','[n] [医]粘液瘤','Objective To review the experience in the diagnosis and surgical treatment of cardiac myxoma.  目的探讨心脏黏液瘤的诊断和外科治疗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6509','reply','rɪ''plai','rɪ''plaɪ','[n] 答复, 答辩v答复, 回击','I tried calling, but there was no reply.  我试着打电话去，但没有人接。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6510','importation',',impɔ:''teiʃən',',ɪmpɔː''teɪʃən','[n] 进口, 输入品','We should stop the importation of these birds which are sold as commodities and endure lives of boredom in cages.  这种作为商品出售的鸟被关在笼子里忍耐着无聊的生活，我们应当停止它的进口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6511','deny','dɪ''nai','dɪ''naɪ','[v] 否认, 拒绝','The government denied the existence of poverty among 16- and 17-year-olds.  政府否认十六七岁的青少年当中存在贫困问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6512','intaglio','','ɪn''tælɪəʊ; -''tɑːl-','[n] 凹雕, 阴雕vt凹雕',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6513','elaboration','ɪ,læbə''reʃən','ɪ,læbə''reɪʃən','[n] 苦心经营, 详尽的细节','The short answer will to power requires some elaboration as to the methods whereby one might effect such a transformation of ones experience.  简短的回答能够激励出苦心经营的需要,至于人们如何影响这样一种,个人经历的转变的方法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6514','congenital','kən''dʒɛnɪtl','kən''dʒenɪt(ə)l','[adj] 先天的,天生的,天赋的','congenital abnormalities  先天畸形'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6515','blockage','''blɑkɪdʒ','''blɒkɪdʒ','[n] 封锁, 妨碍',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6516','photodissociation',',fotodɪ,sosi''eʃɪn','''fəʊtə(ʊ)dɪ,səʊʃɪ''eɪʃ(ə)n','[n] [物][化]光离解,光解 (作用)','Different photodissociation spectra, the action spectrum as function of laser wavelength, and ratio curve of different channels were obtained.  得到了反应的光解谱和作为波长函数的光解行为光谱以及各反应通道的分支比。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6517','survivor','sɚ''vaɪvɚ','sə''vaɪvə','[n] 生还者, 残存物','Don’t worry about Kurt; he’s a survivor.  不用担心库尔特，他是个坚强的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6518','uninhabited',',ʌnɪn''hæbɪtɪd','ʌnɪn''hæbɪtɪd','[adj] 无人居住的,杳无人迹的','an uninhabited island  杳无人迹的荒岛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6519','aphid','','''eɪfɪd','[n] [动]蚜虫','Anyway, Moran sat down at her computer and looked through the aphid genome for the genes that are responsible for carotenoids.  无论你听说过没有，现在，莫兰正坐在她的电脑前，研究蚜虫基因组的资料，查找负责类胡萝卜素的基因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6520','weekend','ˈwikend','wiːkˈɛnd','[n] 周末, 周末休假 a周末的','Are you doing anything nice this weekend?  这个周末你有什么好的安排？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6521','Miami','','','[n] 迈阿密(美国佛罗里州达东南部港市)','Do you have any flights to Miami?  你们有飞迈阿密的班机吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6522','weekday','''wikde','''wiːkdeɪ','[n] 周日, 平日','If you want to avoid the crowds, it''s best to come on a weekday.  如果你想避开人流，最好在工作日来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6523','paralyze','''pærə,laɪz','''pærəlaiz','[v] 使瘫痪, 使麻痹','You can bet that would truly paralyze the flow of credit: Does anyone believe Washington can manage banks?  你可以打赌，这会使流动的信贷真正限于瘫痪：真有人相信华盛顿可以经营银行吗？'),
