('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6539','outskirt','''aʊt,skɝt ','''aʊtskɜːt','[n] 外边, 郊区','Mianyang Nanjiao Airport is seated in southern outskirt of Minayang city proper, operating flights to Beijing, Shanghai and Guangzhou.  绵阳南郊机场位于绵阳南部郊区，有航班开往北京，上海和广州。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6540','milligram','''mɪlɪɡræm','''miliɡræm','[n] 毫克','...0.5 milligrams of mercury.  …0.5毫克的汞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6541','supplier','sə''plaɪɚ','sə''plaɪə','[n] 供应者, 补充者','...one of the country''s biggest food suppliers.  …该国最大的食品供应商之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6542','closeness','''klosnɪs','''kləusnis','[n] 紧闭, 狭窄',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6543','stately','''stetli','''steɪtlɪ','[adj] 庄严的, 堂皇的','the stately progress of the procession  游行队伍缓慢而庄严的行进'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6544','infinitesimally','','','[adv] 极小地','That may not seem like much, especially given the proton''s infinitesimally tiny size.  这也许并不起眼，尤其是考虑到质子极小的尺寸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6545','viability',',vaɪə''bɪləti',',vaɪə''bɪlətɪ','[n] 生存能力','It evaluates the basic viability of the project.  它估计了项目的基本生存能力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6546','lyric','''lɪrɪk','''lɪrɪk','[n] 抒情诗, 歌词','He wrote some great music, but the lyrics weren’t that good.  他创作过一些不错的曲子，但歌词不是很好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6547','dispose','dɪ''spoz','dɪ''spəʊz','[v] 处理,布置, 安排','Chinese vases are disposed around the gallery.  中国花瓶摆放在展馆四周。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6548','uranus','ˈjʊrənəs; jʊˈrenəs','ˈjʊərənəs;jʊˈreɪnəs','[n] 天王星',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6549','rocket','''rɑkɪt','''rɒkɪt','[n] 火箭','The rocket was launched from a space research base.  火箭从一个太空研究基地发射升空。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6550','insulator','''ɪnsəletɚ','''ɪnsjʊleɪtə','[n] 绝缘体, 绝热器','Wood is an excellent insulator.  木材是很好的绝缘体。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6551','keelboat','''kil,bot','''kiːlbəʊt','[n] 一种河船','As it''s name implies, keelboat has a keel to help it go straight in the water. Keelboat is a large, heavy, stable, and multi-people controlled boat that is more suitable on long distance sailing.  特点-船底有一块牢固的稳向板和压铅，排水量年夜、构造庞大、 价钱昂贵， 多人操作，适于长隔断比赛和远洋探险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6552','manageable','''mænɪdʒəbl','''mænɪdʒəb(ə)l','[adj] 易处理的，易管理的','Divide the task into manageable sections.  把工作分成几个部分，方便处理。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6553','metaphor','''mɛtəfɚ','''metəfə; -fɔː','[n] 隐喻, 暗喻','She uses some wonderful images and metaphors in her writing.  她在作品中用了一些绝妙的比喻和暗喻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6554','disaffection',',dɪsə''fɛkʃən','','[n] 不满','...people''s disaffection with their country and its leaders.  ...人民对自己国家和领导人的不满。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6555','requisition','''rɛkwə''zɪʃən',',rekwɪ''zɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 正式请求；征用','...a requisition for a replacement photocopier.  ...一份更换复印机的授权书。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6556','reprint',',ri''prɪnt','riː''prɪnt','[v] 再版','It remained an exceptionally rare book until it was reprinted in 1918.  在1918年再版之前，这本书一直非常罕见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6557','cheerful','''tʃɪrfl','''tʃɪəfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 愉快的, 高兴的','She’s feeling more cheerful today.  今天她高兴些了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6558','entwine','ɪn''twaɪn','ɪn''twaɪn; en-','[v] (使)缠住, (使)盘绕','They walked together with their arms entwined.  他们挽着胳膊一起走。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6559','untie','ʌn''taɪ','ʌn''taɪ','[v] 解开,  松开','Peter untied his shoelaces.  彼得解开鞋带。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6560','impermeable','ɪm''pɝmɪəbl','ɪm''pɜːmɪəb(ə)l','[adj] 不能渗透的','No paint is impermeable to water vapour.  没有哪种涂料是不透水汽的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6561','condenses','','','[v] 浓缩,  压缩','When you summarize, you condense an extended idea or argument into a sentence or more in your own words.  总结的时候，用自己的话把拓展了的观念或论据简缩成一句或几句话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6562','pork','pɔrk','pɔːk','[n] 猪肉,','pork chops  猪排'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6563','looseness','','','[n] 松开, 解除',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6564','anchor','''æŋkɚ','''æŋkə','[n] 锚 v抛锚','We dropped anchor a few yards offshore.  我们在离岸几码远的地方抛锚停航。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6565','governmental',',ɡʌvɚn''mɛntl','','[adj] 政府的','an attempt to restrict governmental power  限制政府权力的尝试'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6566','auction','''ɔkʃən','''ɔːkʃ(ə)n','[n] ／ vt拍卖','The painting is expected to fetch up to $400,000 at auction.  这幅画预计在拍卖会上能卖到40万美元。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6567','successively','sək''sɛsɪvli','sək''sesivli','[adv] 一个接一个地','To increase the overall probability of success, divide a behavior into parts and learn each part successively.  为以增加总体成功的可能性，可以把一个行为分成若干个部分并相继地学习每一个部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6568','obey','ə''be','ə(ʊ)''beɪ','[v] 服从, 顺从','The little boy made no effort to obey.  这小男孩不肯服从。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6569','romanize','','','[v] 古罗马化, 用罗马字书写',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6570','permeate','''pɝmɪet','''pɜːmɪeɪt','[v] 弥漫, 渗透','The smell of diesel oil permeated the air.  空气里充斥着柴油的气味。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6571','teacup','ˈtiˌkʌp','''tiːkʌp','[n] 茶杯','The rim of the teacup is chipped.  茶碗缺了个口儿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6572','allay','ə''le','ə''leɪ','[v] 减轻, 减少','The president made a statement to allay public anxiety.  总统发表了一项声明以缓解公众的忧虑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6573','characterization',',kærəktəraɪ''zeʃən',',kærəktərai''zeiʃən, -ri''z-','[n] 描述, 人物之创造','Pilcher’s books have humour, good characterization, and lively dialogue.  皮尔彻的书风趣幽默，人物塑造到位，而且对话生动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6574','earthen','''ɝθn','''ɜːθ(ə)n','[adj] 土制的, 陶制的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6575','insistence','in''sistəns','ɪn''sɪst(ə)ns','[n] 坚持, 坚决主张','...her insistence on personal privacy.  …她对个人隐私权的坚持。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6576','whence','wɛns','wens','[adv] 从何处；从那里','I walked to Rainbagh, whence I could complete the journey by car.  我步行至雷恩巴夫，从那里我可以开车走完全程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6577','nonporous','','','[adj] 无细孔的','As for your cutting board, use glass or plastic, both of which are nonporous and most resistant to germs.  玻璃或塑料材质的切菜板不会渗漏，预防细菌滋生效果最好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6578','turnover','''tɝn''ovɚ','''tɜːnəʊvə','[n] 翻转,营业额','The company had a turnover of $3.8 million.  那个公司拥有380万美元的营业额。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6579','fork','fɔrk','fɔːk','[n] 叉, 叉状物 vi分叉','Put the knives and forks on the table.  把刀叉摆放在桌子上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6580','deed','did','diːd','[n] 行为，事迹；契约','After the morning’s good deeds he deserved a rest.  上午做了好事之后，他理应休息一下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6581','southernmost','''sʌðɚnmost','''sʌðənməʊst','[adj] 最南的','the southernmost tip of India  印度的最南端'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6582','landless','''lændləs','''lændlɪs','[adj] 无土地的，无陆地的','...landless peasants.  ...无土地的农民。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6583','enhancement','in''hænsmənt','ɪn''hɑːnsm(ə)nt; en-','[n] 增进, 增加','Progressive enhancement helps us to do that because it forces us to focus on the content and build out from there.  渐进增强能够帮助我们做到这一点，因为它让我们关注内容并且从内容开始构建。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6584','memorize','''mɛmə''raɪz','''meməraɪz','[v] 记住, 记忆','He studied his map, trying to memorize the way to Rose''s street.  他研究了地图，努力记住去罗丝家那条街的路。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6585','session','''sɛʃən','''seʃ(ə)n','[n] 会议, 开庭','Board members met in closed session (= with nobody else present ) .  委员会成员举行了闭门会议。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6586','indeterminate','''ɪndɪ''tɝmənət',',ɪndɪ''tɜːmɪnət','[adj] 不确定的, 含混的','a girl of indeterminate age  年龄难以确定的女孩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6587','unbalance','''ʌn''bæləns','ʌn''bæl(ə)ns','[v] 使失衡,使精神紊乱n失衡','He banged against the cupboard, unbalancing a pile of books.  他砰的一声撞到橱柜上，撞翻了一堆书。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6588','conclusively','','','[adv] 最后地, 确定地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6589','fortuitous','fɔr''tuɪtəs','fɔː''tjuːɪtəs','[adj] 偶然的, 幸运的','The meeting with Jack was fortuitous.  遇到杰克是机缘巧合。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6590','hieroglyph','''haɪərəɡlɪf','''haɪ(ə)rəglɪf','[n] 象形文字, 图画文字','Initially the patterns I used were hieroglyph like symbols.  我所采用的图案是类似符号的象形文字。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6591','admirable','''ædmərəbl','''ædm(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 令人钦佩的,令人赞赏的','an admirable achievement  令人钦佩的成就'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6592','democratization','dɪ,mɑkrətɪ''zeʃən','dɪ,mɒkrətaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 民主化','These elections, he said, are “the first take and a test” of Africa’s ability to follow through on increased democratization and transparency.  他说，这些选举是非洲继续推行提高民主化和透明度进程的能力“首次得到应用和检验”。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6593','peacefully','pisfəli','','[adv] 平静地,  和平地','He died peacefully on December 10 after a short illness.  他在一场短病后于12月10日安详地离开了人世。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6594','upheaval','ʌp''hivl','ʌp''hiːv(ə)l','[n] 剧变','political upheaval  政治剧变'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6595','inflection','ɪn''flɛkʃən','ɪn''flekʃ(ə)n','[n] 变形','...the upward inflection of her voice.  …她声调的升高。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6596','stocking','''stɑkɪŋ','''stɒkɪŋ','[n] 长袜','I want you stuffed in my stocking.  我只要你塞在我的袜子里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6597','radiometric','','','[adj] 辐射测量的,  辐射度的','We also made some radiometric measurements to derive a more precise orbit.  我们还通过辐射测量的方法矫正了轨道，使之更加精确。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6598','balkan','''bɔ:lkən','''bɔ:lkən','[n&a] 巴尔干半岛(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6599','thwart','θwɔrt','θwɔːt','[v] 阻挠','Fierce opposition thwarted the government’s plans.  激烈的反对阻碍了政府计划的实施。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6600','hieratic','''haɪə''rætɪk',',haɪə''rætɪk','[adj] 僧侣的, 僧侣用的','As for composers, modernists like Béla Bartók were hieratic and formalist, and postmodernists, like John Adams, were playful and interested in deconstructing.  说到作曲家，现代主义者如贝拉•巴托克是僧侣似的、形式主义的，而后现代主义者如约翰•亚当斯则是顽皮的、精于解构的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6601','cater','''ketɚ','''keɪtə','[v] 迎合,提供饮食及服务','We cater to an exclusive clientele.  我们满足一个特殊客户群的需求。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6602','intonation',',ɪntə''neʃən','ɪntə''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 语调, 声调','intonation patterns  语调类型'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6603','composite','kɑm''pɑzɪt','''kɒmpəzɪt','[adj] 合成的, 复合的 n合成物','The author builds up a useful compo-site picture of contemporary consumer culture.  作者勾勒出了一幅实用的当代消费文化全景图。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6604','fibrous','''faɪbrəs','''faɪbrəs','[adj] 含纤维的, 纤维性的','The coconut has a fibrous outer covering.  椰子有一个纤维质的外壳。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6605','pedagogic',',pɛdə''ɡɑdʒɪk',',pedə''gɒdʒɪk; -''gɒg-','[adj] 教师的, 教育学的, 教授法的','The Educational category groups the educational and pedagogic characteristics of the learning object.  教育（Educational）范畴包括学习对象的教育性和教育学特征。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6606','floe','flo','fləʊ','[n] 大浮冰, 浮殡冰块','Two crew members parachuted on to a larger floe, and then crawled on their bellies to reach him.  两名搜救成员用降落伞落到一块更大的浮冰上，然后匍匐着去够他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6607','bony','''boni','''bəʊnɪ','[adj] 多骨的, 瘦骨嶙峋的','She had a bony intelligent face.  她的脸很瘦，看来很聪明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6608','synonym','ˈsɪnənɪm','''sɪnənɪm','[n] 同义字','The term "industrial democracy" is often used as a synonym for worker participation.  “工业民主”这一词语常被用作“工人参与”的同义词。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6609','listener','''lɪsənɚ','''lɪs(ə)nə','[n] 收听者, 听众','a new programme for younger listeners  针对年轻听众的新节目'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6610','conductivity',',kɑndʌk''tɪvəti','kɒndʌk''tɪvɪtɪ','[n] 传导性, 传导率','It possesses incredible strength and elasticity, while its exceptionally high conductivity and use in flexible semiconductors  could soup up computing.  它具有难以置信的强度和弹性，而其异常的高导电性和半导体中灵活的应用可以提高计算能力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6611','physiology','''fɪzɪ''ɑlədʒi',',fɪzɪ''ɒlədʒɪ','[n] 生理学','a book on biochemistry and physiology  一本关于生物化学和生理学的书'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6612','miocene','','''maiəusi:n','[adj] 中新世的, 中新统的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6613','eletricity','','','[n] 电, 电学',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6614','nowhere','''no''wɛr','''nəʊhweə','[adv] 无处,任何地方都不','Nowhere is drug abuse more of a problem than in the US.  没有什么地方的吸毒问题比美国更严重。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6615','depiction','dɪ''pɪkʃən','dɪ''pɪkʃn','[n] 描写, 叙述','You would think that such western imports would champion any depiction of homosexuality on television, right?  你会想，像这些西方进口会拥护电视媒体对同性恋的描写，对吧？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6616','gun','ɡʌn','gʌn','[n] 炮, 枪,','I’ve never fired a gun in my life.  我这辈子从来没开过枪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6617','groom','ɡrum','gruːm','[v] 刷洗 n新郎；马夫','The horses were exercised and groomed with special care.  这些马受到特殊的训练和照料。'),
