('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6620','recurrent','rɪ''kɝənt','rɪ''kʌr(ə)nt','[adj] 再发生的, 周期性的','recurrent minor illnesses  不断发作的小病'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6621','pear','pɛr','peə','[n] 梨子, 梨树','I took this apple for a pear until I tasted it.  我误将这个苹果当作梨子，直到我尝了才知道。'),
