('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6623','affront','ə''frʌnt','ə''frʌnt','[v] 侮辱，冒犯','He stepped back, affronted by the question.  他觉得这个问题语带冒犯，退后了几步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6624','deflect','dɪ''flɛkt','dɪ''flekt','[v] (使)偏斜, (使)偏转','He deflected the blow with his forearm.  他用前臂挡开了打来的一拳。'),
