('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6626','discernible','dɪ''zɝnəbl','dɪ''sɜːnɪbl','[adj] 可辨别的','Far away the outline of the island is just discernible.  远远的，那岛的轮廓依稀可见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6627','selfish','''sɛlfɪʃ','''selfɪʃ','[adj] 自私的','How can you be so selfish?  你怎能这样自私？'),
