('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6672','crucible','''krʊsəbl','''kruːsɪb(ə)l','[n] 坩锅, 严酷的考验','...a system in which ideas are tested in the crucible of party contention.  ...一个在严峻党派纷争中检验不同观点的体系。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6673','misty','''mɪsti','''mɪstɪ','[adj] 有薄雾的','a cold, misty morning  一个雾蒙蒙的寒冷早晨'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6674','unbreakable','ʌn''brekəbl','ʌn''breɪkəb(ə)l','[adj] 不易破碎的, 牢不可破的','unbreakable glass  不碎玻璃'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6675','thumb','θʌm','θʌm','[n] 拇指','a baby sucking its thumb  吮着大拇指的婴儿'),
