('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6677','flotation','flo''teʃən','fləʊ''teɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 浮选','A rise in the value of old securities is an indispensable preliminary to the flotation of new issues.  一只旧的有价证券的升值是浮现新问题的必不可少的第一步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6678','healthful','''hɛlθfl','''helθfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 有益健康的','healthful mountain air  有利于健康的山区空气'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6679','mesh','mɛʃ','meʃ','[n] 网，筛孔','The windows were covered in wire mesh to keep out flies.  窗户上装了铁丝纱网，防止苍蝇飞入。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6680','hydration','haɪ''dreʃən','haɪ''dreɪʃən','[n] 水合作用','The team believes one of the most important factors is hydration - the way skin collects and retains moisture.  科研人员称，其中最重要的因素是水合，指皮肤吸收水分、保持湿度的过程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6681','leafcutter','','','[n] [昆]南美切叶蚁','Currie added that leafcutter ants are the subject of thousands of papers authored over the last century, “yet this critical aspect of their success was completely unknown.”  库里补充道：切叶蚁上个世纪以来数千页作品的主角。 但是到目前为止它们成功的重要一面还完全未被人所知。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6682','zagros','','','[n] 扎格罗斯山脉[伊朗西南部]',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6683','Arabian','ə''rebiən','ə''reɪbɪən','[n] 阿拉伯人 a阿拉伯(人)的','The term "Arabian Gulf" has been in casual but inconsistent use by various members of the US navy and government, and by many Arab states, for a few decades now.  这一术语“阿拉伯湾”只是一个非正式的词汇，但它已经被美国海军各机构和美国政府，以及许多阿拉伯国家南腔北调的用了几十年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6684','bypass','''baɪpæs','''baɪpɑːs','[v] 绕开, 忽视 n旁道','Francis bypassed his manager and wrote straight to the director.  弗朗西斯绕过他的经理，直接写信给董事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6685','segregate','''sɛɡrɪɡet','''segrɪgeɪt','[v] 隔离','A large detachment of police was used to segregate the two rival camps of protesters.  一大队分遣警察被派来隔离两群敌对的抗议者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6686','willingness','ˈwɪlɪŋnɪs','''wɪlɪŋnəs','[n] 乐意, 愿意','So we do believe we have improved the willingness of our people for our acceptance in the future.  因此，我们确实认为，我们已经使群众发生变化，愿意将来接受我们的领导。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6687','marketplace','''mɑrkɪtples','''mɑːkɪtpleɪs','[n] 集会场所, 市场','Some retailers worry that new regulations will hurt their ability to compete in the marketplace.  有些零售商担心新规定会削弱他们的市场竞争力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6688','revenue','''rɛvənu','''revənjuː','[n] 收入,税收','advertising revenue  广告收入'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6689','unconsciously','ʌn''kɑnʃəsli','ʌn''kɔnʃəsli','[adv] 无意识地；不觉察地','He unconsciously switched a tree with his cane when he talked to her.  在和她讲话时，他无意识地用手里的鞭子抽打着一棵树。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6690','forebear','''fɔrbɛr','''fɔːbeə','[n] 祖先, 祖宗','I''ll come back to the land of my forebears.  我将回到祖先的土地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6691','snail','snel','sneɪl','[n] 蜗牛','Traffic was moving at a snail’s pace.  车辆移动的速度慢得像蜗牛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6692','topography','tə''pɑgrəfi','tə''pɒgrəfɪ','[n] 地形学','The topography of the river''s basin has changed significantly since the floods.  洪水过后，这条河的流域地形已经明显改变了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6693','clergyman','''klɝdʒɪmən','''klɜːdʒɪmən','[n] 牧师, 教士','"Then I need ask no further," said the clergyman, somewhat hastily rising from his chair.  “这样看来，我就不必多问了，”牧师说着，有点匆忙地从椅子上站起身。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6694','perm','pɝm','pɜːm','[v] /n电烫（头发）','I’m going to have my hair permed .  我要去烫头发。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6695','Haiti','','''heiti','[n] 海地','We went through this after the Haiti earthquake, and all of the arguments which applied there apply to Japan as well.  我们在海地地震后讨论过这个，并且相信所有适用于那里的论断同样会在适用于日本。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6696','fatigue','fə''tig','fə''tiːg','[n] 疲劳，劳累 v(使)疲劳','{"COLLOINEXA":["metal fatigue"]}  金属疲劳'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6697','wreck','rɛk','rek','[v] 毁坏；使遇难 n失事(船等)，残骸','The car was completely wrecked in the accident.  汽车在事故中完全损毁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6698','disintegrate','dɪs''ɪntɪɡret','dɪs''ɪntɪgreɪt','[v] 分裂成小片，瓦解','The plane just disintegrated in mid-air.  飞机就在半空中解体了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6699','moody','''mudi','''muːdɪ','[adj] 易怒的, 情绪化的','Keith had seemed moody all morning.  基思好像整个早上都不高兴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6700','faithful','''feθfəl','''feɪθfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 守信的, 忠实的','a faithful friend  忠诚的朋友'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6701','awesome','''ɔsəm','''ɔːs(ə)m','[adj] 可怕的, 表示敬畏的','an awesome responsibility  一项令人惊惧的责任'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6702','kink','kɪŋk','kɪŋk','[n] 结 v纠结,纽绞',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6703','hydroelectric',',haɪdroɪ''lɛktrɪk','haɪdrəʊɪ''lektrɪk','[adj] 水力电气的','a huge hydroelectric power station  大型水力发电站'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6704','favorably','''feivərəbli','''feivərəbli','[adv] 赞同地, 亲切地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6705','proud','praʊd','praʊd','[adj] 自豪的, 得意的','Seth was the proud owner of a new sports car.  赛思因为有了新跑车而扬扬得意。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6706','unemployment',',ʌnɪm''plɔɪmənt','ʌnɪm''plɒɪm(ə)nt; -em-','[n] 失业, 失业人数','a town where there is high unemployment  高失业率城镇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6707','preferably','''prɛfərəbli','''prefrəblɪ','[adv] 更好地,宁愿',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6708','driveway','''draɪvwe','''draɪvweɪ','[n] 车道','I was running down the driveway to the car and I lost my balance.  我正沿着车道向车子跑去，然后我失去了平衡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6709','spacecraft','''speskræft','''speɪskrɑːft','[n] 太空船','Each of the papers in Science reports data from one of the spacecraft.  科学杂志上发表的论文分别报告了来自这些太空船的数据。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6710','hermit','''hɝmɪt','''hɜːmɪt','[n] 隐士, 隐居者','I''ve spent the past ten years living like a hermit.  我过去10年里过着隐士般的生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6711','hurry','''hɝrɪ','''hʌrɪ','[v] 赶紧,匆忙','If we hurry, we’ll get there in time.  要是赶紧的话，我们能及时到那里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6712','grab','ɡræb','græb','[v] 抢夺, 攫取','I grabbed my bag and ran off.  我抓起我的包就跑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6713','pathway','''pæθwe','''pɑːθweɪ','[n] 路, 径','Richard was coming up the pathway.  理查德正沿路走来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6714','guideline','''ɡaɪdlaɪn','''gaɪdlaɪn','[n] 方针','This chapter gives you some guidelines to help you in your work.  本章将介绍一些指导性原则，为你的工作提供帮助。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6715','November','no''vɛmbɚ','nə(ʊ)''vembə','[n] 十一月(略作Nov)','And again in November.  在十一月又一次。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6716','lvory','','','[n] 象牙',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6717','deluge','''dɛljʊdʒ','''deljuːdʒ','[n] 洪水, 豪雨','Even so, the data deluge is already starting to transform business, government, science and everyday life (see our special report in this issue).  尽管如此，数据洪水正在开始改变商业、政府、科学和人们的日常生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6718','minutely','maɪ''njutlɪ','maɪ''njuːtlɪ','[adj] 每分钟的,持续的','Even the levels of carbon dioxide can be minutely altered.  甚至二氧化碳的浓度每分钟也有改变。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6719','landlocked','''lændlɑkt','''lændlɒkt','[adj] 陆地包围的, 内陆水域的','...the landlocked West African nation of Mali.  ...西非内陆国家马里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6720','rape','rep','reɪp','[n&v] 掠夺, 强奸','She had been raped and stabbed.  她遭到强奸，还被刀捅了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6721','monolithic',',mɑnə''lɪθɪk','mɒnə''lɪθɪk','[n] 单片电路, 单块集成电路','This monolithic environment for an application eliminated any concern about which clock to use -- because there was only one clock.  对于一个应用程序的这个单块集成电路环境消除了使用哪个时钟的问题 —— 因为只有一个时钟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6722','cohesiveness','ko''hisɪvnɪs','kəu''hi:sivnis','[n] 粘合, 凝聚性','We see human civilizations begin throughout both North and South America with different levels of complexity, technology and cohesiveness.  我们看到北美洲和南美洲的人类文明在复杂性、技术力和凝聚力上以不同的水平展开。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6723','peculiarly','pɪ''kjʊljɚli','pɪ''kjuːlɪəlɪ','[adv] 古怪地,  特有地','Theo had been behaving peculiarly.  西奥的举止一直很古怪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6724','cruise','krʊz','kruːz','[vi&n] 巡游, 漫游','A black and white police car cruised past.  一辆黑白相间的警车平稳驶过。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6725','oceanographic',',əuʃiənəu''ɡræfik','','[adj] 海洋学的','The Navy will use the machine principally for oceanographic modeling and weather forecasting.  海军将主要将该计算机用于海洋图像建模和天气预报。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6726','vicious','''vɪʃəs','''vɪʃəs','[adj] 恶毒的，凶残的','a vicious murder  一桩凶残的谋杀案'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6727','turnip','''tɝnɪp','''tɜːnɪp','[n] [植]芜箐(甘蓝)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6728','deck','dɛk','dek','[n] 甲板, 舰板','Let’s go up on deck .  我们到甲板上去吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6729','congestion','kən''dʒɛstʃən','kən''dʒestʃ(ə)n','[n] 拥塞, 充血','The problems of traffic congestion will not disappear in a hurry.  交通堵塞问题不会很快消失。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6730','engender','ɪn''dʒɛndɚ','ɪn''dʒendə; en-','[v] 造成','In such circumstances, governments must do all they can to create and engender trust among its nation’s constituents and institutions.  在这种情况下，政府必须尽其所能在它的国家选民和公共机构之间创造和产生信任。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6731','workplace','''wɝkples','''wɜːkpleɪs','[n] 工作场所','...the difficulties facing women in the workplace.  …妇女在工作场所中面临的困难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6732','meticulous','mə''tɪkjələs','mə''tɪkjələs','[adj] 一丝不苟的, 缜密的','He kept meticulous accounts.  他的账记得一丝不苟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6733','fluent','''fluənt','''fluːənt','[adj] 流利的, 流畅的','He spoke in fluent Italian.  他用流利的意大利语讲话。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6734','impermanence','','','[n] 暂时, 无常','So why then do we reject the impermanence of the ever-changing universe when it comes to our own lives?  所以，为什么我们要拒绝这千变万化的宇宙中的无常，当它来到我们身边时？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6735','impenetrable','ɪm''pɛnɪtrəbl','ɪm''penɪtrəb(ə)l','[adj] 不能穿过的, 不可理喻的','The trees formed a dark and impenetrable barrier.  这些树形成了一道无法通过的黑暗屏障。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6736','expendable','ɪk''spɛndəbl','ɪk''spendəb(ə)l; ek-','[n] 消耗品, 可牺牲的','You may be doing what could just as easily be done by someone else, which means you’re highly expendable. You may be playing follow the follower.  你可能在做一些其他也能轻易完成的事，那可能意味着你是完全可牺牲的，你可能是追随追随者的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6737','undeniable','''ʌndɪ''naɪəbl','ʌndɪ''naɪəb(ə)l','[adj] 不可否认的, 无可辩驳的','undeniable proof  确证'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6738','conqueror','''kɑŋkərɚ','''kɒŋk(ə)rə(r)','[n] 征服者, 胜利者','The people of an oppressed country obey their conquerors because they want to go on living.  一个被压迫国家的人民顺从他们的征服者，是因为他们想活下去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6739','incur','ɪn''kɝ','ɪn''kɜː','[v] 招致','The government had also incurred huge debts.  政府也已承受了大笔债务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6740','backbreaking','''bæk,breikiŋ','''bæk,breɪkɪŋ','[adj] 非常辛苦的,极累人的','Just as our exchanges with the local grocer free us from backbreaking farm work, so do imports from around the world move us even more toward the very economic specialization that enriches us.  就好像我们与当地的杂货店交易，我们就不用非常辛苦地从事农业劳动，来自全世界的进口品让我们更快地走向经济专业化，使我们富裕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6741','commercialize','kə''mɝʃlaɪz','kə''mə:ʃəlaiz','[v] 使商业化','Christmas has become so commercialized.  圣诞节现已变得非常商业化了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6742','landsman','''lændzmən','''læn(d)zmən','[n] 同胞,同乡',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6743','albedo','æl''bido','æl''biːdəʊ','[n] [天文](星体)反照率','A similar example of lowered albedo occurs when sea-ice melts and disappears, causing the darker coloured sea underneath to absorb more heat.  当海冰融化消失时，会同样降低反射率，导致深色的海底吸收更多的热量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6744','verbalizable','','','[adj] 可用言辞表达的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6745','incompatibility','''ɪnkəm,pætə''bɪləti','''ɪnkəm,pætə''bɪlətɪ','[n] 不两立, 不相容','In a time when there is so much dispute about the compatibility or incompatibility of science with religion, it may be a good idea to revisit what Newton and Einstein had to say about God.  在这个科学与宗教到底相容还是不相容众说纷纭的时候 还是让我们重新审视一下牛顿和爱因斯坦怎么说主吧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6746','gist','dʒɪst','dʒɪst','[n] 要点, 要旨','Don’t worry about all the details as long as you get the gist (= understand the main meaning ) of it.  不要去管各个细节，只要理解主要意思就行了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6747','doll','dɑl','dɒl','[n] 洋娃娃, 玩偶','a small wooden doll  一个小木玩偶'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6748','forefront','''fɔrfrʌnt','''fɔːfrʌnt','[n] 最前部, 最前线','They have been at the forefront of the campaign for political change.  他们一直处于政治变革运动的前沿。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6749','classicism','''klæsɪsɪzəm','''klæsɪsɪz(ə)m','[n] 古典主义,古典风格','The great thing about classicism for Gadamer, or what he calls "tradition," is that it''s something we can share.  对于伽达默尔来说古典主义，或者传统，最伟大之处是这是我们可以分享的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6750','foresight','''fɔrsaɪt','''fɔːsaɪt','[n] 远见, 深谋远虑','It was an example of the authorities’ lack of foresight .  这是当权者缺乏远见的一个例证。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6751','infertile','ɪn''fɝtl','ɪn''fɜːtaɪl','[adj] 贫瘠的, 不能生育的','infertile couples  不孕的夫妇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6752','horticultural',',hɔrtɪ''kʌltʃərəl',',hɔːtɪ''kʌltʃərəl','[adj] 园艺的','...the John A. Sibley Horticultural Centre.  …约翰A.西布莉园艺中心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6753','parcel','''pɑrsl','''pɑːs(ə)l','[n] 包裹 vt打包, 捆扎','The parcel was delivered last week.  那个邮包上周送到了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6754','hospitalize','''hɑspɪtə''laɪz','''hɒspɪt(ə)laɪz','[v] 就医,  使住院','Most people do not have to be hospitalized for asthma or pneumonia.  多数人不必因哮喘或肺炎住院。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6755','scanty','''skænti','''skæntɪ','[adj] 缺乏的,不足的','There is only scanty evidence of his involvement.  显示他牵涉其中的证据不足。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6756','verbally','''vɝbli','''və:bəli','[adv] 用言辞地, 口头地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6757','juicy','''dʒusi','''dʒuːsɪ','[adj] 多汁(液)的','a juicy lemon  多汁的柠檬'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6758','trim','trɪm','trɪm','[vt&n] 修剪','Pete was trimming the lawn around the roses.  皮特在修剪玫瑰丛周围的草坪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6759','physiologically','','','[adv] 生理上, 在生理学上','But now there is evidence that individualized advice can also be physiologically effective — that it can actually change your neural pathways.  但是现在有证据表明，个性化的建议也可以产生生理影响——事实上它可以改变你的神经通路。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6760','viewpoint','''vjupɔɪnt','''vjuːpɒɪnt','[n] 观点','Different viewpoints produce different images.  角度不同，产生的画面也不同。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6761','chipmunk','''tʃɪpmʌŋk','''tʃɪpmʌŋk','[n] [动] 花栗鼠','The boy stood motionless, like a mouse or a chipmunk when it knows you''re watching.  男孩一动不动站着，好像一只老鼠或花栗鼠知道有人在盯着它一样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6762','birthday','''bɝθde','''bɜːθdeɪ','[n] 生日','It’s my birthday on Monday.  星期一是我的生日。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6763','jay','dʒe','dʒeɪ','[n] 松鸡；鸟',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6764','kernel','''kɝnl','''kɜːn(ə)l','[n] 果仁，核心','The kernel of that message was that peace must not be a source of advantage or disadvantage for anyone.  那一信息的核心是和平绝不应该成为对任何人有利或不利的根源。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6765','wine','waɪn','waɪn','[n] (葡萄)酒','a glass of wine  一杯葡萄酒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6766','incline','ɪn''klaɪn','ɪn''klaɪn','[v] (使)倾斜；倾向于， n斜面','The telescope is inclined at an angle of 43 degrees.  这架望远镜以43度角倾斜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6767','stereotype','''stɛrɪətaɪp','''sterɪə(ʊ)taɪp; ''stɪərɪə(ʊ)-','[n] 老套，固定模式','There''s always been a stereotype about successful businessmen.  对成功的商人们总有一种成见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6768','magnet','''mægnɪt','ˈmæɡnɪt','[n] 磁体, 磁铁','It''s possible to hang a nail from a magnet and then use that nail to pick up another nail.  把一颗钉子挂在一个磁体上再用这颗钉子去吸起另一颗钉子是可能的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6769','trivial','''trɪvɪəl','''trɪvɪəl','[adj] 琐碎的，不重要的','a trivial sum  一笔极小的金额'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6770','distortion','dɪs''tɔrʃən','dɪ''stɔːʃ(ə)n','[n] 扭曲, 变形,曲解','I think it would be a gross distortion of reality to say that they were motivated by self-interest.  我认为说他们被自身利益所驱使是对事实的公然扭曲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6771','circumstantially','','','[adv] 因情形地,  附随地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6772','repute','rɪ''pjut','rɪ''pjuːt','[n] 名誉, 名声 v认为','Under his leadership, the U.N.''s repute has risen immeasurably.  在他的领导下，联合国的名望得到了极大提升。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6773','grizzly','''grɪzli','''grɪzlɪ','[adj] 灰(白)色的','Those would be you, a human, and grizzly bear, the thing that’s approaching you alarmingly fast.  那就是你，一个人类，以及一头灰熊——它正在以惊人的速度向你奔来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6774','zoo','zu','zuː','[n] 动物园','The road to the zoo turns off here.  通向动物园的路由这儿拐弯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6775','Americanism','ə''merikənizəm','ə''merikənizəm','[adj] 美国所创, 美国风俗, 美国精神',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6776','implicate','''ɪmplɪket','''ɪmplɪkeɪt','[v] 含意, 暗示','The allegations implicated Abe to such an extent he was forced to resign.  安倍深受指控牵连，不得不辞职。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6777','shortwave','''ʃɔrt,wev','''ʃɔːt''weɪv','[n] 短波','I use the shortwave radio to get the latest war news.  我用短波收音机收听最新战事新闻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6778','processor','''prɑsɛsɚ','''prəʊsesə','[n] 加工业者；处理机','US tuna processors  美国的金枪鱼加工厂商'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6779','fleshy','''flɛʃi','''fleʃɪ','[adj] 肉的, 多肉的','the fleshy part of your hand  你手上肉厚的部分'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6780','fallout','''fɔlaʊt','''fɔːlaʊt','[n] 辐射微尘, 原子尘, 附带结果','The political fallout of the affair cost him his job.  这一事件的政治影响使他丢了工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6781','pluralism','''plʊər(ə)lɪz(ə)m','''plʊər(ə)lɪz(ə)m','[n] 复数, 兼职',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6782','alumnus','ə''lʌmnəs','ə''lʌmnəs','[n] 男毕业生, 男校友',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6783','heritage','''hɛrɪtɪdʒ','''herɪtɪdʒ','[n] 遗产, 继承权','the importance of preserving the national heritage  保护民族遗产的重要性'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6784','tenet','''tɛnɪt','''tenɪt; ''tiːnet','[n] 原则','Non-violence and patience are the central tenets of their faith.  非暴力和忍耐是他们信仰的基本原则。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6785','logger','''lɔɡɚ','''lɒgə','[n] 樵夫, 圆木装车机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6786','geochemical','','','[adj] 地球化学的','But there’s very little doubt that if methane emissions are as large as this, there will be severe biological and geochemical impacts.  但有一点很肯定，如果甲烷排放量确实是如此大，必将产生严重的生物和地球化学影响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6787','cloudlike','','','[adj] 云雾状的','Following an air burst, condensed droplets of water give it a typical white cloudlike appearance.  空中爆炸过去之后，经过压缩的小水滴使它看上去就像一朵正常的白云一样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6788','aide','ed','eɪd','[n] 助手, 副官','a presidential aide  一位总统助理'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6789','vegetative','''vɛdʒə''tetɪv','''vedʒɪtətɪv; -teɪtɪv','[adj] 植物生长的,植物人状态的','She was in what was described as a vegetative state.  她处于一种被称为植物人的状态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6790','quickest','','','[adj] 最快的','However, in some instances it is the quickest way to achieve a goal.  但是，在有些情况下这是达到目标最快的一种方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6791','overgrow','''ovɚ,gro','əʊvə''grəʊ','[v] 长满','The big banyan overgrow of my day of day of a block limb, hang below brawny and strong limb full each golden orange.  一棵遮天蔽日的大榕树长满了枝干，粗壮有力的枝干下面挂满了一个个金灿灿的橘子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6792','enlargement','ɪn''lɑrdʒmənt','ɪn''lɑːdʒm(ə)nt; en-','[n] 放大','enlargement of the EU  欧盟的扩大'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6793','downhill','','','[adv] 下坡；向下','She bent at the knee when she skied downhill.  她滑雪下山时曲膝下蹲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6794','idiomatic',',ɪdɪə''mætɪk',',ɪdɪə''mætɪk','[adj] 地道的 成语的','He had the ability to write fluent and idiomatic English.  他能够写出流利地道的英语。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6795','reckon','''rɛkən','''rek(ə)n','[v] 计算,估计','The expression ‘full moon’ means the fourteenth day of the moon reckoned from its first appearance.  所谓“满月”是指从新月初现算起的第14天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6796','chromosphere','''kromə,sfɪr','''krəʊməsfɪə','[n] 色球','After that is the chromosphere, a layer that looks reddish because of all the hydrogen found there.  再之外是色球层，这一层由于存在的氢元素而略呈红色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6797','nonproductive',',nɑnprə''dʌktɪv',',nɒnprə''dʌktɪv','[adj] 非生产性的','It’s a batch process, which means that there’s a fair amount of nonproductive capacity,” he said.  这是一个间歇过程，这意味着有一个相当数量的非生产性的产能，“他说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6798','traverse','trə''vɝs','''trævəs; trə''vɜːs','[v] 横渡，横越','two minutes to traverse the park  两分钟横穿公园'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6799','grammar','''græmɚ','''græmə','[n] 文法','Check your spelling and grammar.  检查你的拼写和语法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6800','caliber','''kæləbɚ','''kælibə','[n] 口径, 才干','Perhaps the first thing that students notice about their college is the caliber of their fellow students.  可能学生们对这所大学关注的第一件事就是同学的才干。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6801','junior','''dʒunɪɚ','''dʒuːnɪə','[adj] 年少的；资历较浅的 n年少者；晚辈','the junior football club  青少年足球俱乐部'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6802','photosphere','''fotə,sfɪr','''fəʊtəsfɪə','[n] 光球','The photosphere is the lowest layer of the sun''s atmosphere, and emits the light we see.  光球是太阳大气的最底层，我们看到的光线就是从它发出的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6803','millet','''mɪlɪt','''mɪlɪt','[n] [植]稷, 粟','The maize and millet were just putting forth ears.  玉米粟子刚刚吐穗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6804','ruler','''rulɚ','''ruːlə','[n] 统治者, (直)尺','a 12-inch ruler  一把12英寸的尺子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6805','intimacy','''ɪntɪməsi','''ɪntɪməsɪ','[n] 亲密, 隐私','She thought back over the intimacies they’d shared and the plans they’d made.  她回想起他们之间曾经有过的亲密言行以及他们设想的计划。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6806','coalescence',',koə''lɛsns',',kəuə''lesns','[n] 合并, 接合','The stability of any foam ultimately relies on the hindrance of bubble coalescence.  任何泡沫的稳定性归根到底都依赖于阻止泡泡们的合并。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6807','tantamount','''tæntə''maʊnt','''tæntəmaʊnt','[adj] 同等的,相当于','What Bracey is saying is tantamount to heresy.  布里斯正在说的无异于异端邪说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6808','rag','ræɡ','ræg','[n] 抹布','He wiped his boots dry with an old rag.  他用一块旧布把他的靴子擦干。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6809','zero','ˈzɪərəʊ','''zɪərəʊ','[num] 零点, 零度','Make x greater than or equal to zero.  设x大于或等于零。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6810','inorganic','''ɪnɔr''gænɪk','ɪnɔː''gænɪk','[adj] 无机的, 非自然生长的','inorganic matter  无机物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6811','forever','fɚ''ɛvɚ','fə''revə','[adv] 永远, 永恒','I wanted that moment to last forever .  我希望那一刻成为永远。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6812','preen','prin','priːn','[v] 整理羽毛，(人)打扮修饰','50% of men under 35 spend at least 20 minutes preening themselves every morning in the bathroom.  50%的35岁以下男性每天早上至少花20分钟在盥洗室精心打扮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6813','marvelously','','','[adv] 奇迹般地,奇异地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6814','cavalry','''kævlri','''kæv(ə)lrɪ','[n] 骑兵','The Black Prince led a cavalry charge against them.  黑王子带领骑兵向他们冲去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6815','unacceptable',',ʌnək''sɛptəbl','ʌnək''septəb(ə)l','[adj] 不能接受的, 不受欢迎的','I found her attitude totally unacceptable.  我觉得她的态度让人完全不能接受。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6816','unprofitable','ʌn''prɑfɪtəbl','ʌn''prɒfɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 没有利润的, 无益的','unprofitable businesses  不赢利的企业'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6817','fray','fre','freɪ','[n] 吵架; [v] 磨破，恼火','Three civilians were injured during the fray.  三个平民在冲突中受伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6818','reradiate','ri''redɪ,et','riː''reɪdɪeɪt','[vt] 再辐射(转播)','The starlight he ats up the dust grains, which then reradiate this energy at far-infrared wavelengths.  受星光加热的尘埃颗粒，会于远红外波段再辐射出那个能量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6819','forge','fɔrdʒ','fɔːdʒ','[v] 铸造, 伪造','Someone stole my credit card and forged my signature.  有人偷了我的信用卡，并假冒我的签名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6820','tinge','tɪndʒ','tɪn(d)ʒ','[n] (清淡的)色调 vt给…着色','This glass has a greenish tinge.  这块玻璃带点淡淡的绿色。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6821','weld','wɛld','weld','[v& n] 焊接，焊缝','The new handle will have to be welded on.  新的把手得焊上去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6822','fanners','''fænɚ','''fænə','[n] 电风扇,通风机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6823','attractiveness','ə''træktɪvnɪs','ə''træktivnis','[n] 魅力,  吸引力','Do people believe anyone has one and only one measure of attractiveness?  难道人们真的认为吸引力只有一个衡量的尺度吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6824','unparalleled','ʌn''pærəlɛld','ʌn''pærəleld','[adj] 无比的, 空前的','an achievement unparalleled in sporting history  体育史上空前的成就'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6825','saddle','''sædl','''sæd(ə)l','[n] 鞍；(自行车)座 vt装鞍',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6826','contamination','kən,tæmi''neiʃən','kən,tæmɪ''neɪʃən','[n] 污染, 污染物','However, contamination can occur at any point along the food chain, from field to table.  然而，污染沿着食物链可能在任何的点上发生，从田地到餐桌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6827','dyestuff','''daɪ,stʌf','''daɪstʌf','[n] 染料','Usage: Mainly used in chemical, glass, dyestuff, ceramic and mechanic.  用途：主要用于化学、 玻璃、染料、冶金、机械、搪瓷等工业。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6828','disadvantageous',',dɪsædvæn''tedʒəs',',dɪsædv(ə)n''teɪdʒəs','[adj] 不利的','The sale of part of the company could be disadvantageous to investors.  对公司局部的出售可能对投资人不利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6829','southerner','''sʌðɚnɚ','''sʌð(ə)nə','[n] 南方人, 居住在南方的人','Bob Wilson is a southerner, from Texas.  鲍勃•威尔逊是个南方人，来自得克萨斯州。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6830','drab','dræb','dræb','[adj] 土褐色的, 单调的','people forced to live grey, drab existences in ugly towns  被迫在丑陋的城市里过着平淡乏味生活的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6831','vicinity','və''sɪnəti','vɪ''sɪnɪtɪ','[n] 邻近, 附近','The stolen car was found in the vicinity of the station.  被盗汽车在车站附近被发现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6832','resourcefulness','','','[n] 足智多谋','What stories can you relay that show your passion, initiative and resourcefulness?  你可以讲述什么样的故事来展示你的激情，主动和足智多谋呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6833','micronesian',',maikrəu''ni:ziən; -ʒən',',maikrəu''ni:ziən; -ʒən','[n&a] 密克罗尼西亚人(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6834','outrigger','''aʊt''rɪgɚ','''aʊtrɪgə','[n] (承力外伸)支架','The outrigger tripod is available in both a high and low profile version, to fulfill a diverse array of environmental requirements.  外伸的三脚架有高型和低型两种配置，以满足不同的环境要求。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6835','narration','nə''reʃən','nə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 叙述','I need some good pictures for narration.  我需要一些叙述时用的好镜头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6836','ere','ɛr','eə','[pron&conj] 在…之前','Yet this we ask ere you leave us, that you speak to us and give us of your truth.  然而在你离开我们之前，对我们说话，把你的真理传述给我们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6837','usable','''jʊzəbl','''juːzəb(ə)l','[adj] [亦作useable] 可用的, 合用的','The computer language involved was readily usable.  所涉及的计算机语言便于使用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6838','harmonious','hɑr''monɪəs','hɑː''məʊnɪəs','[adj] 和谐的, 和睦的','The decor is a harmonious blend of traditional and modern.  这种装饰风格是传统与现代的和谐统一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6839','anew','ə''nʊ','ə''njuː','[adv] 重新, 再','I was ready to leave everything behind and start anew in California.  我准备好舍弃一切，在加利福尼亚开始新的生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6840','ironically','aɪ''rɑnɪkli','aɪ''rɒnɪklɪ','[adv] 具有讽刺意味地；嘲讽地','Ironically, his cold got better on the last day of his holiday.  具有讽刺意味的是，他的感冒竟在假期的最后一天有所好转。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6841','genre','''ʒɑnrə','ˈʒɒnrə','[n] 类型, 流派','a literary genre  文学体裁'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6842','marginal','''mɑrdʒɪnl','''mɑːdʒɪn(ə)l','[adj] 边缘的, 边际的','marginal revenue  边际收益'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6843','visually','''vɪʒʊəli','ˈvɪʒʊəli','[adv] 在视觉上地, 真实地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6844','primacy','''praɪməsi','''praɪməsɪ','[n] 首位','We must give primacy to education.  我们必须以教育为本。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6845','sago','''seɡo','''seɪgəʊ','[n] 西米, 西米椰子',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6846','breadfruit','''brɛdfrut','''bredfruːt','[n] 面包果树','At the Marriott, for example, guests ramble amid breadfruit and frangipani trees and photograph one another by an enormous, amoeba-shaped swimming pool.  比如，在万豪酒店，客人们可以在面包果树和鸡蛋花树之间徜徉，在硕大的不规则形状游泳池边相互拍照。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6847','taro','''tærəʊ','''tɑːrəʊ; ''tærəʊ','[n] 芋头','According to Deng, Japan imports taro from Chenzhou because of its high quality.  通过海港，日本也因为芋头的质量高，于是从郴州中进口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6848','sugarcane','','','[n] [植]甘蔗','He cut the sugarcane into several pieces.  他把甘蔗截成几节。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6849','predetermine',',pridɪ''tɝmɪn','priːdɪ''tɜːmɪn','[v] 预先确定','What if you could predetermine the genetics of your newborn baby?  要是你能预先设定新生宝宝的基因，你会怎么办？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6850','nobody','''nəubədi, -bɔdi','''nəʊbədɪ','[pron] 无人, 没有任何人','I knocked on the door but nobody answered.  我敲了敲门，但没人应门。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6851','hazardous','''hæzɚdəs','''hæzədəs','[adj] 危险的, 冒险的','the disposal of hazardous waste  有害废弃物的处理'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6852','unsuspected',',ʌnsə''spektid','ʌnsə''spektɪd','[adj] 未知的, 未被怀疑的','A surprising number of ailments are caused by unsuspected environmental factors.  惊人数量的慢性病是由未知的环境因素引起的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6853','missionary','''mɪʃənɛri','''mɪʃ(ə)n(ə)rɪ','[n&a] 传教士(的) ,传教的,','My mother would still like me to be a missionary in Africa.  我母亲还是想让我在非洲做一名传教士。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6854','underestimate','/ˌʌndərˈestɪmeɪt/','ʌndər''estɪmeɪt','[vt& n] 估计不足，低估','Fourteen percent may be an underestimate.  14%可能是低估的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6855','nitrate','''naɪtret','''naɪtreɪt','[n] [化]硝酸盐, 硝酸钾','potassium nitrate  硝酸钾'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6856','exportation',',ɛkspɔr''teʃən',',ekspɔː''teɪʃən','[n] 出口','"The laws prohibiting such exportation must be reinstated as soon as possible, " he said.  “关于禁止出口珍稀林木的法案必须尽快得到恢复，”他说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6857','extremity','ɪk''strɛməti','ɪk''stremɪtɪ; ek-','[n] 极度，绝境','In spite of the extremity of her seclusion she was sane.  尽管完全与世隔绝，她依然神智清醒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6858','converse','kən''vəʳs','kən''vɜːs；ˈkɒn-','[v] 交谈 n反面说法 a相反的','Luke sat directly behind the pilot and conversed with him.  卢克坐在飞行员的正后方和他交谈。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6859','grounding','''graʊndɪŋ','''graʊndɪŋ','[n] 基础训练, 染色的底色, [电]接地','The degree provides a thorough grounding in both mathematics and statistics.  这个学位提供对数学和统计学全面的基础训练。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6860','spillage','''spɪlɪdʒ','''spɪlɪdʒ','[n] 溢出, 溢出量',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6861','curiously','''kjʊrɪəsli','''kjʊrɪəslɪ','[adv] 好奇地','After the second of third offence I was warned that I should be beaten next time, but I received the warning in a curiously roundabout way.  这样子一两次之后，我被警告，如果再有第三次我会挨揍的。 我以一种好奇的迂回曲则的方式接受了这个警告。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6862','timely','''taɪmli','''taɪmlɪ','[adj] 及时的, 适时的','The fight ended only with the timely arrival of the police.  幸亏警察及时赶到，打斗总算停止。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6863','ashore','ə''ʃɔr','ə''ʃɔː','[adv] 向岸地, 在岸上地','Several dead birds had been washed ashore.  几只死鸟被冲上了岸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6864','redesign',',ridɪ''zaɪn','riːdɪ''zaɪn','[v&n] 重新设计','The hotel has recently been redesigned and redecorated.  该酒店最近刚进行了重新设计及装修。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6865','citizenry','''sɪtɪzənri','''sɪtɪzənrɪ','[n] 公民成市民(集合称)','He used the medium of radio when he wanted to enlist public support or reassure the citizenry.  当他想得到公众支持或恢复民信时，他使用广播作载体。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6866','scenario','sə''nærɪo','sɪ''nɑːrɪəʊ','[n] 剧情说明书，剧本','Imagine a scenario where only 20% of people have a job.  设想一下这种情况: 只有20%的人有工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6867','duplicate','''duplɪket','ˈdjuːplɪkeɪt','[n] 复制品 a复制的 vt复制，复印','The tight race is almost a duplicate of the elections in Georgia and South Dakota last month that pitted a Republican challenger against a Democratic incumbent.  这次紧张的竞选几乎是上个月在佐治亚州和南达科他州选举的翻版，由一个共和党的挑战者竞争一个现任的民主党人。'),
