('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6869','smelter','''smɛltɚ','''smeltə','[n] 熔炉, 熔炼工',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6870','diamond','''daɪəmənd','''daɪəmənd','[n] 钻石,金钢石','a diamond engagement ring  订婚钻戒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6871','crook','krʊk','krʊk','[v] 使弯曲','He crooked his finger: "Come forward," he said.  他弯了弯手指，说：“过来。”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6872','pennycress','','','[n] [植]菥蓂','Any of several related plants, such as pennycress and watercress.  菥蓂，水田芥：任一与其类似的植物，如菥蓂和水田芥。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6873','resort','rɪ''zɔrt','rɪ''zɔːt','[vi& n] 求助，采用','His punishing work schedule had made him resort to drugs.  他那累人的工作日程已经使他不得不求助于毒品了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6874','hydroponically','','','[n] 水耕法,  水栽培',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6875','petiole','''pɛtɪ,ol','''petɪəʊl','[n] 叶柄, 柄部','Light green, elliptical, very thin, long flexible petiole. Usually single crown. Large.  亮绿色椭圆型很薄的叶子，长而有弹性的叶柄。通常单个顶芽。大型。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6876','mobilize','''mobəlaɪz','''məʊbəlaɪz','[v] 动员','an attempt to mobilize popular opinion  鼓动公众舆论的尝试'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6877','conveniently','kən''vi:njəntli','kən''vi:njəntli','[adv] 方便地；合宜地','Conveniently, her parents are often willing to babysit.  方便的是，她父母通常都愿意临时照看一下小孩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6878','roller','''rolɚ','''rəʊlə','[n] 滚筒','a paint roller  刷漆滚筒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6879','paramount','''pærəmaʊnt','''pærəmaʊnt','[adj] 极为重要的','During a war the interests of the state are paramount, and those of the individual come last.  战争时期国家利益是首要的，个人利益置于最后。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6880','Shoshone','ʃəu''ʃəuni','ʃəu''ʃəuni','[n] 美国休休尼族印第安人;休休尼语',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6881','puff','pʌf','pʌf','[v] 喘气；抽烟','George puffed and panted and he tried to keep up.  乔治喘着粗气想跟上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6882','salmon','''sæmən','''sæmən','[n] [鱼]鲑鱼, 大麻哈鱼','The salmon was brought to the table whole, garnished with parsley and slices of tomato and cucumber.  整条大麻哈鱼被端上了桌，并用欧芹、西红柿片和黄瓜片作为花色配菜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6883','oxfordshire','''ɔksfədʃiə','''ɔksfədʃiə','[n] 牛津郡[英国]',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6884','Isle','aɪl','aɪl','[n] ( 小)岛','We have looked at Lord Foster''s plan and he appears to want to place his fantasy Isle of Grain airport on top of the LNG plant and a power station.  我们已经参看过福斯特爵士的计划，看起来他似乎想把他想象中的谷岛机场安置在液化天然气厂和发电站的顶上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6885','gaslit','','','[adj] 以煤气灯照明的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6886','londoner','','','[n] 伦敦人',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6887','microbe','''maɪkrob','''maɪkrəʊb','[n] 微生物, 细菌','...a type of bacteria that include the microbes responsible for tuberculosis and leprosy.  …包括引起结核病和麻风病的微生物在内的一类细菌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6888','tepee','''tipi','''tiːpiː','[n] 美国印第安人的圆锥形帐篷','Designed by the renowned Brazilian architect Oscar Niemeyer, the Cathedral of Brasília rises like a tepee in the middle of Brazil’s capital city.  由巴西著名建筑大师Oscar Niemeyer设计的巴西利亚大教堂，看上去像一个在首都中心搭起的印第安大帐篷~'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6889','Pawnee','pɔn''i','pɔ:''ni:','[n] 波尼族人(语)','The American Indian exhibit intrigues visitors with its collection of totem poles and its Pawnee Earth Lodge, created to explain the traditional ways of the Pawnee Indians, a Nebraska tribe.  美国印第安人展厅的图腾柱和波尼土房也吸引了不少观众，那里展示了内布拉斯加州印第安人部落波尼人的传统生活方式。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6890','experimenter','','','[n] 实验者','The experimenter said “Look at my toy!  试验者对孩子说：“看看我的玩具！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6891','virtual','[ˈvɜ:rtʃuəl]','ˈvɜ:tʃuəl','[adj] 实质的, 虚拟的','The website allows you to take a virtual tour of the art gallery.  这个网站可让你对美术馆作一番虚拟参观。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6892','inter','ɪn''tə','ɪn''tɜː','[v] 埋葬','The team of archaeologists found the spot where his bones were originally interred.  这队考古学家发现了起初埋葬他骸骨的地方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6893','spare','spɛr','speə','[adj] 备用的；多余的','Have you got any spare boxes?  你有没有多余的盒子？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6894','inanimate','ɪn''ænɪmət','ɪn''ænɪmət','[adj] 无生命的','an inanimate object  无生命的物体'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6895','halve','hæv','hɑːv','[v] 二等分,  分享','Halve the potatoes lengthwise.  把马铃薯竖着切成两半。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6896','commentary','''kɑməntɛri','''kɒmənt(ə)rɪ','[n] 注释, 解说词','Commentary is by Tom Ferris.  由汤姆•费里斯现场解说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6897','handsomely','','','[adv] 漂亮地,慷慨地','He did us handsomely.  他慷慨地款待我们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6898','outcrop','''autkrɔp, ,aut''krɔp','''aʊtkrɒp','[n] 露出地面的岩层','Below us was a pool surrounded by rocky outcrops.  我们的下面是一个岩石围绕的水塘。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6899','breadth','brɛdθ','bredθ; -t-','[n] 宽度, (布的)幅宽, (船)幅','The breadth of the whole camp was 400 paces.  整个营地的宽度为400步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6900','parish','''pærɪʃ','''pærɪʃ','[n] 教区','Father Doyle moved to a new parish.  多伊尔神父调到了新的教区。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6901','nucleic','nu''kliɪk','njuː''kliːɪk','[adj] 核的','Organisms rely on phosphorus to build nucleic acids and other molecules to grow and proliferate.  有机物依赖于磷来制造核酸和其他生长与繁殖所需的分子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6902','pavement','''pevmənt','''peɪvm(ə)nt','[n] 人行道, 公路','A small group of journalists waited on the pavement outside her house.  有一小群记者守候在她家外面的人行道上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6903','avid',',ævid','''ævɪd','[adj] 渴望的','Meanwhile, time after time on other issues -- such as the economic stimulus package, health care and Iraq -- he has tacked to the center, much to the frustration of his most avid supporters.  与此同时，在其他问题上，比如经济刺激计划、医保改革以及伊拉克问题，他不止一次改弦易辙、转向中庸，这让他最热心的支持者感到失望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6904','pity','''pɪti','''pɪtɪ','[v] 可怜 n怜悯, 同情','I pity anyone who has to feed a family on such a low income.  我同情那些得依靠如此微薄的收入养活全家的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6905','ascribe','ə''skraɪb','ə''skraɪb','[v] 归因于, 归咎于','An autopsy eventually ascribed the baby''s death to sudden infant death syndrome.  一次尸检最终把这名婴儿的死亡归因于婴儿猝死综合症。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6906','innumerable','ɪ''nʊmərəbl','ɪ''njuːm(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 无数的,数不清的','She’s served on innumerable committees.  她在多个委员会担任委员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6907','totality','to''tæləti','tə(ʊ)''tælɪtɪ','[n] 全部，总数','...a process of social, economic and political change which involves the totality of human experience.  ...一个涉及人类经验总和的社会、经济和政治变革过程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6908','emigration',',ɛmə''greʃən',',emɪ''greɪʃn','[n] 移民出境, 侨居','We have reminded them of the circumstances of our emigration and settlement here.  我们也曾把我们移民来这里和在这里定居的情况告诉他们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6909','peck','pɛk','pek','[vt& n] 啄,小口地吃',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6910','patriarch','''petrɪɑrk','''peɪtrɪɑːk','[n] 家长, 族长, 创办人','The patriarch of the house, Mr. Jawad, rules it with a ferocity renowned throughout the neighbourhood.  那户人家的家长贾瓦德先生治家严苛，名闻乡里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6911','grandeur','''ɡrændʒɚ','''grændjə; -(d)ʒə','[n] 庄严, 伟大','The most visited city in the world, here is a capital whose great talent has been to interweave the grandeur of its official buildings with the everyday charm of its many quartiers.  世界上访问者最多的城市，就是这里，拥有庞大人才资本的首都，这城市中庄严肃穆的官方建筑与许多城区的日常魅力始终融合在一起。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6912','everlasting',',ɛvɚ''læstɪŋ','evə''lɑːstɪŋ','[adj] 永恒的, 持久的','everlasting fame  永久的名声'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6913','detritus','dɪ''traɪtəs','dɪ''traɪtəs','[n] 碎石','In the distance, the detritus of a century of oil exploration lines the horizon.  在远方地平线上，矗立着一个世纪以来开采石油产生的碎石堆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6914','hover','''hʌvɚ','''hɒvə','[v] 盘旋','After rising through the air it stops to hover outside the window of a building several storeys high.  在空气中上升后，它在一幢几层楼高的建筑物的窗前停止升高，进入盘旋状态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6915','completion','kəm''pliʃən','kəm''pliːʃn','[n] 完成','The house is nearing completion (= almost finished ) .  房子即将完工。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6916','abound','ə''baʊnd','ə''baʊnd','[v] 富于,  充满','Stories abound about when he was in charge.  他负责时传闻很多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6917','lipid','lɪpɪd','''lɪpɪd','[n] 脂质, 油脂','Cholesterol, a type of lipid, is found in foods from animal sources.  胆固醇也是一种油脂，存在于动物来源的食物中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6918','smoky','''smoki','''sməʊkɪ','[adj] 冒烟的, 烟状的','a smoky engine  冒出大量烟的引擎'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6919','confer','kən''fɝ','kən''fɜː','[v] 授予, 协商','The constitution also confers large powers on Brazil''s 25 constituent states.  宪法还授予巴西25个成员州极大的权力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6920','primeval','prai''mi:vəl','praɪ''miːv(ə)l','[adj] 原始的, 早期的','primeval forests  原始森林'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6921','viral','''vaɪrəl','''vaɪr(ə)l','[adj] 滤过性毒菌的','...a 65-year-old patient suffering from severe viral pneumonia.  …一位65岁患有严重病毒性肺炎的病人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6922','subtraction','səb''trækʃən','səb''trækʃn','[n] 减少','In other words, we can use the magic of subtraction.  换句话说，我们可以借助减法的魔力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6923','concentric','kən''sɛntrɪk','kən''sentrɪk','[adj] 同中心的, 同轴的','concentric circles  同心圆'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6924','iconography','''aɪkə''nɑgrəfi',',aɪkə''nɒgrəfɪ','[n] 肖像学, 肖像画法',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6925','mite','maɪt','maɪt','[n] 微小的东西,','Poor mite! You must be starving!  可怜的小家伙！你一定是饿坏了！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6926','innate','ɪ''net','ɪ''neɪt; ''ɪneɪt','[adj] 先天的, 天生的','Children have an innate ability to learn language.  儿童学习语言的能力是与生俱来的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6927','indigenous','ɪn''dɪdʒənəs','ɪn''dɪdʒɪnəs','[adj] 本地的, 天生的','the many indigenous cultures which existed in Siberia  存在于西伯利亚的许多当地文化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6928','fog','fɔɡ','fɒg','[n] 雾, 烟雾','It will be a cold night, and there may be fog patches .  今夜天气寒冷，部分地区可能有雾。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6929','remnant','''rɛmnənt','''remnənt','[n] 残余, 剩余','Beneath the present church were remnants of Roman flooring.  在目前的这座教堂下面还有残余的古罗马地板。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6930','graceful','''ɡresfl','''greɪsfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 优美的','Her movements were graceful and elegant.  她举手投足优雅而高贵。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6931','toehold','''tohold','''təʊhəʊld','[n] （攀岩时的）立足点,（发展的）起点','Delta`s agreement with Singapore Airlines gave them a toehold in the Pacific.  德尔塔与新加坡航空公司的协议为他们在太平洋地区提供了一个立足点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6932','wise','waɪz','waɪz','[adj] 英明的, 明智的','a wise precaution  明智的预防措施'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6933','eon','''iən','''iːən','[n] 永世, 无数的年代',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6934','planetary','''plænətɛri','''plænɪt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 行星的','Within our own galaxy there are probably tens of thousands of planetary systems.  在我们所在的银河系中，很可能存在数以万计的行星系。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6935','cuspidor','''kʌspə,dɔr','''kʌspɪdɔː','[n] 痰盂',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6936','activist','''æktɪvɪst','''æktɪvɪst','[n] 激进主义分子, 行动主义分子','The police say they suspect the attack was carried out by animal rights activists.  警方说他们怀疑这次袭击是由保护动物权利的激进分子实施的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6937','hue','','hjuː','[n] 色彩，色调','a golden hue  一种金黄色调'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6938','identification','aɪˌdentɪfɪ''keʃn','aɪ,dentɪfɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 辨认, 鉴定','His body was taken to Brighton mortuary for identification.  他的尸体被送到布赖顿停尸所确认身份。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6939','weakly','''wikli','''wiːklɪ','[a&ad] 虚弱地, 软弱地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6940','doorknob','''dɔrnɑb','''dɔːnɒb','[n] 门把手','Another one turned the doorknob but it was locked.  另一个扭了一下门把手但它是锁住的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6941','incessant','ɪn''sɛsnt','ɪn''ses(ə)nt','[adj] 不断的,  无尽的','The child’s incessant talking started to irritate her.  这孩子喋喋不休，她开始烦躁起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6942','fancy','''fænsi','''fænsɪ','[v] 喜欢n爱好；想象力','Fancy a quick drink, Emma?  想喝点什么吗，埃玛？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6943','widow','''wɪdo','''wɪdəʊ','[n] 寡妇','an elderly widow who was attacked and robbed last month  上个月遭到行凶抢劫的一位寡居老妇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6944','preliminary','prɪ''lɪmɪnɛri','prɪ''lɪmɪn(ə)rɪ','[adj] 预备的, 初步的','the preliminary stages of the competition  竞赛的预赛阶段'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6945','tieback','''taɪ,bæk','''taɪbæk','[n] 牵索,  拉条',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6946','loyal','''lɔɪəl','''lɒɪəl','[adj] 忠诚的, 忠心的','a loyal supporter of the team  球队的忠实支持者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6947','afloat','ə''flot','ə''fləʊt','[a&ad] 飘浮的, 传播的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6948','mistrust',',mɪs''trʌst','mɪs''trʌst','[n&v] 不信任, 猜疑','As a very small child she had learned to mistrust adults.  她很小的时候就学会了不相信大人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6949','interviewer','''ɪntɚvjuɚ','','[n] 会见者',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6950','affectional','','','[adj] 情感上的,  爱情的','In the end, sexuality includes physical intimacy and affectional intimacy.  最后，性既包括肉体上的亲密，也包含着情感上的亲密。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6951','southerly','''sʌðɚli','''sʌðəlɪ','[adj] 向南方的 ad在南方','Tara walked in a southerly direction .  塔拉朝南走去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6952','covering','''kʌvərɪŋ','''kʌv(ə)rɪŋ','[n] 遮盖物','a light covering of snow  薄薄的一层雪'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6953','abnormal','æbˈnɔːrml','æb''nɔːml','[adj] 反常的, 变态的','abnormal behaviour  反常行为'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6954','shopper','''ʃɑpɚ','''ʃɒpə','[n] 购物者','The streets were crowded with shoppers.  街上挤满了购物的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6955','correspondingly',',kɔrə''spɑndɪŋli',',kɔris''pɔndiŋli','[adv] 相应地','As his political stature has shrunk, he has grown correspondingly more dependent on the army.  随着政治声望不断降低，他相应地变得更依赖于军队了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6956','varicolored','''vɛəri,kʌləd','''vɛəri,kʌləd','[adj] 杂色的,  多色的','I hope one day I can sit on the green grassland and watch varicolored fireworks with my girlfriend.  我希望有一天和我的女朋友坐在绿色的草地上看五颜六色的烟花。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6957','flap','flæp','flæp','[n] 片状垂悬物；飘动 v飘动，拍动','the tent flap  帐篷门帘'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6958','psychoanalyst',',saɪko''ænəlɪst','saɪkəʊ''ænəlɪst','[n] 心理分析学者','He''s a psychologist-or rather, a psychoanalyst.  他是一位心理学家——或者更确切地说，一位心理分析学家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6959','stagecraft','''stedʒkræft','''steɪdʒkrɑːft','[n] 编剧才能,演出技术',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6960','lifeblood','''laɪf''blʌd','''laɪfblʌd','[n] 生命必须的血液, 活力的源泉','Small businesses are the lifeblood of the economy.  小型企业是经济的生力军。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6961','autobiography',',ɔtəbaɪ''ɑɡrəfi','ɔːtəbaɪ''ɒgrəfɪ','[n] 自传','He published his autobiography last autumn.  他去年秋天出版了他的自传。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6962','bedpan','''bɛdpæn','''bedpæn','[n] 便盆, 睡床用脚炉',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6963','streak','strik','striːk','[n] 条纹vi疾驶 vt加条纹','Sue has blonde streaks in her hair.  休的头发里夹杂着几缕金发。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6964','duet','dʊ''ɛt','djuː''et','[n] 二重奏','Tonight she sings a duet with first husband Maurice Gibb.  今晚她与第一任丈夫莫里斯∙吉布表演了二重唱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6965','daughter','''dɔtɚ','''dɔːtə','[n] 女儿','She’s got two daughters and one son.  她有两个女儿和一个儿子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6966','sentimentalized',',sɛntɪ''mɛntəlaɪz','sentɪ''mentəlaɪz','[v] 流于感伤,  变多愁善感','He seems either to fear women or to sentimentalize them.  他似乎不是怕女人就是对她们怀有浪漫想法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6967','rentable','','','[adj] 可出租的','Taller buildings also tended to taper inwards, further reducing rentable space; the cost of moving materials and people also soars.  更高建筑的内部也开始变尖了，进一步减少了可出租的空间；运人运货的成本也直线上升。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6968','voluminous','və''lʊmənəs','və''ljuːmɪnəs','[adj] 卷数多的,大量的','a voluminous suitcase  一个能装很多东西的手提箱'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6969','glare','ɡlɛr','gleə','[n] 闪耀光, 刺眼 v发眩光, 瞪视','a special screen to reduce glare  一种可以减弱刺眼强光的特殊屏幕'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6970','stint','stɪnt','stɪnt','[v] 紧缩,节省',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6971','glory','''ɡlɔri','''glɔːrɪ','[n] 荣誉, 光荣','She dreamt of future glory as an Olympic champion.  她梦想着将来能得到奥运冠军的荣誉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6972','wand','wɑnd','wɒnd','[n] 魔杖；[乐]指挥棒',''),
