('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6974','inhibition','ˌɪnhɪˈbɪʃn','ɪn(h)ɪ''bɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 禁止, 阻止',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6975','innocent','''ɪnəsnt','''ɪnəs(ə)nt','[adj] 清白的, 无罪的, 天真的','Nobody would believe that I was innocent.  没人肯相信我是清白的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6976','chomp','tʃɑmp','tʃɒmp','[v] 大声地咀嚼, 反复咀嚼',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6977','civic','''sɪvɪk','''sɪvɪk','[adj] 市的, 市民的','Jackson spent the day meeting with local religious and civic leaders.  杰克逊那天与当地的宗教领袖和市领导会面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6978','stout','staʊt','staʊt','[adj] 发胖的；结实的','a stout pair of shoes  一双厚实耐穿的鞋子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6979','inconsistency',',ɪnkən''sɪstənsi','ɪnkən''sɪst(ə)nsɪ','[n] 矛盾','There were several glaring inconsistencies (= very noticeable differences ) in his report.  他的报告中有几个明显的前后矛盾之处。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6980','perceivable','','','[adj] 可知觉的','Instead of that, the destination is a situation that is perceivable, and declared desirable.  与之相反，目的地是一种可感知、值得期待 的位置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6981','posit','''pɑzɪt','''pɒzɪt','[v] 安置',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6982','incompletely','','','[adv] 不完全地','Carbon monoxide is released when carbon in fuel—both plants and fossil fuels like gasoline—burns incompletely.  当作为燃料的碳——包括植物和化石燃料比如汽油——不完全燃烧时，就会产生一氧化碳。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6983','subjugate','''sʌbdʒuɡet','''sʌbdʒʊgeɪt','[v] 使屈服，征服','The native population was subjugated and exploited.  土著人被征服，并遭受剥削。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6984','lamina','''læmənə','''læmɪnə','[n] 薄板, 薄层',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6985','uniformitarianism',',jʊnə,fɔrmə''tɛrɪən,ɪzm',',juːnɪfɔːmɪ''teərɪənɪʒ(ə)m','[n] [地质]均变论',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6986','guidance','''gaɪdns','''gaɪd(ə)ns','[n] 指导, 领导','a missile with a sophisticated electronic guidance system  有精密电子制导系统的导弹'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6987','disappoint','''dɪsə''pɔɪnt','dɪsə''pɒɪnt','[v] 使失望','I hated to disappoint her.  我不愿意让她失望。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6988','wit','wɪt','wɪt','[n] 智力, 才智','Alone and penniless, I was forced to live on my wits.  孤身一人又身无分文，我只得靠我的机智来过活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6989','contributory','kən''trɪbjətɔri','kən''trɪbjʊt(ə)rɪ','[adj] 贡献的, 捐助的','Smoking is a contributory factor in lung cancer.  抽烟是导致肺癌的一个因素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6990','beloved','bɪ''lʌvd','bɪ''lʌvɪd; -''lʌvd','[adj] 心爱的 n所爱的人','He never recovered from the death of his beloved daughter.  他一直没有走出失去爱女的阴影。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6991','ration','''ræʃən','''ræʃ(ə)n','[n] 定额, 定量','emergency food rations  紧急食物配给'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6992','sunshine','''sʌnʃaɪn','''sʌnʃaɪn','[n] 阳光','We had three days of spring sunshine.  我们享受了三天的春日阳光。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6993','exponent','ɪk''sponənt','ɪk''spəʊnənt; ek-','[n] 阐述者,倡导者','...a leading exponent of test-tube baby techniques.  …一位试管婴儿技术的主要倡导者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6994','intellectually','ˌɪntlˈɛktʃʊəli','ˌɪntɪˈlektʃʊəli','[adv] 理智地, 与智力(或思维)有关地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6995','concoct','kən''kɑkt','kən''kɒkt','[v] 编造；调制','John concocted an elaborate excuse for being late.  约翰为迟到编了一个巧妙的借口。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6996','darling','''dɑrlɪŋ','''dɑːlɪŋ','[n] 心爱的人, 亲爱的','Look, darling, there’s Mary.  看呀，亲爱的，玛丽来了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6997','leaning','''linɪŋ','''liːnɪŋ','[n] 倾斜, 倾向','his radical political leanings  他那激进的政治倾向'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6998','seclusion','sɪ''klʊʒən','sɪ''kluːʒ(ə)n','[n] 隔离','They enjoyed ten days of peace and seclusion.  他们享受了十天与世隔绝的宁静生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_6999','vulnerability',',vʌlnərə''bɪləti',',vʌlnərə''bɪlətɪ','[n] 弱点, 攻击','Now that we know the basis of an attack, what can we do to protect ourselves from this vulnerability?  既然我们知道了攻击的基本知识，那么做些什么才能保护我们自己避免这一脆弱性呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7000','candid','''kændɪd','''kændɪd','[adj] 率直的, 坦诚的','It struck me as an unusually candid confession for a politician.  我觉得这对一个政治家来说是非常坦率的告白了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7001','puritan','''pjʊrɪtən','''pjʊərɪt(ə)n','[n] 清教徒 a清教徒的','Bykov had forgotten that Malinin was something of a puritan.  贝科夫忘记了马利宁是个近乎清教徒式的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7002','regurgitate','rɪ''ɡɝdʒɪtet','rɪ''gɜːdʒɪteɪt','[v] 反刍,（液体）回流','Some birds and animals regurgitate food to feed their young.  有些鸟兽会回吐食物以喂哺幼崽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7003','ruminate','''rumɪnet','''ruːmɪneɪt','[v] 反刍, 沉思','One is to see whether you have any worry triggers and to distract yourself when you begin to ruminate.  首先看看你自己是否有担忧的动机，如果当你自己出现“沉思”时，尽量分散自己的注意力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7004','flatten','''flætn','''flæt(ə)n','[v] 变平, 变单调','Use a rolling pin to flatten the dough.  用擀面杖把面团擀平。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7005','milkweed','''mɪlk,wid','''mɪlkwiːd','[n] 乳草属植物','This is because their staple food, milkweed, is being used more and more as a garden ornament.  这是因为它们的主要食物乳草被越来越多的用于园林装饰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7006','divergent','daɪ''vɝdʒənt','daɪ''vɜːdʒ(ə)nt; dɪ-','[adj] 分歧的,分开的, 偏离的','Two people who have divergent views on this question are George Watt and Bob Marr.  在这个问题上意见相左的两个人是乔治·瓦特和鲍勃·马尔。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7007','unproven','ʌn''prʊvən','','[adj] 未经证明的, 未经检验的','unproven allegations  未经证实的指控'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7008','permafrost','''pɝməfrɔst','''pɜːməfrɒst','[n] [地]永久冻结带','Yakutsk is the largest city in the world built on permafrost – soil that remains permanently frozen year round.  雅库茨克是世界上建设在永久冻土上最大的城市——土壤在全年都保持冰冻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7009','stocky','''stɑki','''stɒkɪ','[adj] 矮壮的, 健壮结实的','a stocky build  敦实的体格'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7010','convergence','kən''vɝdʒəns','kən''vɜːdʒəns','[n] 集中, 收敛','With convergence to an ideal state, you can expect the system to be in or near that ideal state.  通过收敛到一种理想状态，您可以期望系统处于或接近那一理想状态。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7011','conceivably','kən''sivəbli','kən''siːvəblɪ','[adv] 可想到地, 想象中',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7012','rat','ræt','ræt','[n] 老鼠','This was demonstrated in a laboratory experiment with rats.  这点通过在实验室中用老鼠做试验得到证明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7013','statistical','stə''tɪstɪkl','stə''tɪstɪk(ə)l','[adj] 统计的, 统计学的','The report contains a great deal of statistical information.  该报告包含大量统计资料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7014','Venice','ˈvɛnɪs','ˈvɛnɪs','[n] 威尼斯(意大利港市)','They call it “the Venice of the North” and “beauty on water”.  人们把它叫做北方的威尼斯，或者水上美人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7015','tiffany','''tɪfəni','''tɪf(ə)nɪ','[n] 纱的一种',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7016','chase','','tʃeɪs','[v] 追赶, 追逐','The dogs saw him running and chased him.  那些狗看到他在跑就追他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7017','hardware','''hɑrdwɛr','''hɑːdweə','[n] 五金器具','...a shop from which an uncle had sold hardware and timber.  …一家叔叔曾经在那里卖五金器具和木材的店铺。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7018','bunch','bʌntʃ','bʌn(t)ʃ','[n] 串, 束 v捆成一束','He had left a huge bunch of flowers in her hotel room.  他在她的宾馆房间里留了一大束花。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7019','uproot',',ʌp''rut','ʌp''ruːt','[v] 连根拔起, 根除','India''s evil caste systemremains entrenched in spite of government efforts to uproot it, a racist systemthat condemns darker skinned Indians to a life of penury and servitude.  尽管政府努力根除印度罪恶的等级制度，但其仍然根深蒂固，这是一个种族歧视制度，使得深色皮肤的印度人生活贫苦，受奴役。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7020','refuge','''rɛfjʊdʒ','''refjuːdʒ','[n] 庇护, 避难所','a wildlife refuge  野生动物保护区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7021','unnatural','ʌn''nætʃrəl','ʌn''nætʃ(ə)r(ə)l','[adj] 不自然的, 反常的','It was very cold, which seemed unnatural for late spring.  天很冷，对于晚春来说似乎不正常。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7022','powerfully','','','[adv] 非常地,强有力地','And yet, in many ways, Socrates diagnoses very powerfully an important condition of modern democratic life with which we are all familiar.  但在很多方面，苏格拉底却也诊断了,非常有力且重要的,现在民主生活条件,那是我们都很熟悉的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7023','nursing','''nɝsɪŋ','''nɜːsɪŋ','[n] 看护, 养育','The elderly at the nursing home have some protections, but not much.  看护之家的老人们已经受到一些保护，但这类措施为数不多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7024','enamel','ɪ''næml','ɪ''næm(ə)l','[n] 珐琅, 瓷釉','...a white enamel saucepan.  …一个白色搪瓷煮锅。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7025','gossamer','''ɡɑsəmɚ','''gɒsəmə','[n] 蛛丝，薄纱  a轻而薄的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7026','unnecessarily','','','[adv] 不必要地,  徒然','What you should not do is prevent or override it unnecessarily.  您不应该做的是不必要地阻止或重写它。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7027','cube','kjʊb','kjuːb','[n] 立方体, 立方','a sugar cube  一块方糖'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7028','monogamous','mə''nɑɡəməs','mɒ''nɒɡəməs','[n] 一夫一妻的, 单配的','So birds are monogamous but they cheat as well, within limits.  所以鸟类是一夫一妻制，但它们也背叛，有限度地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7029','unwieldy','ʌn''wildi','ʌn''wiːldɪ','[adj] 笨重的，笨拙的','unwieldy bureaucracy  尾大不掉的官僚机构'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7030','coloration',',kʌlə''reʃən','kʌlə''reɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 染色, 着色','That''s the major reason, why I go great lengths with preparation, scanning, coloration and printing techniques.  这是重要的原因，因此，我花很长时间做准备，扫描、着色和印刷技术。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7031','butler','''bʌtlɚ','''bʌtlə','[n] 仆役长, 男管家','I called for the butler to clear up the broken crockery.  我叫来男管家清理摔碎的陶瓷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7032','Caribbean','','','[n] 加勒比海','Then either you go relax on your Caribbean island, or you try to start another one.  你或者可以在你的加勒比海小岛上悠哉游哉下去，或者可以考虑开始下一个生意。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7033','anatomy','ə''nætəmi','ə''nætəmɪ','[n] 剖析, 解剖学','a professor of anatomy  解剖学教授'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7034','flop','flɑp','flɒp','[v] 猛落，惨败','He flopped down onto the bed.  他一头倒在床上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7035','pulse','pʌls','pʌls','[n] 脉搏, 脉冲','His breathing was shallow and his pulse was weak .  他呼吸很浅，脉搏微弱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7036','genuinely','''dʒenjuinli','''dʒenjuinli','[adv] 真正地,  由衷地','They must genuinely like one another, and work well together.  他们必须真诚地喜欢对方，并且能一起有效地工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7037','bomb','bɑm','bɒm','[n] 炸弹 vt投弹于','The bomb went off at 9.30 in the morning.  炸弹在早上9点半爆炸。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7038','flint','flɪnt','flɪnt','[n] 打火石, 燧石','...a flint arrowhead.  ...一个燧石箭头。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7039','vicissitude','vɪ''sɪsɪtud','vɪ''sɪsɪtjuːd; vaɪ-','[n] 变迁兴衰','It reflects the vicissitude of society.  它反映了社会的变迁兴衰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7040','quantitative','''kwɑntətetɪv','''kwɒntɪ,tətɪv; -,teɪtɪv','[adj] 数量的, 定量的','...the advantages of quantitative and qualitative research.  …定量和定性研究的优点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7041','suitably','''sutəbli','','[adv] 合适地, 适宜地','‘He owns three hotels.’ The others looked suitably impressed .  “他拥有三家酒店。”其他人都相应地露出了钦佩之情。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7042','colorless','''kʌlɚlɪs','''kʌləlɪs','[adj] 无色的, 无趣味的','As a colorless, sweet-smelling liquid, DCA is used in the production of plastics.  作为一种无色、带着甜蜜香味的液体，常被用于塑料生产。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7043','cider','''saɪdɚ','''saɪdə','[n] 苹果酒','At the bar he ordered a cider.  他在酒吧点了一杯苹果汁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7044','bard','bɑrd','bɑːd','[n] 吟游诗人','Gnomeo and Juliet is directed and co-written by animation veteran Kelly Asbury, who makes no apologies to William Shakespeare or to the bard''s, perhaps, most malleable tale.  《格诺米欧和朱丽叶》的导演兼编剧是动漫老手凯利.阿斯博瑞，他对莎翁和古代的吟游诗人没有一丝愧疚之情，这大概是最具改编潜力的故事了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7045','chop','tʃɑp','tʃɒp','[v] 砍，劈，斩','He went outside to chop some more wood for the fire.  他出去再砍些木材来生火。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7046','presage','''prɛsɪdʒ','''presɪdʒ','[n] 预兆 v预示',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7047','flatboat','''flæt,bəut','''flætbəʊt','[n] (浅水)平底船','Huck was sitting on the gunwale of a flatboat, listlessly dangling his feet in the water and looking very melancholy.  哈克坐在一条平底船的船舷上边，两只脚没精打采地放在水里，看上去忧心忡忡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7048','onion','''ʌnjən','''ʌnjən','[n] 洋葱','Chop the onions finely.  把洋葱切碎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7049','cleanliness','''klɛnlɪnəs','''klenlɪnəs','[n] 洁癖, 清洁','a high standard of cleanliness  很高的卫生标准'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7050','peal','pil','piːl','[n] 钟声  v(使)鸣响','A sudden peal of bells broke the silence.  突然响起的铃声打破了寂静。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7051','mow','mo','məʊ','[v] 割(草)','It’s time to mow the lawn again.  又该修剪草坪了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7052','professionalism','prə''fɛʃənə''lɪzəm','prə''feʃ(ə)n(ə)lɪz(ə)m','[n] 职业水准或特性, 职业化','the dedication and professionalism of our staff  我们员工的奉献精神和专业素质'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7053','monochrome','''mɑnəkrom','''mɒnəkrəʊm; mɒnə(ʊ)''krəʊm','[n] 单色 单色的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7054','incessantly','in''sesntli','ɪn''sesntlɪ','[adv] 不间断地','And it can be frustrating to watch a beloved pet scratch incessantly—especially after you’ve tried everything to get rid of the pests.  看着自己心爱的宠物不停地挠啊挠相当令人烦躁——尤其是在你费尽心思除去那些害虫的时候。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7055','damper','''dæmpɚ','''dæmpə','[n] 风阀, 减音器','The spikes are believed to be caused by an electrical malfunction; the thud is thought, at least by some, to be just a ventilator damper.  操作员们认为仪表显示峰值只是因为电气故障，而巨响被认为是通风阻尼器所发出的声音，至少有一部分人这么认为。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7056','lightweight','''laɪtwet','''laɪtweɪt','[n] 轻量级选手, 不能胜任者','an intellectual lightweight  智力平庸的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7057','polychrome','''pɑlɪ,krom','''pɒlɪkrəʊm','[adj] 彩饰的 n多彩艺术品',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7058','coriander',',kɔrɪ''ændɚ',',kɒrɪ''ændə','[n] [植]胡荽','Garnish each plate with a sprig of coriander and serve.  给每道菜配上一小枝芫荽然后上菜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7059','tedium','''tidɪəm','''tiːdɪəm','[n] 厌烦, 沉闷','Cut out the tedium of converting your photos manually by using automation features in your photo editing software.  使用照片编辑软件中的自动控制功能可以免去手工转换照片的沉闷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7060','foothill','''futhil','''fʊthɪl','[n] 山麓小丘, 丘陵地带','the foothills of the Himalayas  喜马拉雅山脉的山麓丘陵'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7061','momentous','mo''mɛntəs','mə(ʊ)''mentəs','[adj] 重要的, 重大的','a momentous decision  重大决定'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7062','chateau','ʃæ''to','''ʃætəʊ','[n] 城堡','I followed him to this island chateau where he''s holding a party.  我跟踪他来到这座岛上城堡。他将在这里举办宴会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7063','provincialism','prə''vɪnʃə''lɪzəm','prə''vɪnʃ(ə)lɪz(ə)m','[n] 地方风尚','Wright grew frustrated with American provincialism.  赖特对美国的地方偏狭观念愈发感到沮丧。'),
