('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7065','seashell','''si''ʃɛl','''siːʃel','[n] 海贝壳','jewelry made out of seashells  用贝壳做的首饰'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7066','emigrant','''ɛmɪɡrənt','''emɪgr(ə)nt','[n] 移居外国者, 移民',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7067','quitter','''kwɪtɚ','''kwɪtə','[n] 轻易停止的人, 懦夫','He won''t resign because he''s not a quitter.  他不会辞职，因为他不是个半途而废的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7068','unsettle',',ʌn''sɛtl','ʌn''set(ə)l','[v] 不安','The sudden changes unsettled Judy.  突如其来的变化弄得朱迪心神不宁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7069','feasibility',',fizə''bɪləti','fiːzɪ''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 可行性, 可能性','But this is only at an early stage of feasibility study.  但是这仅仅处于可行性研究的初期阶段。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7070','unending','ʌn''ɛndɪŋ','ʌn''endɪŋ','[adj] 不断的, 不断重复的','an unending stream of people  源源不断的人流'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7071','dispatch','dɪ''spætʃ','dɪˈspætʃ','[v] 分派, 派遣','Goods are normally dispatched within 24 hours.  货物一般在24小时内派送。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7072','eradication','ɪ,rædɪ''keʃən','ɪ,rædɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 连根拔除, 根除',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7073','fun','fʌn','fʌn','[n] 娱乐, 玩笑','There’s plenty of fun for all the family.  可以让全家人玩得很开心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7074','disapproval','''dɪsə''prʊvl','dɪsə''pruːvl','[n] 不赞成','His action had been greeted with almost universal disapproval.  他的行动遭到了几乎一致的反对。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7075','junction','''dʒʌŋkʃən','''dʒʌŋ(k)ʃ(ə)n','[n] 连接, 接合','the junction of Abbot Road and Mill Street  阿伯特路与米尔街的交叉口'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7076','upriver','','','[adj] 上游的 ad在上游','...an upriver trip in Central Africa.  ...在中非的一次沿河而上的旅行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7077','reorient',',ri''ɔrɪɛnt','riː''ɔːrɪent; -''ɒr-','[v] 重定的方向(或方位)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7078','portend','pɔr''tɛnd','pɔː''tend','[v] 预示','strange events that portend disaster  预示着灾难的奇怪事件'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7079','neatness','','','[n] 整洁, 干净','My sister has been preaching at me again about my lack of neatness.  因我不爱整洁姐姐又向我没完没了地劝告。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7080','nonnative','','','[n] 非本地的,  非本地人','Removing sheep and cattle in an attempt to restore Santa Cruz Island, Calif., for example, let nonnative plants spread over the landscape unchecked.  例如，为了保护加利福利亚州的圣克鲁兹岛，除去羊和牛，让非本土植物不加抑制地广泛生长于此地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7081','chug','tʃʌg','tʃʌg','[n] 轧轧响声; [v] 发出轧轧声','The train chugs down the track.  火车沿着轨道嘎嚓嘎嚓地缓慢行驶着。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7082','intercommunity',',ɪntɚkə''mjʊnəti','ɪntəkə''mjuːnɪtɪ','[n] 共同性, 共有','In this study, we examine how intercommunity relationships affect the growth of organizational communities.  在本文中，我们研究了共同性关系是如何影响组织社区的成长的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7083','shear','ʃɪr','ʃɪə','[v] 剪, 剪切','Competitors have six minutes to shear four sheep.  参赛者们有6分钟的时间来给4只羊剪毛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7084','townspeople','''taʊnz''pipl','''taʊnzpiːp(ə)l','[n] 市民, 镇民','the proud townspeople of Semer Water  塞默－沃特城自豪的居民们'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7085','Utopian','','','[adj] 乌托邦式的，梦想的','His was a utopian vision of nature in its purest form.  他对大自然的看法是一种最纯粹的乌托邦式看法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7086','intensely','in''tensli','in''tensli','[adv] 激烈地；热切地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7087','biogeochemical','','','[adj] 生物地球化学的','This correlation suggests that a warming climate is driving this biogeochemical change, Drevnick says.  德莱夫尼克说，这种关联性表明，气候变暖正在推动这种生物地球化学变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7088','loder','','','[n] [计]装填器',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7089','homespun','''homspʌn','''həʊmspʌn','[n] 手织物',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7090','unwelcome','ʌn''wɛlkəm','ʌn''welkəm','[adj] 不受欢迎的, 讨厌的','unwelcome publicity  不必要的宣传'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7091','avoidable','ə''vɔɪdəbl','ə''vɒɪdəbl','[adj] 可避免的','an almost entirely avoidable cause of death  几乎可以完全避免的死因'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7092','referee',',rɛfə''ri','refə''riː','[n] 裁判员 v裁判, 仲裁',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7093','predetermined',',pridɪ''tɝmɪnd',',pri:di''tə:mind','[adj] 预订的','The prince''s destiny was predetermined from the moment of his birth.  该王子的命运从出生那一刻起就已经被决定了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7094','unselective','','','[adj] 非选择性的','A term given to viewers who are unselective about the content they watch.  指那些对所收看的节目内容不加选择的观众。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7095','sensitively','','','[adv] 易感知地,  神经过敏地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7096','authenticity',',ɔθɛn''tɪsəti','ɔːθen''tɪsɪtɪ','[n] 确实性, 真实性','That sums up the concept of authenticity.  这句话概括了真实性的概念。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7097','discredit','dɪs''krɛdɪt','dɪs''kredɪt','[v] 怀疑  n丧失名誉','...a secret unit within the company that had been set up to discredit its major rival.  …为破坏其主要竞争对手声誉而设的一个公司内秘密单位。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7098','superorganisms',',sju:pə''rɔ:ɡənizəm',',sjuːpə''rɔːɡənɪzəm','[n] [生]超个体(指群居昆虫等的群体)','we''re being lured away by other people — people on Facebook, people in our inbox, people who write columns about giant superorganisms.  我们也被其他人所诱惑，他们是飞播上的人，站内邮箱中的人以及巨大的超个体专栏作者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7099','exclusion','ɪk''skluʒn','ɪk''skluːʒ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 排除, 除外','...women''s exclusion from political power.  …政治权力对妇女的排斥。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7100','floodplain','','','[n] 泛洪平原, 漫滩','Adgantole was a sour-smelling, dusty village beside the Awash River floodplain.  阿甘图尔一处闻起来有些酸臭到处都是灰尘的村庄，就坐落在阿瓦什河的泛滥平原上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7101','preservative','prɪ''zɝvətɪv','prɪ''zɜːvətɪv','[n] 防腐剂','food that contains no artificial preservatives  不含人造防腐剂的食品'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7102','sill','sɪl','sɪl','[n] 基石(岩床底面)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7103','insightful','''ɪnsaɪtfəl','''ɪnsaɪtf(ʊ)l','[adj] 有深刻见解的, 富有洞察力的','an insightful analysis  有见地的分析'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7104','misdeed',',mɪs''did','mɪs''diːd','[n] 罪行, 犯罪','...the alleged financial misdeeds of his government.  ...他的政府被指控在财政方面行为不当。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7105','proficient','prə''fɪʃnt','prə''fɪʃ(ə)nt','[n] 精通','As with the transition from competent to proficient, the transition to Expert is also non-linear.  正如从“胜任”到“精通”的转变一样，转变为“专家”也是非线性的过程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7106','salmonberry','''sæmənbɛri','''sæmənberɪ','[n] 美洲大树莓',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7107','optimization',',ɑptəmɪ''zeʃən',',ɒptɪmaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 最佳化, 最优化','These have focused on simplifying the development, automation, and optimization of applications.  这主要集中在简化应用程序的开发、自动化和优化方面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7108','snugly','','','[adv] 舒适温暖地, 整洁地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7109','dripstone','''dripstəun','''drɪpstəʊn','[n] 滴水石',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7110','counterexample','''kaʊntɚɪg''zæmpl','''kaʊntərɪɡ''zɑːmpl','[n] 反例','Sometimes the best way to illustrate how to do something is by counterexample.  有时候，说明如何做某事的最好方法是举反例。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7111','dapple','''dæpl','''dæp(ə)l','[n] 斑纹, 斑点; [v] (使）有斑纹','A large area of white on the chest of a dapple is permissible.  斑纹色腊肠在胸前有大面积的白色斑纹是允许的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7112','multifaceted',',mʌltɪ''fæsɪtɪd','mʌltɪ''fæsɪtɪd','[adj] 多层面的','a multifaceted campaign to reduce teen pregnancy  一个涉及多方面的减少少女怀孕的运动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7113','flesh','flɛʃ','fleʃ','[n] 肉，果肉','a freshwater fish with firm white flesh  一种肉色雪白、肉质紧实的淡水鱼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7114','alluvial','ə''lʊvɪəl','ə''l(j)uːvɪəl','[adj] 冲积的, 淤积的','alluvial flood plains  冲积泛滥平原'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7115','welt','wɛlt','welt','[n] 鞭痕, 贴边vt贴边于',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7116','rootless','''rutləs','''ruːtləs','[adj] 无根的, 无根据的','rootless people  漂泊不定的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7117','fecund','''fikənd','''fek(ə)nd; ''fiːk-','[adj] 生殖力旺盛的, 多产的','It has now become clear how extraordinarily fecund a decade was the 1890s.  十九世纪九十年代被当今视为创造力旺盛的十年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7118','proliferation','','','[n] 增殖, 分芽繁殖',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7119','loam','lom','ləʊm','[n] 肥土','Tomatoes grow in just about any soil, but they really thrive in rich, well-draining loam that is slightly acidic.  番茄在任何土壤中都能生长，但在土质肥沃、排水良好的微酸性粘土中长势最为繁茂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7120','petticoat','''pɛtɪkot','''petɪkəʊt','[n] 衬裙, 裙子','She stood there, in her red petticoat, with a smile on her face.  她站在那里，穿着红色的衬裙，脸上带着微笑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7121','reluctant','rɪ''lʌktənt','rɪ''lʌkt(ə)nt','[adj] 不情愿的, 勉强的','She gave a reluctant smile.  她勉强笑了笑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7122','stratify','''strætɪfaɪ','''strætɪfaɪ','[v] (使)成层','We currently use a large repository of data from our operational systems to help us stratify, or classify, members.  目前，我们使用我们业务系统的一个大型数据存储库来帮助我们对会员进行分层或分类。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7123','basketwork','''bæskɪtwɝk','''bɑːskɪtwɜːk','[n] 编织物','On the metope of smooth simple but elegant, also can hang buy to wait for the basketwork of material make it with bavin, careless, reed, palm, hemp.  在光滑素雅的墙面上，也可挂置用柴、草、苇、棕、麻等材料做成的编织物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7124','commercialization','kə,mɝʃəlɪ''zeʃən','kə,mɜːʃəlaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 商品化','Hardly anyone can escape the influence of commercialization.  几乎没有人能逃脱商品化的影响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7125','acidity','ə''sɪdəti','ə''sɪdɪtɪ','[n] 酸度, 酸性, [医]酸过多, 胃酸过多',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7126','tray','tre','treɪ','[n] 盘, 碟','The waiter brought drinks on a tray.  服务员用托盘端来饮料。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7127','intently','ɪn''tɛntli','ɪn''tentlɪ','[adv] 专心地, 集中地','As we walked alongside each other, she listened intently as I told her about you, about us, about the wonderful times we shared.  我们肩并肩地走着,她专心地听着我讲述你,讲述我们,以及我们一起分享的那些美好时光。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7128','excel','ɪk''sɛl','ɪk''sel; ek-','[v] 优秀, 胜过他人','You have excelled yourself with the new exhibition.  你新办的这次展览特别成功。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7129','diligence','''dɪlɪdʒəns','''dɪlɪdʒ(ə)ns','[n] 勤奋','Genius is nothing but labor and diligence.  天才无非是工作和勤奋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7130','separable','''sɛpərəbl','''sep(ə)rəb(ə)l','[adj] 可分离的, 可分的','Character is not separable from physical form but is governed by it.  性格和外表是分不开的，而且性格决定外表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7131','breast','brɛst','brest','[n] 胸脯，乳房','These bras are specially designed for women with large breasts.  这些胸罩专为乳房丰满的女性设计。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7132','thimble','''θɪmbl','''θɪmb(ə)l','[n] 顶针；嵌环','Is this your thimble?  这是你的顶针吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7133','overload',',ovɚ''lod','əʊvə''ləʊd','[v] 使超载  n超载','Be careful not to overload the washing machine.  注意别让洗衣机负荷过重。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7134','cyclic','''saɪklɪk','''saɪklɪk; ''sɪk-','[adj] 循环的,周期性的','cyclical changes in the economy  经济的周期性变化'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7135','worst','wɝst','wə:st','[a& ad] 最坏(的)，最差(的)','Hope for the best and prepare for the worst.  [谚语]寄予乐观的希望，作最坏的准备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7136','buyer','''baɪɚ','''baɪə','[n] 买主, 顾客','There were several potential buyers.  有好几个潜在的买家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7137','dim','dɪm','dɪm','[v] (使)暗淡,(使)模糊','The lights in the theatre began to dim.  剧院里的灯光开始暗下来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7138','lop','lɑp','lɒp','[v] 剪去, 砍掉','Workmen have lopped off more branches in an effort to save the tree.  为了救活这棵树，工人们砍下了更多的树枝。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7139','harmfully','','','[adv] 伤害地,有害地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7140','boxlike','','','[adj] 象箱子一样的','Then he lifted his shirt to reveal a heavy, boxlike device dangling from his neck.  说完之后，他掀开他的衣领，露出一个悬挂在他脖子上的沉重的，盒子样的装置。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7141','amazingly','','','[adv] 惊奇地, 惊人地','Even those passengers who were most distrustful of themselves pluck up amazingly.  甚至那些对自己最缺乏信心的乘客也令人惊奇地鼓起了勇气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7142','pinhole','''pɪnhol','''pɪnhəʊl','[n] 针孔, 小孔','The yellow parts has small oval-shaped protrusions, each with one or two “pinhole” depressions.  黄色部分有小的椭圆形突出，每个突出又有一到二个“针孔”状凹陷。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7143','admittedly','əd''mɪtɪdli','əd''mɪtɪdlɪ','[adv] 不可否认的, 公认地','This has led to financial losses, though admittedly on a fairly small scale.  这已造成了经济损失，尽管这个损失其实还比较小。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7144','maternal','mə''tɝnl','mə''tɜːn(ə)l','[adj] 母亲的, 母系的','Annie was wonderfully warm and maternal.  安妮非常亲切慈爱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7145','wintertime','''wintətaim','''wɪntətaɪm','[n] 冬, 冬季','This photo of the towers was taken during wintertime.  这些钙华塔的照片是在冬季拍摄的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7146','pliable','','','[adj] 柔顺的','a shoe made of soft pliable leather  柔韧的皮革做成的鞋子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7147','anthropologically','','','[adv] 人类学上','This course examines computers anthropologically, as meaningful tools revealing the social and cultural orders that produce them.  本课程系以人类学的观点探讨电脑，显示过去生产电脑的社会和文化秩序。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7148','cobble','''kɑbl','''kɒb(ə)l','[n] 圆石,鹅卵石; [v] 修补','And such urban architecture - from the simplicity of small, cobble-and-whitewash towns to the 17th-century glories of Cartagena and Popayán.  如此的城市建筑，有简朴的铺着鹅卵石道路和白色房屋的小镇，也有遗留着17世纪荣光的喀他赫纳和博帕雍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7149','bachelor','''bætʃəlɚ','''bætʃələ','[n] 单身汉, 文理学士','Gerald was 38, and a confirmed bachelor (=  a man who has decided that he will never marry  ) .  杰拉德38岁，抱定主意独身。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7150','literate','''lɪtərət','''lɪt(ə)rət','[adj] 有读写能力的；有文化修养的','Over one-quarter of the adult population are not fully literate.  四分之一以上的成年人是半文盲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7151','totemism','''totə,mɪzəm','''təʊtəmɪzəm','[n] 对图腾的信仰, 图腾制度',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7152','enigmatic','''ɛnɪg''mætɪk',',enɪg''mætɪk','[adj] 谜的, 莫明其妙的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7153','illiterate','ɪ''lɪtərət','ɪ''lɪt(ə)rət','[n] 文盲 a不识字的','...a subclass of illiterates.  …文盲阶层。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7154','allusion','ə''lʊʒən','ə''luːʒ(ə)n; -''ljuː-','[n] 提及, 暗示','This last point was understood to be an allusion to the long-standing hostility between the two leaders.  这最后一点曾被理解为对这两位领导人之间长久敌意的一种影射。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7155','inquire','ɪn''kwaɪr','ɪn''kwaɪə','[v] 询问,  查究','‘Why are you doing that?’ the boy inquired.  “你为什么这么做？”男孩问道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7156','proclivity','prə''klɪvəti','prə''klɪvɪtɪ','[n] 倾向','his sexual proclivities  他的性倾向'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7157','awkwardly','''ɔ:kwə:dli','''ɔ:kwə:dli','[adv] 笨拙地, 无技巧地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7158','contention','kən''tɛnʃən','kən''tenʃ(ə)n','[n] 争夺, 争论','It is my contention that death and murder always lurk as potentials in violent relationships.  我的观点是，在暴力关系中总是潜伏着死亡和谋杀的可能。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7159','recount','rɪ''kaʊnt','rɪ''kaʊnt','[v] 叙述','He then recounted the story of the interview for his first job.  他然后叙述了有关他第一份工作面试的故事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7160','sorrow','sɑro','''sɒrəʊ','[n] 悲哀, 悲痛','He said that his decision to resign was made more in sorrow than in anger.  他说他作出辞职的决定与其说是出于气愤，不如说是因为悲伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7161','escutcheon','ɪ''skʌtʃən','ɪ''skʌtʃ(ə)n; e-','[n] 有花纹的盾, 锁眼盖, 孔罩',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7162','horticulturalist','','','[n] 园艺家','The progress of the bloom was checked closely by museum horticulturalist Zac Stayton.  博物馆的园艺学家扎克•斯泰顿严密监测着开花的过程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7163','reunion','','riː''juːnjən; -ɪən','[n] 团圆, 重聚','an annual reunion  一年一度的聚会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7164','alphabetically',',ælfə''bɛtɪkli',',ælfe''bɛtɪkli','[adv] 按字母表顺序地','For example, you could list your records in your report alphabetically.  例如，可以在报告中按字母顺序列出记录。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7165','carelessly','''kɛəlisli','''kɛəlisli','[adv] 粗心地；疏忽地','He carelessly left the door unlocked.  他很粗心，没锁上门。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7166','supermodel','''supɚmɑdl','','[n] 超级名模','Jeff: If you were a supermodel, I can see why that would be important.  杰夫：如果你是一个超级名模我就明白为什么这很重要。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7167','brusquely','','','[adv] 唐突地, 粗率地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7168','stubble','''stʌbl','''stʌb(ə)l','[n] 短须, 麦茬','The stubble was burning in the fields.  残株在田地里燃烧着。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7169','solely','''solli','''səʊllɪ','[adv] 独自地, 单独地','Scholarships are given solely on the basis of financial need.  奖学金完全是根据经济需要发放的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7170','flout','flaʊt','flaʊt','[vt&n] 轻视, 嘲笑','...illegal campers who persist in flouting the law.  …一向无视法律的非法露营者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7171','chihuahua','tʃɪ''wɑwɑ','tʃɪ''wɑːwə','[n] 吉娃娃(一种产于墨西哥的狗)','Well, I think my chihuahua just killed him...  哦，我想我的吉娃娃刚要了它的命……'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7172','morphological',',mɔrfə''lɑdʒəkəl',',mɔːfə''lɒdʒɪkəl','[adj] 形态学的','Many scientists agree that the domestic dog displays more morphological variation than any other known species, thanks to selective breeding by humans.  许多科学家都认为，国内的狗更显示形态比任何其他已知的物种变异，人类有选择育种的感谢。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7173','reactive','rɪ''æktɪv','rɪ''æktɪv','[adj] 反应的, 反作用的','a reactive foreign policy  回应式的外交政策'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7174','Philippine','''filipi:n','''filipi:n','[adj] 菲律宾的, 菲律宾人的','CMMI certification, she says, would ensure a higher quality of software development and help Philippine software companies compete more effectively, particularly in the international market.  她说，CMMI认证将确保更高质量的软件开发，帮助菲律宾的软件公司，特别是在国际市场上，更有效地竞争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7175','geothermally','','','[adj] 地热的','The first geothermally generated electricity was produced in Larderello, Italy, in 1904.  1904年，在意大利的拉德莱罗，首次实现了地热发电。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7176','inflow','''ɪnflo','''ɪnfləʊ','[n] 流入, 流入物','The Swiss wanted to discourage an inflow of foreign money.  瑞士人想要阻止外资流入。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7177','subfreezing','','','[adj] 低于冰点的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7178','anthropomorphism',',ænθrəpə''mɔrfɪzəm',',ænθrəpə''mɔːfɪz(ə)m','[n] 拟人论,拟人观','The comments on webcam sites are rife with anthropomorphism, not surprisingly, and even when this is pointed out, the contributors are often undaunted.  不出意外的，在动物直播网站里充满了各种拟人化的评论，虽然已经有人指出，但是那些评论者却从不更改。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7179','slot','slɑt','slɒt','[n] 狭缝；空位','Alan dropped another quarter into the slot on the pay phone.  艾伦往付费电话的投币口里又塞了一枚 25 分的硬币。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7180','mansion','''mænʃən','''mænʃ(ə)n','[n] 大厦, 官邸','a beautiful country mansion  漂亮的乡村宅第'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7181','awkward','''ɔkwɚd','''ɔːkwəd','[adj] 难使用的, 笨拙的','I hoped he would stop asking awkward questions .  我希望他不要再问令人难堪的问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7182','constraint','kən''strent','kən''streɪnt','[n] 约束, 强制','the constraints of family life  家庭生活的约束'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7183','linger','''lɪŋɡɚ','''lɪŋgə','[v] 逗留, 闲荡','I spent a week at Kandersteg and could happily have lingered on.  我在坎德施泰格逗留了一个星期，本来还可以开开心心地多待几天。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7184','confinement','kən''faɪnmənt','kən''faɪnmənt','[n] 限制, 禁闭','They were held in confinement for three weeks.  他们被关押了三个星期。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7185','centrally','','','[adv] 在中心, 在中央',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7186','adversity','əd''vɝsəti','əd''vɜːsɪtɪ','[n] 灾祸, 逆境','his courage in the face of adversity  他面对逆境的勇气'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7187','imaginative','ɪ''mædʒɪnətɪv','ɪ''mædʒɪnətɪv','[adj] 富有想象力的','an imaginative use of computer technology  计算机技术的妙用'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7188','incapacitated','','','[vt] 使不能','A serious fall incapacitated the 68-year-old congressman.  一次严重跌伤使这位68岁的国会议员丧失了行动能力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7189','onslaught','''ɑnslɔt','''ɒnslɔːt','[n] 冲击','plants that will survive the onslaught of winter  熬得过严冬侵袭的植物'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7190','industrialist','ɪn''dʌstrɪəlɪst','ɪn''dʌstrɪəlɪst','[n] 工业家, 实业家,','...prominent Japanese industrialists.  …杰出的日本工业家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7191','relay','rɪ''le','''riːleɪ','[n] 接力赛；中继转播(设备) vt转述；转播','the 100 metres relay  一百米接力赛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7192','soloist','''soloɪst','''səʊləʊɪst','[n] 独奏者, 独唱者','cello soloist Yo Yo Ma  大提琴独奏家马友友'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7193','interstitial',',ɪntɚ''stɪʃl',',ɪntə''stɪʃ(ə)l','[adj] 空隙的, 裂缝的,',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7194','intertidal',',ɪntɚ''taɪdl','ɪntə''taɪd(ə)l','[n&a] 潮间带(的)','Juveniledevelopment of intertidal creatures varies nearly as much as their physicalforms.  潮间带生物的幼体发育几乎随它们的外形变化而变化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7195','refreshment','ri''frɛʃmənt','rɪ''freʃm(ə)nt','[n] 点心, 精力恢复','Refreshments will be served after the meeting.  会后有茶点招待。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7196','sickness','''sɪknəs','''sɪknɪs','[n] 疾病, 呕吐','an insurance policy against long-term sickness and injury  保长期患病和受伤的保险单'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7197','distill','dɪs''tɪl','dis''til','[v] 蒸馏, 滴下, 吸取','distilled water  蒸馏水'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7198','noble','''nobl','''nəʊb(ə)l','[adj] 高尚的,贵族的','It’s very noble of you to spend all your weekends helping the old folk.  你心地真好，周末的时间全都用来帮助老人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7199','patrol','pə''trol','pə''trəʊl','[v] 出巡, 巡逻','Armed guards patrolled the grounds.  武装卫兵巡逻场地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7200','pony','''poni','''pəʊnɪ','[n] 矮种马，小马','My guess is that after years of being the trick pony, he wanted to see what it was like to be the ringmaster.  在我看来，可能是当了这么多年会变戏法的小马之后，他现在很想看看当马戏团主事什么感觉。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7201','intertwine',',ɪntɚ''twaɪn','ɪntə''twaɪn','[v] (使)纠缠,(使)缠绕','Trees, undergrowth and creepers intertwined, blocking our way.  树木、灌木和攀藤植物相互缠绕，挡了我们的路。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7202','morale','mə''ræl','mə''rɑːl','[n] 士气, 民心','A win is always good for morale.  胜利总是可以鼓舞士气。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7203','incompatible',',ɪnkəm''pætəbl','ɪnkəm''pætɪb(ə)l','[adj] 不相容的 ,矛盾的','I don’t know why they ever got married. They’re totally incompatible.  我不知道他们为什么结婚，他们根本合不来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7204','buddy','''bʌdi','''bʌdɪ','[n] <美口>密友, 伙伴','We’re good buddies.  我们是好朋友。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7205','pristine','''prɪstin','''prɪstiːn; -staɪn','[adj] 质朴的','Walking through the alleys of this venerable water town, one cannot fail to appreciate its pristine and intoxicating atmosphere.  走过这个古老的水乡古镇的小巷，人们不能不欣赏它的质朴，令人陶醉的气氛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7206','sludge','slʌdʒ','''slʌdʒ','[n] 软泥, 淤泥','More than a million gallons of sludge has seeped into the water.  超过一百万加仑的工业废料已渗进水中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7207','Swiss','swɪs','swɪs','[n] / a瑞士(的), 瑞士人(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7208','hallmark','''hɔlmɑrk','''hɔːlmɑːk','[n] 特点','It''s a technique that has become the hallmark of Amber Films.  这是一项已成为安伯电影公司标志的技术。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7209','jean','dʒɪn','dʒiːn','[n] 牛仔裤',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7210','beau','bo','bəʊ','[n] 花花公子','The magnificent beau is dancing to the light of chandeliers.  这个衣着华丽的花花公子在枝形吊灯灯光下翩翩起舞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7211','vibrato','vɪ''brɑto','vɪ''brɑːtəʊ','[n] 颤音, 振动','So at first glance, the idea of a seasonal flamenco Christmas performance seems as wobbly as a cantaora''s vibrato.  所以初看上去，弗拉门戈舞作为圣诞季节的表演与女歌星Cantaora 的颤音一样令人心颤而略带伤感。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7212','sparrow','''spæro','''spærəʊ','[n] [鸟]麻雀','The myrtle, dove, sparrow, and swan are sacred to her.  桃金娘，鸽子，麻雀和天鹅是她的圣物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7213','blackbird','''blækbɝd','''blækbɜːd','[n] 山鸟类',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7214','rhythmic','','','[adj] 节奏的, 合拍的','the rhythmic thud of the bass drum  低音鼓有节奏的咚咚声'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7215','waling','','','[n] 横撑',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7216','lacuna','lə''kjʊnə','lə''kjuːnə','[n] 空白, 空隙',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7217','enigma','ɪ''nɪgmə','ɪ''nɪgmə','[n] 谜, 难以理解的事物','The neighbours regarded him as something of an enigma.  邻居们把他当成谜一样的人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7218','tendon','''tɛndən','''tendən','[n] [解]腱','...a torn tendon in his right shoulder.  …他右肩一根被拉伤的腱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7219','fiddler','''fɪdlɚ','''fɪdlə','[n] 拉提琴的人,游手好闲的人',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7220','carnival','''kɑrnɪvl','''kɑːnɪv(ə)l','[n] 狂欢节, 饮宴狂欢','preparations for this year’s carnival  今年狂欢节的准备工作'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7221','assemblage','ə''sɛmblɪdʒ','ə''semblɪdʒ','[n] 集合, 集会','He had an assemblage of old junk cars filling the backyard.  他曾经在后院堆满了废旧汽车。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7222','saucer','''sɔsɚ','''sɔːsə','[n] 茶托, 碟子','a china cup and saucer  一套瓷茶杯和杯托'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7223','dedication',',dɛdɪ''keʃən','dedɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 贡献, 奉献','To reach a high level of skill requires talent, dedication, and a lot of hard work.  要达到高级水平需要天分，还需要全身心的投入和很多的努力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7224','qualitatively','''kwɑlə,tetɪvli','''kwɔliteitivli','[adv] 质量上','When you automate content generation or processing, you open up new possibilities for customization and qualitatively better service.  将内容生成或处理过程自动化时，在定制和更佳质量的服务方面，会出现新的可能性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7225','redwing','''rɛdwɪŋ','''redwɪŋ','[n] [动](欧洲产的)红翼鸫','Hunting of song and mistle thrushes and their cousin the redwing is not illegal, but the methods used are, despite attempts by legislators to introduce exceptions.  捕猎画眉、 獬鸫 和 红翼鸫 等鸟类并不违法，但使用灌胶陷阱的方法是违法的，立法者试图引入免责条款。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7226','vigilance','''vɪdʒələns','''vɪdʒɪl(ə)ns','[n] 警戒, 警惕','the need for increased police vigilance  警方加强警戒的必要性'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7227','adventurous','əd''vɛntʃərəs','əd''ventʃ(ə)rəs','[adj] 冒险的；惊险的','He had always wanted an adventurous life in the tropics.  他一直都想要一种在热带丛林里的冒险生活。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7228','telltale','''tɛltel','''telteɪl','[adj] 泄密的','They examined the child carefully, looking for telltale signs of abuse.  他们仔细检查了那个孩子，寻找被虐待的痕迹。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7229','ordinance','''ɔrdnəns','''ɔːdɪnəns','[n] 法令，条例','a city ordinance that says parks must be closed at 11 p.m.  规定公园须于夜间11点钟关闭的城市条例'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7230','tether','ˈteðər','''teðə','[n] 范围','We should tether our plan to our resources.  我们应把我们的计划限定在自己财力所允许的范围内。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7231','overestimate',',ovər''ɛstɪmət','əʊvər''estɪmeɪt','[vt&n] 评价过高','He tends to overestimate his own abilities.  他往往高估自己的能力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7232','syrup','''sɪrəp','''sɪrəp','[n] 糖浆, 果汁','ice cream and maple syrup  枫糖浆冰激凌'),
