('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7258','singleton','''sɪŋɡltən','''sɪŋg(ə)lt(ə)n','[n] 一个, 独身','Since there is only one singleton instance, any instance fields of a singleton will occur only once per class, just like static fields.  由于只有一个单实例，单例对象的域只会在一个类中出现一次，就像静态域一样。'),
