('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7260','nationalistic',',næʃnə''lɪstɪk','','[adj] 国家主义的','They were encouraging nationalistic sentiment among the students.  他们在鼓动学生们的民族主义情绪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7261','soothe','sʊð','suːð','[v] 缓和, 安慰','Lucy soothed the baby by rocking it in her arms.  露西把宝宝抱在怀里摇晃着，让他安静下来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7262','deteriorates','dɪ''tɪrɪəret','dɪ''tɪərɪəreɪt','[v] 恶化，变坏','There are fears that the situation might deteriorate into full-scale war.  人们担心局势会恶化为全面战争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7263','stabilization',',stebɪlɪ''zeʃən',',steɪbɪlaɪ''zeɪʃən','[n] 稳定性','On this point, RUP offers extensive guidance by showing you the prioritization technique of use cases and architecture stabilization.  在这一点上，RUP 通过展示用例和架构稳定性的优先化技术来提供广泛的指导。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7264','aspire','ə''spaɪr','ə''spaɪə','[v] 热望, 立志','...people who aspire to public office.  …志在获得公职的人们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7265','joinery','''dʒɔɪnəri','''dʒɒɪnərɪ','[n] 木工职业','It basically is from joinery board in release, also have in coating and paint a few.  它主要是从细木工板中释放出来的，涂料和油漆中也有少量。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7266','mechanically','mɪ''kænɪkəli','mɪ''kænɪkəlɪ','[adv] 机械地；无意识地','Never copy foreign things blindly or mechanically.  不要盲目地或机械地照搬外国的东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7267','stride','straɪd','straɪd','[v] 大步走(过), 跨过','They were joined by a newcomer who came striding across a field.  他们中又来了个新人，那人穿过一块田地大步走过来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7268','windswept','','','[adj] 风刮的, 被风吹扫的','windswept moors  狂风劲吹的荒野'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7269','swiftness','''swiftnis','','[n] 迅速，敏捷','The current financial and economic crisis is difficult to appreciate, not only for the drop in elevation, but because of the swiftness of the declines.  目前的金融与经济危机令我们无所适从，不仅因为经济高度的回落，更是因为回落得如此迅速。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7270','radioactivity',',redɪoæk''tɪvəti',',reɪdɪəʊæk''tɪvɪtɪ','[n] 放射能','the discovery of radioactivity  放射现象的发现'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7271','seabird','''sibɝd','','[n] 海鸟(如海鸥)','The island is covered with seabirds.  这岛上到处都是海鸟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7272','Reykjavik','''reikjəvik; -vi:k','''reikjəvik; -vi:k','[n] 雷克雅末(冰岛首都)','He has built a comfortable life in Reykjavik with his family. They vacation abroad.  他和家人在雷克雅维克过得舒舒服服，还能到国外度假。'),
