('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7276','midnight','''mɪdnaɪt','''mɪdnaɪt','[n] 午夜','You can’t phone her now – it’s gone midnight (= after midnight ) !  你现在不能打电话给她，都过午夜了！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7277','Utah','''ju:tɑ:','''ju:tɑ:','[n] 犹他州(略作Ut,UT)','I even moved to Utah to be with him.  我甚至搬到了犹他州，为了和他在一起。'),
