('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7281','hydrosphere','''haɪdrosfɪr','''haɪdrəsfɪə','[n] 水圈, 水气','Geosphere, hydrosphere and atmosphere are fluids in motion; their main difference is their viscosity.  地圈，水圈和大气是流体；他们的主要差别是他们的黏性。'),
