('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7284','exoskeleton','''ɛksoskɛlɪtn','''eksəʊ,skelɪt(ə)n','[n] [动] 外骨骼','An advanced onboard micro-computer ensures the exoskeleton moves in concert with the operator.  一种最先进的机载微型电脑确保了外骨骼与操作器一致移动。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7285','dimply','','','[adj] 有酒窝的, 有凹处的','The rough, dimply surfaces of Mentos encourage bubble growth because they efficiently disrupt the polar attractions between water molecules, creating bubble growth sites.  粗糙的有纹路的曼妥斯促使泡泡增长，因为他们有效地中断水分子之间的极吸引力，使泡泡数量变多了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7286','clamor','''klæmə','''klæmə','[n] 喧闹','On weekdays, the marmosets steered clear of the roar of traffic, and on Sundays they shunned the clamor of visiting crowds.  工作日的时候，这些狨猴避开嘈杂的交通，星期天的时候它们就会避开喧闹的游客。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7287','mob','mɑb','mɒb','[n] 暴民 vt成群围住,聚众袭击','They were immediately surrounded by the mob.  他们立刻被那帮暴民包围了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7288','enjoyable','ɪn''dʒɔɪəbl','ɪn''dʒɒɪəb(ə)l; en-','[adj] 有趣的, 愉快的','Games can make learning more enjoyable.  游戏可以寓教于乐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7289','reluctantly','rɪ''lʌktəntli','rɪ''lʌktəntlɪ','[adj] 不情愿地；勉强地','The mistress of the house reluctantly installed the two refugees in a spare room.  女主人很不情愿地把两个难民安置在一个空闲的房间里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7290','overbalance',',ovɚ''bæləns','əʊvə''bæl(ə)ns','[v] 失去平衡','He overbalanced and fell head first.  他失去了平衡而且头部先着了地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7291','carbonization','','','[n] 碳化(物)','This entails the destruction of the equipment tested, through carbonization of the insulating material.  这意味着测试设备因绝缘部分的碳化而被破坏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7292','marshland','''mɑrʃlænd','''mɑːʃlənd','[n] 沼泽地','At Honghu Lake, fish spawning has been affected, said Zeng Xiaodong, leader of the Honghu marshland management office.  另据洪湖沼泽管理办公室的曾晓东介绍，洪湖的鱼类的产卵量也受到了很大影响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7293','viscera','''vɪsərə','''vɪs(ə)rə','[n] 内脏,内部的东西',''),
