('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7347','preparedness','prɪ''pɛrdnəs','prɪ''peərɪdnɪs','[n] 有准备, 已准备','the country’s lack of military preparedness  该国在军事上的准备不足'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7348','wrinkle','''rɪŋkl','''rɪŋkl','[n] 皱纹 v使皱','Her face was a mass of wrinkles.  她的脸上布满皱纹。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7349','eyeball','''aɪbɔl','''aɪbɔːl','[n] 眼球, 眼珠子',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7350','persuasive','pɚ''swesɪv','pə''sweɪsɪv','[n] 说服者a善说服的','In either case it is persuasive because there is somebody whom it persuades.  不管在那种情况下，它之所以有说服力，是因为有人被说服了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7351','seedy','''sidi','''siːdɪ','[adj] 多种子的, 结籽的','a seedy nightclub  一家乌烟瘴气的夜总会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7352','thoughtfully','''θɔtfəli','''θɔ:tfəl','[adv] 思虑地, 仔细地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7353','unbiased','ʌn''baɪəst','ʌn''baɪəst','[adj] 公正的','We aim to provide a service that is balanced and unbiased.  我们的目标是提供一种公平公正的服务。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7354','square','skwɛr','skweə','[adj] 正方形的,平方的 n正方形；广场','a large square room  一个正方形的大房间'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7355','plethora','''plɛθərə','''pleθ(ə)rə','[n] 过剩,过量','a plethora of suggestions  一大堆建议'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7356','openly','''opənli','','[adv] 不隐瞒地, 公然地','Sarah talked openly about her problems.  萨拉毫不掩饰地说起自己的问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7357','conditioner','kən''dɪʃənɚ','kən''dɪʃ(ə)nə','[n] 调节者, 调节装置',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7358','dung','dʌŋ','dʌŋ','[n] 粪 vt施粪肥于','Workers at Sydney''s harbourside Taronga zoo are refusing to collect animal dung in a protest over wages.  悉尼海港塔龙加动物园的工人因对工资的抗议而拒绝收拾动物粪便。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7359','substantive','səb''stæntɪv','''sʌbst(ə)ntɪv','[adj] 独立存在的，直接的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7360','automatic','''ɔtə''mætɪk','ɔːtə''mætɪk','[n] 自动机械 a自动的,机械的','He drew his automatic and began running in the direction of the sounds.  他拔出自动枪，朝发出声音的方向跑去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7361','replenishment','rɪ''plɛnɪʃmənt','rɪ''plenɪʃmənt','[n] 补给, 补充','There is a concern about replenishment of the population.  有人担心人口的补充问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7362','fanner','''fænɚ','''fænə','[n] 通风机','If be used on fanner, is kiss formula switch, should look up each to block a distinction between place pilot rotate speed in the check after electrify apparent.  假如电风扇上使用的是轻触式开关，则应该在通电后检查一下各挡位所控制的转速之间的区别是否明显。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7363','globally','','','[adv] 世界上, 全世界',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7364','invigorate','ɪn''vɪɡəret','ɪn''vɪgəreɪt','[v] 鼓舞','Carey’s hope was that the church would be renewed and invigorated.  凯里希望教会能复兴。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7365','civet','''sɪvɪt','''sɪvɪt','[n] [动物]麝猫','Studying the ecology of carnivores in the rainforest, he thinks like a desperate civet running out of territory.  主攻热带雨林肉食动物生态学的他，思考起来像是跑出领地的绝望麝猫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7366','drown','draʊn','draʊn','[v] 溺死, 淹没','Many people drowned when the boat overturned.  船翻后许多人淹死了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7367','setup','''sɛt,ʌp','''setʌp','[n] 装备, 安装,计划','The worst part of the setup is the poor instruction manual.  安装过程中最糟糕的部分就是差劲的操作手册。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7368','untrue','ʌn''tru','ʌn''truː','[adj] 不真实的, 不正确的','allegations that are totally untrue  完全不能成立的指控'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7369','dolphin','''dɑlfɪn','''dɒlfɪn','[n] 海豚','By hunting or gathering away from the group, both chimpanzee and dolphin moms ensure that what they find goes to their young.  黑猩猩和海豚妈妈们远离群体打猎和收集食物，并保证他们所找到的食物都给孩子们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7370','rephrase',',ri''frez','riː''freɪz','[v] 改述','Again, the executive rephrased the question.  经理又重新表述了他的问题。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7371','overproduction','','','[n] 生产过剩','the systematic overproduction of food  有计划的食物生产过剩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7372','moat','mot','məʊt','[n] 护城河, 城壕','Certainly no one in the media would deny the attraction of living behind a deep moat, even if it is filled with sharks.  当然，在媒体业，没有人会否认围在深深的护城河里面过日子的吸引力，即使那河里满是鲨鱼在游来游去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7373','replica','''rɛplɪkə','''replɪkə','[n] 复制品','replica guns  仿真枪'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7374','minority','maɪ''nɔrəti','maɪ''nɒrɪtɪ; mɪ-','[n] 少数, 少数民族','Gaelic is still spoken in Ireland by a tiny minority.  爱尔兰仍有极少数人在说盖尔语。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7375','forum','''fɔrəm','''fɔːrəm','[n] 讨论会, 论坛','Members of the council agreed that was an important forum for discussion.  理事会成员们一致认为那是一个用于讨论的重要论坛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7376','aridity','æ''rɪdəti','ə''rɪdətɪ','[n] 干旱, 乏味','"Increased aridity is making the drylands the most conflict prone region of the world, " he said.  “干旱的增加正使旱地成为世界上最容易发生冲突的地区，”他说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7377','purge','pɝdʒ','pɜːdʒ','[v] 清洗(除) n清洗','The leadership voted to purge the party of "hostile and antiparty elements."  领导层投票来清除党内“有敌意的反党分子”。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7378','therapist','''θɛrəpɪst','''θerəpɪst','[n] 临床医学家',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7379','attacker','ə''tækɚ','','[n] 攻击者','Her attacker then dragged her into the bushes.  袭击者接着将她拖进灌木丛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7380','regrettable','rɪ''ɡrɛtəbl','rɪ''gretəb(ə)l','[adj] 可惜的, 遗憾的','This was a very regrettable error.  这是个令人很遗憾的错误。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7381','cheer','tʃɪr','tʃɪə','[n& v] 欢呼','A great cheer went up from the crowd.  人群中爆发出巨大的欢呼声。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7382','schist','ʃɪst','ʃɪst','[n] [地]片岩','The jagged stratification of Jedburgh, so different than the smooth schist-and-sandstone layering seen elsewhere in Scotland, would provide it.  而赫顿不整合结构正好佐证了这种观点，这处位于杰德堡的交错岩层完全不同于在苏格兰其他地区所发现的光滑片岩和砂岩层结构。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7383','Thai','taɪ','taɪ','[n] 泰国人, 泰国语','She was interviewed about the death of the Thai worker on Israeli TV and she plans to continue to work for peace.  她接受了以色列电视台关于这位泰国工人致死的报道，并且她计划继续致力于为和平而工作。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7384','rime','raɪm','raɪm','[n] 结晶, v使蒙霜',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7385','loyally','','','[adv] 忠诚','If the consensus is that you should continue, then I will support the government loyally from the backbenches.  如果一致意见是你应该继续留任，那么我会以一名普通议员的身份忠诚地支持政府。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7386','artiste','ɑr''tist','ɑː''tiːst','[n] 技艺家','...a cabaret artiste.  ...一名“卡巴莱”餐馆艺人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7387','symbolically','sim''bɔlikəli','sim''bɔlikəli','[adv] 象征(性)地','Say I have an online resource that I want you to symbolically pay for.  比如，我有一个在线资源，希望您能象征性地为其付出代价。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7388','misinterprete','','','[v] 误解',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7389','controllable','kən''troləbl','kən''trəʊləbl','[adj] 可管理的, 可控制的','Diabetes is a serious but controllable disease.  糖尿病是一种严重但可以控制的疾病。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7390','categorically',',kæti''gɔrikli',',kæti''gɔrikli','[adv] 断然地, 明确地','Can you state categorically that her death was caused by lack of food?  你能明确地说她是饿死的吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7391','outwit',',aʊt''wɪt','aʊt''wɪt','[v] 瞒骗, 以智取胜','a wolf that had outwitted hunters for years  一头多年来智胜猎人的狼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7392','intelligently','','','[adv] 聪明地；理智地','Philosophy is a study that lets us be unhappy more intelligently.  哲学是让我们更聪明地不快乐的一门学问。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7393','problematic','''prɑblə''mætɪk','prɒblə''mætɪk','[adj] 问题的, 有疑问的','The reforms could turn out to be highly problematic .  改革最终可能会困难重重。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7394','restlessness','rɛstlɪsnɪs','ˈrestlɪsnɪs','[n] 辗转不安, 烦躁不安',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7395','bearing','''bɛrɪŋ','''beərɪŋ','[n] 举止，风度','She later wrote warmly of his bearing and behaviour.  稍后她热情地写到了他的风度与举止。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7396','clutch','klʌtʃ','klʌtʃ','[v] 抓住, 攫住','He clutched at a pillar for support.  他猛地抓住一根柱子作支撑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7397','uncarved','','','[adj] 没雕刻的','One day, a man named He Shi of the State of Chu got a piece of uncarved jade in a hill. He quickly went to present it to King Li of the State of Chu.  一天，有个叫“和氏”的楚国人，在一座山里得到一块没有雕琢过得玉石，连忙拿去献给楚厉王。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7398','macaque','mə''kɑk','mə''kɑːk; -''kæk','[n] 短尾猿','Now, two macaque monkeys may have helped MIT researchers solve the time tracking puzzle.  现在，两只短尾猿或许可以帮助这些研究人员们解开时间谜团。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7399','villager','''vɪlɪdʒɚ','''vɪlɪdʒə','[n] 村民','Soon the villagers couldn''t afford to buy food for themselves.  很快村民们就买不起吃的东西了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7400','fallacy','''fæləsi','''fæləsɪ','[n] 谬误, 谬论','It’s a common fallacy that a neutered dog will become fat and lazy.  说阉割过的狗会变得又胖又懒，这是普遍的谬见。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7401','vitascope','','','[n] 老式放映机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7402','unfocused','','','[adj] 未聚焦的,无焦点的','The discussion was becom­ing unfocused.  讨论的焦点越来越分散。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7403','anyplace','''ɛnɪples','''enɪpleɪs','[adv] 任何地方','I can’t imagine living anyplace else now.  我现在不能想象住在其他地方会怎么样。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7404','stealthy','''stɛlθi','''stelθɪ','[adj] 鬼鬼祟祟的, 秘密的','the stealthy approach of the soldiers  士兵的悄悄靠近'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7405','beng','','','[n] 大麻',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7406','hut','hʌt','hʌt','[n] 小屋, 棚屋','a wooden hut  小木屋'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7407','douse','daʊs','daʊs','[v] 熄灭；浸，洒','The pumps were started and the crew began to douse the fire with water.  抽水机启动了，船员们开始用水将火浇灭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7408','silvery','''sɪlvəri','''sɪlv(ə)rɪ','[adj] 含银的,银色光泽的','her silvery hair  她的银发'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7409','healer','''hilɚ','''hiːlə','[n] 医治者, 治病术士',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7410','holy','''holi','''həʊlɪ','[adj] 神圣的, 圣洁的','the holy city of Varanasi  圣城瓦拉纳西'),
