('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7469','meteoroid','''mitɪər,ɔɪd','''miːtɪərɒɪd','[n] 流星体','Shortly before the uninhabited space station reached orbit in .May 1973,aeroaynamic pressure ripped off a meteoroid and heat shield.  在1973年5月无人空间站到达轨道前不久，空气动力压力扯破了一个流星体和挡热板。 分析：首先，从逻辑上看，说：“空气动力压力扯破了一个流星体”，是不合事理的，荒谬可笑的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7470','threadlike','','','[adj] 线状的','Genes are spiraled, threadlike particles made of DNA (deoxyribonucleic acid).  基因是由DNA（脱氧核糖核酸）组成的丝状螺旋微粒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7471','pulp','pʌlp','pʌlp','[n] 酱；果肉；纸浆','Halve the melon and scoop out the pulp.  把瓜切成两半，挖出瓜瓤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7472','physician','fɪ''zɪʃən','fɪ''zɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 医师, 内科医师','...your family physician.  …你的家庭医生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7473','sod','sɑd','sɒd','[n] 草地','But why cover your car in sod?  不过为什么要盖上一层草皮呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7474','clench','klɛntʃ','klen(t)ʃ','[v] 捏紧；紧紧握住','Jody was pacing the sidelines, her fists clenched.  乔迪在球场的边线上紧握着拳头来回踱步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7475','fist','fɪst','fɪst','[n] 拳头','She held the money tightly in her fist.  她把钱紧紧地攥在手中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7476','supplementation',',sʌpləmən''teʃən','','[n] 增补,补充','The product provided inadequate vitamin and mineral supplementation.  这种产品不能充分补充维生素和矿物质。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7477','disrepute',',dɪsrɪ''pjut',',dɪsrɪ''pjuːt','[n] 坏名声','He faces six charges of bringing the game into disrepute .  他面临六项破坏这项运动声誉的指控。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7478','syndrome','''sɪndrəm','''sɪndrəʊm','[n] 综合病症','people who suffer from irritable bowel syndrome  患有肠道过敏综合征的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7479','rectify','''rɛktɪfaɪ','''rektɪfaɪ','[v] 矫正, 调整','I did my best to rectify the situation, but the damage was already done.  我竭尽全力去挽回局面，但损害已经造成了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7480','herein',',hɪr''ɪn','hɪər''ɪn','[adv] 在此处, 此中','the conditions stated herein  本文所列条件'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7481','denial','dɪ''naɪəl','dɪ''naɪ(ə)l','[n] 否认,谢绝','It seems clear that despite official denials, differences of opinion lay behind the ambassador''s decision to quit.  很清楚，尽管官方否认，人们对大使决定辞职还是有不同看法。'),
