('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7485','theological',',θiə''lɑdʒɪkl','θɪə''lɒdʒɪk(ə)l','[adj] 神学(上)的','Did he not offer any reasons for what he did or did he have theological and philosophical discussions with Pilate about his message?   他没有为他的行为给出任何解释,还是他说了一些神学和哲学的观点,和彼拉多进行了一番讨论呢？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7486','dorsal','''dɔrsl','''dɔːs(ə)l','[adj] 背的, 脊的','a shark’s dorsal fin  鲨鱼的背鳍'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7487','irritability',',ɪrətə''bɪləti',',ɪrɪtə''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 过敏性, 兴奋性',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7488','neurilemmal','','','[adj] 神经膜的, 神经鞘的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7489','neuroglia','njʊ''rɑglɪə',',njʊə''rɒglɪə','[n] [解]神经胶(质)','There are a certain number of neural stem cells, which can be potentially differentiated into the neurons or neuroglia, in the adult mammalian brain.  成年哺乳动物脑内存在有能分化成神经元或神经胶质的神经干细胞，这种神经前体细胞一般位于脑室壁部位。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7490','mushroom','''mʌʃrʊm','''mʌʃruːm; -rʊm','[n] 蘑菇','mushroom soup  蘑菇汤'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7491','breakdown','''brek''daʊn','''breɪkdaʊn','[n] 崩溃, 衰弱','I was worried he might have a breakdown if he carried on working so hard.  我担心他这样辛苦地做下去，精神会崩溃的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7492','yeast','jist','jiːst','[n] 酵母, 发酵粉',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7493','concurrent','kən''kɝənt','kən''kʌr(ə)nt','[adj] 一致的；同时的','The exhibition reflected concurrent developments abroad.  该展览反映了国外的同期发展情况。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7494','stratification',',strætɪfɪ''keʃən',',strætɪfɪ''keɪʃən','[n] 分层, 成层法','The Indian caste system is an example of social stratification .  印度的种姓制度是社会阶层化的一个例子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7495','microcosm','''maɪkrokɑzəm','''maɪkrə(ʊ)kɒz(ə)m','[n] 微观世界','In each one of these places you will find a microcosm of molecules which directly impact the look, smell, touch, and sound of everything that you see.  在每一个这样的地方，你都可以发现分子的微观世界，它们会直接影响你所见物质的外观、气味、触感和声音。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7496','unsureness','','','[n] 不确定, 缺乏自信','The public psychosocial status is mostly affected by the unsureness of information in the event of epidemic outbreak.  面对疫情及突发事件，信息的不确定性是影响民众心态变化的主要因素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7497','fright','fraɪt','fraɪt','[n] 惊骇, 吃惊','The steam pipes rattled suddenly, and Franklin jumped with fright.  蒸汽管突然发出咯咯的声音，弗兰克林吓得跳了起来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7498','belie','bɪ''laɪ','bɪ''laɪ','[v] 掩饰','Her pleasant manner belied her true character.  她讨人喜欢的举止掩饰了她真实的个性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7499','hesitant','''hɛzɪtənt','''hezɪt(ə)nt','[adj] 迟疑的, 犹豫不定的','Gail gave me a hesitant little smile.  盖尔迟疑地对我微微一笑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7500','sewer','''suɚ','''suːə; ''sjuːə','[n] 排水沟，下水道','...the city''s sewer system.  …该城市的下水道系统。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7501','slum','slʌm','slʌm','[n] 贫民窟','a slum area  贫民区'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7502','detection','dɪ''tɛkʃən','dɪ''tekʃ(ə)n','[n] 察觉, 侦查','...the early detection of breast cancer.  …乳腺癌的早期发现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7503','glider','''ɡlaɪdɚ','''glaɪdə','[n] 滑行(或物), 滑翔机','And go for a ride on a glider airplane, because who says planes need motors?  她会去坐滑翔机，因为没人说过飞机一定要有发动机吧？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7504','anytime','''ɛnɪ,taɪm','''enɪtaɪm','[adv] 任何时候, 无论何时','Call me anytime. I’m always home.  随时给我打电话，我一直在家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7505','intuitive','ɪn''tuɪtɪv','ɪn''tjuːɪtɪv','[adj] 有直觉力的，直觉到的','He seemed to have an intuitive awareness of how I felt.  他好像凭直觉就知道我的感受。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7506','undernutrition',',ʌndənʊ''trɪʃən; ,ʌndənjʊ''trɪʃən',',ʌndənjuː''trɪʃən','[n] 营养不良','Does this mean that all GM foods are fated never to solve the undernutrition of the poor?  这是否意味着所有的转基因食品注定永远不会解决穷人的营养不足？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7507','urgent','''ɝdʒənt','ˈɜːdʒənt','[adj] 急迫的, 紧急的','He was in urgent need of medical attention.  他急需治疗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7508','hohokam','','','[adj] 霍霍坎文化的','The hohokam culture disintegrated as they had difficulty maintaining the canals in the dry conditions of the drought.  当干旱的条件使得运河很难被维护好的时候，霍霍坎文化瓦解了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7509','irresponsible',',ɪrɪ''spɑnsəbl','ˌɪrɪˈspɒnsəbl','[adj] 不负责任的, 不可靠的','It was highly irresponsible of him to leave the children on their own in the pool.  他把孩子们独自留在游泳池里，真是太不负责任了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7510','retrospect','''rɛtrəspɛkt','''retrəspekt','[n] 回顾','In retrospect, I wonder if we should have done more.  回过头看，我在想我们是否应该做得更多些。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7511','chronic','''krɑnɪk','''krɒnɪk','[adj] 慢性的, 延续很长的','chronic arthritis  慢性关节炎'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7512','index','''ɪndɛks','''ɪndeks','[n] 索引, 指数','...the consumer price index.  …消费价格指数。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7513','flatfish','''flætfɪʃ','''flætfɪʃ','[n] 比目鱼','Recently, she caught a large catfish with the flatfish lures when going on vacation in Ebro River in Spain. The catfish was 97.85 kilograms weight.  日前她在西班牙巴塞罗纳附近的埃布罗河度假时，用大比目鱼鱼饵，逮到一条体重达97.85公斤的淡水鲶鱼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7514','attic','''ætɪk','''ætɪk','[n] 阁楼','a small attic room  一间小阁楼'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7515','sundial','''sʌn''daɪəl','''sʌndaɪəl','[n] 日昝仪, 日规',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7516','butte','bjut','bjuːt','[n] 孤立的丘',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7517','lightly','''laɪtli','''laɪtlɪ','[adv] 轻轻地, 轻松地','I knocked lightly on the door.  我轻轻地敲了敲门。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7518','uneducated','ʌn''ɛdʒuketɪd','ʌn''edjʊkeɪtɪd','[adj] 没受教育的；文盲的','a largely uneducated workforce  大部分人都没受过教育的劳动力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7519','securely','sɪ''kjʊrli','sɪ''kjʊəlɪ','[adv] 安全地；无疑地','Customers can now buy products securely over the Internet.  如今顾客可以安全放心地在网上购物了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7520','uncorrupt','''ʌnkə''rʌpt','''ʌnkə''rʌpt','[adv] 不腐败的;廉洁的','We filmed there this summer, and it is deeply touching to see that Collins not only ran a rare, uncorrupt and democratic camp, but had put up a schoolhouse, a library and a meeting hall.  今年夏天我们在那里拍摄时，激动地发现，科林斯不仅管理着一个少见的、廉洁民主的营地，并且建设了校舍、图书馆和大会堂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7521','landscapist','''lænd,skeipist','''lænd,skeɪpɪst','[n] 风景画家','The third, draw the art history in the scenery up, the different landscapist has different beauty appreciation.  第三，在风景画艺术史上，不同的风景画家有着不同的审美取向。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7522','scenery','''sinəri','''siːn(ə)rɪ','[n] 风景, 景色','The best part of the trip was the fantastic scenery.  此次旅行最精彩之处就是那美妙绝伦的风景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7523','complimentary',',kɑmplɪ''mɛntri','kɒmplɪ''ment(ə)rɪ','[adj] 称赞的；免费的','There was a complimentary bottle of champagne in the hotel room.  酒店客房里有一瓶免费赠送的香槟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7524','incorporation','ɪn,kɔrpə''reʃən','ɪn,kɔːpə''reɪʃən','[n] 合并；组建公司',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7525','sobriquet','''sobrɪkɛi','''səʊbrɪkeɪ','[n] 假名, 绰号','From his staff he earned the sobriquet "Mumbles."  他的员工们给了他“嘟囔”的绰号。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7526','socialize','''soʃəlaɪz','ˈsəʊʃəlaɪz','[v] 使社会化, 使社会主义化','...an open meeting, where members socialized and welcomed any new members.  …让会员们相互交流、欢迎所有新成员的一次公开集会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7527','rename',',ri''nem','riː''neɪm','[v] 重新命名, 改名','Tel Aviv''s Kings Square was renamed Yitzhak Rabin Square.  特拉维夫的国王广场更名为伊扎克·拉宾广场。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7528','awaken','ə''wekən','ə''weɪk(ə)n','[v] 唤醒, 醒来','She was awakened by a noise at two in the morning.  凌晨两点，她被一个声音吵醒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7529','afflict','ə''flɪkt','ə''flɪkt','[v] 使痛苦, 折磨',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7530','governance','''gʌvɚnəns','''gʌv(ə)nəns','[n] 统治, 管理','...he will meet with officials from several countries to discuss ways to promote good governance.  ...他将与诸国官员会面，讨论如何促进对国家的良性管理。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7531','methodically','məˈθɑːdɪkli','məˈθɒdɪkli','[adv] 有条不紊地, 有方法地','As I methodically explained why each clue revealed too much, my husband dutifully crossed out the words.  我有条不紊地解释为什么每个线索都透露得太多，我丈夫就尽职地划去一些词。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7532','feverishly','','','[adv] 兴奋地, 发热地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7533','personnel',',pɝsə''nɛl','pɜːsə''nel','[n] 人员, 职员','All personnel are to receive security badges.  所有人员都将拿到安保徽章。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7534','antifungal',',ænti''fʌŋɡəl; ,æntaɪfʌŋɡəl',',æntɪ''fʌŋɡəl','[adj] 抗真菌的, 杀真菌的','It’s treated with nonprescription antifungal creams.  可通过涂抹非处方的抗真菌乳膏进行治疗。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7535','senior','''sinɪɚ','''siːnɪə; ''siːnjə','[adj] 年长的, 资格较老的','the senior Democrat on the House committee  众议院委员会中的资深民主党人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7536','flashy','''flæʃi','''flæʃɪ','[adj] 浮华的','a flashy dresser  穿着奢华招眼的人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7537','dimly','''dɪmli','''dimli','[adv] 微暗, 朦胧','Ecological sciences were only dimly understood in the late 19th century.  19世纪末，人们对生态科学只有朦胧的认识。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7538','earthward','''ɝθwɚd','''ɜːθwəd','[adv] 向地球, 向地面',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7539','justice','''dʒʌstɪs','''dʒʌstɪs','[n] 正义, 公平','Children have a strong sense of justice.  儿童有很强的正义感。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7540','overwhelmingly',',ovɚ''hwɛlmɪŋli',',ovə''hwelmiŋli','[adv] 压倒性地, 不可抵抗地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7541','assembly','ə''sɛmbli','ə''semblɪ','[n] 集会，集合;组装','Police have imposed conditions on public assemblies.  警方给公共集会设置了条件。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7542','stressful','''strɛsfl','''stresfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 紧张的, 压力重的','Moving to a new house is a very stressful experience.  搬新家是件很劳心的事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7543','exertion','ɪɡ''zɝʃən','ɪɡ''zɜːʃn','[n] 努力, 发挥,运用','the exertion of authority  行使权力'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7544','deformity','dɪ''fɔrməti','dɪ''fɔːmɪtɪ','[n] 残缺, 畸形','a hip deformity  臀部畸形'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7545','disruptive','dɪs''rʌptɪv','dɪs''rʌptɪv','[adj] 使破裂的, 分裂性的','Mike’s parents thought I was a disruptive influence (= a person who causes disruption ) .  迈克的父母认为我是个捣蛋分子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7546','girder','''ɡədɚ','''gɜːdə','[n] 梁','Listen, when you start to feel weak, just tell yourself, ‘I’m as strong as a girder’ .  听着，当你开始觉得虚弱的时候，就对自己说：‘我像 钢梁 一样强壮’。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7547','bustle','''bʌsl','''bʌs(ə)l','[v] 匆匆忙忙','My mother bustled around the kitchen.  我母亲在厨房里忙得团团转。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7548','unforeseen',',ʌnfɔr''sin','ʌnfɔː''siːn','[adj] 无法预料的','Radiation may damage cells in a way that was previously unforeseen.  辐射也许会以以前未预见的方式损坏细胞。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7549','conversational',',kɑnvɚ''seʃənl','kɒnvə''seɪʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 会话的, 对话的','The article was written in straight-forward, almost conversational language.  这篇文章用简单易懂、几乎是谈话式的语言写成。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7550','governor','''ɡʌvɚnɚ','''gʌv(ə)nə','[n] 统治者, 管理者','the prison governor  监狱长'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7551','abbreviate','ə''brivɪ''et','ə''briːvɪeɪt','[v] 缩写, 简化','And, furthermore, he started to abbreviate.  此外，他开始使用缩写词。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7552','restrain','rɪ''stren','rɪ''streɪn','[v] 抑制, 制止','Renwick restrained a feeling of annoyance.  伦威克忍住了不悦的情绪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7553','broadcaster','''brɔdkæstɚ','''brɔːd,kɑːstə','[n] 播送设备, 广播员','a well-known broadcaster  一位著名的播音员'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7554','adviser','əd''vaɪzɚ','əd''vaɪzə','[n] 顾问,','a financial adviser  财务顾问'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7555','clarification',',klærəfə''keʃən',',klærɪfɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 澄清, 净化','There have been a number of official changes and clarifications.  官方有过数次修改和说明。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7556','awful','''ɔfl','''ɔːfʊl','[adj] 可怕的, 威严的,','The weather was awful.  天气很糟糕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7557','speechwriter','','','[n] 演讲稿撰写人','And if you came up with more than one, you’re probably either a former presidential speechwriter or a historian.  如果你能说出不止一个，你很可能是一位前总统演讲撰稿人或者历史学家。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7558','televisual',',tɛlɪ''vɪʒʊəl','telɪ''vɪʒjʊəl; -zj-','[adj] 电视的','a major televisual event like the Olympics  奥运会等进行电视转播的大型活动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7559','electrify','ɪ''lɛktrə''fai','ɪ''lektrɪfaɪ','[v] 使充电, 使通电','The west coast main line has been electrified.  西海岸铁路干线已经电气化了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7560','legislative','''lɛdʒɪsletɪv','''ledʒɪslətɪv','[adj] 立法的, 立法机关的','The new assemblies will have no legislative power.  新的议会将没有立法权。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7561','melodic','mə''lɑdɪk','mɪ''lɒdɪk','[adj] 有旋律的,调子美妙的','Their music is loud and not very melodic.  他们的音乐很响，而且不大悦耳。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7562','predictably','pri''diktəbli','pri''diktəbli','[adv] 可预言地, 不出所料地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7563','climatically','','','[adv] 气候上, 风土上','The city of Madrid soon plans to add a striking new structure that will “climatically transform” its urban architecture.  马德里市区计划修建一座醒目的建筑，此建筑还将在气候上改变城市的建筑格局。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7564','lethargic','','lɪ''θɑːdʒɪk','[adj] 昏睡的','The cat became lethargic and had trouble breathing.  这只猫整天昏睡而且呼吸困难。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7565','chicken','ˈtʃɪkən','''tʃɪkɪn','[n] 小鸡','roast chicken  烤鸡'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7566','compute','kəm''pjʊt','kəm''pjuːt','[v] 计算, 估计','Final results had not yet been computed.  最终的结果还未计算出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7567','pathology','pə''θɑlədʒi','pə''θɒlədʒɪ','[n] 病理学','One person may show lots of pathology in their brain while another shows very little, yet both may have had dementia.  即使两人都患有痴呆症，但一人的大脑可能在病理现象中呈现较多，而另一个人可能较少。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7568','offend','ə''fɛnd','ə''fend','[v] 犯罪, 冒犯','His remarks deeply offended many Scottish people.  他的话严重冒犯了许多苏格兰人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7569','disk','dɪsk','dɪsk','[n] 磁盘,圆盘','The program takes up 2.5 megabytes of disk space and can be run on a standard personal computer.  这个程序占用2.5 兆字节的磁盘空间，可以在标准个人电脑上运行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7570','helper','''hɛlpɚ','''helpə(r)','[n] 帮忙者, 助手','I was a classroom helper at the local primary school.  我是当地小学的课室助理。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7571','triangular','traɪ''æŋgjəlɚ','traɪ''æŋgjʊlə','[adj] 三角形的, 三人间的','a triangular sporting competition  一项由三方参加的体育比赛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7572','counsel','''kaʊnsl','''kaʊns(ə)l','[n] 律师 vt劝告，提议','He had always been able to count on her wise counsel.  他总是能够指望她明智的忠告。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7573','programme','proɡrəm','''prəʊgræm','[n] 程序, 编程','Stanford University’s MBA program  斯坦福大学的工商管理硕士课程'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7574','curvature','''kɝvətʃɚ','''kɜːvətʃə','[n] 弯曲, 曲率','Matter, energy and dark energy all produce curvature in space-time, however.  而事实上，物质、能量和暗能量在时空中都会产生弯曲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7575','endpoint','''ɛnd,pɔɪnt','''end,pɒɪnt','[n] 端点','But is there an endpoint?  但是这是否有一个终点？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7576','vocational','vo''keʃənl','və(ʊ)''keɪʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 职业的，业务的','vocational qualifications  职业资格'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7577','datebase','','','[n] 数据库, 资料库',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7578','compulsory','kəm''pʌlsəri','kəm''pʌls(ə)rɪ','[adj] 强制的,  义务的','the threat of compulsory redundancies  强制性裁员的威胁'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7579','shyness','''ʃainis','''ʃaɪnɪs','[n] 羞怯, 胆怯','I endured the shyness and the pain of jealousness.  我既忍受着羞怯，又忍受着嫉妒的折磨；'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7580','lethargy','''lɛθɚdʒi','''leθədʒɪ','[n] 无生气',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7581','hostility','hɑ''stɪləti','hɒ''stɪlɪtɪ','[n] 敌意, 不友善','The last decade has witnessed a serious rise in the levels of racism and hostility to black and ethnic groups.  过去的10年里，种族主义及对黑人和少数民族的敌意变得更加严重了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7582','credential','krə''dɛnʃl','krɪ''denʃ(ə)l','[n] 外交使节所递的国书, 信任状',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7583','disorientation','','','[n] 迷失方向, 迷惑','She was assigned a job to help Jews by talking to them and helping them cope with shock and disorientation at the train station.  工作的内容是用来帮助犹太人与他们谈话，并帮助他们应付犹太人的冲突和犹太人在火车站迷失方向事情。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7584','additionally','ə''dɪʃənli','ə''dɪʃənəlɪ','[adv] 另外, 同时','All teachers are qualified to teach their native language. Additionally, we select our teachers for their engaging personalities.  所有教师都具备教授其母语的资格。另外，我们还根据富有魅力的个性来选择我们的教师。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7585','uninterrupted',',ʌn,ɪntə''rʌptɪd',',ʌnɪntə''rʌptɪd','[adj] 不停的, 连续的','uninterrupted sleep  不间断的睡眠'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7586','bureaucratization','','','[n] 官化','At the same time, government experienced the rise of bureaucratization and the administrative state.  同时，政府经历了官僚化和行政州的风险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7587','excursion','ɪk''skɝʒn','ɪk''skɜːʃ(ə)n; ek-','[n] 远足，短途旅行','a shopping excursion  购物游'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7588','dissension','dɪ''sɛnʃən','dɪ''senʃ(ə)n','[n] 意见不同, 纠纷','The Labour Party was torn by internal dissensions .  工党因内部纷争产生分裂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7589','embryonic',',ɛmbrɪ''ɑnɪk',',embrɪ''ɒnɪk','[adj] 胚胎的，萌芽期的','The plans are still only in embryonic form.  计划还只是在酝酿之中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7590','breakup','''brek''ʌp','''breɪkʌp','[n] 破裂, 崩溃','the breakup of her marriage  她婚姻的破裂'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7591','necklace','''nɛkləs','''neklɪs','[n] 项链','...a diamond necklace and matching earrings.  …一条钻石项链和与之相配的耳环。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7592','bylaw','''baɪ,lɔ','''baɪlɔː','[n] 附则, 法规','Under the company''s bylaws, he can continue as chairman until the age of 70.  按照公司的规章，他能继续担任主席职位到70岁。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7593','republish','ri''pʌblɪʃ','riː''pʌblɪʃ','[v] 再版, 重新发表','If you wish to switch the query mode for a package, you must republish the package with the desired setting.  如果您希望切换一个程序包的查询模式，必须使用要求的设置重新发布程序包。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7594','publicly','''pʌblikli','''pʌblɪklɪ','[adv] 公然地, 舆论上','publicly elected bodies  由公众选举产生的机构'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7595','distantly','''distəntli','','[adj] 疏远的, 遥远的','What these pictures demonstrate is that we do feel the pain of others, however distantly.  这些照片证实了 无论距离的远近 我们都可以感受到他人的痛楚。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7596','oily','''ɔɪli','''ɒɪlɪ','[adj] 油的, 油滑的','He wiped his hands on an oily rag.  他在一块油腻的抹布上擦了擦手。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7597','assault','ə''sɔlt','ə''sɔːlt; ə''sɒlt','[n&v] 攻击, 袭击','The refugee camp came under assault again last night.  昨晚难民营再次遭袭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7598','fierce','fɪrs','fɪəs','[adj] 凶猛的, 猛烈的','fierce fighting in the city  城里的激烈战斗'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7599','categorize','''kætəgə''raɪz','''kætəɡəraɪz','[v] 加以类别, 分类','Lindsay, like his films, is hard to categorize.  就像他演的电影难于归类一样，很难说林赛属于哪一类演员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7600','severity','sə''vɛrəti','sɪ''verɪtɪ','[n] 严肃, 严格',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7601','definitively','','','[adv] 决定性地, 最后地','What we need is a means to objectively evaluate code quality, something that can tell us, definitively, that the code we''re looking at is risky.  我们需要的是客观评估代码质量的方法，某种可以决定性地告诉我们正在查看的代码是否存在风险的东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7602','lineage','''lɪnɪɪdʒ','''lɪnɪɪdʒ','[n] 血统, 世系','a family of ancient lineage  古老世家'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7603','slam','slæm','slæm','[v] 砰地关上(放下)','We heard a car door slam.  我们听到有车门砰的一声关上了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7604','flaming','''flemɪŋ','''fleɪmɪŋ','[adj] 熊熊燃烧的；热情的','Residents panicked as flaming petrol poured down the street.  燃烧的汽油沿街流淌，居民惊慌失措。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7605','pique','pik','piːk','[n] 生气, 愤怒','He stormed out in a fit of pique .  他气呼呼地冲了出去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7606','internet','''ɪntɚnɛt','''ɪntənet','[n] 国际互联网，因特网',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7607','newscast','''njʊzkæst','''njuːzkɑːst','[n] <美>新闻广播','Radio and television anchors usually appear on more than one newscast per day.  广播电视的主播通常要在每天的新闻节目中多次出现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7608','fateful','''fetfl','''feɪtfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 重大的；不幸的','It was a fateful decision, one which was to break the Government.  那是一项重大的决定，一个将使政府垮台的决定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7609','antipathy','æn''tɪpəθi','æn''tɪpəθɪ','[n] 憎恶, 反感','...the voting public''s antipathy toward the president.  …投票民众对总统的憎恶。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7610','hurtle','''hɝtl','''hɜːt(ə)l','[v] 急飞','All of a sudden, a car came hurtling round the corner.  突然，一辆汽车从拐角处冲了出来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7611','glisten','''ɡlɪsn','''glɪs(ə)n','[v] 闪光','glistening black hair  乌黑发亮的头发'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7612','predate','pri''det','priː''deɪt','[v] 提早日期, 居先','His troubles predated the recession.  他的麻烦早在经济衰退前就出现了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7613','Finnish','''finiʃ','''finiʃ','[adj] 芬兰的','He plans to play with a Finnish team, the Loimaa Bisons, for a week in September.  他计划在九月份为芬兰的落马亚野牛队打一个星期的比赛。'),
