('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7615','empathy','''ɛmpəθi','''empəθɪ','[n] 移情作用, 共鸣',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7616','hardwood','''hɑrdwʊd','''hɑːdwʊd','[n] 硬木, 阔叶树','...hardwood floors.  ...硬木地板。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7617','sash','sæʃ','sæʃ','[n] 腰带，肩带','She wore a white dress with a thin blue sash.  她穿着一条白连衣裙，系着一根蓝色的细腰带。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7618','prohibit','prə''hɪbɪt','prə(ʊ)''hɪbɪt','[v] 禁止, 阻止','Smoking is strictly prohibited inside the factory.  厂区严禁吸烟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7619','foment','','fə(ʊ)''ment','[v] [医]热敷',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7620','gesture','''dʒɛstʃɚ','''dʒestʃə','[n] 姿态, 手势','Luke made an obscene gesture with his finger.  卢克用手指做了一个下流的手势。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7621','pretentious','prɪ''tɛnʃəs','prɪ''tenʃəs','[adj] 自命不凡的，自负的','a pretentious film  矫饰的电影'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7622','heredity','hə''rɛdəti','hɪ''redɪtɪ','[n] 遗传, 形质遗传','Heredity is not a factor in causing the cancer.  遗传并非导致这种癌症的一个因素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7623','yean','ji:n','jiːn','[v] 生产, 生育',''),
