('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7848','expressionless','ik''spreʃənlis','ɪk''spreʃ(ə)nlɪs','[adj] 无表情的','a blank expressionless stare  面无表情的注视'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7849','clumsy','''klʌmzi','''klʌmzɪ','[adj] 笨拙的','A clumsy waiter spilled wine all over her new skirt.  一名笨手笨脚的服务员把葡萄酒洒得她新裙子上到处都是。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7850','foghorn','''fɔɡhɔrn','''fɒghɔːn','[n] [航海]雾角,尖而响的声音',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7851','majestic','mə''dʒɛstɪk','mə''dʒestɪk','[adj] 雄伟的，壮丽的','This lovely village is surrounded by majestic mountain scenery.  这座美丽的村庄四周山色壮丽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7852','viennese',',viə''ni:z',',viə''ni:z','[n&a] 维也纳人（语）(的)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7853','commissioner','kə''mɪʃənɚ','kə''mɪʃ(ə)nə','[n] 委员, 专员','...Alaska''s commissioner of education.  …阿拉斯加州的教育要员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7854','plum','plʌm','plʌm','[n] [植] 李子, 洋李','juicy ripe plums  多汁的成熟李子'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7855','seaman','''simən','''siːmən','[n] 海员, 水手','The men emigrate to work as seamen.  这些男人移居国外当海员。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7856','stilt','stɪlt','stɪlt','[n] 高跷, 支柱','They inhabit reed huts built on stilts above the water.  他们居住在建在水中木桩上的芦苇草屋里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7857','stele','stil','stiːl; ''stiːlɪ','[n] 石碑,  匾额','We do have a victory hymn, a victory hymn that''s inscribed on a stele that''s a slab of stone--which was erected in the year 1204 BCE.  我们确实有胜利颂歌，刻在石碑上的胜利颂歌,那是一块石板，立于公元前1204年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7858','chronology','krə''nɑlədʒi','krə''nɒlədʒɪ','[n] 年代学, 年表','The book includes a chronology of his life and works.  本书附有他的生平和著作年表。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7859','overt','o''vɝt','əʊ''vɜːt; ''əʊvət','[adj] 明显的, 公然的','an overt attempt to silence their political opponents  他们想压制政敌言论的明显企图'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7860','colorfully','','','[adj] 华美的, 富有色彩的','That''s what he told us again and again in his campaign, not as colorfully as Edwards, but ultimately more convincingly.  那也是他在竞选中一次次告诉大家的，尽管言语没有爱德华说的那么有文采，但最终却更加让人信服。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7861','eminence','''ɛmɪnəns','''emɪnəns','[n] 出众, 显赫','Many of the pilots were to achieve eminence in the aeronautical world.  其中的很多飞行员后来在航空界都取得了显赫的声名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7862','beacon','''bikən','''biːk(ə)n','[n] 信号灯，闪光灯','...a huge office tower with aircraft warning beacons on the roof.  …一个屋顶有航行警告灯的巨型办公塔。'),
