('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7864','prearrange',',priə''rendʒ','priːə''reɪndʒ','[v] 预先安排','When you prearrange your funeral, you can pick your own flowers and music.  当你预先准备自己的葬礼时，你就能够选择自己喜欢的鲜花和音乐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7865','persevere',',pɝsə''vɪr','pɜːsɪ''vɪə','[v] 坚持','It can be tricky at first, but persevere.  一开始会有些棘手，不过要坚持。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7866','softball','''sɔftbɔl','''sɒf(t)bɔːl','[n] 垒球运动, 垒球',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7867','Shakespeare','''ʃekspɪr','ˈʃeɪkspɪə','[n] 莎士比亚(1564-1616,英国剧作家,诗人)','He turned to the study of Shakespeare.  他致力于莎士比亚的研究。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7868','abuse','ə''bjus','ə''bjuːz','[n&v] 滥用, 虐待,辱骂','several cases of child abuse  数宗虐待儿童案'),
