('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7875','austere','ɔ''stɪr','ɒ''stɪə; ɔː-','[adj] 简朴的, 严厉的','the church’s austere simplicity  那座教堂的朴实无华'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7876','nationwide',',neʃn''waɪd','''neɪʃ(ə)nwaɪd; -''waɪd','[adj] 全国性的','a nationwide search for a missing British tourist  在全国范围内对一名失踪英国游客的搜寻'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7877','astrological',',æstrə''lɔdʒik,-kəl',',æstrə''lɔdʒik,-kəl','[adj] 占星的, 占星术的','So, the problem with astrological predictions is not that they''re wrong.  占星预测的问题并不在于它们是错误的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7878','mirage','mə''rɑʒ','''mɪrɑːʒ; mɪ''rɑːʒ','[n] 海市蜃楼,幻想','Perhaps we are just chasing a mirage.  也许我们只是在追逐一个梦。'),
