('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7888','cathedral','kə''θidrəl','kə''θiːdr(ə)l','[n] 大教堂','St Paul’s Cathedral  圣保罗大教堂'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7889','ignition','ɪɡ''nɪʃən','ɪg''nɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 点火, 点燃','The device automatically disconnects the ignition.  那个装置自动断开了点火器。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7890','midwestern','ˌmɪd''wɛstən','','[adj] 美国中西部的','...the Midwestern plains.  ...这些中西部的平原。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7891','interject',',ɪntɚ''dʒɛkt',',ɪntə''dʒekt','[v] 插嘴, 突然插入','‘That’s absolute rubbish!’ he interjected.  “那全是废话！”他突然插话道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7892','lightness','''laɪtnɪs','''laitnis','[n] 轻盈, 灵活',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7893','idyllic','aɪ''dɪlɪk','ɪ''dɪlɪk','[adj] 田园短诗的, 牧歌的','It was an attractive hope that the high technology of our society might be wrested from the grip of benighted forces and used to restore us to an idyllic natural state.  人类社会的高科技可能将我们自愚昧势力的控制之中拯救出来，并重建一个田园诗般的自然状态，这曾是一个有吸引力的愿景。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7894','resonance','''rɛznəns','''rez(ə)nəns','[n] 共鸣,  反响','a tradition that has little resonance in the 21st century  在21世纪难以引起共鸣的传统'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7895','allegory','''æləɡɔri','''ælɪg(ə)rɪ','[n] 寓言','The poem''s comic allegory was transparent.  这首诗歌的喜剧性讽寓很明显。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7896','rainbow','''renbo','''reɪnbəʊ','[n] 彩虹','...silk and satin in every shade of the rainbow.  …如彩虹般五颜六色的丝绸与锦缎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7897','pretense','''pritɛns','pri''tens, ''pri:t-','[n] 借口,伪装，自吹','Using as little pretense as possible (ideally none), ask the person if he or she would like to get together for a cup of coffee or do something similarly casual.  在问对方是否愿意出来喝杯咖啡或做一些其他类似的事情的时候，尽量不要用虚伪的借口（理想中应该是一点虚假也没有）。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7898','gratuitous','ɡrə''tuɪtəs','grə''tjuːɪtəs','[adj] 无缘无故的；免费的','children’s books which include gratuitous violence  包含无谓暴力内容的儿童书籍'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7899','liveliness','''laɪvlɪnɪs','''laɪvlɪnɪs','[n] 活泼','We need to consolidate and develop the current political situation of democracy, solidarity, liveliness, stability and harmony.  我们要巩固和发展民主团结、生动活泼、安定和谐的政治局面。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7900','stench','stɛntʃ','sten(t)ʃ','[n] 恶臭, 臭气','the stench of urine  尿臭味'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7901','slime','slaɪm','slaɪm','[n] 粘土, 粘液','He swam down and retrieved his glasses from the muck and slime at the bottom of the pond.  他潜下水去，从池塘底部的烂泥污物中找回了眼镜。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7902','tern','tɝn','tɜːn','[n] 三个一组, [鸟]燕鸥','The tiny arctic tern makes the longest migration of any animal in the world, flying about two times farther than previously thought, a new study says.  一项新的研究表明，小小的北极燕鸥竟创下了动物世界的飞行记录，“旅途”长度是此前相关数据的二倍。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7903','starlike','''stɑr,laɪk','''stɑːlaɪk','[adj] 星形的, 星般闪烁的','In chapter three, we get the upper bounds and some properties of the second order item of homogeneous expansion for E starlike mappings as well as some order items for one special E starlike mappings.  第三章在单位超球上给出了E 星形映照族齐次展开式的二次项和一类特殊的E 星形映照齐次展开式相关项的上界估计，并将其结果应用到单位球上的凸映照和 星形映照，得出相应的结论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7904','slimy','''slaɪmi','''slaɪmɪ','[adj] 黏滑的, 卑劣的','slimy mud  黏糊糊的泥巴'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7905','germ','dʒɝm','dʒɜːm','[n] 微生物, 细菌','Put disinfectant down the toilet to kill any germs.  在抽水马桶里投放消毒剂杀菌。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7906','storeroom','''stɔrum','''stɔːruːm; -rʊm','[n] 储藏室, 库房','...a storeroom filled with massive old furniture covered with dust.  ...一间堆满了尘封的大件旧家具的贮藏室。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7907','Oakland','''əuklənd','''əuklənd','[n] 奥克兰(美国加利福尼亚州西部城市)','I thought this building should be physically and symbolically connected with the city as a powerful social and cultural resource for Oakland.  我认为，这座建筑应该作为奥克兰一个强大的社会与文化资源，在外形和寓意上都与这座城市彼此相联。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7908','allude','ə''lʊd','ə''l(j)uːd','[v] 暗指，提及','With friends, she sometimes alluded to a feeling that she herself was to blame for her son''s predicament.  和朋友们一起时，她有时暗示她感到儿子的困境要怪她自己。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7909','sunburst','''sʌnbɝst','''sʌnbɜːst','[n] 从云隙射下的阳光','A pyramid built by the mysterious Maya looms against sunburst clouds in Chichén Itzá, a postclassic site of the lost civilization on the Yucatán Peninsula.  尤卡坦半岛失去的文明古遗址奇琴伊察，一座由神秘玛雅人建造的金字塔隐现在破云而出的阳光下。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7910','lordly','''lɔrdli','''lɔːdlɪ','[adj] 高贵的；高傲的','a lordly disdain for the common man  对平民百姓的轻慢'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7911','ditch','dɪtʃ','dɪtʃ','[n] 沟,  壕沟','Both vehicles ended up in a ditch.  两辆车都掉进了沟里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7912','rebellious','rɪ''bɛljəs','rɪ''beljəs','[adj] 反抗的，难控制的','rebellious teenagers  叛逆的青少年'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7913','disciple','dɪ''saɪpl','dɪ''saɪp(ə)l','[n] 信徒, 弟子','...a major intellectual figure with disciples throughout Europe.  …一位信徒遍布欧洲的重要知识分子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7914','arctic','''ɑrktɪk','''ɑːktɪk','[adj] 北极的 n北极(圈)','The bathroom, with its spartan pre-war facilities, is positively arctic.  这个有简陋战前设施的浴室实在冷极了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7915','tadpole','''tæd''pol','''tædpəʊl','[n] [动]蝌蚪','The tadpole has become a frog.  这个蝌蚪已长成青蛙。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7916','propensity','prə''pɛnsəti','prə''pensɪtɪ','[n] 倾向','Mr. Bint has a propensity to put off decisions to the last minute.  宾特先生有一种将决定拖到最后一分钟的倾向。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7917','wildflower','''waild,flauə','''waɪld,flaʊə','[n] 野花','And yes,if I see the blue flowers again,you can bet I''ll stop and transplant them to my wildflower garden.  是的，如果我再次看到那些蓝色的花儿，你可以相信，我会停下来把它们移值到我的野花花园里。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7918','stifle','''staɪfl','''staɪf(ə)l','[v] 窒息, 抑制','rules and regulations that stifle innovation  压制创新的规章制度'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7919','whip','wɪp','wɪp','[n] 鞭子 v鞭打','The coachman cracked his whip and the carriage lurched forward.  马车夫甩了一记响鞭，马车猛然向前冲去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7920','debut','de''bju','''deɪbjuː; -buː','[n] 首次演出，初次露面','She made her debut in a 1937 production of "Hamlet."  她在1937年《哈姆雷特》的演出中首次登台。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7921','sufficiency','sə''fɪʃnsi','sə''fɪʃ(ə)nsɪ','[n] 充足；充裕','The war has affected the country’s economic sufficiency.  战争已经影响到了这个国家的经济富足。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7922','rebel','rɪ''bɛl','''reb(ə)l','[n] 反叛分子; [v] 反叛；反对','Anti-government rebels attacked the town.  反政府的叛乱分子攻击该镇。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7923','foray','''fɔre','''fɒreɪ','[v&n] 突袭，偷袭','These base camps were used by the PKK guerrillas to make forays into Turkey.  这些基地营被库尔德工人党游击队用来对土耳其进行突袭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7924','pupil','pjupl','''pjuːpɪl; -p(ə)l','[n] 小学生','About 20 pupils study music here.  大约20名小学生在这里学习音乐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7925','lacquer','''lækɚ','''lækə','[n] 漆, 漆器','We put on the second coating of lacquer.  我们刷了第二层漆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7926','gobi','','','[n] 戈壁',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7927','maiden','''medn','''meɪd(ə)n','[n] 少女, 处女','...stories of noble princes and their brave deeds on behalf of beautiful maidens.  …高贵的王子以及他们英雄救美的故事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7928','academically',',ækə''dɛmɪkəli',',ækə''demɪkəlɪ','[adv] 学业上','Challenge yourself academically, but give yourself plenty of time for fun as well.  学业上要努力，但也要给自己充足的娱乐时间。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7929','vaccinate','''væksə''net','''væksɪneɪt','[v] 接种疫苗，给…打防疫针','Dogs must be vaccinated against distemper.  犬类必须接种疫苗以防犬热病。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7930','summarization','','','[n] 摘要, 概要','The pipeline processes documents before they are indexed in the full-text index, and it provides automated summarization, document format conversion, and categorization services (See Figure 1).  在全文索引中建立文档的索引之前，管道将对文档进行处理，并且提供了自动化的摘要、文档格式转换和分类服务（请参见图 1）。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7931','flu','flu','fluː','[n] 流感','Steven’s still in bed with flu .  史蒂文患了流感，仍卧病在床。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7932','haphazardly','','','[adv] 不规则地, 随意地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7933','geometrically','','','[adv] 成几何级数(图形)地','So, geometrically, my function can be represented by this graph, and I fix some point, .  从几何上看，函数可以用这个图像表示，固定某个点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7934','solidly','''sɑlɪdli','''sɔlidli','[adv] 坚硬地, 稳固地','A man who sat himself solidly in an arm-chair, and looked into the fire, so--A shower of ideas fell perpetually from some very high Heaven down through his mind.  这个人稳稳地坐在扶手椅里，凝视着炉火，就这样——一阵骤雨似的念头源源不断地从某个非常高的天国倾泻而下，进入他的头脑。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7935','timid','''tɪmɪd','''tɪmɪd','[adj] 胆小的, 羞怯的','I was a timid child.  我曾是个胆小的孩子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7936','embroider','ɪm''brɔɪdɚ','ɪm''brɒɪdə; em-','[v] 刺绣，修饰','a richly embroidered jacket  刺绣华美的夹克衫'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7937','drugstore','''drʌɡstɔr','''drʌgstɔː','[n] 药房, 杂货店',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7938','speckle','''spɛkl','''spek(ə)l','[n] 小斑点  vt点缀',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7939','gentlemanly','','''dʒent(ə)lmənlɪ','[adj] 绅士派头的','He was respected by all who knew him for his kind and gentlemanly consideration.  他为人谦和而且有绅士风度，认识他的人都很尊重他。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7940','gamble','''ɡæmbl','''gæmb(ə)l','[v& n] (打)赌；投机，冒险','Their religion forbids them to drink or gamble.  他们的宗教禁止饮酒和赌博。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7941','override',',ovɚ''raɪd','əʊvə''raɪd','[v] 不顾，否决','The EU commission exercised its power to override British policy.  欧盟委员会行使其权力来否决英国的政策。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7942','citadel','ˈsɪtədəl','''sɪtəd(ə)l; -del','[n] 根据地, 大本营',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7943','fresher','''frɛʃɚ','','[n] 大学一年级新生, 新鲜人',''),
