('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7959','Calvinist','''kælvinist','','[n] 加尔文教徒(见Calvin)','Calvinist Christianity has a culture of phenomenal industry.  基督教加尔文主义拥有瞩目的产业文化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7960','sociability',',soʃə''bɪləti',',səʊʃə''bɪlɪtɪ','[n] 好交际,善于交际',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7961','frivolity','fri''vəliti','frɪ''vɒlɪtɪ','[n] 轻薄,轻浮','I don’t think such frivolity helps the organization’s public image.  我认为这种愚蠢的行为无益于这个组织的公众形象。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7962','womanhood','''wʊmən''hʊd','''wʊmənhʊd','[n] 女人,女人气质','Pregnancy is a natural part of womanhood.  怀孕是女子成年期的一个自然部分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7963','stern','stɝn','stɜːn','[adj] 严厉的; [n] 船尾','sterner penalties for drug offences  对毒品犯罪的更为严厉的惩罚'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7964','patriarchal',',petrɪ''ɑrkl','peɪtrɪ''ɑːk(ə)l','[adj] 家长的, 族长的','To feminists she is a classic victim of the patriarchal society.  在女权主义者眼中，她是父权社会的典型受害者。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7965','disinterest','dɪs''ɪntrəst','dɪs''ɪnt(ə)rɪst','[n] 无兴趣, 不关心','The fact that Liberia has no oil seems to explain foreign disinterest in its internal affairs.  利比里亚没有石油的事实似乎可以解释外国对该国内政漠不关心的原因。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_7966','grip','ɡrɪp','grɪp','[v] 握紧，抓牢','I gripped the rail and tried not to look down.  我紧紧抓住栏杆，尽量不往下看。'),
