('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8362','chimp','tʃɪmp','tʃɪmp','[n] (非洲)黑猩猩','At one point, she even yells for the police to shoot the chimp to stop the attack.  有一次，她甚至大叫着让警察向黑猩猩射击，以便阻止他的攻击。'),
