('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8374','metamorphic','''mɛtə''mɔrfɪk','metə''mɔːfɪk','[adj] 变质的,变性的','This metamorphic rock has been compressed for millions of years.  这种变质岩已经过数百万年的压缩。'),
