('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8389','intrusion','ɪn''truʒn','ɪn''truːʒ(ə)n','[n] 闯入, 侵扰','the unwelcome intrusion of the press  不受欢迎的新闻界的侵扰'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8390','pinch','pɪntʃ','pɪn(t)ʃ','[n] 捏, 撮 v夹痛,节省','She gave him a playful pinch.  她开玩笑地捏了他一把。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8391','inactivate','ɪn''æktə,vet','ɪn''æktɪveɪt','[v] 使不活泼, 阻止活动',''),
