('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8393','pollination','ˌpɑləˈneʃən','ˌpɒləˈneɪʃn','[n] 授粉','The new research provides early evidence that climate change may be playing a role in driving down pollination.  这项新的研究提供了初步证据，气候变化可能是促使授粉减少的一个因素。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8394','recognizable',',rɛkəɡ''naɪzəbl','''rekəɡnaizəbl, ,rekəɡ''nai-','[adj] 可辨认的,可认识的','The vault was opened and the body found to be well preserved, his features easily recognizable.  地窖被打开了, 尸体被发现保存完好, 他的面容很容易辨认。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8395','unwillingly','','','[adv] 不情愿地,勉强地','Even when I call, he receives unwillingly.  即使我登门拜访， 他也是很不情愿地接待我。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8396','impartially','','','[adv] 公平地,无私地','If she gets the nod, Kagan says she will consider every case impartially and with commitment to principle.  Kagan 说如果她能通过，她将公平地处理每个案子并忠于原则办事。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8397','dose','dos','dəʊs','[n] 剂量, (一)剂 v(给)服药','One dose of penicillin can wipe out the infection.  一剂青霉素即可消除感染。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8398','retrain','','','[v] 重新教育, 再教育','One solution is to retrain the long-term unemployed.  一个解决办法是对长期失业的人进行再培训。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8399','irrationally','','','[adv] 无理性地,不合理地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8400','boon','bʊn','buːn','[n] 恩惠, 福利','It is for this reason that television proves such a boon to so many people.  正是这个原因电视机成为这么多人的一大福音。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8401','democracy','dɪˈmɑkrəsi','dɪ''mɒkrəsɪ','[n] 民主政治, 民主主义','a return to democracy after 16 years of military rule  16年军人统治后民主制度的恢复'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8402','unavoidably','','','[adv] 不可避免地,不得已地','The conflict of the class interests results in the pitiless class-struggle that unavoidably leads to the victory of the most numerous and most wronged class, the proletariat.  阶级利益的冲突导致了无情的阶级斗争，从而不可避免地导致了最广大的、最受虐待的阶级，即无产阶级的胜利。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8403','layman','''lemən','''leɪmən','[n] 外行','To the layman (= laymen in general ) all these plants look pretty similar.  对外行的人来说，这些植物看起来都很相似。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8404','racetrack','''restræk','','[n] (主要用于赛马, 赛狗的)跑道','...the Breeders'' Cup, run Oct. 26 at Arlington racetrack near Chicago.  …育马者杯比赛，于10月26日在芝加哥附近的阿灵顿赛马场举行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8405','inoffensive',',ɪnə''fɛnsɪv','ɪnə''fensɪv','[adj] 不触犯人的,无害的','Her husband was a small, inoffensive-looking man.  她丈夫个子不高，看上去很随和。'),
