('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8441','dash','dæʃ','dæʃ','[n] 冲撞, 破折号 v猛掷, 冲撞','...a 160-mile dash to the hospital.  …飞奔160英里赶向医院。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8442','emboss','ɪm''bɔs','ɪm''bɒs; em-','[v] 饰以浮饰, 使浮雕出来',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8443','yolk','jok','jəʊk','[n] 蛋黄, [生物] 卵黄','Only the yolk contains cholesterol.  只有蛋黄含胆固醇。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8444','embellish','im''beliʃ','ɪm''belɪʃ; em-','[v] 修饰','The boat was embellished with carvings in red and blue.  这艘船饰有红、蓝雕刻。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8445','learner','''lɝnɚ','''lɜːnə','[n] 学习者, 初学者','the needs of slow learners   学习迟缓者的需要'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8446','theft','θɛft','θeft','[n] 偷, 行窃','There have been a number of thefts in the area.  该地区发生了几宗偷窃案。'),
