('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8591','strikingly','''straɪkɪŋli','''straikiŋli','[adv] 醒目地, 引人侧目地','one of the most strikingly attractive regions in Britain  英国风景异常美丽的地区之一'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8592','akin','ə''kɪn','ə''kɪn','[adj] 同类的','Something akin to panic overwhelmed him.  一种近似惊恐的感觉使他不知所措。'),
