('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8614','nominate','''nɑmɪnet','''nɒmɪneɪt','[v] 提名, 推荐','This week one of them will be nominated by the Democratic Party for the presidency of the United States.  本周他们中的一人将被民主党提名为美国总统职位的候选人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8615','frenetic','frə''nɛtɪk','frə''netɪk','[adj] 发狂的, 狂热的','She rushes from job to job at a frenetic pace.  她发疯似的不停地跳槽。'),
