('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8619','irreverence','ɪ''rɛvərəns','ɪ''rev(ə)r(ə)ns','[adj] 不尊敬的','He added humor, irreverence, and a strong speaking style that captivated the audience.  他的幽默、不恭以及强烈的说话风格吸引了所有的听众。'),
