('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8641','miracle','''mɪrəkl','''mɪrək(ə)l','[n] 奇迹, 奇事','It’s a miracle you weren’t killed!  你没有死真是奇迹！'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8642','quaint','kwent','kweɪnt','[adj] 离奇有趣的, 奇怪的','a quaint little village in Yorkshire  约克郡一个古色古香的小村庄'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8643','counterclockwise','''kaʊntɚ''klɑk''waɪz','kaʊntə''klɒkwaɪz','[n&a] 反时针方向(的)','However, there is also an eddy of cooler water (purple) circulating counterclockwise at the top of the Loop Current.  不过，在洋流的顶端还出现一个逆时针方向旋转的水流（紫色部分），而且温度较低。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8644','entanglement','ɪn''tæŋɡlmənt','ɪn''tæŋg(ə)lm(ə)nt; en-','[n] 纠缠','...a military and political entanglement the president probably doesn''t want.  …一个总统很可能不想要的军事政治纠葛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8645','diagonally','daɪ''ægənəli','daɪ''æg(ə)nəlɪ; daɪ''ægən(ə)lɪ','[adv] 斜对地,  对角地','Rising diagonally from the ground to the right of Venus is the band of our Milky Way Galaxy.  从地面斜对角向金星的右上方，可以看到我们的银河系的光带。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8646','rustproof','''rʌstpruf','''rʌs(t)pruːf','[adj] 不锈的, 抗锈的','Stainless products are always popular because they’re rustproof.  不锈钢制品因为能防锈，所以很受欢迎。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8647','enclosure','ɪn''kloʒɚ','ɪn''kləʊʒə; en-','[n] 围住, 围栏','the bear enclosure at the zoo  动物园中的熊园'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8648','installation','''ɪnstə''leʃən','ɪnstə''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 安装, 装置','the installation and maintenance of alarm systems  警报系统的安装和维护'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8649','galvanize','''ɡælvənaɪz','''ɡælvənaiz','[v] 通电流于, 电镀',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8650','matrilinear',',mætri''lini:ə',',mætrɪ''lɪniːə','[adj] 母系的','In matrilinear societies the real head of the family is the mother''s brother.  在母系社会中，家庭里真正的头领是妈妈的兄弟。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8651','underworld','''ʌndɚ''wɝld','''ʌndəwɜːld','[n] 黑社会','New York’s criminal underworld  纽约的黑社会'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8652','oval','''ovl','''əʊv(ə)l','[n&a] 卵形(的), 椭圆(的)','Using 2 spoons, form the cheese into small balls or ovals.  用两把勺把干酪挤成小圆球状或椭圆球状。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8653','crimp','krɪmp','krɪmp','[v] 起皱, 卷曲, 抑制','crimped blonde hair  微微卷曲的金发'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8654','serrate','sə''ret','''sereɪt','[adj] 锯齿状的','Trees or shrubs. Leaves petiolate , entire or serrate at margin.  乔木或灌木叶具叶柄，全缘的或有锯齿在边缘。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8655','convivial','kən''vɪvɪəl','kən''vɪvɪəl','[adj] 好交际的, 愉快而随和的','a convivial atmosphere  欢快友好的气氛'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8656','foreshadow','fɔr''ʃædo','fɔː''ʃædəʊ','[v] 预示','The revolution foreshadowed an entirely new social order.  这场革命预示着一种全新的社会秩序将要出现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8657','plaint','plent','pleɪnt','[n] [诗]悲叹, 抱怨','..a forlorn, haunting plaint.  ...一种愁苦的、挥之不去的悲叹。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8658','waterborne','''wɔtəbɔn','''wɔːtəbɔːn','[adv] 水上的,  水运的','Because they measured success only by the number of wells built and the decline of waterborne illnesses, they missed early signs of the arsenicosis crisis.  因为他们认为的成功只是水井的数量和减少水传播的疾病，他们忽视掉了早期砷中毒所带来的危机信号。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8659','amazement','ə''mezmənt','ə''meɪzm(ə)nt','[n] 惊愕, 惊异','I stared at her in amazement.  我惊讶地盯着她。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8660','urgency','''ɝdʒənsi','''ɜːdʒ(ə)nsɪ','[n] 紧急, 紧急的事',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8661','unpromising','ʌn''prɑmɪsɪŋ','ʌn''prɒmɪsɪŋ','[adj] 没有希望的(结果未必良好的)','In fact, his business career had distinctly unpromising beginnings.  事实上，他的职业生涯开始时看起来非常没有前途。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8662','deter','dɪ''tɝ','dɪ''tɜː','[v] 阻止','The company’s financial difficulties have deterred potential investors.  该公司的财务困境令潜在的投资者望而却步。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8663','bluntly','''blʌntli','''blʌntli','[adv] 坦率地, 率直地','‘You’re drunk,’ she said bluntly.  “你喝醉了。”她不客气地说。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8664','overcharge',',ovɚ''tʃɑrdʒ','əʊvə''tʃɑːdʒ','[v] 讨价过高,夸张,过度充电','They were being overcharged for cheap beer.  他们买的是便宜的啤酒，却被收取了高价。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8665','calibration',',kælɪ''breʃən','kælɪ''breɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 标度, 刻度',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8666','subclass','''sʌbklæs','''sʌbklɑːs','[n] [生]亚纲, 子集',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8667','luminous','''lʊmənəs','''luːmɪnəs','[adj] 发光的,清楚的,明白易懂的','luminous paint  发光涂料'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8668','simplistic','sɪm''plɪstɪk','sɪm''plɪstɪk','[adj] 过分简单化的','This is a very simplistic approach to the problem.  这应该对该问题过分简单化的处理办法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8669','teapot','''ti''pɑt','''tiːpɒt','[n] 茶壶','She upped and threw the teapot at him.  她跳起来，将茶壶向他掷去。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8670','specification','''spɛsəfə''keʃən',',spesɪfɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 详述, 规格','The bolts met all the engineering specifications .  这些螺栓符合所有的工程设计规格。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8671','rationally','''ræʃənli','''ræʃənəli','[adv] 理性地','Large scale revolutions attempting to change all the institutions of society at once make it impossible for anyone –including the revolutionaries –to plan rationally.  企图立即改变社会的制度而引发的大规模革命使得所有人都不能理性的计划，包括那些革命者的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8672','prominence','''prɑmɪnəns','''prɒmɪnəns','[n] 突出, 显著','He came to prominence during the World Cup.  他在该世界杯期间一举成名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8673','importer','ɪm''pɔrtɚ','','[n] 输入者, 进口商','Japan is the biggest importer of U.S. beef.  日本是美国牛肉的最大进口国。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8674','foundry','''faʊndri','''faʊndrɪ','[n] 铸造, 铸造场','an iron foundry  铸铁厂'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8675','systematize','''sɪstəmətaɪz','''sɪstəmə,taɪz','[v] 系统化','This basic plugin is undoubtedly one of the important plugins to systematize the archives.  这个插件无疑是系统化归档的重要插件之一。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8676','persuasion','pɚ''sweʒn','pə''sweɪʒ(ə)n','[n] 说服, 说服力','After a little gentle persuasion , Debbie agreed to let us in.  好言劝说了几句后，黛比就同意让我们进去了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8677','penalty','''pɛnəlti','''pen(ə)ltɪ','[n] 处罚, 罚款','No littering. Penalty $500.  禁止乱扔垃圾。 违者罚款500美元。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8678','singly','''sɪŋɡli','''sɪŋglɪ','[adv] 单独地, 个别地','Plant the trees singly or in small groups.  把这些树单棵或成小片种植。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8679','gloss','ɡlɑs','glɒs','[n] 光泽，注解','This gel will add gloss to even the dullest hair.  用了这种发胶，即使最干枯的头发也会增添光泽。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8680','refinement','rɪ''faɪnmənt','rɪ''faɪnm(ə)nt','[n] 精致, 文雅','Her mother is a woman with great refinement.  她母亲是一个非常文雅的女人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8681','guess','ɡɛs','ges','[v] 猜测, 推测','I’d say he’s around 50, but I’m only guessing.  我想他50岁左右，不过也只是猜测。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8682','gaze','ɡeɪz','geɪz','[v] 盯, 凝视','Patrick sat gazing into space  (= looking straight in front, not at any particular person or thing ).  帕特里克坐着，茫然地看着前方。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8683','earthworm','''ɝθwɝm','''ɜːθwɜːm','[n] 蚯蚓','The earthworm is a useful animal. On the ground it is food for other animals. Under the ground, it makes rich soil for fields and gardens.  蚯蚓是一种有益的动物。在地面上它是其他动物的食物。在地下，它为田园和花园制造肥沃的土壤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8684','fantastic','fæn''tæstɪk','fæn''tæstɪk','[adj] 幻想的, 奇异的','a fantastic scheme  异想天开的计划'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8685','lateral','''lætərəl','''læt(ə)r(ə)l','[n] 侧部, 支线 a侧面的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8686','intimately','ˈɪntəmɪtlɪ','''intimitli','[adv] 密切地,  亲密地','Maybe your relationships will be your primary focus for a period of life, as well as learning how to cultivate them more intimately and intelligently.  或许生活中的一段时期，你的主要焦点是人际关系，了解怎样聪明地培养人际亲密关系成为了关注点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8687','nostril','''nɑstrəl','''nɒstr(ə)l','[n] 鼻孔','The smell of gunpowder filled his nostrils.  火药味灌进他的鼻孔。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8688','bis','bɪs','bɪs','[adv] 二度, 二回',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8689','uniqueness','jʊ''niknɪs','ju:''ni:knis','[n] 唯一性, 独特性','Creativity and uniqueness often depends on how well you hide your sources.  创意和独特性往往取决于如何隐藏你的创意来源。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8690','deferential','ˌdefə''rɛnʃl','defə''renʃ(ə)l','[adj] 恭敬的, 顺从的','They like five-star hotels and deferential treatment.  他们喜欢五星级酒店和谦恭的礼遇。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8691','shaper','','','[n] 造形者, 塑造者','He concluded that the sexual drive was the most powerful shaper of a person''s psychology, and that sexuality was present even in infants.  他得出的结论是，性冲动是个人心理最有力的塑造者，即使是婴儿，他们也有性欲。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8692','genial','''dʒinɪəl','''dʒiːnɪəl','[adj] 亲切的','a genial smile  亲切的微笑'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8693','avocational','','','[n] 娱乐,  消遣',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8694','occupancy','''ɑkjəpənsi','''ɒkjəpənsɪ','[n] 占有','Hotels in Tokyo enjoy over 90% occupancy.  东京的宾馆入住率高达90%以上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8695','mildly','''maɪldli','''maɪldlɪ','[adv] 温和地, 适度地','‘Of course I don’t mind,’ she answered mildly.  “我当然不介意。”她温和地答道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8696','bundle','''bʌndl','''bʌnd(ə)l','[n] 捆v捆扎','a small bundle containing mostly clothing  一个小包袱，里面主要是衣服'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8697','ethnographic',',eθnə''ɡræfik',',eθnə''ɡræfɪk','[adj] 民族志学的,  人种志学的','Near Amsterdam there is an ethnographic museum where one can trace the history of klomps development, to see the fully automated production process of this unique wooden shoes.  在阿姆斯特丹附近，有一个人种学博物馆，里面介绍了木屐鞋的发展历史，还能了解这种独特木鞋的整个自动化制作过程。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8698','infinite','''ɪnfɪnət','''ɪnfɪnət','[adj] 无限的，无穷的','The universe is infinite.  宇宙是无限的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8699','wearability','','','[n] 耐磨性, 磨损性','Employing abrasive machining for the form of the gear and intellective-control carburizing and quenching technology for the surface, the gear is with high intensity, strong tenacity and wearability.  齿轮齿形采用磨齿加工，齿面采用智能控制渗碳淬火技术，齿轮的强度高、韧性和耐磨性好。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8700','masthead','''mæsthɛd','''mɑːsthed','[n] 桅顶, 报头','The bark was dressed with masthead flags only.  那条三桅帆船只用桅顶旗装饰。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8701','gazette','ɡə''zet','gə''zet','[n] 报纸, 政府的公报','the ‘Phoenix Gazette’  《凤凰城报》'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8702','disc','dɪsk','dɪsk','[n] 圆盘, 唱片','three keys attached to a metal disc  穿在金属圆盘上的三把钥匙'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8703','spheroidal','','sfɪə''rɒɪdəl','[adj] 球状的','For another, the clouds don''t look like the disheveled spheroidal dwarf galaxies that closely orbit the Milky Way and other major spirals.  另一方面，这些星云看上去并不像结构松散的球状矮星系一样紧紧地围绕银河系和其它主要的漩涡星系的轨道运行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8704','flattish','''flætɪʃ','''flætɪʃ','[adj] 有点平凡的, 稍平的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8705','businesswoman','''biznis,wumən','''bɪznɪs,wʊmən','[n] 妇女实业家',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8706','expo','''ɛkspoʊ','''ekspəʊ','[n] 博览会, 展览会','...the 1995 Queensland Computer Expo.  …1995年昆士兰计算机博览会。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8707','slander','''slændɚ','''slɑːndə','[vt&n] 诽谤','He is being sued for slander .  他被控犯有口头诽谤罪。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8708','signer','''saɪnɚ','','[n] 签名人, (用手势) 示意者','You understand that any authorized signer on your current account can access your credit line.  你要知道你目前银行账户的任何授权的签署人都能够获取你的信贷限额。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8709','silurian','sai''ljuəriən; si-','sai''ljuəriən; si-','[adj] 〈地〉志留纪的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8710','explosively','','','[adv] 爆发地, 引起爆炸地','As grungy as the rock audience may have been, it wanted its music explosively amplified and expertly modulated; it wanted to hear the beat through its pores.  尽管摇滚乐的观众可能非常邋遢，摇滚乐仍然力图爆炸式地放大，并精细地调制其声响；它希望能透过毛孔听到节奏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8711','lastly','''læstli','''lɑːstlɪ','[adv] 最后, 终于','Lastly, could I ask all of you to keep this information secret?  最后，我请求各位对这一消息保密。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8712','radial','''redɪəl','''reɪdɪəl','[adj] 光线的, 放射状的','radial roads leading out of the city centre  从市中心向外辐射的道路'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8713','culminate','''kʌlmɪnet','''kʌlmɪneɪt','[v] 达到顶点','A series of international meetings held over the last ten weeks will culminate in the Geneva meeting.  过去十周内举行的一系列国际会议将于这次日内瓦会议达到高潮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8714','restraint','rɪ''strent','rɪ''streɪnt','[n] 抑制, 制止','The police were praised for their restraint in handling the demonstrators.  警方因对待示威者时所表现出的克制而受到赞扬。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8715','frill','frɪl','frɪl','[n] 皱边','She was wearing a white blouse with frills at the cuffs.  她穿了一件袖口有褶边的白衬衫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8716','facilitation','fə,sɪlə''teʃən','fəsɪlɪ''teɪʃn','[n] 简易化, 助长',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8717','provocative','prə''vɑkətɪv','prə''vɒkətɪv','[adj] 煽动的 n刺激物','a provocative act by a terrorist group  恐怖团体的挑衅行为'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8718','megafossil','','','[n] 大化石','Firstly, the Pliocene climate and elevation of Zhangcun basin are estimated using ODA method, based on the former data of both plant megafossil and 3 sets of pollen assemblages.  首先，基于前人山西榆社盆地张村植物大化石和花粉组合资料，运用分布区叠加分析法，初步重建了华北张村上新世气候参数值和古海拔高度。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8719','cryptic','''krɪptɪk','''krɪptɪk','[adj] 秘密的, 含义模糊的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8720','inspect','ɪn''spɛkt','ɪn''spekt','[v] 检查, 视察','I got out of the car to inspect the damage.  我下车查看损坏情况。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8721','genesis','''dʒɛnəsɪs','''dʒenɪsɪs','[n] 起源','Could that be the genesis?  那有可能是起源吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8722','conspiracy','kən''spɪrəsi','kən''spɪrəsɪ','[n] 共谋, 阴谋','There were many conspiracy theories (= beliefs that something is the result of a conspiracy ) surrounding Princess Diana’s death.  围绕戴安娜王妃之死有许多阴谋论。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8723','jobber','''dʒɑbɚ','''dʒɒbə','[n] 临时工, 批发商','These are the differences between the responsibilities of a broker and a jobber .  这些是经纪人的职责和一个批发商之间的不同。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8724','wholesaler','''həʊlseɪlə(r)','ˈhəʊlseɪlə','[n] 批发商','Under state law, bar owners must buy their liquor from wholesalers.  依照州法律，酒吧经营者们必须从批发商们那儿购买酒。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8725','cigar','sɪ''ɡɑr','sɪ''gɑː','[n] 雪茄','He was smoking a big cigar.  他在抽一只大雪茄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8726','sweatshop','''swɛtʃɑp','''swetʃɒp','[n] 血汗工厂(指工人劳动条件差,工作时间长,工资低的工场或工厂)','Her boy has never been to a doctor or a dentist, and last bathed when he was 2, so a sweatshop job by comparison would be far more pleasant and less dangerous.  他的儿子从来没看过医生或者牙医，最后一次洗澡是在2岁的时候，所以两相对照，血汗工厂的工作将会开心的并且没有那么危险。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8727','retailer','''ri:teilə','''riːteɪlə','[n] 零售商人','Furniture and carpet retailers are among those reporting the sharpest annual decline in sales.  家具和地毯零售商们是在那些报告最大年销售下滑的商家之中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8728','cabinet','''kæbɪnət','''kæbɪnɪt','[n] 橱柜, a<美>内阁的','a cabinet meeting  内阁会议'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8729','orthopteran','ɔr''θɑptərən','ɔː''θɒpt(ə)rən','[n] 直翅类的昆虫','On the whole, the orthopteran communities''diversity in edge zone are higher than those in the interior of adjacent communities at the similar edges.  分析各边缘地带直翅目昆虫群落多样性发现，所有边缘类型的边缘处直翅目昆虫多样性明显高于其相邻的生态系统。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8730','heyday','''hede','''heɪdeɪ','[n] 全盛时期','In its heyday, the studio''s boast was that it had more stars than there are in heaven.  该制片厂吹嘘，它在鼎盛时期拥有的明星比天上的星星还多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8731','sideline','''saɪdlaɪn','''saɪdlaɪn','[n] 副业, 边界线',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8732','modicum','''mɑdɪkəm','''mɒdɪkəm','[n] 少量, 一点点','a modicum of common sense  一点常识'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8733','handbook','''hændbʊk','''hæn(d)bʊk','[n] 手册, 便览','the Fiction Writer’s Handbook  《小说写作手册》'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8734','bitter','''bɪtɚ','''bɪtə','[adj] 苦的, 痛苦的','His photo stirred up bitter memories.  他的照片勾起了痛苦的回忆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8735','lonely','''lonli','''ləʊnlɪ','[adj] 孤独的, 寂寞的','a lonely old man  一个孤单的老人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8736','shutter','''ʃʌtɚ','''ʃʌtə','[n] 百叶窗；(照相机的)快门','There are a few things you should check before pressing the shutter release.  在按快门之前，有几件事情你应该检查。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8737','shoulder','''ʃoldɚ','''ʃəʊldə','[n] 肩(部)t肩负, 承当','She tapped the driver on the shoulder.  她拍拍司机的肩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8738','decorator','''dɛkəretɚ','''dekəreɪtə','[n] 油漆工',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8739','wonderfully','''wʌndɚfəli','','[adv] 令人惊讶地；奇妙地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8740','unimaginable',',ʌnɪ''mædʒɪnəbl','ʌnɪ''mædʒɪnəb(ə)l','[adj] 不能想象的, 想象不到的','unimaginable wealth  难以想象的财富'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8741','ruthlessly','''ru:θlisli','''ru:θlisli','[adv] 冷酷地, 残忍地','I also did things like put myself on auto-response and I ruthlessly stopped caring about a lot of things (to make psychic space for my primary aim of liberation). That''s about the gist of it.  我也会做一些像把博客调成自动回复，残忍地忽视很多事（让我最初的解放目标有个心灵上的空当）。这是要点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8742','unknowing','ʌn''noɪŋ','ʌn''nəʊɪŋ','[adj] 没查觉的, 无知的','Some governments have been victims and perhaps unknowing accomplices in the bank''s activities.  有些政府曾是银行行为的受害者或不知情的同谋。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8743','haste','hest','heɪst','[n] 匆忙, 急忙','I soon regretted my haste.  我很快就对自己的仓促感到后悔。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8744','scruple','''skrupl','''skruːp(ə)l','[n&v] 踌躇, 犹豫','and every speculative scruple will be solved by practical public blessing.  并且每一个推测性的踌躇都将为符合实际的公共祝福所解决。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8745','equitable','''ekwitəbl','''ekwɪtəb(ə)l','[adj] 公平的, 公正的','an equitable distribution of food supplies  所供应食品的合理分配'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8746','laurasia','lɔ:''reiʃə','lɔ:''reiʃə','[n] [地质] 劳亚古大陆',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8747','innkeeper','''ɪn''kipɚ','''ɪnkiːpə','[n] 旅馆主人','Shelley and Byron were the sons of aristocrats while Keats was the son of an innkeeper.  雪莱和拜伦是贵族子弟，而济慈只是一个旅馆老板的儿子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8748','buzz','bʌz','bʌz','[n] 嗡嗡声 v嗡嗡作响',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8749','peddler','''pɛdlɚ','''pedlə','[n] 小贩, 传播者',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8750','educationally','','','[adv] 教育的, 有关教育的','It provides an exciting new way for students and instructors to find educationally valuable resources on the Web.  它为学生和讲师提供了一种全新的方式来发现网上具有教育价值的资源。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8751','tractor','''træktɚ','''træktə','[n] 拖拉机','Iron-ox is another name for tractor.  铁牛是拖拉机的别名。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8752','constellation',',kɑnstə''leʃən',',kɒnstə''leɪʃ(ə)n','[n] [天]星群, 星座','a star in the constellation of Orion  猎户座的一颗恒星'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8753','exam','ɪg''zæm','ɪg''zæm; eg-','[n] 考试, 测验','At the end of each level, there’s an exam.  在每一级别结束时都有一次考试。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8754','working','''wɝkɪŋ','''wɜːkɪŋ','[n] 工作','I shall never understand the workings of his mind (= how he thinks ) .  我永远理解不了他的想法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8755','inclusive','ɪn''klusɪv','ɪn''kluːsɪv','[adj] 包含在内的','You are also invited to join us on our prayer days (this year, June 6 to June 14 inclusive).  你也受邀加入我们的祷告日（今年从6月6日（含）至6月14日（含））。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8756','grandparent','''græn''pɛrənt','''græn(d)peər(ə)nt','[n] 祖父或祖母, 祖父母','My grandparents live in Sussex.  我的祖父母住在萨塞克斯郡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8757','contractor','kən''træktɚ','kən''træktə','[n] 订约人, 承包人','We told the building contractor that we wanted a garage big enough for two cars.  我们告诉建筑承包商，我们想要一个可以停放两辆汽车的车库。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8758','cubism','''kjubɪzəm','''kjuːbɪz(ə)m','[n] 立体派','Pablo Picasso played a principal role in the early movement of cubism.  帕勃洛•毕加索在立体派早期发展中起首重要的推动作用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8759','woodcarving','''wʊd''kɑrvɪŋ','''wʊdkɑːvɪŋ','[n] 木雕, 木刻','Masi island is famous woodcarving centre.  玛斯是该岛著名的木雕中心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8760','prodigy','''prɑdədʒi','''prɒdɪdʒɪ','[n] 惊人的事物, 天才','The Russian tennis prodigy is well on the way to becoming the youngest world champion of all time.  这位俄罗斯网球奇才已很有望成为历史上最年轻的世界冠军。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8761','nonconformist',',nɑnkən''fɔrmɪst','nɒnkən''fɔːmɪst','[adj] 不信奉英国国教的 n非国教徒','Their views are nonconformist and their political opinions are extreme.  他们的看法与众不同，政治观点也很极端。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8762','fascination',',fæsɪ''neʃən',',fæsɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 魔力,  魅力, 迷恋','The fascination lay in the mystery of what was inside the box.  吸引力就在于这神秘感——不知道盒子里是什么东西。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8763','rectangle','''rɛktæŋɡl','''rektæŋg(ə)l','[n] 长方形, 矩形','Suppose the width of a rectangle is x metres.  设长方形的宽是 x 米。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8764','aloud','ə''laʊd','ə''laʊd','[adv] 大声地','When we were children, our father read aloud to us.  当我们是孩子时，我们的父亲大声地朗读给我们听。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8765','walnut','''wɔlnət','''wɔːlnʌt','[n] 胡桃, 胡桃木','coffee and walnut cake  咖啡核桃蛋糕'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8766','profitability','','','[n] 收益性, 利益率',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8767','renter','''rɛntɚ','''rentə','[n] 租贷人','He considers himself fortunate to be a renter in the Detroit area, where the “for sale” signs are multiplying.  他考虑以后在底特律当一名承租人，因为底特律的“租赁”业正在不断发展。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8768','claimant','''klemənt','''kleɪm(ə)nt','[n] 要求者,申请者, 原告','benefit claimants  救济金申请人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8769','sadden','''sædn','''sæd(ə)n','[v] 悲哀','The cruelty in the world saddens me incredibly.  世间的残酷令我悲伤不已。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8770','beard','bɪrd','bɪəd','[n] 胡须','He''s decided to grow a beard.  他已经决定蓄胡须。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8771','skeletally','','','[adj] 骨骼的, 梗概的','Adolescent patients should be skeletally mature with documented closure of growth plates (eg, 15 years or older).  青少年患者应骨性）成熟的旧记录生长板关闭的（例如，15年。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8772','muscularly','','','[adj] 肌肉的','The second tenet to help nourish the joints is to become still and muscularly soft, allowing gravity to have us.  第二个能够帮助滋养关节的原则是，保持静止并让肌肉柔软放松，让重力来帮助我们。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8773','tinplate','','','[n] 镀锡铁皮, 马口铁','Indian Railway paint and tinplate production sheared.  生产印铁涂料和马口铁剪切。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8774','tomato','tə''meto','tə''mɑːtəʊ','[n] 番茄, 西红柿','He staked his tomato vines with bamboo.  他用竹竿支撑起西红柿秧。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8775','starch','stɑrtʃ','stɑːtʃ','[n] 淀粉','He eats a lot of starch.  他吃大量含淀粉的食物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8776','grape','ɡrep','greɪp','[n] 葡萄, 葡萄树','a bunch of grapes  一串葡萄'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8777','packer','''pækɚ','''pækə','[n] 包装工人, 打包机','Norma Jones worked as a packer in a local chemical factory.  诺玛·琼斯在本地一家化工厂作包装工。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8778','strawberry','''strɔbɛri','''strɔːb(ə)rɪ','[n] [植]草莓','...strawberries and cream.  …奶油草莓。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8779','negate','nɪˈɡet','nɪ''geɪt','[v] 否定, 打消','He warned that to negate the results of elections would only make things worse.  他警告说否定选举结果只能使事态更加恶化。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8780','creeper','''kripɚ','''kriːpə','[n] 爬行者',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8781','bluebird','''blubɝd','''bluːbɜːd','[n] 北美产的蓝知更鸟','A bluebird in the garden, a spirit in a house, a kind man on the side of the road.  花园中的蓝知更鸟，房屋中的精灵，路边的好人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8782','lark','lɑrk','lɑːk','[n] 云雀, 百灵鸟','It sounds like the singing of lark birds.  这歌声就像百灵鸟一样清脆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8783','communally','','','[adv] 共同地, 社区地',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8784','rooster','''rustɚ','''ruːstə','[n] 雄禽,',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8785','sociably','','','[adv] 和蔼可亲地','Two women in widow''s black touch his arm sociably as he passes the street corner where they sit singing folk songs to each other.  两个身着素黑衣服的女人坐在街角互相唱着民谣，当他从身边走过时她们和蔼地轻拍他的手臂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8786','perch','pɝtʃ','pɜːtʃ','[n] 栖息处 v暂栖，停留','She watched the parade from her perch on her father’s shoulders.  她骑在父亲的肩上观看游行。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8787','geometrical','dʒɪə''mɛtrɪkl','dʒɪə''metrɪkl','[adj] 几何学的,  几何的','A geometrical wonder, DOME ECILE not only is a sight in and of itself, but it also sports beautiful beach views.  这是一个几何学上的奇迹，DOME ECILE本身就是一处景观，但从这里你还可以看到漂亮的沙滩。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8788','awake','ə''wek','ə''weɪk','[v] 醒,唤醒 a警觉的, 醒的','It was midday when she awoke.  她醒来时已是中午。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8789','radiate','''redɪet','''reɪdɪeɪt','[v] 放射, 辐射','Many kinds of woodland can be seen on the various walks which radiate from the Heritage Centre.  从遗产中心向外伸展的各条走道上可以看到多种林地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8790','obsolete','ɑbsəˌlit','''ɒbsəliːt','[adj] 已废弃的, 过时的','obsolete weapons  已被淘汰的武器'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8791','rarefy','''rɛrə,fai','''reərɪfaɪ','[v] 稀薄','The insertion of an inner rod into the waveguide can rarefy the spectrum of the competing modes in the vicinity of the operating mode and restrict the mode competing effectively.  在圆柱腔体内插入一个内导体将会使工作模式附近的模谱变稀，从而有效的抑制模式竞争。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8792','crossbones','''krɔsbonz','''krɒsbəʊnz','[n] 交叉腿骨的图形',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8793','figurehead','''fɪgjɚ''hɛd','''fɪgəhed','[n] 装饰船头的雕像, 破浪神',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8794','snipe','snaɪp','snaɪp','[n] [鸟]鹬','I propose that every time an American bags a snipe, the federal government should pay him or her $100.  美国需要更多的猎鹬者，我提议一个美国人每捕到一只鹬，联邦政府支付给他100美元。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8795','intricately','ˈɪntrəkɪtlɪ','''ɪntrɪkətlɪ','[adv] 杂乱地,  复杂地','In areas where river deltas inject organic material and dissolved trace elements into the sea, for instance, it’s not clear how all of the intricately related processes will affect water chemistry.  例如，在有些地区，河流三角洲将有机物质和溶解的微量元素注入海洋，目前还不清楚所有这些错综复杂的相关进程将如何影响水的化学性能。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8796','icon','''aɪkɑn','''aɪkɒn; -k(ə)n','[n] 图标, 肖像','To open a new file, click on the icon.  要打开新文档，点击该图标。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8797','antelope','''æntɪlop','''æntɪləʊp','[n] 羚羊','The hunter disembowelled the antelope.  猎人取出羚羊的内脏。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8798','interferometer',',ɪntɚfɪ''rɑmətɚ',',ɪntəfə''rɒmɪtə','[n] 干涉计','One possibility, according to Hogan, would be to use a device called an atom interferometer.  霍根说，一种可行方式是使用所谓的“原子干涉仪”设备。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8799','hardworking','''hɑrd,wɝkɪŋ','''hɑːd,wɜːkɪŋ','[adj] 努力工作的,  勤奋的','He was hardworking and energetic.  他很努力且精力充沛。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8800','proprietorship','prə''praɪətɚ,ʃɪp','prə''praiətə,ʃip','[n] 所有权','She would preside over the innocent repasts of the young heir, with ineffable satisfaction, almost with an air of joint proprietorship with Richards in the entertainment.  她会怀着难以形容的满意心情主持这位年轻继承人的天真的用餐，那副神态就几乎像在这个款待中她跟理查兹共同享有所有权似的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8801','aie','','','[n] 急性包涵(体)脑炎',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8802','imbibe','ɪm''baɪb','ɪm''baɪb','[v] 吸收','She had imbibed the traditions of her family.  她受到了自己家庭传统的影响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8803','agility','ə''dʒiləti','ə''dʒɪlətɪ','[n] 敏捷, 活泼','If for some reason you don''t have or cannot adopt these values, then you should not worry about agility.  如果因为某些原因您没有或者不能采用这些价值，那么您就不需要为敏捷而操心了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8804','delightful','dɪ''laɪtfl','dɪ''laɪtfʊl; -f(ə)l','[adj] 令人愉快的,  可喜的','a delightful little girl  讨人喜欢的小女孩'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8805','overheat',',ovɚ''hit','əʊvə''hiːt','[v] 使过热， 变得过热','I think the engine’s overheating again.  我想引擎又过热了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8806','rehydrate','ri:''haidreit',',riːhaɪ''dreɪt','[v] [化] 再水化, 再水合',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8807','efficacy','''ɛfɪkəsi','''efɪkəsɪ','[n] 功效, 效验','Recent medical studies confirm the efficacy of a healthier lifestyle.  近来的医学研究证实了更健康的生活方式的功效。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8808','dilution','dɪ''ljʊʃən','daɪ''luːʃn','[n] 稀释','"Aromatherapy oils" are not pure essential oils but dilutions.  “香薰精油”不是纯精油，而是稀释油。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8809','festive','''fɛstɪv','''festɪv','[adj] 庆祝的, 喜庆的','The atmosphere was festive and jolly.  气氛喜庆欢乐。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8810','zealous','''zɛləs','''zeləs','[adj] 热心的','a zealous preacher  热心的讲道者'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8811','bust','bʌst','bʌst','[n] 半身像, 胸像','a 36-inch bust  36英寸的胸围'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8812','equestrian','ɪ''kwɛstrɪən','ɪ''kwestrɪən; e-','[adj] 骑马的 n骑手','equestrian sports  马术运动'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8813','urn','ɝn','ɜːn','[n] 瓮, 缸','...a funeral urn.  …一个骨灰瓮。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8814','timidity','tɪ''mɪdəti','tɪ''mɪdətɪ','[n] 胆怯','They mocked at my timidity.  他们耻笑我胆小。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8815','stonemason','''stonmesn','''stəʊnmeɪs(ə)n','[n] 石匠','One thinks of Amos the sheepherder, Socrates the stonemason, Omar the tentmaker .  想想牧羊人阿摩司，石匠苏格拉底，帐蓬制造人奥马尔。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8816','biter','''baɪtɚ','''baɪtə','[n] 咬人的动物, 骗子','The kids already know that biting hurts, so after removing the biter from the situation, focus all your concern on the victim.  孩子是知道咬会伤人的，因此把咬人的孩子抱离后，集中关心一下被咬的孩子。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8817','bitterness','''bɪtɚnɪs','bɪtənəs','[n] 苦味, 辛酸','ON WHY THE POOR SHOULD BE HAPPY: “Nobody has the excuse of ‘lack of money’ for not being at peace and living in integrity,” writes one survey respondent of his family, with a touch of bitterness.  关于为什么穷人应该是快乐的：“没有人会因为没有钱这个借口而过的不平和和不完整，”某个调查对象在说到关于他的家庭的时候，带着一点痛苦的意味。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8818','plainspoken','','','[adj] 老实说的,直言的','a straightforward, plainspoken man  一个性格坦率、有话直说的男人'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8819','grit','ɡrɪt','grɪt','[n] 粗砂 v研磨',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8820','aero','''ɛro','''eərəʊ','[adj] 航空的,  飞行的','Boeing''s research in India will break new ground in aero structures, aerodynamics and electronic networks with a team of senior researchers, scientists and engineers.  在印度，波音公司将与资深研究人员、科学家和工程师一起开创印度航空构造学、空气动力学以及电子网络的新天地。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8821','cheapen','''tʃipən','''tʃiːp(ə)n','[v] 减价, 跌价',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8822','thorny','''θɔrni','''θɔːnɪ','[adj] 多刺的, 痛苦的','...thorny hawthorn trees.  …带刺的山楂树。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8823','inchworm','''ɪntʃwɝm','''ɪn(t)ʃwɜːm','[n] [昆] 尺蠖','The adorable inchworm is really the caterpillar of the geometer moth.  可爱的尺蠖就是尺蠖毛虫。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8824','escalator','''ɛskə''letɚ','''eskəleɪtə','[n] 电动扶梯','Take the escalator to the third floor and it''s the last office on the left.  乘电梯到4楼，左边最后的那个办公室就是。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8825','voltage','''voltɪdʒ','''vəʊltɪdʒ; ''vɒltɪdʒ','[n] [电工]电压, 伏特数','The systems are getting smaller and using lower voltages.  这些系统正变得更小而且使用更低的电压。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8826','smite','smaɪt','smaɪt','[v] 重击','The heroic leader charged into battle, ready to smite the enemy.  英勇的军官冲上战场，准备重击敌人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8827','follower','''fɑloɚ','''fɒləʊə','[n] 追随者, 信徒','Marx and his followers were convinced that capitalism would destroy itself.  马克思及其支持者确信资本主义将自我毁灭。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8828','indifference','ɪn''dɪfrəns','ɪn''dɪf(ə)r(ə)ns','[n] 不关心','Whether you stay or leave is a matter of total indifference to me (= I do not care ).  你是留是走我根本无所谓。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8829','eyelid','''aɪ,lɪd','''aɪlɪd','[n] 眼皮, 眼睑','His eyelids began to droop (= close, because he was sleepy ).  他的眼皮开始往下垂。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8830','comfortably','''kʌmftəbli','''kʌmfətəbli','[adv] 舒适地','The hotel is modern and comfortably furnished .  这家宾馆很现代化，家具很舒适。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8831','hatchet','''hætʃɪt','''hætʃɪt','[n] 短柄斧','Would I feel better if I took a hatchet to her, just to end this nightmare?  如果我向她举起一把短柄斧，结束这场噩梦，我会感觉好一些吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8832','axe','æks','æks','[n] 斧, (经费的)大削减',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8833','ambidextrous','''æmbə''dɛkstrəs',',æmbɪ''dekstrəs','[adj] 十分灵巧的',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8834','attributable','ə''trɪbjətəbl','ə''trɪbjʊtəbl','[adj] 可归因于的','10,000 deaths a year from chronic lung disease are attributable to smoking.  每年1万个慢性肺病患者的死亡可能是由于吸烟导致的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8835','predominance','prɪ''dɑmɪnəns','prɪ''dɒmɪnəns','[n] 优势','...the predominance of women in the industry.  ...该产业妇女在数量上拥有的优势。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8836','petrify','''pɛtrɪfaɪ','''petrɪfaɪ','[v] 石化,吓呆',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8837','polarity','pə''lærəti','pə(ʊ)''lærɪtɪ','[n] 极性','Whether you want to call it magnetism, polarity,electricity, thought, intelligence or charisma, it''s still attraction, and it invests everything—animal, vegetable or mineral.  不论你管它叫磁性、极性、活力、体贴、智慧还是魅力，它们都是吸引力，而且它适用于一切------动物、蔬菜或矿物。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8838','ax','æks','æks','[n] 斧头 vt削减',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8839','ferromagnetic',',fɛromæɡ''nɛtɪk',',ferə(ʊ)mæg''netɪk','[adj] 铁磁的','When they gradually increased the repulsive forces between the atoms, they observed several features indicating that the gas had become ferromagnetic.  他们利用红外线激光束捕获超冷锂原子气团，将其冷却到仅比绝对零度高亿分之十五开尔文。 当逐渐增加原子间斥力时，研究人员观察到的几个现象表明气体已经变得具有强磁性。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8840','afterward','ˈæftərwərd','''ɑːftəwəd','[adv] 然后, 后来','Shortly afterward, police arrested four suspects.  之后不久，警方逮捕了４名嫌疑犯。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8841','occupant','''ɑkəpənt','''ɒkjʊp(ə)nt','[n] 占有者, 居住者','The furniture had been left by the previous occupants.  家具是先前的住户留下的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8842','inflexible','ɪn''flɛksəbl','ɪn''fleksɪb(ə)l','[adj] 不可弯曲的, 僵硬的','This approach is too inflexible and too costly.  这个方法太死板，而且花费也太高。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8843','lotus','''lotəs','''ləʊtəs','[n] [植] 莲(花); [adj] 贪图安乐的','The soul unfolds itself, like a lotus of countless petals.  灵魂伸展绽放，就像一朵有无数花瓣的莲花。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8844','inexplicable',',ɪnɪk''splɪkəbl',',ɪnɪk''splɪkəb(ə)l; ,ɪnek-; ɪn''eksplɪ-','[adj] 无法解释的，难理解的','inexplicable behaviour  费解的行为'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8845','nineteen',',naɪn''tin','naɪn''tiːn; ''naɪntiːn','[num] 十九','It was nineteen minutes past seven.  当时是7点19分。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8846','therapeutic',',θɛrə''pjutɪk',',θerə''pjuːtɪk','[adj] 治疗的, 治疗学的 n治疗剂, 治疗学家','Some claim that the herb has therapeutic value for treating pain.  有些人称这种草药具有止痛的疗效。'),
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO words (book_slug, slug, word, phonetic_us, phonetic_uk, meaning, example) VALUES,
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8847','restrictive','rɪ''strɪktɪv','rɪ''strɪktɪv','[adj] 限制性的','Many members thought the rules were too restrictive.  很多会员认为这些规定限制条件太多。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8848','ail','el','eɪl','[v] 生病，使苦恼','A full-scale debate is under way on what ails the industry.  就困扰工业发展的弊端所展开的一次全面讨论正在进行中。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8849','unbind',',ʌn''baind','ʌn''baɪnd','[v] 解开, 解放','She unbound her hair and let it flow loose in the wind.  她解开头绳，让头发在风里自由地飘。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8850','Grecian','''ɡriʃən','''ɡri:ʃən','[adj] 希腊的, 希腊式的 n希腊学家','a Grecian urn  希腊古瓮'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8851','defender','dɪ''fɛndɚ','dɪ''fendə(r)','[n] 防卫者, 拥护者','He presented himself as a defender of democracy.  他以民主捍卫者的姿态出现。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8852','volcanism','''vɑlkənɪzm','''vɒlkənɪz(ə)m','[n] 火山作用','His study of eruptions over the past 300 years with Ben Mason of the University of Cambridge and colleagues reveals that volcanism varies with the seasons.  他和剑桥大学的本.梅森及其同事研究了过去300年来发生的火山喷发，研究显示火山活动随季节变化而不同。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8853','subduction','səb''dʌkʃən','səb''dʌkʃ(ə)n','[n] [地]潜没(指地壳的板块沉到另一板块之下)','In the past 300 years, no earthquake nearly that large — nothing larger than magnitude-eight — had struck in the Japan subduction zone.  在过去的300年里，在日本俯冲地区，从没发生过一个如此巨大的地震-没有一次比八级还大。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8854','diverge','daɪ''vɝdʒ','daɪ''vɜːdʒ; dɪ-','[v] 分歧','The two species diverged millions of years ago.  这两个物种从数百万年前开始朝不同方向演变。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8855','electrocardiogram','ɪ,lɛktro''kɑrdɪoɡræm','ɪ,lektrəʊ''kɑːdɪəgræm','[n] [医]心电图','A disposable electrocardiogram machine the size of a Band-Aid monitors a heart patient.  一个邦迪大小的一次性心电图仪器监视着一个心脏病人。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8856','grope','ɡrop','grəʊp','[v] / n摸索','With his left hand he groped for the knob, turned it, and pulled the door open.  他用左手摸索到门把手，转动把手，把门拉开。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8857','hesitate','''hɛzɪtet','''hezɪteɪt','[v] 犹豫, 踌躇','Some parents hesitate to take these steps because they suspect that their child is exaggerating.  一些家长迟迟不肯采取这些措施，因为他们怀疑自己的孩子在夸大其词。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8858','electroencephalogram','','ɪ,lektrəʊɪn''sef(ə)ləgræm; -''kef-','[n] [医]脑电图','The brain, too, sends out brain waves of electricity, which can be recorded in an electroencephalogram.  大脑也是一样，会发出脑电波，而脑电波可以在脑电图中记录。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8859','blackout','''blækaʊt','''blækaʊt','[n] 灯火管制，断电','...blackout curtains.  …灯火管制时用的窗帘。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8860','jolt','dʒolt','dʒəʊlt; dʒɒlt','[v& n] (使)颠簸；震动','We jolted along rough wet roads through an endless banana plantation.  我们沿崎岖潮湿的公路颠簸着驶过无边无际的香蕉种植园。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8861','bandleader','''bændlidɚ','''bændliːdə','[n] 伴舞乐队的指挥','Their father was a bandleader and their mother taught harmony singing.  他们的父亲是伴舞乐队的指挥，他们的母亲教授合唱。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8862','ballroom','''bɔl''rʊm','''bɔːlruːm; -rʊm','[n] 舞厅, 跳舞场',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8863','memorandum',',mɛmə''rændəm','memə''rændəm','[n] 备忘录, 便笺','...a memorandum from the Department of Defense on its role.  …一份来自国防部的有关其角色的备忘录。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8864','nickname','''nɪk''nem','''nɪkneɪm','[n] 绰号, 昵称','Stephen earned himself the nickname Hawkeye.  斯蒂芬得了个“鹰眼”的绰号。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8865','pepper','''pɛpɚ','''pepə','[n] 胡椒粉','salt and pepper  盐和胡椒粉'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8866','accusation',',ækju''zeʃən','ækjʊ''zeɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 谴责, [律]指控','The main accusation levelled against him was that he tried to avoid military service.  对他提出的主要指控是他想逃避兵役。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8867','obligate','''ɑblɪ,ɡeɪt','''ɒblɪgeɪt','[v] 使负义务 a有责任的','The ruling obligates airlines to release information about their flight delays.  这一裁决迫使航空公司公布航班晚点信息。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8868','forbearance','fɔr''bɛrəns','fɔː''beər(ə)ns','[n] 自制，忍耐','There is too much torment, renunciation, and anxiety in this love for it to be anything but infinite forbearance.  这爱中有太多的折磨、太多的自制、与太多的焦虑，除了无穷无尽的忍耐，这些就成了它的一切。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8869','consent','kən''sɛnt','kən''sent','[n& vi] 同意，赞成','The chairman was elected by common consent (= with most people agreeing ) .  主席是大家一致推选出来的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8870','Thames','','temz','[n] 泰晤士河(流经牛津,伦敦等)','Many bridges span the Thames.  很多桥横亘在泰晤士河上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8871','maverick','''mævərɪk','''mæv(ə)rɪk','[adj] 标新立异的；持不同意见的','...a maverick group of scientists, who oppose the prevailing medical opinion on the disease.  …一群特立独行的科学家，他们反对关于这种疾病的医学界的盛行观点。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8872','commemorate','kə''mɛməret','kə''meməreɪt','[v] 纪念','a parade to commemorate the town’s bicentenary  庆祝该镇建立200周年的游行'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8873','blower','''bloɚ','''bləʊə','[n] 吹制工, 送风机',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8874','goldfish','''ɡoldfɪʃ','''gəʊl(d)fɪʃ','[n] 金鱼','I have nine little goldfish .  我有九条小金鱼。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8875','decor','de''kɔr','''deɪkɔː; ''de-','[n] 舞台装饰','The decor is a mix of antique and modern.  装修风格是古今合璧。 decorate 装修；装饰'),
