('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8877','rook','rʊk','rʊk','[n] 白嘴鸦；赌棍  vt骗',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8878','fitting','''fɪtɪŋ','''fɪtɪŋ','[adj] 适合的n试穿，装配','I thought the memorial was a fitting tribute to the President.  我认为这座纪念碑恰如其分地表达了对总统的敬意。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8879','equilateral','''ikwə''lætərəl',',iːkwɪ''læt(ə)r(ə)l; ,ekwɪ-','[adj] 等边的 n等边形','...an equilateral triangle.  ...一个等边三角形。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8880','honeycomb','''hʌnɪkom','''hʌnɪkəʊm','[n] 蜂房, 蜂巢','On the other hand, Thompson’s explanation of surface tension ignores the bees, which painstakingly build the honeycomb, and possess capabilities that are not yet fully understood.  而另一方面，汤姆逊的表面张力论忽视了蜜蜂费力建造蜂巢的过程，而且蜜蜂拥有至今仍未弄清的许多能力。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8881','romanticize','rəu''mæntisaiz','rə(ʊ)''mæntɪsaɪz','[v] 浪漫化, 传奇化','a romanticized image of life during the war  对战时生活的浪漫化描写'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8882','misconception','''mɪskən''sɛpʃən','mɪskən''sepʃ(ə)n','[n] 误解','It is a misconception that Peggy was fabulously wealthy.  说佩吉以前极其富有，这是一个错误的看法。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8883','conviction','kən''vɪkʃən','kən''vɪkʃ(ə)n','[n] 深信,  定罪','It was a reasonable explanation, but his voice lacked conviction .  这解释合情合理，只是他的语气不坚定。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8884','poster','''postɚ','''pəʊstə','[n] 海报, 招贴','A team of volunteers were putting up posters .  一队志愿者正在张贴海报。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8885','tessellation','','','[n] 棋盘形嵌石饰',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8886','victim','''vɪktɪm','''vɪktɪm','[n] 受害人,牺牲品','The victim received head injuries from which she died a week later.  受害人头部受伤，一周后死亡。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8887','cate','ket','keɪt','[n] 佳肴, 美食',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8888','arouse','ə''raʊz','ə''raʊz','[v] 唤醒,鼓励; [v] 睡醒','At dawn the farmers began to arouse.  黎明时农民们开始醒来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8889','officeholder','''ɔfɪs,holdɚ','''ɒfɪs,həʊldə','[n] 官员,公务员','If inscribe, troublesome everybody. Favour, bit more specific. Thank! Read a language kind can you take an examination of officeholder?  如题，麻烦各位了。恩，具体点。谢谢！读语言类可以考公务员吗？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8890','pentagon','''pɛntəɡɑn','''pentəɡ(ə)n','[n] 五角形, 五边形',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8891','corset','''kɔrsɪt','''kɔːsɪt','[n] 束腹, 妇女的胸衣; [v] 严格控制',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8892','sheepskin','''ʃipskɪn','''ʃiːpskɪn','[n] 羊皮(革,纸), 毕业证书','...a sheepskin coat.  ...一件羊皮袄。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8893','perimeter','pə''rɪmɪtɚ','pə''rɪmɪtə','[n] [树数] 周长, 周界','...the perimeter of the airport.  …机场周边。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8894','denomination','dɪ,nɑmɪ''neʃən','dɪ,nɒmɪ''neɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 面额,名称,教派','Christians of all denominations  各教派的基督徒'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8895','breech','britʃ','briːtʃ','[n] 臀部,后膛; [vt] 给…穿上裤子','Soon after we arrived, we learned Hillary would have to give birth by cesarean section because the baby was in breech, upside down in the womb.  我们抵达医院后不久，就听说希拉里需要做剖腹产，因为孩子是“臀位”，也就是说，孩子在子宫里的姿势是上下颠倒的。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8896','mitigate','''mɪtɪɡet','''mɪtɪgeɪt','[v] 减轻,缓和','Measures need to be taken to mitigate the environmental effects of burning more coal.  需要采取措施来减轻燃煤增加对环境造成的影响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8897','mighty','''maɪti','''maɪtɪ','[n] 有势力的人; [adj] 有势力的','the mighty Mississippi river  浩荡的密西西比河'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8898','spaceship','''spesʃɪp','''speɪsʃɪp','[n] 太空船',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8899','adventure','əd''vɛntʃɚ','əd''ventʃə','[n] 冒险; [v] 冒险,大胆说出来','a great adventure  一大奇遇'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8900','feud','fjʊd','fjuːd','[n] 不和,争执; [v] 长期争斗','Insults only served to inflame the feud.  侮辱只是起到了加剧长期不和的作用。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8901','ted','tɛd','ted','[vt] 翻晒; [n] 泰德',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8902','venturesome','''vɛntʃɚsəm','''ventʃəs(ə)m','[adj] 危险的,冒险的','...the venturesome graduate who is determined to succeed.  ...敢闯敢干、下决心要成功的毕业生。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8903','knuckle','''nʌkl','''nʌk(ə)l','[n] 指节, 关节; [v] 开始工作','Her knuckles whitened as she gripped the gun.  她紧紧握着枪，指关节都发白了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8904','receiver','rɪ''sivɚ','rɪ''siːvə','[n] 接受者, 接收器, 收信机','Auto-tuning VHF receivers are now common in cars.  自动调谐的超高频信号接收器现普遍使用在小汽车上。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8905','wrist','rɪst','rɪst','[n] 手腕, 腕关节','He broke his wrist climbing rocks for a cigarette ad.  他为了一个香烟广告攀岩折断了手腕。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8906','familiarization','','','[n] 亲密, 熟悉, 精通',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8907','bulldoze','''bʊldoz','''bʊldəʊz','[v] 威吓, 欺负',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8908','mason','''mesn','''meɪs(ə)n','[n] 泥瓦匠; [vt] 用砖瓦砌成',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8909','woodlot','','','[n] 植林地(尤指附属林场地)',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8910','profoundly','prə''faʊndli','prə''faʊndlɪ','[adv] 深深地, 衷心地','As he cuddles with her, it feels like he’s doing the same with me — that’s how profoundly I feel we are all intertwined.  当他搂住她的时候，感觉就像是他也在搂着我——这就是为什么我感到我们被深深地羁绊住了。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8911','hone','hon','həʊn','[n] 磨（刀）石vt用磨刀石磨',''),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8912','tele','''tɛli','''telɪ','[n] 电视','You might think of this new medium as books we watch, or tele­vision we read.  你可以将这种全新的媒体想象成自己所看的书，也可以将它们想象成电视。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8913','uncounted','ʌn''kaʊntɪd','ʌn''kaʊntɪd','[adj] 无数的,没有数过的','This arrangement is no different from one where the voter casts a symbolic vote, a vote that remains uncounted, with the outcome already determined by the whims of the tyrant.  民主制度的这种安排与独裁者的独断专行基本无异，选民只是象征性的投了一票，但是这一票背后的民意却很少有人关心。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8914','profiteer',',prɑfə''tɪə','prɒfɪ''tɪə','[n] 奸商; [v] 牟取暴利','...a new social class composed largely of war profiteers and gangsters.  ...主要由战争投机商和强盗组成的一个新的社会阶层。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8915','arsenal','','','[n] 兵工厂, 军械库','The enemy bombers targeted our arsenal.  敌机把我们的兵工厂作为轰炸目标。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8916','ordnance','''ɔrdnəns','''ɔːdnəns','[n] 军火','...a team clearing an area littered with unexploded ordnance.  ...一个在四处留有未爆炸武器的地区排爆的小组。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8917','tycoon','taɪ''kun','taɪ''kuːn','[n] 企业界大亨, 将军','...a self-made Irish-American property tycoon.  …一个靠自己奋斗成功的爱尔兰裔美国房地产大亨。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8918','knit','nɪt','nɪt','[v] 编织, 密接; [n] 编织物','My grandmother taught me how to knit.  我祖母教过我编织。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8919','stickpin','''stikpin','''stɪkpɪn','[n] 领带夹(指插于领带上的装饰别针)','If the suit is buttoned, where should be the stickpin?  西装系着扣时，领带夹应在衬衫的哪两粒钮扣之间？'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8920','cane','ken','keɪn','[n] 藤条,手杖; [v] 以杖击, 以藤编制','a cane chair  藤椅'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8921','flamboyant','flæm''bɔɪənt','flæm''bɒɪənt','[adj] 辉耀的,艳丽的','He lifted his arms in a flamboyant gesture .  他抬起胳膊，做了个炫耀的手势。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8922','rumble','''rʌmbl','''rʌmb(ə)l','[v] 隆隆声,低沉地说; [n] 隆隆声, 吵嚷声','We could hear thunder rumbling in the distance.  我们听见远处雷声隆隆。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8923','gunfire','''ɡʌnfaɪɚ','''gʌnfaɪə','[n] 炮火','I heard a burst of distant gunfire .  我听到远处一阵炮响。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8924','shrill','ʃrɪl','ʃrɪl','[adj] 尖声的; [v] 尖声叫出','‘That’s not true,’ she protested in a shrill voice.  “不是这样的。”她尖声抗议道。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8925','ameliorate','ə''milɪə''ret','ə''miːlɪəreɪt','[v] 改善, 改进','It is not clear what can be done to ameliorate the situation.  可以采取什么办法来改善局面并不明确。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8926','bugle','''bjuɡl','''bjuːg(ə)l','[n] 喇叭,军号; [v] 吹号集合','The bugle sounded as the troops advanced.  军号吹响前进的号令。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8927','heartbreak','''hɑrtbrek','''hɑːtbreɪk','[n] 心碎；伤心事','...suffering and heartbreak for those close to the victims.  …那些受害者亲人的痛苦与悲伤。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8928','northerner','''nɔrðənɚ','''nɔːð(ə)nə','[n] 北国人, 北方人','I like the openness and directness of northerners.  我喜欢北方人的豪爽和直率。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8929','tingle','''tɪŋɡl','''tɪŋg(ə)l','[v] 造成麻刺的感觉,使感刺痛','My body tingled all over and I had a terrible headache.  我全身刺痛，头疼欲裂。'),
