('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8949','codify','''kɔdifai','''kəʊdɪfaɪ','[v] 把…编成法典, 编纂','The latest draft of the agreement codifies the panel''s decision.  该协议的最新草案将专家小组的决定编篡成了法规条款。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8950','soul','sol','səʊl','[n] 灵魂, 精髓','the immortality of the soul  灵魂的不灭'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8951','airy','''ɛri','''eərɪ','[adj] 通风的, 轻快的','All the hotel’s bedrooms are light and airy.  这家酒店的所有客房都明亮通风。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8952','dread','drɛd','dred','[n] 恐惧,可怕的人(或物); [v] 惧怕; [adj] 恐怖的','The prospect of flying filled me with dread .  想到要乘飞机我充满了恐惧。'),
