('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8962','magnification',',mæɡnɪfɪ''keʃən',',mægnɪfɪ''keɪʃ(ə)n','[n] 扩大, 放大倍率','greater levels of magnification  更高的放大倍数'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8963','bat','bæt','bæt','[n] 蝙蝠, 球棒 v用球棒击球','...a baseball bat.  …一只棒球棒。'),
