('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8967','forestall','','fɔː''stɔːl','[v] 之前, 先(用先发制人的方法)预防, 阻止','a measure intended to forestall further attacks  意在预先阻止进一步攻击的措施'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8968','melange','','','[n] 混合物, 杂录','...a successful melange of music styles, from soul and rhythm and blues to rap.  ...一个从灵乐、节奏、布鲁斯到说唱各种音乐风格的成功组合。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8969','waterside','''wɔtɛrsaɪd','''wɔːtəsaɪd','[n] n&; [adj] 水边(的),湖畔(的)','There are still bears to be encountered though, albeit from the safety of our boat - two cubs and a grizzly idling along the waterside; a black bear emerging from the river.  我们居然遇到了熊，尽管我们安坐在船上——一头大灰熊和两只小熊在水边闲逛，一头黑熊从水中冒出头来。'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8970','irrational','ɪ''ræʃənl','ɪ''ræʃ(ə)n(ə)l','[adj] 无理性的, 失去理性的; [n] 无理数','an irrational fear of flying  对飞行非理性的恐惧'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8971','cherish','''tʃɛrɪʃ','''tʃerɪʃ','[v] 珍爱, 怀抱(希望等)','In marriage, a man promises to cherish his wife.  在婚姻中，男人承诺要爱护妻子。'),
