('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8973','kiosk','''kiɑsk','''kiːɒsk','[n] 亭子','"We went into a market and established a kiosk in that market out of a butcher''s shop," Kalanda says.  卡兰达说，“由于一家肉店，我们进入这个市场，在那个市场我们建立了一个公用电话亭”'),
('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8974','cordwainer','''kɔrdwenɚ','''kɔːdweɪnə','[n] 鞋匠',''),
