('TOEFL_2','TOEFL_2_8983','Thailand','''taɪlænd; -lənd','''taɪlænd','[n] 泰国','Thailand, Brazil and India each have a carrier, while the US has eleven.  泰国，巴西，和印度，每个国家都有航母，而美国有十一艘。'),
